#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Trucker"
msgstr "トラック運転手"

#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Trucker"
msgstr "トラック運転手"

#. ~ Profession (male Trucker) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You ruled the road in your big rig and managed to drive it somewhere you "
"hoped was safe when the riots hit.  Now it's just you and your trusty truck "
"cab."
msgstr ""
"かつて大型トラックで道路を支配していた。暴動が起きたときも、安全を期待できる場所まで運転して逃げ切った。今、この世界に残っているのは、あなたと信頼するトラックの運転席だけだ。"

#. ~ Profession (female Trucker) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
