#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Meth Cook"
msgstr "麻薬調合師"

#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Meth Cook"
msgstr "麻薬調合師"

#. ~ Profession (male Meth Cook) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You clawed your way out of poverty by selling products everyone wanted, and "
"they had the nerve to put you in jail for it.  Too bad you can't sell drugs "
"to zombies or aliens."
msgstr ""
"誰もが欲しがる商品を売って、貧困から這い上がった。そのせいで投獄されたが、構うものか。残念なのは、ゾンビや異星人にドラッグは売れないってことだ。"

