msgstr "毎年恒例の「ニューイングランド独立戦争再現劇」に向かう道すがら、それは起こった。ようやく男女は伝統的な役割から解放された。"

#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Ninja"
msgstr "忍者"

#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Ninja"
msgstr "忍者"

#. ~ Profession (male Ninja) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Your cosplay may be more theatrical than historical, less shinobi and more "
"kabuki stagehand, but your weapons are real enough.  Tread lightly, but "
"remember they hunt by scent too."
msgstr ""
"あなたのコスプレは史実より演劇的で、忍者よりは歌舞伎の舞台裏方のようだが、武器は本物だ。足元には注意し、彼らも嗅覚で獲物を追うことを忘れるな。"

#. ~ Profession (female Ninja) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Your cosplay may be more theatrical than historical, less shinobi and more "
"kabuki stagehand, but your weapons are real enough.  Tread lightly, but "
"remember they hunt by scent too."
msgstr ""
"あなたのコスプレは史実より演劇的で、忍者よりは歌舞伎の舞台裏方のようだが、武器は本物だ。足元には注意し、彼らも嗅覚で獲物を追うことを忘れるな。"

#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Pirate"
msgstr "海賊"

#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Pirate"
msgstr "海賊"

#. ~ Profession (male Pirate) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Arr!  Your costume may be shipshape, but the end of the world's scuppered "
"all your plans.  Strike up your Jolly Roger and hoist the Bloody Red, for no"
" quarter shall be given."
msgstr "アーッ！ お前の衣装は整然としているが、世界の終末がすべての計画を台無しにした。海賊旗を掲げ、ブラッディ・レッドを掲げよう。容赦はしない。"

