msgid "Teacher"
msgstr "教師"

#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Teacher"
msgstr "教師"

#. ~ Profession (male Teacher) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You've been teaching kids for the whole of your life, and they've mostly "
"listened to your teachings.  However, the dead won't write out lines for "
"eating you alive."
msgstr ""
"人生の大部分を教師として生きてきた。今までに教えたどの子供も概ね良き生徒でしたが、今や彼らの目的は恩師を生きたまま食うことであって、宿題の作文を書いてくることはもうない。"

#. ~ Profession (female Teacher) description
#: data/json/professions.json
