#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Heist Crew"
msgstr "強盗団"

#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Heist Crew"
msgstr "強盗団"

#. ~ Profession (male Heist Crew) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"For as long as you can remember, you have lived a double life: a normal "
"driver by the day and a heist driver in the night.  Now you've got one last "
"job."
msgstr ""
"物心ついた頃から、お前は二重生活を送ってきた。昼は普通のドライバー、夜は強盗の逃走用ドライバーとして。今、お前には最後の仕事が残されている。"

#. ~ Profession (female Heist Crew) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"For as long as you can remember, you have lived a double life: a normal "
"driver by the day and a heist driver in the night.  Now you've got one last "
"job."
msgstr ""
"物心ついた頃から、お前は二重生活を送ってきた。昼は普通のドライバー、夜は強盗の逃走用ドライバーとして。今、お前には最後の仕事が残されている。"

#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Neighborhood Watch"
msgstr "自治会自警団"

#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Neighborhood Watch"
msgstr "自治会自警団"

#. ~ Profession (male Neighborhood Watch) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You always knew the end was coming - maybe not zombies, but something bad. "
"Between late-night doomsday movies, cheap beer, and greasy pizza, you talked"
" your neighbors into taking it seriously. When it all went down, you grabbed"
" the truck, called the boys, and swore you’d keep the neighborhood safe. Now"
" it’s time to put those plans into action."
msgstr ""
"お前は終末が来ることを予知していた――ゾンビではないにしても、何か悪いことが起きると。夜中の終末映画と、安酒と脂っこいピザを肴に、お前は近隣住民を説得して事態を真剣に受け止めさせた。すべてが始まったとき、お前はトラックに飛び乗り、仲間を呼び出し、この近所を必ず守ると誓った。今こそ、その計画を実行に移す時だ。"

#. ~ Profession (female Neighborhood Watch) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You always knew the end was coming - maybe not zombies, but something bad. "
"Between late-night doomsday movies, cheap beer, and greasy pizza, you talked"
" your neighbors into taking it seriously. When it all went down, you grabbed"
" the truck, called the boys, and swore you’d keep the neighborhood safe. Now"
" it’s time to put those plans into action."
msgstr ""
"お前は終末が来ることを予知していた――ゾンビではないにしても、何か悪いことが起きると。夜中の終末映画と、安酒と脂っこいピザを肴に、お前は近隣住民を説得して事態を真剣に受け止めさせた。すべてが始まったとき、お前はトラックに飛び乗り、仲間を呼び出し、この近所を必ず守ると誓った。今こそ、その計画を実行に移す時だ。"

#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Exterminator"
msgstr "害虫駆除業者"

#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Exterminator"
msgstr "害虫駆除業者"

#. ~ Profession (male Exterminator) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Before the world fell apart, you were the first line of defense against "
"roaches, rats, and worse. Armed with sprays, traps, and a healthy dose of "
"stubbornness, you knew every trick in the book for clearing infestations. "
"Now, your skills have never been more relevant - the pests are bigger, "
"meaner, and sometimes hungry for you."
msgstr ""
"世界が崩壊する前、お前はゴキブリ、ネズミ、そしてさらに厄介な害虫から身を守る最前線にいた。殺虫剤や罠、そして持ち前の頑固さで、お前は害虫駆除のあらゆる手口を知り尽くしていた。今、その技術はかつてないほど重要になっている――害虫はより巨大で、凶暴になり、時にはお前を食らおうと牙を剥く。"

#. ~ Profession (female Exterminator) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Before the world fell apart, you were the first line of defense against "
"roaches, rats, and worse. Armed with sprays, traps, and a healthy dose of "
"stubbornness, you knew every trick in the book for clearing infestations. "
"Now, your skills have never been more relevant - the pests are bigger, "
"meaner, and sometimes hungry for you."
msgstr ""
"世界が崩壊する前、お前はゴキブリ、ネズミ、そしてさらに厄介な害虫から身を守る最前線にいた。殺虫剤や罠、そして持ち前の頑固さで、お前は害虫駆除のあらゆる手口を知り尽くしていた。今、その技術はかつてないほど重要になっている――害虫はより巨大で、凶暴になり、時にはお前を食らおうと牙を剥く。"

#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Hazmat Unit"
msgstr "ハズマットユニット"

#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Hazmat Unit"
msgstr "ハズマットユニット"

#. ~ Profession (male Hazmat Unit) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were deployed to autopsy one of the rioters showing feral behavior "
"before being put down.  When they got back up, you knew this was out of your"
" pay grade."
msgstr ""
"お前は、野性的な行動をしている暴徒の一人を解剖するために派遣されたが、仕留める前にその人物が再び立ち上がったとき、これは自分の手に余る案件だと悟った。"

#. ~ Profession (female Hazmat Unit) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were deployed to autopsy one of the rioters showing feral behavior "
"before being put down.  When they got back up, you knew this was out of your"
" pay grade."
msgstr ""
"お前は、野性的な行動を示している暴徒の一人を解剖するために派遣されたが、仕留める前にその人物が再び立ち上がったとき、これは自分の手に余る案件だと悟った。"

#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Military Corpse Disposal"
msgstr "軍用遺体処理"

#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Military Corpse Disposal"
msgstr "軍用遺体処理"

#. ~ Profession (male Military Corpse Disposal) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"In response to the outbreak, you were dispatched to contain the infection by"
" burning the corpses.  With command consumed by the undead, your priorities "
"have shifted to basic survival."
msgstr ""
"アウトブレイクへの対応として、お前は感染を封じ込めるため、遺体を焼却する任務に派遣された。しかし、指揮系統がアンデッドに占拠され、現在は生き残ることが最優先となった。"

#. ~ Profession (female Military Corpse Disposal) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"In response to the outbreak, you were dispatched to contain the infection by"
" burning the corpses.  With command consumed by the undead, your priorities "
"have shifted to basic survival."
msgstr ""
"アウトブレイクへの対応として、お前は感染を封じ込めるため、遺体を焼却する任務に派遣された。しかし、指揮系統がアンデッドに占拠され、現在は生き残ることが最優先となった。"

#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Major General"
msgstr "少将"

#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Major General"
msgstr "少将"

#. ~ Profession (male Major General) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You worked your way up through the ranks from a no-name private to a big "
"shot Major General, respected and decorated.  On the downside, years of desk"
" duty have left your shooting skills rusty, and all the medals in the world "
"won't protect you now."
msgstr ""
"お前は無名の二等兵から始まり、階級を上げて名声ある少将にまで昇り詰めた。尊敬され、数々の勲章を授与されてきた。しかし、その反面、長年の机上勤務により射撃技能は鈍っており、今ではどれほどの勲章もお前を守ってはくれない。"

#. ~ Profession (female Major General) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You worked your way up through the ranks from a no-name private to a big "
"shot Major General, respected and decorated.  On the downside, years of desk"
" duty have left your shooting skills rusty, and all the medals in the world "
"won't protect you now."
msgstr ""
"お前は無名の二等兵から始まり、階級を上げて名声ある少将にまで昇り詰めた。尊敬され、数々の勲章を授与されてきた。しかし、その反面、長年の机上勤務により射撃技能は鈍っており、今ではどれほどの勲章もお前を守ってはくれない。"

#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Knight"
msgstr "騎士"

#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Knight"
msgstr "騎士"

#. ~ Profession (male Knight) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Chivalry! Daring! Honor! All traits that are useless in the Cataclysm. But "
"you know how to fight with a sword and you have this armor so it could be "
"worse."
msgstr ""
"騎士道！大胆さ！名誉！これらはすべて大災厄においては無用な特性だ。だが、お前は剣の戦い方を知っているし、この鎧もある。最悪の状況は避けられたと言えるだろう。"

#. ~ Profession (female Knight) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
