#. ~ Description for scenario 'Challenge - The Lost And Damned' for a male
#. character.
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You spent the first few weeks of the Cataclysm in a dull haze.  The riots "
"have died down and the summer sun has drawn out the stench of decay.  You "
"stagger out of your hiding place with a gnawing hunger, unsure if you're the"
" only one left alive, or if this is what living death is like."
msgstr ""
"大災厄が起きてから最初の数週間、朦朧とした頭で過ごしていた。暴動は収まり、夏の太陽が腐敗の悪臭を引き出している。お前は飢えに苛まれながらふらつく足取りで隠れ場所を出た…自分だけが生き残ったのか、それとも生きながら死んでいるのか、確信は持てない。"

