msgid "Prison"
msgstr "刑務所"

#. ~ Description for scenario 'Prison' for a male character.
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"When the Cataclysm happened, you were convicted or working in a prison.  Now"
" the prisoners have turned into mindless horrors and the security bots are "
"shooting on sight… you might need to expedite your escape plans."
msgstr ""
"大災厄が起こったとき、お前は有罪判決を受けていたか、あるいは刑務所で働いていた。現在、囚人たちは無思考の怪物へと化し、警備ロボットは発見次第射撃を開始している……脱出計画を急がせたほうがよい。"

