#: data/json/items/ammo.json data/mods/Aftershock/items/item_overrides.json
msgid "battery"
msgid_plural "batteries"
msgstr[0] "バッテリー"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'battery', 'str_pl': 'batteries'}
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid ""
"Some free-floating battery charge.  This can be reloaded into rechargable "
"battery cells, but can never be unloaded."
msgstr "浮遊しているバッテリー電力。充電式バッテリーに再充填できるが、一度充填すると取り出せない。"

#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "radioisotope thermoelectric generator"
msgid_plural "radioisotope thermoelectric generators"
msgstr[0] "放射性同位体熱電発電機"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'radioisotope thermoelectric generator'}
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid ""
"Did your neighbors brag about their cool beta-decay powered nightlights?  Do"
" them one better!  The CuppaTech 4 radioisotope thermoelectric generator is "
"a three kilogram chunk of metal - mostly lead - with a slug of curium-244 "
"encased within.  It is capable of generating somewhere between 100-150 Watts"
" of thermal energy, although its electrical generation capacity is minimal "
"at only 2 Watts.  Careful!  Curium is great at making heat, and also "
"releases deadly gamma radiation.  Keep away from cellular life forms."
msgstr ""
"隣人がベータ崩壊式ナイトライトを自慢しているか？それよりも上を行こう。CuppaTech 4 "
"放射性同位体熱電発電機は、3kgの金属塊(主に鉛)で、内部にキュリウム244の塊を封入している。100～150ワットの熱エネルギーを発生可能だが、電力発電能力はわずか2ワットと非常に低い。注意:キュリウムは熱を発生させるのに優れているが、致死的なガンマ線も放出する。生物には近づけないでおくこと。"

#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid "aluminum foil"
msgid_plural "aluminum foils"
msgstr[0] "アルミホイル"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'aluminum foil'}
#: data/json/items/ammo.json
msgid ""
"A thin foil made of aluminum.  Sometimes called 'tin foil' due to being made"
" of tin in the past."
msgstr "アルミニウム製の薄い箔。過去にはスズで作られていたことから、「ティンホイル」と呼ばれることがある。"

