#: data/json/items/fuel.json
msgid "ethanol"
msgid_plural "ethanol"
msgstr[0] "エタノール"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'ethanol'}
#: data/json/items/fuel.json
msgid ""
"Extremely pure alcohol suitable for use as a component in chemical "
"reactions.  You could also water it down and drink it, or use it as fuel in "
"alcohol-burning stoves."
msgstr ""
"極めて高純度のアルコール。化学反応の成分として適している。水で薄めて飲むこともできるし、アルコール焚きストーブの燃料として使うこともできる。"

#: data/json/items/fuel.json
msgid "denatured alcohol"
msgid_plural "denatured alcohols"
msgstr[0] "変性アルコール"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'denatured alcohol'}
#: data/json/items/fuel.json
msgid ""
"A high-strength ethanol solution mixed with methanol to make it toxic to "
"drink, so as to avoid pre-apocalyptic regulations on ethanol.  Intended for "
"use in alcohol-burning stoves and as a solvent."
msgstr ""
"高濃度のエタノール溶液にメタノールを混合し、飲用に毒として破滅前のエタノール規制を回避したもの。アルコール焚きストーブの燃料や溶剤として使用することを想定。"

#: data/json/items/fuel.json
msgid "methanol"
msgid_plural "methanols"
msgstr[0] "メタノール"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'methanol'}
#: data/json/items/fuel.json
msgid ""
"High purity methanol suitable for use in chemical reactions.  Could be used "
"in alcohol-burning stoves.  Very toxic."
msgstr "高純度のメタノール。化学反応の成分として適している。アルコール焚きストーブでの使用も可能。極めて有毒。"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'diesel'}
#: data/json/items/fuel.json
msgid ""
"Petroleum-based fuel made from a byproduct of the gasoline making process."
msgstr "ガソリンの製造過程における副産物から作られる石油由来の燃料。"

#: data/json/items/fuel.json
msgid "JP8 fuel"
msgid_plural "JP8 fuel"
msgstr[0] "JP-8燃料"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'JP8 fuel'}
#: data/json/items/fuel.json
msgid ""
"A kerosene-based fuel used mainly by US military vehicles as a replacement "
"for diesel and jet fuel, to simplify logistics."
msgstr "灯油由来の燃料。主に米軍車両が、軽油およびジェット燃料の代替として兵站の簡素化のために使用する。"

#: data/json/items/fuel.json
msgid "avgas fuel"
msgid_plural "avgas fuel"
msgstr[0] "アブガス"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'avgas fuel'}
#: data/json/items/fuel.json
msgid "A specialized type of petroleum-based fuel used to power aircraft."
msgstr "特殊な石油由来の燃料。航空機に動力を与えるために使用される。"

#: data/json/items/fuel.json
msgid "biodiesel"
msgid_plural "biodiesel"
msgstr[0] "バイオディーゼル"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'biodiesel'}
#: data/json/items/fuel.json
msgid ""
"Vegetable oil- or animal fat-based diesel fuel consisting of long-chain "
"alkyl (methyl, ethyl, or propyl) esters."
msgstr "植物油または動物脂肪由来の軽油。長鎖アルキル(methyl, ethyl, または propyl)エステルから構成される。"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'gasoline'}
#: data/json/items/fuel.json
msgid ""
"Gasoline is a highly flammable liquid.  When under pressure, it has the "
"potential for violent explosion."
msgstr "引火性の高い液体。圧力下では激しい爆発を起こす可能性がある。"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'lamp oil'}
#: data/json/items/fuel.json
msgid "A thin and clean-burning oil made for use in oil lamps."
msgstr "薄く、燃焼時にすすの少ないオイル。オイルランプ用に作られた。"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'motor oil'}
#: data/json/items/fuel.json
msgid "An oil made for use in car engines."
msgstr "自動車のエンジン用に作られた潤滑油。"

#: data/json/items/fuel.json
msgid "napalm"
msgid_plural "napalm"
msgstr[0] "ナパーム"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'napalm'}
#: data/json/items/fuel.json
msgid ""
"This is gasoline mixed with some other components to make it stick to the "
"surface and increase burning temperature, meant to be used with a "
"flamethrower."
msgstr "ガソリンに他の成分を混合し、表面に付着させ、燃焼温度を上昇させるようにした燃料。火炎放射器用に設計されている。"

#: data/json/items/fuel.json
msgid "gelled gasoline"
msgid_plural "gelled gasoline"
msgstr[0] "ゲル化ガソリン"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'gelled gasoline'}
#: data/json/items/fuel.json
msgid ""
"A flammable gel composed of gasoline and a chemical that renders it to a "
"gel, it is roughly similar in properties to napalm b.  It's meant to be used"
" with a flamethrower."
msgstr "ガソリンとそれをゲル状にする化学物質から構成される可燃性のゲル。性質はナパームBと概ね類似。火炎放射器用に設計されている。"

#: data/json/items/fuel.json
msgid "flamethrower fuel"
msgid_plural "flamethrower fuel"
msgstr[0] "火炎放射器燃料"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'flamethrower fuel'}
#: data/json/items/fuel.json
msgid ""
"A mixture of gasoline and diesel oil in equal parts.  Its combustion "
"properties make it unfit for applications where you would use any of them "
"separately, but it can be used to feed a flamethrower."
msgstr "ガソリンとディーゼルオイルを同量混合した液体。燃焼特性上、個別に使用する用途には不適だが、火炎放射器に供給することはできる。"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'butane'}
#: data/json/items/fuel.json
msgid ""
"A flammable natural gas product typically used in lighters, stored as a "
"pressurized liquid.  It could be useful as a fuel, but also as a solvent or "
"chemical reagent."
msgstr "ライターに一般的に使われる可燃性の天然ガス製品で、加圧された液体として貯蔵されている。燃料としてだけでなく、溶剤や化学試薬としても有用だ。"

#: data/json/items/furniture.json
