msgid "liquid cooling suit"
msgid_plural "liquid cooling suits"
msgstr[0] "温度調節スーツ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'liquid cooling suit'}
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"This a bodysuit with a number of heatsinks and heating coils tied to a "
"liquid coolant system, and a built-in thermometer.  Use it to turn it on, "
"helping to keep the entire body at an ideal temperature"
msgstr ""
"多数のヒートシンクと加熱コイルを備えたボディスーツで、液体冷却システムと内蔵温度計に接続されている。これを使うと作動し、全身を理想的な温度に保つのを助ける。"

#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid "liquid cooling suit (on)"
msgid_plural "liquid cooling suits (on)"
msgstr[0] "温度調節スーツ(作動中)"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'liquid cooling suit (on)', 'str_pl': 'liquid
#. cooling suits (on)'}
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"This a bodysuit with a number of heatsinks and heating coils tied to a "
"liquid coolant system, and a built-in thermometer.  It is currently working "
"to keep the entire body at an ideal temperature, use it to turn it off."
msgstr "ヒートシンクと加熱コイルが液体冷却システムと連動するボディスーツ。内蔵温度計を備え、現在は全身を理想の温度に保っている。使うと止まる。"

#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid "pair of binoculars"
msgid_plural "pairs of binoculars"
msgstr[0] "双眼鏡"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'pair of binoculars', 'str_pl': 'pairs of
#. binoculars'}
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A pair of optics with a neck strap attached.  Useful for seeing long "
"distances.  Wearing this item or carrying it in your inventory will double "
"the distance around you that is mapped during your travels.  You could also "
"use them to focus the sunlight."
msgstr "ネックストラップ付きの双眼鏡。遠距離の視認に有用。装備または所持で、移動時のマップ展開範囲が2倍になる。使うと日光を集中させられる。"

#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid "headlamp"
msgid_plural "headlamps"
