#. ~ Description for {'str': 'headlamp'}
#: data/json/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"This is an LED headlamp with an adjustable strap so as to be comfortably "
"worn on your head or attached to your helmet.  Use it to turn it on."
msgstr "LED式ヘッドランプ。頭またはヘルメットに装着可能な調節式ストラップ付き。使うと点く。"

