"A black replica pirate flag, depicting a skeleton stabbing a heart with a "
"spear."
msgstr "黒いレプリカの海賊旗。スケルトンが槍で心臓を刺している。"

#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A black replica pirate flag, depicting an arm holding a cutlass."
msgstr "黒いレプリカの海賊旗。カットラスを持った腕を描いている。"

#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A black replica pirate flag, depicting a skull."
msgstr "黒いレプリカの海賊旗。ドクロを描いている。"

#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "Foodperson's cape"
msgid_plural "Foodperson's capes"
msgstr[0] "フードパーソンケープ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': "Foodperson's cape"}
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A brightly-colored cape emblazoned with the \"Fp\" symbol."
msgstr "色鮮やかなケープ。『Fp』のシンボルが大きく掲げられている。"

#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "cloak"
msgid_plural "cloaks"
msgstr[0] "クローク"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'cloak'}
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A heavy cloak meant to be thrown over your body."
msgstr "身体に被せる用の重厚な外套。"

#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "fur cloak"
msgid_plural "fur cloaks"
msgstr[0] "ファークローク"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'fur cloak'}
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A heavy fur cloak meant to be thrown over your body."
msgstr "身体に被せる用の、毛皮製の分厚い外套。"

#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "leather cloak"
msgid_plural "leather cloaks"
msgstr[0] "レザークローク"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'leather cloak'}
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A heavy leather cloak meant to be thrown over your body.  Provides decent "
"protection."
msgstr "身体に被せる用の、革製の分厚い外套。ある程度の防御を提供。"

#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "wool cloak"
msgid_plural "wool cloaks"
msgstr[0] "ウールクローク"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'wool cloak'}
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "A heavy woolen cloak meant to be thrown over your body."
msgstr "身体に被せる用の、羊毛製の分厚い外套。"

#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "Jedi cloak"
msgid_plural "Jedi cloaks"
msgstr[0] "ジェダイクローク"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Jedi cloak'}
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"Long, flowing robes.  Simple and comfortable to wear.  Be sure to tear it "
"off dramatically before fighting any foes!"
msgstr "長く流れるローブ。簡素で着心地がよい。敵と戦う前に、格好よく脱げ！"

#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "FB51 optical cloak"
msgid_plural "FB51 optical cloaks"
msgstr[0] "FB51光学迷彩クローク"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'FB51 optical cloak'}.
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "Your optical cloak flickers as it becomes transparent."
msgstr "光学迷彩外套が明滅し、透明になる。"

#. ~ Use action need_charges_msg for {'str': 'FB51 optical cloak'}.
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "You don't have enough UPS charges to turn on the %s"
msgstr "%sの電源を入れるのに十分なUPSの電力がない"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'FB51 optical cloak'}
#. ~ Description for {'str': 'FB51 optical cloak (on)', 'str_pl': 'FB51
#. optical cloaks (on)'}
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A plastic cloak embedded with cameras and LEDs that will render you fully "
"invisible to normal vision when powered and worn.  You must be carrying a "
"unified power supply, or UPS, to use it.  Activate to toggle visibility."
msgstr ""
"カメラとLEDが埋め込まれたプラスチック製の外套。電源が入り、着用されている状態で、通常の視界から完全に姿を消す。使用には統合電源[UPS]が必要。Activateで可視/不可視を切り替え。"

#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "FB51 optical cloak (on)"
msgid_plural "FB51 optical cloaks (on)"
msgstr[0] "FB51光学迷彩クローク[作動中]"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'FB51 optical cloak (on)', 'str_pl': 'FB51
#. optical cloaks (on)'}.
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "The %s flickers for a moment as it becomes opaque."
msgstr "%sが明滅し、不透明になる。"

#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "wool poncho"
msgid_plural "wool ponchos"
msgstr[0] "ウールポンチョ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'wool poncho'}
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid ""
"A simple wool garment worn over the torso.  Provides a bit of protection."
msgstr "胴体に羽織る羊毛製のシンプルな衣服。少しだけ保護する。"

#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "snuggie"
msgid_plural "snuggies"
msgstr[0] "スナギー"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'snuggie'}
#: data/json/items/armor/cloaks.json
msgid "Perfect for reading all those books you scavenged."
msgstr "拾ってきた本を読むのに最適。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "turnout coat"
msgid_plural "turnout coats"
msgstr[0] "ターナウトコート"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'turnout coat'}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A heavy protective coat worn by firefighters.  Highly resistant to heat and "
"flame, it provides excellent protection from injury."
msgstr "頑丈な消防士用防火衣。熱と炎に優れた耐性を持ち、怪我から優れた保護を提供。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "cassock"
msgid_plural "cassocks"
msgstr[0] "カソック"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'cassock'}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A piece of clerical clothing, usually worn by Christian priests."
msgstr "キリスト教の神職者が通常着用する服。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "fur coat"
msgid_plural "fur coats"
msgstr[0] "ファーコート"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'fur coat'}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A fur coat with a couple small pockets.  Extremely warm."
msgstr "小さなポケットが2つ付いた毛皮製のコート。非常に暖かい。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "faux fur coat"
msgid_plural "faux fur coats"
msgstr[0] "フェイクファーコート"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'faux fur coat'}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A garishly-colored faux fur coat with a couple small pockets.  Although not "
"as warm as the natural fur, it gives you some of that unique flair."
msgstr "小さなポケットが2つ付いた、派手な色のフェイクファーコート。天然の毛皮ほど暖かくないが、独特の華やかさを与える。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "sable coat"
msgid_plural "sable coats"
msgstr[0] "サブルコート"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'sable coat'}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A very well-made fur coat, featuring thick panels of sable fur.  Very warm "
"and very good-looking."
msgstr "非常に上質な毛皮のコート。厚手の黒貂皮を使用。非常に暖かく、見た目も良い。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "lab coat"
msgid_plural "lab coats"
msgstr[0] "ラボコート"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'lab coat'}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A long white coat with several large pockets.  Comes with a very nice pocket"
" protector."
msgstr "複数の大きなポケットが付いた白いロングコート。上質なポケットプロテクター付き。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "rain coat"
msgid_plural "rain coats"
msgstr[0] "レインコート"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'rain coat'}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A plastic coat with a hood and two very large pockets.  Provides protection "
"from rain."
msgstr "フードと大きなポケットが2つ付いたビニール製のコート。雨から保護する。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "gutskin parka"
msgid_plural "gutskin parkas"
msgstr[0] "ガスキンパルカ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'gutskin parka'}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"An intricately sewn coat of treated and split intestines, prized for its "
"light weight and waterproofness among the indigenous peoples of the arctic."
msgstr "処理済みで裂かれた腸を丁寧に縫い合わせたコート。北極圏の先住民族に軽量性と防水性の高さから珍重されている。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "winter coat"
msgid_plural "winter coats"
msgstr[0] "ウィンターコート"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'winter coat'}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A padded coat with deep pockets and a hood.  Very warm."
msgstr "深いポケットとフードが付いたパッド入りのコート。非常に暖かい。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "duster"
msgid_plural "dusters"
msgstr[0] "ダスター"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'duster'}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A rugged full-length duster coat.  Has many pockets for storage."
msgstr "全身を覆う丈夫なダスターコート。収納用に多くのポケットがある。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "fur duster"
msgid_plural "fur dusters"
msgstr[0] "ファーダスター"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'fur duster'}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A thick fur full-length duster.  Has many pockets for storage."
msgstr "厚手の毛皮で作った、全身を覆うダスターコート。収納用に多くのポケットがある。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "faux fur duster"
msgid_plural "faux fur dusters"
msgstr[0] "フェイクファダスター"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'faux fur duster'}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A thick faux fur duster, falling below your knees.  Has many pockets for "
"storing things."
msgstr "厚手のフェイクファー製ダスターコート。膝より下まである。物を収納するための多くのポケットがある。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "leather duster"
msgid_plural "leather dusters"
msgstr[0] "レザーダスター"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'leather duster'}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A thick leather full-length duster.  Has many pockets for storage."
msgstr "厚手の革で作った、全身を覆うダスターコート。収納用に多くのポケットがある。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "survivor duster"
msgid_plural "survivor dusters"
msgstr[0] "サバイバーダスター"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'survivor duster'}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A Kevlar armored custom full-length duster, covered with pouches and "
"pockets.  Comfortable, durable, and great for storage."
msgstr "ケブラー製の装甲を施した特製のロングダスター。ポーチとポケットで覆われており、快適で耐久性が高く、収納に優れる。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "greatcoat"
msgid_plural "greatcoats"
msgstr[0] "グレートコート"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'greatcoat'}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A heavy, full-length wool coat.  Cumbersome, but warm and with deep pockets."
msgstr "重く嵩張るが、暖かく、深いポケットがある羊毛製のロングコート。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "hakama"
msgid_plural "hakamas"
msgstr[0] "袴"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'hakama'}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "Plain black hakama for use in kendo and other martial arts."
msgstr "剣道や他の武道用の、無地の黒い袴。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'hakama'}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A flowing, pleated garment which can be worn over a kimono."
msgstr "着物の上に着られる、折りひだのあるゆったりとした衣服。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "bathrobe"
msgid_plural "bathrobes"
msgstr[0] "バスローブ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'bathrobe'}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"An outer garment of absorbent, towel-like material traditionally worn to "
"cover one's nakedness to and from the bath.  It makes you wish you had "
"running water to bathe with."
msgstr "風呂の出入り時に裸を隠すために古くから使われる、吸水性の高いタオル状の外衣。流水が使えたなら、と願わずにはいられない。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "army jacket"
msgid_plural "army jacket"
msgstr[0] "アーミージャケット"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'army jacket'}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A tough jacket with lots of pockets.  Favored by the military."
msgstr "複数のポケットが付いた、軍に好まれる丈夫なジャケット。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "chef's jacket"
msgid_plural "chef's jackets"
msgstr[0] "シェフジャケット"

#. ~ Description for {'str': "chef's jacket"}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"This double-breasted uniform is unusually thick to protect against the heat "
"of the kitchen."
msgstr "調理場の熱気から身を守るために、かなり厚く作られたダブル仕立ての制服。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "emergency jacket"
msgid_plural "emergency jackets"
msgstr[0] "エマージェンシージャケット"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'emergency jacket'}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A bright & cheaply made FEMA-issue windbreaker jacket with a hood.  One "
"size, fits none.  Helps keep you unfrozen & visible for rescuers."
msgstr ""
"FEMAが配布した、フード付きの色鮮やかな安物ウインドブレーカー。ワンサイズだが、誰にも合わない。凍えるのを防ぎ、救助者に気づいてもらいやすい。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "flannel jacket"
msgid_plural "flannel jackets"
msgstr[0] "フランネルジャケット"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'flannel jacket'}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A jacket made from flannel-style denim, favored by outdoorsy types.  "
"Provides decent protection from cuts."
msgstr "フランネル調デニム製のジャケット。アウトドア派に好まれる。適度な対刃性能を備える。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "jean jacket"
msgid_plural "jean jackets"
msgstr[0] "デニムジャケット"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'jean jacket'}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A jacket made from denim.  Provides decent protection from cuts."
msgstr "デニム製のジャケット。適度な対刃性能を備える。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A jacket made from denim.  Provides decent protection from cuts.  This one "
"is haphazardly covered with patches featuring metal band logos."
msgstr "デニム製のジャケット。適度な対刃性能を備える。メタルバンドのロゴを模したワッペンがでたらめに縫い付けられている。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "leather jacket"
msgid_plural "leather jackets"
msgstr[0] "レザージャケット"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'leather jacket'}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A jacket made from thick leather.  Cumbersome, but offers excellent "
"protection from cuts."
msgstr "厚い革製のジャケット。嵩張るが、対刃性に優れる。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "red leather jacket"
msgid_plural "red leather jackets"
msgstr[0] "レッドレザージャケット"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'red leather jacket'}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A candy-apple-red leather jacket with black strips and shoulder protrusions."
"  It has a number of zippers and snaps in the front."
msgstr "黒いラインと肩部の隆起が特徴的な、キャンディアップルレッドのレザージャケット。前面に複数のジッパーと留め具がある。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "light jacket"
msgid_plural "light jackets"
msgstr[0] "ライトジャケット"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'light jacket'}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A thin cotton jacket with a hood.  Good for brisk weather."
msgstr "フード付きの薄手綿ジャケット。過ごしやすい天候に適している。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "windbreaker"
msgid_plural "windbreakers"
msgstr[0] "ウィンドブレーカー"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'windbreaker'}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A light synthetic jacket with a hood.  Not very warm, but will keep out the "
"rain."
msgstr "フード付きの軽量な合成繊維ジャケット。あまり暖かくないが、雨を防ぐ。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "judo gi"
msgid_plural "judo gis"
msgstr[0] "柔道着"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'judo gi'}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"Plain white judo gi.  Thick and a little stiff, it gives minor protection "
"from cuts and punches."
msgstr "無地の白い柔道着。厚手でやや硬く、斬撃や打撃から多少保護する。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "karate gi"
msgid_plural "karate gis"
msgstr[0] "空手着"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'karate gi'}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"Plain white karate gi.  Loose and flowing, it offers little protection, and "
"little encumbrance."
msgstr "真っ白な空手着。ゆったりとしてなめらかな着姿だが、防御力は低く、動作制限も少ない。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "kariginu"
msgid_plural "kariginus"
msgstr[0] "狩衣"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'kariginu'}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A traditional, ankle-length Shinto robe with several layers and very wide "
"sleeves."
msgstr "足首まで届く長さの伝統的な神道用装束。何層にも重なった生地に、非常に広い袖が特徴。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "keikogi"
msgid_plural "keikogis"
msgstr[0] "稽古着"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'keikogi'}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "Plain white keikogi for use in martial arts."
msgstr "無地の白い稽古着。武道用。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "kimono"
msgid_plural "kimonos"
msgstr[0] "着物"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'kimono'}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A traditional, ankle-length Japanese robe, wrapped around the body with a "
"sash."
msgstr "伝統的な足首までの和服。帯で体に巻き付けるように着用。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "yukata"
msgid_plural "yukatas"
msgstr[0] "浴衣"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'yukata'}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"An easy-to-wear, breezy robe secured with a sash.  Essentially Japanese "
"pajamas.  Great for summer nights."
msgstr "帯で留める、着やすい涼しいローブ。本質的に日本のパジャマ。夏の夜に最適。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "haori"
msgid_plural "haoris"
msgstr[0] "羽織"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'haori'}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A loose coat with wide sleeves that is worn unfastened over a kimono.  It is"
" jet black with sparse, tasteful golden embroidery."
msgstr "着物の上に留めず羽織る、幅広袖のゆったりとした上着。漆黒の地に、控えめな金色の刺繍が施されている。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "kittel"
msgid_plural "kittels"
msgstr[0] "キッテル"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'kittel'}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A white, knee-length cotton robe, traditionally worn by Jews on special "
"occasions."
msgstr "白い木綿のローブ。膝丈。特別な行事でユダヤ人が伝統的に着用。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "peacoat"
msgid_plural "peacoats"
msgstr[0] "ピーコート"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'peacoat'}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A heavy wool coat.  Cumbersome, but warm and with deep pockets."
msgstr "重い羊毛コート。かさばるが、暖かく、深いポケットを持つ。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "robe"
msgid_plural "robes"
msgstr[0] "ローブ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'robe'}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A loose-fitting outer garment with sleeves, and a mysterious amount of well-"
"hidden pockets."
msgstr "袖付きのゆったりとした上着。謎めいたほど多数の、よく隠されたポケットを持つ。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "ski jacket"
msgid_plural "ski jackets"
msgstr[0] "スキージャケット"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'ski jacket'}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"An insulated, breathable hoodie made for alpine skiing.  Very warm, and with"
" sizable pockets."
msgstr "アルペンスキー用の断熱・通気性パーカー。非常に暖かく、大きめのポケットを持つ。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "sleeveless duster"
msgid_plural "sleeveless dusters"
msgstr[0] "スリーブダスター"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'sleeveless duster'}
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A rugged full-length duster that leaves your arms unencumbered.  Has plenty "
"of storage space due to its many pockets."
msgstr "丈夫なロング丈の袖なしダスター。腕を拘束せず、多数のポケットで収納スペースが豊富。"

#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "sleeveless fur duster"
