#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Guy Fawkes mask'}
#: data/json/items/armor/masks.json
msgid "Remember, remember, the fifth of November."
msgstr "忘れるな、11月5日を、忘れるな。"

#: data/json/items/armor/masks.json
