#. ~ Description for {'str': 'rioter mask'}
#: data/json/items/armor/masks.json
msgid ""
"This is a t-shirt with sleeves tied on the back.  These are usually worn by "
"rioters to hide their identity."
msgstr "袖を後ろで結んだTシャツ。身元を隠すために、暴徒がよく着用している。"

#: data/json/items/armor/misc.json
