#: data/json/items/armor/misc.json
msgid "necktie"
msgid_plural "neckties"
msgstr[0] "ネクタイ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'necktie'}
#: data/json/items/armor/misc.json
msgid ""
"An ordinary, green necktie.  It's more difficult to put on, but it takes "
"real skill to do so.  Wearing a necktie is much better than wearing a clip-"
"on tie."
msgstr "ありふれた緑のネクタイ。装着は難しく、それだけの技量が要求される。ネクタイを着用するほうが、クリップオンネクタイよりずっと良い。"

