#: data/json/items/armor/power_armor.json
msgid "salvaged power armor"
msgid_plural "salvaged power armors"
msgstr[0] "サルベージパワーアーマー"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'salvaged power armor'}
#: data/json/items/armor/power_armor.json
msgid ""
"This used to be a powered exoskeleton with a set of heavy armor plates, made"
" wearable by the assist of the servos.  Now it's just the armor plating and "
"a stripped down chassis: as one might expect, it's a lot harder to wear."
msgstr ""
"かつてはサーボの支援で着用できた、重装甲プレート付きの動力外骨格。今は装甲板と簡素化されたシャーシだけとなり、予想通り着用ははるかに難しくなっている。"

#: data/json/items/armor/power_armor.json
msgid "salvaged power armor helmet"
msgid_plural "salvaged power armor helmets"
msgstr[0] "サルベージパワーヘルメット"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'salvaged power armor helmet'}
#: data/json/items/armor/power_armor.json
msgid ""
"This used to be a military-grade full-head helmet with advanced optics and "
"environmental filters.  It looks like it was decommissioned or otherwise "
"stripped for parts; now it's a very expensive hat.  It's still quite "
"durable, but quite hard to see out of."
msgstr ""
"かつては先進の光学装置と環境フィルターを備えた軍用フルフェイスヘルメット。分解または部品取りのうえで廃棄されたようで、今ではただの高価な帽子と化している。耐久性はかなり高いが、視認性は非常に悪い。"

#: data/json/items/armor/power_armor.json
msgid "power armor"
msgid_plural "suits of power armor"
msgstr[0] "パワーアーマースーツ"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'power armor', 'str_pl': 'suits of power
#. armor'}.
#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'heavy power armor', 'str_pl': 'suits of heavy
#. power armor'}.
#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'light power armor', 'str_pl': 'suits of light
#. power armor'}.
#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'survivor armored exo-suit'}.
#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'military exo-suit'}.
#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'industrial exo-suit'}.
#: data/json/items/armor/power_armor.json
msgid "The %s engages."
msgstr "%sが起動した。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'power armor', 'str_pl': 'suits of power armor'}
#: data/json/items/armor/power_armor.json
msgid ""
"These were the second wave of military combat exoskeleton, and got a lot of "
"media attention, with popular Navy commercials featuring them heavily.  It "
"consists of a muscle-boosting exoskeleton frame with overlayed segmented "
"alloy plating.  Despite advancements over the original bulky 'tank suits', "
"it's still highly cumbersome when inactive.  An integrated chemical "
"resistant bodyglove precludes wearing other clothing, aside from most "
"undergarments or handheld equipment like shields."
msgstr ""
"これは軍用戦闘外骨格の第二世代モデルで、海軍のポピュラーなコマーシャルに頻繁に登場したこともあり、多くのメディアの注目を集めた。筋力増強機能を持つ外骨格フレームに、セグメント式の合金プレートが重ねられている。初代の頑丈すぎる「タンクスーツ」に比べて進化を遂げたものの、非稼働時は依然として非常に扱いにくい。一体化された化学防護用ボディグローブのため、下着類や盾などの手持ち装備を除いて、他の服は着用できない。"

#: data/json/items/armor/power_armor.json
msgid "power armor (active)"
msgid_plural "suits of power armor (active)"
msgstr[0] "パワーアーマースーツ(作動中)"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'power armor (active)', 'str_pl': 'suits of
#. power armor (active)'}.
