msgid ""
"A nice cook book that goes beyond recipes and into the chemistry of food."
msgstr "レシピにとどまらず、食品の化学まで踏み込んだ料理本。"

#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid "To Serve Man"
msgid_plural "copies of To Serve Man"
msgstr[0] "『To Serve Man』"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'To Serve Man', 'str_pl': 'copies of To Serve
#. Man'}
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid "It's… it's a cookbook!"
msgstr "これは… まさか？… 料理本！"

#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid "Cucina Italiana"
msgid_plural "copies of Cucina Italiana"
msgstr[0] "『Cucina Italiana』"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Cucina Italiana', 'str_pl': 'copies of Cucina
#. Italiana'}
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid ""
"This cookbook is written in Italian, but handily illustrated with step by "
"step photo instructions."
msgstr "イタリア語で書かれているが、写真付きのステップバイステップ手順で実用的に図解されている。"

#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid "Sushi Made Easy"
msgid_plural "copies of Sushi Made Easy"
msgstr[0] "『誰でもできる寿司』"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Sushi Made Easy', 'str_pl': 'copies of Sushi
#. Made Easy'}
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid ""
"A simple text for the aspiring sushi lover, this easy to read guide is "
"filled with lots of helpful illustrations for everything from basic rice "
"preparation to setting a proper Japanese table."
msgstr "寿司を極めたい人のための簡単なガイド。基本的なご飯の炊き方から正しい日本風食卓のセッティングまで、多くの役立つイラストで解説されている。"

#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid "family cookbook"
msgid_plural "family cookbooks"
msgstr[0] "『家族の料理本』"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'family cookbook'}
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid ""
"A big binder full of somebody's family recipes.  The well-turned pages and "
"creased corners speak volumes of the culinary knowledge contained within.  "
"You could probably learn a lot about cooking from studying this domestic "
"artifact."
msgstr ""
"誰かの家族のレシピを収めた大きなバインダー。よくめくられたページや折り目がついた端が、その中に詰まった料理の知恵を物語っている。この家庭の遺品を学べば、料理について多くのことを学べるだろう。"

#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid "Bon Appetit"
msgid_plural "issues of Bon Appetit"
msgstr[0] "『ボン・アペティ』"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Bon Appetit', 'str_pl': 'issues of Bon Appetit'}
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid ""
"Exciting recipes and restaurant reviews.  Full of handy tips about cooking."
msgstr "刺激的なレシピとレストランのレビュー。料理に関する便利なヒントが満載。"

#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid "Glamopolitan"
msgid_plural "issues of Glamopolitan"
msgstr[0] "『グラモポリタン』"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Glamopolitan', 'str_pl': 'issues of
#. Glamopolitan'}
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid ""
"This is a full-size glossy women's magazine.  There are a few unoriginal "
"recipes and some simple cooking tips somewhere in between the fashion photos"
" and the sex advice columns."
msgstr "フルサイズの光沢紙女性雑誌。ファッション写真と性教育コラムの間に、特に目新しいものはないレシピや簡単な料理のヒントが挟まれている。"

#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid "The Modern Tanner"
msgid_plural "copies of The Modern Tanner"
msgstr[0] "『現代の皮なめし職人』"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'The Modern Tanner', 'str_pl': 'copies of The
#. Modern Tanner'}
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid ""
"An in-depth and easy to read guide that details a very modern take on the "
"ancient art of leather tanning."
msgstr "古代から伝わる皮なめしの技法を、現代風のアプローチで詳細かつ分かりやすく解説した解説書。"

#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid "PE050 \"Alpha\": Preliminary Report"
msgid_plural "copies of PE050 \"Alpha\": Preliminary Report"
msgstr[0] "『PE050 \"Alpha\":初期報告』"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'PE050 "Alpha": Preliminary Report', 'str_pl':
#. 'copies of PE050 "Alpha": Preliminary Report'}
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid ""
"This sheaf of papers--dated two weeks before all this started--describes "
"some new chemical formula, and its effects on human subjects.  It's stamped "
"\"APPROVED\"…"
msgstr ""
"この紙束の日付は、大災厄が始まる2週間前。いくつかの新しい化学式と、それらが人体被験者に与えた影響について記されている。表面には「承認済み」というスタンプが押されている…"

#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid "lab journal-Dionne"
msgid_plural "lab journals-Dionne"
msgstr[0] "『Dionneの研究日誌』"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'lab journal-Dionne', 'str_pl': 'lab journals-
#. Dionne'}
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid ""
"This team logbook details several varieties of mutagenic experiments, "
"focusing on those derived from various Earth fauna.  The team seems quite "
"enthusiastic--if not eager--about their results."
msgstr ""
"この研究日誌には、地球の動物に由来するさまざまな変異誘発実験が記されている。研究チームはその結果に非常に熱意を示しているが、むしろ熱望しているようにも見える。"

#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid "PE065 \"Chimera\": Best Practices"
msgid_plural "copies of PE065 \"Chimera\": Best Practices"
msgstr[0] "『PE065 \"Chimera\":標準手順』"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'PE065 "Chimera": Best Practices', 'str_pl':
#. 'copies of PE065 "Chimera": Best Practices'}
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid ""
"This sheaf of papers describes a new chemical formula in detail and supplies"
" instructions for its use as some sort of… crowd-control catalyst?  That "
"can't be right…"
msgstr ""
"この紙束には、新しい化学式が詳細に記されている。また、それをある種の……群衆制御用触媒として使用する手順も記載されている。……それは正しくないはずだ…"

#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid "lab journal-Smythe"
msgid_plural "lab journals-Smythe"
msgstr[0] "『Smytheの研究日誌』"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'lab journal-Smythe', 'str_pl': 'lab journals-
#. Smythe'}
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid ""
"This team logbook details several varieties of mutagenic experiments, "
"focusing on those derived from flesh contaminated with XE037.  The results "
"look promising but the procurement methods seem awfully vague…"
msgstr ""
"この研究日誌には、XE037で汚染された肉に由来するさまざまな変異誘発実験が記されている。結果は有望に見えるが、調達方法については極めて曖昧に記載されている…"

#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json data/json/items/book/misc.json
msgid "standpipe maintenance log"
msgid_plural "standpipe maintenance logs"
msgstr[0] "『配管保守記録』"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'standpipe maintenance log'}
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid ""
"This binder details the scheduled maintenance for several plumbing systems "
"throughout the facility.  However, some of the log sheets seem to be filled "
"with… a chemical formula?"
msgstr ""
"このバインダーには、施設内の複数の配管システムに関する定期保守スケジュールが詳細に記されている。しかし、一部の記録用紙は化学式で埋められている…？"

#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid "chemical reference-CLASSIFIED"
msgid_plural "chemical references-CLASSIFIED"
msgstr[0] "『化学参考資料-機密』"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'chemical reference-CLASSIFIED', 'str_pl':
#. 'chemical references-CLASSIFIED'}
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid ""
"This somewhat technical binder has several intimidating security warnings on"
" the cover, yet guarantees unauthorized readers \"permanent employment, for "
"life\".  It contains useful information on \"basic\" chemical projects like "
"methamphetamine and heroin, along with briefing on things called \"XE037\" "
"and \"PE012\"."
msgstr ""
"このやや専門的なバインダーの表紙には、いくつもの威圧的なセキュリティ警告が記されている。しかし、無断で読んだ者には「終身にわたる雇用を約束する」とも書かれている。中身には、「メタンフェタミン」や「ヘロイン」などの「基本的」な化学合成プロジェクトに関する有用な情報に加え、「XE037」や「PE012」と呼ばれる物質の概要も記載されている。"

#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid "lab journal-x-|xp"
msgid_plural "lab journals-x-|xp"
msgstr[0] "『研究日誌-x-|xp』"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'lab journal-x-|xp', 'str_pl': 'lab
#. journals-x-|xp'}
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid ""
"This damaged team logbook lacks (deliberately?) any identifying information,"
" but still contains useful information on several types of mutagen and their"
" development."
msgstr "この破損した研究日誌は、(意図的に？)識別情報を欠いているが、いくつかの変異原とその開発に関する有用な情報が残っている。"

#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid "PE023 \"Medical\": Application and Findings"
msgid_plural "copies of PE023 \"Medical\": Application and Findings"
msgstr[0] "『PE023 \"Medical\":適用と成果』"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'PE023 "Medical": Application and Findings',
#. 'str_pl': 'copies of PE023 "Medical": Application and Findings'}
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid ""
"This binder of highly technical papers describes some new chemical formula, "
"and its effects on human subjects.  It's stamped \"APPROVED\"…"
msgstr ""
"このバインダーには、いくつかの新しい化学式と、それらが人体被験者に与えた影響について記されている。表面には「承認済み」というスタンプが押されている…"

#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid "PE070 \"Raptor\": Proposal"
msgid_plural "copies of PE070 \"Raptor\": Proposal"
msgstr[0] "『PE070 \"Raptor\":提案』"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'PE070 "Raptor": Proposal', 'str_pl': 'copies of
#. PE070 "Raptor": Proposal'}
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid ""
"This sheaf of papers is a highly speculative proposal for focusing "
"\"PE065\".  Scribbled notes throughout seem to think that it might work, but"
" that there's no time."
msgstr ""
"この紙束には、PE065の集束化に関する極めて推測的な提案が記されている。至る所の走り書きメモには、「うまくいくかもしれないが、時間がない」とある。"

#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid "Best Practices for Compound Delivery"
msgid_plural "copies of Best Practices for Compound Delivery"
msgstr[0] "『化合物投与の標準手順』"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Best Practices for Compound Delivery', 'str_pl':
#. 'copies of Best Practices for Compound Delivery'}
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid ""
"This internal manual details several varieties of mutagenic experiments, as "
"well as describing the protocols used to concentrate mutagens for quicker "
"results.  The authors recommend that researchers ensure that their subjects "
"are well-fed and in good health, as the concentrated serums draw heavily on "
"subjects' bodies."
msgstr ""
"この内部マニュアルには、さまざまな変異誘発実験と、より迅速な結果を得るための変異誘発剤の濃縮プロトコルが詳細に記されている。濃縮血清は被験者の体に大きな負担をかけるため、研究者は被験者が十分に栄養を摂取し、健康であることを確実に保つよう推奨されている。"

#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid "CRC-Merck Handbook, 4th edition"
msgid_plural "copies of CRC-Merck Handbook, 4th edition"
msgstr[0] "『CRC-Merck Handbook, 第4版』"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'CRC-Merck Handbook, 4th edition', 'str_pl':
#. 'copies of CRC-Merck Handbook, 4th edition'}
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid ""
"This huge hardbound book is a collection of reference data and formulae "
"pertinent to many technical disciplines.  If poring over tables of chemical "
"and physical data is your thing, this is the book for you."
msgstr ""
"様々な技術分野に関連する参考データや数式が収録された、分厚いハードカバー本。化学や物理のデータ表に没頭して調べるのが好きなら、この1冊が最適。"

#. ~ That would translate out to The Scottish Book of Cookery, or The Scottish
#. Cookbook.
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid "Ye Scots Beuk o Cuikery"
msgid_plural "copies of Ye Scots Beuk o Cuikery"
msgstr[0] "『Ye Scots Beuk o Cuikery』"

#. ~ Description for {'//~': 'That would translate out to The Scottish Book of
#. Cookery, or The Scottish Cookbook.', 'str': 'Ye Scots Beuk o Cuikery',
#. 'str_pl': 'copies of Ye Scots Beuk o Cuikery'}
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid ""
"A semi-translated cookbook from thirteenth century Scotland.  While a bit "
"difficult to read, as there are a disquieting number of illustrations of "
"people stabbing each other mixed amongst the recipes, it provides insights "
"into medieval Scottish culture and fashion as well as new uses for oatmeal, "
"fish, and sheep liver."
msgstr ""
"13世紀のスコットランドの料理書。部分的に翻訳されているが、レシピの間に人々が互いに刺し合う不気味なイラストが多数挟まれているため、読みづらい。オートミール、魚、羊の肝臓の新たな利用法に加え、中世スコットランドの文化や服飾についても学べる。"

#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid "chemistry textbook"
msgid_plural "chemistry textbooks"
msgstr[0] "『化学教科書』"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'chemistry textbook'}
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid "A college textbook on chemistry."
msgstr "大学レベルの化学教科書。"

#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid "The Vinegar Maker's Handbook"
msgid_plural "copies of Vinegar Maker's Handbook"
msgstr[0] "『酢作りハンドブック』"

#. ~ Description for {'str': "The Vinegar Maker's Handbook", 'str_pl': "copies
#. of Vinegar Maker's Handbook"}
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid ""
"This book describes in detail all the ways that one can make vinegar.  You "
"would have thought that there wasn't much to making vinegar, but the girth "
"of this book tells you otherwise."
msgstr "酢の作り方を詳細に記した本。酢作りにそれほど奥深いものがあるとは思えなかったが、この本の分厚さが、現実がそうではないことを物語っている。"

#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid "Drink the Harvest"
msgid_plural "copies of Drink the Harvest"
msgstr[0] "『収穫を飲め』"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Drink the Harvest', 'str_pl': 'copies of Drink
#. the Harvest'}
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid ""
"Canning foods doesn't have to stop with jam and pickles.  This book provides"
" a plethora of juices that can be preserved."
msgstr "瓶詰めはジャムや酢漬けだけに限りません。この本には、保存可能なジュースの作り方が多数紹介されています。"

#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid "Offal Holiday Cooking"
msgid_plural "copies of Offal Holiday Cooking"
msgstr[0] "『内臓祝祭料理』"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Offal Holiday Cooking', 'str_pl': 'copies of
#. Offal Holiday Cooking'}
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid ""
"Offal Holiday Cooking, by Evelyn Turncoat, is a book of holiday recipes that"
" utilize organ meats from various animals.  For the true nose-to-tail cook."
msgstr "『内臓祝祭料理』――イブリン・ターンコート著。さまざまな動物の内臓を使った祝祭日のレシピ集。真のノーズ・トゥ・テール調理人のための1冊。"

#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid "Things to do with Milk"
msgid_plural "copies of Things to do with Milk"
msgstr[0] "『牛乳でできること何でも』"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Things to do with Milk', 'str_pl': 'copies of
#. Things to do with Milk'}
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid ""
"Whatever you want to do with milk, you will probably find it in this book."
msgstr "牛乳で何をしたいかに関わらず、たいてい何でもこの本に書いてある。"

#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid "Liver-Licious Recipes Your Kids Will Love"
msgid_plural "copies of Liver-Licious Recipes"
msgstr[0] "『子供もきっと気に入る肝レシピ』"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Liver-Licious Recipes Your Kids Will Love',
#. 'str_pl': 'copies of Liver-Licious Recipes'}
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid ""
"This cookbook is written by liver enthusiast Tamsyn Beckerleg.  Inside "
"you'll find a great deal of anecdotes about the near-certain ruination of "
"children who refuse to eat their liver."
msgstr "この料理本の著者は、肝臓の過激な崇拝者・タムシン・ベッケルレグ。肝を食べなかった子供は即地獄行き、という怪しげな話が山ほど載ってる。"

#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid "Dainty Dishes Fit for a King"
msgid_plural "copies of Dainty Dishes"
msgstr[0] "『国王御用達のこじゃれた一品』"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Dainty Dishes Fit for a King', 'str_pl': 'copies
#. of Dainty Dishes'}
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid ""
"This cookbook contains many fanciful recipes.  Some of them are even worth "
"the trouble to actually prepare.  Lovely pen and ink illustrations of "
"overweight knights and gluttonous monks line the pages."
msgstr ""
"この料理本には奇想天外なレシピがてんこ盛り。その中には、本当に作ってみる価値のあるものもちらほらある。ページをめくれば、いかにも堕落した太っちょ騎士や食いしん坊の修道士たちが、インクでどことなく誇らしげに描かれている。"

#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid "Eat Your Way to a Fit Physique"
msgid_plural "copies of Eat Your Way"
msgstr[0] "『そのままで理想の体に 食べ続ければ』"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Eat Your Way to a Fit Physique', 'str_pl':
#. 'copies of Eat Your Way'}
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid ""
"This self-help book is as dubious as its title.  Worse, it is boring.  It "
"does, however, contain a few basic cooking instructions."
msgstr "この自己啓発本は、タイトルと同じくらい信用ならない。もっと悪いのは、単純に退屈なことだ。まあ、基本的な調理手順は一応載ってる。"

#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid "Food Fashions for Young Moderns"
msgid_plural "copies of Food Fashions"
msgstr[0] "『モダンな若者向け 食の流行もの』"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Food Fashions for Young Moderns', 'str_pl':
#. 'copies of Food Fashions'}
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid ""
"A cookbook professing itself to be for those seeking \"daring and "
"sophisticated flavors.\"  The book exhorts the reader to defy convention and"
" break the rules, and then presents a number of useful rules and conventions"
" for preparing food."
msgstr ""
"「洗練された大胆な味」を求めている人向けの料理本。読者に「常識を破れ、ルールを壊せ」と煽るが、肝心なのは、調理のための役に立つルールや慣習がてんこ盛りなことだ。"

#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid "Winemaking for Beginners"
msgid_plural "copies of Winemaking for Beginners"
msgstr[0] "『初心者のためのワイン造り』"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Winemaking for Beginners', 'str_pl': 'copies of
#. Winemaking for Beginners'}
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid ""
"Winemaking, is an art form.  This book teaches you how to crayon within the "
"lines."
msgstr "ワイン造りは芸術だ。だがこの本が教えるのは、クレヨンで線内を塗るような安全なやり方だけだ。"

#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid "You Can Can at Home"
msgid_plural "copies of You Can Can at Home"
msgstr[0] "『自宅で瓶詰めができる』"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'You Can Can at Home', 'str_pl': 'copies of You
#. Can Can at Home'}
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid ""
"This entry-level guide to home canning talks about the importance of acidity"
" and food contents in preservation, and how to avoid contaminants in your "
"canning batches."
msgstr ""
"自宅での瓶詰保存の入門ガイド。保存における酸性度と食品の内容の重要性、および瓶詰めのロットにおける汚染物質の混入を避ける方法について述べている。"

#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid "Can Sealer Instructions"
msgid_plural "copies of Can Sealer Instructions"
msgstr[0] "『封缶機取扱説明書』"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Can Sealer Instructions', 'str_pl': 'copies of
#. Can Sealer Instructions'}
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid ""
"This dry guide to a home-use tin can sealer goes into clear detail on "
"everything you can seal with the device and how to do it safely, and "
"includes some basic recipes."
msgstr ""
"家庭用ブリキ缶封缶機について書かれた、情味に乏しい取扱説明書。封缶機で密閉できるもの、安全な密閉の手順が詳細に記載されており、基本的な料理のレシピもいくつか収録。"

#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid "The Baker's Companion"
msgid_plural "copies of The Baker's Companion"
msgstr[0] "『パン職人の相棒』"

#. ~ Description for {'str': "The Baker's Companion", 'str_pl': "copies of The
#. Baker's Companion"}
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid ""
"This book promises to teach you the ways of baking, from cakes to souffles."
msgstr "この本は、ケーキからスフレまで、ベーキングのやり方を教えると約束している。"

#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid "Fermenting Culture"
msgid_plural "copies of Fermenting Culture"
msgstr[0] "『発酵用培養』"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Fermenting Culture', 'str_pl': 'copies of
#. Fermenting Culture'}
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid ""
"Fermenting as a cooking practice only recently came back into vogue before "
"the Cataclysm.  Here is a book with dozens of recipes, many of which you are"
" unlikely to ever see the ingredients for again."
msgstr ""
"発酵は料理法として、大災厄以前に再び流行し始めていた。この本には何十ものレシピが載っているが、その多くは、もう二度と手に入らない食材で作られている。"

#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid "Out of the Holler and into the Home: A guide to home distilation. "
msgid_plural "copies of Out of the Holler"
msgstr[0] "『山奥から家庭へ:家庭内蒸留ガイド』"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Out of the Holler and into the Home: A guide to
#. home distilation. ', 'str_pl': 'copies of Out of the Holler'}
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid ""
"A book describing the history of at home distillation by liquor.  Each "
"chapter contains a complete recipe for its namesake."
msgstr "家庭での酒の蒸留の歴史を記した本。各章には、その名前と同じ蒸留酒を造るための完全なレシピが収録されている。"

#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid "Sweets for your Sweet Child"
msgid_plural "copies of Sweets for Sweet"
msgstr[0] "『良い子のための良いお菓子』"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Sweets for your Sweet Child', 'str_pl': 'copies
#. of Sweets for Sweet'}
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid ""
"Sweets for your Sweet Child is the best selling cooking book to the parents "
"of young children.  Every recipe uses oversized text, easy words and diagram"
" instructions for children learning to cook with their parents."
msgstr ""
"「良い子のための良いお菓子」は、小さな子を持つ保護者に大人気の料理本。どのレシピも、親子で一緒に料理を学べるように、大きな文字、簡単な言葉、図解付きの手順を採用。"

#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid "Pocket Survival Cookbook"
msgid_plural "copies of Pocket Survival Cookbook"
msgstr[0] "『ポケットサイズのサバイバル料理本』"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Pocket Survival Cookbook', 'str_pl': 'copies of
#. Pocket Survival Cookbook'}
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid ""
"The smallest cookbook on the market, marketed exclusively to the "
"outdoorsman.  Packs a surprising number of recipes for its tiny size."
msgstr "市場で最も小さい料理本。アウトドア愛好家専用に販売されている。この小さな本には、サイズに反して驚くほど多くのレシピが詰まっている。"

#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid "Tasting India"
msgid_plural "copies of Tasting India"
msgstr[0] "『インドを味わう』"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Tasting India', 'str_pl': 'copies of Tasting
#. India'}
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid ""
"A thick hardcover book as much about Indian culture as it is a cookbook, "
"clearly written with adoration."
msgstr "インドの文化と同様に料理に重点を置いた、分厚いハードカバーの本。著者がインドに抱く敬愛の念が、文章の端々に伝わってくる。"

#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid "Chemicals in the Water"
msgid_plural "copies of Chemicals in the Water"
msgstr[0] "水中の化学物質"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Chemicals in the Water', 'str_pl': 'copies of
#. Chemicals in the Water'}
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
msgid ""
"A binder of notes printed off some website attempting to prove that the "
"government puts chemicals in the water, to poison the population.  It "
"purports to show how to isolate \"soul poisons\" found in tap water among "
"other claims.  Someone who understands actual chemistry could learn how to "
"isolate mutagenic compounds using improvised tools, though the many "
"conspiracy theories and strange tangents mixed in make it hard to parse."
msgstr ""
"とあるウェブサイトから印刷された、水道水への化学物質混入を主張する陰謀論ノートの束だ。『魂の毒』を分離する方法などが書かれているが、支離滅裂な内容が多い。しかし、これには即席の道具で変異原性化合物を分離する、本物の化学知識が紛れ込んでいるぞ。"

#: data/json/items/book/cutting.json
