msgid_plural "copies of The Fletcher's Friend"
msgstr[0] "『矢師の友』"

#. ~ Description for {'str': "The Fletcher's Friend", 'str_pl': "copies of The
#. Fletcher's Friend"}
#: data/json/items/book/fabrication.json
msgid ""
"This hefty book is devoted to folks looking to handcraft their own arrows.  "
"It starts with a hip and snappy disclaimer about the risks, both physical "
"and legal, of using explosives and flammable materials.  Look for its "
"companion, \"The Bowyer's Buddy\"!"
msgstr ""
"この分厚い本は、自作の矢を手作りしようとする人々向けの専門書だ。冒頭には、爆発物や可燃物を使うことによる身体的・法的リスクについて、かっこよくてキレのある免責文が書かれている。関連書籍『弓師の相棒』も探してみよう！"

#: data/json/items/book/fabrication.json
msgid "The Bowyer's Buddy"
msgid_plural "copies of The Bowyer's Buddy"
msgstr[0] "『弓師の相棒』"

#. ~ Description for {'str': "The Bowyer's Buddy", 'str_pl': "copies of The
#. Bowyer's Buddy"}
#: data/json/items/book/fabrication.json
msgid ""
"This hefty book is dedicated to craftsfolk and outdoors-y types looking to "
"make their own bows.  It recommends its companion volume \"The Fletcher's "
"Friend\" for instructions on producing their ammunition."
msgstr "この分厚い本は、手工芸やアウトドアを好む人々が弓を自作するための専門書だ。弾薬の製作手順については、関連書籍『矢師の友』を参照すること。"

#: data/json/items/book/fabrication.json
msgid "The Handloader's Helper"
msgid_plural "copies of The Handloader's Helper"
