#: data/json/items/book/fabrication.json
msgid "238-NK: Practicality Enhancement"
msgid_plural "copies of 238-NK: Practicality Enhancement"
msgstr[0] "『238-NK:実用性の強化』"

#. ~ Description for {'str': '238-NK: Practicality Enhancement', 'str_pl':
#. 'copies of 238-NK: Practicality Enhancement'}
#: data/json/items/book/fabrication.json
msgid ""
"The authors of this thoroughly researched and documented proposal make a "
"very persuasive case for the adoption of spring-driven nuclear shells.  It's"
" stamped \"DENIED\"."
msgstr ""
"この入念に調査・文書化された提案の著者らは、バネ駆動式核弾頭の採用について非常に説得力のある主張を行っている。ただし、文書には「却下」というスタンプが押されている。"

#: data/json/items/book/firstaid.json
msgid "Guide to Advanced Emergency Care"
msgid_plural "copies of Guide to Advanced Emergency Care"
msgstr[0] "『上級緊急医療ガイド』"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Guide to Advanced Emergency Care', 'str_pl':
#. 'copies of Guide to Advanced Emergency Care'}
#: data/json/items/book/firstaid.json
msgid ""
"A thick textbook for paramedics describing advanced lifesaving procedures "
"and field-expedient care methods."
msgstr "救急救命士向けの分厚い教科書。高度な救命手順および資源に乏しい現場での簡易治療法について詳細に記載されている。"

#: data/json/items/book/firstaid.json
msgid "Paramedics"
msgid_plural "issues of Paramedics"
msgstr[0] "『救急救命士』"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Paramedics', 'str_pl': 'issues of Paramedics'}
#: data/json/items/book/firstaid.json
msgid "An educational magazine for EMTs."
msgstr "救急救命士向けの教育雑誌。"

#: data/json/items/book/firstaid.json
msgid "The Big Book of First Aid"
msgid_plural "copies of The Big Book of First Aid"
msgstr[0] "『応急手当大全』"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'The Big Book of First Aid', 'str_pl': 'copies of
#. The Big Book of First Aid'}
#: data/json/items/book/firstaid.json
msgid "It's big and heavy, but full of great information about first aid."
msgstr "大きくて重いが、応急手当に関する有用な情報が豊富に記載されている。"

#: data/json/items/book/firstaid.json
msgid "Pocket Guide to First Aid"
msgid_plural "copies of Pocket Guide to First Aid"
msgstr[0] "『応急手当ポケットガイド』"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Pocket Guide to First Aid', 'str_pl': 'copies of
#. Pocket Guide to First Aid'}
#: data/json/items/book/firstaid.json
msgid ""
"This pocket-sized leather-bound guide to first aid combines a wealth of "
"concise information with simple to follow instructions and easy to read "
"illustrations."
msgstr "ポケットサイズの革表紙による応急手当ガイド。簡潔な情報と分かりやすい手順、読みやすい図解を併せ持つ。"

#: data/json/items/book/firstaid.json
msgid "First Responder Handbook"
msgid_plural "copies of First Responder Handbook"
msgstr[0] "『第一対応者ハンドブック』"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'First Responder Handbook', 'str_pl': 'copies of
#. First Responder Handbook'}
#: data/json/items/book/firstaid.json
msgid ""
"A hardbound book detailing advanced first aid techniques and field-expedient"
" medical care."
msgstr "高度な応急手当技術および現地簡易医療法について詳細に記されたハードカバー本。"

#: data/json/items/book/firstaid.json
msgid "First Aid Kit Instruction Booklet"
msgid_plural "copies of First Aid Kit Instruction Booklet"
msgstr[0] "『救急キット取扱説明書』"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'First Aid Kit Instruction Booklet', 'str_pl':
#. 'copies of First Aid Kit Instruction Booklet'}
#: data/json/items/book/firstaid.json
msgid "Illustrated how-to guide for your first aid kit."
msgstr "救急キットの使い方をイラストで解説したガイド。"

#: data/json/items/book/firstaid.json
msgid "Physicians' Desk Reference"
msgid_plural "copies of Physicians' Desk Reference"
msgstr[0] "『医薬品便覧』"

#. ~ Description for {'str': "Physicians' Desk Reference", 'str_pl': "copies
#. of Physicians' Desk Reference"}
#: data/json/items/book/firstaid.json
msgid ""
"This hefty volume contains all the legally mandated information relevant to "
"physicians for writing prescriptions, generously supported by the efforts "
"and contributions of major pharmaceutical companies.  At least it doesn't "
"need power to be used, unlike digital pharmaceutical references like "
"Medisoft."
msgstr ""
"この分厚い書籍には、処方箋作成に必要な医師向けの法的義務情報をすべて収録している。大手製薬会社の協力と支援によって体系化された内容だ。少なくとも、メディソフトのような電子医薬品データベースと異なり、使用に電力を必要としない。"

#: data/json/items/book/firstaid.json
msgid "Merck Veterinary Manual"
msgid_plural "copies of Merck Veterinary Manual"
msgstr[0] "『メルク社獣医学マニュアル』"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Merck Veterinary Manual', 'str_pl': 'copies of
#. Merck Veterinary Manual'}
#: data/json/items/book/firstaid.json
msgid ""
"This expansive text covers 'all domestic species and diseases in veterinary "
"medicine worldwide'.  Should you need information regarding zoonotic "
"diseases, off-label use of medication for animals, common dysfunctions and "
"diseases of animals, or any other veterinary reference info, this is your "
"book."
msgstr ""
"世界中の獣医学におけるすべての家畜種および疾病を網羅した専門書。人獣共通感染症、獣医薬の適応外使用、動物の一般的な機能障害および疾病、その他の獣医参考情報が必要な場合に最適。"

#: data/json/items/book/gun.json
msgid "Guns n Ammo"
msgid_plural "issues of Guns n Ammo"
msgstr[0] "『月刊・銃と弾薬』"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Guns n Ammo', 'str_pl': 'issues of Guns n Ammo'}
#: data/json/items/book/gun.json
msgid "Reviews of firearms, and various useful tips about their use."
msgstr "銃火器のレビューと、その使用に関するさまざまな実用的なヒントを収録。"

#: data/json/items/book/gun.json
msgid "The Gun Owner's Handbook"
msgid_plural "copies of The Gun Owner's Handbook"
msgstr[0] "『銃所有者ハンドブック』"

#. ~ Description for {'str': "The Gun Owner's Handbook", 'str_pl': "copies of
#. The Gun Owner's Handbook"}
#: data/json/items/book/gun.json
msgid ""
"A thick soft-cover book that claims to be a complete guide to safely "
"operating, maintaining, and repairing firearms."
msgstr "銃火器を安全に使用する手順に始まり、手入れや修復法なども網羅した完全なガイドブックだと主張している分厚いソフトカバー本。"

#: data/json/items/book/gun.json
msgid "Pocket Guide to Firearm Safety"
msgid_plural "copies of Pocket Guide to Firearm Safety"
msgstr[0] "『銃器安全ポケットガイド』"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Pocket Guide to Firearm Safety', 'str_pl':
#. 'copies of Pocket Guide to Firearm Safety'}
#: data/json/items/book/gun.json
msgid ""
"This pocket-sized leather-bound guide to firearm safety combines a wealth of"
" concise information with simple to follow instructions and easy to read "
"illustrations."
msgstr "ポケットサイズの革表紙による銃器安全ガイド。簡潔な情報と分かりやすい手順、読みやすい図解を併せ持つ。"

#: data/json/items/book/gun.json
msgid "Expedient Homemade Firearms"
msgid_plural "copies of Expedient Homemade Firearms"
msgstr[0] "『急造自家製銃器』"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Expedient Homemade Firearms', 'str_pl': 'copies
#. of Expedient Homemade Firearms'}
#: data/json/items/book/gun.json
msgid ""
"A manual written by Philip Luty regarding the production of the homemade "
"submachine gun that often is referred to simply as the Luty Submachine Gun."
"  Contains instructions for the original 9x19 model and also for .45 ACP and"
" .40 S&W variations."
msgstr ""
"フィリップ・ルーティによる、自家製サブマシンガン（通称:ルーティ・サブマシンガン）の製作マニュアル。オリジナルの9x19モデルに加え、.45 "
"ACPおよび .40 S&W バリエーションの製作手順も収録。"

#: data/json/items/book/launcher.json
msgid "High Explosives Quarterly"
msgid_plural "High Explosives Quarterlies"
msgstr[0] "季刊・高性能爆薬"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'High Explosives Quarterly', 'str_pl': 'High
#. Explosives Quarterlies'}
#: data/json/items/book/launcher.json
msgid ""
"An interesting quarterly report about rocket launchers and recoilless "
"rifles.  There are lots of large, exciting photos of explosions and "
"weaponry."
msgstr "ロケットランチャーや無反動ライフルについての興味深い季刊報告。爆発や兵器の大きな写真が多数掲載されている。"

#: data/json/items/book/launcher.json
msgid "Jane's Mortars and Rocket Launchers"
msgid_plural "copies of Jane's Mortars and Rocket Launchers"
msgstr[0] "『ジェーン社発行・迫撃砲とロケットランチャー』"

#. ~ Description for {'str': "Jane's Mortars and Rocket Launchers", 'str_pl':
#. "copies of Jane's Mortars and Rocket Launchers"}
#: data/json/items/book/launcher.json
msgid ""
"An incredibly detailed guide to modern rockets, mortars, grenade launchers, "
"and recoilless weaponry.  Lavishly illustrated with color photographs, it "
"contains a wealth of information."
msgstr ""
"現代のロケット、迫撃砲、グレネードランチャー、無反動兵器について極めて詳細に記したガイド。カラー写真を豊富に掲載し、膨大な情報が収録されている。"

#: data/json/items/book/lockpick.json
msgid "MIT Guide to Lock Picking"
msgid_plural "copies of MIT Guide to Lock Picking"
msgstr[0] "『MIT 鍵開けガイド』"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'MIT Guide to Lock Picking', 'str_pl': 'copies of
#. MIT Guide to Lock Picking'}
#: data/json/items/book/lockpick.json
msgid ""
"A home-made booklet with large black-and-white pictures of several types of "
"modern locks and general information on how to crack them open."
msgstr "手作りの小冊子。様々な現代の錠前を描いた大きなモノクロ図版とともに、鍵開けの一般的な方法を記している。"

#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
msgid "abstract map"
msgid_plural "abstract maps"
msgstr[0] "汎用地図"

#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
msgid "scientific operations map"
msgid_plural "scientific operations maps"
msgstr[0] "科学作業地図"

#. ~ Use action message for {'str': 'scientific operations map'}.
#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
msgid "You add the hidden stations to your map"
msgstr "隠された拠点をマップに追加。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'scientific operations map'}
#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
msgid ""
"A small, meticulously folded piece of paper, filled with tiny handwriting "
"and some surprisingly precise diagrams of subway tunnels, access codes, "
"ventilation shafts, and…guard shifts?  You have the feeling they weren't "
"supposed to write any of this stuff down."
msgstr ""
"小さな紙片が丁寧に折りたたまれている。微細な手書き文字で埋め尽くされており、地下鉄トンネルの驚くほど正確な図解、アクセスコード、換気シャフト、そして……警備の巡回シフトまで記載されている。これらを書き留めるべきではなかったという気がしてならない。"

#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
msgid "regional transport map"
msgid_plural "regional transport maps"
msgstr[0] "地域交通地図"

#. ~ Use action message for {'str': 'regional transport map'}.
#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
msgid "You add the regional transportation systems to your map."
msgstr "地域交通システムをマップに追加。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'regional transport map'}
#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
msgid ""
"This is a printed guide to the local regional transportation systems.  This "
"one specifically seems to show bus stations, airports, and entrances to "
"subways."
msgstr "地域の交通システムについて記された印刷されたガイド。特にバス停、空港、地下鉄の入り口が示されている。"

#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
msgid "military operations map"
msgid_plural "military operations maps"
msgstr[0] "軍事作戦地図"

#. ~ Use action message for {'str': 'military operations map'}.
#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
msgid "You add roads and facilities to your map."
msgstr "道路や施設をマップに追加。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'military operations map'}
#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
msgid ""
"This is a printed topographical map of the local area.  Originally of "
"military origin, it details the locations of evacuation centers and military"
" facilities.  Using it will add points of interest to your map."
msgstr "周辺地域の印刷された地形図。元は軍事用で、避難所や軍事施設の位置が詳細に記録されている。使用すると関心地点がマップに追加される。"

#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
msgid "survivor's map"
msgid_plural "survivor's maps"
msgstr[0] "生存者の地図"

#. ~ Use action message for {'str': "survivor's map"}.
#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
msgid "You add roads and possible supply points to your map."
msgstr "道路や物資を調達できそうな地点をマップに追加。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': "survivor's map"}
#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
msgid ""
"This is a hand-drawn map of the local area.  Whoever created it has marked "
"down the locations of nearby supply sources including gun stores and gas "
"stations.  Using it will add points of interest to your map."
msgstr "周辺地域の手書き地図。作成者が銃器店やガソリンスタンドなど、物資がありそうな施設に印を付けている。使用すると関心地点がマップに追加される。"

#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
msgid "road map"
msgid_plural "road maps"
msgstr[0] "道路地図"

#. ~ Use action message for {'str': 'road map'}.
#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
msgid "You add roads and points of interest to your map."
msgstr "道路や関心地点をマップに追加。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'road map'}
#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
msgid ""
"This is a road map for the local area.  Listing information on civic sites "
"like hospitals and police stations, it can be used to add points of interest"
" to your map."
msgstr "周辺地域の道路地図。病院や警察署などの公共施設が記録されている。使用すると関心地点がマップに追加される。"

#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
msgid "subway maintenance map"
msgid_plural "subway maintenance maps"
msgstr[0] "地下鉄整備地図"

#. ~ Use action message for subway maintenance map.
#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
msgid "You add subway lines and underground stations to your map."
msgstr "地下鉄の線路と駅をマップに追加。"

#. ~ Description for subway maintenance map
#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
msgid ""
"This is a map of subway tunnels formerly used by public maintenance workers."
"  Using it will add subway lines and underground stations to your map."
msgstr "公共交通機関の保守作業員が使用していた地下鉄トンネルの地図。使用すると地下鉄の線路と駅がマップに追加される。"

#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
msgid "sewer maintenance map"
msgid_plural "sewer maintenance maps"
msgstr[0] "下水道整備地図"

#. ~ Use action message for sewer maintenance map.
#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
msgid "You add the local sewer systems to your map."
msgstr "地元の下水道システムをお前の地図に追加した。"

#. ~ Description for sewer maintenance map
#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
msgid ""
"This is a map of sewer tunnels formerly used by public maintenance workers."
"  Using it will add sewer systems to your map."
msgstr "これは以前、公共の整備作業員によって 使用されていた下水道トンネルの地図だ。これを使うと、下水道システムがお前の地図に追加される。"

#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
msgid "spelunker's map"
msgid_plural "spelunker's maps"
msgstr[0] "洞窟探検家の地図"

#. ~ Use action message for spelunker's map.
#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
msgid ""
"You mark potential entry points and underground routes in the margins of "
"your map."
msgstr "お前の地図の余白に、潜在的な侵入ポイントと地下ルートを印した。"

#. ~ Description for spelunker's map
#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
msgid ""
"This is a handmade map of local caving spots, some requiring trespassing.  "
"There's probably bigger worries than that now, though."
msgstr ""
"これは地元の洞窟探検スポットの手作りの地図で、中には不法侵入が必要な場所もある。とはいえ、今となってはそんなことよりももっと大きな心配事があるだろう。"

#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
msgid "trail guide"
msgid_plural "trail guides"
msgstr[0] "自然歩道ガイド"

#. ~ Use action message for {'str': 'trail guide'}.
#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
msgid "You add trails and trailheads to your map."
msgstr "自然歩道やその入口をマップに追加。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'trail guide'}
#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
msgid ""
"This is a printed guide to the best local trails.  It has general details "
"about the trails, trailhead amenities, suggestions for the best thru-hikes, "
"and advice on interacting with local wildlife in a responsible and "
"respectful manner."
msgstr ""
"地域の自然歩道について記された印刷されたガイド。自然歩道や入口の施設の概要、最適なスルーハイキングコース、地元の野生動物と責任を持って接するための指針を収録。"

#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
msgid "tourist guide"
msgid_plural "tourist guides"
msgstr[0] "観光ガイド"

#. ~ Use action message for {'str': 'tourist guide'}.
#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
msgid "You add roads and tourist attractions to your map."
msgstr "道路や観光名所をマップに追加。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'tourist guide'}
#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
msgid ""
"This is glossy printed pamphlet for tourists that details local hotels and "
"attractions."
msgstr ""
"観光客向けに発行された光沢のある印刷パンフレット。周辺のホテルや観光名所についての主な情報が記載されている。使用すると内容がマップに追加される。"

#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
msgid "restaurant guide"
msgid_plural "restaurant guides"
msgstr[0] "レストランガイド"

#. ~ Use action message for {'str': 'restaurant guide'}.
#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
msgid "You add roads and restaurants to your map."
msgstr "道路や飲食施設をマップに追加。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'restaurant guide'}
#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
msgid ""
"This is glossy printed pamphlet that details dining establishments in the "
"local area.  Printed by the Chamber of Commerce, it lists the addresses of "
"all the best diners and bars.  Using it will add points of interest to your "
"map."
msgstr ""
"これは光沢のある印刷のパンフレットで、周辺地域の飲食店を紹介している。商工会議所が発行したもので、評判のダイナーとバーの住所が記載されている。使用すると、関心地点がマップに登録される。"

#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
msgid "waterway map"
msgid_plural "waterway maps"
msgstr[0] "水路地図"

#. ~ Use action message for {'str': 'waterway map'}.
#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
msgid "You add local waterways and notable features on the shore to your map."
msgstr "地元の水路および沿岸の特徴的な地点をマップに登録した。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'waterway map'}
#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
msgid ""
"This is a map of local rivers and lakes, along with the location of notable "
"points of interest such as marinas and lighthouses."
msgstr "これは周辺地域の川や湖に加え、マリーナや灯台などの関心地点の位置を示した地図である。"

#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
msgid "urban explorer's map"
msgid_plural "urban explorer's maps"
msgstr[0] "都市探検家の地図"

#. ~ Use action message for {'str': "urban explorer's map"}.
#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
msgid "You add roads and abandoned buildings to your map."
msgstr "道路と廃墟の建物をお前の地図に追加した。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': "urban explorer's map"}
#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
msgid ""
"This is a printout of a local road map, with several buildings circled in "
"red.  Using it will add roads and abandoned buildings to your map."
msgstr "これは、いくつかの建物が赤で囲まれた 地元の道路地図の印刷物だ。これを使うと、道路と廃墟の建物がお前の地図に追加される。"

#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
msgid "satellite map"
msgid_plural "satellite maps"
msgstr[0] "衛星地図"

#. ~ Use action message for {'str': 'satellite map'}.
#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
msgid "You add terrain and roads to your map."
msgstr "地形と道路をお前の地図に追加した。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'satellite map'}
#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
msgid ""
"This is a printed satellite map of the local area.  Due to it's low quality "
"and lack of map legend, you are unable to recognise most buildings.  Using "
"it will add terrain and roads to your map."
msgstr ""
"これは地元の衛星地図の印刷物だ。低品質で地図の凡例がないため、ほとんどの建物を認識できない。これを使うと、地形と道路がお前の地図に追加される。"

#: data/json/items/book/martial.json
msgid "The Spirit of Aikido"
msgid_plural "The Spirit of Aikido"
msgstr[0] "『合気道の精神』"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'The Spirit of Aikido'}
#: data/json/items/book/martial.json
msgid "A complete guide to Aikido."
msgstr "合気道の完全なガイド。"

#. ~ Don't translate name, this book is in archaic Spanish with translations
#. in the margins.
#: data/json/items/book/martial.json
msgid "Las Nueve Reglas de la Montante"
msgid_plural "copies of Las Nueve Reglas de la Montante"
msgstr[0] "『Las Nueve Reglas de la Montante』"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Las Nueve Reglas de la Montante', 'str_pl':
#. 'copies of Las Nueve Reglas de la Montante', '//~': "Don't translate name,
#. this book is in archaic Spanish with translations in the margins."}
#: data/json/items/book/martial.json
msgid ""
"Thankfully, someone has scrawled translations in the margins of this guide "
"to Barbaran Montante.  Judging by the notation, this greatsword and war "
"hammer training manual is also a form of poem."
msgstr ""
"バルバラン・モンタンテの指南書。ありがたいことに、誰かが余白に翻訳を書き込んでいる。記述から判断すると、この大剣と戦鎚の訓練マニュアルは詩の形式を取っている。"

#: data/json/items/book/martial.json
msgid "Practical Pugilism"
