"of them.  It contains no tea, but the inclusion of cola gives it a tea-like "
"color."
msgstr "非常に強烈なリキュールを混ぜた一杯だが、不思議とどれの味もしない。紅茶は入っていないが、コーラのおかげで茶色い。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "screwdriver cocktail"
msgid_plural "screwdriver cocktails"
msgstr[0] "スクリュードライバーカクテル"

#. ~ Description for screwdriver cocktail
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"A mix of orange juice and vodka.  It's the surreptitious drunkard mechanic's"
" drink of choice."
msgstr "オレンジジュースとウォッカの混合ドリンク。隠れアル中整備士の定番。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "wild apple"
msgid_plural "wild apple"
msgstr[0] "ワイルドアップル"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'wild apple'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "Like apple cider, only with vodka."
msgstr "アップルサイダーにウォッカを加えた一杯。それだけ。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "rum & cola"
msgid_plural "rum & cola"
msgstr[0] "ラムコーク"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'rum & cola'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "Suitable for tropical retreats and Canadian artists alike."
msgstr "熱帯の隠れ家にも、カナダの芸術家にも合う。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "beer"
msgid_plural "beer"
msgstr[0] "ビア"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'beer'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"A grain alcohol flavored with hops.  It's best served cold, in a glass, and "
"with a lime - but you're not that lucky."
msgstr "ホップ風味の穀物蒸留酒。冷やしてグラスに注ぎ、ライムを添えて飲むのが理想だ。だが、そんな贅沢は許されない。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "spiced mead"
msgid_plural "spiced mead"
msgstr[0] "スパイスミード"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'spiced mead'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"Well-aged honey wine, spiced with a hint of hops.  Goes down bittersweet."
msgstr "熟成された蜂蜜酒。ほのかなホップの香りがする。飲み口は苦くも甘くもある。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "dandelion wine"
msgid_plural "dandelion wine"
msgstr[0] "タンポポワイン"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'dandelion wine'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"A light and delicious wine made from dandelion flowers.  Slightly "
"effervescent, it is smooth and crisp."
msgstr "タンポポの花から作られた、軽くて美味しいワイン。わずかに発泡しており、滑らかでさわやか。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "burdock wine"
msgid_plural "burdock wine"
msgstr[0] "ボルドックワイン"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'burdock wine'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "A light and delicious wine made from burdock roots.  Somewhat sweet."
msgstr "ゴボウの根から作られた、軽くて美味しいワイン。やや甘い。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "pine wine"
msgid_plural "pine wine"
msgstr[0] "パインワイン"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'pine wine'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"A potent wine flavored with pine resin.  Bold and pungent, its biting taste "
"and strong aroma takes some getting used to."
msgstr "香り高い松脂風味のワイン。強烈な味わいと香りが特徴で、慣れるまでに時間がかかる。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "homebrew beer"
msgid_plural "homebrew beer"
msgstr[0] "ホームブリュービア"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'homebrew beer'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "Not the finest drink you've had, but hey, it's alcohol by the gallon."
msgstr "最高の飲み物ではないが、まあ、ガロン単位で得られるアルコールだ。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "moonshine"
msgid_plural "moonshine"
msgstr[0] "ムーンシャイン"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'moonshine'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"Only the strongest, purest, good ol' fashioned hooch, distilled from corn "
"and sugar.  Guaranteed to make you forget about the whole Cataclysm thing, "
"or you get your vision back."
msgstr "最も強く、最も純粋な、古き良き密造酒。大災厄のことを忘れさせてくれる保証付き。あるいは視界が戻るまで。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "European pilsner"
msgid_plural "European pilsner"
msgstr[0] "ヨーロッパ風ピルスナー"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'European pilsner'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"A lager beer imported from Europe.  Best served cold, in a glass - but "
"you're not that lucky."
msgstr "ヨーロッパから輸入されたラガービール。冷やしてグラスで飲むのが理想。だが、そんな贅沢は許されない。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "American pale ale"
msgid_plural "American pale ale"
msgstr[0] "アメリカンペールエール"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'American pale ale'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"A tasty craft beer.  Best served cold, in a glass - but you're not that "
"lucky."
msgstr "味わい深いクラフトビール。冷やしてグラスで飲むのが理想。だが、そんな贅沢は許されない。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "India pale ale"
msgid_plural "India pale ale"
msgstr[0] "インディアペールエール"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'India pale ale'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"A very flavorful microbrewed beer.  Best served cold, in a glass - but "
"you're not that lucky."
msgstr "風味豊かなマイクロビール。冷やしてグラスで飲むのが理想。だが、そんな贅沢は許されない。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "stout"
msgid_plural "stout"
msgstr[0] "スタウト"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'stout'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "A tasty craft beer, as dark in color as the days ahead."
msgstr "味わい深いクラフトビール。色はこれからの日々のように暗い。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "Belgian ale"
msgid_plural "Belgian ale"
msgstr[0] "ベルジャンエール"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'Belgian ale'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"A flavorful and filling beer brewed by monks in Belgium.  Best served in a "
"goblet."
msgstr "ベルギーの修道士が醸造した、風味豊かで腹持ちの良いビール。グレイルに注いで飲むのが最適。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "imperial stout"
msgid_plural "imperial stout"
msgstr[0] "インペリアルスタウト"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'imperial stout'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"A very flavorful beer that has been aged in bourbon barrels.  It is as black"
" as midnight on a moonless night and has the viscosity of oil.  While very "
"tasty, it also has an alcohol content on the level with wine."
msgstr ""
"バーボン樽で熟成された、非常に風味豊かなビール。無月の真夜中のように真っ黒で、油のような粘性を持つ。味は非常に良いが、ワイン並みのアルコール度数もある。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "strawberry surprise"
msgid_plural "strawberry surprises"
msgstr[0] "ストロベリーサプライズ"

#. ~ Description for strawberry surprise
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"Strawberries left to ferment with a few other choice ingredients offer up a "
"surprisingly palatable mixture; you barely even have to force yourself to "
"drink it after the first few gulps."
msgstr "イチゴといくつかの厳選された材料を発酵させたもの。意外に飲みやすく、最初の数口の後は無理に飲もうとしなくてもいい。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "boozeberry"
msgid_plural "boozeberries"
msgstr[0] "ブーズベリー"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'boozeberry', 'str_pl': 'boozeberries'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"This fermented blueberry mixture is surprisingly hearty, though the soup-"
"like consistency is slightly unsettling no matter how much you drink."
msgstr "発酵させたブルーベリーの混合物。意外にボリュームがあるが、スープのような粘稠さは、いくら飲んでもやや不快だ。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "single malt whiskey"
msgid_plural "single malt whiskey"
msgstr[0] "シングルモルトウィスキー"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'single malt whiskey'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "Only the finest whiskey straight from the bung."
msgstr "樽口から直接注がれた、最高級のウイスキー。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "single pot still Irish whiskey"
msgid_plural "single pot still Irish whiskey"
msgstr[0] "単式蒸留アイリッシュウイスキー"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'single pot still Irish whiskey'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "A whiskey made from a mixed mash of malted and unmalted barley."
msgstr "麦芽と未糖化大麦の混合マッシュから作られたウイスキー。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "cheap whiskey"
msgid_plural "cheap whiskey"
msgstr[0] "安価なウィスキー"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'cheap whiskey'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "Really cheap blended whiskey."
msgstr "非常に安価なブレンドウイスキー。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "Canadian whiskey"
msgid_plural "Canadian whiskey"
msgstr[0] "カナディアンウィスキー"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'Canadian whiskey'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "A multi-grain liquor made from a mash of corn and rye."
msgstr "トウモロコシとライ麦のマッシュから作られた穀物蒸留酒。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "sherry"
msgid_plural "sherry"
msgstr[0] "シェリー"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'sherry'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"East India Solera.  A true drink of a British gentleman.  Sherry, Niles?"
msgstr "イースト・インディア・ソレラ。英国紳士のための真の飲み物。シェリーを飲むかね、ナイルズ？"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "Bristol Cream"
msgid_plural "Bristol Cream"
msgstr[0] "ブリストルクリーム"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'Bristol Cream'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"A fine sherry that has been aged in American oak casks and bottled in "
"Bristol, England."
msgstr "アメリカ産オーク樽で熟成され、イングランドのブリストルで瓶詰めされた高級シェリー。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "Madeira wine"
msgid_plural "Madeira wine"
msgstr[0] "マデイラワイン"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'Madeira wine'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "Fortified wine from Madeira.  A true Royal Navy drink."
msgstr "マデイラ産の強化ワイン。英国海軍のための真の一杯。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "fancy hobo"
msgid_plural "fancy hobo"
msgstr[0] "ファンシーホーボー"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'fancy hobo'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "This definitely tastes like a hobo drink."
msgstr "どう見ても浮浪者の飲み物のような味。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "kalimotxo"
msgid_plural "kalimotxo"
msgstr[0] "カリモーチョ"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'kalimotxo'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"A mix of equal parts wine and cola.  It's not as bad as some might imagine, "
"and pretty popular among young and/or poor people in some countries."
msgstr "ワインとコーラを同量混ぜた一杯。思っているほど悪くはなく、ある国では若者や貧困層に人気。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "bee's knees"
msgid_plural "bee's knees"
msgstr[0] "ビーズニーズ"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': "bee's knees"}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"This cocktail dates from the Prohibition era.  Gin, honey and lemon in a "
"delightful mix."
msgstr "禁酒法時代に生まれたカクテル。ジン、蜂蜜、レモンが絶妙に調和している。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "whiskey sour"
msgid_plural "whiskey sours"
msgstr[0] "ウィスキーサワー"

#. ~ Description for whiskey sour
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "A mixed drink made of whiskey and lemon juice."
msgstr "ウイスキーとレモンジュースを混ぜた飲み物。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "honeygold brew"
msgid_plural "honeygold brews"
msgstr[0] "ハニーゴールドブリュー"

#. ~ Description for honeygold brew
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"A mixed drink containing all the advantages of its ingredients and none of "
"their disadvantages.  It tastes great and it's a good source of nourishment."
msgstr "材料の長所はすべて、欠点はまったくない。味は良いし、栄養もある。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "honey ball"
msgid_plural "honey balls"
msgstr[0] "ハニーボール"

#. ~ Description for honey ball
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"Droplet shaped ant food.  It's like a thick balloon the size of a baseball, "
"filled with sticky liquid.  Unlike bee honey, this has mostly a sour taste, "
"probably because ants feed upon a variety of things."
msgstr ""
"しずく型のアリの食料。野球ボール大の分厚い風船のようなもので、粘着質の液体が詰まっている。ミツバチの蜂蜜とは異なり、主に酸っぱい味がする。アリがさまざまなものを餌とするためと考えられる。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "spiked eggnog"
msgid_plural "spiked eggnogs"
msgstr[0] "スパイクエッグノッグ"

#. ~ Description for spiked eggnog
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"Smooth and rich, this spoon-coating mixture of milk, cream, eggs, and booze "
"is a popular traditional holiday drink.  Having been fortified with alcohol,"
" it will keep for a long time."
msgstr ""
"牛乳、生クリーム、卵、アルコールを混ぜた、スプーンにからむほど濃厚な飲み物。伝統的な祝祭のドリンクとして人気がある。アルコールで強化されているため、長期保存が可能。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "martini"
msgid_plural "martinis"
msgstr[0] "マティーニ"

#. ~ Description for martini
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"This is a popular cocktail made with gin and dry vermouth, dating from the "
"Prohibition era."
msgstr "禁酒法時代にさかのぼる、ジンとドライベルモットで作られる人気のカクテル。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "sake"
msgid_plural "sake"
msgstr[0] "日本酒"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'sake'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "The traditional alcohol of Japan, this wine is made from rice."
msgstr "日本の伝統的なアルコール飲料。米から作られるワイン。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid "donut holes"
msgid_plural "donut holes"
msgstr[0] "ドーナツホール"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'donut holes'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid ""
"These balls of dough have been cut into shape, covered with sugar, and "
"cooked to a crisp.  A staple of fairgrounds everywhere."
msgstr "生地のかたまりを形に整え、砂糖をまぶしてカリカリになるまで調理したスナック。どこにでもある遊園地の定番。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid "juvenile sourdough starter"
msgid_plural "juvenile sourdough starters"
msgstr[0] "未熟なサワードウスターター"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'juvenile sourdough starter'}.
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid ""
"After feeding it and caring for it for a week, your sourdough starter is "
"finally ready for the big leagues."
msgstr "1週間の世話と給餌を経て、サワードウスターターがようやく本格的に使える状態になった。"

#. ~ Use action not_ready_msg for {'str': 'juvenile sourdough starter'}.
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid ""
"You've been caring for your starter for a while, but it's going to need "
"longer before you can do anything tasty with it."
msgstr "サワードウスターターの世話を続けてきたが、何か美味しいものを作るには、まだ時間がかかる。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'juvenile sourdough starter'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid ""
"A floury paste that is slowly going bad.  Someday it will be sourdough."
msgstr "粉っぽいペースト。少しずつ発酵が進んでいる。いずれサワードウになる。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid "freshly fed sourdough starter"
msgid_plural "freshly fed sourdough starters"
msgstr[0] "直前に給餌したサワードウスターター"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'freshly fed sourdough starter'}.
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid "The starter is now stinky and bubbly, and looks ready for cooking."
msgstr "サワードウスターターが臭っており、泡立っている。調理に使える状態のようだ。"

#. ~ Use action not_ready_msg for {'str': 'freshly fed sourdough starter'}.
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid "The starter isn't quite ready to go."
msgstr "サワードウスターターはまだ準備できていない。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'freshly fed sourdough starter'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid ""
"A floury paste with sourdough starter mixed in.  It needs a day to recover "
"its strength before it can be used again."
msgstr "サワードウスターターを混ぜた粉っぽいペースト。再利用には1日かけて力を回復させる必要がある。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid "sourdough starter"
msgid_plural "sourdough starters"
msgstr[0] "サワードウスターター"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'sourdough starter'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid ""
"A precious mix of flour, water, molds and bacteria from the air.  When you "
"add flour and water to it, after a few hours it froths and rises."
msgstr "粉と水、空気中のカビと細菌から成る貴重な混合物。粉と水を加えると、数時間で発酵し、膨らむ。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid "sourdough bread"
msgid_plural "sourdough breads"
msgstr[0] "サワードウブレッド"

#. ~ Description for sourdough bread
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid ""
"Healthy and filling, with a sharper taste and thicker crust than yeast-only "
"bread."
msgstr "イースト100%のパンより酸味が強く、表皮も硬い。健康に良く、満足感がある。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid "flatbread"
msgid_plural "flatbreads"
msgstr[0] "フラットブレッド"

#. ~ Description for flatbread
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid "Simple unleavened bread."
msgstr "無発酵のシンプルなブレッド。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid "bread"
msgid_plural "breads"
msgstr[0] "ブレッド"

#. ~ Description for bread
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid "Healthy and filling."
msgstr "健康に良く、満足感がある。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid "garlic bread"
msgid_plural "garlic bread"
msgstr[0] "ガーリックブレッド"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'garlic bread'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid "Bread cooked with garlic, oil and seasonings."
msgstr "ニンニクと油、調味料で調理されたパン。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid "cornbread"
msgid_plural "cornbreads"
msgstr[0] "コーンブレッド"

#. ~ Description for cornbread
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid "Healthy and filling cornbread."
msgstr "凝縮されており、味わい深い揚げパンのお菓子。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid "johnnycake"
msgid_plural "johnnycakes"
msgstr[0] "ジョンニーケーキ"

#. ~ Description for johnnycake
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid "A dense and tasty fried bread treat."
msgstr "細かく挽いたトウモロコシ粉で作られた、薄くて丸い平パン。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid "blinkie"
msgid_plural "blinkies"
msgstr[0] "ブリンキー"

#. ~ Description for blinkie
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid ""
"A sweet, cream-filled snack cake with an indefinitely long shelf life. For "
"all you know, this could be the last one that anyone will enjoy in the whole"
" universe."
msgstr "甘くてクリームが詰まったスナックケーキ。極めて長い間日持ちする。この宇宙で最後の一つかもしれない。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid "fried blinkie"
msgid_plural "fried blinkies"
msgstr[0] "フライドブリンキー"

#. ~ Description for fried blinkie
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid ""
"A sweet, cream-filled snack cake.  This one has been removed from the "
"packaging and deep fried, greatly reducing its shelf life."
msgstr "甘くてクリームが詰まったスナックケーキ。開封後に揚げられており、保存期間が大幅に短くなっている。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid "corn tortilla"
msgid_plural "corn tortillas"
msgstr[0] "コーントルティーヤ"

#. ~ Description for corn tortilla
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid "A round, thin flatbread made from finely ground corn flour."
msgstr "細かく挽いたトウモロコシ粉で作られた、薄くて丸い平パン。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid "hardtack"
msgid_plural "hardtacks"
msgstr[0] "堅パン"

#. ~ Description for hardtack
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid ""
"A dry and virtually tasteless bread product capable of remaining edible "
"without spoilage for vast lengths of time."
msgstr "乾燥しており、ほとんど味はない。しかし非常に長期間、腐敗せずに食用可能。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid "biscuit"
msgid_plural "biscuits"
msgstr[0] "ビスケット"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'biscuit'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid "Wholesome and filling, this home made biscuit is pretty good!"
msgstr "栄養価が高く、満足感がある。家庭製の焼きパン！"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid "wastebread"
msgid_plural "wastebreads"
msgstr[0] "廃棄パン"

#. ~ Description for wastebread
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid ""
"Flour is a commodity these days and to deal with that, most survivors resort"
" to mix it with leftovers of other ingredients and bake it all into bread.  "
"It's filling, and that's what matters."
msgstr "小麦粉は今や貴重品だ。それを補うため、生き残りの多くは他の材料の残りを混ぜてパンに焼いている。満足感があり、それが何より重要だ。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid "base brew"
msgid_plural "base brews"
msgstr[0] "基本ブリュー"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid "mycus wine must"
msgid_plural "mycus wine musts"
msgstr[0] "マイカスワインの未発酵液"

#. ~ Description for mycus wine must
#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid ""
"Unfermented mycus wine.  A goopy white mess, made from fruit of mycus.  It "
"smells sweetly of mushrooms."
msgstr "マイカスの果実から作られた、ドロドロの白い未発酵液。キノコのような甘い香りがする。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid "whiskey wort"
msgid_plural "whiskey worts"
msgstr[0] "ウイスキー用モルト汁"

#. ~ Description for whiskey wort
#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid ""
"Unfermented whiskey.  The base of a fine drink.  Not the traditional "
"preparation, but you don't have the time."
msgstr "未発酵のウイスキー。良質な酒の基となるが、伝統的な製法に従う余裕はない。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid "whiskey wash"
msgid_plural "whiskey washes"
msgstr[0] "ウイスキー用発酵液"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'whiskey wash', 'str_pl': 'whiskey washes'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid "Fermented, but not distilled whiskey.  No longer tastes sweet."
msgstr "発酵済みだが未蒸留のウイスキー。もはや甘みはない。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid "fermenting gin mash"
msgid_plural "fermenting gin mashes"
msgstr[0] "発酵中のジン用マッシュ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'fermenting gin mash', 'str_pl': 'fermenting gin
#. mashes'}
