msgstr "発酵済みだが未蒸留の密造酒。望ましくない不純物をすべて含んでいる。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid "unfermented vinegar"
msgid_plural "unfermented vinegars"
msgstr[0] "未発酵の酢"

#. ~ Description for unfermented vinegar
#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid ""
"Mixture of water, alcohol and fruit juice that will eventually become "
