msgstr "気に入らない人物の新鮮な肉を調理したもの。味は良い。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid "cooked seasoned creep"
msgid_plural "cooked seasoned creeps"
msgstr[0] "味付けされたアイツ[調理済]"

#. ~ Description for cooked seasoned creep
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid ""
"A freshly cooked slice of some unpleasant person.  Tastes great especially "
