msgid_plural "mutant humanoid meats"
msgstr[0] "変異人肉"

#. ~ Description for mutant humanoid meat
#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid ""
"Freshly butchered from the body of a heavily mutated creature that was "
"unsettlingly humanoid in appearance.  It smells like a failed chemical "
"experiment.  You'd have to be crazy or starving to eat this."
msgstr ""
"外見が不気味なほど人型に近い重度変異生物の体から新鮮に解体したもの。化学実験の失敗のような臭いがする。これを食べるには、正気を失っているか、あるいは完全に空腹である必要がある。"

