msgstr "調理済みの新鮮な肉塊だ。食べ応えがあり栄養価も高いが、味付けがされておらず淡白だ。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/carnivore.json
msgid "cooked seasoned meat"
msgid_plural "cooked seasoned meats"
msgstr[0] "味付け肉[調理済]"

#. ~ Description for cooked seasoned meat
