"The southwest beef & beans entree from an MRE.  Sterilized using radiation, "
"so it's safe to eat.  It's wrapped in an atmospherically-sealed package.  "
"This one tastes fantastic, could be one of the best MRE menus you can get "
"your hands on."
msgstr ""
"MREのサウスウェスト風ビーフと豆の主食。放射線による滅菌済みのため、摂取は安全。大気隔離包装されている。これは味が極上で、手に入れられる中で最高クラスのMREメニューかもしれない。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/mre.json
msgid "frankfurters & beans entree"
msgid_plural "frankfurters & beans entrees"
msgstr[0] "フランクフルト&ビーンズの主食"

#. ~ Description for frankfurters & beans entree
#: data/json/items/comestibles/mre.json
msgid ""
"The dreaded four fingers of death.  It seems to be several decades old.  "
"Sterilized using radiation, so it's safe to eat.  It's wrapped in an "
"atmospherically-sealed package.  You have the potential to become the first "
"person on Earth to be capable of enjoying this, with enough training."
msgstr ""
"恐るべき「死の4本指」。数十年は経っているようだ。放射線による滅菌済みのため、摂取は安全。大気隔離包装されている。十分な訓練を積めば、地球上でこの味を楽しめる最初の人物になる可能性がある。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/mre.json
msgid "cheese omelette entree"
msgid_plural "cheese omelette entrees"
msgstr[0] "チーズオムレツの主食"

#. ~ Description for cheese omelette entree
#: data/json/items/comestibles/mre.json
msgid ""
"The unholy vomelette.  It seems to be several decades old.  Sterilized using"
" radiation, so you might be mistaken that it is safe to eat.  It's wrapped "
"in an atmospherically-sealed package.  Keep this one for the dogs that you "
"happen to really, really hate."
msgstr ""
"忌まわしきゲロレット。数十年は経っているようだ。放射線による滅菌済みのため、安全だと誤解するかもしれない。大気隔離包装されている。大嫌いな犬にでも与えるためだけに取っておけ。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/mushroom.json
msgid "cooked mushroom"
msgid_plural "cooked mushrooms"
msgstr[0] "キノコ[調理済]"

#. ~ Description for cooked mushroom
#: data/json/items/comestibles/mushroom.json
msgid "A tasty cooked wild mushroom."
msgstr "美味しく調理された野生のキノコ。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/mushroom.json
