#. ~ Description for protein shake
#: data/json/items/comestibles/protein.json
msgid ""
"A thick and tasty beverage made from pure refined protein and nutritious "
"fruit."
msgstr "精製されたタンパク質に栄養豊富な果物を混ぜて作られた、とろみがあり、味のよい飲料。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/protein.json
msgid "fortified protein shake"
msgid_plural "fortified protein shakes"
msgstr[0] "強化プロテインシェイク"

#. ~ Conditional name for fortified protein shake when VITAMIN matches
#. human_flesh_vitamin
#: data/json/items/comestibles/protein.json
msgid "fortified soylent green shake"
msgid_plural "fortified soylent green shakes"
msgstr[0] "強化ソイレントグリーンシェイク"

#. ~ Description for fortified protein shake
#: data/json/items/comestibles/protein.json
msgid ""
"A thick and tasty beverage made from pure refined protein and nutritious "
"fruit.  It has been supplemented with extra vitamins and minerals"
msgstr "精製されたタンパク質に栄養価の高い果物を混ぜて作られた、とろみがあり、味のよい飲料。ビタミンとミネラルを追加。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
msgid "apple"
msgid_plural "apples"
msgstr[0] "アップル"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'apple'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
msgid "An apple a day keeps the doctor away."
msgstr "1日1個のアップルは医者いらず、といわれている。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/seed.json
msgid "banana"
msgid_plural "bananas"
msgstr[0] "バナナ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'banana'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
msgid ""
"A long, curved yellow fruit in a peel.  Some people like using them in "
"desserts.  Those people are probably dead."
msgstr "長い皮で覆われた歪曲した黄色の果物。一部の人々はデザートに使用する。しかし、デザートを作るような人々は恐らくは死に絶えているだろう。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
msgid "cacao pod"
msgid_plural "cacao pod"
msgstr[0] "カカオのさや"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'cacao pod'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
msgid ""
"The cacao fruit, scientifically known as Theobroma cacao, is the source of "
"cocoa beans used to make chocolate.  It is a tropical fruit that contains "
"cocoa beans surrounded by a sweet-tasting, white pulp.  The beans are "
"harvested, fermented, and processed to produce various chocolate products."
msgstr ""
"科学的にはテオブロマ・カカオとも呼ばれるこのカカオの実には、チョコレートを作るために必要なカカオ豆が含まれている。甘い味のする白い果肉の中にカカオ豆が入っている。カカオ豆を収穫し、発酵させて適切な工程を経ることで、さまざまなチョコレート加工品を作ることができる。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/seed.json
msgid "orange"
msgid_plural "oranges"
msgstr[0] "オレンジ"

#. ~ Description for orange
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
msgid "Sweet citrus fruit.  Also comes in juice form."
msgstr "甘みのある柑橘類の果物。ジュースにして食べることもできる。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/seed.json
msgid "lemon"
msgid_plural "lemons"
msgstr[0] "レモン"

#. ~ Description for lemon
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
msgid "Very sour citrus.  Can be eaten if you really want."
msgstr "非常に酸っぱい柑橘類の果物。どうしても食べる必要があるなら、食べることは可能。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
msgid "blueberries"
msgid_plural "blueberries"
msgstr[0] "ブルーベリー"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'blueberries'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
msgid "They're blue, but that doesn't mean they're sad."
msgstr "青い色をしているが、それは悲しさを表現している訳ではない。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
msgid "strawberries"
msgid_plural "strawberries"
msgstr[0] "ストロベリー"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'strawberries'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
msgid "Tasty, juicy berry.  Often found growing wild in fields."
msgstr "美味しく瑞々しいストロベリー。野原に自生していることがある。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
msgid "cranberries"
msgid_plural "cranberries"
msgstr[0] "クランベリー"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'cranberries'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
msgid "Sour red berries.  Good for your health."
msgstr "酸味のある赤いベリー。健康的な果物。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
msgid "raspberries"
msgid_plural "raspberries"
msgstr[0] "ラズベリー"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'raspberries'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
msgid "A sweet red berry."
msgstr "甘くて赤いベリー。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
msgid "huckleberries"
msgid_plural "huckleberries"
msgstr[0] "ハックルベリー"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'huckleberries'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
msgid "Huckleberries, often times confused for blueberries."
msgstr "しばしばブルーベリーと混同される果実。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
msgid "mulberries"
msgid_plural "mulberries"
msgstr[0] "マルベリー"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'mulberries'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
msgid ""
"Mulberries, this red variety is unique to east North America and is "
"described to have the strongest flavor of any variety in the world."
msgstr "赤いマルベリーは北米東部地域にのみ自生し、世界で最も風味が優れているとされる品種。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
msgid "elderberries"
msgid_plural "elderberries"
msgstr[0] "エルダーベリー"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'elderberries'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
msgid "Elderberries, toxic when eaten raw but great when cooked."
msgstr "エルダーベリーは生で食べると毒があるが、調理すれば非常に美味しく食べられる。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
msgid "rose hips"
msgid_plural "rose hips"
msgstr[0] "ローズヒップ"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'rose hips'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
msgid "The fruit of a pollinated rose flower."
msgstr "受粉したバラに実る果実。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
msgid "juice pulp"
msgid_plural "juice pulps"
msgstr[0] "ジュースパルプ"

#. ~ Description for juice pulp
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
msgid ""
"Left-over from juicing the fruit.  Not very tasty, but contains a lot of "
"healthy fiber."
msgstr "果物を搾った後の残り物。あまり美味しくないが、健康的な繊維がたくさん含まれている。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
msgid "pear"
msgid_plural "pears"
msgstr[0] "ピアー"

#. ~ Description for pear
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
msgid "A juicy, bell-shaped pear.  Yum!"
msgstr "ベルの形をした瑞々しいピアー。美味しい！"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
msgid "grapefruit"
msgid_plural "grapefruits"
msgstr[0] "グレープフルーツ"

#. ~ Description for grapefruit
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
msgid "A citrus fruit, whose taste ranges from sour to semi-sweet."
msgstr "独特の爽やかな香りがあって、酸っぱくてほんのり甘い、柑橘系の果物。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
msgid "cherries"
msgid_plural "cherries"
msgstr[0] "チェリー"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'cherries'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
msgid "A red, sweet fruit that grows in trees."
msgstr "木に実る赤くて甘い果物。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
msgid "plum"
msgid_plural "plums"
msgstr[0] "プラム"

#. ~ Description for plum
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
msgid ""
"A handful of large, purple plums.  Healthy and good for your digestion."
msgstr "紫色の大きなプラム。健康に良く、消化を助ける。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
msgid "grapes"
msgid_plural "grapes"
msgstr[0] "グレープ"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'grapes'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
msgid "A cluster of juicy grapes."
msgstr "みずみずしいグレープ。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/seed.json
msgid "pineapple"
msgid_plural "pineapples"
msgstr[0] "パイナップル"

#. ~ Description for pineapple
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
msgid "A large, spiky pineapple.  A bit sour, though."
msgstr "大きなパイナップル。少し酸味がある。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/seed.json
msgid "coconut"
msgid_plural "coconuts"
msgstr[0] "ココナッツ"

#. ~ Description for coconut
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
msgid "A fruit with a hard and hairy shell."
msgstr "硬くて毛深い殻に覆われた果物。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
msgid "peach"
msgid_plural "peaches"
msgstr[0] "ピーチ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'peach', 'str_pl': 'peaches'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
msgid "This fruit's large pit is surrounded by its tasty flesh."
msgstr "大きな種の周りに美味しい果肉が付いた果物。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
msgid "watermelon"
msgid_plural "watermelons"
msgstr[0] "ウォーターメロン"

#. ~ Description for watermelon
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
msgid "A fruit, bigger than your head.  It is very juicy!"
msgstr "人の頭よりも大きな果物。とてもジューシー！"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/seed.json
msgid "melon"
msgid_plural "melons"
msgstr[0] "メロン"

#. ~ Description for melon
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
msgid "A large and very sweet fruit."
msgstr "大きくて非常に甘い果物。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
msgid "blackberries"
msgid_plural "blackberries"
msgstr[0] "ブラックベリー"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'blackberries'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
msgid "A darker cousin of raspberry."
msgstr "ラズベリーより色の濃いベリー。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
msgid "mango"
msgid_plural "mangos"
msgstr[0] "マンゴー"

#. ~ Description for mango
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
msgid "A fleshy fruit with large pit."
msgstr "大きな種のある多肉質の果物。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
msgid "pomegranate"
msgid_plural "pomegranates"
msgstr[0] "ポメグラネイト"

#. ~ Description for pomegranate
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
msgid "Under this pomegranate's spongy skin lies hundreds of fleshy seeds."
msgstr "海綿状の皮の下に数百の赤く透明な多汁性の果肉の粒がある果物。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
msgid "papaya"
msgid_plural "papayas"
msgstr[0] "パパイヤ"

#. ~ Description for papaya
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
msgid "A very sweet and soft tropical fruit."
msgstr "柔らかくて、非常に甘い南国の果物。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
msgid "kiwi"
msgid_plural "kiwis"
msgstr[0] "キウイ"

#. ~ Description for kiwi
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
msgid ""
"A large, brown and fuzzy-skinned berry.  Its delicious insides are green."
msgstr "薄い毛で覆われた茶色の大きな果実。中身は緑色の美味しい果肉。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
msgid "apricots"
msgid_plural "apricots"
msgstr[0] "アプリコット"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'apricots'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
msgid "A smooth-skinned fruit, related to the peach."
msgstr "滑らかな肌触りのピーチに似た果物。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
msgid "cholla bud"
msgid_plural "cholla buds"
msgstr[0] "サボテンの芽"

#. ~ Description for cholla bud
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
msgid ""
"Edible bud of a cholla cactus, with spines removed; the candy of the Mojave "
"indigenous peoples.  Tastes similar to asparagus."
msgstr "棘を取り除いた食用サボテンの芽で、モハーヴェ族はこれをお菓子として食べる。味はアスパラガスに似ている。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
msgid "cactus pad"
msgid_plural "cactus pads"
msgstr[0] "サボテンの中身"

#. ~ Description for cactus pad
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_fruit.json
msgid "An edible pad of a cactus."
msgstr "サボテンの食用部分。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#: data/json/items/comestibles/seed.json
msgid "barley"
msgid_plural "barleys"
msgstr[0] "大麦"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'barley'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
msgid ""
"Grainy cereal used for malting.  A staple of brewing everywhere.  It can "
"also be ground into flour."
msgstr "主にビールやウイスキーの醸造に使われる穀物。もちろん挽いて粉にして使うこともできる。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#: data/json/items/comestibles/seed.json
msgid "bee balm"
msgid_plural "bee balms"
msgstr[0] "ビーバーム"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'bee balm'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
msgid ""
"A snow-white flower also known as wild bergamot.  Smells faintly of mint."
msgstr "ワイルドベルガモットという通称で知られており、雪のように白い花をつける。ほんのりとミントのような香りがする。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#: data/json/items/comestibles/seed.json
msgid "broccoli"
msgid_plural "broccoli"
msgstr[0] "ブロッコリー"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'broccoli'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
msgid "It's a bit tough, but quite delicious."
msgstr "少し硬さがあるが、とても美味しい野菜。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#: data/json/items/comestibles/seed.json
msgid "buckwheat"
msgid_plural "buckwheat"
msgstr[0] "蕎麦"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'buckwheat'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
msgid ""
"Seeds from a wild buckwheat plant.  Not particularly good to eat in their "
"raw state, they are commonly cooked or ground into flour."
msgstr "野生の蕎麦の種。そのままでは食べられたものではない。調理するか挽いて粉にして使う。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#: data/json/items/comestibles/seed.json
msgid "cabbage"
msgid_plural "cabbages"
msgstr[0] "カベイジ"

#. ~ Description for cabbage
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
msgid "Crisp white cabbage."
msgstr "実が引き締まった白カベイジだ。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
msgid "grape leaves"
msgid_plural "grape leaves"
msgstr[0] "グレープの葉"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'grape leaves'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
msgid ""
"Edible leaves of a grape vine.  Typically used in salads or as food "
"wrapping."
msgstr "グレープのつるの葉。食用可能で、サラダの材料や料理を包むのに使われる。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
msgid "spinach"
msgid_plural "spinach"
msgstr[0] "スピナッチ"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'spinach'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
msgid "A bunch of spinach leaves."
msgstr "一束のスピナッチ。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#: data/json/items/comestibles/seed.json
msgid "carrot"
msgid_plural "carrots"
msgstr[0] "キャロット"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'carrot'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
msgid "A healthy root vegetable.  Rich in vitamin A!"
msgstr "健康的な根菜。ビタミンAが豊富！"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
msgid "cattail rhizome"
msgid_plural "cattail rhizomes"
msgstr[0] "ガマの地下茎"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'cattail rhizome'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
msgid ""
"A stout branching rhizome from a cattail plant.  Its crisp white flesh is "
"very starchy and fibrous, but you really ought to cook it before you attempt"
" to eat it."
msgstr ""
"がっしりとした、硬くて大ぶりなガマの根茎。断面は白色でカリカリとした硬い歯触りがあり、デンプン質と繊維質を豊富に含んでいる。しかし食べるなら調理する必要がありそうだ。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
msgid "cattail stalk"
msgid_plural "cattail stalks"
msgstr[0] "ガマの茎"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'cattail stalk'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
msgid ""
"A stiff green stalk from a cattail plant.  It is starchy and fibrous, but it"
" would be much better if you cooked it."
msgstr "ガマの茎だ。堅くて緑色をしている。デンプン質と繊維を非常に多く含む。食べるなら調理したほうがよい。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#: data/json/items/comestibles/seed.json
msgid "celery"
msgid_plural "celerys"
msgstr[0] "セロリ"

#. ~ Description for celery
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
msgid "Neither tasty nor very nutritious, but it goes well with salad."
msgstr "美味しくもなく栄養もそれほど豊富ではないが、サラダにはよく合う。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#: data/json/items/comestibles/seed.json
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "corn"
msgid_plural "corn"
msgstr[0] "コーン"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'corn'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
msgid "Delicious golden kernels."
msgstr "美味しい黄金の粒が一杯付いたコーン。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
msgid "cotton boll"
msgid_plural "cotton bolls"
msgstr[0] "コットンボール"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'cotton boll'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
msgid ""
"A tough protective capsule bulging with densely packed fibers and seeds, "
"this cotton boll can be processed into usable material with the right tools."
msgstr "丈夫な殻の中に繊維と種が入っている。適切な道具を使って、有用な素材に変えることができる。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#: data/json/items/comestibles/seed.json
msgid "chili pepper"
msgid_plural "chili peppers"
msgstr[0] "チリペッパー"

#. ~ Description for chili pepper
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
msgid "Spicy chili pepper."
msgstr "ピリッと辛いチリペッパー。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#: data/json/items/comestibles/seed.json
msgid "cucumber"
msgid_plural "cucumbers"
msgstr[0] "キューカンバー"

#. ~ Description for cucumber
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
msgid "Comes from the gourd family.  Not tasty but very juicy."
msgstr "ウリ科に属している。味はあまりないが、非常に水分が多い。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
msgid "dahlia root"
msgid_plural "dahlia roots"
msgstr[0] "ダリアの根"

#. ~ Description for dahlia root
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
msgid ""
"The large, tuberous root of a dahlia flower.  It smells spicy, but is too "
"starchy to eat without cooking."
msgstr "ダリアの大きな塊根。辛い匂いがするが、あまりにも硬いため、調理せずに食べるには非常にパサパサしている。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#: data/json/items/comestibles/seed.json
msgid "salsify"
msgid_plural "salsify"
msgstr[0] "サルシファイ"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'salsify'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
msgid ""
"An herb with a small purple flower.  The roots are nutritious, but tough and"
" bland until cooked."
msgstr "小さな紫色の花が咲くハーブ。根は栄養価があるが、加熱する前は粗く、味が薄い。"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'chicory'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
msgid ""
"A modest blue flower.  The flower's roots are very bitter and not meant to "
"be eaten raw."
msgstr "それほど大きくない青い花。花の根は非常に苦く、生で食べるのは危険である。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#: data/json/items/comestibles/seed.json
msgid "wild root"
msgid_plural "wild roots"
msgstr[0] "野生根菜"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'wild root'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
msgid ""
"A weed with a cluster of tiny white flowers.  These are often wild carrots, "
"but beware of poisonous lookalikes."
msgstr "小さな白い花を持つ雑草。これらはしばしば野生のニンジンと呼ばれるが、有毒なモドキである毒ニンジンに注意せよ。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#: data/json/items/comestibles/seed.json
msgid "dogbane"
msgid_plural "dogbanes"
msgstr[0] "ドッグベイン"

#. ~ Description for dogbane
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
msgid ""
"A stalk of dogbane.  It has very fibrous stems and is mildly poisonous."
msgstr "ドッグベインの茎。繊維質が非常に多く、若干の毒性がある。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
msgid "garlic bulb"
msgid_plural "garlic bulbs"
msgstr[0] "ガーリックの球根"

#. ~ Description for garlic bulb
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
msgid ""
"A pungent garlic bulb.  Popular as a seasoning for its strong flavor.  Can "
"be disassembled to cloves."
msgstr "ツンとした刺激のあるニンニクの球根。強い風味を持つ調味料として人気がある。ひとかけらに分けられる。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
msgid "hops flower"
msgid_plural "hops flowers"
msgstr[0] "ホップの花"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'hops flower'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
msgid "A cluster of small cone-like flowers, indispensable for brewing beer."
msgstr "小さなトウモロコシのような花。ビールの醸造に必ず必要とされる。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
msgid "horseradish root"
msgid_plural "horseradish roots"
msgstr[0] "ホースラディッシュ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'horseradish root'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
msgid ""
"Large white tapered root of a horseradish plant.  Way too spicy in this "
"form, but can be used for making condiments."
msgstr "先端が細長い西洋ワサビの大きな根。そのまま食べるとあまりにも辛いが、調味料を作るのに使うことができる。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#: data/json/items/comestibles/seed.json
msgid "lettuce"
msgid_plural "lettuces"
msgstr[0] "レタス"

#. ~ Description for lettuce
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
msgid "A crisp head of iceberg lettuce."
msgstr "シャキシャキしたレタス。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#: data/json/items/comestibles/seed.json
msgid "mugwort"
msgid_plural "mugworts"
msgstr[0] "モグワート"

#. ~ Description for mugwort
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
msgid "A stalk of mugwort.  Smells wonderful."
msgstr "モグワートの茎。独特の強い匂いがする。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#: data/json/items/comestibles/seed.json
msgid "onion"
msgid_plural "onions"
msgstr[0] "オニオン"

#. ~ Description for onion
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
msgid ""
"An aromatic onion used in cooking.  Cutting these up can make your eyes "
"sting!"
msgstr "料理に使われる香りのよいタマネギ。切ると涙が出ることもある！"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
msgid "fungal fluid sac"
msgid_plural "fungal fluid sacs"
msgstr[0] "菌液の袋"

#. ~ Description for fungal fluid sac
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
msgid ""
"A fluid bladder from a fungus based lifeform.  Not very nutritious, but fine"
" to eat anyway."
msgstr "きのこを基盤とする生命体の菌液入りの袋。栄養価はほとんどないが、食べることはできる。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
msgid "raw popcorn"
msgid_plural "raw popcorn"
msgstr[0] "ポップコーン粒"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'raw popcorn'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
msgid ""
"A special variety of corn which could be used for making popcorn, after it's"
" dried.  Unlike normal corn, it's not sweet and is more dry."
msgstr "乾燥させてポップコーンを作るのに使える爆裂種のトウモロコシ。普通のトウモロコシとは異なり、甘みが少なく、より乾燥している。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
msgid "raw potato"
msgid_plural "raw potatoes"
msgstr[0] "ポテト"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'raw potato', 'str_pl': 'raw potatoes'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
msgid "Mildly toxic and not very tasty raw.  When cooked, it is delicious."
msgstr "生のものは弱い毒性を持つ上ひどい不味さ。調理すると美味しくなる。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#: data/json/items/comestibles/seed.json
msgid "pumpkin"
msgid_plural "pumpkins"
msgstr[0] "パンプキン"

#. ~ Description for pumpkin
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
msgid ""
"A large vegetable, about the size of your head.  Not very tasty raw, but is "
"great for cooking."
msgstr "大きな野菜。だいたいお前の頭ほどの大きさ。生のままではあまり美味しくないが、調理すると非常に美味しい。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
msgid "horseradish greens"
msgid_plural "horseradish greens"
msgstr[0] "ホースラディッシュの葉"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'horseradish greens'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
msgid ""
"Leaves of a horseradish plant with a sharp, bitter and peppery taste.  "
"They're edible, but not commonly eaten."
msgstr "舌を刺すような苦味とコショウのような辛みを持つ西洋ワサビの葉。食用ではあるが、普通はそのまま食べることはない。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
msgid "dandelions"
msgid_plural "dandelions"
msgstr[0] "タンポポ"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'dandelions'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
msgid ""
"A collection of freshly picked yellow dandelions.  In their current raw "
"state they are quite bitter."
msgstr "新鮮なうちに収穫されたタンポポ。生で食べるには非常に苦い。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
msgid "burdocks"
msgid_plural "burdocks"
msgstr[0] "ゴボウ"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'burdocks'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
msgid "Burdock, a bitter thistle-like vegetable.  Can be eaten raw or cooked."
msgstr "アザミに似た苦みのある野菜。生でも調理しても食べることができる。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#: data/json/items/comestibles/seed.json
msgid "rhubarb"
msgid_plural "rhubarbs"
msgstr[0] "ルバーブ"

#. ~ Description for rhubarb
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
msgid "Sour stems of the rhubarb plant, often used in baking pies."
msgstr "茎に強い酸味のある食用の植物で、焼き菓子やパイ、ジャム等に使われる。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#: data/json/items/comestibles/seed.json
msgid "sugar beet"
msgid_plural "sugar beets"
msgstr[0] "シュガービート"

#. ~ Description for sugar beet
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
msgid ""
"This fleshy root is ripe and flowing with sugars; just takes some processing"
" to extract them."
msgstr "糖分を含む太い根菜。いくつかの工程を経ることで砂糖を抽出することができる。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
msgid "tea leaf"
msgid_plural "tea leaves"
msgstr[0] "茶葉"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'tea leaf', 'str_pl': 'tea leaves'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
msgid ""
"Dried leaves of a tropical plant.  You can boil them into tea, or you can "
"just eat them raw.  They aren't too filling though."
msgstr "乾燥させた熱帯植物の葉。お湯で煮出して茶として飲むことも、生で食べることもできるが、どちらにしても腹を満たすものではない。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
msgid "coca leaf"
msgid_plural "coca leaves"
msgstr[0] "コカの葉"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'coca leaf', 'str_pl': 'coca leaves'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
msgid ""
"Coca leaves.  Have a long history of medicinal and culinary uses, and can "
"produce a mild high when chewed.  You can boil them into tea or you can just"
" eat them raw.  Can cause addiction if consumed in large quantities."
msgstr ""
"コカの木の葉。古くから医療および食用として用いられており、噛むと軽い快感が得られる。煮て茶として飲んだり、そのまま食べることもできる。大量に摂取すると中毒を起こす可能性がある。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#: data/json/items/comestibles/seed.json
msgid "tomato"
msgid_plural "tomatoes"
msgstr[0] "トマト"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'tomato', 'str_pl': 'tomatoes'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
msgid ""
"Juicy red tomato.  It gained popularity in Italy after being brought back "
"from the New World."
msgstr "水分を多く含む赤いトマト。新大陸からイタリアへ伝わったことで、その人気が広まり始めた。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
msgid "plant marrow"
msgid_plural "plant marrows"
msgstr[0] "野菜のかたまり"

#. ~ Description for plant marrow
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
msgid "A nutrient rich chunk of plant matter, could be eaten raw or cooked."
msgstr "栄養素が豊富な植物のかたまり。生でも、調理しても食べることができる。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
msgid "alien fungus chunk"
msgid_plural "alien fungus chunks"
msgstr[0] "異星の菌類のかたまり"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'alien fungus chunk'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
msgid ""
"This is a chunk of fungal matter from some sort of alien mushroom creature."
"  Eating unfamiliar mushrooms is a bad idea."
msgstr "異星のキノコ状生物の菌質のかたまり。見知らぬキノコを食べるのは、あまりよい考えではない。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
msgid "wild vegetables"
msgid_plural "wild vegetables"
msgstr[0] "山菜"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'wild vegetables'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
msgid ""
"An assortment of edible-looking wild plants.  Most are quite bitter-tasting."
"  Some are inedible until cooked."
msgstr "食べられそうな見た目の野生植物。ほとんどのものは苦みが強く、生ではあまり美味しくない。中には調理しないと食べられないものもある。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#: data/json/items/comestibles/seed.json
msgid "zucchini"
msgid_plural "zucchinis"
msgstr[0] "ズッキーニ"

#. ~ Description for zucchini
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
msgid "A tasty summer squash."
msgstr "美味しい夏野菜だ。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
#: data/json/items/comestibles/seed.json
msgid "canola"
msgid_plural "canolas"
msgstr[0] "キャノーラ"

#. ~ Description for canola
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
msgid "A pretty stalk of canola.  Its seeds can be pressed into oil."
msgstr "キャノーラの茎。油を絞り取ることができる。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
msgid "raw beans"
msgid_plural "raw beans"
msgstr[0] "生豆"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'raw beans'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
msgid ""
"Raw, uncooked beans.  They are mildly toxic in this form, but you could cook"
" them to make them tasty."
msgstr "加熱していない生の豆。そのままではわずかな毒性があるが、調理することで美味しく食べられる。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
msgid "raw lentils"
msgid_plural "raw lentils"
msgstr[0] "生レンティル"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'raw lentils'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
msgid "Raw, uncooked lentils.  They could be cooked."
msgstr "加熱していない生のレンズ豆。調理して食べることができる。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
msgid "fiddleheads"
msgid_plural "fiddleheads"
msgstr[0] "ゼンマイ"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'fiddleheads'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
msgid ""
"A handful of immature fern fronds, still curled up like the head of a "
"fiddle.  Delicious when cooked, but consuming raw can cause food poisoning."
msgstr "少数の、まだバイオリンの頭のように丸まったままの若いシダの芽。調理して食べるとおいしいが、生で食べると食中毒を起こす可能性がある。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
msgid "rice bran"
msgid_plural "rice brans"
msgstr[0] "米ぬか"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'rice bran'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
msgid ""
"The leftover outer layer of rice seeds, this vegetable matter is quite "
"nutritionally dense and makes for a good cooking oil."
msgstr "稲を精米した後に残る外皮。この植物性物質は栄養が豊富で、良質な食用油を作ることができる。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
msgid "aquatic greens"
msgid_plural "aquatic greens"
msgstr[0] "水生の葉"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'aquatic greens'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/raw_veggy.json
msgid ""
"Shoots and leaves from underwater plants, such as hornwort or pondweed.  A "
"bit like raw seaweed."
msgstr "ホルトノキやミズバショウなどの水中植物の芽や葉。生の海草に似ている。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/sandwich.json
msgid "GENERIC SANDWICH"
msgid_plural "GENERIC SANDWICHES"
msgstr[0] "通常のサンドイッチ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'GENERIC SANDWICH', 'str_pl': 'GENERIC
#. SANDWICHES'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/sandwich.json
msgid ""
"If you can see this, you shouldn't be able to.  This is to solve dumb copy-"
"from issues."
msgstr "これを見ることができたら、何かが間違っている。元々は単純なコピー・ペーストのバグを修正するためのもの。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/sandwich.json
msgid "deluxe sandwich"
msgid_plural "deluxe sandwiches"
msgstr[0] "デラックスサンドイッチ"

#. ~ Conditional name for {'str': 'deluxe sandwich', 'str_pl': 'deluxe
#. sandwiches'} when COMPONENT_ID matches mutant
#: data/json/items/comestibles/sandwich.json
msgid "\"deluxe\" sandwich"
msgid_plural "\"deluxe\" sandwiches"
msgstr[0] "『特製』サンドイッチ"

#. ~ Conditional name for {'str': 'deluxe sandwich', 'str_pl': 'deluxe
#. sandwiches'} when FLAG matches CANNIBALISM
#: data/json/items/comestibles/sandwich.json
msgid "slob deluxe sandwich"
msgid_plural "slob deluxe sandwiches"
msgstr[0] "あいつデラックスサンドイッチ"

#. ~ Conditional name for {'str': 'deluxe sandwich', 'str_pl': 'deluxe
#. sandwiches'} when COMPONENT_ID matches butter
#. ~ Conditional name for {'str': 'dairy-free deluxe sandwich', 'str_pl':
#. 'dairy-free deluxe sandwiches'} when COMPONENT_ID matches butter
#: data/json/items/comestibles/sandwich.json
#, c-format
msgid "%s with butter"
msgid_plural "%s with butters"
msgstr[0] "%sにバターを添えて"

#. ~ Conditional name for {'str': 'deluxe sandwich', 'str_pl': 'deluxe
#. sandwiches'} when COMPONENT_ID matches sauerkraut
#. ~ Conditional name for {'str': 'dairy-free deluxe sandwich', 'str_pl':
#. 'dairy-free deluxe sandwiches'} when COMPONENT_ID matches sauerkraut
#: data/json/items/comestibles/sandwich.json
#, c-format
msgid "%s with sauerkraut"
msgid_plural "%s with sauerkrauts"
msgstr[0] "ザウアークラウトを添えた %s"

#. ~ Conditional name for {'str': 'deluxe sandwich', 'str_pl': 'deluxe
#. sandwiches'} when COMPONENT_ID matches soysauce
#. ~ Conditional name for {'str': 'dairy-free deluxe sandwich', 'str_pl':
#. 'dairy-free deluxe sandwiches'} when COMPONENT_ID matches soysauce
#: data/json/items/comestibles/sandwich.json
#, c-format
msgid "%s with soy sauce"
msgid_plural "%s with soy sauces"
msgstr[0] "醤油をかけた %s"

#. ~ Conditional name for {'str': 'deluxe sandwich', 'str_pl': 'deluxe
#. sandwiches'} when COMPONENT_ID matches seasoning_salt
#. ~ Conditional name for {'str': 'dairy-free deluxe sandwich', 'str_pl':
#. 'dairy-free deluxe sandwiches'} when COMPONENT_ID matches seasoning_salt
#: data/json/items/comestibles/sandwich.json
#, c-format
msgid "%s with seasoned salt"
msgid_plural "%s with seasoned salts"
msgstr[0] "味塩をかけた %s"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'deluxe sandwich', 'str_pl': 'deluxe sandwiches'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/sandwich.json
msgid ""
"A sandwich of meat, vegetables, and cheese with condiments.  Tasty and "
"nutritious!"
msgstr "肉、野菜、チーズを挟んだサンドイッチ。美味しく、栄養も豊富！"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/sandwich.json
msgid "grilled cheese sandwich"
msgid_plural "grilled cheese sandwiches"
msgstr[0] "焼きチーズサンドイッチ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'grilled cheese sandwich', 'str_pl': 'grilled
#. cheese sandwiches'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/sandwich.json
msgid ""
"A delicious grilled cheese sandwich, because everything is better with "
"melted cheese."
msgstr "おいしく焼き上げたチーズサンドイッチ。溶けたチーズがあれば、何にでも味がぐんと良くなる。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/sandwich.json
msgid "cheese sandwich"
msgid_plural "cheese sandwiches"
msgstr[0] "チーズサンドイッチ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'cheese sandwich', 'str_pl': 'cheese sandwiches'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/sandwich.json
msgid "A simple cheese sandwich."
msgstr "シンプルなチーズサンドイッチ。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/sandwich.json
msgid "jam sandwich"
msgid_plural "jam sandwiches"
msgstr[0] "ジャムサンドイッチ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'jam sandwich', 'str_pl': 'jam sandwiches'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/sandwich.json
msgid "A delicious jam sandwich."
msgstr "おいしいジャムサンドイッチ。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/sandwich.json
msgid "fairy bread"
msgid_plural "fairy bread"
msgstr[0] "妖精パン"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'fairy bread'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/sandwich.json
msgid ""
"An 'open-faced sandwich' consisting of sliced white bread, a healthy crust-"
"to-crust slathering of butter, and sprinkles.  Supposedly a staple of "
"birthday parties in Australia."
msgstr ""
"薄切りの白パンに、一端のクラストからもう一端までたっぷりとバターを塗り、スプリンクルを散らした「トッピングのないサンドイッチ」。オーストラリアでは誕生日パーティーの主なメニューとして提供される。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/sandwich.json
msgid "honey sandwich"
msgid_plural "honey sandwiches"
msgstr[0] "ハチミツサンドイッチ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'honey sandwich', 'str_pl': 'honey sandwiches'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/sandwich.json
msgid "A delicious honey sandwich."
msgstr "おいしい蜂蜜サンドイッチ。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/sandwich.json
msgid "sauce sandwich"
msgid_plural "sauce sandwiches"
msgstr[0] "ソースサンドイッチ"

#. ~ Conditional name for {'str': 'sauce sandwich', 'str_pl': 'sauce
#. sandwiches'} when COMPONENT_ID matches ketchup
#: data/json/items/comestibles/sandwich.json
msgid "ketchup sandwich"
msgid_plural "ketchup sandwiches"
msgstr[0] "ケチャップサンドイッチ"

#. ~ Conditional name for {'str': 'sauce sandwich', 'str_pl': 'sauce
#. sandwiches'} when COMPONENT_ID matches mayonnaise
#: data/json/items/comestibles/sandwich.json
msgid "mayonnaise sandwich"
msgid_plural "mayonnaise sandwiches"
msgstr[0] "マヨネーズサンドイッチ"

#. ~ Conditional name for {'str': 'sauce sandwich', 'str_pl': 'sauce
#. sandwiches'} when COMPONENT_ID matches mustard
#: data/json/items/comestibles/sandwich.json
msgid "mustard sandwich"
msgid_plural "mustard sandwiches"
msgstr[0] "マスタードサンドイッチ"

#. ~ Conditional name for {'str': 'sauce sandwich', 'str_pl': 'sauce
#. sandwiches'} when COMPONENT_ID matches horseradish
#: data/json/items/comestibles/sandwich.json
msgid "horseradish sandwich"
msgid_plural "horseradish sandwiches"
msgstr[0] "西洋ワサビサンドイッチ"

#. ~ Conditional name for {'str': 'sauce sandwich', 'str_pl': 'sauce
#. sandwiches'} when COMPONENT_ID matches butter
#: data/json/items/comestibles/sandwich.json
msgid "butter sandwich"
msgid_plural "butter sandwiches"
msgstr[0] "バターサンドイッチ"

#. ~ Conditional name for {'str': 'sauce sandwich', 'str_pl': 'sauce
#. sandwiches'} when COMPONENT_ID matches sauerkraut
#: data/json/items/comestibles/sandwich.json
msgid "sauerkraut sandwich"
msgid_plural "sauerkraut sandwiches"
msgstr[0] "ザウアークラウトサンドイッチ"

#. ~ Conditional name for {'str': 'sauce sandwich', 'str_pl': 'sauce
#. sandwiches'} when COMPONENT_ID matches soysauce
#: data/json/items/comestibles/sandwich.json
msgid "soy sauce sandwich"
msgid_plural "soy sauce sandwiches"
msgstr[0] "醤油サンドイッチ"

#. ~ Conditional name for {'str': 'sauce sandwich', 'str_pl': 'sauce
#. sandwiches'} when COMPONENT_ID matches sauce_pesto
#: data/json/items/comestibles/sandwich.json
msgid "pesto sandwich"
msgid_plural "pesto sandwiches"
msgstr[0] "ペストサンドイッチ"

#. ~ Conditional name for {'str': 'sauce sandwich', 'str_pl': 'sauce
#. sandwiches'} when COMPONENT_ID matches sauce_red
#: data/json/items/comestibles/sandwich.json
msgid "red sauce sandwich"
msgid_plural "red sauce sandwiches"
msgstr[0] "レッドソースサンドイッチ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'sauce sandwich', 'str_pl': 'sauce sandwiches'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/sandwich.json
msgid ""
"A simple sauce sandwich.  Not very filling but beats eating just the bread."
msgstr "シンプルなソースをかけたサンドイッチ。それほど腹は満たさないが、パンだけを食べるよりはましだ。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/sandwich.json
msgid "vegetable sandwich"
