#. meat'} when COMPONENT_ID matches mutant
#: data/json/items/comestibles/soup.json
msgid "creature curry"
msgid_plural "creature curries"
msgstr[0] "カタクリズムカレー"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'curry with meat', 'str_pl': 'curries with meat'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/soup.json
msgid "Spicy, and filled with bits of peppers and meat!  It's pretty good."
msgstr "ピリ辛で、わずかなコショウと肉が入っている！かなりおいしい。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/soup.json
msgid "woods soup"
msgid_plural "woods soups"
msgstr[0] "森のスープ"

#. ~ Conditional name for woods soup when COMPONENT_ID matches mutant
#: data/json/items/comestibles/soup.json
msgid "Mirkwood soup"
msgid_plural "Mirkwood soups"
msgstr[0] "陰れの森のスープ"

#. ~ Description for woods soup
#: data/json/items/comestibles/soup.json
msgid "A nutritious and delicious soup, made of gifts of nature."
msgstr "美味しく栄養価の高いスープ。森で採れる自然の恵みで作られた一品。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/soup.json
msgid "chicken noodle soup"
msgid_plural "chicken noodle soups"
msgstr[0] "チキンヌードル"

#. ~ Description for chicken noodle soup
#: data/json/items/comestibles/soup.json
msgid ""
"Chicken chunks and noodles swimming in a salty broth.  Rumored to help cure "
"colds."
msgstr "しょっぱいスープにチキンと麺を浸した料理。風邪に効くという噂がある。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/soup.json
msgid "mushroom soup"
msgid_plural "mushroom soups"
msgstr[0] "キノコスープ"

#. ~ Description for mushroom soup
#: data/json/items/comestibles/soup.json
msgid "A mushy, gray semi-liquid soup made from mushrooms."
msgstr "キノコ入りの、どろどろとした灰色のスープ。やわらかく、とろみがある。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/soup.json
msgid "tomato soup"
msgid_plural "tomato soups"
msgstr[0] "トマトスープ"

#. ~ Description for tomato soup
#: data/json/items/comestibles/soup.json
msgid ""
"It smells of tomatoes.  Not very filling, but it goes well with grilled "
"cheese."
msgstr "トマトの香りがする。食べたからといってそれほど満腹にはならないが、焼きチーズとの相性は抜群。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/soup.json
msgid "chicken and dumplings"
msgid_plural "chicken and dumplings"
msgstr[0] "チキンとダンプリング"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'chicken and dumplings'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/soup.json
msgid "A soup with chicken chunks and balls of dough.  Not bad."
msgstr "チキンと丸い形の小麦粉の団子が入ったスープ。悪くない味わい。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/soup.json
msgid "cullen skink"
msgid_plural "cullen skinks"
msgstr[0] "カレンスキンク"

#. ~ Description for cullen skink
#: data/json/items/comestibles/soup.json
msgid ""
"A rich and tasty fish chowder from Scotland, made with preserved fish and "
"creamy milk."
msgstr "スコットランドの伝統料理、贅沢で美味しい魚のチャウダー。塩漬けの魚とクリーミーな牛乳を使っている。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
msgid "chili powder"
msgid_plural "chili powder"
msgstr[0] "チリパウダー"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'chili powder'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
msgid ""
"Chilly P, Yo!  Not edible on its own, but it could be used to make "
"seasoning."
msgstr "チリパウダー。そのままでは食べられないが、調味料として使える。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
msgid "cinnamon"
msgid_plural "cinnamon"
msgstr[0] "シナモン"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'cinnamon'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
msgid "Ground cinnamon bark with a sweet but slightly spicy aroma."
msgstr "シナモンの樹皮。甘い香りがするが、わずかにツンとする香りも含まれている。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
msgid "curry powder"
msgid_plural "curry powder"
msgstr[0] "カレー粉"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'curry powder'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
msgid ""
"A blend of spices meant to be used in some South Asian dishes.  Can't be "
"eaten raw, why would you even try that?"
msgstr "南アジアの一部の料理に使われるスパイス。生で食べることはできない。なぜそんなものをわざわざ食べようとするのだろうか？"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
msgid "black pepper"
msgid_plural "black pepper"
msgstr[0] "黒胡椒"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'black pepper'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
msgid "Ground black spice berries with a pungent aroma."
msgstr "強い香りを持つ黒いスパイスパウダー。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
msgid "salt"
msgid_plural "salt"
msgstr[0] "塩"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'salt'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
msgid ""
"Yuck!  You surely wouldn't want to eat this.  It's good for preserving meat "
"and cooking, though."
msgstr "げっ！これはそのまま食べたいとは思わないだろう。料理や食品の保存に使うのがよい。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
msgid "Italian seasoning"
msgid_plural "Italian seasoning"
msgstr[0] "イタリアンスパイス"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'Italian seasoning'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
msgid "A fragrant mix of dried oregano, basil, thyme and other spices."
msgstr "乾燥させたオレガノ、バジル、タイムなど、他の香辛料を混ぜ合わせたもの。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
msgid "seasoned salt"
msgid_plural "seasoned salt"
msgstr[0] "調味塩"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'seasoned salt'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
msgid "Salt mixed with a fragrant blend of secret herbs and spices."
msgstr "秘密のスパイスとハーブパウダーを混ぜて作られた調味塩。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
msgid "sugar"
msgid_plural "sugar"
msgstr[0] "砂糖"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'sugar'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
msgid ""
"Sweet, sweet sugar.  Bad for your teeth and surprisingly not very tasty on "
"its own."
msgstr "とても甘い砂糖。歯の健康には悪く、意外にもそのままではそれほど美味しくない。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
msgid "sprinkles"
msgid_plural "sprinkles"
msgstr[0] "スプリンクル"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'sprinkles'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
msgid ""
"Known as nonpareils, sprinkles, jimmies, sugar strands or 'hundreds-and-"
"thousands', these colorful balls, rods or flakes of sugar and starch are "
"intended for use decorating soft surfaces of sweets.  Like sugar, they are "
"bad for your teeth and surprisingly not very tasty on their own."
msgstr ""
"ノンパレル "
"、スプリンクル、ジミー、シュガーストランド、「ハンドレッド&サウザンド」などの呼び名がある色鮮やかな丸い粒、縦長の粒、砂糖やデンプンの薄片。菓子などの柔らかい食品の表面を飾り付けるために使われる。砂糖と同じく、歯には悪く、これだけを食べてもまったく美味しくない。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
msgid "wild herbs"
msgid_plural "wild herbs"
msgstr[0] "野生のハーブ"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'wild herbs'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
msgid ""
"A tasty collection of wild herbs including violet, sassafras, mint, clover, "
"purslane, fireweed, and burdock."
msgstr "スミレ、サッサフラス、ミント、クローバー、スベリヒユ、ヤナギラン、ゴボウなどの食べられる野草を摘んだもの。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
msgid "soy sauce"
msgid_plural "soy sauce"
msgstr[0] "醤油"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'soy sauce'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
msgid "Salty fermented soybean sauce."
msgstr "大豆を発酵させて作る液体調味料。"

#. ~ Description for thyme
#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
msgid "A stalk of thyme.  Smells delicious."
msgstr "タイムの茎。美味しそうな芳香を放っている。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
msgid "mustard powder"
msgid_plural "mustard powder"
msgstr[0] "マスタード粉末"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'mustard powder'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
msgid "A fragnant yellow powder.  Not edible in this form."
msgstr "香りのよい黄色の粉末。この状態では食べられない。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
msgid "gochujang"
msgid_plural "gochujang"
msgstr[0] "コチュジャン"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'gochujang'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
msgid ""
"A spicy and sweet Korean condiment, quite often used throughout Korean "
"cooking."
msgstr "韓国料理全般に頻繁に使われる、辛くて甘い韓国風の調味料。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "cooked cattail stalk"
msgid_plural "cooked cattail stalks"
msgstr[0] "ガマの茎[調理済]"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'cooked cattail stalk'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"A cooked stalk from a cattail plant.  Its fibrous outer leaves have been "
"stripped away and now it is quite delicious."
msgstr "加熱調理されたガマの茎。繊維質の外皮が剥がれ落ち、美味しく食べられるようになった。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "starch"
msgid_plural "starch"
msgstr[0] "デンプン"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'starch'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"Sticky, gooey carbohydrate paste extracted from plants.  Spoils rather "
"quickly if not prepared for storage."
msgstr "植物から抽出した、べとつく炭水化物のペーストだ。腐敗が速く保存には向かない。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "roasted garlic"
msgid_plural "roasted garlic"
msgstr[0] "焼きニンニク"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'roasted garlic'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"Exposed cloves of garlic that have been coated in oil and then roasted.  "
"Much better than eating them raw."
msgstr "油を塗って焼いたニンニク。生で食べるよりもずっとおいしい。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "roasted chili pepper"
msgid_plural "roasted chili peppers"
msgstr[0] "焼き唐辛子"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'roasted chili pepper'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"Spicy chili pepper that has been roasted on high heat, with skin removed.  "
"Much better than eating it raw, and could also be used for other cooking "
"recipes."
msgstr "殻を取り除き、高温で焼いた辛い唐辛子。生で食べるよりずっと美味しく、他の料理に使うこともできる。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "cooked dandelion greens"
msgid_plural "cooked dandelion greens"
msgstr[0] "タンポポの葉[調理済]"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'cooked dandelion greens'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "Cooked leaves from wild dandelions.  Tasty and nutritious."
msgstr "調理した野生のタンポポの葉。美味しく栄養も豊富。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "fried dandelions"
msgid_plural "fried dandelions"
msgstr[0] "揚げタンポポ"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'fried dandelions'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"Wild dandelion flowers that have been battered and deep-fried.  Very tasty "
"and nutritious."
msgstr "野生のタンポポの花に衣をつけて揚げたもの。非常に美味しく栄養満点。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "cooked burdock greens"
msgid_plural "cooked burdock greens"
msgstr[0] "ゴボウの葉[調理済]"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'cooked burdock greens'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "Cooked burdock leaves.  Tasty and nutritious."
msgstr "調理した野生のゴボウの葉。美味しく栄養も豊富。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "fried burdocks"
msgid_plural "fried burdocks"
msgstr[0] "揚げゴボウ"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'fried burdocks'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"Wild burdocks that have been battered and deep-fried.  Very tasty and "
"nutritious."
msgstr "野生のゴボウに衣をつけて揚げたもの。非常に美味しく栄養も豊富。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "fried dandelions and burdocks"
msgid_plural "fried dandelions burdocks"
msgstr[0] "タンポポとゴボウのかき揚げ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'fried dandelions and burdocks', 'str_pl': 'fried
#. dandelions burdocks'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"Wild dandelions and burdocks that have been battered and deep-fried.  Very "
"tasty and nutritious."
msgstr "野生のタンポポとゴボウに衣をつけて揚げたもの。非常に美味しく栄養も豊富。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "cooked plant marrow"
msgid_plural "cooked plant marrows"
msgstr[0] "植物髄[調理済]"

#. ~ Description for cooked plant marrow
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "A freshly cooked chunk of plant matter, tasty and nutritious."
msgstr "美味しく栄養価の高い、新鮮な調理済の植物。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "cooked wild vegetables"
msgid_plural "cooked wild vegetables"
msgstr[0] "山菜[調理済]"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'cooked wild vegetables'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "Cooked wild edible plants.  An interesting mix of flavors."
msgstr "食べられる野草を調理したもの。色々な食材が混ざった風変わりな味。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "vegetable aspic"
msgid_plural "vegetable aspics"
msgstr[0] "野菜のアスピック"

#. ~ Description for vegetable aspic
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"A dish in which vegetables are set into a gelatin made from a plant stock."
msgstr "煮汁から作ったゼラチンで野菜を固めた料理。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "cooked buckwheat"
msgid_plural "cooked buckwheat"
msgstr[0] "蕎麦[調理済]"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'cooked buckwheat'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"A serving of cooked buckwheat groats.  Healthy and nutritious but bland."
msgstr "調理して軽く潰した蕎麦の実。健康的で栄養豊富だが、面白みのない味。"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'corn'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "Canned corn in water.  Eat up!"
msgstr "水に浸したコーンが容器に入っている。美味しそう！"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "hominy"
msgid_plural "hominy"
msgstr[0] "ホミニー"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'hominy'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"Corn kernels which have been cooked in an alkaline solution and then rinsed,"
" making them better suited for eating or cooking."
msgstr "アルカリ性の水溶液で茹でてから皮を取り除いたコーン。そのまま食べても調理しても構ない。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "cornmeal"
msgid_plural "cornmeal"
msgstr[0] "コーンミール"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'cornmeal'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "This yellow cornmeal is useful for baking."
msgstr "焼いて調理すると美味しく食べられる。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "vegetarian baked beans"
msgid_plural "vegetarian baked beans"
msgstr[0] "野菜とベイクドビーンズ"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'vegetarian baked beans'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "Slow-cooked beans with vegetables.  Tasty and very filling."
msgstr "豆と野菜を一緒に炊いた料理。美味しく、お腹も十分満たされる。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "dried rice"
msgid_plural "dried rice"
msgstr[0] "米"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'dried rice'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"Dehydrated long-grain rice.  Tasty and nutritious when cooked, virtually "
"inedible when dry."
msgstr "乾燥させた長粒種の米。調理すれば満腹で美味しく食べられるが、乾いた状態では食べにくい。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "cooked rice"
msgid_plural "cooked rice"
msgstr[0] "ご飯"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'cooked rice'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "A hearty serving of cooked long-grain white rice."
msgstr "温かく炊き上がった長粒種の白いご飯。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "fried rice"
msgid_plural "fried rice"
msgstr[0] "野菜チャーハン"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'fried rice'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "Delicious fried rice with vegetables.  Tasty and very filling."
msgstr "野菜を入れて炒めた美味しいご飯。味がよく、お腹もしっかり満たされる。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "beans and rice"
msgid_plural "beans and rice"
msgstr[0] "豆飯"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'beans and rice'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"A serving of beans and rice that has been cooked together.  Delicious and "
"healthy!"
msgstr "豆と米を一緒に調理した料理。美味しくて体にも良い！"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "tofu fried rice"
msgid_plural "tofu fried rice"
msgstr[0] "豆腐チャーハン"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'tofu fried rice'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "Delicious tofu fried rice with vegetables.  Tasty and very filling."
msgstr "野菜とご飯を入れて炒めた美味しい豆腐料理。味がよく、お腹もしっかり満たされる。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "tofu stirfry"
msgid_plural "tofu stirfry"
msgstr[0] "豆腐の炒め物"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'tofu stirfry'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"A tofu stirfry with rice and a sweet bold flavor sure to be on your mind "
"through these dark days."
msgstr "炒めた豆腐をご飯と和えて濃く甘く味付けした。先の見えない日々の心を支える料理。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "deluxe vegetarian beans and rice"
msgid_plural "deluxe vegetarian beans and rice"
msgstr[0] "特製ベジタリアン豆ご飯"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'deluxe vegetarian beans and rice'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"Slow-cooked beans and rice with vegetables and seasonings.  Tasty and very "
"filling."
msgstr "豆と米、味付けされた野菜を蒸し上げたもの。味もよく、とても満足感がある。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "baked potato"
msgid_plural "baked potatoes"
msgstr[0] "ベイクドポテト"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'baked potato', 'str_pl': 'baked potatoes'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "A delicious baked potato.  Got any sour cream?"
msgstr "美味しそうなジャガイモの丸焼き。サワークリームを付けようか？"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "mashed pumpkin"
msgid_plural "mashed pumpkins"
msgstr[0] "マッシュパンプキン"

#. ~ Description for mashed pumpkin
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"This is a simple dish made by cooking the pumpkin pulp and then mashing."
msgstr "調理したかぼちゃの身をさらに柔らかくすり潰したもの。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "vegetable pie"
msgid_plural "vegetable pies"
msgstr[0] "ベジタブルパイ"

#. ~ Description for vegetable pie
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "A delicious baked pie with a delicious vegetable filling."
msgstr "美味しい野菜が沢山詰まった美味しそうなパイ。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "vegetable pizza"
msgid_plural "vegetable pizzas"
msgstr[0] "ベジタブルピザ"

#. ~ Description for vegetable pizza
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"A vegetarian pizza, with delicious tomato sauce and a fluffy crust.  Its "
"smell brings back great memories."
msgstr "ベジタリアンも安心して食べられる野菜のピザ。厚みのあるふわふわの生地に美味しいトマトソースがたっぷりと使われている。どこか懐かしい匂い。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "pesto"
msgid_plural "pesto"
msgstr[0] "ペスト"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'pesto'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "Olive oil, basil, garlic, pine nuts.  Simple and delicious."
msgstr "オリーブオイル、バジル、ガーリック、松の実が入ってる。シンプルで美味しい。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "canned veggy"
msgid_plural "canned veggies"
msgstr[0] "缶詰野菜"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'canned veggy', 'str_pl': 'canned veggies'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"This mushy pile of vegetable matter was boiled and canned in an earlier "
"life.  Better eat it before it oozes through your fingers."
msgstr "世界が滅びる前に、野菜をゆでて作った保存食。指の間から零れ落ちる前に、食べよう。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "salted veggy chunk"
msgid_plural "salted veggy chunks"
msgstr[0] "野菜のかたまり 塩漬け"

#. ~ Description for salted veggy chunk
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"Vegetable chunks pickled in a salt bath.  Goes well with burgers, if only "
"you can find one."
msgstr "野菜のかたまりを塩漬けにしたもの。ハンバーガーに入れて食べるとおいしい。ただし、ハンバーガーが見つかるなら、という前提だが。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "spaghetti al pesto"
msgid_plural "spaghetti al pesto"
msgstr[0] "スパゲッティ アルペスト"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'spaghetti al pesto'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "Spaghetti, with a generous helping of pesto on top.  Yum!"
msgstr "スパゲッティにペストソースをたっぷりかけたもの。美味しそうだね！"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "pickle"
msgid_plural "pickles"
msgstr[0] "ピクルス"

#. ~ Description for pickle
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"A pickled cucumber.  Rather sour, but tastes good and lasts for a long time."
msgstr "キューカンバーの酢漬け。少々酸っぱいが美味しく食べられ、長持ちする。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "sauerkraut w/ sautee'd onions"
msgid_plural "sauerkraut w/ sautee'd onions"
msgstr[0] "ザワークラウトとタマネギのソテー"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': "sauerkraut w/ sautee'd onions"}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"This is a delicious sautee of lovely diced onions and sauerkraut.  The smell"
" alone is enough to make your mouth water."
msgstr "角切りのタマネギとザワークラウトを合わせてさっと炒めた美味しそうな料理。匂いだけでよだれが溢れてくる。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "pickled veggy"
msgid_plural "pickled veggies"
msgstr[0] "野菜の酢漬け"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'pickled veggy', 'str_pl': 'pickled veggies'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"This is a serving of crisply brined and canned vegetable matter.  Tasty and "
"nutritious."
msgstr "野菜を漬けて作った缶詰。美味しく、栄養価も高い。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "dehydrated vegetable"
msgid_plural "dehydrated vegetables"
msgstr[0] "乾燥野菜"

#. ~ Description for dehydrated vegetable
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"Dehydrated vegetable flakes.  With proper storage, this dried food will "
"remain edible for an incredibly long time."
msgstr "水分を完全に除去した野菜フレーク。適切に保管すれば、信じられないほど長期間、食べられる状態のまま保存できる。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "rehydrated vegetable"
msgid_plural "rehydrated vegetables"
msgstr[0] "水戻し野菜"

#. ~ Description for rehydrated vegetable
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"Reconstituted vegetable flakes, which are much more enjoyable to eat now "
"that they have been rehydrated."
msgstr "水で戻した乾燥野菜。乾燥したまま食べるよりずっと美味しい。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "vegetable salad"
msgid_plural "vegetable salads"
msgstr[0] "野菜サラダ"

#. ~ Description for vegetable salad
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "Salad with all kind of vegetables."
msgstr "色んな種類の野菜を使ったサラダ。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "dried salad"
msgid_plural "dried salads"
msgstr[0] "乾燥野菜サラダ"

#. ~ Description for dried salad
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"Dried salad packed in a box with mayonnaise and ketchup.  Add water to "
"enjoy."
msgstr "乾燥した野菜にマヨネーズとケチャップを添えて箱に詰めたサラダ。美味しく食べるには水が必要。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "insta-salad"
msgid_plural "insta-salads"
msgstr[0] "即席野菜サラダ"

#. ~ Description for insta-salad
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"Dried salad with water added, not very tasty but still a decent substitution"
" for real salad."
msgstr "乾燥サラダを水で戻した物。干物を水で戻したものなので味は今一つだが、本物のサラダの代用品としては合格点。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "baked dahlia root"
msgid_plural "baked dahlia roots"
msgstr[0] "ベイクドダリアルート"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'baked dahlia root'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"Baking this dahlia root has broken down the starch, making it softer and "
"sweeter."
msgstr "ダリアの根を加熱すると、デンプンが分解されて柔らかくなり、甘みが増す。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "roasted salsify"
msgid_plural "roasted salsifies"
msgstr[0] "焼きサルシファイ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'roasted salsify', 'str_pl': 'roasted salsifies'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"When properly cooked, salsify tastes vaguely like oysters.  Makes a great "
"side dish."
msgstr "きちんと熱が通っていれば牡蠣に似た風味の美味しい料理になる。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "sushi rice"
msgid_plural "sushi rice"
msgstr[0] "酢飯"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'sushi rice'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "A serving of sticky vinegared rice commonly used in sushi."
msgstr "酢で味付けされた米で、主に寿司を作るために使われる。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "onigiri"
msgid_plural "onigiri"
msgstr[0] "おにぎり"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'onigiri'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"A triangular block of tasty sushi rice with a healthy green vegetable folded"
" around it."
msgstr "三角形に握った酢飯の中に健康的な緑黄色野菜を入れた美味しい携帯食。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "vegetable hosomaki"
msgid_plural "vegetable hosomaki"
msgstr[0] "野菜巻き寿司"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'vegetable hosomaki'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"Delicious chopped vegetables wrapped in tasty sushi rice and rolled up in a "
"healthy green vegetable."
msgstr "刻んだ野菜を酢飯の中心に置いて巻き、さらにそれを健康的な緑黄色野菜で巻いて包んだ美味しい食べ物。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "dehydrated alien fungus chunk"
msgid_plural "dehydrated alien fungus chunks"
msgstr[0] "乾燥した異星菌類の塊"

#. ~ Description for dehydrated alien fungus chunk
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"Pieces of alien mushroom that have been dried to prevent them from rotting "
"away.  It will still poison you if you eat this."
msgstr "腐敗を防ぐために乾燥させた宇宙産きのこの欠片。依然として毒性が残っており、食べると中毒を起こす。"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "sauerkraut"
msgid_plural "sauerkraut"
