#. ~ Description for {'str': '10mm Auto casing'}
#: data/json/items/generic/casing.json
msgid "An empty casing from a 10mm Auto round."
msgstr "10mm オート弾の空薬莢。"

#: data/json/items/generic/casing.json
msgid "40x46mm M212 casing"
msgid_plural "40x46mm M212 casings"
msgstr[0] "40x46mm M212 薬莢"

#. ~ Description for {'str': '40x46mm M212 casing'}
#: data/json/items/generic/casing.json
msgid ""
"A large canister from a spent 40mm cartridge, used by M1006 stun rounds.  "
"Not very useful now that the world has ended; less-lethal rounds aren't very"
" useful against undead, and it likely won't tolerate higher pressures."
msgstr ""
"40mmグレネードを発射後に残る大型の空薬莢。M1006インパルス弾に対応している。だが、世界が滅びた今となってはほとんど意味はない。アンデッド相手に非致死弾はまったく役に立たず、高圧にも耐えられない。"

#: data/json/items/generic/casing.json
msgid "40x46mm M118 casing"
msgid_plural "40x46mm M118 casings"
msgstr[0] "40x46mm M118 薬莢"

#. ~ Description for {'str': '40x46mm M118 casing'}
#: data/json/items/generic/casing.json
msgid ""
"A large canister from a spent 40mm cartridge, used by M433 HEDP rounds.  It "
"could be repurposed for makeshift buckshot and other handloads."
msgstr "40mmグレネードを発射後に残る大型の空薬莢。M433 HEDP弾に対応。自作のベッグショット弾やその他の手製弾薬を作るのに利用できる。"

#: data/json/items/generic/casing.json
msgid "40x46mm M199 casing"
msgid_plural "40x46mm M199 casings"
msgstr[0] "40x46mm M199 薬莢"

#. ~ Description for {'str': '40x46mm M199 casing'}
#: data/json/items/generic/casing.json
msgid ""
