msgid "Merch"
msgid_plural "Merchs"
msgstr[0] "ﾏｰﾁ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Merch'}
#: data/json/items/generic/currency.json
msgid ""
"The Free Merchant Certified Note, also known by names such as a 'c-note' or "
"'merch', is a currency based on old American bills.  Fifty dollar bills and "
"larger are printed with a promissory note signed by the treasurer of the "
"Free Merchants, along with a complex design.  The note explains that this "
"can be exchanged for food, water, and other services through the Free "
"Merchants in the Refugee Center."
msgstr ""
"自由商人認定紙幣は、『シーノート』や『マーチ』などとも呼ばれ、かつてのアメリカ紙幣を基にした通貨。50ドル紙幣以上には、自由商人の会計係による為替手形が署名され、複雑な模様とともに印刷されている。この紙幣は、難民センターにおける自由商人を通じて、食料や水、その他のサービスと交換できることが記載されている。"

#: data/json/items/generic/currency.json
msgid "Hub 01 Gold Coin"
msgid_plural "Hub 01 Gold Coins"
msgstr[0] "ハブ01金貨"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Hub 01 Gold Coin'}
#: data/json/items/generic/currency.json
msgid ""
"This is a small but surprisingly heavy gold coin.  One side is etched with "
"circuitry and the other side reads 'Hub 01 exchange currency'."
msgstr "小さくとも、驚くほど重みのある金貨。片面には電気回路網の模様が刻まれ、反対側には『ハブ01 交易通貨』と記されている。"

#: data/json/items/generic/currency.json
msgid "FlatCoin"
msgid_plural "FlatCoins"
msgstr[0] "フラットコイン"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'FlatCoin'}
#: data/json/items/generic/currency.json
msgid ""
"This is a coin that has been flattened in a novelty coin flattening machine."
"  The machine has been somewhat crudely altered so that the design - which "
"appears to once have been Mickey Mouse - is overlaid with a handwritten "
"emblem of a book.  There is some text that faintly reads 'Campus Exchange "
"Token'."
msgstr ""
"珍しいコイン圧延機でプレスされた記念硬貨。機械は粗末に改造されており、かつてミッキーマウスだった図柄が、巨大な本の紋章で上書きされている。かすかに『キャンパス交換用トークン』という文字が読み取れる。"

