"A fletched wooden crossbow bolt with a blunt tip.  Useful for hunting small "
"woodland creatures without splattering them all over the ground.  Stands a "
"decent chance of remaining intact once fired."
msgstr "鈍い先端と羽根を付けた木製ボルト。小動物をバラバラにすることなく狩るのに役立つ。発射後、無傷で残る可能性はそこそこ高い。"

#: data/json/items/ranged/crossbows.json
msgid "stinger bolt"
msgid_plural "stinger bolts"
msgstr[0] "毒針ボルト"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'stinger bolt'}
#: data/json/items/ranged/crossbows.json
msgid ""
"A simple fletched wooden crossbow bolt with a tip carved from a mutated "
"insect stinger.  It poisons enemies it hits and stands a decent chance of "
"remaining intact once fired."
msgstr ""
"突然変異した昆虫の毒針を削って作った先端と羽根を付けた簡素な木製ボルト。命中した敵を中毒状態にする。発射後、無傷で残る可能性はそこそこ高い。"

#: data/json/items/ranged/crossbows.json
msgid "triffid bolt"
msgid_plural "triffid bolts"
msgstr[0] "トリフィド ボルト"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'triffid bolt'}
#: data/json/items/ranged/crossbows.json
msgid ""
"A simple fletched wooden crossbow bolt with a tip carved from an alien "
"plants stinger.  It paralyzes enemies it hits and stands a decent chance of "
"remaining intact once fired."
msgstr ""
"突然変異したエイリアン植物の毒針を削って作った先端と羽根を付けた簡素な木製ボルト。命中した敵を麻痺状態にする。発射後、無傷で残る可能性はそこそこ高い。"

#: data/json/items/ranged/crossbows.json
msgid "sharktooth bolt"
msgid_plural "sharktooth bolts"
msgstr[0] "シャークテースボルト"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'sharktooth bolt'}
#: data/json/items/ranged/crossbows.json
msgid ""
"A simple fletched crossbow bolt shaft with a tip carved from a serrated "
"tooth.  It stands a somewhat low chance of remaining intact once fired."
msgstr "ギザギザの歯を削って作った先端と羽根を付けた簡素なボルト。発射後、無傷で残る可能性はやや低い。"

#: data/json/items/ranged/crossbows.json
msgid "simple metal bolt"
msgid_plural "simple metal bolts"
msgstr[0] "粗末な金属製ボルト"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'simple metal bolt'}
#: data/json/items/ranged/crossbows.json
msgid ""
"A simple fletched steel crossbow bolt with a flattened and sharpened tip.  "
"Stands a somewhat low chance of remaining intact once fired."
msgstr "叩いて平らにし、鋭利に仕上げた先端と羽根を付けた簡素な鋼鉄製ボルト。発射後、無傷で残る可能性はやや低い。"

#: data/json/items/ranged/crossbows.json
msgid "aluminum broadhead bolt"
msgid_plural "aluminum broadhead bolts"
msgstr[0] "アルミニウム ブロードヘッドボルト"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'aluminum broadhead bolt'}
#: data/json/items/ranged/crossbows.json
msgid ""
"A fletched aluminum crossbow bolt with a bladed tip.  Useful for maximising "
"damage to the target.  Stands a good chance of remaining intact once fired."
msgstr "鋭い刃状の先端と羽根を付けたアルミニウム製ボルト。対象に最大限のダメージを与えるのに有効。発射後、無傷で残る可能性は高い。"

#: data/json/items/ranged/crossbows.json
msgid "aluminum field point bolt"
msgid_plural "aluminum field point bolts"
msgstr[0] "アルミニウム フィールドポイントボルト"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'aluminum field point bolt'}
#: data/json/items/ranged/crossbows.json
msgid ""
"A fletched aluminum crossbow bolt with a pointed tip.  Useful for piercing "
"armor.  Stands a good chance of remaining intact once fired."
msgstr "尖った先端と羽根を付けたアルミニウム製ボルト。防具を貫通するのに有効。発射後、無傷で残る可能性は高い。"

#: data/json/items/ranged/crossbows.json
msgid "aluminum small game bolt"
msgid_plural "aluminum small game bolts"
msgstr[0] "アルミニウム狩猟用ボルト"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'aluminum small game bolt'}
#: data/json/items/ranged/crossbows.json
msgid ""
"A fletched aluminum crossbow bolt with a blunt tip.  Useful for hunting "
"small woodland creatures without splattering them all over the ground.  "
"Stands a good chance of remaining intact once fired."
msgstr "鈍い先端と羽根を付けたアルミニウム製ボルト。小動物をバラバラにすることなく狩るのに役立つ。発射後、無傷で残る可能性は高い。"

#: data/json/items/ranged/crossbows.json
msgid "carbon fiber hunting bolt"
msgid_plural "carbon fiber hunting bolts"
msgstr[0] "カーボンファイバー狩猟用ボルト"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'carbon fiber hunting bolt'}
#: data/json/items/ranged/crossbows.json
msgid ""
"A fletched carbon fiber crossbow bolt shaft with an expanding broadhead tip."
"  Deals impressive damage to targets, but less effective against armor.  "
"Stands a good chance of remaining intact once fired."
msgstr ""
"展開式ブロードヘッドの先端と羽根を備えたカーボンファイバーボルト。対象に優れたダメージを与えるが、防具に対しては効果が低い。発射後、無傷で残る可能性は高い。"

#: data/json/items/ranged/crossbows.json
msgid "explosive crossbow bolt"
msgid_plural "explosive crossbow bolts"
msgstr[0] "爆発式クロスボルト"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'explosive crossbow bolt'}
#: data/json/items/ranged/crossbows.json
msgid ""
"A lightweight, sharpened bolt made from some kind of metal.  It is fairly "
"unwieldy and only provides moderate accuracy, due to being filled with "
"explosives and fitted with an impact trigger."
msgstr "何らかの金属から作られた、軽量で鋭利なボルト。爆発物と衝撃起爆装置が内蔵されているため、かなり扱いにくく、精度も並程度にとどまる。"

#: data/json/items/ranged/crossbows.json
msgid "bullet crossbow"
msgid_plural "bullet crossbows"
msgstr[0] "バレットクロスボウ"

#: data/json/items/ranged/crossbows.json
msgid ""
"A modified version of the classic crossbow which utilizes stones as "
"projectiles instead of the traditional quarrel.  Primarily intended for "
"hunting small game, stronger people can reload it much faster."
msgstr ""
"従来のボルトの代わりに石を投射物として使用するよう改造された古典的なクロスボウだ。主として小動物の狩猟を目的としており、筋力の強い者はより速く装填できる。"

#: data/json/items/ranged/crossbows.json
msgid "makeshift crossbow"
msgid_plural "makeshift crossbows"
msgstr[0] "簡易クロスボウ"

#: data/json/items/ranged/crossbows.json
msgid ""
"A simple, handmade crossbow of the Skane style, with a wooden peg that is "
"pushed up from underneath to loose the bowstring.  Not as powerful as other "
"crossbow designs, but it is easier to draw the bow back.  Bolts fired from "
"this weapon have a good chance of remaining intact for re-use."
msgstr ""
"バネで木製の杭を押し上げて発射する機構の、シンプルな自作クロスボウです。他のクロスボウほど威力は高くない構造ですが、簡単に装填できます。放たれた矢は消滅しなければ再利用が可能です。"

#: data/json/items/ranged/crossbows.json
msgid "pistol crossbow"
msgid_plural "pistol crossbows"
msgstr[0] "ピストルクロスボウ"

#: data/json/items/ranged/crossbows.json
msgid ""
"A small concealable pistol-like crossbow.  It's weak due to its small size "
"and draw, so it is best suited for hunting small game.  Bolts fired from "
"this weapon have a good chance of remaining intact for re-use."
msgstr ""
"隠蔽可能な小型のピストル型クロスボウ。サイズと弓の張り幅が小さいため威力は弱く、小動物の狩猟に最も適している。この武器で発射したボルトは、再利用のために無傷で残る可能性が高い。"

#: data/json/items/ranged/crossbows.json
msgid "crossbow"
msgid_plural "crossbows"
msgstr[0] "クロスボウ"

#: data/json/items/ranged/crossbows.json
msgid ""
"A slow-loading hand weapon that launches bolts.  Stronger people can reload "
"it much faster.  Bolts fired from this weapon have a good chance of "
"remaining intact for re-use."
msgstr ""
"ボルトを発射する装填速度の遅い手持ち武器。筋力の強い者は、より速く再装填できる。この武器で発射したボルトは、再利用のために無傷で残る可能性が高い。"

#: data/json/items/ranged/crossbows.json
msgid "composite crossbow"
msgid_plural "composite crossbows"
msgstr[0] "コンポジットクロスボウ"

#: data/json/items/ranged/crossbows.json
msgid ""
"A slightly larger, more powerful crossbow utilizing composite material limbs"
" and somewhat more modern design practices."
msgstr "やや大きく、より強力なクロスボウ。複合素材の弓胴を利用し、いくらか現代的な設計手法に従っている。"

#: data/json/items/ranged/crossbows.json
msgid "compound crossbow"
msgid_plural "compound crossbows"
msgstr[0] "コンパウンドクロスボウ"

#: data/json/items/ranged/crossbows.json
msgid ""
"A high-power crossbow with shaped cams and extra cables for high-power "
"shots.  Takes less time to reload due to a modern string-pulling system."
msgstr ""
"特殊な形状のカムと追加のケーブルを備えた高張力クロスボウ。高威力の射撃を可能にする。現代的な弦引きシステムのおかげで、再装填にかかる時間は短い。"

#: data/json/items/ranged/crossbows.json
msgid "heavy crossbow"
msgid_plural "heavy crossbows"
msgstr[0] "ヘビークロスボウ"

#: data/json/items/ranged/crossbows.json
msgid ""
"A HUGE medieval crossbow from Germany with a very slow, difficult reloading "
"process not suited for unskilled users.  Its tension is so powerful that you"
" feel it shake after firing.  Bolts fired from this weapon have a good "
"chance of remaining intact for re-use."
msgstr ""
"装填が非常に遅く困難なため、未熟な使用者には向かない、ドイツ製の巨大な中世クロスボウだ。張力が非常に強いため、発射後にその振動を感じる。この武器で発射したボルトは、再利用のために無傷で残る可能性が高い。"

#: data/json/items/ranged/crossbows.json
msgid "repeating crossbow"
msgid_plural "repeating crossbows"
msgstr[0] "リピーティングクロスボウ"

#: data/json/items/ranged/crossbows.json
msgid ""
"A custom-made crossbow with a clever mechanism that loads and fires bolts in"
" a single motion, it has a wooden magazine that holds 10 bolts.  Bolts fired"
" from this weapon have a good chance of remaining intact for re-use."
msgstr ""
"装填と発射を単一の動作で行う巧妙な機構を備えた特注のクロスボウで、10本のボルトを保持できる木製の弾倉がある。この武器で発射したボルトは、再利用のために無傷で残る可能性が高い。"

#: data/json/items/ranged/crossbows.json
msgid "carbon fiber repeating crossbow"
msgid_plural "carbon fiber repeating crossbows"
msgstr[0] "リピーティングクロスボウ(ｶｰﾎﾞﾝ)"

#: data/json/items/ranged/crossbows.json
msgid ""
"A custom 3D-printed pump-action repeating crossbow made out of carbon fiber "
"and synthetic fabric.  This expensive hunting weapon is surprisingly "
"lightweight thanks to its construction, but it can only be repaired using a "
"3D printer."
msgstr ""
"カーボンファイバーと合成繊維を用いて3Dプリンターで製作された特注のポンプアクション式連発クロスボウ。この高価な狩猟用武器は、その構造のおかげで驚くほど軽量だが、修理には3Dプリンターを使用する以外に方法がない。"

#: data/json/items/ranged/crossbows.json
msgid "wooden ballista bolt"
msgid_plural "wooden ballista bolts"
msgstr[0] "木製バリスタボルト"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'wooden ballista bolt'}
#: data/json/items/ranged/crossbows.json
msgid ""
"A thick wooden projectile sharpened at one end, not much longer than an "
"arrow but much heavier.   Stands a low chance of remaining intact once "
"fired."
msgstr "片端が尖った太い木製の投射物。矢よりは長くないが、はるかに重い。発射後、無傷で残る可能性は低い。"

#: data/json/items/ranged/crossbows.json
msgid "iron ballista bolt"
msgid_plural "iron ballista bolts"
msgstr[0] "鉄製バリスタボルト"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'iron ballista bolt'}
#: data/json/items/ranged/crossbows.json
msgid ""
"A thick wooden projectile not much longer than an arrow, tipped with a heavy"
" iron point.   Stands a decent chance of remaining intact once fired."
msgstr "重い鉄の先端が取り付けられた、矢よりは長くない太い木製の投射物。発射後、無傷で残る可能性はそこそこ高い。"

#: data/json/items/ranged/crossbows.json
msgid "copper ballista bolt"
msgid_plural "copper ballista bolts"
msgstr[0] "カッパーバリスタボルト"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'copper ballista bolt'}
#: data/json/items/ranged/crossbows.json
msgid ""
"A thick wooden projectile not much longer than an arrow, tipped with a heavy"
" copper point.   Stands a somewhat low chance of remaining intact once "
"fired."
msgstr "重い銅の先端が取り付けられた、矢よりは長くない太い木製の投射物。発射後、無傷で残る可能性はやや低い。"

#: data/json/items/ranged/crossbows.json
msgid "ballista"
msgid_plural "ballistas"
msgstr[0] "バリスタ"

#: data/json/items/ranged/crossbows.json
msgid ""
"A massive weapon resembling a crossbow, powered by two torsion springs made "
"from tightly-wound rope and drawn using a winch.  Relatively light as far as"
" siege weapons go, it's far too heavy to fire without adequate support and "
"slow to reload.  Even so, it can send stones or specially-designed bolts "
"downrange with devastating force."
msgstr ""
"クロスボウに似た巨大な兵器で、固く巻かれたロープで作られた二つのねじりばねで動力を得て、ウインチを使って引き絞られる。攻城兵器としては比較的に軽量だが、適切な支持がなければ発射するには重すぎ、装填にも時間がかかる。それでもなお、石や特別に設計されたボルトを壊滅的な威力で射出する。"

#: data/json/items/ranged/pneumatic.json
msgid "BB gun"
msgid_plural "BB guns"
msgstr[0] "BB弾銃"

#: data/json/items/ranged/pneumatic.json
msgid ""
"Popular among children.  It's fairly accurate, but BBs deal nearly no "
"damage."
msgstr "子供たちに人気の品物だ。かなりの精度を持つが、BB弾はほとんどダメージを与えない。"

#: data/json/items/ranged/pneumatic.json
msgid "pneumatic bolt driver"
msgid_plural "pneumatic bolt drivers"
msgstr[0] "空圧式ボルトドライバー"

#: data/json/items/ranged/pneumatic.json
msgid ""
"A ten-shot, revolving barrel, pneumatic bolt driver handcrafted from scrap."
"  Be careful where you reload it, pumping air into the tank takes a few "
"seconds.  It is pretty quiet and quite deadly."
msgstr ""
"スクラップから手作りされた10連装の回転式銃身を備えた空圧式ボルトドライバーだ。タンクへの空気注入に数秒かかるため、再装填する場所には注意が必要だ。非常に静かで、かなりの致死性を持つ。"

#: data/json/items/ranged/pneumatic.json
msgid "pneumatic assault rifle"
msgid_plural "pneumatic assault rifles"
msgstr[0] "空圧式アサルトライフル"

#: data/json/items/ranged/pneumatic.json
msgid ""
"A multistroke pneumatic rifle handcrafted from scrap.  Be careful where you "
"reload it, pumping air into the tank takes a few seconds.  It is pretty "
"quiet and quite deadly."
msgstr ""
"スクラップから手作りされたマルチストローク式の空圧式ライフルだ。タンクへの空気注入に数秒かかるため、再装填する場所には注意が必要だ。非常に静かで、かなりの致死性を持つ。"

#: data/json/items/ranged/pneumatic.json
msgid "pneumatic shotgun"
msgid_plural "pneumatic shotguns"
msgstr[0] "空圧式ショットガン"

#: data/json/items/ranged/pneumatic.json
msgid ""
"A double-barreled pneumatic air shotgun handcrafted from scrap.  Though its "
"firepower is lacking compared to more conventional shotguns, this thing can "
"still pack quite a punch.  That is, if your target is directly in front of "
"you."
msgstr ""
"スクラップから手作りされた二連装の空圧式エアショットガン。より一般的なショットガンに比べると火力は劣るが、それでもかなりのパンチ力を秘めている。それは、標的が目の前にいる場合に限るが。"

#: data/json/items/ranged/slings.json
msgctxt "weapon"
msgid "sling"
msgid_plural "slings"
msgstr[0] "スリング"

#: data/json/items/ranged/slings.json
msgid ""
"A leather sling, easy to use and accurate.  It uses pebbles or rocks as "
"ammunition."
msgstr "使いやすく命中精度が高い革製スリング。弾薬として小石や岩を使用する。"

#: data/json/items/ranged/slings.json
msgid "staff sling"
msgid_plural "staff slings"
msgstr[0] "スタッフスリング"

#: data/json/items/ranged/slings.json
msgid ""
"A leather sling attached to a staff, easy to use and accurate.  It uses "
"rocks as ammunition."
msgstr "杖に括り付けられた革製スリング。使いやすく、命中精度が高い。弾薬として岩を使用する。"

#: data/json/items/ranged/slings.json
msgid "slingshot"
msgid_plural "slingshots"
msgstr[0] "スリングショット"

#: data/json/items/ranged/slings.json
msgid ""
"A wooden slingshot, easy to use and accurate.  It uses pebbles as "
"ammunition."
msgstr "木製のスリングショット。使いやすく、命中精度が高い。弾薬として小石を使用する。"

#: data/json/items/ranged/slings.json
msgid "brace slingshot"
msgid_plural "brace slingshots"
msgstr[0] "ブレーススリングショット"

#: data/json/items/ranged/slings.json
msgid ""
"A modern slingshot with a wrist brace, it is easy to use, accurate, and "
"quite powerful."
msgstr "リストブレースが付いた現代的なスリングショット。使いやすく、命中精度が高く、かなり強力だ。"

#: data/json/items/ranged/slings.json
msgid "slingshot cannon"
msgid_plural "slingshot cannons"
msgstr[0] "スリングショット砲"

#: data/json/items/ranged/slings.json
msgid ""
"Somewhere between a bullet crossbow and a slingshot on steroids, this "
"shoulder-mounted weapon uses a winch to keep several elastic bands under "
"tension.  It fires full-size rocks with much more power and range than "
"pebbles out of a normal slingshot.  High strength will make it faster to "
"reload."
msgstr ""
"筋肉増強剤を打たれたようなスリングショットと牽弓の間に位置するこの肩掛け式の武器は、ウインチを使用して複数の弾性バンドを強く引き絞る。通常のスリングショットで射出する小石よりもはるかに大きな岩を、より強力に、より遠くまで発射できる。筋力が高いほど、再装填が速くなる。"

#: data/json/items/ranged/slings.json
msgid "atlatl"
msgid_plural "atlatls"
msgstr[0] "アトラトル"

#: data/json/items/ranged/slings.json
msgid ""
"A wooden tool for supporting a javelin, to throw it more effectively than by"
" hand."
msgstr "ジャベリンを補助する手持ちの投槍器です。これを使えば素手よりもずっと効率的な投擲が可能です。"

#: data/json/items/ranged/spearguns.json
msgid "wooden fishing spear"
msgid_plural "wooden fishing spears"
msgstr[0] "木製釣り用のハープーン"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'wooden fishing spear'}
#: data/json/items/ranged/spearguns.json
msgid ""
"An underwater fishing spear made from wood tipped with steel.  It's very "
"light, but doesn't have much range.  Stands a below average chance of "
"remaining intact once fired."
msgstr "鋼鉄製の先端が付いた木製の水中漁用銛。非常に軽量だが、射程は短い。発射後、無傷で残る可能性は平均を下回る。"

#: data/json/items/ranged/spearguns.json
msgid "carbon fiber fishing spear"
msgid_plural "carbon fiber fishing spears"
msgstr[0] "カーボンファイバー釣り用のハープーン"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'carbon fiber fishing spear'}
#: data/json/items/ranged/spearguns.json
msgid ""
"An underwater fishing spear made from carbon fiber.  It's very light, but "
"doesn't have much range.  Stands a bad chance of remaining intact once "
"fired."
msgstr "カーボンファイバー製の水中漁用銛。非常に軽量だが、射程は短い。発射後、無傷で残る可能性は非常に低い。"

#: data/json/items/ranged/spearguns.json
msgid "metal fishing spear"
msgid_plural "metal fishing spears"
msgstr[0] "金属製釣り用のハープーン"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'metal fishing spear'}
#: data/json/items/ranged/spearguns.json
msgid ""
"An underwater fishing spear made from metal.  It's light, but doesn't have "
"much range.  Stands a very good chance of remaining intact once fired."
msgstr "金属製の水中漁用銛。軽量だが、射程は短い。発射後、無傷で残る可能性は非常に高い。"

#: data/json/items/ranged/spearguns.json
msgid "pneumatic speargun"
msgid_plural "pneumatic spearguns"
msgstr[0] "空圧式ハープーン銃"

#: data/json/items/ranged/spearguns.json
msgid ""
"A sophisticated underwater fishing implement designed to fire a specialized "
"type of spear using a hand-pump pressure system.  While highly effective "
"when used underwater, it is nearly useless on dry land."
msgstr ""
"手動ポンプ式の加圧システムを使用して特殊な銛を発射するよう設計された、洗練された水中漁用具。水中での使用には極めて有効だが、地上ではほとんど役に立たない。"

#: data/json/items/ranged/spearguns.json
msgid "mini speargun"
msgid_plural "mini spearguns"
msgstr[0] "小型ハープーン銃"

#: data/json/items/ranged/spearguns.json
msgid ""
"A small underwater fishing implement designed to fire a specialized type of "
"spear using tension in a rubber band.  While highly effective when used "
"underwater, it is nearly useless on dry land."
msgstr "ゴムバンドの張力を使用して特殊な銛を発射するよう設計された小型の水中漁用具。水中での使用には極めて有効だが、地上ではほとんど役に立たない。"

#: data/json/items/ranged/spearguns.json
msgid "speargun"
msgid_plural "spearguns"
msgstr[0] "ハープーン銃"

#: data/json/items/ranged/spearguns.json
msgid ""
"An underwater fishing implement designed to fire a specialized type of spear"
" using tension in a rubber band.  While highly effective when used "
"underwater, it is nearly useless on dry land."
msgstr "ゴムバンドの張力を使用して特殊な銛を発射するよう設計された水中漁用具。水中での使用には極めて有効だが、地上ではほとんど役に立たない。"

#: data/json/items/ranged/spearguns.json
msgid "double speargun"
msgid_plural "double spearguns"
msgstr[0] "二連ハープーン銃"

#: data/json/items/ranged/spearguns.json
msgid ""
"A double-loading underwater fishing implement designed to fire a specialized"
" type of spear using tension in a rubber band.  While highly effective when "
"used underwater, it is nearly useless on dry land."
msgstr ""
"ゴムバンドの張力を使用して特殊な銛を発射するよう設計された2連装の水中漁用具。水中での使用には極めて有効だが、地上ではほとんど役に立たない。"

#: data/json/items/ranged/throwing.json
msgid "bolas"
msgid_plural "bolases"
msgstr[0] "ボラ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'bolas', 'str_pl': 'bolases'}
#: data/json/items/ranged/throwing.json
msgid ""
"Some ropes with weights, designed to tangle the legs of a target when "
"thrown, usually at an animal.  Used by the Gauchos of Argentina."
msgstr ""
"重りが付いた複数のロープで構成された狩猟用具。投げつけることで、主に動物の足に絡みつかせて転倒させるよう設計されている。アルゼンチンのガウチョによって使用された。"

#: data/json/items/ranged/throwing.json src/artifact.cpp
msgid "disc"
msgid_plural "discs"
msgstr[0] "円盤"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'disc'}
#: data/json/items/ranged/throwing.json
msgid ""
"A plastic disc made for playing disc golf, it is smaller and denser then a "
"normal frisbee."
msgstr "ディスクゴルフ用のプラスチックディスク。一般的なフリスビーよりも小さく、密度が高い。"

#: data/json/items/ranged/throwing.json
msgid "frisbee"
msgid_plural "frisbees"
msgstr[0] "フリスビー"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'frisbee'}
#: data/json/items/ranged/throwing.json
msgid "A plastic frisbee made for outdoor games."
msgstr "屋外での遊びのために作られたプラスチック製のフリスビー。"

#: data/json/items/ranged/throwing.json
msgid "net"
msgid_plural "nets"
msgstr[0] "投網"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'net'}
#: data/json/items/ranged/throwing.json
msgid ""
"A mesh of string and weights, traditionally used to catch fish, and to "
"entangle opponents in combat."
msgstr "紐と重りで構成された網。伝統的に魚を捕獲したり、戦闘で敵を絡め取ったりするために使用される。"

#: data/json/items/ranged/throwing.json
msgid "lawn dart"
msgid_plural "lawn darts"
msgstr[0] "ローンダーツ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'lawn dart'}
#: data/json/items/ranged/throwing.json
msgid "A large plastic dart made for outdoor games."
msgstr "屋外での遊びのために作られた大きなプラスチック製のダーツ。"

#: data/json/items/ranged/throwing.json
msgid "throwing axe"
msgid_plural "throwing axes"
msgstr[0] "投斧"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'throwing axe'}
#: data/json/items/ranged/throwing.json
msgid ""
"A lightweight hatchet made for throwing.  Its ineffective cutting edge and "
"light weight makes it unsuitable for use as a tool."
msgstr "投擲のために作られた軽量の手斧。刃の切れ味が悪く、重量も軽いため、工具としては不適切だ。"

#: data/json/items/ranged/throwing.json
msgid "throwing knife"
msgid_plural "throwing knives"
msgstr[0] "投げナイフ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'throwing knife', 'str_pl': 'throwing knives'}
#: data/json/items/ranged/throwing.json
msgid ""
"A thin and flat knife made for throwing.  Its ineffective cutting edge and "
"odd shape makes it unsuitable for use as a tool."
msgstr "投擲のために作られた薄くて平たいナイフ。刃の切れ味が悪く、奇妙な形状をしているため、工具としては不適切だ。"

#: data/json/items/ranged/throwing.json
msgid "shuriken"
msgid_plural "shurikens"
msgstr[0] "手裏剣"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'shuriken'}
#: data/json/items/ranged/throwing.json
msgid ""
"A small throwing star.  Easy to store and quite light, but not very useful "
"for anything but throwing."
msgstr "小型の投擲用手裏剣。収納しやすく非常に軽量だが、投擲以外の用途ではほとんど役に立たない。"

#: data/json/items/ranged/throwing.json
msgid "throwing stick"
msgid_plural "throwing sticks"
msgstr[0] "投げ用棒"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'throwing stick'}
#: data/json/items/ranged/throwing.json
msgid ""
"A stick carved into a shape suitable for throwing at a target.  Not a "
"boomerang, so don't expect it to return to your hand."
msgstr "標的に向かって投擲しやすい形状に削られた棒。ブーメランではないため、手元に戻ってくることを期待しないように。"

#: data/json/items/resources/alien.json
msgid "alien resin chunk"
msgid_plural "alien resin chunks"
msgstr[0] "異星樹脂塊"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'alien resin chunk'}
#: data/json/items/resources/alien.json
msgid ""
"This is a shattered fragment of alien resin.  It looks a bit like a large "
"piece of sea glass, frosted and gritty with the edges rounded off.  It is "
"somewhat warm to the touch."
msgstr "破損した異星の樹脂の破片だ。曇っていてザラザラしており、縁が丸くなった大きなシーグラスのように見える。触るとわずかに温かい。"

#: data/json/items/resources/alien.json
msgid "alien resin pod"
msgid_plural "alien resin pods"
msgstr[0] "異星樹脂鞘"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'alien resin pod'}
#: data/json/items/resources/alien.json
msgid ""
"This is a large pod, the size of a keg, filled with gooey alien resin.  "
"Squeezing it firmly causes resin to squirt from the broken stalk at the end,"
" hardening within a few seconds of being exposed to the air."
msgstr ""
"小型の樽ほどの大きさの大きなさやで、粘着質の異星の樹脂が詰まっている。しっかりと握り込むと、折れた茎の先端から樹脂が噴出し、空気に触れると数秒以内に硬化する。"

#: data/json/items/resources/alien.json
msgid "alien storage pod"
msgid_plural "alien storage pods"
msgstr[0] "異星保管鞘"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'alien storage pod'}
#: data/json/items/resources/alien.json
msgid ""
"This is a large pod, filled with a thick gel obscuring its contents.  "
"Something is suspended in it, suggesting this is an alien container of some "
"sort.  Activate to tear it open and see what's inside."
msgstr ""
"厚いジェルで満たされており、中身が見えない大きなさや。何かが中に浮いていることから、何らかの異星の保管容器であることが示唆される。使用して引き裂き、中身を確認できる。"

#: data/json/items/resources/alien.json
msgid "alien organ pod"
msgid_plural "alien organ pods"
msgstr[0] "異星の臓器鞘"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'alien organ pod'}
#: data/json/items/resources/alien.json
msgid ""
"This is a large pod.  What appear to be human organs can be seen floating "
"instead, like some sort of morbid trophy.  Activate to tear it open and see "
"what's inside, if you really want to."
msgstr ""
"大きなさやだ。中には人間の臓器のように見えるものが、不気味なトロフィーのように浮いているのが見える。「使用」して引き裂き、中身を確認できる。本当にそうしたいのなら、だが。"

#: data/json/items/resources/chemicals.json
msgid "potassium alum"
msgid_plural "potassium alums"
msgstr[0] "硫酸アルミカリウム"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'potassium alum'}
#: data/json/items/resources/chemicals.json
msgid ""
"Small water-soluble white crystals with watery metallic odor, historically "
"used for many different purposes.  Also known as potash alum and potassium "
"aluminum sulfate; often called simply alum, as it's the most important "
"member of the generic class of compounds called alums."
msgstr ""
"水溶性の小さな白い結晶で、水っぽい金属臭がする。歴史的に様々な用途に使用されてきた。カリウムミョウバンや硫酸アルミニウムカリウムとしても知られ、ミョウバン類と呼ばれる一般的な化合物の中で最も重要であるため、単に「ミョウバン」と呼ばれることが多い。"

#: data/json/items/resources/chemicals.json
msgid "cloth dye powder"
msgid_plural "cloth dye powders"
msgstr[0] "衣料染め用の粉"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'cloth dye powder'}
#: data/json/items/resources/chemicals.json
msgid ""
"This is a powdered colorful cloth dye, which can be used to dye many fabrics"
" if combined with water and some mordant."
msgstr "粉末状の色鮮やかな布地染料。水と媒染剤と組み合わせることで、多くの繊維を染色できる。"

#: data/json/items/resources/glass.json
msgid "glass shard"
msgid_plural "glass shards"
msgstr[0] "ガラス片"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'glass shard'}
#: data/json/items/resources/glass.json
msgid ""
"A broken shard of glass covered in sharp edges.  With a piece of rag you "
"could use it to make it a primitive weapon."
msgstr "鋭い縁に覆われた割れたガラスの破片。ボロ布があれば、それを使って原始的な武器を作ることができる。"

#: data/json/items/resources/glass.json
msgid "sheet of glass"
msgid_plural "sheets of glass"
msgstr[0] "ガラス板"

#. ~ Use action done_message for {'str': 'sheet of glass', 'str_pl': 'sheets
#. of glass'}.
#: data/json/items/resources/glass.json
msgid ""
"You break the pane and place the shards on the ground, ready to be cracked "
"by something passing by."
msgstr "ガラス板を割り、通りかかる何かに踏まれて割れるように破片を地面に置いた。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'sheet of glass', 'str_pl': 'sheets of glass'}
#: data/json/items/resources/glass.json
msgid ""
"A large sheet of glass.  Easily shattered.  Useful for repairing windows."
msgstr "大きなガラス板。簡単に割れる。窓の修理に役立つ。"

#: data/json/items/resources/glass.json
msgid "sheet of reinforced glass"
msgid_plural "sheets of reinforced glass"
msgstr[0] "強化ガラス板"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'sheet of reinforced glass', 'str_pl': 'sheets of
#. reinforced glass'}
#: data/json/items/resources/glass.json
msgid "A large sheet of glass strengthened with steel wiring."
msgstr "鉄線で補強された大きなガラス板。"

#: data/json/items/resources/glass.json
msgid "pane of reinforced glass"
msgid_plural "panes of reinforced glass"
msgstr[0] "強化板ガラス"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'pane of reinforced glass', 'str_pl': 'panes of
#. reinforced glass'}
#: data/json/items/resources/glass.json
msgid "A small pane of glass strengthened with steel wiring."
msgstr "鉄線で補強された小型の板ガラス。"

#: data/json/items/resources/glass.json
msgid "sheet of tempered glass"
msgid_plural "sheets of tempered glass"
msgstr[0] "安全ガラス板"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'sheet of tempered glass', 'str_pl': 'sheets of
#. tempered glass'}
#: data/json/items/resources/glass.json
msgid ""
"A large, durable sheet of tempered glass, approximately six millimeters "
"thick.  A common type of safety glass with the curious property of breaking "
"into small, non-lethal pieces upon shattering."
msgstr ""
"厚さ約6mmの、大きく耐久性のある強化ガラス板。一般的な安全ガラスの一種であり、割れた際に小さく、非致死性の破片に砕けるという興味深い特性を持つ。"

#: data/json/items/resources/home_improvement.json
msgid "red paint"
msgid_plural "red paint"
msgstr[0] "赤色のペンキ"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'red paint'}
#: data/json/items/resources/home_improvement.json
msgid "A can of red paint."
msgstr "赤色のペンキが入った缶。"

#: data/json/items/resources/home_improvement.json
msgid "blue paint"
msgid_plural "blue paint"
msgstr[0] "青色のペンキ"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'blue paint'}
#: data/json/items/resources/home_improvement.json
msgid "A can of blue paint."
msgstr "青色のペンキが入った缶。"

#: data/json/items/resources/home_improvement.json
msgid "white paint"
msgid_plural "white paint"
msgstr[0] "白色のペンキ"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'white paint'}
#: data/json/items/resources/home_improvement.json
msgid "A can of white paint."
msgstr "白色のペンキが入った缶。"

#: data/json/items/resources/home_improvement.json
msgid "green paint"
msgid_plural "green paint"
msgstr[0] "緑色のペンキ"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'green paint'}
#: data/json/items/resources/home_improvement.json
msgid "A can of green paint."
msgstr "緑色のペンキが入った缶。"

#: data/json/items/resources/home_improvement.json
msgid "purple paint"
msgid_plural "purple paint"
msgstr[0] "紫色のペンキ"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'purple paint'}
#: data/json/items/resources/home_improvement.json
msgid "A can of purple paint."
msgstr "紫色のペンキが入った缶。"

#: data/json/items/resources/home_improvement.json
msgid "yellow paint"
msgid_plural "yellow paint"
msgstr[0] "黄色のペンキ"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'yellow paint'}
#: data/json/items/resources/home_improvement.json
msgid "A can of yellow paint."
msgstr "黄色のペンキが入った缶。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'red carpet'}
#: data/json/items/resources/home_improvement.json
msgid "A roll of red carpet."
msgstr "丸めて束ねられた赤色のカーペット。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'green carpet'}
#: data/json/items/resources/home_improvement.json
msgid "A roll of green carpet."
msgstr "丸めて束ねられた緑色のカーペット。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'yellow carpet'}
#: data/json/items/resources/home_improvement.json
msgid "A roll of yellow carpet."
msgstr "丸めて束ねられた黄色のカーペット。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'purple carpet'}
#: data/json/items/resources/home_improvement.json
msgid "A roll of purple carpet."
msgstr "丸めて束ねられた紫色のカーペット。"

#: data/json/items/resources/home_improvement.json
msgid "peephole"
msgid_plural "peepholes"
msgstr[0] "ドアスコープ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'peephole'}
#: data/json/items/resources/home_improvement.json
msgid ""
"A metal cylinder with a small lens inside intended to be installed on a "
"door."
msgstr "ドアに設置するための、小さなレンズが組み込まれた金属製の筒。"

#: data/json/items/resources/home_improvement.json
msgid "mesh screen"
msgid_plural "mesh screens"
msgstr[0] "防虫網"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'mesh screen'}
#: data/json/items/resources/home_improvement.json
msgid "A roll of fine mesh screen for bug barriers on porches."
msgstr "ポーチや縁側で虫の侵入を防ぐための、細かい網目のスクリーン。"

#: data/json/items/resources/metal.json
msgid "pipe"
msgid_plural "pipes"
msgstr[0] "パイプ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'pipe'}
#: data/json/items/resources/metal.json
msgid ""
"A steel pipe, makes a good melee weapon.  Useful in a few crafting recipes."
msgstr "優れた近接武器となる鉄製パイプ。いくつかの物品の製作に役立つ。"

#: data/json/items/resources/metal.json
#: data/mods/CheesyInnaWoodsFixes/items/ammo_casing.json
msgid "brass"
msgid_plural "brass"
msgstr[0] "黄銅"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'brass'}
#: data/json/items/resources/metal.json
msgid ""
"Some brass scraps, if you have the right tools they could be formed into "
"cartridge casings."
msgstr "黄銅の破片。適切な工具があれば、薬莢の作成に使用できる。"

#: data/json/items/resources/metal.json
msgid "scrap metal"
msgid_plural "scrap metals"
msgstr[0] "金属屑"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'scrap metal'}
#: data/json/items/resources/metal.json
msgid ""
"A bulky assortment of small bits of scrap steel useful in all kinds of "
"crafting."
msgstr "様々な種類の小さな鉄くずがかさばって寄せ集まったもの。あらゆる種類の製作に役立つ。"

#: data/json/items/resources/metal.json
#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
msgid "spike"
msgid_plural "spikes"
msgstr[0] "スパイク"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'spike'}
#: data/json/items/resources/metal.json
msgid ""
"A large and slightly misshapen spike, could do some damage mounted on a "
"vehicle."
msgstr "大きくて少し不格好なスパイク、車両に搭載すれば若干のダメージを与えられる。"

#: data/json/items/resources/metal.json
msgid "copper tubing"
msgid_plural "copper tubings"
msgstr[0] "銅管"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'copper tubing'}
#: data/json/items/resources/metal.json
msgid ""
"A copper tube, too thin to be much use as a melee weapon, but will do if "
"nothing else is available.  Useful in a few crafting recipes."
msgstr "銅製のパイプ。近接武器としてはあまりに細いが、他に選択肢がない場合には使える。いくつかの物品の製作に用いられる。"

#: data/json/items/resources/metal.json
msgid "aluminum ingot"
msgid_plural "aluminum ingots"
msgstr[0] "アルミニウム地金"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'aluminum ingot'}
#: data/json/items/resources/metal.json
msgid ""
"A small aluminum ingot, standardized for further processing.  Light but "
"durable, this could be cast into various shapes for construction or ground "
"down to a powder, for more… high-profile applications."
msgstr ""
"後続の工程で使用できるよう標準化された小型のアルミニウム地金。軽量で耐久性があるため、建築用にさまざまな形状に鋳造したり、粉末にしたりできる。…もっと目立つ用途にも使えるだろう。"

#: data/json/items/resources/metal.json
msgid "bismuth"
msgid_plural "bismuth"
msgstr[0] "ビスマス"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'bismuth'}
#: data/json/items/resources/metal.json
msgid "A dense but brittle metal often used as an alternative to lead."
msgstr "密度は高いがもろく、割れやすい金属。鉛の代替としてよく用いられる。"

#: data/json/items/resources/metal.json
msgid "gold"
msgid_plural "gold"
msgstr[0] "金"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'gold'}
#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'platinum'}
#: data/json/items/resources/metal.json
msgid ""
"A soft shiny metal.  Before the apocalypse this would've been worth a small "
"fortune but now its value is greatly diminished."
msgstr "柔らかく光沢のある金属。大災厄以前に手に入れていたなら幸運だったが、現在ではその価値は大きく下がっている。"

#: data/json/items/resources/metal.json
msgid "platinum"
msgid_plural "platinum"
msgstr[0] "白金"

#: data/json/items/resources/metal.json
msgid "zinc"
msgid_plural "zinc"
msgstr[0] "亜鉛"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'zinc'}
#: data/json/items/resources/metal.json
msgid ""
"A slightly brittle metal.  Apart from being an essential mineral that the "
"body needs, it reacts readily with acids, alkalis and other non-metals.  It "
"can be crushed to make zinc powder, used in the production of batteries, "
"among other things."
msgstr ""
"もろく折れやすい金属。人体に必須の鉱物質の一つであり、酸やアルカリ、他の非金属とよく反応する。バッテリーやその他製品の製作に使う亜鉛粉末を作るために粉砕できる。"

#: data/json/items/resources/metal.json
msgid "lead"
msgid_plural "lead"
msgstr[0] "鉛"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'lead'}
#: data/json/items/resources/metal.json
msgid ""
"A soft dull metal known since ancient times.  Due to its malleability it has"
" a wide variety of uses including the manufacture of ammunition."
msgstr "鈍い光沢を持つ金属で、古代から知られている。非常に柔らかく延性が高いため、弾薬の製造など幅広い用途に使える。"

#: data/json/items/resources/metal.json
msgid "magnesium powder"
msgid_plural "magnesium powder"
msgstr[0] "マグネシウム粉末"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'magnesium powder'}
#: data/json/items/resources/metal.json
msgid ""
"A gray powder composed of the highly flammable alkaline earth metal "
"magnesium.  Useful for constructing flares and similar items."
msgstr "可燃性のアルカリ土類金属であるマグネシウムから作られた灰色の粉末。信号弾や類似の道具の製作に役立つ。"

#: data/json/items/resources/metal.json
msgid "silver"
msgid_plural "silver"
msgstr[0] "銀"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'silver'}
#: data/json/items/resources/metal.json
msgid ""
"A soft shiny metal.  Before the Cataclysm it was worth quite a bit but its "
"value is now greatly diminished."
msgstr "柔らかく光沢のある金属。大災厄以前はかなりの価値があったが、現在ではその価値は大きく下がっている。"

#: data/json/items/resources/metal.json
msgid "small metal sheet"
msgid_plural "small metal sheets"
msgstr[0] "小型金属板"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'small metal sheet'}
#: data/json/items/resources/metal.json
msgid "A small sheet of metal."
msgstr "小さな金属製の板。"

#: data/json/items/resources/metal.json
msgid "chunk of steel"
msgid_plural "chunks of steel"
msgstr[0] "鋼鉄の破片"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'chunk of steel', 'str_pl': 'chunks of steel'}
#: data/json/items/resources/metal.json
msgid ""
"A misshapen chunk of steel.  Makes a decent weapon in a pinch, and is also "
"useful for some crafting recipes."
msgstr "不格好な鋼鉄の塊。緊急時にはそれなりの武器となり、いくつかの製作レシピに役立つ。"

#: data/json/items/resources/metal.json
msgid "lump of steel"
msgid_plural "lumps of steel"
msgstr[0] "鋼鉄の塊"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'lump of steel', 'str_pl': 'lumps of steel'}
#: data/json/items/resources/metal.json
msgid "A heavy formed piece of steel.  Useful for some crafting recipes."
msgstr "重い鋼鉄の塊。物品の製作に使用される。"

#: data/json/items/resources/metal.json
msgid "door hinge"
msgid_plural "door hinges"
msgstr[0] "ドアヒンジ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'door hinge'}
#: data/json/items/resources/metal.json
msgid ""
"A small metal hinge with two metal plates with screw holes.  Useful for "
"making doors."
msgstr "ねじ穴と二枚の金属板からなる小型の金属製ヒンジ。ドアの製作に使用される。"

#: data/json/items/resources/metal.json
msgid "scrap copper"
msgid_plural "scrap copper"
msgstr[0] "銅の破片"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'scrap copper'}
#: data/json/items/resources/metal.json
msgid "A small chunk of copper, usable for crafting or repairs."
msgstr "小さな銅の欠片。製作や修理に使える。"

#: data/json/items/resources/metal.json
msgid "tin"
msgid_plural "tin"
msgstr[0] "スズ"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'tin'}
#: data/json/items/resources/metal.json
msgid ""
"Tin can be used to make solder and for lining containers to prevent "
"corrosion."
msgstr "スズははんだの製造や、容器の内張りとして腐食を防ぐために利用される。"

#: data/json/items/resources/metal.json
msgid "solder"
msgid_plural "solder"
msgstr[0] "はんだ"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'solder'}
#: data/json/items/resources/metal.json
msgid ""
"A small spool of solder, able to be used in ammunition and electronics."
msgstr "小さなはんだのスプールで、弾薬や電子機器の製作に利用できる。"

#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid "bee sting"
msgid_plural "bee stings"
msgstr[0] "ミツバチの針"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'bee sting'}
#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid "A six-inch stinger from a giant bee.  Makes a mediocre melee weapon."
msgstr "巨大蜜蜂から得られた15cmほどの針。並の近接武器として使える。"

#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid "broom"
msgid_plural "brooms"
msgstr[0] "ほうき"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'broom'}
#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid ""
"A long-handled broom.  Makes a terrible weapon unless you're chasing cats."
msgstr "柄の長いほうき。猫を追い払う以外の目的では、優れた武器とは言えない。"

#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid "ceramic shard"
msgid_plural "ceramic shards"
msgstr[0] "セラミック片"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'ceramic shard'}
#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid ""
"A broken ceramic shard.  It is heavy and has a somewhat sharp edge, but it's"
" too irregular to cut properly."
msgstr "セラミックの破片。重みがあり、鋭利な角を持っているが、何かを切るために使える程ではない。"

#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid "fungal fighter sting"
msgid_plural "fungal fighter stings"
msgstr[0] "菌人戦士のトゲ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'fungal fighter sting'}
#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid "A short dart from a fungal fighter.  Makes a poor melee weapon."
msgstr "菌人戦士から得られた短いダート。劣悪な近接武器にしかならない。"

#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid "incendiary"
msgid_plural "incendiaries"
msgstr[0] "焼夷剤"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'incendiary', 'str_pl': 'incendiaries'}
#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid ""
"Material from an incendiary round, useful in constructing incendiary "
"ammunition."
msgstr "焼夷弾の素材であり、燃焼する弾薬を作る際に役立つ。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'mattress', 'str_pl': 'mattresses'}
#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid "This is a single, or twin, sized mattress."
msgstr "シングルかツインサイズのマットレス。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'down mattress', 'str_pl': 'down mattresses'}
#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid "This is a single, or twin, sized down filled mattress."
msgstr "シングルかツインサイズの、羽毛が入ったマットレス。"

#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid "fuse"
msgid_plural "fuse"
msgstr[0] "導火線"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'fuse'}
#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid ""
"A piece of fuse, long enough to give you enough time to get away from most "
"explosions."
msgstr "導火線の一部。ほとんどの爆発物が爆発する前に、逃げられる程度の長さがある。"

#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid "sharp rock"
msgid_plural "sharp rocks"
msgstr[0] "鋭利な石"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'sharp rock'}
#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid ""
"A rock with sharp edges, that can be used as a butchering tool, if nothing "
"else is available.  Makes a passable melee weapon."
msgstr "鋭く尖った石。他に何も利用できない場合、屠殺用具として使用できる。そこそこの近接武器にもなる。"

#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid "grenade launcher buttstock"
msgid_plural "grenade launcher buttstocks"
msgstr[0] "グレネードランチャー用ストック"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'grenade launcher buttstock'}
#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid ""
"A collapsible buttstock designed for the M320 grenade launcher.  When "
"combined with this stock, the M320 can be used as a standalone weapon"
msgstr "M320グレネードランチャー用の折りたたみ式バットストック。これを組み合わせることで、M320を単独の武器として使用できる。"

#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid "wasp sting"
msgid_plural "wasp stings"
msgstr[0] "スズメバチの針"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'wasp sting'}
#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid "A six-inch stinger from a giant wasp.  Makes a poor melee weapon."
msgstr "巨大スズメバチから得られた約15cmの針。劣悪な近接武器にしかならない。"

#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid "unpacked cannon shell"
msgid_plural "unpacked cannon shells"
msgstr[0] "大砲用未完成砲弾"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'unpacked cannon shell'}
#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid ""
"A metal case tightly packed with gunpowder and an impact fuse.  With some "
"gunpowder, wadding, and a fuse, it could be prepared to load into a cannon."
msgstr "火薬と着発信管を金属外装でしっかり包んだもの。火薬、充填材、導火線があれば大砲に装填できる。"

#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid "cannonball"
msgid_plural "cannonballs"
msgstr[0] "大砲の玉"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'cannonball'}
#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid ""
"A four-pound, cast-iron cannonball.  With some gunpowder, wadding, and a "
"fuse, it could be prepared to load into a cannon."
msgstr "4ポンドの鋳鉄製大砲の玉。火薬、充填材、導火線があれば大砲に装填できる。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'wool mattress', 'str_pl': 'wool mattresses'}
#: data/json/items/resources/misc.json
msgid "A mattress made of wool.  It is quite soft and comfortable."
msgstr "ウールのマットレス。かなり柔らかく、快適だ。"

#: data/json/items/resources/plastic.json
msgid "plastic chunk"
msgid_plural "plastic chunks"
msgstr[0] "プラスチック片"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'plastic chunk'}
#: data/json/items/resources/plastic.json
msgid ""
"This is a piece of plastic.  It could be used to fabricate, repair, or "
"reinforce plastic items."
msgstr "プラスチックの破片。プラスチック製品の製作、修理、強化に使用できる。"

#: data/json/items/resources/plastic.json
msgid "carbon fiber filament"
msgid_plural "carbon fiber filament"
msgstr[0] "カーボンファイバー フィラメント"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'carbon fiber filament'}
#: data/json/items/resources/plastic.json
msgid ""
"A spool of fine carbon filament, used to make lightweight yet strong items."
"  Very useful if you can get your hands on a 3D printer, more advanced "
"models might even allow you to make more."
msgstr ""
"軽量で頑丈な物品の製作に用いられる、細いカーボンフィラメントのスプール。3Dプリンターがあれば非常に有用で、高度なモデルを持っている場合はさらに多くのものを製作できる可能性がある。"

#: data/json/items/resources/plastic.json
msgid "synthetic fabric"
msgid_plural "synthetic fabric"
msgstr[0] "合成繊維"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'synthetic fabric'}
#: data/json/items/resources/plastic.json
msgid ""
"This is small bolt of synthetic fabric.  Unlike you and other natural "
"materials, it won't degrade much with age.  Maybe that's less of a bad thing"
" now."
msgstr "合成繊維の端切れ。人間や天然素材と異なり、時間の経過によって大きく劣化しない。この時代においては、むしろ利点だろう。"

#: data/json/items/resources/plastic.json
msgid "plastic sheet"
msgid_plural "plastic sheets"
msgstr[0] "プラスチック板"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'plastic sheet'}
#: data/json/items/resources/plastic.json
msgid ""
"This is a large sheet of heavy flexible plastic, the sort that might have "
"been used for commercial wrapping or for weather-sealing a home."
msgstr "重みがあり、柔軟で幅広いプラスチック板。商業用の包装材や、家の防水処理に使われていた可能性がある。"

#: data/json/items/resources/plastic.json
msgid "rigid plastic sheet"
msgid_plural "rigid plastic sheets"
msgstr[0] "硬化プラスチック板"

#. ~ Description for rigid plastic sheet
#: data/json/items/resources/plastic.json
msgid ""
"A large, rigid sheet of translucent plastic, useful for all manner of "
"things; from construction to art, or even junior snowboarding."
msgstr "大きくて半透明のプラスチック板。建築から芸術まで、さまざまな用途に役立つ。子供用のスノーボードとしても使える。"

#: data/json/items/resources/plastic.json
msgid "plastic scrap"
msgid_plural "plastic scraps"
msgstr[0] "プラスチック残骸"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'plastic scrap'}
#: data/json/items/resources/plastic.json
msgid ""
"This is a tiny piece of plastic.  Useless on its own, but could be melted "
"down if you gather enough."
msgstr "小さなプラスチックの破片。それ自体には何の役にも立たないが、十分な量を集めれば溶かして他の物品を製作できる。"

#: data/json/items/resources/wood.json
msgid "log"
msgid_plural "logs"
msgstr[0] "丸太"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'log'}
#: data/json/items/resources/wood.json
msgid ""
"A large chunk of log, cut from a tree.  (a)ctivate a wood axe or wood saw to"
" cut it into planks."
msgstr "木を伐採して切り出した大きな丸太。[aキー]で斧や製材のこぎりを使って板に加工できる。"

#: data/json/items/resources/wood.json
msgid "splintered wood"
msgid_plural "splintered wood"
msgstr[0] "割れた木"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'splintered wood'}
#: data/json/items/resources/wood.json
msgid "A splintered piece of wood, could be used as a skewer or for kindling."
msgstr "ささくれだった木の破片。串として使うか、着火材として利用できる。"

#: data/json/items/resources/wood.json
msgid "heavy stick"
msgid_plural "heavy sticks"
msgstr[0] "重い棒"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'heavy stick'}
#: data/json/items/resources/wood.json
msgid "A sturdy, heavy stick.  Makes a decent melee weapon."
msgstr "堅く、重みのある棒。そこそこの近接武器になる。"

#: data/json/items/resources/wood.json
msgid "long stick"
msgid_plural "long sticks"
msgstr[0] "長い棒"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'long stick'}
#: data/json/items/resources/wood.json
msgid ""
"A long stick.  Makes a decent melee weapon, and can be broken into heavy "
"sticks for crafting."
msgstr "長い棒。そこそこの近接武器となり、製作のために重い棒に分解できる。"

#: data/json/items/resources/wood.json
msgid "long pole"
msgid_plural "long poles"
msgstr[0] "長竿"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'long pole'}
#: data/json/items/resources/wood.json
msgid ""
"A stout, ten-foot pole.  Could be used similarly to a spear.  The Cataclysm "
"gives fresh meaning to walking softly and carrying a big stick."
msgstr "頑丈な10フィートの長さの竿。槍のように使用できる。大災厄は、「大きな棒を手に静かに歩く」という格言に新たな意味を与えた。"

#: data/json/items/resources/wood.json src/crafting_gui.cpp
msgid "plank"
msgid_plural "planks"
msgstr[0] "板材"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'plank'}
#: data/json/items/resources/wood.json
msgid ""
"A narrow, thick plank of wood, like a 2 by 4 or similar piece of dimensional"
" lumber.  Makes a decent melee weapon, and can be used for all kinds "
"construction."
msgstr "断面が2x4インチまたは類似の寸法の、狭く厚みのある木製の板。適当な近接武器としても使えるほか、あらゆる種類の建設に利用できる。"

#: data/json/items/resources/wood.json
msgid "heavy wooden beam"
msgid_plural "heavy wooden beams"
msgstr[0] "重木柱"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'heavy wooden beam'}
#: data/json/items/resources/wood.json
msgid ""
"An enormous beam of solid wood, very heavy and hard to lug around, but also "
"very sturdy for construction.  You could saw or chop it into smaller pieces,"
" like planks or panels."
msgstr "非常に重く運搬が困難な巨大な無垢材の梁。建築用としては極めて堅牢だ。板材や木板などのより小さな部材に切断または製材することが可能。"

#: data/json/items/resources/wood.json
msgid "wooden panel"
msgid_plural "wooden panels"
msgstr[0] "木板"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'wooden panel'}
#: data/json/items/resources/wood.json
msgid ""
"A wide, thin wooden board - plywood, OSB, MDF, tongue-in-groove boards, or "
"similar, already cut to shape.  These large flat boards are good for all "
"kinds of construction, but for really big projects you'd need a proper sheet"
" of uncut plywood or the like."
msgstr ""
"広く薄く裁断された木の板。ベニヤ板、OSB合板、MDF合板、指接ぎ板など。用途に応じて所定の形状にカットされている。広く平らなため、あらゆる種類の建築工事に使用できるが、大規模なプロジェクトでは、未裁断のベニヤ板などの木材が必要になる場合もある。"

#: data/json/items/resources/wood.json
msgid "large wooden sheet"
msgid_plural "large wooden sheets"
msgstr[0] "大型木製シート"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'large wooden sheet'}
#: data/json/items/resources/wood.json
msgid ""
"A standard 4x8 sheet of flat wood - usually plywood, OSB, or MDF.  Heavy and"
" bulky, this is extremely useful for all manner of construction, but you "
"might have to cut it to size before doing smaller projects."
msgstr ""
"4x8フィートの標準サイズの木製シート。一般的にはベニヤ板、OSB合板、MDF合板が該当する。重く、かさばるが、あらゆる種類の建築工事に非常に役立つ。ただし、小規模なプロジェクトで使う場合は、サイズに合わせて再裁断が必要な場合がある。"

#: data/json/items/resources/wood.json
msgid "fuel briquette"
msgid_plural "fuel briquettes"
msgstr[0] "ブリケット燃料"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'fuel briquette'}
#: data/json/items/resources/wood.json
msgid ""
"A hunk of dried plant matter condensed into a puck, then dried.  It burns "
"well."
msgstr "大量の植物性物質を乾燥させ、大きな塊に圧縮して再び乾燥させた燃料。火が付きやすく、よく燃える。"

#: data/json/items/tool/container.json
msgid "steel bottle"
msgid_plural "steel bottles"
msgstr[0] "ステンレス水筒"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'steel bottle'}
#: data/json/items/tool/container.json
msgid "A stainless steel water bottle, holds 750ml of liquid."
msgstr "ステンレス製の水筒。750mlの液体を収納できる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/container.json
msgid "foldable plastic bottle"
msgid_plural "foldable plastic bottles"
msgstr[0] "携帯ボトル"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'foldable plastic bottle'}
#: data/json/items/tool/container.json
msgid "A non-rigid plastic bottle for easy storage, holds 500 ml of liquid."
msgstr "収納が容易な柔らかいプラスチック製のボトル。500mlの液体を収納できる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "atomic coffee maker"
msgid_plural "atomic coffee makers"
msgstr[0] "アトミック コーヒーメーカー"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'atomic coffee maker'}
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid ""
"This is a Curie-G coffeemaker, by CuppaTech.  It famously uses a radioactive"
" generator to heat water for coffee.  Normally the water is heated using "
"energy stored in a capacitor, and makes ordinary coffee.  However, as a "
"special feature, water from the RTG containment area can be used, giving the"
" coffee a very special kick.  The Curie-G is illegal in most countries."
msgstr ""
"これは、CuppaTech社製のキュリー-"
"Gコーヒーメーカーだ。コーヒー用の湯を加熱するのに原子力電池を使用することで知られている。通常、水は蓄電器に蓄えられたエネルギーで温められ、普通のコーヒーを作る。しかし、特別な機能として、RTG収納部から供給された水を使うことで、コーヒーに非常に特別な刺激を加えることができる。キュリー-"
"Gは、ほとんどの国で違法である。"

#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "butchering kit"
msgid_plural "butchering kits"
msgstr[0] "食肉解体キット"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'butchering kit'}
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid ""
"This is a kit containing all the specialized knives you need to debone, "
"skin, and prepare cuts of meat from an animal."
msgstr "動物から骨を外し、皮を剥ぎ、肉を切り分けるのに必要な、複数の専用ナイフをまとめたキット。"

#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "pseudo butter churn"
msgid_plural "pseudo butter churns"
msgstr[0] "偽バター製造機"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'pseudo butter churn'}
#. ~ Description for {'str': 'deployed atomic butter churn'}
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "This is a crafting_pseudo_item if you have it something is wrong."
msgstr "これは製作中の一時的なアイテムだ。もしお前がこれを所持しているなら、システム上の問題が発生している。"

#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "deployed atomic butter churn"
msgid_plural "deployed atomic butter churns"
msgstr[0] "展開された原子力バター製造機"

#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "can sealer"
msgid_plural "can sealers"
msgstr[0] "缶詰密封機"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'can sealer'}
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid ""
"A hand crank powered cast steel machine designed to automatically seal tin "
"cans."
msgstr "スチール製の手動クランク式機械。スチール製の缶を自動的に密封するように設計されている。"

#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "electric carver (off)"
msgid_plural "electric carvers (off)"
msgstr[0] "電動ナイフ [停止中]"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'electric carver (off)', 'str_pl': 'electric
#. carvers (off)'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "You turn on the electric carver."
msgstr "電動ナイフの電源を入れた。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'electric carver (off)', 'str_pl': 'electric
#. carvers (off)'}
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid ""
"An electric meat carver powered by batteries.  Two serrated blades that "
"vibrate together to slice just about anything from turkey to ham… even "
"zombies!"
msgstr ""
"電池駆動式の電動肉切りナイフだ。2つののこぎり状の刃が同時に振動することで、大抵の物は七面鳥をハムのようにスライスできる......もちろんゾンビも！"

#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "electric carver (on)"
msgid_plural "electric carvers (on)"
msgstr[0] "電動ナイフ [作動中]"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'electric carver (on)', 'str_pl': 'electric
#. carvers (on)'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "You turn off the electric carver."
msgstr "電動包丁の電源を切った。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'electric carver (on)', 'str_pl': 'electric
#. carvers (on)'}
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "This carver is on and the blades are buzzing.  Use it to turn it off."
msgstr "電動包丁は現在オンの状態で、刃が唸っている。使用すると電源が切れる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "charcoal water purifier"
msgid_plural "charcoal water purifiers"
msgstr[0] "木炭フィルター式浄水器"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'charcoal water purifier'}
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid ""
"Using this item on a container full of water will purify the water using "
"layered charcoal.  Once the charcoal has purified enough water, it will "
"become unusable and can be disassembled and recycled.  Water taken from "
"uncertain sources like a river may be dirty."
msgstr ""
"水の入った容器に使用すると、水が活性炭層を通過して浄化される。活性炭は一定量の水を浄化すると消耗し、それ以上は使用できなくなる。その場合は分解またはリサイクルが可能。川など出所のはっきりしない水源の水は汚染されている可能性がある。"

#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "charcoal smoker"
msgid_plural "charcoal smokers"
msgstr[0] "活性木炭グリル"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'charcoal smoker'}
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid ""
"This is a portable charcoal smoker.  Good for weekend barbecuing and "
"preserving meat with smoke."
msgstr "携帯用の木炭火グリル。週末のバーベキューに最適で、肉を燻製して保存することもできる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "charcoal cooker"
msgid_plural "charcoal cookers"
msgstr[0] "木炭火クッカー"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'charcoal cooker'}
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid ""
"This is a little metal tank for holding charcoal with a pilot light "
"attached.  You could use it for cooking food."
msgstr "極小の金属タンクに木炭を詰め、着火装置を付けたもの。調理用として使える。"

#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "clay pot"
msgid_plural "clay pots"
msgstr[0] "粘土鍋"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'clay pot'}
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "A crude clay pot with lid used for cooking."
msgstr "蓋付きの粗い粘土製鍋。調理に使用される。"

#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "clay quern"
msgid_plural "clay querns"
msgstr[0] "粘土製の手挽き臼"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'clay quern'}
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "This is a simple hand-powered clay quern for grinding grain."
msgstr "穀物を挽くのに使われるシンプルな手動式のミル。"

#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "clay teapot"
msgid_plural "clay teapots"
msgstr[0] "粘土製の急須"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'clay teapot'}
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "A clay teapot.  Now all you need is tea and water."
msgstr "粘土製のティーポット。後は茶葉と水さえあればよい。"

#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "coffeemaker"
msgid_plural "coffeemakers"
msgstr[0] "コーヒーメーカー"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'coffeemaker'}
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid ""
"This is a heating element with pot and frame for holding coffee or other "
"powders.  It's got a battery compartment for use when the power goes out.  "
"You can use it to make coffee, or other drinks if you so choose."
msgstr ""
"発熱体付きの鍋に、コーヒー粉を載せるためのフレームが取り付けられている。停電時にはバッテリーで動作する。コーヒーを淹れるのに使うほか、必要であれば他の飲み物も作れる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "food dehydrator"
msgid_plural "food dehydrators"
msgstr[0] "食品乾燥機"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'food dehydrator'}
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid ""
"This is a portable electric food dehydrator.  It's powered by batteries, and"
" could be invaluable in preserving food."
msgstr "携帯用の食品乾燥機。バッテリー駆動で、食品の保存に非常に役立つ。"

#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "fermenting eggs jar"
msgid_plural "fermenting eggs jars"
msgstr[0] "発酵中の卵のガラス瓶"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'fermenting eggs jar'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid ""
"You examine the batch and see that the pickling solution has done its job, "
"so you seal the jar up for storage."
msgstr "漬け込み液が役目を果たしたことを確認し、保存のために瓶を密封した。"

#. ~ Use action not_ready_msg for {'str': 'fermenting eggs jar'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "The eggs are not done yet."
msgstr "卵はまだ発酵していない。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'fermenting eggs jar'}
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid ""
"This jar contains a batch of eggs in a pickling solution.  You can seal up "
"the jar once the process is completed."
msgstr "この瓶には、漬け込み液に浸された卵が入っている。プロセスが完了すれば、瓶を密封して保存できる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "hexamine stove"
msgid_plural "hexamine stoves"
msgstr[0] "ヘキサミン調理器具"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'hexamine stove'}
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid ""
"Known as an Esbit stove, this is a lightweight, folding stove designed to "
"use small hexamine tablets for cooking."
msgstr "エスビットストーブとも呼ばれる、この軽量折りたたみ式ストーブは、ヘキサミンの固形燃料を使うよう設計されている。"

#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "small sealed yeast culture"
msgid_plural "small sealed yeast culture"
msgstr[0] "密封された小型イースト培養器"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str_sp': 'small sealed yeast culture'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "You open the flask and harvest the culture."
msgstr "フラスコを開け、培養物を収穫した。"

#. ~ Use action not_ready_msg for {'str_sp': 'small sealed yeast culture'}.
#. ~ Use action not_ready_msg for {'str_sp': 'sealed yeast culture'}.
#. ~ Use action not_ready_msg for {'str_sp': 'large sealed yeast culture'}.
#. ~ Use action not_ready_msg for {'str_sp': 'sealed wild yeast culture'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "The yeast isn't done culturing yet."
msgstr "イーストがまだ十分に培養されていない。"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'small sealed yeast culture'}
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid ""
"A sealed flask holding sanitized yeast wort.  You may harvest the yeast "
"inside when it's done culturing."
msgstr "殺菌済みのイースト麦汁を密封したフラスコ。培養が完了すればイーストを収穫できる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "sealed yeast culture"
msgid_plural "sealed yeast culture"
msgstr[0] "密封されたイースト培養器"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str_sp': 'sealed yeast culture'}.
#. ~ Use action msg for {'str_sp': 'large sealed yeast culture'}.
#. ~ Use action msg for {'str_sp': 'sealed wild yeast culture'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "You open the jar and harvest the culture."
msgstr "容器を開けて、培養物を収穫した。"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'sealed yeast culture'}
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid ""
"A sealed jar holding sanitized yeast wort.  You may harvest the yeast inside"
" when it's done culturing."
msgstr "殺菌済みのイースト麦汁を密封した容器。培養が完了すればイーストを収穫できる。"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str_sp': 'sealed yeast culture'}.
#. ~ Use action msg for {'str_sp': 'sealed wild yeast culture'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "You remove the lid from the bowl and harvest the culture."
msgstr "ボウルの蓋を外して、培養物を収穫した。"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'sealed yeast culture'}
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid ""
"A sealed clay bowl holding sanitized yeast wort.  You may harvest the yeast "
"inside when it's done culturing."
msgstr "殺菌済みのイースト麦汁を密封した粘土製のボウル。培養が完了すればイーストを収穫できる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "large sealed yeast culture"
msgid_plural "large sealed yeast culture"
msgstr[0] "密封された大型イースト培養器"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'large sealed yeast culture'}
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid ""
"A sealed 3L glass jar holding sanitized yeast wort.  You may harvest the "
"yeast inside when it's done culturing."
msgstr "殺菌済みのイースト麦汁を密封した3Lガラス瓶。培養が完了すればイーストを収穫できる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "sealed wild yeast culture"
msgid_plural "sealed wild yeast culture"
msgstr[0] "密封された野生イースト培養器"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'sealed wild yeast culture'}
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid ""
"Mixture of water, sugar and fruits with some naturally occurring yeast, that"
" will eventually produce a more sizable yeast culture."
msgstr "水、砂糖、果物、および自然に付着したイーストの混合物。まもなく大量のイースト培養物が生成されるだろう。"

#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "food processor"
msgid_plural "food processors"
msgstr[0] "フードプロセッサー"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'food processor'}
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid ""
"This is a kitchen appliance capable of slicing, chopping, shredding, "
"grinding, pureeing and mixing."
msgstr "スライス、みじん切り、細断、粉砕、ピューレ化、混合が可能な調理器具。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'soda machine'}
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "This is a kitchen appliance capable of creating carbonated beverages."
msgstr "炭酸飲料を作れる調理器具。"

#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "atomic soda machine"
msgid_plural "atomic soda machines"
msgstr[0] "原子力ソーダマシン"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'atomic soda machine'}
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid ""
"This is a Curie-G soda machine, a follow-up to the infamous coffeepot by "
"CuppaTech.  It uses the same miniature RTG core to chill and carbonate "
"beverages.  Normally, it dispenses standard fizzy drinks using stored CO₂ "
"and coolant, but with a twist of the dial, it can cycle irradiated "
"condensation from the RTG chamber into the mix.  Like its predecessor, the "
"atomic soda machine is banned in most regions."
msgstr ""
"CuppaTech社の悪名高いコーヒーメーカーの後継機、キュリー-"
"Gソーダマシンだ。同じ小型RTG炉心を使って飲料を冷却し、炭酸を注入する。通常は貯蔵されたCO₂と冷媒を使って標準的な炭酸飲料を出すが、ダイヤルをひねれば、RTGチャンバーから放射能汚染された結露水をミックスに循環させられる。先代と同様、この原子力ソーダマシンはほとんどの地域で禁止されている。"

#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "camping stove"
msgid_plural "camping stoves"
msgstr[0] "キャンプ用ストーブ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'camping stove'}
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid ""
"This is a simple burner powered by pressurized fuel, such as butane or "
"gasoline.  It is designed for cooking food."
msgstr "これは、ブタンやガソリンなどの加圧燃料で動く 単純なバーナーだ。食べ物を調理するために設計されている。"

#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "heat pack"
msgid_plural "heat packs"
msgstr[0] "発熱パック"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'heat pack'}
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid ""
"This is a chemical heat pack.  It's used to treat sports injuries and heat "
"food.  It is usable only once."
msgstr "化学反応によって熱を発する発熱パック。運動中の怪我の治療や、食料の加熱に使う。一度だけ使用可能な使い捨て品。"

#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "hotplate"
msgid_plural "hotplates"
msgstr[0] "ホットプレート"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'hotplate'}
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid ""
"This is a small heating element on a stand, powered by batteries.  It is "
"indispensable for cooking and chemistry.  Try not to burn yourself."
msgstr "台の上に小型の発熱体を載せたもの。バッテリー駆動で、調理や化学作業に不可欠。自分自身を加熱しようとしないこと。"

#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "atompot"
msgid_plural "atompots"
msgstr[0] "アトミックポット"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'atompot'}
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid ""
"Rivtech's premiere self-heating kitchen appliance, complete with lid, hand-"
"crafted with the power of the atom to reach any temperature in thirty "
"seconds.  As bulky as it is, its plutonium power source means that it can be"
" used to cook an absurd amount of meals without ever worrying about running "
"low on power.  Unsurprisingly, sales weren't particularly good because of "
"the prospect of irradiating your food, but internal shielding ensures that "
"only trace amounts find its way into the center."
msgstr ""
"Rivtech社の最高級自己発熱調理器具。蓋付きで、原子力の力で手作りされ、30秒以内に任意の温度に達する。かさばるが、プルトニウムを動力源としているため、電力切れの心配なく途方もない量の食事を調理できる。調理した食品が放射能汚染されるという懸念から、売れ行きが芳しくなかったのは当然だ。しかし内部の遮蔽により、食品に影響を及ぼす放射能は極めて微量にとどまる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "sealed jar of eggs"
msgid_plural "sealed jars of eggs"
msgstr[0] "卵入りの密封ガラス瓶"

#. ~ Use action menu_text for {'str': 'sealed jar of eggs', 'str_pl': 'sealed
#. jars of eggs'}.
#. ~ Use action menu_text for {'str': 'sealed jar of pickles', 'str_pl':
#. 'sealed jars of pickles'}.
#. ~ Use action menu_text for {'str': 'sealed jar of sauerkraut', 'str_pl':
#. 'sealed jars of sauerkraut'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "Open jar"
msgstr "瓶を開ける"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'sealed jar of eggs', 'str_pl': 'sealed jars
#. of eggs'}.
#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'sealed jar of pickles', 'str_pl': 'sealed
#. jars of pickles'}.
#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'sealed jar of sauerkraut', 'str_pl': 'sealed
#. jars of sauerkraut'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "You open the jar, exposing it to the atmosphere."
msgstr "瓶のふたを開け、大気に露出させた。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'sealed jar of eggs', 'str_pl': 'sealed jars of
#. eggs'}
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid ""
"This is a sealed glass jar containing pickled eggs.  Use to open and eat to "
"enjoy."
msgstr "ピクルス卵を密封したガラス瓶。使用時は密封を剥がして食べられる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "sealed jar of pickles"
msgid_plural "sealed jars of pickles"
msgstr[0] "ピクルス入りの密封ガラス瓶"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'sealed jar of pickles', 'str_pl': 'sealed jars
#. of pickles'}
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid ""
"This is a sealed glass jar containing pickles.  Use to open and eat to "
"enjoy."
msgstr "ピクルスを入れて密封したガラス瓶。使用時は密封を剥がして食べられる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "sealed jar of sauerkraut"
msgid_plural "sealed jars of sauerkraut"
msgstr[0] "ザワークラウト入りの密封ガラス瓶"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'sealed jar of sauerkraut', 'str_pl': 'sealed
#. jars of sauerkraut'}
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid ""
"This is a sealed glass jar containing sauerkraut.  Use to open and eat to "
"enjoy."
msgstr "ザワークラウトを入れて密封したガラス瓶。使用時は密封を剥がして食べられる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "makeshift vacuum sealer"
msgid_plural "makeshift vacuum sealers"
msgstr[0] "簡易真空パック機"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'makeshift vacuum sealer'}
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid ""
"This is a homemade heat sealer unit with an air pump.  It's used for vacuum "
"packing food to preserve it."
msgstr "空気ポンプ付きの自作ヒートシーラーユニット。食品を真空パックして長期保存するために使われる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "mess kit"
msgid_plural "mess kits"
msgstr[0] "携帯用食器セット"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'mess kit'}
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid ""
"A self-contained camping mess kit, containing everything you might need for "
"wilderness cooking.  This model relies on a battery-operated hotplate, "
"rather than the more commonplace chemical-fueled butane and Esbit stoves."
msgstr ""
"野外での調理に必要な全てが含まれた "
"自己完結型のキャンプ用メスキット。このモデルは、より一般的な化学燃料のブタンやエスビットストーブとは異なり、バッテリー駆動のホットプレートに依存している。"

#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "mess tin"
msgid_plural "mess tins"
msgstr[0] "飯盒"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'mess tin'}
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid ""
"A compact military-style pan and tray, designed for heating food over a fire"
" or portable stove.  It is shallower than a proper pot or pan, and lacks the"
" integrated heating elements modern mess kits have."
msgstr ""
"火や携帯用バーナーで食事を温めるための、軍仕様のコンパクトな皿とトレー。通常の鍋やフライパンより浅く、現代のメスキットに内蔵されているような加熱装置はない。"

#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "military mess kit"
msgid_plural "military mess kits"
msgstr[0] "携帯用食器セット(軍式)"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'military mess kit'}
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid ""
"Military mess kit designed for long-range reconnaissance patrols deployed "
"behind enemy lines.  All parts are made from thin sheet of aluminum / "
"superalloy composite and are insulated with ceramic coating.  Relies on a "
"battery-operated hotplate, rather than the smoke-producing chemical-fueled "
"Esbit stove.  Compact, durable and lightweight."
msgstr ""
"敵陣の背後に展開し長期的な偵察斥候をするための軍事用携帯食器セット。すべての部品がアルミニウムと超合金製の薄いシートから作られており、表面はセラミックコーティングで断熱処理されている。発煙化学燃料のエスビットストーブではなく、電池駆動のホットプレートを採用。コンパクトで軽量、耐久性がある。"

#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "mortar and pestle"
msgid_plural "mortars and pestles"
msgstr[0] "すり鉢とすりこぎ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'mortar and pestle', 'str_pl': 'mortars and
#. pestles'}
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid ""
"This is a simple combination of a small grindstone and a bowl-shaped stone."
"  Used for grinding grain, but time-consuming compared to more complex "
"methods."
msgstr "小さな磨石と皿状の石を組み合わせたシンプルな道具。穀物を挽くのに使うが、より複雑な方法と比べると時間がかかる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "multi cooker"
msgid_plural "multi cookers"
msgstr[0] "マルチクッカー"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'multi cooker'}
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid ""
"A professional-grade multi-cooker, with a battery slot for camping trips or "
"tailgating.  Its multitude of settings and features promise to handle any "
"sort of cooking, from parboiling potatoes to cooking curry to popping "
"popcorn.  There's no manual, but you're sure you can work it out."
msgstr ""
"プロ仕様のマルチクッカー。キャンプやテールゲートパーティー用に電池スロットが組み込まれている。無数の設定と機能により、じゃがいもを茹でることからカレー、ポップコーンまで、あらゆる調理に対応する。取扱説明書はないが、どうにか使えるだろう。"

#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "improved multi cooker"
msgid_plural "improved multi cookers"
msgstr[0] "改良型 マルチクッカー"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'improved multi cooker'}
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid ""
"A professional-grade multi-cooker, with a battery slot for camping trips or "
"tailgating. This has been tinkered with."
msgstr "プロ仕様のマルチクッカー。キャンプやテールゲートパーティー向けの電池スロットが付いている。改造されているようだ。"

#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "lamp oil cooker"
msgid_plural "lamp oil cookers"
msgstr[0] "ランプオイル調理器具"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'lamp oil cooker'}
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid ""
"This is a simple heater powered by lamp oil.  It is designed for cooking "
"food."
msgstr "ランプオイルで動作するシンプルな加熱装置。食料の調理に使う。"

#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "pasta extruder"
msgid_plural "pasta extruders"
msgstr[0] "パスタ押出機"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'pasta extruder'}
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid ""
"A pasta extruder run by a hand-crank.  Useful in making pasta.  It comes "
"with various heads to make various kinds of pasta."
msgstr "ハンドルを回して動作するパスタ押出機。複数の成形用金型が付属しており、さまざまな形状のパスタを作れる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "fermenting pickle jar"
msgid_plural "fermenting pickle jars"
msgstr[0] "発酵中のピクルスのガラス瓶"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'fermenting pickle jar'}.
#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'fermenting sauerkraut jar'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid ""
"You test the batch, and it tastes good, so you seal the jar up for storage."
msgstr "試食したところ美味しかったので、保存のために瓶を密封した。"

#. ~ Use action not_ready_msg for {'str': 'fermenting pickle jar'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "The pickles are not done fermenting yet."
msgstr "ピクルスはまだ発酵していない。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'fermenting pickle jar'}
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid ""
"This jar contains a batch of pickles set to ferment.  You can seal up the "
"jar once the process is completed."
msgstr "この瓶には、発酵が始まったピクルスが入っている。プロセスが完了すれば、密封して保存できる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "soda can stove kit"
msgid_plural "soda can stove kits"
msgstr[0] "ソーダ缶ストーブセット"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'soda can stove kit'}
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid ""
"This is an ultra-light alcohol-burning stove with simmer ring.  It comes "
"with a 500 ml container to hold concentrated alcohol fuel."
msgstr "とろ火リング付きの超軽量アルコールストーブ。濃縮アルコール燃料を入れる500mlの容器が付属する。"

#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "pressure cooker"
msgid_plural "pressure cookers"
msgstr[0] "圧力鍋"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'pressure cooker'}
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid ""
"Useful for boiling water when cooking spaghetti and more.  This sealed pot "
"is designed to cook food at higher pressures and temperatures.  Can also be "
"used for pressure sensitive chemical reactions."
msgstr ""
"スパゲティなどの調理に必要なお湯を沸かすのに便利。高圧・高温での調理を可能にするように設計されている。また、圧力に敏感な化学反応を行うのにも使用できる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "quern"
msgid_plural "querns"
msgstr[0] "ミル"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'quern'}
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "This is a simple hand-powered stone quern for grinding grain."
msgstr "穀物を挽くためのシンプルな手動式の石臼だ。"

#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "fermenting sauerkraut jar"
msgid_plural "fermenting sauerkraut jars"
msgstr[0] "発酵中のザワークラウトのガラス瓶"

#. ~ Use action not_ready_msg for {'str': 'fermenting sauerkraut jar'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "The sauerkraut isn't done fermenting yet."
msgstr "ザワークラウトはまだ発酵が完了していない。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'fermenting sauerkraut jar'}
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid ""
"This jar contains a batch of sauerkraut set to ferment.  You can seal up the"
" jar once the process is completed."
msgstr "この瓶には、発酵が始まったザワークラウトが入っている。プロセスが完了すれば、密封して保存できる。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'still'}
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid ""
"This is a still.  It's useful for creating distillation of alcohol and "
"other, more curious substances."
msgstr "これは蒸留器だ。アルコールや、その他の非常に興味深い物質の蒸留に役立つ。"

#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "clay retort"
msgid_plural "clay retorts"
msgstr[0] "粘土製蒸留器"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'clay retort'}
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid ""
"This is a primitive distillation tool made from clay, with a long neck that "
"acts as a condenser."
msgstr "粘土で作られた原始的な蒸留器。冷却管の役割を果たす長い首が付いている。"

#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "copper retort"
msgid_plural "copper retorts"
msgstr[0] "銅製蒸留器"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'copper retort'}
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid ""
"This is a primitive distillation tool made from copper, with a long neck "
"that acts as a condenser."
msgstr "銅で作られた原始的な蒸留器。冷却管の役割を果たす長い首が付いている。"

#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "survivor mess kit"
msgid_plural "survivor mess kits"
msgstr[0] "サバイバー調理セット"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'survivor mess kit'}
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid ""
"A homemade mess kit, containing everything you might need for creating post-"
"apocalyptic cuisine.  Powered by a lamp oil burner, it is composed of simple"
" yet durable tools and materials."
msgstr "大災厄後の調理に必要なすべてが揃った手作りの調理セット。ランプオイルバーナーで駆動し、シンプルだが耐久性の高い道具と素材で構成されている。"

#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "teapot"
msgid_plural "teapots"
msgstr[0] "ティーポット"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'teapot'}
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "A small metal teapot.  Teatime wouldn't be complete without one."
msgstr "金属製の小さなティーポット。これなしではティータイムは始まらない。"

#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "vacuum sealer"
msgid_plural "vacuum sealers"
msgstr[0] "真空パック機"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'vacuum sealer'}
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid ""
"This is a portable heat sealer unit with an air pump.  It's used for vacuum "
"packing food to preserve it."
msgstr "空気ポンプ付きの携帯用ヒートシーラーユニットだ。食品を真空パックして長期保存するために使われる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "waffle iron"
msgid_plural "waffle irons"
msgstr[0] "ワッフル型"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'waffle iron'}
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "A waffle iron.  For making waffles."
msgstr "ワッフルを作るための型。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'water purifier'}
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid ""
"This is a battery-powered device designed to purify drinking water.  Using "
"this item on a container full of water will purify the contents.  It could "
"be useful for water taken from uncertain sources like a river, as it may be "
"non-potable."
msgstr ""
"飲料水の浄化を目的としたバッテリー駆動の装置だ。水の入った容器に使用すると中身を浄化できる。川など水源が不確かで、飲用に適さない可能性がある水に対しても有用だ。"

#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "kimchi gimjangdok"
msgid_plural "kimchi gimjangdoks"
msgstr[0] "キムチ漬物壺"

#. ~ Use action menu_text for {'str': 'kimchi gimjangdok'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "Open dok"
msgstr "漬物壺を開封する"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'kimchi gimjangdok'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid ""
"You lift the lid and the smell of tangy, spicy, ripe kimchi makes you "
"salivate."
msgstr "蓋を持ち上げると、ツンとするスパイシーな、よく熟成されたキムチの香りに思わずよだれが出る。"

#. ~ Use action not_ready_msg for {'str': 'kimchi gimjangdok'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid "This kimchi is not done fermenting yet."
msgstr "キムチはまだ発酵していない。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'kimchi gimjangdok'}
#: data/json/items/tool/cooking.json
msgid ""
"A dok, or clay jar, in which kimchi is stored for the winter.  "
"Traditionally, this is buried in the ground, but it doesn't matter if you "
"leave it above ground; just close the lid and wait for it to ferment, and "
"you'll have delicious kimchi."
msgstr ""
"冬にキムチを保存するための粘土製の甕。通称「ドク」。伝統的には穴を掘って埋めて保管するが、地上に置いても問題ない。ふたをしっかり閉じ、発酵を待てば美味しいキムチが食べられる。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'brazier'}
#: data/json/items/tool/deployable.json
msgid ""
"A large metal stand used to contain a fire.  Fires set in a brazier will not"
" spread to surrounding flammable objects."
msgstr "火を閉じ込めて保管できる大型の金属製スタンド。内部の火は周囲の可燃物に引火しない。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'hobo stove'}
#: data/json/items/tool/deployable.json
msgid ""
"This is a small improvised wood stove, made from a metal can or similar "
"container of the right size.  It's too small to fit anything much larger "
"than splintered wood.  Activate it to Deploy."
msgstr "金属の缶や同程度の大きさの容器で作られた、簡易的な小型薪ストーブだ。木片より大きなものを燃料として使うには小さすぎる。起動して設置できる。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'camp chair'}
#: data/json/items/tool/deployable.json
msgid "Folded camp chair, deploy to sit down."
msgstr "折りたたまれたキャンプ用の椅子。展開して座る。"

#. ~ Use action done_message for {'str': 'cot'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/deployable.json
msgid "You unfold the cot and place it on the ground."
msgstr "簡易ベッドを広げて床に設置した。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'cot'}
#: data/json/items/tool/deployable.json
msgid ""
"This is a military style fold up cot.  While it may not be quite as "
"comfortable as a bed, it's better than slumming it on the ground."
msgstr "軍仕様の簡易ベッド。ベッドほど快適ではないが、地面に直接寝るよりはましだ。"

#: data/json/items/tool/deployable.json
msgid "folding bicycle"
msgid_plural "folding bicycles"
msgstr[0] "折りたたみ自転車"

#. ~ Use action unfold_msg for {'str': 'folding bicycle'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/deployable.json
msgid "You painstakingly unfold the bicycle and make it ready to ride."
msgstr "苦労して折りたたみ自転車を展開し、乗車の準備を整えた。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'folding bicycle'}
#: data/json/items/tool/deployable.json
msgid "This is a bicycle folded into a relatively portable package."
msgstr "保管しやすいよう折りたたみ可能な自転車。"

#: data/json/items/tool/deployable.json
msgid "skateboard"
msgid_plural "skateboards"
msgstr[0] "スケートボード"

#. ~ Use action unfold_msg for {'str': 'skateboard'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/deployable.json
msgid "You lay the skateboard down on the ground."
msgstr "スケートボードを床に下ろす。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'skateboard'}
#: data/json/items/tool/deployable.json
msgid "This is a skateboard."
msgstr "スケートボード。移動用の道具。"

#: data/json/items/tool/deployable.json
msgid "folding wagon"
msgid_plural "folding wagons"
msgstr[0] "折りたたみ式の荷車"

#. ~ Use action unfold_msg for {'str': 'folding wagon'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/deployable.json
msgid "You unfold the folding wagon."
msgstr "折りたたみ式の荷車を展開する。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'folding wagon'}
#: data/json/items/tool/deployable.json
msgid "This is a folding wagon."
msgstr "折りたたみ式の荷車。"

#: data/json/items/tool/deployable.json data/json/vehicles/boats.json
msgid "sea scooter"
msgid_plural "sea scooters"
msgstr[0] "水中スクーター"

#. ~ Use action unfold_msg for {'str': 'sea scooter'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/deployable.json
msgid "You place the sea scooter down."
msgstr "水中スクーターを下した。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'sea scooter'}
#: data/json/items/tool/deployable.json
msgid ""
"A super fast Rivtech sea scooter. Includes a headlight for night "
"expeditions. Can be recharged in the sun."
msgstr "極めて高速なリブテック社製水中スクーター。夜間走行用のヘッドライトを装備。太陽光で再充電が可能。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'metal butchering rack'}
#: data/json/items/tool/deployable.json
msgid ""
"Metal butchering rack designed to hang a carcass in the air.  It is folded "
"for easy transportation."
msgstr "獣の死体を空中に吊るすために設計された金属製の屠畜用ラック。持ち運びやすいよう折りたたまれている。"

#: data/json/items/tool/deployable.json data/json/vehicles/boats.json
msgid "inflatable boat"
msgid_plural "inflatable boats"
msgstr[0] "ゴムボート"

#. ~ Use action unfold_msg for {'str': 'inflatable boat'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/deployable.json
msgid "You painstakingly unfold, inflate, and launch the %s."
msgstr "苦労して%sを展開し、空気を入れて進水させた。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'inflatable boat'}
#: data/json/items/tool/deployable.json
msgid ""
"This rubber rowboat (oars included) is deflated for storage.  Activate it "
"(having an air pump in inventory) to inflate and launch."
msgstr "オール付きのゴムボート。収納のため空気が抜かれている。起動（インベントリに空気ポンプが必要）して空気を入れ、進水させられる。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'metal smoking rack'}
#: data/json/items/tool/deployable.json
msgid ""
"A metal rack designed to smoke food for better preservation and taste.  It "
"is folded for easy transportation."
msgstr "食品を燻製して保存性と風味を高めるための金属製ラック。持ち運びやすいよう折りたたまれている。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'tourist table'}
#: data/json/items/tool/deployable.json
msgid ""
"Metal tourist table for off-road trips.  It is folded for easy "
"transportation."
msgstr "オフロード旅行用の金属製テーブル。持ち運びやすいよう折りたたまれている。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'leather tarp'}
#: data/json/items/tool/deployable.json
msgid ""
"A large sheet of sewn leather that can be deployed instead of a picnic "
"blanket, but it's more valuable as a butchery appliance as it does not soak "
"in blood.  It's rolled and ready for carrying."
msgstr ""
"ピクニックシート代わりに使える広い縫い合わせの革製シートだ。しかし、血が染み込まないため、屠畜道具としてもより価値が高い。持ち運びしやすいよう丸めてある。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'fiber mat'}
#: data/json/items/tool/deployable.json
msgid ""
"A large mat woven from fibrous material that can be used instead of a picnic"
" blanket, but it's more valuable as a butchery appliance.  Too thin to be "
"used as a comfortable sleeping place.  It's rolled and ready for carrying."
msgstr ""
"ピクニックシート代わりに使える、繊維素材を編んだ大型マットだ。しかし、屠畜道具としてもより価値が高い。快適な寝床として使うには薄すぎる。持ち運びしやすいよう丸めてある。"

#: data/json/items/tool/deployable.json
msgid "folded butter churn"
msgid_plural "folded butter churns"
msgstr[0] "折りたたみ式バター撹拌機"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'folded butter churn'}
#: data/json/items/tool/deployable.json
msgid ""
"A large wooden container used to turn raw milk into butter and buttermilk.  "
"This model uses a foot crank and holds three gallons of raw milk."
msgstr "生乳をバターとバターミルクに分離する際に使う大きな木製の容器だ。容量は11.25Lで、足でクランクを回して稼働させる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/deployable.json
msgid "folded atomic butter churn"
msgid_plural "folded atomic butter churns"
msgstr[0] "折りたたみ式アトミックバター撹拌機"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'folded atomic butter churn'}
#: data/json/items/tool/deployable.json
msgid ""
"The Rivtech Churninator 4000, the only churn to be banned by 13 religious "
"sects.  The legs are currently folded up for travel.  This churn requires "
"nothing but raw milk, salt and a healthy respect for glowing objects, even "
"able to clarify butter with its awe-inspiring nuclear might."
msgstr ""
"13の宗教宗派によって禁じられた唯一の攪拌機、Rivtech チャーミネーター "
"4000。移動のため脚部が折りたたまれている。生乳と塩、そして輝くものへの健全な尊敬心があれば動作する。その驚異的な原子の力でバターを精製することさえ可能だ。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'water mill'}
#: data/json/items/tool/deployable.json
msgid ""
"A small water-powered mill that can convert starchy products into flour.  "
"Can be placed via the construction menu."
msgstr "生乳をバターとバターミルクに分離する際に使う大きな木製の容器だ。容量は3ガロン（11.25L）で、足でクランクを回して稼働させる。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'wind mill'}
#: data/json/items/tool/deployable.json
msgid ""
"A small wind-powered mill that can convert starchy products into flour.  Can"
" be placed via the construction menu."
msgstr "デンプンを含む穀物を挽いて細かい粉にできる小型の風車。建設メニューから設置可能だ。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'folding chair'}
#: data/json/items/tool/deployable.json
msgid "Folded plastic chair on a metal frame, deploy to sit down."
msgstr "金属フレームの折りたたみ式プラスチック椅子。展開して座る。"

#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json data/mods/Aftershock/items/tools.json
msgid "advanced UPS"
msgid_plural "advanced UPS's"
msgstr[0] "改良型UPS"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'advanced UPS', 'str_pl': "advanced UPS's"}
#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
msgid ""
"This is an advanced version of the unified power supply, or UPS.  Designed "
"for military use to power advanced weapons, it uses plutonium fuel cells "
"which provide better efficiency, but are not rechargeable.  It can power "
"many household electronics as well."
msgstr ""
"これは統合電源装置の進化版だ。高性能な兵器への電力供給を目的として設計されており、効率を高める代わりに、再充電不可能なプルトニウム燃料電池を採用している。多くの家庭用電子機器にも電力を供給できる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
msgid "camera"
msgid_plural "cameras"
msgstr[0] "カメラ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'camera'}
#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
msgid ""
"A point-and-shoot digital camera, with digital viewfinder, a backup 'iron-"
"sight', and flash.  You can look at your photos on the digital screen, or "
"transfer them with a memory card.  Takes conventional batteries."
msgstr ""
"コンパクトデジタルカメラ。電子ビューファインダー、バックアップ用の「アイアンサイト」、そしてフラッシュ機能を搭載している。撮影した写真はデジタル画面で閲覧でき、メモリーカードで転送することも可能。通常の電池で稼働する。"

#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
msgid "professional camera"
msgid_plural "professional cameras"
msgstr[0] "高性能カメラ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'professional camera'}
#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
msgid ""
"A 35 mm digital SLR (single-lens reflex) camera, with optical and digital "
"viewfinders, zoom lens with auto-focus and stabilizer, and flash.  You can "
"view your photos on it or transfer them with a memory card; it runs on a "
"rechargeable power cell that can be switched to charge via Unified Power "
"Supply.  Before the Cataclysm, you could have taken professional-grade "
"photos using this."
msgstr ""
"35mm "
"DSLR（デジタル一眼レフ）カメラ。光学式とデジタル式のビューファインダー、オートフォーカスと手ブレ補正機能付きのズームレンズ、そしてフラッシュを搭載。撮影した写真の閲覧や、メモリーカードでの転送が可能だ。統合電源装置からの充電に切り替えられる充電式バッテリーで動作する。大災厄以前であれば、このカメラでプロ並みの写真を撮影できたことだろう。"

#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
msgid "cellphone"
msgid_plural "cellphones"
msgstr[0] "携帯電話"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'cellphone'}.
#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'control laptop'}.
#. ~ Use action msg for laptop computer.
#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
msgid "You light up the screen."
msgstr "携帯電話の画面を点けた。"

#. ~ Use action need_charges_msg for {'str': 'cellphone'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
msgid "The cellphone's batteries need more charge."
msgstr "携帯電話のバッテリーを充電する必要がある。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'cellphone'}
#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
msgid ""
"This is a cellphone, an older cousin of a smartphone but still popular in "
"certain circles due to its reliability, sturdiness and the ability to run on"
" common batteries.  Using this cellphone will turn it on and provide light, "
"assuming it is sufficiently charged.  It also has a clock app that includes "
"an alarm."
msgstr ""
"これは携帯電話。スマートフォンの古めの親戚にあたるが、信頼性と頑丈さ、市販の電池を使える点から、今でも特定の層に人気がある。充電が十分な状態で使えば、照明として利用できる。時計機能"
" (アラーム付き) も備える。"

#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
msgid "cellphone - Screenlight"
msgid_plural "cellphones - Screenlight"
msgstr[0] "携帯電話－[画面点灯中]"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'cellphone - Screenlight', 'str_pl':
#. 'cellphones - Screenlight'}.
#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'control laptop - lit screen', 'str_pl':
#. 'control laptops - lit screen'}.
#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'laptop computer - lit screen', 'str_pl':
#. 'laptop computers - lit screen'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
msgid "You stop lighting up the screen."
msgstr "携帯電話の画面を消した。"

#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json data/mods/Aftershock/items/tools.json
msgid "control laptop"
msgid_plural "control laptops"
msgstr[0] "ロボット制御用ノートパソコン"

#. ~ Use action need_charges_msg for {'str': 'control laptop'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
msgid "The control laptop's batteries need more charge."
msgstr "制御用ノートパソコンのバッテリーは、もっと充電が必要だ。"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'control laptop'}.
#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'wrist computer'}.
