#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': "Wraitheon executive's smartphone"}.
#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json data/mods/Aftershock/items/tools.json
msgid "You put in the earbuds and start listening to music."
msgstr "イヤホンを耳に差し込み、音楽を聴き始めた。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'control laptop'}
#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
msgid ""
"A modified laptop, now capable of transmitting in the ultra-high frequencies"
" utilized by robots.  Activate it to command robots from afar, or to toggle "
"charging via UPS."
msgstr "ロボットが使用する極超短波を送信できるよう改造されたノートパソコン。使用して遠隔のロボットを制御したり、UPSの充電設定を行える。"

#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
msgid "control laptop - lit screen"
msgid_plural "control laptops - lit screen"
msgstr[0] "制御用ノートパソコン - 点灯画面"

#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
msgid "control laptop - music"
msgid_plural "control laptops - music"
msgstr[0] "制御用ノートパソコン - 音楽再生"

#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
msgid "wrist computer"
msgid_plural "wrist computers"
msgstr[0] "リストコンピューター"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'wrist computer'}.
#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'wrist control computer'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
msgid "You activate the flashlight."
msgstr "ライトを点灯した。"

#. ~ Use action need_charges_msg for {'str': 'wrist computer'}.
#. ~ Use action need_charges_msg for {'str': 'wrist control computer'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
msgid "The wrist computer's charge is too low."
msgstr "リストコンピューターの充電量が低すぎる。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'wrist computer'}
#. ~ Description for {'str': 'wrist control computer'}
#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
msgid ""
"A fancy wrist-mounted computer, with a menagerie of useful features, such as"
" SD reading, a built-in thermometer, and even a radiation monitor!"
msgstr "豪華な腕時計型のコンピューターで、SDカード読み取り、内蔵温度計、さらには放射線モニターまで、多種多様な便利な機能を備えている！"

#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
msgid "wrist computer - music"
msgid_plural "wrist computers - music"
msgstr[0] "リストコンピューター - 音楽再生"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'wrist computer - music', 'str_pl': 'wrist
#. computers - music'}
#. ~ Description for {'str': 'wrist control computer - music', 'str_pl':
#. 'wrist control computers - music'}
#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
msgid ""
"This wrist computer is playing music, steadily raising your morale.  You "
"can't hear anything else while you're listening."
msgstr "このリストコンピューターは音楽を再生しており、お前の意欲を着実に高めている。聞いている間は他の音が何も聞こえない。"

#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
msgid "wrist computer - Flashlight"
msgid_plural "wrist computers - Flashlight"
msgstr[0] "リストコンピューター - ライト"

#. ~ Use action menu_text for {'str': 'wrist computer - Flashlight', 'str_pl':
