msgid "You deactivate the flashlight app."
msgstr "ライトアプリを無効化しました。"

#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
msgid "directional antenna"
msgid_plural "directional antennas"
msgstr[0] "指向性アンテナ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'directional antenna'}
#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
msgid ""
"This is an antenna designed to pick up signals better when pointed at the "
"source.  You could use this with a radio to receive faint signals."
msgstr "発信源に向けたときに、より強く信号を受信するように設計されたアンテナ。使用すればかすかな信号であってもラジオで受信することができる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
msgid "electronic handcuffs"
msgid_plural "electronic handcuffs"
msgstr[0] "電子手錠"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'electronic handcuffs'}
#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
msgid ""
"A pair of electronic handcuffs, used by police and riot bots to detain captives.  Their continuous siren clearly identifies the wearer as an arrested criminal and alerts human police.  Wait for their arrival, don't try to escape or to remove the cuffs - they will administer an electric shock.\n"
"However, since the only police likely to respond are undead, you may have a long wait ahead, unless you get creative…"
msgstr ""
"警察ロボットや暴動鎮圧ロボットが容疑者を逮捕するために使う電気式手錠。装着中は常にサイレンを鳴らし続け、装着者を逮捕中の犯罪者と認識して人間の警察を呼び出す。支援部隊が到着するまで待機せよ。脱出や手錠の解除を試みるな―電気ショックが加えられる。\n"
"だが、応答する警察がみなゾンビと化してしまった今、何か創造的な解決策を思いつかなければ、とてつもなく長い間、ただ待ち続ける羽目になるだろう…"

#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json data/mods/ebook_lua/items/tools.json
msgid "e-ink tablet PC"
msgid_plural "e-ink tablet PCs"
msgstr[0] "E-InkタブレットPC"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'e-ink tablet PC'}
#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
msgid ""
"A tablet PC using an efficient color e-ink display, with a recharging "
"battery that can be switched to draw from a UPS.  Before the Cataclysm, "
"these were nifty gadgets; now, it's an almost priceless resource."
msgstr ""
"高効率のカラー電子インクディスプレイを搭載したタブレットPC。UPS充電に対応した充電式バッテリーで動作。大災厄以前は実用的な道具であり、現在では極めて貴重な資源。"

#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
msgid "electrohack"
msgid_plural "electrohacks"
msgstr[0] "電子ハッキング装置"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'electrohack'}
#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
msgid ""
"This device has many ports attached, allowing it to connect to almost any "
"control panel or other electronic machine (but not computers).  With a "
"little skill, it can be used to crack passwords and more.  It requires 25 "
"charges of battery power per use."
msgstr ""
"この装置には多数のバイパスポートが内蔵されており、ほぼすべての制御パネルや (コンピュータを除く) "
"電子機器に接続できる。ある程度の技術があれば、これを使ってパスワードをクラックしたり、それ以上の操作が可能になる。使用ごとに25のバッテリーを消費する。"

#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
msgid "geiger counter (off)"
msgid_plural "geiger counters (off)"
msgstr[0] "ガイガーカウンター [停止中]"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'geiger counter (off)', 'str_pl': 'geiger
#. counters (off)'}
#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
msgid ""
"This is a tool for measuring radiation.  Using it will prompt you to choose "
"whether to scan yourself or the terrain, or to turn it on, which will "
"provide continuous feedback on ambient radiation.  It is currently off."
msgstr ""
"放射能を測定する装置。使用すると、体の被曝量を測るか、地面を調査するか、あるいは単に電源を入れるかを選択できる。電源を入れたままにしておくと、周辺の放射能レベルを継続的に知らせてくれる。現在は電源が入っていない。"

#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
msgid "geiger counter (on)"
msgid_plural "geiger counters (on)"
msgstr[0] "ガイガーカウンター [作動中]"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'geiger counter (on)', 'str_pl': 'geiger counters
#. (on)'}
#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
msgid ""
"This is a tool for measuring radiation.  It is in continuous scan mode, and "
"will produce quiet clicking sounds in the presence of ambient radiation.  "
"Using it allows you to turn it off, or scan yourself or the ground.  It is "
"currently on."
msgstr ""
"放射能を測定する装置。継続測定モードで稼働中。ピーピーという音で周囲の放射能レベルを知らせている。使用して電源を切るか、地面の測定、体の被曝量測定が可能。現在は電源が入っている。"

#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
msgid "hand-crank charger"
msgid_plural "hand-crank chargers"
msgstr[0] "手動式バッテリー充電器"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'hand-crank charger'}
#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
msgid ""
"This is a hand-powered battery charger.  It has an adjustable receptacle "
"designed to accept a wide variety of rechargeable battery cells."
msgstr "手回し式のバッテリー充電器。調整可能な差し込み口により、さまざまな種類の充電式バッテリーに対応する。"

#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
msgid "laptop computer"
msgid_plural "laptop computers"
msgstr[0] "ノートパソコン"

#. ~ Use action need_charges_msg for laptop computer.
#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
msgid "The laptop's batteries need more charge."
msgstr "ノートパソコンのバッテリーが不足している。"

#. ~ Description for laptop computer
#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
msgid ""
"A laptop computer with an internal rechargeable battery, also capable of "
"using UPS."
msgstr "充電式一体型バッテリーで動作するノートパソコン。UPSでも充電可能。"

#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
msgid "laptop computer - music"
msgid_plural "laptop computers - music"
msgstr[0] "ノートパソコン - 音楽再生"

#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
msgid "laptop computer - lit screen"
msgid_plural "laptop computers - lit screen"
msgstr[0] "ノートパソコン [画面点灯中]"

#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
msgid "mp3 player (off)"
msgid_plural "mp3 players (off)"
msgstr[0] "MP3プレーヤー [停止中]"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'mp3 player (off)', 'str_pl': 'mp3 players
#. (off)'}
#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
msgid ""
"This battery-powered device is loaded up with someone's music collection.  "
"Fortunately, there's lots of songs you like, and listening to it will raise "
"your morale slightly.  Use it to turn it on, or toggle charging on the go "
"from a Unified Power System."
msgstr ""
"誰かが集めた音楽で満たされた、バッテリー駆動の電子機器。幸運にもお前の好みの曲がたくさん入っており、これを聴いていると気分が少し良くなる。使用して電源を入れたり、UPSでの充電設定を行える。"

#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
msgid "mp3 player (on)"
msgid_plural "mp3 players (on)"
msgstr[0] "MP3プレーヤー [作動中]"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'mp3 player (on)', 'str_pl': 'mp3 players (on)'}
#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
msgid ""
"This mp3 player is turned on and playing some great tunes, raising your "
"morale steadily while on your person.  It runs through batteries quickly; "
"you can turn it off by using it.  It also obscures your hearing."
msgstr ""
"このMP3プレーヤーは電源が入り、良い曲が流れている。携帯している間はやる気を継続的に高めてくれるが、バッテリーを急速に消費する。使用して電源を切れるが、音楽を聴いていたことさえ忘れてしまうだろう。"

#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
msgid "noise emitter (off)"
msgid_plural "noise emitters (off)"
msgstr[0] "騒音発生器 [停止中]"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'noise emitter (off)', 'str_pl': 'noise emitters
#. (off)'}
#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
msgid ""
"This device was constructed by 'enhancing' a speaker ripped off from some "
"electronic device with some amplifier circuits.  It has now no other use "
"beside emitting loud crackling static noise, that could distract zombies."
msgstr ""
"電子機器から取り外したスピーカーに増幅回路を接続して「強化」することで作られた装置。ゾンビが群がってくるほど大きな騒音を発する以外に、特に使い道はない。"

#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
msgid "noise emitter (on)"
msgid_plural "noise emitters (on)"
msgstr[0] "騒音発生器 [作動中]"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'noise emitter (on)', 'str_pl': 'noise emitters
#. (on)'}
#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
msgid ""
"This device has been turned on and is emitting horrible crackles, pops and "
"other static sounds.  Quick, get away from it before it draws zombies to "
"you!"
msgstr "装置が作動し、ひどくうるさいジジッ、パンパンといった騒音を発している。ゾンビが集まってくる前に、すぐに逃げろ！"

#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
msgid "handheld game system"
msgid_plural "handheld game systems"
msgstr[0] "携帯ゲーム機"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'handheld game system'}
#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
msgid ""
"This is a portable games console in working condition, with an LED-screen "
"allowing you to play in the dark.  You can use it to play it for a little "
"while, running down the integrated battery.  Can also be set to draw power "
"from a UPS."
msgstr ""
"バックライト付き画面を備えた携帯用ゲーム機。暗闇の中でも遊べる。内蔵バッテリーで短時間遊べるほか、UPSから電力を供給するよう設定することも可能。"

#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
msgid "smartphone"
msgid_plural "smartphones"
msgstr[0] "スマートフォン"

#. ~ Use action menu_text for {'str': 'smartphone'}.
#. ~ Use action menu_text for {'str': 'atomic smartphone'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
msgid "Activate Flashlight"
msgstr "ライトアプリをアクティブ化"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'smartphone'}.
#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'atomic smartphone'}.
#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': "Wraitheon executive's smartphone"}.
#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json data/mods/Aftershock/items/tools.json
msgid "You activate the flashlight app."
msgstr "ライトアプリを起動する。"

#. ~ Use action need_charges_msg for {'str': 'smartphone'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
msgid "The smartphone's charge is too low."
msgstr "スマートフォンの充電量が低すぎる。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'smartphone'}
#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
msgid ""
"A popular, fancy smartphone.  Capable of making photos due to integrated "
"camera and illuminating an area as per flashlight app, assuming it has "
"enough charge.  The smartphone also has a clock app that includes an alarm."
"  Runs on a small, rechargeable power cell compatible with Unified Power "
"Supply if set to charge from one."
msgstr ""
"人気で洗練されたスマートフォン。内蔵カメラで写真が撮れ、充電が十分あれば懐中電灯アプリで周囲を照らせる。アラーム付き時計アプリも搭載。UPSで充電可能な、小型充電式バッテリー駆動。"

#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
msgid "smartphone - music"
msgid_plural "smartphones - music"
msgstr[0] "スマートフォン [音楽再生中]"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'smartphone - music', 'str_pl': 'smartphones -
#. music'}
#. ~ Description for {'str': 'atomic smartphone - music', 'str_pl': 'atomic
#. smartphones - music'}
#. ~ Description for {'str': "Wraitheon executive's smartphone - music",
#. 'str_pl': "Wraitheon executive's smartphones - music"}
#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json data/mods/Aftershock/items/tools.json
msgid ""
"This phone is playing music, steadily raising your morale.  You can't hear "
"anything else while you're listening."
msgstr "スマートフォンからは意欲を高める音楽が流れています。聞いている間は他の音を聞き取れません。"

#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
msgid "smartphone - Flashlight"
msgid_plural "smartphones - Flashlight"
msgstr[0] "スマートフォン(ライト)"

#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
msgid "atomic smartphone"
msgid_plural "atomic smartphones"
msgstr[0] "アトミックスマートフォン"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'atomic smartphone'}
#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
msgid ""
"Never charge your phone again with the Rivtech atomic smartphone.  Rated for"
" 10 million years of use, this cutting-edge gadget had been on public "
"markets for less than a week when the Cataclysm hit, and their eye-watering "
"price made them a rarity.  It includes an alarm clock, a high-resolution "
"camera, and a bright flashlight."
msgstr ""
"Rivtech社のアトミックスマートフォンは永久に充電要らずだ。1000万年の耐用年数を保証するこの最先端のガジェットは、大災厄が訪れる一週間前に発売を開始したばかりだ。目覚まし時計、高性能カメラ、明るい懐中電灯が内蔵されている。"

#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
msgid "atomic smartphone - music"
msgid_plural "atomic smartphones - music"
msgstr[0] "アトミックスマートフォン(音楽)"

#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
msgid "atomic smartphone - Flashlight"
msgid_plural "atomic smartphones - Flashlight"
msgstr[0] "アトミックスマートフォン(ライト)"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'UPS', 'str_pl': "UPS's"}
#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
msgid ""
"This is a unified power supply, or UPS.  It is a civilian evolution of a "
"military project.  Designed to power advanced weapons and armor, the "
"civilian version serves as a portable power bank and inverter for many "
"household electronics."
msgstr ""
"統合電源装置、略してUPS。軍用装備の民生用バージョン。もとは最新式の武器や防具への電力供給を目的に開発されたが、この民生用モデルは、家庭用電子機器向けの携帯型電力貯蔵装置兼インバーターとして機能する。"

#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
msgid "vibrator"
msgid_plural "vibrators"
msgstr[0] "バイブレーター"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'vibrator'}
#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
msgid ""
"This battery-devouring device is just the thing to knead the tension out and"
" help you relax.  Use it to take a break and unwind."
msgstr "マッサージによって緊張を和らげ、リラックスをもたらすバッテリー駆動式の機器。使用すると休息をとり、緊張を緩和できる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
msgid "bullet vibrator (off)"
msgid_plural "bullet vibrator (off)s"
msgstr[0] "バレットバイブレーター [停止中]"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'bullet vibrator (off)'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
msgid "You turn on the bullet vibe and place it appropriately."
msgstr "バレットバイブレーターを点け、適切な場所に当てる。"

#. ~ Use action need_charges_msg for {'str': 'bullet vibrator (off)'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
msgid "The vibrator's battery is dead."
msgstr "バイブレーターの電池が尽きた。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'bullet vibrator (off)'}
#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
msgid ""
"This battery-devouring device is just the thing to knead the tension out and"
" help you relax.  Use it to turn it on and start letting it buzz away."
msgstr "電池をよく消費する装置で、緊張をほぐしリラックスするのに最適。使用すると電源が入り、ブンブンと振動する。"

#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
msgid "bullet vibrator (on)"
msgid_plural "bullet vibrator (on)s"
msgstr[0] "バレットバイブレーター [作動中]"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'bullet vibrator (on)'}
#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
msgid ""
"This battery-devouring device is just the thing to knead the tension out and"
" help you relax.  You can feel it buzzing away all that tension."
msgstr "電池をよく消費する装置で、緊張をほぐしリラックスするのに最適。今まさにブンブンと振動し、その緊張を追い払っている。"

#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
msgid "gps pinpointer"
msgid_plural "gps pinpointers"
msgstr[0] "GPSピンポインタ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'gps pinpointer'}
#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
msgid ""
"Durable handheld GPS unit built for outdoor navigation.  Activate to acquire"
" satellite lock and search the database."
msgstr "屋外活動を支援するための頑丈な携帯型GPS端末。使用すると人工衛星と接続し、データベースを検索できる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
msgid "military gps pinpointer"
msgid_plural "military gps pinpointers"
msgstr[0] "軍用GPSピンポインタ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'military gps pinpointer'}
#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
msgid ""
"Durable handheld GPS unit built for outdoor navigation.  Activate to acquire"
" satellite lock and search the database.  This one has encrpytion keys for "
"military-grade satellites, allowing a much greater search range."
msgstr ""
"屋外活動を支援するための頑丈な携帯型GPS端末。使用すると人工衛星と接続し、データベースを検索できる。この端末には軍用衛星に接続するためのセキュリティキーが内蔵されており、より広範な領域を検索可能。"

#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
msgid "bionic scanner"
msgid_plural "bionic scanners"
msgstr[0] "義体探知機"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'bionic scanner'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
msgid "You start scanning for bionics."
msgstr "義体探知を開始します。"

#. ~ Use action need_charges_msg for {'str': 'bionic scanner'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
msgid "The scanner doesn't have enough power."
msgstr "スキャナーの電力が不足しています。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'bionic scanner'}
#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
msgid ""
"A small metal scanner specialized in detecting bionic hardware.  Activate to"
" start scanning nearby corpses for bionics."
msgstr "義体装置の探知に特化した小型金属探知機。作動させると、近くの死体に装着された義体を検出できる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
msgid "bionic scanner (on)"
msgid_plural "bionic scanner (on)s"
msgstr[0] "義体探知機 [作動中]"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'bionic scanner (on)'}
#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
msgid ""
"A small metal scanner specialized in detecting bionic hardware.  While in "
"use it will steadily drain power, automatically scanning corpses near you "
"for bionics."
msgstr "義体装置の探知に特化した小型の金属探知機。作動中は継続的に電力を消費し、周辺の死体に装着された義体を検出できる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
msgid "genome sampler"
msgid_plural "genome samplers"
msgstr[0] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'genome sampler'}
#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
msgid ""
"A handheld device designed to extract and analyze DNA from living organisms."
"  If you have an empty USB drive on hand, scanning a creature with it can "
"create a genome sample for later sequencing in a cloning vat."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
msgid "genome workstation"
msgid_plural "genome workstations"
msgstr[0] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'genome workstation'}
#: data/json/items/tool/electronics.json
msgid ""
"A medium-sized, high-tech machine with screens and sample trays.  It can "
"scan genetic samples off USB drives, and produce DNA samples for cloning if "
"provided with growth medium.  It can also be used as a microcentrifuge in a "
"pinch."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/tool/entry_tools.json
msgid "crowbar"
msgid_plural "crowbars"
msgstr[0] "バール"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'crowbar'}
#: data/json/items/tool/entry_tools.json
msgid ""
"This is a hefty prying tool.  Use it to open locked doors without destroying"
" them or to lift manhole covers.  You could also wield it to bash some heads"
" in."
msgstr "ドアなどを壊す事なく開けられる工具。マンホールの蓋も持ち上げられる。もちろん、誰かの頭に叩きつける事もできる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/entry_tools.json
msgid "hairpin lockpick"
msgid_plural "hairpin lockpicks"
msgstr[0] "ヘアピンロックピック"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'hairpin lockpick'}
#: data/json/items/tool/entry_tools.json
msgid ""
"This is a metal hairpin bent into shape by hand, worse than an improvised "
"set but easier to work with than a bone skewer.  You need MacGyver-like "
"skills to open locks with this as it is brittle, but it lowers the chance of"
" an alarm being set off.  If you're crouched, examining a locked door will "
"have you prioritize picking the lock instead of using a crowbar on it."
msgstr ""
"手で曲げた金属製のヘアピン。性能は簡易ロックピックより劣るが、骨のこてよりはましだ。ヘアピンは折れやすいため、これで錠を解除するにはマクガイバー並みの技術が必要だが、警報が鳴る可能性は低い。屈んだ状態で施錠されたドアを調べると、バールを使うよりも錠前解除を優先する。"

#: data/json/items/tool/entry_tools.json
msgid "improvised lockpick"
msgid_plural "improvised lockpicks"
msgstr[0] "簡易ロックピック"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'improvised lockpick'}
#: data/json/items/tool/entry_tools.json
msgid ""
"This is an improvised set of picks and torsion wrenches made from scrap "
"metal.  You need MacGyver-like skills to open locks with these as they are "
"brittle, but they lower the chances of alarms being set off.  If you're "
"crouched, examining a locked door will have you prioritize picking the lock "
"instead of using a crowbar on it."
msgstr ""
"スクラップから作った簡易ロックピックとツイストワレンチ。ロックピックが折れやすいため、これで錠を解除するにはマクガイバー並みの技術が必要だが、警報が鳴る可能性は低い。屈んだ状態で施錠されたドアを調べると、バールを使うよりも錠前解除を優先する。"

#: data/json/items/tool/entry_tools.json
msgid "ice axe"
msgid_plural "ice axes"
msgstr[0] "アイスアックス"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'ice axe'}
#: data/json/items/tool/entry_tools.json
msgid ""
"This is an ice axe with hammer on its head, a multi-purpose hiking and "
"climbing tool used by mountaineers.  It is sturdy enough to pry open closed "
"doors or lift manhole covers."
msgstr ""
"ハイキングやクライミングで利用する、片側にハンマーが付いたピッケルだ。とても頑丈な作りで、ドアをこじ開けたりマンホールの蓋を持ち上げたりするのにも使える。"

#: data/json/items/tool/entry_tools.json
msgid "makeshift crowbar"
msgid_plural "makeshift crowbars"
msgstr[0] "急造バール"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'makeshift crowbar'}
#: data/json/items/tool/entry_tools.json
msgid ""
"This is a pipe whose ends have been bent and hammered flat to resemble a "
"crowbar.  Use it to open locked crates without destroying them, to lift "
"manhole covers, or even open doors and windows.  You could also wield it to "
"fight with, in a pinch."
msgstr ""
"パイプの両端を曲げ、バールのように平らに加工した。施錠された箱を壊さずに開けたり、マンホールの蓋を持ち上げたり、ドアや窓を開けるのにも使える。緊急時には武器としても十分実用可能。"

#: data/json/items/tool/entry_tools.json
msgid "locksmith kit"
msgid_plural "locksmith kits"
msgstr[0] "ロックピックセット"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'locksmith kit'}
#: data/json/items/tool/entry_tools.json
msgid ""
"This is a locksmith's set of sturdy steel lock picks and torsion wrenches.  "
"It is essential for silently and quickly opening locks, provided you have "
"some mechanical skill.  If you're crouched, examining a locked door will "
"have you prioritize picking the lock instead of using a crowbar on it."
msgstr ""
"頑丈な鋼製のロックピックとツイストレンチからなる、錠前解除用の道具。静かで迅速な錠の解除には、この道具とある程度の機械整備スキルが不可欠。屈んだ状態で施錠されたドアを調べると、バールを使うよりも錠前解除を優先する。"

#: data/json/items/tool/entry_tools.json
msgid "bionic lockpick"
msgid_plural "bionic lockpicks"
msgstr[0] ""

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "debug shrapnel"
msgid_plural "debug shrapnels"
msgstr[0] "デバッグ破片"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'debug shrapnel'}
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"This item, which shouldn't exist, has shrapnel range larger than the reality"
" itself."
msgstr "この存在してはならない破片は、現実よりもさらに遠い射程を持っています。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "acid bomb"
msgid_plural "acid bombs"
msgstr[0] "強酸爆弾"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'acid bomb'}
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"This is a fragile container filled with acid.  Throw it to spill out a pool "
"of potent acid."
msgstr "酸で満たされた壊れやすい容器。投げると強酸溜まりを発生させる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "can bomb"
msgid_plural "can bombs"
msgstr[0] "缶爆弾"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'can bomb'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"You light the fuse on the can bomb.  Throw it before it blows in your face!"
msgstr "缶爆弾の導火線に火を点ける。顔を吹っ飛ばされる前に早く投げ捨てろ！"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'can bomb'}
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"This is a tin can filled with some explosives provided with a fuse.  Won't "
"make a big explosion but you still wouldn't want to be near it.  Will "
"explode in 5 seconds if lit."
msgstr "ブリキ缶の中に爆薬を詰めて導火線を取り付けた爆弾。大爆発はしないが、近くに置きたくはない。点火後、5秒で爆発する。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "active can bomb"
msgid_plural "active can bombs"
msgstr[0] "缶爆弾 [点火済み]"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'active can bomb'}
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"This is a tin can filled with some explosives and provided with a fuse.  "
"Won't make a big explosion but you still wouldn't want to be near it.  The "
"fuse has been lit, you should throw it."
msgstr ""
"ブリキ缶の中に爆薬を詰めて導火線を取り付けた爆弾。それほど大きな爆発はしないが、近くに置きたくはない。導火線に火がついている。急いで逃げろ。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "C-4 explosive"
msgid_plural "C-4 explosives"
msgstr[0] "C-4"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'C-4 explosive'}
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"This is military grade RDX composition explosive.  A label reads: \"Highly "
"explosive, use with extreme caution!\" It comes with a small timer."
msgstr "軍用RDX複合火薬。ラベルには「高性能爆薬、使用時は極度の注意を要す！」と記載されている。小さなタイマーが付いている。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "C-4 explosive (armed)"
msgid_plural "C-4 explosives (armed)"
msgstr[0] "C-4 [作動中]"

#. ~ Use action no_deactivate_msg for {'str': 'C-4 explosive (armed)',
#. 'str_pl': 'C-4 explosives (armed)'}.
#. ~ Use action no_deactivate_msg for {'str': 'mininuke (armed)', 'str_pl':
#. 'mininukes (armed)'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "You've already set the %s's timer, you might want to get away from it."
msgstr "すでに%sのタイマーが作動している。速やかに離れるべきだ。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'C-4 explosive (armed)', 'str_pl': 'C-4
#. explosives (armed)'}
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"This is military grade RDX composition explosive.  A label reads: \"Highly "
"explosive, use with extreme caution!\" It comes with a small timer, which is"
" currently ticking down."
msgstr ""
"軍用RDX複合火薬。ラベルには「高性能爆薬、使用時は極度の注意を要す！」と記載されている。小型の時限起爆装置がカチカチと残り時間を刻んでいる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "dynamite"
msgid_plural "dynamites"
msgstr[0] "ダイナマイト"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'dynamite'}.
#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'dynamite bomb'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "You light the dynamite."
msgstr "ダイナマイトに火をつけた。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'dynamite'}
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"These are several sticks of explosives with a fuse attached.  Use this item "
"to light the fuse.  You will, of course, need a lighter or matches in your "
"inventory to do this.  Shortly after lighting the fuse, this item will "
"explode, so get away!"
msgstr ""
"導火線のついた爆薬をいくつか束ねたもの。使用すると導火線に点火される。点火にはライターやマッチが必要。導火線に火がつくと間もなく爆発するので、すぐに逃げろ！"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "dynamite (lit)"
msgid_plural "dynamites (lit)"
msgstr[0] "ダイナマイト [点火済み]"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'dynamite (lit)', 'str_pl': 'dynamites (lit)'}
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"The fuse on this dynamite is lit and hissing.  It'll explode any moment now."
msgstr "このダイナマイトの導火線がジリジリと燃えている。すぐ爆発しそうだ。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "dynamite bomb"
msgid_plural "dynamite bombs"
msgstr[0] "ダイナマイト束"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'dynamite bomb'}
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"These are several sticks of explosives surrounded by shrapnel stuffed inside"
" a metal container.  The fuse is sticking out through a small hole.  Use "
"this item to light the fuse.  You will, of course, need a lighter or matches"
" in your inventory to do this.  Shortly after lighting the fuse, this item "
"will explode, so get away!"
msgstr ""
"棒状の爆発物を破片と共に金属製の容器に詰めた爆弾。容器に開いた小さな穴から導火線が飛び出している。使用すると導火線に点火される。当たり前だが、ライターやマッチがないと使えない。導火線に火がつくと間もなく爆発するので、すぐに逃げろ！"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "dynamite bomb (lit)"
msgid_plural "dynamite bombs (lit)"
msgstr[0] "ダイナマイト束 [点火済み]"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'dynamite bomb (lit)', 'str_pl': 'dynamite bombs
#. (lit)'}
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"The fuse on this dynamite bomb is lit and hissing.  It'll explode any moment"
" now."
msgstr "このダイナマイト束の導火線がジリジリと燃えている。すぐ爆発しそうだ。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "EMP bomb"
msgid_plural "EMP bombs"
msgstr[0] "EMP爆弾"

#. ~ Use action menu_text for {'str': 'EMP bomb'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "Activate bomb"
msgstr "爆弾を起動する"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'EMP bomb'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "You activate the EMP bomb."
msgstr "EMP爆弾を起動した。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'EMP bomb'}
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"This substantial device is a bomb that generates an electromagnetic pulse.  "
"When this magnetic field is fed into the antenna, it creates a strong "
"electro-magnetic pulse.  It will also create a sizable explosion, so stay "
"clear of it."
msgstr ""
"この大型装置はEMPを発生させる爆弾。磁場がアンテナを通過すると強力なEMPが発生する。また、かなり大きな爆発も伴うため、安全圏まで後退せよ。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "active EMP bomb"
msgid_plural "active EMP bombs"
msgstr[0] "EMP爆弾 [起動中]"

#. ~ Use action no_deactivate_msg for {'str': 'active EMP bomb'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "You've already activated the %s, try throwing it instead."
msgstr "すでに%sを起動済み。急いで投げろ。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'active EMP bomb'}
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"This EMP bomb is active, and will shortly detonate, creating a large EMP "
"field that damages robots and drains bionic energy.  You may not want to be "
"holding it much longer.  It will also create an explosion, which may hurt "
"you."
msgstr ""
"EMP爆弾は起動済みで、まもなく爆発してロボットにダメージを与え、義体電力を吸収する強力なEMPを発生させる。爆発も伴うため負傷の恐れがあり、長く持ち続けたいものではない。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "improvised demolition charge"
msgid_plural "improvised demolition charges"
msgstr[0] "自作解体爆薬"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'improvised demolition charge'}
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"This is a improvised demolition charge.  Use this item to light the fuse.  "
"You will, of course, need a lighter or matches in your inventory to do this."
"  20 seconds after lighting the fuse, this item will explode, so get away!"
msgstr ""
"急造の爆発物。使用すると導火線に点火される。もちろん、ライターやマッチがある場合に限る！導火線に火をつけてから20秒後に爆発するので、すぐに逃げろ！"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "improvised demolition charge (lit)"
msgid_plural "improvised demolition charges (lit)"
msgstr[0] "自作解体爆薬 [点火済み]"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'improvised demolition charge (lit)', 'str_pl':
#. 'improvised demolition charges (lit)'}
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"The fuse on this primitive demolition charge is lit and hissing.  It'll "
"explode any moment now."
msgstr "この原始的な解体爆薬の導火線に火がついて、シューッという音を立てている。今にも爆発しそうだ。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "firecracker"
msgid_plural "firecrackers"
msgstr[0] "爆竹"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'firecracker'}
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"A solitary firecracker with a short fuse.  Use this item to light the fuse."
"  Of course, you will need a lighter or some matches to do so.  Shortly "
"after you light the fuse it will explode, so throw it quickly!"
msgstr ""
"短い導火線のついた爆竹一つ。使用すると導火線に点火される。もちろん、ライターやマッチを持っている場合に限る。点火直後に爆発するため、すぐに投げろ！"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "firecracker (lit)"
msgid_plural "firecrackers (lit)"
msgstr[0] "爆竹 [点火済み]"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'firecracker (lit)', 'str_pl': 'firecrackers
#. (lit)'}
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"A firecracker that has been lit; the fuse is hissing.  Throw it quickly "
"before it explodes."
msgstr "この爆竹束に火がついている。導火線が燃えている。爆発する前にすばやく投げろ。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "pack of firecrackers"
msgid_plural "packs of firecrackers"
msgstr[0] "爆竹パック"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'pack of firecrackers', 'str_pl': 'packs of
#. firecrackers'}
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"This is a pack of 25 firecrackers with a starter fuse.  Use this item to "
"light the fuse.  Of course, you will need a lighter or some matches to do "
"so.  Shortly after you light the fuse they will begin to explode, so throw "
"them quickly!"
msgstr ""
"始動用導火線付きの爆竹25個入りパック。使用すると導火線に点火される。もちろん、ライターやマッチが必要だ。点火直後に爆発が始まるため、すぐに投げろ！"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "pack of firecrackers (lit)"
msgid_plural "packs of firecrackers (lit)"
msgstr[0] "爆竹パック [点火済み]"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'pack of firecrackers (lit)', 'str_pl': 'packs of
#. firecrackers (lit)'}
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"A pack of 25 firecrackers that has been lit; the fuse is hissing.  Throw "
"them quickly before the start to explode."
msgstr "点火された爆竹25個入りパック。導火線が、シューシューと音を立てている。爆発する前にすばやく投げろ。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "flashbang"
msgid_plural "flashbangs"
msgstr[0] "閃光手榴弾"

#. ~ Use action menu_text for {'str': 'flashbang'}.
#. ~ Use action menu_text for {'str': 'grenade'}.
#. ~ Use action menu_text for {'str': 'EMP grenade'}.
#. ~ Use action menu_text for {'str': 'incendiary grenade'}.
#. ~ Use action menu_text for {'str': 'scrambler grenade'}.
#. ~ Use action menu_text for {'str': 'tear gas payload'}.
#. ~ Use action menu_text for {'str': 'makeshift grenade'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json data/json/items/tool/misc.json
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "Pull pin"
msgstr "ピンを引き抜く"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'flashbang'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "You pull the pin on the flashbang."
msgstr "閃光手榴弾のピンを引き抜いた。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'flashbang'}
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"This is a military police style flashbang.  Use this item to pull the pin "
"and light the fuse.  You will then have five turns before it detonates with "
"intense light and sound, blinding, deafening and disorienting anyone nearby."
msgstr ""
"軍警察が使っている閃光手榴弾。使用するとピンを引き、導火線に点火される。その後5ターンで強烈な光と音を発生とともに爆発し、周囲にいる者の視界と聴力を奪い、混乱させる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "active flashbang"
msgid_plural "active flashbangs"
msgstr[0] "閃光手榴弾 [起動中]"

#. ~ Use action no_deactivate_msg for {'str': 'active flashbang'}.
#. ~ Use action no_deactivate_msg for {'str': 'active EMP grenade'}.
#. ~ Use action no_deactivate_msg for {'str': 'active tear gas payload'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json data/json/items/tool/misc.json
#: src/iuse.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "You've already pulled the %s's pin, try throwing it instead."
msgstr "すでに%sのピンを抜いている。投げたほうがいい。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'active flashbang'}
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"This flashbang is active, and will soon detonate with intense light and "
"sound, blinding, deafening and disorienting anyone nearby.  It may be a good"
" idea to throw it!"
msgstr "この閃光弾は起動中で、まもなく強烈な光と音を放って爆発し、視界と聴力を奪い周囲の人間を混乱させる。投げたほうがいい！"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "fungicidal gas grenade"
msgid_plural "fungicidal gas grenades"
msgstr[0] "殺菌ガス手榴弾"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'fungicidal gas grenade'}
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"This is a canister grenade filled with fungicidal solution.  Use this item "
"to pull the pin and light the fuse, turning it into an active fungicidal "
"grenade.  In five turns it will begin to expel a volatile spray that is "
"highly toxic to fungal life forms."
msgstr ""
"殺菌液を満たした、カートリッジ型手榴弾。使用するとピンを抜き、導火線に点火して起動状態の殺菌ガス手榴弾になる。5秒後に真菌にとって極めて有害な揮発性スプレーを周囲に噴出する。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "armed fungicidal gas canister"
msgid_plural "armed fungicidal gas canisters"
msgstr[0] "殺菌ガス手榴弾 [放出中]"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'armed fungicidal gas canister'}
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"This fungicidal bomb has had its pin removed and is expelling highly toxic "
"gas."
msgstr "殺菌ガス手榴弾のピンは既に引かれており、猛毒のガスを放出している。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "makeshift fungicidal gas grenade"
msgid_plural "makeshift fungicidal gas grenades"
msgstr[0] "自作殺菌ガス手榴弾"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'makeshift fungicidal gas grenade'}
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"This is a makeshift canister grenade filled with fungicidal solution.  Use "
"this item to pull the pin and light the fuse, turning it into an active "
"fungicidal grenade.  In five turns it will begin to expel a volatile spray "
"that is highly toxic to fungal life forms."
msgstr ""
"殺菌液を満たした簡易カートリッジ型手榴弾。使用するとピンを引き、導火線に点火して起動状態の殺菌ガス手榴弾になる。5ターン後に揮発性のスプレーを噴出し始める。このスプレーは真菌系生命体にとって極めて毒性が高い。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "armed makeshift fungicidal gas canister"
msgid_plural "armed makeshift fungicidal gas canisters"
msgstr[0] "自作殺菌ガス手榴弾 [放出中]"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'armed makeshift fungicidal gas canister'}
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"This makeshift fungicidal bomb has had its pin removed and is expelling "
"highly toxic haze."
msgstr "自作殺菌ガス手榴弾のピンは既に引かれており、猛毒のガスを放出している。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "makeshift gas grenade"
msgid_plural "makeshift gas grenades"
msgstr[0] "急造ガス手榴弾"

#. ~ Use action menu_text for {'str': 'makeshift gas grenade'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "Arm"
msgstr "起動する"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'makeshift gas grenade'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "You arm the makeshift gas canister."
msgstr "自作催涙弾を起動した。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'makeshift gas grenade'}
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"This is a crude gasbomb using household chemicals.  Use this item to arm it."
"  In three turns it will begin to expel a highly toxic gas for a short time."
"  This gas poisons those exposed to it, in addition to obscuring vision and "
"scent."
msgstr "家庭用化学品で適当に作った催涙弾。使用して起動する。3ターン後に一時的に有毒ガスを噴出。このガスに入ると視界と嗅覚が遮断される。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "active makeshift gas grenade"
msgid_plural "active makeshift gas grenades"
msgstr[0] "急造ガス手榴弾 [起動中]"

#. ~ Use action no_deactivate_msg for {'str': 'active makeshift gas grenade'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "You've already armed the %s, try throwing it instead."
msgstr "すでに%sを起動済みだ。投げたほうがいい。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'active makeshift gas grenade'}
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"This homemade canister of poison gas has been unsealed, and is (or will "
"shortly be) expelling highly toxic gas.  You should consider getting rid of "
"it soon."
msgstr "この自家製の毒ガスカートリッジは密封が解かれており、まもなく極めて有毒なガスを放出する。早急に処分したほうがよい。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "grenade"
msgid_plural "grenades"
msgstr[0] "手榴弾"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'grenade'}.
#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'incendiary grenade'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "You pull the pin on the grenade."
msgstr "手榴弾のピンを引き抜いた。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'grenade'}
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"This is a military-grade fragmentary hand grenade.  Use this item to pull "
"the pin and light the fuse.  You will then have five turns before it "
"explodes; throwing it would be a good idea."
msgstr "軍用の破片手榴弾。使用するとピンを引き、導火線に点火する。5ターン後に爆発するため、投げたほうがよい。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "active grenade"
msgid_plural "active grenades"
msgstr[0] "手榴弾 [起動中]"

#. ~ Use action no_deactivate_msg for {'str': 'active grenade'}.
#. ~ Use action no_deactivate_msg for {'str': 'active scrambler grenade'}.
#. ~ Use action no_deactivate_msg for {'str': 'active makeshift grenade'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "You've already pulled the %s's pin; try throwing it instead."
msgstr "すでに%sのピンを抜いている。投げたほうがいい。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'active grenade'}
#. ~ Description for {'str': 'active improvised grenade'}
#. ~ Description for {'str': 'active makeshift grenade'}
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"This is an active grenade, and will explode any second now.  Better throw "
"it!"
msgstr "起動中の手榴弾。いつ爆発してもおかしくない。さっさと投げたほうがいい！"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "EMP grenade"
msgid_plural "EMP grenades"
msgstr[0] "EMP手榴弾"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'EMP grenade'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "You pull the pin on the EMP grenade."
msgstr "EMP手榴弾のピンを引き抜いた。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'EMP grenade'}
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"This is a grenade that generates an electromagnetic pulse with a low-"
"inductance capacitor bank discharged into a single-loop antenna.  Use this "
"item to pull the pin and light the fuse, turning it into an active EMP "
"grenade.  You will then have three turns before it detonates, creating an "
"EMP field that damages robots and drains bionic energy."
msgstr ""
"低インダクタンスコンデンサバンクを単一周波アンテナに放電させ、電磁パルスを発生させる手榴弾。使用するとピンを引いて起動し、3ターン後に爆発し、ロボットにダメージを与え、義体電力を奪うEMPフィールドを発生させる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/grenade.json
msgid "active EMP grenade"
msgid_plural "active EMP grenades"
msgstr[0] "EMP手榴弾 [起動中]"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'active EMP grenade'}
#. ~ Description for active EMP grenade
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/grenade.json
msgid ""
"This EMP grenade is active, and will shortly detonate, creating a large EMP "
"field that damages robots and drains bionic energy.  You may not want to be "
"holding it much longer."
msgstr ""
"このEMP手榴弾は起動中で、まもなく爆発してロボットにダメージを与え、義体電力を奪う広範囲のEMPフィールドを発生させる。これ以上持っているのは得策ではない。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "incendiary grenade"
msgid_plural "incendiary grenades"
msgstr[0] "焼夷手榴弾"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'incendiary grenade'}
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"This is a military-grade incendiary hand grenade.  Use this item to pull the"
" pin and light the fuse.  You will then have five turns before it explodes "
"into a raging inferno; throwing it would be a good idea."
msgstr "軍用の焼夷手榴弾。使用して安全ピンを抜き、導火線に点火する。爆発まで5ターンで激しい炎の爆発を起こすため、投げたほうがよい。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "active incendiary grenade"
msgid_plural "active incendiary grenades"
msgstr[0] "焼夷手榴弾 [起動中]"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'active incendiary grenade'}
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"This is an active incendiary grenade, likely to burst into an inferno any "
"second now.  Better throw it!"
msgstr "ピンが抜かれた焼夷手榴弾。まもなく爆発して炎の地獄を引き起こす。急いで投げろ！"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "canister grenade"
msgid_plural "canister grenades"
msgstr[0] "破片手榴弾"

#. ~ Use action message for {'str': 'canister grenade'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json src/iuse.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "You pull the pin on the %s."
msgstr "%sのピンを抜いた。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "tear gas grenade"
msgid_plural "tear gas grenades"
msgstr[0] "催涙手榴弾"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'tear gas grenade'}
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"This is a canister grenade filled with noxious irritant.  Use this item to "
"pull the pin and light the fuse, turning it into an active tear gas grenade."
"  In five turns it will begin to expel a highly toxic gas for some time.  "
"This gas damages and slows those who enter it, as well as obscuring vision "
"and scent."
msgstr ""
"有害な刺激物で満たされたカートリッジ型手榴弾。使用するとピンを引き、導火線に点火して起動状態の催涙手榴弾になる。5ターン後にしばらくの間、極めて有毒なガスを噴出する。このガスにさらされた者はダメージを受け、行動が鈍り、視界や嗅覚も妨害される。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "armed tear gas grenade"
msgid_plural "armed tear gas grenades"
msgstr[0] "催涙手榴弾 [起動中]"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'armed tear gas grenade'}
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"This smoke bomb has had its pin removed and is expelling highly toxic gas."
msgstr "この煙幕弾はピンが抜けており、極めて有毒なガスを噴出している。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "insecticidal gas grenade"
msgid_plural "insecticidal gas grenades"
msgstr[0] "殺虫ガス手榴弾"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'insecticidal gas grenade'}
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"This is a canister grenade filled with insecticidal solution.  Use this item"
" to pull the pin and light the fuse, turning it into an active insecticidal "
"grenade.  In five turns it will begin to expel a volatile spray that is "
"highly toxic to insect life forms."
msgstr ""
"これは殺虫液で満たされたカートリッジ型手榴弾。使用するとピンを引き、導火線に点火して起動状態の殺虫ガス手榴弾になる。5ターン後に揮発性のスプレーを噴出し始める。このスプレーは昆虫系生命体にとって極めて毒性が高い。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "armed insecticidal gas grenade"
msgid_plural "armed insecticidal gas grenades"
msgstr[0] "殺虫ガス手榴弾 [起動中]"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'armed insecticidal gas grenade'}
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"This insecticidal bomb has had its pin removed and is expelling highly toxic"
" haze."
msgstr "この殺虫ガス手榴弾はピンが抜けており、極めて有毒なガスを噴出している。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "makeshift insecticidal gas grenade"
msgid_plural "makeshift insecticidal gas grenades"
msgstr[0] "自作殺虫ガス手榴弾"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'makeshift insecticidal gas grenade'}
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"This is a makeshift canister grenade filled with insecticidal solution.  Use"
" this item to pull the pin and light the fuse, turning it into an active "
"insecticidal grenade.  In five turns it will begin to expel a volatile spray"
" that is highly toxic to insect life forms."
msgstr ""
"これは殺虫液で満たされた簡易カートリッジ型手榴弾。使用するとピンを引き、導火線に点火して起動状態の殺虫ガス手榴弾になる。5ターン後に揮発性のスプレーを噴出し始める。このスプレーは昆虫系生命体にとって極めて毒性が高い。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "armed makeshift insecticidal gas grenade"
msgid_plural "armed makeshift insecticidal gas grenades"
msgstr[0] "自作殺虫ガス手榴弾 [起動中]"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'armed makeshift insecticidal gas grenade'}
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"This makeshift insecticidal bomb has had its pin removed and is expelling "
"highly toxic haze."
msgstr "この自作殺虫ガス手榴弾は安全ピンが抜けており、極めて有毒なガスを噴出している。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "packed M72 LAW"
msgid_plural "packed M72 LAWs"
msgstr[0] "M72 LAW [梱包]"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'packed M72 LAW'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "You pull the activating lever, readying the LAW to fire."
msgstr "作動レバーを引いて、LAWを発射準備状態にした。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'packed M72 LAW'}
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"This is a M72 LAW, packed in its storage form with attached shoulder strap."
"  Use it to pop it out and make it ready to fire.  Once it is activated, it "
"cannot be repacked."
msgstr ""
"これは、ショルダーストラップが取り付けられた収納形態のM72 "
"LAWだ。これを使って展開し、発射準備を整える。一度起動すると、再度収納することはできない。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "improvised grenade"
msgid_plural "improvised grenades"
msgstr[0] "簡易手榴弾"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'improvised grenade'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"You light the fuse on the improvised grenade.  Throw it before it blows in "
"your face!"
msgstr "簡易手榴弾の導火線に点火した。顔面で爆発する前に投げ捨てろ！"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'improvised grenade'}
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"A improvised explosive device cobbled together from parts.  Use this item to"
" light the fuse.  You will then have some amount of time before it explodes;"
" throwing it would be a good idea."
msgstr "部品をかき集めて作った簡易爆発物。使用すると導火線に点火される。点火後、ある程度の時間で爆発するため、投げたほうがよい。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "active improvised grenade"
msgid_plural "active improvised grenades"
msgstr[0] "簡易手榴弾 [起動中]"

#. ~ Use action no_deactivate_msg for {'str': 'active improvised grenade'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "You've already lit the %s's fuse; try throwing it instead."
msgstr "すでに%sの導火線に点火済みだ。投げたほうがよい。"

#. ~ Use action sound_msg for {'str': 'active improvised grenade'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "sssssh."
msgstr "シューー。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "mininuke"
msgid_plural "mininukes"
msgstr[0] "小型核"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'mininuke'}
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"This is an extremely powerful weapon, a portable nuclear bomb.  Use it to "
"activate the timer.  You guess that the explosion would be large enough to "
"take out a small house."
msgstr "極めて協力な携行型核爆弾。使用してタイマーを起動する。この爆弾の爆発威力なら、小さな家屋一軒程度は吹き飛ばせるだろう。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "mininuke (armed)"
msgid_plural "mininukes (armed)"
msgstr[0] "ミニニューク[起動中]"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'mininuke (armed)', 'str_pl': 'mininukes
#. (armed)'}
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"This miniature nuclear bomb has a light blinking on the side, showing that "
"it will soon explode.  You should probably get far, far away from it."
msgstr "この小型核爆弾の側面で光が点滅し、まもなく爆発することを示している。遠くへ、できる限り遠くへ逃げたほうがよい。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "Molotov cocktail"
msgid_plural "Molotov cocktails"
msgstr[0] "モロトフカクテル"

#. ~ Use action menu_text for {'str': 'Molotov cocktail'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "Light rag"
msgstr "点火する"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'Molotov cocktail'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "You light the Molotov cocktail!"
msgstr "モロトフ・カクテルに火をつけた！"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Molotov cocktail'}
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"A bottle of flammable liquid with a rag inserted.  Use this item to light "
"the rag.  You will, of course, need a lighter or matches in your inventory "
"to do this.  After lighting it, throw it to cause fires."
msgstr ""
"可燃性液体の入った瓶に布きれが差し込まれている。使用して布に点火する。もちろん、ライターやマッチを所持している必要がある。点火後、投げて火災を発生させることができる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "Molotov cocktail (lit)"
msgid_plural "Molotov cocktails (lit)"
msgstr[0] "モロトフカクテル[点火中]"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Molotov cocktail (lit)', 'str_pl': 'Molotov
#. cocktails (lit)'}
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"A bottle of flammable liquid with a flaming rag stoppered in its neck.  "
"Throwing it will shatter the bottle on impact and ignite a fireball.  You "
"can also activate it to smash it on yourself, but why would you want to do "
"that?"
msgstr ""
"可燃性液体と可燃性布地で満たされた瓶。投げると瓶が割れて火炎球が爆発する。必要なら拳で叩いて即座に破裂させることもできるが、あえてそんな真似をする必要があるか？"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "improvised pipe bomb"
msgid_plural "improvised pipe bombs"
msgstr[0] "簡易パイプ爆弾"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'improvised pipe bomb'}
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"This is a section of a pipe filled with stable explosives and a primer.  Use"
" this item to light the fuse, which gives you six seconds to get away from "
"it before it detonates.  You'll need a lighter or some matches to use it."
msgstr "安定化された爆薬と触媒をパイプに詰めた。使用すると導火線に点火される。爆発まで6秒ある。使用するにはライターやマッチが必要だ。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "active improvised pipe bomb"
msgid_plural "active improvised pipe bombs"
msgstr[0] "簡易パイプ爆弾 [点火中]"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "scrambler grenade"
msgid_plural "scrambler grenades"
msgstr[0] "攪乱手榴弾"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'scrambler grenade'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "You pull the pin on the scrambler grenade."
msgstr "攪乱手榴弾のピンを引き抜いた。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'scrambler grenade'}
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"This is a specialized grenade, designed to scramble robots' IFF control "
"chips.  This converts the robot to your side for a short time, before the "
"backup systems kick in.  Use this item to pull the pin and light the fuse, "
"turning it into an active scrambler grenade."
msgstr ""
"ロボットのIFF操縦チップを混乱させるための特殊な手榴弾。この影響を受けたロボットは、バックアップシステムが作動するまでの間、一時的に味方と認識するようになる。使用して安全ピンを抜き、導火線に点火し、起動状態の攪乱手榴弾にする。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "active scrambler grenade"
msgid_plural "active scrambler grenades"
msgstr[0] "攪乱手榴弾 [起動中]"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'active scrambler grenade'}
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"This scrambler grenade is active, and will soon detonate, releasing a "
"control wave that temporarily converts robots to your side."
msgstr "攪乱手榴弾は起動中で、まもなく爆発し、ロボットを一時的に味方にする。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "smoke bomb"
msgid_plural "smoke bombs"
msgstr[0] "発煙手榴弾"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'smoke bomb'}
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"This is a canister grenade filled with a variety of pyrotechnic chemicals.  "
"Use this item to pull the pin and light the fuse, turning it into an active "
"smoke bomb.  Five turns after you do that, it will begin to expel a thick "
"black smoke.  This smoke will slow those who enter it, as well as obscuring "
"vision and scent."
msgstr ""
"多種の発火性化学物質が詰まったカートリッジ型手榴弾。使用するとピンが抜けて導火線に点火される。5ターン後に濃い黒煙を噴出する。この煙は敵の行動を鈍らせ、視界と嗅覚も遮断する。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "armed smoke bomb"
msgid_plural "armed smoke bombs"
msgstr[0] "発煙手榴弾 [発煙中]"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'armed smoke bomb'}
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "This smoke bomb has had its pin removed and is expelling thick smoke."
msgstr "発煙手榴弾のピンは既に引かれており、濃い煙を放出している。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "small improvised frag device"
msgid_plural "small improvised frag devices"
msgstr[0] "小型簡易クレイモア"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'small improvised frag device'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"You light the fuse on the small improvised fragmentation device.  Get rid of"
" it quickly!"
msgstr "小型簡易クレイモアの起爆装置を起動した。急いで処分しろ！"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'small improvised frag device'}
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"This is a home-made explosive device, consisting of a large plastic jug "
"filled with stable explosives and scrap metal, equipped with a long fuse.  "
"Use this item to light the fuse.  Once you do it should explode in about 20 "
"seconds. "
msgstr ""
"家庭で作られた爆発装置。安定性のある爆薬と金属片を詰めた大型プラスチック容器に、長い導火線が取り付けられている。使用して導火線に点火する。点火後、約20秒で爆発する。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'small improvised frag device'}
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"This is a home-made explosive device, consisting of a large plastic jug "
"filled with stable explosives and scrap metal, whose fuse has been lit, its "
"final countdown starting."
msgstr "大型プラスチック容器に安定性のある爆薬と金属片を詰めた自作爆発装置。導火線に点火されており、爆発は間近に迫っている。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "improvised barrel bomb"
msgid_plural "improvised barrel bombs"
msgstr[0] "簡易ドラム爆弾"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'improvised barrel bomb'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "You light the fuse on the barrel bomb.  Clear the area!"
msgstr "ドラム爆弾の導火線を点火した。逃げろ！"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'improvised barrel bomb'}
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"This is a metal keg, filled with a lot of stable explosives.  Contains a "
"volatile explosive core so 100 seconds after the fuse has been lit the "
"charge detonates completely and delivers its entire destructive power to "
"everything in sight."
msgstr ""
"安定性の高い爆薬がたくさん詰まった金属製の樽。中心部には不安的な爆薬が混じっているため、導火線に点火してから100秒後には全体が反応し、周囲のものを完全に破壊し尽す。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "active improvised barrel bomb"
msgid_plural "active improvised barrel bombs"
msgstr[0] "簡易ドラム爆弾 [点火中]"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'active improvised barrel bomb'}
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"This is a metal keg, filled with a lot of stable explosives.  The fuse has "
"been lit and once it ignites the primary explosive, the bomb will detonate "
"and rain fire and steel on everything in sight."
msgstr ""
"安定性の高い爆薬がたくさん詰まった金属製の樽。導火線には火がついており、起爆薬が反応すればその瞬間に大爆発を引き起こし、周囲に炎と鋼の雨を降らせる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "rocket candy"
msgid_plural "rocket candies"
msgstr[0] "ロケットキャンディ"

#. ~ Use action menu_text for {'str': 'rocket candy', 'str_pl': 'rocket
#. candies'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "Light candy"
msgstr "キャンディに点火する"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'rocket candy', 'str_pl': 'rocket candies'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "You light the rocket candy on fire.  Throw it!"
msgstr "ロケットキャンディの導火線に火をつけた。投げろ！"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'rocket candy', 'str_pl': 'rocket candies'}
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"A pear-shaped chunk of rocket candy obtained by heating saltpeter with sugar"
" and casting the obtained liquid.  Can serve as a rocket fuel, but also as a"
" smokescreen - if you lit the narrow end, you should be able to throw it "
"before the flame reaches the broad end."
msgstr ""
"砂糖と硝酸カリウムを混ぜて加熱し、出てきた液体を詰めて作った洋ナシ型のロケットキャンディー。この液体はロケットの燃料だけでなく、煙幕としての役割も果たす。細い方の導火線に火を点けて、根元に達する前に投げることができる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "burning rocket candy"
msgid_plural "burning rocket candies"
msgstr[0] "ロケットキャンディ [点火中]"

#. ~ Use action no_deactivate_msg for {'str': 'burning rocket candy',
#. 'str_pl': 'burning rocket candies'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "You've already lit the fuse - get rid of it immediately!"
msgstr "導火線にはすでに火をつけてある。すぐに投げ捨てろ！"

#. ~ Use action sound_msg for {'str': 'burning rocket candy', 'str_pl':
#. 'burning rocket candies'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid "Hsssss."
msgstr "シューッ。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'burning rocket candy', 'str_pl': 'burning rocket
#. candies'}
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"This is a chunk of rocket candy that has been lit on fire and burns with a "
"loud hiss, spewing forth large amounts of smoke."
msgstr "甲高い音を立てながら煙と火花を大量に吹き出しているロケットキャンディ。"

#: data/json/items/tool/fire.json
msgid "electric firestarter"
msgid_plural "electric firestarters"
msgstr[0] "電動発火装置"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'electric firestarter'}
#: data/json/items/tool/fire.json
msgid ""
"This is a crudely made electric firestarter, which can function as an "
"inefficient lighter."
msgstr "大雑把に作られた電動発火装置。簡易ライターとして使用できる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/fire.json
msgid "fire drill"
msgid_plural "fire drills"
msgstr[0] "火起こし器"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'fire drill'}
#: data/json/items/tool/fire.json
msgid ""
"This fire drill is a simple item for starting fires; it is made from two "
"pieces of wood and some string.  Since it is constructed out of simple "
"materials, it's slow and rather difficult to get a fire started using this "
"tool."
msgstr ""
"この火おこしドリルは火を起こすための簡素な道具で、二つの木片と紐で作られている。単純な素材で構成されているため、火を起こすのに時間がかかり、かなり使いにくい。"

#: data/json/items/tool/fire.json
msgid "camp fire drill"
msgid_plural "camp fire drills"
msgstr[0] "強化火起こし器"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'camp fire drill'}
#: data/json/items/tool/fire.json
msgid ""
"This stout fire drill is a simple item for starting fires; it is made from "
"two pieces of wood and some string.  Since it is constructed out of simple "
"materials, it's slow and rather difficult to get a fire started using this "
"tool."
msgstr ""
"この頑丈な火おこしドリルは火を起こすための簡素な道具で、二つの木片と紐で作られている。単純な素材でできているため、この道具を使って火を起こすのは時間がかかり、かなり難しい。"

#: data/json/items/tool/fire.json
msgid "flint and steel"
msgid_plural "sets of flint and steel"
msgstr[0] "ファイヤースターター"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'flint and steel', 'str_pl': 'sets of flint and
#. steel'}
#: data/json/items/tool/fire.json
msgid ""
"This is a magnesium bar and a carbon steel striker.  Use it to spark a "
"flame."
msgstr "マグネシウム製の棒と炭素鋼の火打ち金。火花を飛ばして着火する。"

#: data/json/items/tool/fire.json
msgid "lighter"
msgid_plural "lighters"
msgstr[0] "ライター"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'lighter'}
#: data/json/items/tool/fire.json
msgid ""
"This is a disposable plastic lighter.  A lighter must be carried to use "
"various drugs, like cigarettes, or to light things like Molotov cocktails.  "
"You can also use a lighter to light nearby items on fire."
msgstr ""
"使い捨てのプラスチックライター。タバコなどのドラッグを吸う際や、モロトフカクテルなどを点火する際には、ライターを所持している必要がある。また、ライターを使って周囲の物に火をつけることもできる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/fire.json
msgid "magnifying glass"
msgid_plural "magnifying glasses"
msgstr[0] "虫眼鏡"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'magnifying glass', 'str_pl': 'magnifying
#. glasses'}
#: data/json/items/tool/fire.json
msgid ""
"This is a magnifying glass.  May be useful for starting fires during sunny "
"skies."
msgstr "虫眼鏡。晴天時に火を起こすのに役立つかもしれない。"

#: data/json/items/tool/fire.json
msgid "matchbook"
msgid_plural "matchbooks"
msgstr[0] "マッチ箱"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'matchbook'}
#: data/json/items/tool/fire.json
msgid ""
"This is a small book of matches with a coarse strike surface on the outside "
"flap.  Matches must be carried to use various drugs like cigarettes, or to "
"light things like Molotov cocktails.  You can also use matches to light "
"nearby items on fire."
msgstr ""
"外側のフラップに粗い発火面を持つ小さなマッチ箱。タバコなどのドラッグを吸う際や、モロトフカクテルなどを点火するには、マッチを所持している必要がある。また、マッチを使って周囲の物に火をつけることもできる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/fire.json
msgid "refillable lighter"
msgid_plural "refillable lighters"
msgstr[0] "詰め替え式ライター"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'refillable lighter'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/fire.json
msgid "You flick the lighter."
msgstr "ライターの火を点けた。"

#. ~ Use action need_charges_msg for {'str': 'refillable lighter'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/fire.json src/activity_actor.cpp src/explosion.cpp
#: src/gates.cpp src/iuse.cpp
msgid "Nothing happens."
msgstr "何も起こらない。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'refillable lighter'}
#: data/json/items/tool/fire.json
msgid ""
"This is a lighter featuring a flip top cover and refuelable tank.  A lighter"
" must be carried to use various drugs, like cigarettes, or to light things "
"like Molotov cocktails.  You can also use a lighter to light nearby items on"
" fire."
msgstr ""
"フリップトップ式のカバーと詰め替え可能な燃料タンクを備えたライター。タバコなどのドラッグを吸う際や、モロトフカクテルなどを点火するには、ライターを所持している必要がある。また、ライターを使って周囲の物に火をつけることもできる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/fire.json
msgid "refillable lighter (lit)"
msgid_plural "refillable lighters (lit)"
msgstr[0] "詰め替え式ライター[点火中]"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'refillable lighter (lit)', 'str_pl':
#. 'refillable lighters (lit)'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/fire.json
msgid "You extinguish the lighter."
msgstr "ライターの火を消した。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'refillable lighter (lit)', 'str_pl': 'refillable
#. lighters (lit)'}
#: data/json/items/tool/fire.json
msgid ""
"This is a lighter featuring a flip top cover and refuelable tank.  It is "
"lit."
msgstr "フリップトップ式のカバーと詰め替え可能な燃料タンクを備えたライター。現在、点火中だ。"

#: data/json/items/tool/fire.json
msgid "ember carrier"
msgid_plural "ember carriers"
msgstr[0] "火種入れ"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'ember carrier'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/fire.json
msgid "You light the tinder."
msgstr "火口に火をつけた。"

#. ~ Use action need_charges_msg for {'str': 'ember carrier'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/fire.json
msgid "The ember carrier is out of tinder."
msgstr "火種入れの火口が尽きた。"

#. ~ Use action need_fire_msg for {'str': 'ember carrier'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/fire.json
msgid "You need a lighter or fire to light this."
msgstr "点火するにはライターや火が必要だ。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'ember carrier'}
#: data/json/items/tool/fire.json
msgid ""
"This is a small container for holding tinder, with holes punched in it to "
"provide a controlled airflow.  It can nurture a smoldering ember for a long "
"time, to start fires without modern tools."
msgstr ""
"火口を収納する小型容器。空気の流れを制御するために穴が開けられている。煙を出す火種を長時間維持でき、近代的な道具を使わずに火を起こすのに役立つ。"

#: data/json/items/tool/fire.json
msgid "ember carrier (lit)"
msgid_plural "ember carriers (lit)"
msgstr[0] "火種入れ [点火中]"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'ember carrier (lit)', 'str_pl': 'ember
#. carriers (lit)'}.
#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'hobo stove (lit)', 'str_pl': 'hobo stoves
#. (lit)'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/fire.json data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "The ember is extinguished."
msgstr "火口が燃え尽きた。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'ember carrier (lit)', 'str_pl': 'ember carriers
#. (lit)'}
#: data/json/items/tool/fire.json
msgid ""
"This is a small container for holding tinder, with holes punched in it to "
"provide a controlled airflow.  An ember is smoldering inside it, and can be "
"used to start a campfire."
msgstr "火口を収納する小型容器。空気の流れを制御するための穴が開いている。内部では火種がわずかに燃えており、焚き火を起こすのに使える。"

#: data/json/items/tool/fire.json
msgid "electric lighter"
msgid_plural "electric lighters"
msgstr[0] "電気ライター"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'electric lighter'}
#: data/json/items/tool/fire.json
msgid ""
"A battery-powered lighter.  More efficient than a crude electric "
"firestarter, its batteries last for quite a while."
msgstr "電池式のライター。自作の電気発火装置よりも効率が高く、電池はかなり長持ちする。"

#: data/json/items/tool/fire.json
msgid "survivor lighter"
msgid_plural "survivor lighters"
msgstr[0] "サバイバーライター"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'survivor lighter'}
#: data/json/items/tool/fire.json
msgid ""
"This makeshift refillable lighter contains a simple wick and ignitor that "
"can be used with improvised fuels such as diesel or lamp oil."
msgstr ""
"この急造の詰め替え式ライターには、シンプルな芯と点火装置が内蔵されており、ディーゼル燃料やランプオイルといった間に合わせの燃料で使うことができる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/firefighting.json
msgid "crash axe"
msgid_plural "crash axes"
msgstr[0] "非常用斧"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'crash axe'}
#: data/json/items/tool/firefighting.json
msgid ""
"A short lightweight emergency tool with a quarter circular blade, a short "
"pick opposite the blade and an insulated handle.  Used on airplanes to chop "
"down or pry walls or cabinets to gain access in case of fire."
msgstr ""
"四分一円形の刃を持つ、短く軽量な非常用工具。刃の反対側には短いピックが付き、絶縁されたハンドルを備える。火災時に壁や収納庫を破壊・解体するために、航空機に備え付けられている。"

#: data/json/items/tool/firefighting.json
msgid "large fire extinguisher"
msgid_plural "large fire extinguishers"
msgstr[0] "大型消火器"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'large fire extinguisher'}
#: data/json/items/tool/firefighting.json
msgid ""
"This is an emergency fire extinguisher containing five gallons of fire "
"retardant foam.  It would be useful for putting out adjacent fires."
msgstr "発火防止用の泡を約18.9リットル含んだ非常用消火器。近くの火事を消すのに役立つ。"

#: data/json/items/tool/firefighting.json
msgid "fire axe"
msgid_plural "fire axes"
msgstr[0] "消火斧"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'fire axe'}
#: data/json/items/tool/firefighting.json
msgid ""
"This is a large, two-handed pickhead axe normally used by firefighters.  It "
"makes a powerful melee weapon, but is a bit slow to recover between swings."
msgstr ""
"主に消防士が使用する、片方に尖ったピック状の刃が付いた大型の両手用アックスだ。強力な近接武器だが、振りかざす動作が大きいため次の攻撃に時間がかかる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/firefighting.json
msgid "Halligan bar"
msgid_plural "Halligan bars"
msgstr[0] "ハリガンバール"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Halligan bar'}
#: data/json/items/tool/firefighting.json
msgid ""
"This is a heavy multiple-use tool commonly carried by firefighters, law "
"enforcement, and military rescue units.  Use it to open locked doors without"
" destroying them or to lift manhole covers.  You could also wield it to bash"
" some heads in."
msgstr ""
"消防士や警察官、軍人がよく携行する多目的ツール。これを使って鍵のかかったドアやマンホールの蓋を開けられる。装備して誰かの頭を殴るのにも使える。"

#: data/json/items/tool/firefighting.json
msgid "small fire extinguisher"
msgid_plural "small fire extinguishers"
msgstr[0] "小型消火器"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'small fire extinguisher'}
#: data/json/items/tool/firefighting.json
msgid ""
"This is a hand held fire extinguisher containing a liter of highly "
"compressed CO2 gas.  It would be useful for putting out adjacent fires."
msgstr "高圧で圧縮された1LのCO2ガスが入った小型消火器だ。隣接する火事を消すのに効果的だ。"

#: data/json/items/tool/firefighting.json
msgid "throwable fire extinguisher"
msgid_plural "throwable fire extinguishers"
msgstr[0] "投擲式消火器"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'throwable fire extinguisher'}
#: data/json/items/tool/firefighting.json
msgid ""
"This is a fire extinguisher in grenade form.  While not as effective as a "
"regular fire extinguisher, you can use it from a distance.  It is activated "
"by heat, so just throw it into the flames."
msgstr "投擲式の消火器だ。通常の消火器ほど効果はないが、遠くから使用できる。熱で作動するため、炎の中に投げ入れるだけでよい。"

#: data/json/items/tool/firefighting.json
msgid "pike pole"
msgid_plural "pike poles"
msgstr[0] "パイクポール"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'pike pole'}
#: data/json/items/tool/firefighting.json
msgid ""
"A durable tool consisting of a sturdy fiberglass shaft tipped with a small "
"steel hook."
msgstr "丈夫なグラスファイバー製の軸の先端に、小さなスチール製のフックが付いている。"

#: data/json/items/tool/firefighting.json
msgid "New York hook"
msgid_plural "New York hooks"
msgstr[0] "ニューヨーク・フック"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'New York hook'}
#: data/json/items/tool/firefighting.json
msgid ""
"A shaft with a pair of hooks on one end and a pry bar on the other, forged "
"from a single piece of steel."
msgstr "一端にフック、反対側にクラウバーが付いた長めの棒状の道具。一本の鋼材を鍛えて作られている。"

#: data/json/items/tool/fishing.json
msgid "plastic fish trap"
msgid_plural "plastic fish traps"
msgstr[0] "プラスチック製魚罠"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'plastic fish trap'}
#: data/json/items/tool/fishing.json
msgid ""
"This is a makeshift fish trap made from plastic bottles.  It's simple, even "
"primitive, but easy to use.  The principle of action: the fish swims inside "
"for bait, but can't get out.  Not humane, prohibited by law, but there are "
"no cops left to care."
msgstr ""
"これはプラスチック瓶で作られた簡易的な魚罠だ。単純で、いわば原始的だが使いやすい。仕組みは簡単で、魚が餌を求めて中に入ってしまうが、出口が見つからずに脱出できない。人道的ではないし、法的にも禁止されているが、もはや取り締まる警官はいない。"

#: data/json/items/tool/fishing.json
msgid "clay fish trap"
msgid_plural "clay fish traps"
msgstr[0] "粘土製魚罠"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'clay fish trap'}
#: data/json/items/tool/fishing.json
msgid ""
"This is a fish trap made from clay canisters, closely resembling old "
"Japanese squid traps.  It's simple, even primitive, but easy to use.  The "
"principle of action: the fish swims inside for bait, but can't get out.  Not"
" humane, prohibited by law, but there are no cops left to care."
msgstr ""
"これは粘土製の容器で作られた魚罠で、昔の日本のイカ壺に良く似ている。単純で、いわば原始的だが使いやすい。仕組みは簡単で、魚が餌を求めて中に入ってしまうが、出口が見つからずに脱出できない。人道的ではないし、法的にも禁止されているが、もはや取り締まる警官はいない。"

#: data/json/items/tool/fishing.json
msgid "fishing hook"
msgid_plural "fishing hooks"
msgstr[0] "釣り針"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'fishing hook'}
#: data/json/items/tool/fishing.json
msgid "A simple fishing hook."
msgstr "シンプルな釣り針。"

#: data/json/items/tool/fishing.json
msgid "improvised fishing hook"
msgid_plural "improvised fishing hooks"
msgstr[0] "簡易釣り針"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'improvised fishing hook'}
#: data/json/items/tool/fishing.json
msgid "An improvised fishing hook carved from wood or bone."
msgstr "木や骨を削って作られた簡易的な釣り針だ。"

#: data/json/items/tool/fishing.json
msgid "basic fishing rod"
msgid_plural "basic fishing rods"
msgstr[0] "簡易釣り竿"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'basic fishing rod'}
#: data/json/items/tool/fishing.json
msgid ""
"'Fishing rod' might be a bit too charitable of a description.  In truth, "
"this is a stick with a piece of string and a hook."
msgstr "「釣り竿」と呼ぶのは少々大げさかもしれない。実際のところ、これは紐と針が付いただけの棒だ。"

#: data/json/items/tool/fishing.json
msgid "pro fishing rod"
msgid_plural "pro fishing rods"
msgstr[0] "プロ用釣り竿"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'pro fishing rod'}
#: data/json/items/tool/fishing.json
msgid ""
"A professional fishing rod with a matching set of weights.  With this you "
"should be able to catch 'em all."
msgstr "専用のウェイトセット付きプロ用釣り竿。これがあれば、すべての魚を釣り上げられるだろう。"

#: data/json/items/tool/handloading.json
msgid "hand press"
msgid_plural "hand presses"
msgstr[0] "ハンドプレス"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'hand press', 'str_pl': 'hand presses'}
#: data/json/items/tool/handloading.json
msgid ""
"This is a small hand press for hand loading firearm ammunition.  It comes "
"with everything you need to start hand loading your own munitions."
msgstr "銃器用弾薬を手詰めするための小型ハンドプレス。独自の手作り弾薬を作るのに必要なすべてが含まれている。"

#: data/json/items/tool/handloading.json
msgid "makeshift shotshell press"
msgid_plural "makeshift shotshell presses"
msgstr[0] "ショットガン弾用簡易プレス機"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'makeshift shotshell press', 'str_pl': 'makeshift
#. shotshell presses'}
#: data/json/items/tool/handloading.json
msgid ""
"This is a collection of items improvised for field reloading of shotshells."
"  A plank with a hole cut in the center, a medium-sized nail, and a "
"selection of whittled dowels are used to seat wads, decap primers, and "
"reprime (carefully!) hulls.  The opposite side of the plank has been shaped "
"to allow for roll crimping of the plastic hulls."
msgstr ""
"散弾用の薬莢を現地で再装填するために用意された簡易工具のセットだ。中央に穴の開いた板、中くらいの釘、削り棒が含まれており、これを使ってパウダー・ガスケットの固定、プライマーの除去、および（慎重に！）薬莢への再点火装置の取り付けを行う。板の反対側は特殊な形状に加工されており、プラスチック製薬莢のロールクラインプが可能になっている。"

#: data/json/items/tool/handloading.json
msgid "kinetic bullet puller"
msgid_plural "kinetic bullet pullers"
msgstr[0] "弾薬分解ツール"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'kinetic bullet puller'}
#: data/json/items/tool/handloading.json
msgid "This is a tool used for properly disassembling firearm ammunition."
msgstr "弾薬の分解に用いる工具。"

#: data/json/items/tool/handloading.json
msgid "reloading press"
msgid_plural "reloading presses"
msgstr[0] "弾薬圧着機"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'reloading press', 'str_pl': 'reloading presses'}
#: data/json/items/tool/handloading.json
msgid ""
"This is an all-in-one handloading tool consisting of a multi-stage press, "
"bullet molds, a hotplate, and a collet puller for disassembling cartridges."
"  It needs to be hooked up as grid furniture or mounted on a vehicle, but "
"once you do it can handle both making your own ammunition and taking ammo "
"apart for materials."
msgstr ""
"弾薬を手作りするための多段式プレス、弾薬鋳型、ホットプレート、弾薬分解ツールが一式そろった装置だ。電力網に接続して家具として設置するか、車両に取り付ける必要があるが、一度設置すれば、自作弾薬の製造や弾薬の分解による素材調達に幅広く使える。"

#: data/json/items/tool/knives.json
msgid "copper knife"
msgid_plural "copper knives"
msgstr[0] "カッパーナイフ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'copper knife', 'str_pl': 'copper knives'}
#: data/json/items/tool/knives.json
msgid ""
"A knife consisting of crudely-worked copper, and a simple handle.  "
"Primitive, but a step above stone-age."
msgstr "粗く加工された銅製の刃とシンプルなハンドルからなるナイフ。原始的だが、石器時代よりは進んでいる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/knives.json
msgid "dive knife"
msgid_plural "dive knives"
msgstr[0] "ダイビングナイフ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'dive knife', 'str_pl': 'dive knives'}
#: data/json/items/tool/knives.json
msgid ""
"This is a short, sturdy knife with a serrated edge for cutting lines and "
"straps, and a blunt tip for prying.  Used primarily by divers, it is very "
"light and takes up virtually no space in one's pockets."
msgstr ""
"これは切り裂き用のノコギリ刃とレバー用の鈍い先端を持つ、短く頑丈なナイフだ。主にダイバーが使用し、非常に軽量でポケット内のスペースをほとんど取らない。"

#: data/json/items/tool/knives.json
msgid "honey scraper"
msgid_plural "honey scrapers"
msgstr[0] "ハニースクレーパー"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'honey scraper'}
#: data/json/items/tool/knives.json
msgid ""
"A sharp, knife-like tool used in harvesting honey from beehives.  Makes a "
"passable melee weapon."
msgstr "蜂の巣から蜂蜜を採取する際に使う鋭いナイフ状の道具。まともな近接武器としても使える。"

#: data/json/items/tool/knives.json
msgid "pocket knife"
msgid_plural "pocket knives"
msgstr[0] "ポケットナイフ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'pocket knife', 'str_pl': 'pocket knives'}
#: data/json/items/tool/knives.json
msgid ""
"This is a small pocket knife.  It isn't great for combat, but it's better "
"than nothing.  It's sharp enough to butcher with."
msgstr "これは小型のポケットナイフだ。戦闘には不向きだが、何も持たないよりはましだ。肉の解体ができるほどには鋭い。"

#: data/json/items/tool/knives.json
msgid "primitive knife"
msgid_plural "primitive knives"
msgstr[0] "原始的なナイフ"

#. ~ Conditional name for {'str': 'primitive knife', 'str_pl': 'primitive
#. knives'} when COMPONENT_ID matches rock
#: data/json/items/tool/knives.json
msgid "stone knife"
msgid_plural "stone knives"
msgstr[0] "ストーンナイフ"

#. ~ Conditional name for {'str': 'primitive knife', 'str_pl': 'primitive
#. knives'} when COMPONENT_ID matches ceramic
#: data/json/items/tool/knives.json
msgid "ceramic knife"
msgid_plural "ceramic knives"
msgstr[0] "セラミックナイフ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'primitive knife', 'str_pl': 'primitive knives'}
#: data/json/items/tool/knives.json
msgid ""
"This is a sharpened stone or shard of ceramic set into a hollowed handle.  "
"Not nearly as usable as a proper knife, but it's better than nothing."
msgstr "鋭く研いだ石や陶器の破片を、中が空洞になったハンドルに取り付けたもの。本物のナイフほど使いやすいわけではないが、ないよりはましだ。"

#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
msgid "digging stick"
msgid_plural "digging sticks"
msgstr[0] "掘削用の棒"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'digging stick'}
#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
msgid ""
"This is a large stick, with the end carved into a broad blade for digging.  "
"It could be used to dig shallow pits, but not deep ones."
msgstr "先端が広い刃状に彫り出された大きな棒だ。浅い穴を掘るのには使えるが、深い穴は掘れない。"

#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
msgid "trowel"
msgid_plural "trowels"
msgstr[0] "タマゴ取り"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'trowel'}
#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
msgid ""
"A small, sharp gardening shovel, perfect for digging up grubs and worms."
msgstr "小型で鋭い園芸シャベル。幼虫やミミズを掘り出すのに最適だ。"

#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
msgid "hoe"
msgid_plural "hoes"
msgstr[0] "鍬"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'hoe'}
#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
msgid ""
"This is a farming implement.  You can use it to turn tillable land into a "
"slow-to-cross pile of dirt, or dig a shallow pit."
msgstr "農具だ。耕作可能な土地を、通過に時間がかかる土の畝に変えたり、浅い穴を掘るために使える。"

#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
msgid "primitive shovel"
msgid_plural "primitive shovels"
msgstr[0] "原始的なシャベル"

#. ~ Conditional name for {'str': 'primitive shovel'} when COMPONENT_ID
#. matches rock
#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
msgid "stone shovel"
msgid_plural "stone shovels"
msgstr[0] "石のシャベル"

#. ~ Conditional name for {'str': 'primitive shovel'} when COMPONENT_ID
#. matches ceramic
#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
msgid "ceramic shovel"
msgid_plural "ceramic shovels"
msgstr[0] "セラミックシャベル"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'primitive shovel'}
#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
msgid ""
"This is a flattened stone or ceramic shard affixed to a stick.  It works "
"passably well as a shovel but really can't compare to a real shovel."
msgstr "棒に取り付けられた平らな石や陶器の破片だ。シャベルとして一応の役は果たすが、本物のシャベルには到底及ばない。"

#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
msgid "scythe"
msgid_plural "scythes"
msgstr[0] "サイズ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'scythe'}
#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
msgid ""
"This is an old-fashioned farming tool used to cut tall grass.  While it may "
"be a giant blade on the end of a stick, it is incredibly awkward to use for "
"anything but its intended purpose."
msgstr "昔ながらの農具で、背の高い草を刈るために使われる。棒の先に巨大な刃が付いているが、本来の目的以外では非常に難しい。"

#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
msgid "shovel"
msgid_plural "shovels"
msgstr[0] "シャベル"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'shovel'}
#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
msgid "This is a digging tool.  Use it to dig pits adjacent to your location."
msgstr "掘削するための道具。使用すると隣接する地形に穴を掘る。"

#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
msgid "short shovel"
msgid_plural "short shovels"
msgstr[0] "ショートシャベル"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'short shovel'}
#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
msgid ""
"This digging tool has had its handle cut shorter to be easier to carry.  "
"Digs holes just like any other shovel, but less effective as a weapon."
msgstr "掘削用ツールは携行性を高めるためにハンドルが短く切断されている。他のシャベルと同様に穴を掘れるが、武器としてはやや効果が低い。"

#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
msgid "sickle"
msgid_plural "sickles"
msgstr[0] "シックル"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'sickle'}
#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
msgid ""
"This is an old-fashioned farming tool used to cut tall grass.  While it may "
"be a massive curved blade on a handle, it is incredibly awkward to use for "
"anything but its intended purpose."
msgstr "昔ながらの農具で、背の高い草を刈るために使われる。ハンドルに取り付けられた巨大な湾曲刃だが、本来の目的以外では使うのが極めて難しい。"

#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
msgid "hedge trimmer (off)"
msgid_plural "hedge trimmers (off)"
msgstr[0] "ヘッジトリマー [停止中]"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'hedge trimmer (off)', 'str_pl': 'hedge
#. trimmers (off)'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
msgid "You turn on the hedge trimmer."
msgstr "ヘッジトリマーの電源を入れた。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'hedge trimmer (off)', 'str_pl': 'hedge trimmers
#. (off)'}
#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
msgid ""
"A cordless, double-sided, gasoline-powered hedge trimmer.  A long line of "
"sharp-edged teeth extends from the engine; turning the trimmer on will make "
"them rapidly vibrate.  The poor man's chainsaw as far as the zombies are "
"concerned."
msgstr ""
"コードレスの両面式、ガソリン駆動のヘッジトリマー。エンジンから一列の鋭い歯が伸びており、スイッチを入れると高速で振動する。この安物チェーンソーでさえ、ゾンビを切り刻んでしまうだろう。"

#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
msgid "hedge trimmer (on)"
msgid_plural "hedge trimmers (on)"
msgstr[0] "ヘッジトリマー [作動中]"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'hedge trimmer (on)', 'str_pl': 'hedge
#. trimmers (on)'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
msgid "You turn off the hedge trimmer."
msgstr "ヘッジトリマーの電源を切った。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'hedge trimmer (on)', 'str_pl': 'hedge trimmers
#. (on)'}
#: data/json/items/tool/landscaping.json
msgid ""
"A cordless, double-sided, gasoline-powered hedge trimmer.  It is currently "
"on, ready to do some zombie topiary; use this item to turn it off."
msgstr "ガソリンで動くコードレスの両刃ヘッジトリマー。電源が入っており、ゾンビを刈り込む準備が出来ており、使用すると電源を切る。"

#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json data/json/vehicleparts/lights.json
msgid "atomic lamp"
msgid_plural "atomic lamps"
msgstr[0] "アトミックランプ"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'atomic lamp'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "You close the lamp's cover."
msgstr "ランプのカバーを閉した。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'atomic lamp'}
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid ""
"Powered by the magic of nuclear decay and low-energy LEDs, this very "
"expensive lamp will emit a small amount of light for at least a decade.  "
"Before the Cataclysm, it was mostly an expensive way to show off your "
"preparedness.  Now, it's actually pretty cool.  Use it to close the cover "
"and hide the light."
msgstr ""
"核崩壊の力で動く低消費電力LED式のこの高価なスタンドランプは、少なくとも10年間、微弱な光を発し続ける。大災禍以前は、備えの徹底ぶりを誇示するための高価なアイテムにすぎなかったが、今では実際に非常に頼もしい存在だ。カバーを閉じて光を隠すために使用できる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "atomic lamp (covered)"
msgid_plural "atomic lamps (covered)"
msgstr[0] "アトミックランプ [閉鎖中]"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'atomic lamp (covered)', 'str_pl': 'atomic
#. lamps (covered)'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "You open the lamp's cover."
msgstr "ランプのカバーを開した。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'atomic lamp (covered)', 'str_pl': 'atomic lamps
#. (covered)'}
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid ""
"Powered by the magic of nuclear decay and low-energy LEDs, this very "
"expensive lamp will emit a small amount of light for at least a decade.  "
"Before the Cataclysm, it was mostly an expensive way to show off your "
"preparedness.  Now, it's actually pretty cool.  The cover is closed.  Use it"
" to open the cover and show the light."
msgstr ""
"核崩壊の力で動く低消費電力LED式のこの高価なスタンドランプは、少なくとも10年間、微弱な光を発し続ける。大災禍以前は、備えの徹底ぶりを誇示するための高価なアイテムにすぎなかったが、今では実に頼もしい存在だ。カバーを開けて光を出すために使用できる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "atomic reading light"
msgid_plural "atomic reading lights"
msgstr[0] "アトミック読書灯"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'atomic reading light'}.
#. ~ Use action msg for magical reading light.
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/enchanted/enchanted_misc.json
msgid "You close the nightlight's cover."
msgstr "常夜灯のカバーを閉じた。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'atomic reading light'}
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid ""
"Powered by the magic of nuclear decay and low-energy LEDs, this extremely "
"expensive little light will provide just enough light to read by for at "
"least a decade.  It is also available with a cute cartoon bear cover to turn"
" it into a nightlight for a very wealthy child with a fear of the dark.  Use"
" it to close the cover and hide the light."
msgstr ""
"核崩壊の力で動く低消費電力LED式の、この高価な読書用ランプは、最低でも10年間、文字を読むのにぎりぎり十分な光を発し続ける。暗闇を恐れる金持ちの子供がナイトライトとして使っていたのか、かわいらしい漫画風のクマのカバーが付属している。使用時はカバーを閉じて、光を隠すこともできる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "atomic reading light (covered)"
msgid_plural "atomic reading lights (covered)"
msgstr[0] "アトミック読書灯 [閉鎖中]"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'atomic reading light (covered)', 'str_pl':
#. 'atomic reading lights (covered)'}.
#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'magical reading light (covered)', 'str_pl':
#. 'magical reading lights (covered)'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/enchanted/enchanted_misc.json
msgid "You open the nightlight's cover."
msgstr "常夜灯のカバーを開いた。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'atomic reading light (covered)', 'str_pl':
#. 'atomic reading lights (covered)'}
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid ""
"Powered by the magic of nuclear decay and low-energy LEDs, this extremely "
"expensive little light will provide just enough light to read by for at "
"least a decade.  It is also available with a cute cartoon bear cover to turn"
" it into a nightlight for a very wealthy child with a fear of the dark.  The"
" cover is closed.  Use it to open the cover and show the light."
msgstr ""
"核崩壊の力で動く低消費電力LED式のこの高価な読書用ランプは、最低でも10年間、文字を読むのにぎりぎり十分な明るさを発し続ける。暗闇を恐れる裕福な子供がナイトライトとして使っていたのか、かわいらしい漫画風のクマのカバーが付属している。カバーを開けて光を出すために使用できる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "candle"
msgid_plural "candles"
msgstr[0] "ロウソク"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'candle'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "You light the candle."
msgstr "ロウソクに火をつけた。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'candle'}
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid ""
"This is a thick candle.  It doesn't provide very much light, but it can burn"
" for quite a long time.  You'll need a lighter or matches to light it."
msgstr "これは分厚いロウソクだ。あまり明るくはないが、かなり長時間燃え続ける。火をつけるにはライターやマッチが必要だ。"

#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "candle (lit)"
msgid_plural "candles (lit)"
msgstr[0] "ロウソク [点灯中]"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'candle (lit)', 'str_pl': 'candles (lit)'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "The candle winks out."
msgstr "ロウソクの火がふっと消えた。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'candle (lit)', 'str_pl': 'candles (lit)'}
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid ""
"This is a thick candle.  It doesn't provide very much light, but it can burn"
" for quite a long time.  This candle is lit."
msgstr "分厚いロウソク。それほど明るくはないが、かなり長く燃える。点火するにはライターやマッチが必要だ。"

#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "electric lantern (off)"
msgid_plural "electric lanterns (off)"
msgstr[0] "電動ランタン [消灯中]"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'electric lantern (off)', 'str_pl': 'electric
#. lanterns (off)'}.
#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'gasoline lantern (off)', 'str_pl': 'gasoline
#. lanterns (off)'}.
#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'oil lamp (off)', 'str_pl': 'oil lamps
#. (off)'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "You turn the lamp on."
msgstr "ランプに明かりを灯した。"

#. ~ Use action need_charges_msg for {'str': 'electric lantern (off)',
#. 'str_pl': 'electric lanterns (off)'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "The lantern has no batteries."
msgstr "ランタンに電池が無い。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'electric lantern (off)', 'str_pl': 'electric
#. lanterns (off)'}
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid ""
"This is a battery-powered lamp.  It does not provide much light, but it "
"lasts a long time.  Use it to turn it on."
msgstr "電池駆動式のランプ。光は弱いが、長持ちする。オンにすることで明かりが点く。"

#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "electric lantern (on)"
msgid_plural "electric lanterns (on)"
msgstr[0] "電動ランタン [点灯中]"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'electric lantern (on)', 'str_pl': 'electric
#. lanterns (on)'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "You turn the lamp off."
msgstr "ランプの明かりを消した。"

#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "flashlight (off)"
msgid_plural "flashlights (off)"
msgstr[0] "懐中電灯 [消灯中]"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'flashlight (off)', 'str_pl': 'flashlights
#. (off)'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "You turn the flashlight on."
msgstr "懐中電灯を点けた。"

#. ~ Use action need_charges_msg for {'str': 'flashlight (off)', 'str_pl':
#. 'flashlights (off)'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "The flashlight's batteries are dead."
msgstr "懐中電灯の電池は切れている。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'flashlight (off)', 'str_pl': 'flashlights
#. (off)'}
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid ""
"This is a typical household flashlight with a plastic handle.  Using this "
"flashlight will turn it on and provide light, assuming it is charged with "
"batteries."
msgstr "プラスチック製ハンドルの一般的な家庭用懐中電灯。電池が入っていれば、使用すると電源が入り、光を発する。"

#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "flashlight (on)"
msgid_plural "flashlights (on)"
msgstr[0] "懐中電灯 [点灯中]"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'flashlight (on)', 'str_pl': 'flashlights
#. (on)'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "You turn the flashlight off."
msgstr "懐中電灯を消した。"

#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "gasoline lantern (off)"
msgid_plural "gasoline lanterns (off)"
msgstr[0] "ガソリンランタン [消灯中]"

#. ~ Use action need_charges_msg for {'str': 'gasoline lantern (off)',
#. 'str_pl': 'gasoline lanterns (off)'}.
#. ~ Use action need_charges_msg for {'str': 'oil lamp (off)', 'str_pl': 'oil
#. lamps (off)'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "The lamp is empty."
msgstr "ランプは空である。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'gasoline lantern (off)', 'str_pl': 'gasoline
#. lanterns (off)'}
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid ""
"This is a small gasoline powered lantern.  It does not provide much light, "
"but it lasts a long time.  Use it to turn it on."
msgstr "ガソリンを燃料とする小型のランタン。それほど明るくはないが、その分長持ちする。使用すると点灯する。"

#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "gasoline lantern (on)"
msgid_plural "gasoline lanterns (on)"
msgstr[0] "ガソリンランタン [点灯中]"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'gasoline lantern (on)', 'str_pl': 'gasoline
#. lanterns (on)'}.
#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'oil lamp'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "The lantern is extinguished."
msgstr "ランタンの火が消えた。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'gasoline lantern (on)', 'str_pl': 'gasoline
#. lanterns (on)'}
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid ""
"This is a small gasoline powered lantern.  It does not provide much light, "
"but it lasts a long time.  It is turned on.  Use it to turn it off."
msgstr "ガソリンを燃料とする小型のランタン。それほど明るくはないが、その分長持ちする。現在は点灯しており、使用すると消灯できる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "glowstick"
msgid_plural "glowsticks"
msgstr[0] "ケミカルライト"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'glowstick'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "You activate the glowstick."
msgstr "ケミカルライトを点けた。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'glowstick'}
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid ""
"This is a small blue light glowstick.  Use it to bend the plastic and break "
"the glass cylinder inside to start the reaction.  It will produce a small "
"amount of light."
msgstr "小型の青色発光スティック。使用するとチューブが曲げられ、内部のガラス管が割れて反応が起きる。わずかな光を発する。"

#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "dead glowstick"
msgid_plural "dead glowsticks"
msgstr[0] "ケミカルライト [使用済]"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'dead glowstick'}
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "This is a spent glowstick.  It is essentially trash."
msgstr "使用済みのケミカルライト。使い道のないゴミだ。"

#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "active glowstick"
msgid_plural "active glowsticks"
msgstr[0] "ケミカルライト [発光中]"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'active glowstick'}
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid ""
"This is an active glowstick and is producing light.  It will last for a few "
"hours before burning out."
msgstr "発光中のケミカルライト。数時間光を発し続ける。"

#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "flare"
msgid_plural "flares"
msgstr[0] "発炎筒"

#. ~ Use action menu_text for {'str': 'flare'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "Strike the striker"
msgstr "発炎筒に点火する"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'flare'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "You strike your flare and light it."
msgstr "発炎筒をつけた。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'flare'}
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid ""
"This is a slow-burning magnesium flare.  Use it to strike the striker and "
"light it.  It will produce a bright light for about a half hour."
msgstr "ゆっくり燃えるマグネシウム式フレアだ。使用すると発炎筒を擦り、点火する。およそ30分間、明るい光を発する。"

#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "active flare"
msgid_plural "active flares"
msgstr[0] "発炎筒 [点火中]"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'active flare'}
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid ""
"This burning magnesium flare is producing light.  It will last for about a "
"half hour before burning out."
msgstr "燃焼中のマグネシウム発炎筒は光を発します。30分程度燃え続けます。"

#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "heavy duty flashlight (off)"
msgid_plural "heavy duty flashlights (off)"
msgstr[0] "高耐久懐中電灯 [消灯中]"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'heavy duty flashlight (off)', 'str_pl':
#. 'heavy duty flashlights (off)'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "You turn the heavy duty flashlight on."
msgstr "高耐久懐中電灯を点けた。"

#. ~ Use action need_charges_msg for {'str': 'heavy duty flashlight (off)',
#. 'str_pl': 'heavy duty flashlights (off)'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "The heavy duty flashlight's batteries are dead."
msgstr "高耐久懐中電灯の電池が切れた。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'heavy duty flashlight (off)', 'str_pl': 'heavy
#. duty flashlights (off)'}
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid ""
"This is a heavy duty tubular aluminum LED flashlight as often used by "
"security guards.  Makes for a passable melee weapon.  Using this flashlight "
"will turn it on and provide light, assuming it is charged with batteries."
msgstr ""
"過酷な使用環境を想定して設計された、アルミ合金製のLEDフラッシュライト。ショッピングモールの警備員がよく持っている。頑丈で重量があるので、まずまずの威力の近接武器としても使える。電池が装填されていれば、使用すると点灯し、周囲を照らす。"

#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "heavy duty flashlight (on)"
msgid_plural "heavy duty flashlights (on)"
msgstr[0] "高耐久懐中電灯 [点灯中]"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'heavy duty flashlight (on)', 'str_pl': 'heavy
#. duty flashlights (on)'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "You turn the heavy duty flashlight off."
msgstr "高耐久懐中電灯を消した。"

#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "lightstrip_base"
msgid_plural "lightstrip_bases"
msgstr[0] "lightstrip_bases"

#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "lightstrip"
msgid_plural "lightstrips"
msgstr[0] "ストリップライト"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'lightstrip'}
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid ""
"This is a light-emitting circuit that has been wired directly to a battery."
"  It provides some weak light and can't be turned off until the battery "
"dies."
msgstr "電池と直接繋がっている発光回路だ。弱い光を発しており、電池が切れるまで消灯できない。"

#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "lightstrip (inactive)"
msgid_plural "lightstrips (inactive)"
msgstr[0] "ストリップライト [停止中]"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'lightstrip (inactive)', 'str_pl':
#. 'lightstrips (inactive)'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "You irreversibly activate the lightstrip."
msgstr "ストリップライトを不可逆的に有効化した。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'lightstrip (inactive)', 'str_pl': 'lightstrips
#. (inactive)'}
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid ""
"This is a light-emitting circuit that can be wired directly to a battery.  "
"It provides some weak light and can't be turned off until the battery dies."
msgstr "電池と直接繋げられる発光回路だ。使用すると弱い光を発し、電池が切れるまで消灯できない。"

#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "oil lamp (off)"
msgid_plural "oil lamps (off)"
msgstr[0] "オイルランプ [消灯中]"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'oil lamp (off)', 'str_pl': 'oil lamps (off)'}
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid ""
"This is an oil fueled lamp.  It does not provide much light, but it lasts a "
"long time.  Use it to turn it on."
msgstr "これはオイルを燃料とするランプだ。光は弱いものの、長く持つ。使用すると明かりを点ける。"

#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "oil lamp"
msgid_plural "oil lamps"
msgstr[0] "オイルランプ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'oil lamp'}
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid ""
"This is an oil fueled lamp.  It does not provide much light, but it lasts a "
"long time.  It is turned on.  Use it to turn it off."
msgstr "これはオイルを燃料とするランプだ。光は弱いものの、長く持つ。現在ランプは点灯中だ。使用すると明かりを消す。"

#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "acetylene lamp (off)"
msgid_plural "acetylene lamps (off)"
msgstr[0] "アセチレンランプ [消灯中]"

#. ~ Use action need_charges_msg for {'str': 'acetylene lamp (off)', 'str_pl':
#. 'acetylene lamps (off)'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "The %s must be attached to a gas cylinder to light."
msgstr "%sを点灯するにはガスシリンダーを取り付ける必要がある。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'acetylene lamp (off)', 'str_pl': 'acetylene
#. lamps (off)'}
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid ""
"An antique brass lamp designed to run from a pressurized cylinder of "
"acetylene.  It is an efficient, if not somewhat dangerous light source."
msgstr "アセチレン入りの加圧シリンダーで作動する、真鍮製の古いランプだ。多少危険はあるものの、効率的な光源だ。"

#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "acetylene lamp (on)"
msgid_plural "acetylene lamps (on)"
msgstr[0] "アセチレンランプ [点灯中]"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'acetylene lamp (on)', 'str_pl': 'acetylene
#. lamps (on)'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "The %s is extinguished"
msgstr "%sが消えた"

#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "reading light"
msgid_plural "reading lights"
msgstr[0] "読書灯"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'reading light'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "You switch on the reading light."
msgstr "読書灯を点けた。"

#. ~ Use action need_charges_msg for {'str': 'reading light'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "The reading light winks out."
msgstr "読書灯がふっと消えた。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'reading light'}
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "A little clip-on LED light, meant for reading books in the dark."
msgstr "暗闇で本を読むための、クリップで固定できるLEDライトだ。"

#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "reading light (on)"
msgid_plural "reading lights (on)"
msgstr[0] "読書灯 [点灯中]"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'reading light (on)', 'str_pl': 'reading
#. lights (on)'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "You switch off the reading light."
msgstr "読書灯を消した。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'reading light (on)', 'str_pl': 'reading lights
#. (on)'}
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid ""
"A little clip-on LED light, meant for reading books in the dark.  This one "
"is turned on."
msgstr "暗闇で本を読むための、クリップで固定できるLEDライトだ。これは点灯している。"

#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "smart lamp (off)"
msgid_plural "smart lamps (off)"
msgstr[0] "スマートランプ [消灯中]"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'smart lamp (off)', 'str_pl': 'smart lamps
#. (off)'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "You turn the smart lamp on."
msgstr "スマートランプを点けた。"

#. ~ Use action need_charges_msg for {'str': 'smart lamp (off)', 'str_pl':
#. 'smart lamps (off)'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "The smart lamp batteries are dead."
msgstr "スマートランプの電池が切れた。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'smart lamp (off)', 'str_pl': 'smart lamps
#. (off)'}
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "This is a smart lamp, it can be activated remotely."
msgstr "これはスマートランプだ。遠隔操作で起動できる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "smart lamp (on)"
msgid_plural "smart lamps (on)"
msgstr[0] "スマートランプ [点灯中]"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'smart lamp (on)', 'str_pl': 'smart lamps
#. (on)'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "Your smart lamp turned off"
msgstr "スマートランプが消灯した"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'smart lamp (on)', 'str_pl': 'smart lamps (on)'}
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid ""
"This is a smart lamp, this smart lamp is turned on.  It can be deactivated "
"remotely."
msgstr "これはスマートランプだ。電源はオンになっており、遠隔操作で消灯できる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "torch"
msgid_plural "torches"
msgstr[0] "松明"

#. ~ Use action menu_text for {'str': 'torch', 'str_pl': 'torches'}.
#. ~ Use action menu_text for {'str': 'everburning torch', 'str_pl':
#. 'everburning torches'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/enchanted/enchanted_misc.json
msgid "Light torch"
msgstr "点火する"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'torch', 'str_pl': 'torches'}.
#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'everburning torch', 'str_pl': 'everburning
#. torches'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/enchanted/enchanted_misc.json
msgid "You light the torch."
msgstr "松明に火をつけた。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'torch', 'str_pl': 'torches'}
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid ""
"This is a large stick, wrapped in rags that are soaked with a flammable "
"material.  When lit, produces a fair amount of light.  You'll need a lighter"
" or matches to light it."
msgstr "可燃性の液体を染みこませた布を巻きつけた大きな棒だ。火をつけると十分な光を発する。点火にはライターかマッチが必要だ。"

#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "torch (lit)"
msgid_plural "torches (lit)"
msgstr[0] "松明 [点火中]"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'torch (lit)', 'str_pl': 'torches (lit)'}.
#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'everburning torch (lit)', 'str_pl':
#. 'everburning torches (lit)'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/enchanted/enchanted_misc.json
msgid "The torch is extinguished."
msgstr "松明の火が消えた。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'torch (lit)', 'str_pl': 'torches (lit)'}
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid ""
"This is a large stick, wrapped in rags that are soaked with a flammable "
"material.  It is burning, producing plenty of light."
msgstr "可燃性の液体を染みこませた布を巻きつけた大きな棒だ。燃え盛っており、十分な光を発している。"

#: data/json/items/tool/masonry.json
msgid "masonry saw (off)"
msgid_plural "masonry saws (off)"
msgstr[0] "コンクリートカッター [停止中]"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'masonry saw (off)', 'str_pl': 'masonry saws
#. (off)'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/masonry.json
msgid "You turn on the masonry saw."
msgstr "コンクリートカッターを起動した。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'masonry saw (off)', 'str_pl': 'masonry saws
#. (off)'}
#: data/json/items/tool/masonry.json
msgid ""
"This is a construction tool for cutting through concrete or other surfaces."
"  It runs on gasoline.  Using this item will cause it to turn on, turning it"
" into a very powerful but unwieldy melee weapon or a terrible chainsaw."
msgstr ""
"コンクリートなどの表面を切断する、ガソリン駆動の建設用工具だ。これを起動すると、非常に強力だが扱いにくい近接武器、あるいは恐ろしいチェーンソーとして機能する。"

#: data/json/items/tool/masonry.json
msgid "masonry saw (on)"
msgid_plural "masonry saws (on)"
msgstr[0] "コンクリートカッター [作動中]"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'masonry saw (on)', 'str_pl': 'masonry saws
#. (on)'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/masonry.json
msgid "You turn off the masonry saw."
msgstr "コンクリートカッターの電源を切った。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'masonry saw (on)', 'str_pl': 'masonry saws
#. (on)'}
#: data/json/items/tool/masonry.json
msgid ""
"This masonry saw is on and making a lot of noise.  Use it to turn it off."
msgstr "コンクリートカッターは大きな騒音を立てて作動している。使用すると電源が切れる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/masonry.json
msgid "grinder blade"
msgid_plural "grinder blades"
msgstr[0] "グラインダー刃"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'grinder blade'}
#: data/json/items/tool/masonry.json
msgid ""
"A 125mm angle grinder blade.  You could make a powertool with it, or throw "
"it.  Wielding it without sturdy gloves is a bad idea."
msgstr ""
"外径125mmのアングルグラインダー用の刃だ。電動工具に取り付けても、投擲武器として使ってもいい。丈夫なグローブなしで扱うのは避けるべきだ。"

#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
msgid "anesthesia kit"
msgid_plural "anesthesia kits"
msgstr[0] "麻酔キット"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'anesthesia kit'}
#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
msgid ""
"A kit for inducing anesthesia for surgery, containing specialized canisters "
"with a variety of powerful hypnotic, analgetic, and stimulative drugs.  It's"
" intended for use in specialized medical equipment, and can't be "
"administered manually."
msgstr ""
"強力な睡眠剤、鎮痛剤、興奮剤といった薬剤入りの特殊な容器を備えた手術用の麻酔キットだ。特殊な医療機器で使うものであり、手動での使用は不可能だ。"

#: data/json/items/tool/med.json data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
msgid "autoclave"
msgid_plural "autoclaves"
msgstr[0] "オートクレーブ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'autoclave'}
#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
msgid ""
"This is an autoclave.  It's useful for sterilizing things like CBMs.  It "
"requires a massive amount of power, so standard batteries will not power it "
"sufficiently.  Examine a non-sterile CBM and mend it to sterilize."
msgstr ""
"これはオートクレーブだ。CBMなどの滅菌に役立つ。大量の電力を必要とするため、標準的なバッテリーでは十分に動かせない。非滅菌状態のCBMを調べ、修復することで滅菌できる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
msgid "inhaler"
msgid_plural "inhalers"
msgstr[0] "吸入器"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'inhaler'}
#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
msgid ""
"Albuterol inhaler.  Used in the treatment of bronchospasm, it is a lifeline "
"for people with asthma.  A mild stimulant, it may cause nervousness or "
"tremors."
msgstr ""
"アルブテロールの吸入器だ。気管支痙攣の治療に使用され、喘息持ちの人には生命線となる。軽度の興奮剤であり、神経過敏や震えを引き起こすことがある。"

#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
msgid "RX12 jet injector"
msgid_plural "RX12 jet injectors"
msgstr[0] "RX12ジェット式注射器"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'RX12 jet injector'}
#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
msgid ""
"The Rivtech RX12 jet injector is a small pistol-shaped device used to inject"
" advanced fast-healing chemicals through the skin without using a needle.  A"
" label on the side warns against using more than two doses per hour."
msgstr ""
"Rivtech社製のRX12ジェット式注射器は、針を用いずに皮膚を通して先進的な高速治癒薬を注入する拳銃型デバイスだ。側面のラベルには、1時間に2回以上投薬しないよう警告が書かれている。"

#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
msgid "scalpel"
msgid_plural "scalpels"
msgstr[0] "メス"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'scalpel'}
#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
msgid ""
"This is a very sharp knife designed for surgical cutting.  Its small, sharp "
"blade allows for precision strikes in the hands of the skilled."
msgstr ""
"医療用の小型圧縮酸素タンクだ。折りたたみ式のレギュレーターとマスクが付属している。通常、喘息発作や煙の吸入時の非常時に使用され、即座に症状を緩和し、一時的にエネルギーを高める効果がある。"

#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
msgid "emergency oxygen pack"
msgid_plural "emergency oxygen packs"
msgstr[0] "非常用酸素パック"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'emergency oxygen pack'}
#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
msgid ""
"This is a small tank of compressed medical oxygen with a folding regulator "
"and mask.  Commonly used in emergency situations, it provides immediate "
"relief for asthma attacks or smoke inhalation, and can provide a brief burst"
" of energy."
msgstr ""
"医療用の小型圧縮酸素タンクだ。折りたたみ式のレギュレーターとマスクが付属している。通常、喘息発作や煙の吸入時の非常時に使用され、即座に症状を緩和し、一時的に活力を高める効果がある。"

#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
msgid "syringe"
msgid_plural "syringes"
msgstr[0] "注射器"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'syringe'}
#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
msgid "A medical syringe.  Used for administering intravenous drugs."
msgstr "医療用の注射器だ。静脈注射用の薬物投与に使う。"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'DNA'}
#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
msgid ""
"The DNA sample of some living creature.  This can be used in a cloning vat, "
"together with a sterile artificial womb, to create a copy of the creature."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
msgid "universal growth medium"
msgid_plural "universal growth medium"
msgstr[0] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'universal growth medium'}
#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
msgid ""
"A heavily processed nutrient liquid, containing the basic building blocks of"
" life.  A genome workstation could take a stored sample off a USB drive, and"
" convert this raw material into viable DNA for cloning."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
msgid "thermometer"
msgid_plural "thermometers"
msgstr[0] "温度計"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'thermometer'}
#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
msgid "A plastic thermometer that can read the air temperature."
msgstr "気温を測定できるプラスチック製の温度計だ。"

#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
msgid "oxygen tank"
msgid_plural "oxygen tanks"
msgstr[0] "酸素タンク"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'oxygen tank'}
#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
msgid ""
"This is tank of compressed medical oxygen with a regulator and mask.  "
"Commonly used in emergency situations, it provides immediate relief for "
"asthma attacks or smoke inhalation, and can provide a brief burst of energy."
msgstr ""
"医療用の圧縮酸素タンクだ。レギュレーターとマスクが付属している。通常、喘息発作や煙の吸入時の緊急時に使用され、即座に症状を緩和し、一時的にエネルギーを高める効果がある。"

#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
msgid "blood draw kit"
msgid_plural "blood draw kits"
msgstr[0] "採血キット"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'blood draw kit'}
#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
msgid ""
"This is a kit for drawing blood, including a test tube for holding the "
"sample.  Use this tool to draw blood, either from yourself or from a corpse "
"you are standing on."
msgstr "サンプル保存用の試験管を含む採血キットだ。これを使って、自分自身か、足元にある死体から採血できる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
msgid "wrapped radiation badge"
msgid_plural "wrapped radiation badges"
msgstr[0] "放射線バッジ [未開封]"

#. ~ Use action menu_text for {'str': 'wrapped radiation badge'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
msgid "Unwrap badge"
msgstr "開封する"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'wrapped radiation badge'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
msgid ""
"You remove the badge from its wrapper, exposing it to ambient radiation."
msgstr "バッジの保護ラップを剥がし、周囲の放射線に晒した。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'wrapped radiation badge'}
#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
msgid ""
"This is a badge that detects radiation dosage sealed in a radiation-blocking"
" bag.  Use it to remove it from the bag."
msgstr "放射線量を検知するバッジだ。放射線を遮断する袋に密封されている。使用して袋から取り出せる。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'anvil'}
#: data/json/items/tool/metalworking.json
msgid ""
"This is an enormously heavy block of oddly shaped steel with a chisel-like "
"projection set into the corner.  It's used in most metalworking fabrication "
"recipes."
msgstr "角にノミのような突起が付いた奇妙な形状の、非常に重い鉄塊だ。ほとんどの金属加工レシピで必要になる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/metalworking.json
msgid "bronze anvil"
msgid_plural "bronze anvils"
msgstr[0] "青銅金床"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'bronze anvil'}
#: data/json/items/tool/metalworking.json
msgid ""
"This is a block of oddly shaped bronze with a chisel-like projection set "
"into the corner.  It's used in most metalworking fabrication recipes."
msgstr "角にノミのような突起が付いた奇妙な形状の青銅の塊だ。ほとんどの金属加工レシピで必要になる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/metalworking.json
msgid "pair of bolt cutters"
msgid_plural "pairs of bolt cutters"
msgstr[0] "ボルトカッター"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'pair of bolt cutters', 'str_pl': 'pairs of bolt
#. cutters'}
#: data/json/items/tool/metalworking.json
msgid ""
"This is a large pair of bolt cutters.  You could use them to cut padlocks or"
" heavy gauge wire."
msgstr "大型のボルトカッターだ。南京錠や太いワイヤーを切断できる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/metalworking.json
msgid "charcoal forge"
msgid_plural "charcoal forges"
msgstr[0] "炭火炉"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'charcoal forge'}
#: data/json/items/tool/metalworking.json
msgid ""
"This is a portable, charcoal fired, metalworking forge.  If combined with "
"the right tools, you could use this for metalworking, or it could be used to"
" repair metal items."
msgstr "これは持ち運び可能な、木炭火で動く金属加工用の炉だ。適切な工具と組み合わせれば、金属加工や金属アイテムの修理に使える。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'charcoal kiln'}
#: data/json/items/tool/metalworking.json
msgid ""
"A stout metal box used for producing charcoal via pyrolysis; the incomplete "
"burning of organic materials in the absence of oxygen."
msgstr "丈夫な金属製の箱だ。酸素がない状態で有機物を不完全に燃焼させる、熱分解によって木炭を生成するのに使われる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/metalworking.json
msgid "metalworking chisel"
msgid_plural "metalworking chisels"
msgstr[0] "彫金用タガネ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'metalworking chisel'}
#: data/json/items/tool/metalworking.json
msgid ""
"This is a short, stout metalworking chisel.  It's used in some metalworking "
"fabrication recipes."
msgstr "短く頑丈な、金属加工用のタガネだ。いくつかの金属加工レシピで必要になる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/metalworking.json
msgid "crucible"
msgid_plural "crucibles"
msgstr[0] "るつぼ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'crucible'}
#: data/json/items/tool/metalworking.json
msgid ""
"This is a small metalworking crucible.  It's used in some metalworking "
"fabrication recipes."
msgstr "小型の金属加工用るつぼだ。いくつかの金属加工レシピで使われる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/metalworking.json
msgid "clay crucible"
msgid_plural "clay crucibles"
msgstr[0] "陶製るつぼ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'clay crucible'}
#: data/json/items/tool/metalworking.json
msgid ""
"This is a primitive metalworking crucible made of clay.  You could use it "
"for metalworking."
msgstr "粘土で作られた原始的な金属加工用るつぼだ。金属加工に使える。"

#: data/json/items/tool/metalworking.json
msgid "electric forge"
msgid_plural "electric forges"
msgstr[0] "電動炉"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'electric forge'}
#: data/json/items/tool/metalworking.json
msgid ""
"This is a portable electric metalworking forge, powered by batteries.  "
"Combined with the right tools, you could use this for metalworking, or it "
"could be used to repair metal items.  With a little mechanical know-how, you"
" could probably even convert it to run directly off a vehicle's power "
"system."
msgstr ""
"電池で動く持ち運び可能な電動金属加工炉だ。適切な工具と組み合わせれば、金属加工や金属アイテムの修理に使える。少し機械の知識があれば、車両の電源システムから直接動くように改造することもできるだろう。"

#: data/json/items/tool/metalworking.json
msgid "hydraulic press"
msgid_plural "hydraulic presss"
msgstr[0] "油圧プレス"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'hydraulic press'}
#: data/json/items/tool/metalworking.json
msgid ""
"A large, barely portable hydraulic press, that uses a 36kW motor to squash "
"whatever needs squashing.  Do not put your hand in here, it will get "
"squashed.  Can run off heavy-duty batteries, installed to run off a power "
"grid, or mounted on a vehicle."
msgstr ""
"36kWのモーターで必要なものを何でも押しつぶす、大型でほとんど持ち運び不可能な油圧プレスだ。手を挟まないように。潰れるぞ。頑丈なバッテリーや電力網に接続したり、車両に搭載したりして動かせる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/metalworking.json
msgid "finished charcoal kiln"
msgid_plural "finished charcoal kilns"
msgstr[0] "炭焼窯 [完了]"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'finished charcoal kiln'}
#: data/json/items/tool/metalworking.json
msgid ""
"A charcoal kiln that has finished burning.  Disassemble it to retrieve the "
"charcoal and kiln."
msgstr "燃焼を終えた炭焼窯だ。分解して炭と窯を回収できる。"

#. ~ Use action menu_text for {'str': 'filled charcoal kiln'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/metalworking.json
msgid "Light wood"
msgstr "着火する"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'filled charcoal kiln'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/metalworking.json
msgid "You light the wood."
msgstr "木材に火をつけた。"

#. ~ Use action need_fire_msg for {'str': 'filled charcoal kiln'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/metalworking.json
msgid "You need something to light it with!"
msgstr "着火するための道具が必要だ！"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'filled charcoal kiln'}
#: data/json/items/tool/metalworking.json
msgid ""
"A kiln filled with wood which will become charcoal after a slow period of "
"burning."
msgstr "木材が詰まった炭焼窯だ。ゆっくりと燃焼した後、炭になる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/metalworking.json
msgid "lit charcoal kiln"
msgid_plural "lit charcoal kilns"
msgstr[0] "炭焼窯 [点火中]"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'lit charcoal kiln'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/metalworking.json
msgid ""
"The kilns embers have died out, you can now disassemble it to harvest the "
"charcoal."
msgstr "残り火が消えた。分解して木炭を回収できる。"

#. ~ Use action not_ready_msg for {'str': 'lit charcoal kiln'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/metalworking.json
msgid "The kiln is still burning."
msgstr "窯はまだ燃焼している。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'lit charcoal kiln'}
#: data/json/items/tool/metalworking.json
msgid "A kiln full of wood that has been lit; better drop it!"
msgstr "木材を詰めて火をつけた窯だ。すぐに手放すべきだろう！"

#: data/json/items/tool/metalworking.json
msgid "chainmail sheet"
msgid_plural "chainmail sheets"
msgstr[0] "チェーンメイルシート"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'chainmail sheet'}
#: data/json/items/tool/metalworking.json
msgid ""
"This is a sheet of riveted chainmail.  With some skill, several of these "
"sheets could be connected to make effective armor."
msgstr "鎖をリベットで留めて作ったチェーンメイルのシートだ。特定のスキルがあれば、複数のシートを繋ぎ合わせて効果的な防具を製作できる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/metalworking.json
msgid "swage and die set"
msgid_plural "swage and die sets"
msgstr[0] "金属加工セット"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'swage and die set'}
#: data/json/items/tool/metalworking.json
msgid ""
"These are a set of swages and dies for metalsmithing.  These loops and metal"
" blocks are used in some metalworking fabrication recipes."
msgstr "金属細工用の金型と成形器具一式だ。これらの輪や金属ブロックは、いくつかの金属加工レシピで使われる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/metalworking.json
msgid "pair of metal tongs"
msgid_plural "pairs of metal tongs"
msgstr[0] "火ばさみ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'pair of metal tongs', 'str_pl': 'pairs of metal
#. tongs'}
#: data/json/items/tool/metalworking.json
msgid ""
"These are long, metal tongs.  They are commonly used for cooking or in "
"metalworking fabrication recipes."
msgstr "金属製の長い火ばさみだ。調理や金属加工レシピで一般的に使われる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "compressed air horn"
msgid_plural "compressed air horns"
msgstr[0] "空圧式ホーン"

#. ~ Use action noise_message for {'str': 'compressed air horn'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "HOOOOONK!"
msgstr "プーーーーーー！！"

#. ~ Use action use_message for {'str': 'compressed air horn'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "You honk your airhorn."
msgstr "空圧式ホーンを鳴らした。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'compressed air horn'}
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid ""
"This is a small can of compressed air attached to a plastic horn.  Pressing "
"the button on top causes it to emit a loud honking sound."
msgstr "小型の圧縮空気ボンベにプラスチック製のホーンが取り付けられている。上部のボタンを押すと大音量のホーン音を鳴らす。"

#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "alarm clock"
msgid_plural "alarm clocks"
msgstr[0] "目覚まし時計"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'alarm clock'}
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid ""
"A wind-up alarm clock.  Though the noise it makes is unpleasant to wake up "
"to, it's always good to get an early start to your day.  Can also be "
"disassembled into some useful parts."
msgstr "ねじ巻き式の目覚まし時計だ。起こされる音は不快だが、早めに一日を始めるのには良い。いくつかの有用な部品に解体することもできる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "cow bell"
msgid_plural "cow bells"
msgstr[0] "カウベル"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'cow bell'}
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "A brass cow bell.  You feel like you need more of it."
msgstr "真鍮製のカウベルだ。これをさらに多く手に入れたいと感じる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json data/json/items/tool/smoking.json
msgid "dab pen"
msgid_plural "dab pens"
msgstr[0] "ダブペン"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'dab pen'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "You turn on the dab pen."
msgstr "ダブペンの電源を入れた。"

#. ~ Use action need_charges_msg for {'str': 'dab pen'}.
#. ~ Use action need_charges_msg for {'str': 'dab pen (on)', 'str_pl': 'dab
#. pens (on)'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "The dab pen's batteries need more charge."
msgstr "ダブペンの電力が足りない。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'dab pen'}
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid ""
"A battery operated dab pen used for smoking cannabis distillate cartridges."
msgstr "大麻の蒸留オイルカートリッジを喫煙する際に使う、電池式ダブペンだ。"

#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "Cube of Shame"
msgid_plural "Cube of Shame"
msgstr[0] "キューブ・オブ・シェイム"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str_sp': 'Cube of Shame'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "You inject yourself into the Cube of Shame."
msgstr "キューブ・オブ・シェイムに自分を注入した。"

#. ~ Use action need_charges_msg for {'str_sp': 'Cube of Shame'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "Batteries not included."
msgstr "バッテリーは別売だ。"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'Cube of Shame'}
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid ""
"This is a debug-only item for testing relic properties, powered by "
"batteries.  Turn it on to lose intelligence and perception, but gain "
"clairvoyance."
msgstr "レリックの特性をテストするための、デバッグ専用アイテムだ。バッテリーで動く。電源を入れると知力と感覚が低下するが、透視能力を得る。"

#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "Cube of Shame (on)"
msgid_plural "Cube of Shame (on)"
msgstr[0] "キューブ・オブ・シェイム [作動中]"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str_sp': 'Cube of Shame (on)'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "You extract yourself from the Cube of Shame."
msgstr "キューブ・オブ・シェイムから自分を抽出した。"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'Cube of Shame (on)'}
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid ""
"This is a debug-only item for testing relic properties, powered by "
"batteries.  Drop it or turn it off to retrieve your mind."
msgstr "レリックの特性をテストするための、デバッグ専用アイテムだ。バッテリーで動く。ドロップするか電源を切ると、元の精神に戻る。"

#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "Trapezohedron of Edginess"
msgid_plural "Trapezohedron of Edginess"
msgstr[0] "トラペゾヘドロン・オブ・エッジネス"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'Trapezohedron of Edginess'}
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid ""
"This is a debug-only item for testing enchantment mutations.  Wield it to "
"stay up all night, become stealthy, and to see in the dark."
msgstr "エンチャントの変異をテストするための、デバッグ専用アイテムだ。装備すると、一晩中起き続けられ、隠密性が高まり、暗闇でも見えるようになる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "entrenching tool"
msgid_plural "entrenching tools"
msgstr[0] "塹壕用シャベル"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'entrenching tool'}
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid ""
"This is a stout collapsible spade.  It's commonly used by military forces "
"and favored by hikers for digging.  This was a popular weapon during WW1."
msgstr "頑丈な折りたたみ式のシャベルだ。軍隊で広く使われ、ハイカーには穴掘り用として好まれる。第一次世界大戦中は人気の武器だった。"

#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "etched human skull"
msgid_plural "etched human skulls"
msgstr[0] "装飾頭骸骨"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'etched human skull'}
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "This is a human skull with strange etchings covering it."
msgstr "奇妙なエッチングが全体に施された人間の頭蓋骨だ。"

#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "flammable arrow"
msgid_plural "flammable arrows"
msgstr[0] "火矢"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'flammable arrow'}
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid ""
"This arrow has a rag soaked in a flammable liquid wrapped around the shaft "
"near the head.  You need to light it before shooting."
msgstr "先端付近に可燃性の液体を染み込ませた布を巻き付けた矢だ。撃つ前に火をつける必要がある。"

#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "fur rollmat"
msgid_plural "fur rollmats"
msgstr[0] "毛皮ロールマット"

#. ~ Use action done_message for {'str': 'fur rollmat'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "You unroll the fur mat and lay it on the ground."
msgstr "毛皮マットを広げて足元に敷いた。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'fur rollmat'}
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid ""
"This is a bedroll made of pelts which can be rolled up for transport.  It "
"insulates you from the floor, making it easier to sleep.  Use it to unroll "
"and place on the ground."
msgstr "運搬用に丸められる毛皮製のベッドロールだ。床からの冷気を遮断し、睡眠をとりやすくする。使用すると地面に広げられる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "grappling hook"
msgid_plural "grappling hooks"
msgstr[0] "フック付きロープ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'grappling hook'}
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid ""
"A folding grappling hook attached to a stout 30-foot long piece of "
"lightweight cord.  Useful for keeping yourself safe from falls.  Can be used"
" in place of a long rope for butchering, in a pinch."
msgstr ""
"頑丈で軽量な、全長約9mの細いコードに折り畳み式のフックが付いている。落下時の安全確保に役立つ。いざという時には食肉解体用の長いロープの代わりとして使うこともできる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "grip hook"
msgid_plural "grip hooks"
msgstr[0] "食肉用フック"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'grip hook'}
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "A simple steel meathook with a circular steel handle."
msgstr "円形の持ち手が付いた、シンプルな鋼鉄製の食肉用フックだ。"

#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "hand pump"
msgid_plural "hand pumps"
msgstr[0] "手押しポンプ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'hand pump'}
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "This pump is suitable for pumping air into inflatable objects."
msgstr "空気を入れて膨らませるアイテムに空気を送り込むのに適したポンプだ。"

#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
msgid "bicycle horn"
msgid_plural "bicycle horns"
msgstr[0] "自転車用ホーン"

#. ~ Use action use_message for {'str': 'bicycle horn'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "You honk the bicycle horn."
msgstr "自転車用ホーンを鳴らした。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'bicycle horn'}
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid ""
"This is a simple bulb horn, found on many bicycles.  Use to honk.  Honk "
"honk."
msgstr "多くの自転車に付いているシンプルなラッパだ。使用して鳴らせる。ホンク、ホンク。"

#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
msgid "truck horn"
msgid_plural "truck horns"
msgstr[0] "トラック用クラクション"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'truck horn'}
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "This is a very loud horn, usually found on large trucks like semis."
msgstr "トレーラーなどの大型トラックに付いている、非常に騒々しいクラクションだ。"

#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
msgid "ship air horn"
msgid_plural "ship air horns"
msgstr[0] "船舶用エアホーン"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'ship air horn'}
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid ""
"An enormous ship air horn, extremely loud and deafening.  Usually found on "
"large vessels."
msgstr "巨大な船舶用エアホーン。非常に音が大きく、耳をつんざくほどの轟音を発する。通常、大型の船に搭載されている。"

#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
msgid "car horn"
msgid_plural "car horns"
msgstr[0] "自動車用クラクション"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'car horn'}
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "This is a car horn meant to be attached to a car's electrical system."
msgstr "車の電気系統に接続するためのクラクションだ。"

#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "large space heater"
msgid_plural "large space heaters"
msgstr[0] "高出力ヒーター"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'large space heater'}.
#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'small space heater'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "You turn on the heater."
msgstr "ヒーターの電源を入れた。"

#. ~ Use action need_charges_msg for {'str': 'large space heater'}.
#. ~ Use action need_charges_msg for {'str': 'small space heater'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "The heater needs more charge."
msgstr "ヒーターの電力が足りない。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'large space heater'}
#. ~ Description for {'str': 'large space heater (on)', 'str_pl': 'large space
#. heaters (on)'}
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid ""
"A portable electric heater that steadily emits warm air.  Raises temperature"
" about 10 degrees C and fills a larger volume of air than the smaller "
"version."
msgstr "暖かい空気を安定して放出する携帯用電気ヒーターだ。温度を約10度上昇させ、小型版よりも広い空間を暖める。"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'large space heater (on)', 'str_pl': 'large
#. space heaters (on)'}.
#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'small space heater (on)', 'str_pl': 'small
#. space heaters (on)'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "You turn off the heater."
msgstr "ヒーターの電源を切った。"

#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "lifestraw"
msgid_plural "lifestraws"
msgstr[0] "ライフストロー"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'lifestraw'}
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid ""
"Set the lifestraw in suspect water, let sit for one minute then drink.  The "
"two part filtration system will purify the water you drink.  Water taken "
"from uncertain sources like a river may be dirty."
msgstr ""
"疑わしい水源の水にライフストローを差し込み、1分間待ってから飲む。二層式のろ過システムが、飲む水を浄化してくれる。川のような不確かな水源から採取した水は汚れている可能性がある。"

#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "mind splicer kit"
msgid_plural "mind splicer kits"
msgstr[0] "マインド・スプライサー・キット"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'mind splicer kit'}
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid ""
"Surgical forceps, cables and a modified smartphone inside a small plastic "
"pouch.  Assembled to steal the mind of some poor man, these are tools of the"
" creepy high-tech sandman."
msgstr ""
"小さなプラスチック製ポーチの中に、外科用鉗子、ケーブル、改造されたスマートフォンが入っている。気の毒な犠牲者の精神を盗むために組み立てられた、不気味なハイテク時代のサンドマンの道具だ。"

#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "permanent marker"
msgid_plural "permanent markers"
msgstr[0] "油性マーカー"

#. ~ Use action gerund for {'str': 'permanent marker'}.
#. ~ Use action gerund for {'str': 'survival marker'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "Written"
msgstr "書込み"

#. ~ Use action verb for {'str': 'permanent marker'}.
#. ~ Use action verb for {'str': 'survival marker'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "Write"
msgstr "記入"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'permanent marker'}
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid ""
"This is a King Size(tm) industrial strength permanent marker, about halfway "
"between a typical marker and a can of spray paint in size.  Use it to write "
"something down.  However, writing \"Elbereth\" probably won't help you."
msgstr ""
"サイズは一般的なマーカーとスプレー缶の中間ほどある、業務用「キングサイズ™」の油性マーカーだ。これで何かを書き留められる。だが、\"Elbereth\"と書いても気休めにもならないだろう。"

#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "zombie pheromone"
msgid_plural "zombie pheromones"
msgstr[0] "ゾンビフェロモン"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'zombie pheromone'}
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid ""
"This is a disgusting ball of rotting meat of zombie origin.  Squeezing this "
"gland causes a small cloud of pheromones to spray into the air.  Apparently "
"the foul secretion can change zombies' attitude towards you, and they may "
"ignore you for a short period of time.  Perhaps they briefly consider you as"
" one of them."
msgstr ""
"ゾンビを材料に作られた、吐き気を催す腐肉の塊だ。この腺を握りつぶすと、少量のフェロモンが空気中に噴出する。この汚れた分泌物はゾンビの君に対する態度を変え、短時間だけ君を無視する可能性がある。おそらく彼らは、君を仲間だと勘違いするのだろう。"

#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "pocket watch"
msgid_plural "pocket watches"
msgstr[0] "懐中時計"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'pocket watch', 'str_pl': 'pocket watches'}
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid ""
"An old-fashioned pocket watch.  This one tells you the time and looks good "
"doing it.  Can also be disassembled into some useful parts."
msgstr "昔ながらの懐中時計だ。時刻を知ることができるし、見た目もいい。いくつかの有用な部品に解体することもできる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "rollmat"
msgid_plural "rollmats"
msgstr[0] "ロールマット"

#. ~ Use action done_message for {'str': 'rollmat'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "You unroll the mat and lay it on the ground."
msgstr "マットを広げて地面に敷いた。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'rollmat'}
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid ""
"This is a sheet of foam which can be rolled tightly for storage.  It "
"insulates you from the floor, making it easier to sleep.  Use it to unroll "
"and place on the ground."
msgstr "丸めてコンパクトに収納できるウレタン製のシートだ。床からの冷気を遮断し、睡眠をとりやすくする。使用すると地面に広げられる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "safe deposit box"
msgid_plural "safe deposit boxes"
msgstr[0] "金庫"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'safe deposit box', 'str_pl': 'safe deposit
#. boxes'}
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid ""
"This is a secure combination lock box.  Sadly, you don't know the "
"combination.  Breaking inside it would destroy anything of value."
msgstr "ダイヤル式金庫だ。残念ながら、暗証番号は分からない。無理にこじ開けようとすると、中の貴重品を破壊してしまう。"

#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "sarcophagus access code"
msgid_plural "sarcophagus access codes"
msgstr[0] "石棺アクセスコード"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'sarcophagus access code'}
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid ""
"This printout is a string of numbers to access the elevator in the hazardous"
" waste sarcophagus."
msgstr "有害廃棄物石棺にあるエレベーターにアクセスするための数字列が印刷された用紙だ。"

#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "small space heater"
msgid_plural "small space heaters"
msgstr[0] "低出力ヒーター"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'small space heater'}
#. ~ Description for {'str': 'small space heater (on)', 'str_pl': 'small space
#. heaters (on)'}
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid ""
"A portable electric heater that steadily emits warm air.  Raises temperature"
" about 10 degrees C."
msgstr "暖かい空気を安定して放出する携帯用電気ヒーターだ。温度を約10℃上昇させる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "small space heater (on)"
msgid_plural "small space heaters (on)"
msgstr[0] "低出力ヒーター [作動中]"

#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "spray can"
msgid_plural "spray cans"
msgstr[0] "スプレー塗料"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'spray can'}
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid ""
"This is a spray can, filled with paint.  Use this tool to make graffiti on "
"the floor."
msgstr "塗料が入ったスプレー缶だ。地面に落書きをするのに使う。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'stepladder'}
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "This is a wooden stepladder.  Use it to set it down."
msgstr "木製の脚立だ。使用すると設置できる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "survival marker"
msgid_plural "survival markers"
msgstr[0] "炭片マーカー"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'survival marker'}
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid ""
"This is a sharpened piece of charcoal that is almost guaranteed to make your"
" hands all covered in charcoal.  Use it to write something down."
msgstr "先端を尖らせた木炭だ。使うと手が木炭まみれになること間違いなし。これで何かを書き留められる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "survivor telescope"
msgid_plural "survivor telescopes"
msgstr[0] "サバイバー望遠鏡"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'survivor telescope'}
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid ""
"A homemade collapsible telescope.  Too large and inaccurate to use as a "
"weapon scope, but carrying this item in your inventory will double the "
"distance that is mapped around you during your travels."
msgstr ""
"自作の伸縮式望遠鏡だ。武器の照準器として使うには大きすぎ、精度も不十分だが、インベントリに入れて持ち歩くと、移動中に周囲のマップ範囲が2倍になる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "tear gas payload"
msgid_plural "tear gas payloads"
msgstr[0] "催涙ガス弾頭"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'tear gas payload'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "You pull the pin on the payload."
msgstr "弾頭のピンを抜いた。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'tear gas payload'}
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid ""
"This is a dummy item used by tear gas hacks.  You should never see it "
"outside of debug."
msgstr "これは催涙ガスを使用するマンハックのダミーアイテムだ。デバッグ以外でこれを目にすることはない。"

#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "active tear gas payload"
msgid_plural "active tear gas payloads"
msgstr[0] "催涙ガス弾頭 [起動中]"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'active tear gas payload'}
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid ""
"This is a dummy item used by tear gas hacks that just so happens to be "
"counting down.  You should never see it outside of debug."
msgstr "これは催涙ガスを起動させたマンハックが使用するダミーアイテムだ。デバッグ以外でこれを目にすることはない。"

#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "telescoping umbrella"
msgid_plural "telescoping umbrellas"
msgstr[0] "折り畳み傘"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'telescoping umbrella'}
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid ""
"A telescoping umbrella which collapses down for easy storage, useful for "
"keeping dry when wielded."
msgstr "コンパクトに折りたたんで収納できる傘だ。手に持てば濡れずに済む。"

#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "Flaming Chunk of Steel +2"
msgid_plural "Flaming Chunks of Steel +2"
msgstr[0] "灼熱の鋼塊 +2"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Flaming Chunk of Steel +2', 'str_pl': 'Flaming
#. Chunks of Steel +2'}
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "HOLY SHIT THIS THING IS ON FIRE"
msgstr "クソ、これ燃えてやがる！"

#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "Whistle of Tindalos"
msgid_plural "Whistles of Tindalos"
msgstr[0] "ティンダロスの笛"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Whistle of Tindalos', 'str_pl': 'Whistles of
#. Tindalos'}
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "Who is this Tindalos guy?"
msgstr "このティンダロスってやつは誰だ？"

#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "umbrella"
msgid_plural "umbrellas"
msgstr[0] "傘"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'umbrella'}
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "An umbrella with a pointy end, useful for keeping dry when wielded."
msgstr "先がとがった傘だ。手に持てば濡れずに済む。"

#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "vortex stone"
msgid_plural "vortex stones"
msgstr[0] "渦流石"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'vortex stone'}
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid ""
"This is a stone with spirals all over it, and holes around its perimeter.  "
"Though it is fairly large, it weighs next to nothing.  Air seems to gather "
"around it."
msgstr "全体に渦巻き模様があり、周囲に穴が開いた石だ。かなり大きいが、重さはほとんどない。空気が石の周りに集まっているように見える。"

#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "whistle multitool"
msgid_plural "whistle multitools"
msgstr[0] "万能ホイッスル"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'whistle multitool'}
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid ""
"A cheap gadget combining a whistle, thermometer, magnifying glass, and "
"compass."
msgstr "ホイッスル、温度計、虫眼鏡、コンパスが一つになった安物のガジェットだ。"

#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "handmade pocket watch"
msgid_plural "handmade pocket watches"
msgstr[0] "自作懐中時計"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'handmade pocket watch', 'str_pl': 'handmade
#. pocket watches'}
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid ""
"An old-fashioned pocket watch, useful for telling the time and not much "
"else."
msgstr "昔ながらの懐中時計だ。時刻を知るのに役立つが、それ以外に大した使い道はない。"

#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "artificial womb"
msgid_plural "artificial wombs"
msgstr[0] ""

#. ~ Use action friendly_msg for {'str': 'artificial womb'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "The cloned creature seems to enjoy your presence."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Use action hostile_msg for {'str': 'artificial womb'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "The cloned creature seems aloof to you!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'artificial womb'}
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid ""
"This artificial womb holds a nearly fully grown clone, nurtured from "
"extracted DNA within a cloning vat.  Activate it, and the organism will "
"swiftly complete its development and emerge ready to function.  Ideal for "
"quickly repopulating herds, restoring endangered species, or deploying "
"engineered creatures with minimal wait."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'artificial womb'}
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid ""
"A single-use vessel for transporting clones safely from the cloning vat to "
"the field.  Currently empty, if sufficiently sterile it can be used by a "
"cloning vat to grow a creature from a viable DNA sample. "
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/tool/musical_instruments.json
msgid "banjo"
msgid_plural "banjos"
msgstr[0] "バンジョー"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'banjo'}
#: data/json/items/tool/musical_instruments.json
msgid "A standard factory-made banjo.  Looks to be in working condition."
msgstr "一般的な工場製のバンジョーだ。見たところ問題なく弾けそうだ。"

#: data/json/items/tool/musical_instruments.json
msgid "bone flute"
msgid_plural "bone flutes"
msgstr[0] "骨のフルート"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'bone flute'}
#: data/json/items/tool/musical_instruments.json
msgid "A polished bone flute with five finger holes."
msgstr "滑らかな骨に5つの指穴が開いたフルートだ。"

#: data/json/items/tool/musical_instruments.json
msgid "wooden flute"
msgid_plural "wooden flutes"
msgstr[0] "木製フルート"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'wooden flute'}
#: data/json/items/tool/musical_instruments.json
msgid "A simple flute carved from wood with five finger holes."
msgstr "木から彫り出した、5つの指穴があるシンプルなフルートだ。"

#: data/json/items/tool/musical_instruments.json
msgid "clarinet"
msgid_plural "clarinets"
msgstr[0] "クラリネット"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'clarinet'}
#: data/json/items/tool/musical_instruments.json
msgid "An ornate clarinet made from wood."
msgstr "木製の華やかなクラリネットだ。"

#: data/json/items/tool/musical_instruments.json
msgid "flute"
msgid_plural "flutes"
msgstr[0] "フルート"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'flute'}
#: data/json/items/tool/musical_instruments.json
msgid "A simple silver-plated flute."
msgstr "シンプルな銀メッキのフルートだ。"

#: data/json/items/tool/musical_instruments.json
msgid "trumpet"
msgid_plural "trumpets"
msgstr[0] "トランペット"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'trumpet'}
#: data/json/items/tool/musical_instruments.json
msgid "A brass trumpet with only a few dents here and there."
msgstr "真鍮製のトランペットだ。あちこちにわずかに凹みがある。"

#: data/json/items/tool/musical_instruments.json
msgid "ukulele"
msgid_plural "ukuleles"
msgstr[0] "ウクレレ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'ukulele'}
#: data/json/items/tool/musical_instruments.json
msgid "A small factory made ukulele.  Looks to be in working condition."
msgstr "小さな工場で作られたウクレレだ。見たところ問題なく弾けそうだ。"

#: data/json/items/tool/musical_instruments.json
msgid "violin"
msgid_plural "violins"
msgstr[0] "ヴァイオリン"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'violin'}
#: data/json/items/tool/musical_instruments.json
msgid ""
"A cheap, factory-made violin with a built-in holder for a bow.  Still "
"produces a nice sound."
msgstr "弓のホルダーが組み込まれた、安価な工場製のヴァイオリンだ。それでも、いい音を奏でてくれる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/musical_instruments.json
msgid "golden fiddle"
msgid_plural "golden fiddles"
msgstr[0] "黄金のフィドル"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'golden fiddle'}
#: data/json/items/tool/musical_instruments.json
msgid ""
"A shiny golden fiddle, with a strange aura around it.  You feel like it once"
" belonged to the best there's ever been."
msgstr "不思議なオーラを纏った、輝く黄金のフィドルだ。これは史上最高のフィドルだったに違いない。"

#: data/json/items/tool/pets.json
msgid "chicken cage"
msgid_plural "chicken cages"
msgstr[0] "ニワトリ用ケージ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'chicken cage'}
#: data/json/items/tool/pets.json
msgid ""
"A wire container made for transporting chickens, but you can use it to hold "
"any tiny animal.  Use it on a suitable animal to capture, use it on an empty"
" tile to release."
msgstr ""
"ニワトリの運搬に使うワイヤー製のケージだ。どんな小動物でも中に入れられる。使用して動物がいる方向を選択すれば捕獲でき、何もいない方向を選択すれば中の動物を解放できる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/pets.json
msgid "dog whistle"
msgid_plural "dog whistles"
msgstr[0] "犬笛"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'dog whistle'}
#: data/json/items/tool/pets.json
msgid ""
"This is a small whistle.  When used, it produces a high tone that causes "
"nearby friendly dogs to either follow you closely and stop attacking, or "
"start attacking enemies if they are currently docile."
msgstr "小さな笛だ。使用すると甲高い音で付近の友好的なイヌに指示を出し、近くに呼び寄せて攻撃を止めさせたり、大人しい状態の敵を襲わせたりできる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/pets.json
msgid "shears"
msgid_plural "shears"
msgstr[0] "毛刈りハサミ"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'shears'}
#: data/json/items/tool/pets.json
msgid "This is a set of shears designed to obtain wool from sheep."
msgstr "羊から羊毛を刈り取るためのハサミだ。"

#: data/json/items/tool/pets.json
msgid "electric shears"
msgid_plural "electric shears"
msgstr[0] "電動毛刈りハサミ"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'electric shears'}
#: data/json/items/tool/pets.json
msgid "These electric shears can be used to shear animals quicker."
msgstr "動物の毛を素早く刈れる電動ハサミだ。"

#: data/json/items/tool/pets.json
msgid "horse tack"
msgid_plural "horse tacks"
msgstr[0] "馬具"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'horse tack'}
#: data/json/items/tool/pets.json
msgid ""
"A saddle, bridle, and associated tack that can be placed on a tamed animal "
"that is capable of being ridden."
msgstr "騎乗に適した飼いならされた動物に装着できる鞍、馬勒などの馬具一式だ。"

#: data/json/items/tool/pets.json
msgid "pet carrier"
msgid_plural "pet carriers"
msgstr[0] "ペットキャリー"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'pet carrier'}
#: data/json/items/tool/pets.json
msgid ""
"A plastic container meant to hold pets for transport.  Use it on a suitable "
"animal to capture, use it on an empty tile to release."
msgstr ""
"ペットを収容して運ぶための、プラスチック製のケージだ。使用して動物がいる方向を選択すれば捕獲でき、何もいない方向を選択すれば中の動物を解放できる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/pets.json
msgid "wooden pet carrier"
msgid_plural "wooden pet carriers"
msgstr[0] "木製ペットキャリー"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'wooden pet carrier'}
#: data/json/items/tool/pets.json
msgid ""
"A wooden container meant to hold pets for transport.  Use it on a suitable "
"animal to capture, use it on an empty tile to release."
msgstr "ペットの収容や運搬を目的として作られた木製の容器だ。使用して適切な動物の方向を選択すると収容し、何もないタイルを選択すると開放する。"

#: data/json/items/tool/pets.json
msgid "wooden dog whistle"
msgid_plural "wooden dog whistles"
msgstr[0] "木製犬笛"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'wooden dog whistle'}
#: data/json/items/tool/pets.json
msgid ""
"This is a whistle carved out of hardwood.  When used, it produces a high "
"tone that causes nearby friendly dogs to either follow you closely and stop "
"attacking, or start attacking enemies if they are currently docile."
msgstr ""
"堅い木を彫って作った笛だ。使用すると甲高い音で付近の友好的なイヌに指示を出し、近くに呼び寄せて攻撃を止めさせたり、大人しい状態の敵を襲わせたりできる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/radio_tools.json
msgid "radio car base"
msgid_plural "radio car bases"
msgstr[0] "ラジコンカー台"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'radio car base'}
#: data/json/items/tool/radio_tools.json
msgid "Generic radio car kit, you shouldn't see this."
msgstr "汎用的なラジコンカーキットだ。これを目にすることはないはずだ。"

#: data/json/items/tool/radio_tools.json
msgid "radio car box"
msgid_plural "radio car boxes"
msgstr[0] "ラジコンカーセット"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'radio car box', 'str_pl': 'radio car boxes'}
#: data/json/items/tool/radio_tools.json
msgid ""
"An RC car, with radio-control and batteries included!  Disassemble to unpack"
" and enjoy."
msgstr "箱の中にはラジコンカー、無線制御装置と電池が入っている！分解して開けたら存分に楽しんでくれ。"

#: data/json/items/tool/radio_tools.json
msgid "RC control"
msgid_plural "RC controls"
msgstr[0] "無線制御装置"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'RC control'}
#: data/json/items/tool/radio_tools.json
msgid ""
"A remote control for RC cars, with joystick to steer the car and colorful "
"buttons that don't seem to do anything.  Perhaps they were for the deluxe "
"model?"
msgstr "ジョイスティックと色鮮やかなボタンが付いたリモコンだ。だが、ボタンは何の役にも立たないようだ。デラックスモデル用だったのだろうか？"

#: data/json/items/tool/radio_tools.json
msgid "RC car"
msgid_plural "RC cars"
msgstr[0] "ラジコンカー"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'RC car'}
#: data/json/items/tool/radio_tools.json
msgid "A remote-controlled car.  Fun for young and old alike."
msgstr "遠隔制御できる模型自動車だ。老若男女問わず楽しめる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/radio_tools.json
msgid "RC car (on)"
msgid_plural "RC cars (on)"
msgstr[0] "ラジコンカー [作動中]"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'RC car (on)', 'str_pl': 'RC cars (on)'}
#: data/json/items/tool/radio_tools.json
msgid ""
"This remote-controlled car is on, and draining its batteries just like a "
"real electric car!  Use a remote control to drive it around."
msgstr "電源が入ったラジコンカーだ。まるで本物の電気自動車のように電池を消費している！無線制御装置を使って操作しろ。"

#: data/json/items/tool/radio_tools.json
msgid "radio activation mod"
msgid_plural "radio activation mods"
msgstr[0] "無線起動モジュール"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'radio activation mod'}
#: data/json/items/tool/radio_tools.json
msgid ""
"This small piece of electronics can be attached to certain items and "
"activate them after receiving a radio signal."
msgstr "この小型電子機器を特定の道具に取り付けると、無線信号を受信した時に起動するようになる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/radio_tools.json
msgid "radio (off)"
msgid_plural "radios (off)"
msgstr[0] "ラジオ [停止中]"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'radio (off)', 'str_pl': 'radios (off)'}
#: data/json/items/tool/radio_tools.json
msgid ""
"This is a portable radio.  Using this radio turns it on.  It will pick up "
"any nearby signals being broadcast and play them audibly."
msgstr "携帯ラジオだ。使用すると電源が入る。近くで放送されている任意の信号を受信し、音を鳴らす。"

#: data/json/items/tool/radio_tools.json
msgid "radio (on)"
msgid_plural "radios (on)"
msgstr[0] "ラジオ [作動中]"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'radio (on)', 'str_pl': 'radios (on)'}
#: data/json/items/tool/radio_tools.json
msgid ""
"This portable radio is turned on, and continually draining its batteries.  "
"It is playing the broadcast being sent from any nearby radio towers."
msgstr "携帯ラジオは電源が入っており、継続的に電池を消費している。近くの電波塔が送信している任意の放送を受信している。"

#: data/json/items/tool/radio_tools.json
msgid "two-way radio"
msgid_plural "two-way radios"
msgstr[0] "双方向無線機"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'two-way radio'}
#: data/json/items/tool/radio_tools.json
msgid ""
"This is a radio with a transmitting unit.  You could use it to contact "
"someone who also has one.  Unfortunately no one seems to use those nowadays…"
msgstr "送信機能が付いた無線機だ。同じものを持っている人と連絡を取れる。残念ながら、今の時代これを使っている人はいないようだが…"

#: data/json/items/tool/radio_tools.json
msgid "remote vehicle controller"
msgid_plural "remote vehicle controllers"
msgstr[0] "遠隔車両制御装置"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'remote vehicle controller'}
#: data/json/items/tool/radio_tools.json
msgid ""
"A remote controller for real cars.  Can turn onboard devices on and off.  "
"Some cars can be driven remotely."
msgstr "本物の車のための遠隔制御装置だ。車両に搭載された機器の電源を入れたり切ったりできる。これを使って遠隔駆動できる車もある。"

#. ~ Use action done_message for {'str': 'birchbark funnel'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/raincatchers.json
msgid "You place the birchbark funnel, waiting to collect rain."
msgstr "雨水を集めるために樹皮製の漏斗を設置した。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'birchbark funnel'}
#: data/json/items/tool/raincatchers.json
msgid ""
"This is a small birchbark funnel.  Place it above an outdoor container to "
"collect rainwater."
msgstr "樹皮製の小さな漏斗だ。屋外に置いた容器の上に設置すると、雨水を集められる。"

#. ~ Use action done_message for {'str': 'funnel'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/raincatchers.json
msgid "You place the funnel, waiting to collect rain."
msgstr "雨水を集めるために漏斗を設置した。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'funnel'}
#: data/json/items/tool/raincatchers.json
msgid ""
"This is a funnel used to collect rainwater.  Use it outside and place a "
"container beneath it to collect water when it rains."
msgstr "雨水を集めるための漏斗だ。屋外で使用し、下に容器を置けば雨水を溜められる。"

#. ~ Use action done_message for {'str': 'leather funnel'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/raincatchers.json
msgid "You place the leather funnel, waiting to collect rain."
msgstr "雨水を集めるために革製の漏斗を設置した。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'leather funnel'}
#: data/json/items/tool/raincatchers.json
msgid ""
"This is a small, leather funnel used to collect rainwater.  Use it outside "
"and place a container beneath it to collect water when it rains."
msgstr "雨水を集める革製の小さな漏斗だ。屋外で使用し、下に容器を置けば雨水を溜められる。"

#. ~ Use action done_message for {'str': 'makeshift funnel'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/raincatchers.json
msgid "You place the makeshift funnel, waiting to collect rain."
msgstr "雨水を集めるために簡易漏斗を設置した。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'makeshift funnel'}
#: data/json/items/tool/raincatchers.json
msgid ""
"This is a small, makeshift funnel used to collect rainwater.  Use it outside"
" and place a container beneath it to collect water when it rains."
msgstr "雨水を集める自作の小さな漏斗だ。屋外で使用し、下に容器を置けば雨水を溜められる。"

#. ~ Use action done_message for {'str': 'metal funnel'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/raincatchers.json
msgid "You place the metal funnel, waiting to collect rain."
msgstr "雨水を集めるために金属製の漏斗を設置した。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'metal funnel'}
#: data/json/items/tool/raincatchers.json
msgid ""
"This is a large metal funnel used to collect rainwater.  Less portable than "
"plastic funnels, but collects more water.  Use it outside and place a "
"container beneath it to collect water when it rains."
msgstr ""
"雨水を集める金属製の大きな漏斗だ。プラスチック製のものと比べて持ち運びにくいが、より多くの水を集められる。屋外で使用し、下に容器を置けば雨水を溜められる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/raincatchers.json
#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
msgid "tarp raincatcher"
msgid_plural "tarp raincatchers"
msgstr[0] "集水シート"

#. ~ Use action done_message for {'str': 'tarp raincatcher'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/raincatchers.json
msgid "You set up the raincatcher, waiting to collect water."
msgstr "雨水を集めるために集水シートを設置した。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'tarp raincatcher'}
#: data/json/items/tool/raincatchers.json
msgid ""
"Some sticks and string with a tarp to set up an improvised raincatcher."
msgstr "棒とひも、防水シートを使って作った、即席の設置式集水器だ。"

#: data/json/items/tool/science.json
msgid "barometer"
msgid_plural "barometers"
msgstr[0] "気圧計"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'barometer'}
#: data/json/items/tool/science.json
msgid "A plastic barometer that can read the atmospheric pressure."
msgstr "大気圧を測定できるプラスチック製の気圧計だ。"

#: data/json/items/tool/science.json
msgid "goo canister"
msgid_plural "goo canisters"
msgstr[0] "粘液の缶詰"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'goo canister'}
#: data/json/items/tool/science.json
msgid ""
"There is a label on this canister: \"Warning: contains highly toxic and "
"corrosive materials.  Contents may be sentient.  Open at your own risk.\" "
"You think you can feel something moving inside it."
msgstr ""
"缶の上部にラベルが貼ってある。「警告:強い毒物や腐食性物質が含まれています。中身は知性を持つ可能性があります。開封は自己責任で。」缶の中で何かが動いているように感じる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/science.json
msgid "chemistry set"
msgid_plural "chemistry sets"
msgstr[0] "化学実験セット"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'chemistry set'}
#: data/json/items/tool/science.json
msgid ""
"This is a chemistry set stored in a box.  The contents include glass "
"containers, hoses, metal wire, a hotplate, and safety glasses.  It might be "
"used to craft some chemistry projects if you're so inclined."
msgstr ""
"持ち運び可能な箱に収納された化学実験セットだ。ガラス容器、ゴムホース、金属線、ホットプレート、保護メガネなどが含まれている。気が向いたら、いくつかの化学系製作に使えるかもしれない。"

#: data/json/items/tool/science.json
msgid "basic chemistry set"
msgid_plural "basic chemistry sets"
msgstr[0] "基礎化学実験器具セット"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'basic chemistry set'}
#: data/json/items/tool/science.json
msgid ""
"This is a basic chemistry set which includes glass containers, hoses and "
"safety glasses.  It might be used to craft some chemistry projects if you're"
" so inclined, but you'll need a source of heat."
msgstr ""
"ガラス容器、ゴムホース、保護メガネなどが含まれた基本的な化学実験器具のセットだ。気が向いたら、いくつかの化学系製作に使えるが、別途熱源が必要になる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/science.json
msgid "electrolysis kit"
msgid_plural "electrolysis kits"
msgstr[0] "電解キット"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'electrolysis kit'}
#: data/json/items/tool/science.json
msgid ""
"A set of wiring and electrodes for applying a direct current, usually to a "
"liquid.  Useful for crafting.  Load with a storage battery or 12V vehicle "
"battery to use."
msgstr "通常は液体に直流電流を流すための、配線と電極のセットだ。製作に役立つ。使用するには蓄電池か12Vの自動車用バッテリーを装填する必要がある。"

#: data/json/items/tool/science.json
msgid "hydrogen tank"
msgid_plural "hydrogen tanks"
msgstr[0] "水素タンク"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'hydrogen tank'}
#: data/json/items/tool/science.json
msgid ""
"This is a tank of compressed hydrogen gas.  If you need to make water from "
"scratch, or lift a zeppelin, it could come in handy."
msgstr "高圧の水素ガスが充填されたタンクだ。ゼロから水を作り出したい時や、飛行船を浮上させたい時に役立つだろう。"

#: data/json/items/tool/science.json
msgid "hygrometer"
msgid_plural "hygrometers"
msgstr[0] "湿度計"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'hygrometer'}
#: data/json/items/tool/science.json
msgid "A plastic hygrometer that can read the relative humidity in the air."
msgstr "大気中の相対湿度を測るプラスチック製の湿度計だ。"

#: data/json/items/tool/science.json
msgid "nitrogen tank"
msgid_plural "nitrogen tanks"
msgstr[0] "窒素タンク"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'nitrogen tank'}
#: data/json/items/tool/science.json
msgid ""
"This is a tank of compressed nitrogen gas.  Nitrogen is useful for its lack "
"of reactivity.  Don't try to breathe it."
msgstr "高圧の窒素ガスが充填されたタンクだ。窒素は反応性に乏しいため様々な用途に使える。吸い込もうとはするな。"

#: data/json/items/tool/science.json
msgid "oxygen cylinder"
msgid_plural "oxygen cylinders"
msgstr[0] "酸素ボンベ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'oxygen cylinder'}
#: data/json/items/tool/science.json
msgid ""
"A large steel cylinder used for storing pressurized gas.  It is marked with "
"a faded, but legible O2 symbol."
msgstr "加圧されたガスを保存するための大きな鋼鉄製シリンダーだ。表面は色あせているが、酸素のシンボルマークははっきりと読み取れる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/science.json
msgid "carbon dioxide tank"
msgid_plural "carbon dioxide tanks"
msgstr[0] "二酸化炭素タンク"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'carbon dioxide tank'}
#: data/json/items/tool/science.json
msgid "This is a tank of compressed carbon dioxide gas."
msgstr "高圧の二酸化炭素ガスが充填されたタンクだ。"

#: data/json/items/tool/science.json
msgid "platinum grille"
msgid_plural "platinum grilles"
msgstr[0] "プラチナ担体"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'platinum grille'}
#: data/json/items/tool/science.json
msgid ""
"This is a metal grille with a layer of platinum plating, suitable for use as"
" a catalyst for some chemical reactions."
msgstr "プラチナメッキをかけた金属製の網だ。いくつかの化学反応で触媒として使える。"

#: data/json/items/tool/science.json
msgid "portal generator"
msgid_plural "portal generators"
msgstr[0] "ポータル発生器"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'portal generator'}
#: data/json/items/tool/science.json
msgid ""
"This is a rare, bizarre, and arcane device of an otherworldly nature.  It's "
"giving you a headache just looking at it.  It is covered in alien markings."
msgstr "異世界よりもたらされた、希少かつ奇妙で秘術的な装置だ。見ているだけで頭痛がする。この世のものとは思えない文様がびっしりと刻まれている。"

#. ~ Use action done_message for {'str': 'teleport pad'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/science.json
msgid "You place the telepad."
msgstr "瞬間移動パッドを設置した。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'teleport pad'}
#: data/json/items/tool/science.json
msgid ""
"This is a kit for a teleporter trap consisting of a teleporter and a solar "
"cell that is triggered when stepped upon."
msgstr "テレポート罠の一式だ。踏むと作動するソーラー電池と瞬間移動装置が組み合わされている。"

#: data/json/items/tool/science.json
msgid "teleporter"
msgid_plural "teleporters"
msgstr[0] "瞬間移動装置"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'teleporter'}
#: data/json/items/tool/science.json
msgid ""
"This is an experimental device that will teleport you a short distance when "
"activated."
msgstr "起動すると短い距離をテレポートできる実験装置だ。"

#: data/json/items/tool/science.json
msgid "Doppler Radar Turbo 2000"
msgid_plural "Doppler Radar Turbo 2000s"
msgstr[0] "ドップラーレーダーターボ2000"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Doppler Radar Turbo 2000'}
#: data/json/items/tool/science.json
msgid ""
"A briefcase with built-in laptop that looks like it's from the 80s.  Its "
"vintage monochrome monitor displays a plethora of meteorological data.  No "
"sign of the FLDSMDFR, however."
msgstr ""
"80年代の製品にも見える、ノートPCが内蔵されたブリーフケースだ。年代物のモノクロモニターには、たくさんの気象データが表示されている。しかし、FLDSMDFRがやってきた兆候はまだ見つからない。"

#: data/json/items/tool/science.json
msgid "basic laboratory analysis kit"
msgid_plural "basic laboratory analysis kits"
msgstr[0] "基礎検査分析キット"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'basic laboratory analysis kit'}
#: data/json/items/tool/science.json
msgid ""
"This hefty kit contains some basic things you should probably not try to do "
"precise chemistry without: namely, a small balance scale, a "
"spectrophotometer, a melting point apparatus, a pH meter, and a set of paper"
" for thin layer chromatography.  This makes it a lot easier to feel "
"confident that the chemical you've made is what you think you've made."
msgstr ""
"精密な化学分析には欠かせない、ずっしりと重いキットだ。小型天秤ばかり、分光光度計、融点測定装置、pHメーター、そして薄層クロマトグラフィー用の紙が一式含まれている。これを使えば、自分で作った化学物質が思い通りのものか、ずっと簡単に確認できるだろう。"

#: data/json/items/tool/science.json
msgid "small weight scale"
msgid_plural "small weight scales"
msgstr[0] "小型天秤ばかり"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'small weight scale'}
#: data/json/items/tool/science.json
msgid ""
"This is a simple scale that uses a set of steel weights on sliding bars to "
"measure a sample's mass quite accurately."
msgstr "竿に取り付けられた鋼鉄製のおもりを使ってサンプルの質量をかなり正確に測定する、簡素な作りの測定器だ。"

#: data/json/items/tool/science.json
msgid "spectrophotometer"
msgid_plural "spectrophotometers"
msgstr[0] "分光光度計"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'spectrophotometer'}
#: data/json/items/tool/science.json
msgid ""
"This ubiquitous analytical chemistry tool measures the light absorption of a"
" liquid sample in a special tube called a cuvette."
msgstr "キュベットと呼ばれる特殊なチューブ内に液体サンプルを入れて吸光度を測定する、分析化学の分野で広く使われているツールだ。"

#: data/json/items/tool/science.json
msgid "pH meter"
msgid_plural "pH meters"
msgstr[0] "pHメーター"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'pH meter'}
#: data/json/items/tool/science.json
msgid ""
"This is basically a pair of glass probes on a voltmeter.  By putting one "
"probe into a calibration solution (conveniently included) and the other in a"
" substance, you can calculate the acidity."
msgstr ""
"基本的には、2本のガラス製プローブが付いた電圧計だ。一方のプローブを標準液（親切にも付属している）に、もう一方を検査対象の物質に浸すことで、酸性度を測定できる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/science.json
msgid "voltmeter"
msgid_plural "voltmeters"
msgstr[0] "電圧計"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'voltmeter'}
#: data/json/items/tool/science.json
msgid ""
"This device has two probes that let you measure the electrical potential "
"between two points.  Activate to check the status of any local grid "
"connections or battery charge in your surroundings, as well as make "
"modifications to grid connections"
msgstr ""
"2つのプローブを使って2点間の電位差を測定できる装置だ。起動すると、周囲の局所的な電力網接続やバッテリー残量を確認できるほか、電力網の接続を変更することも可能だ。"

#: data/json/items/tool/science.json
msgid "melting point apparatus"
msgid_plural "units of melting point apparatus"
msgstr[0] "融点測定装置"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'melting point apparatus', 'str_pl': 'units of
#. melting point apparatus'}
#: data/json/items/tool/science.json
msgid ""
"This is basically a hot plate, with a metal housing attached.  The metal "
"housing has a magnification viewport and a slot into which a capillary tube "
"containing a crystallized sample is inserted.  The device lets you precisely"
" measure the melting point of a crystal, a property very useful in "
"identifying what it is and how pure it is."
msgstr ""
"要するに、金属製の筐体が取り付けられたホットプレートだ。筐体には拡大レンズと、結晶化したサンプルを入れる毛細管挿入スロットが付いている。この装置を使えば、結晶の融点を正確に測定でき、それが何の物質でどれだけ純粋かを特定するのに非常に役立つ。"

#: data/json/items/tool/science.json
msgid "vortex device"
msgid_plural "vortex devices"
msgstr[0] "ボルテックスミキサー"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'vortex device'}
#: data/json/items/tool/science.json
msgid ""
"This is a small, hefty, boring looking machine.  Its weighted trapezoidal "
"frame has a single on-off switch and a speed dial, and on top of it sits a "
"rubber receptacle.  Pressing a test tube into the receptacle would, with "
"power, rapidly shake and mix the contents of the test tube.  It's "
"surprisingly fun to use."
msgstr ""
"小さく、ずっしりと重く、つまらない見た目の機械だ。重い台形の土台には電源スイッチとダイヤルが1つずつ付いており、上部にはゴム製の容器がある。試験管をこの容器に押し当てると、電源が入っていれば中身を素早く攪拌してくれる。使ってみると驚くほど楽しい。"

#: data/json/items/tool/science.json
msgid "light detector"
msgid_plural "light detectors"
msgstr[0] "光センサー"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'light detector'}
#: data/json/items/tool/science.json
msgid ""
"This is a photodiode on a chip, designed to convert incoming light to "
"electrical energy for quantification."
msgstr "チップに取り付けられたフォトダイオードだ。受けた光を電気エネルギーに変換して定量化するように設計されている。"

#: data/json/items/tool/science.json
msgid "glass prism"
msgid_plural "glass prisms"
msgstr[0] "プリズム"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'glass prism'}
#: data/json/items/tool/science.json
msgid ""
"This is a high quality crystal glass prism for separating and redirecting "
"light."
msgstr "光を分散・屈折させるための高品質なクリスタルガラス製プリズムだ。"

#: data/json/items/tool/science.json
msgid "small glass tube"
msgid_plural "small glass tubes"
msgstr[0] "小型ガラス管"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'small glass tube'}
#: data/json/items/tool/science.json
msgid ""
"This is a small glass tube.  What more could you possibly want to know about"
" it?"
msgstr "小さなガラス管だ。これ以上他に知りたいことがあるか？"

#: data/json/items/tool/science.json
msgid "microscope"
msgid_plural "microscopes"
msgstr[0] "顕微鏡"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'microscope'}
#: data/json/items/tool/science.json
msgid ""
"A classic tool for the ages!  This hefty, durable piece of lab equipment "
"makes small things look bigger.  Without electricity the light doesn't work,"
" but the rest of it is surprisingly functional.  Unfortunately it's not "
"useful for very much at the moment."
msgstr ""
"昔ながらの古典的な道具だ！この重く頑丈な実験器具を使えば、小さな物体をより大きく拡大して観察できる。電気がなければ照明は機能しないが、それ以外の機能は驚くほど実用的だ。残念ながら、今のところあまり役に立たない。"

#: data/json/items/tool/science.json
msgid "dissecting microscope"
msgid_plural "dissecting microscopes"
msgstr[0] "解剖顕微鏡"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'dissecting microscope'}
#: data/json/items/tool/science.json
msgid ""
"This microscope has less magnification than a standard one.  It's also "
"stereoscopic and produces a neat 3d image of the surface.  It was typically "
"used for doing dissections and other fine detail work on small creatures.  "
"It still works pretty well with an added light source, but what would you do"
" with it?"
msgstr ""
"この顕微鏡は標準的なものより拡大倍率が低い。だが立体視が可能で、試料の表面を詳細に観察できる。一般的に小さな生物の解剖や細かい作業に使うものだ。光源があれば今の状態でもかなりうまく機能するが、一体何に使うつもりだ？"

#: data/json/items/tool/science.json
msgid "separation funnel"
msgid_plural "separation funnels"
msgstr[0] "分液漏斗"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'separation funnel'}
#: data/json/items/tool/science.json
msgid ""
"This thing doesn't look much like a funnel.  It's a teardrop shaped piece of"
" glass with a stopper at the wide end and a valve at the other.  It can be "
"used to wash one liquid with another, like water and an oil, and then draw "
"off whichever of the two liquids contains a higher amount of whatever "
"compound you're trying to isolate.  With a high level of skill it can also "
"be used to make juvenile farting noises."
msgstr ""
"とても漏斗には見えない形状だ。膨らんだ上部に栓、下部に弁が付いた涙滴型のガラス瓶だ。水と油のように混じり合わない液体を分離させ、一方の液体に含まれる特定の化合物を抽出するために使える。高度なスキルがあれば、子供じみたおならの音を出すこともできるかもしれない。"

#: data/json/items/tool/science.json
msgid "rotary evaporator"
msgid_plural "rotary evaporators"
msgstr[0] "ロータリーエバポレーター"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'rotary evaporator'}
#: data/json/items/tool/science.json
msgid ""
"Just looking at this thing makes you feel like a proper mad scientist.  It's"
" a series of glass tubes and round flasks, connected to a central motor and "
"a heating element.  The heating element warms one flask, kept rotating by "
"the motor, evaporating the contents.  The vapour is then condensed in the "
"tubes and collected in another flask, in case you wanted to save it for "
"later."
msgstr ""
"これを見ているだけで、ちゃんとしたマッドサイエンティストになったような気分になる。ガラス管と複数の丸型フラスコが連結された容器に、中央のモーターと加熱装置が接続されている。加熱装置で一方のフラスコを温め、モーターで回転させて内容物を蒸発させる。蒸気はガラス管で凝縮され、後で使う場合に備えて別のフラスコに集められる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/science.json
msgid "fractional distillation apparatus"
msgid_plural "fractional distillation apparati"
msgstr[0] "蒸留装置"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'fractional distillation apparatus', 'str_pl':
#. 'fractional distillation apparati'}
#: data/json/items/tool/science.json
msgid ""
"One of the classic pieces of mad science glassware, this is basically a "
"small volume still that passes the vapour through a fractional distillation "
"column and then condenses the distillate in a cooled collection column.  A "
"grad student or a robot (is there really any difference?) collects the "
"distillate in fractions so that specific contents can be analyzed.  Going a "
"few milliliters at a time, it would not be very effective to try to distill "
"whiskey in this thing."
msgstr ""
"マッドサイエンスの古典的なガラス器具の一つだ。基本的には、蒸気を分留塔に通し、冷却された凝縮器で留出物を凝縮させて回収する、小型の蒸留装置だ。大学院生かロボット（この2つに違いがあるだろうか？）が、特定の成分を分析できるよう、留出物を少量ずつ集める。一度に数ミリリットルしか蒸留できないため、これでウイスキーを蒸留しようとするのは非効率的だろう。"

#: data/json/items/tool/science.json
msgid "electrophoresis tray"
msgid_plural "electrophoresis trays"
msgstr[0] "電気泳動装置"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'electrophoresis tray'}
#: data/json/items/tool/science.json
msgid ""
"This is a set of plastic trays, electrodes, and a power supply designed to "
"create an electric voltage gradient through a liquid solution containing a "
"solid gel.  Stuff like proteins and DNA would then get separated on the gel "
"according to electrical charge and size.  Pretty useless now, for anything "
"but salvage."
msgstr ""
"ゲルを入れる一組のプラスチック製トレイに電極が付いており、電源を入れると、溶液中に電圧勾配が生じるようになっている。タンパク質やDNAなどの物質は、電荷とサイズに応じてゲル内で分離される。現状では、分解して部品を利用する以外の使い道はほとんどない。"

#: data/json/items/tool/science.json
msgid "microcentrifuge"
msgid_plural "microcentrifuges"
msgstr[0] "微量遠心分離機"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'microcentrifuge'}
#: data/json/items/tool/science.json
msgid ""
"This is a smaller, benchtop version of the larger furniture-sized "
"centrifuge.  Don't be fooled by its portable scale; it's still a very "
"powerful piece of equipment that can spin stuff really quickly.  It's not a "
"toy!"
msgstr ""
"大型の家具ほどのサイズの遠心分離機を卓上で使えるよう小型化した装置だ。小さな見た目に騙されるな。物質を非常に素早く回転させる、大変強力な装置だ。これはおもちゃではない！"

#: data/json/items/tool/science.json
msgid "3D printer"
msgid_plural "3D printers"
msgstr[0] "3Dプリンター"

#. ~ Description for {'str': '3D printer'}
#: data/json/items/tool/science.json
msgid ""
"Although it's not nearly as fancy as the experimental nanofabricators, this "
"civilian-grade 3D printer can produce almost any item out of plastic, "
"polymer, or carbon fiber…  so long as you can program it.  It's also useful "
"for repairing items made out of plastic or carbon fiber."
msgstr ""
"ナノファブリケーターの足元にも及ばないが、この民生用3Dプリンターは、適切にプログラミングすれば、プラスチック、ポリマー、カーボンファイバー製のほぼ全てのアイテムを製造可能だ。これらの素材のアイテムを修理する際にも有用である。"

#: data/json/items/tool/science.json
msgid "advanced 3D printer"
msgid_plural "advanced 3D printers"
msgstr[0] "高性能3Dプリンター"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'advanced 3D printer'}
#: data/json/items/tool/science.json
msgid ""
"Recent advances in 3D printing technology have resulted in the ability to "
"quickly and cheaply 3D print metals and alloys.  Such 3D printers are highly"
" expensive, but sought out by collectors and preppers alike.  In addition to"
" crafting, it can be used to repair polymer and metal items alike, or "
"permeate fabric items with carbon fiber for added protection."
msgstr ""
"3Dプリンティング技術の最新の進歩により、金属や合金を迅速かつ低コストで造形する能力が実現した。この種の高額な3Dプリンターは、コレクターやプレッパー双方に求められている。これは単に製作に用いるだけでなく、ポリマーや金属アイテムの修理、さらには布製アイテムにカーボンファイバーを浸透させて保護性能を付与できる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/shelters.json
msgid "damaged shelter kit"
msgid_plural "damaged shelter kits"
msgstr[0] "壊れたシェルターキット"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'damaged shelter kit'}
#: data/json/items/tool/shelters.json
msgid ""
"This is a small shelter, made of sticks and skins.  Use it to place.  This "
"shelter has been damaged, and needs repairs."
msgstr "木や皮革で作られた小型のシェルターだ。使用すると設置できる。このシェルターは損傷しており、修復が必要だ。"

#: data/json/items/tool/shelters.json
msgid "large tent"
msgid_plural "large tents"
msgstr[0] "大型テント"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'large tent'}
#: data/json/items/tool/shelters.json
msgid ""
"This is a family sized tent.  It provides a large amount of space, but is "
"very bulky."
msgstr "ファミリーサイズのテントだ。広いスペースを確保できるが、非常に嵩張る。"

#: data/json/items/tool/shelters.json
msgid "shelter kit"
msgid_plural "shelter kits"
msgstr[0] "シェルターキット"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'shelter kit'}
#: data/json/items/tool/shelters.json
msgid "This is a small shelter, made of sticks and skins.  Use it to place."
msgstr "木や皮革で作られた小型のシェルターだ。使用すると設置できる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/shelters.json
msgid "tent"
msgid_plural "tents"
msgstr[0] "テント"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'tent'}
#: data/json/items/tool/shelters.json
msgid ""
"This is a small personal tent, it's just big enough to fit you comfortably."
msgstr "小さな個人用テントだ。一人で使うにはちょうどいい大きさだ。"

#: data/json/items/tool/smoking.json
msgid "boxmod vape"
msgid_plural "boxmod vapes"
msgstr[0] "ボックスモッド型ベイプ"

#. ~ Use action activation_message for {'str': 'boxmod vape'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/smoking.json
msgid "You take a puff from your boxmod vape."
msgstr "ボックスモッド型ベイプを一服した。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'boxmod vape'}
#: data/json/items/tool/smoking.json
msgid ""
"An advanced version of the electronic cigarette.  A less harmful way to get "
"your nicotine fix than regular cigarettes, but still addictive.  It needs "
"batteries and nicotine liquid to function.  The side has a display showing "
"the battery and amount of nicotine liquid left.  Additionally, it allows you"
" to play simple games on it."
msgstr ""
"電子タバコの発展型だ。普通のタバコよりは害が少ないが、それでも中毒性がある。動かすにはバッテリーとニコチン液が必要だ。側面にはバッテリー残量とニコチン液の残量が表示される。さらに、簡単なゲームで遊ぶこともできる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/smoking.json
msgid "disposable vape"
msgid_plural "disposable vapes"
msgstr[0] "使い捨てベイプ"

#. ~ Use action activation_message for disposable vape.
#: data/json/items/tool/smoking.json
msgid "You take a puff from your disposable vape."
msgstr "使い捨てベイプを一服した。"

#. ~ Description for disposable vape
#: data/json/items/tool/smoking.json
msgid ""
"This battery-operated device vaporizes a liquid that contains flavorings and"
" nicotine.  A less harmful alternative to traditional cigarettes, but it's "
"still addictive.  It can't be reused once it's empty.  The side has a "
"display showing the battery and amount of nicotine liquid left."
msgstr ""
"フレーバーとニコチンを含む液体を気化させる、電池式のデバイスだ。従来のタバコよりは害が少ない代替品だが、やはり中毒性がある。空になると再利用できない。側面にはバッテリー残量とニコチン液の残量が表示される。"

#: data/json/items/tool/smoking.json
msgid "crack pipe"
msgid_plural "crack pipes"
msgstr[0] "クラックパイプ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'crack pipe'}
#: data/json/items/tool/smoking.json
msgid ""
"This is a fine glass tube with a bulb with a bowl on one end.  It's used to "
"partake of certain illicit substances."
msgstr "バルブとボウルが付いた、細いガラス製のパイプだ。特定の違法な物質を吸うために使われる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/smoking.json
msgid "glass pipe"
msgid_plural "glass pipes"
msgstr[0] "ガラス煙管"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'glass pipe'}
#: data/json/items/tool/smoking.json
msgid ""
"This is a hand-blown glass pipe.  It's of the type most commonly used to "
"smoke recreational substances."
msgstr "職人が一つ一つ手吹きで作ったガラス製のパイプだ。娯楽目的の物質を吸うのによく使われるタイプだ。"

#: data/json/items/tool/smoking.json
msgid "glass bong"
msgid_plural "glass bongs"
msgstr[0] "ガラス製ボング"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'glass bong'}
#: data/json/items/tool/smoking.json
msgid ""
"This is a hand-blown glass beaker bong.  Easy to clean, hard to tip over, "
"and functional even after society collapses."
msgstr "職人が手吹きで作ったビーカー型のガラス製ボングだ。掃除が簡単で倒れにくく、社会が崩壊した後でも使える。"

#: data/json/items/tool/smoking.json
msgid "tobacco pipe"
msgid_plural "tobacco pipes"
msgstr[0] "煙管"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'tobacco pipe'}
#: data/json/items/tool/smoking.json
msgid ""
"This is a hand-carved wooden smoking pipe.  It's designed to facilitate "
"consumption of fire cured tobacco leaves."
msgstr "手彫りの木製煙管だ。火で乾燥させたタバコの葉を効率よく吸えるように設計されている。"

#. ~ Use action activation_message for {'str': 'dab pen'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/smoking.json
msgid "You hit your dab pen. Sooooo smooth..."
msgstr "ダブペンを一服した。すっごくスムーズだ…"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'dab pen'}
#: data/json/items/tool/smoking.json
msgid ""
"This is a dab pen for vaporizing cannabis.  Now all you need is 'thc "
"distillate' and you're ready to rock and roll."
msgstr "大麻を気化させるためのダブペンだ。必要なのは「THC蒸留物」だけ。それが手に入れば準備万端だ。"

#: data/json/items/tool/smoking.json
msgid "disposable dab pen"
msgid_plural "disposable dab pens"
msgstr[0] "使い捨てダブペン"

#. ~ Use action activation_message for {'str': 'disposable dab pen'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/smoking.json
msgid "You hit your disposable dab pen. Sooooo smooth..."
msgstr "使い捨てダブペンを一服した。すっごくスムーズだ…"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'disposable dab pen'}
#: data/json/items/tool/smoking.json
msgid ""
"This is a disposable dab pen for vaporizing cannabis.  This one is already "
"filled with distillate for your convenience, but can't be recharged."
msgstr "大麻を気化させるための使い捨てダブペンだ。これは最初から蒸留物が充填されているので便利だが、充電はできない。"

#: data/json/items/tool/smoking.json
msgid "nectar collector"
msgid_plural "nectar collectors"
msgstr[0] "ネクターコレクター"

#. ~ Use action activation_message for {'str': 'nectar collector'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/smoking.json
msgid "You heat the nectar collector and hit it. Sooooo smooth..."
msgstr "ネクターコレクターを熱して一服した。すっごくスムーズだ…"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'nectar collector'}
#: data/json/items/tool/smoking.json
msgid ""
"This is a metal and wooden nectar collector.  The top cover can be attached "
"and detached magnetically.  The wood has engravings depicting bees, honey, "
"and flowers.  You need 'thc wax' to use this item."
msgstr ""
"金属と木製のネクターコレクターだ。上部のカバーは磁石で着脱できる。木の部分にはハチ、ハチミツ、花が彫刻されている。「THCワックス」があれば使える。"

#: data/json/items/tool/stationary.json
msgid "stapler"
msgid_plural "staplers"
msgstr[0] "ホッチキス"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'stapler'}
#: data/json/items/tool/stationary.json
msgid "A stapler for fastening sheets of paper together."
msgstr "紙をまとめて固定するための道具だ。"

#: data/json/items/tool/stationary.json
msgid "pen"
msgid_plural "pens"
msgstr[0] "ペン"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'pen'}
#: data/json/items/tool/stationary.json
msgid "A plastic ball point pen."
msgstr "プラスチック製のボールペンだ。"

#: data/json/items/tool/stationary.json
msgid "pair of scissors"
msgid_plural "pairs of scissors"
msgstr[0] "ハサミ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'pair of scissors', 'str_pl': 'pairs of
#. scissors'}
#: data/json/items/tool/stationary.json
msgid ""
"These are a long pair of heavy-duty scissors.  Use scissors to cut items "
"made from cotton (like clothing) into rags."
msgstr "しっかりとした刃の付いた、長いハサミだ。布製のアイテム（衣類など）を切断して布切れにするのに使う。"

#: data/json/items/tool/stationary.json
msgid "paper"
msgid_plural "papers"
msgstr[0] "紙"

#. ~ Description for paper
#: data/json/items/tool/stationary.json
msgid "A piece of paper.  Can be used for fires."
msgstr "1枚の紙だ。火をつけるのに使える。"

#: data/json/items/tool/tailoring.json
msgid "bone sewing awl"
msgid_plural "bone sewing awls"
msgstr[0] "骨の千枚通し"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'bone sewing awl'}
#: data/json/items/tool/tailoring.json
msgid ""
"This is a crude sharpened bone awl; those were used for leatherworking "
"before metal was discovered.  It can also serve as an improvised stabbing "
"weapon, but will break quickly."
msgstr "骨を尖らせて作った粗末な千枚通しだ。金属が発見される前は革の加工に使われていた。即席の刺突武器としても使えるが、すぐに壊れるだろう。"

#: data/json/items/tool/tailoring.json
msgid "steel sewing awl"
msgid_plural "steel sewing awls"
msgstr[0] "鋼の千枚通し"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'steel sewing awl'}
#: data/json/items/tool/tailoring.json
msgid ""
"This is a steel awl with a wooden grip, usually used for leatherworking.  It"
" can also serve as an improvised stabbing weapon, but will break quickly."
msgstr "木製のグリップを取り付けた鋼鉄製の千枚通しだ。主に革細工に使う。即席の刺突武器としても使えるが、すぐに壊れるだろう。"

#: data/json/items/tool/tailoring.json
msgid "knitting needles"
msgid_plural "pairs of knitting needles"
msgstr[0] "編針"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'knitting needles', 'str_pl': 'pairs of knitting
#. needles'}
#: data/json/items/tool/tailoring.json
msgid ""
"A pair of stout wooden needles with round ends used to turn thread and yarn "
"into cloth."
msgstr "先端部が丸くなっている、2本の頑丈な木製の針だ。糸や毛糸を布に編むために使う。"

#: data/json/items/tool/tailoring.json
msgid "bone needle"
msgid_plural "bone needles"
msgstr[0] "骨の針"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'bone needle'}
#: data/json/items/tool/tailoring.json
msgid ""
"This is sharp needle made from a bone.  It would be useful for making rough "
"clothing and items.  Its low quality makes it rather unsuitable for anything"
" requiring speed or precision."
msgstr "骨で作った鋭い針だ。粗末な衣類やアイテムを作るのに役立つ。質が低いため、速度や精密さが必要な作業にはあまり向いていない。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'curved needle'}
#: data/json/items/tool/tailoring.json
msgid ""
"A curved sharp needle made of steel.  Its rounded shape allows it to make "
"stitches that only pierce one side of the material.  While unsuitable for "
"most tailoring projects, it's a necessity for stitching neoprene."
msgstr ""
"弧を描くように曲げられた鋼鉄製の鋭い針だ。この形状によって素材の片面だけに糸を通せる。ほとんどの仕立て作業には不向きだが、ネオプレンを縫う際には不可欠だ。"

#: data/json/items/tool/tailoring.json
msgid "wooden needle"
msgid_plural "wooden needles"
msgstr[0] "木の針"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'wooden needle'}
#: data/json/items/tool/tailoring.json
msgid ""
"This is a wooden needle whittled down to a sharp point.  It has a narrow "
"hole carved into the head for threading.  Its low quality makes it rather "
"unsuitable for anything requiring speed or precision, or involving tougher "
"materials like Kevlar."
msgstr ""
"木をナイフで削って鋭く尖らせた針だ。先端には糸を通すための細い穴が彫られている。質が低いため、速度や精度が必要な作業や、ケブラーのような硬い素材を扱う製作には不向きだ。"

#: data/json/items/tool/tailoring.json
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/tools.json
msgid "sewing kit"
msgid_plural "sewing kits"
msgstr[0] "裁縫道具"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'sewing kit'}
#: data/json/items/tool/tailoring.json
msgid ""
"This is a plastic kit with a variety of needles, some plastic spools for "
"thread, and a few other useful textile tools.  Use a sewing kit on an "
"article of clothing to attempt to repair or reinforce that clothing.  This "
"uses your tailoring skill, and can also sew pockets or warmer liner into "
"your gear, or resize it for mutant wearers."
msgstr ""
"これは、様々な針、糸用のプラスチックスプール、その他いくつかの便利な裁縫道具が入ったプラスチック製のキットだ。衣類に裁縫キットを使用すると、その衣類を修理または補強しようと試みる。これは裁縫スキルを使用し、ポケットや暖かい裏地を装備に縫い付けたり、変異体が着用できるようにサイズ変更したりもできる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/tailoring.json
msgid "tailoring pattern set"
msgid_plural "tailoring pattern sets"
msgstr[0] "型紙セット"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'tailoring pattern set'}
#: data/json/items/tool/tailoring.json
msgid ""
"This is a large set of tailoring patterns made from paper.  They're useful "
"for making any kind of cloth or leather items from scratch, but are "
"necessary for more advanced projects."
msgstr "仕立てに使う大量の紙製型紙だ。布や革で様々なアイテムをゼロから作るのに便利だが、より高度なプロジェクトには必須となる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/tailoring.json
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/tools.json
msgid "tailor's kit"
msgid_plural "tailor's kits"
msgstr[0] "仕立て道具"

#. ~ Description for {'str': "tailor's kit"}
#: data/json/items/tool/tailoring.json
msgid ""
"This is a high quality kit consisting of a variety of needles, some plastic "
"spools for thread, some small scissors, and an awl.  Using your tailoring "
"skill, this kit can customize your clothing and armor, whether up-armoring "
"them or altering some items to fit mutant wearers."
msgstr ""
"これは、様々な針、糸用のプラスチックスプール、小さなハサミ、そして千枚通しで構成された高品質のキットだ。裁縫スキルを使って、このキットで衣類やアーマーをカスタマイズできる。それらを強化したり、一部のアイテムを変異体が着用できるように変更したりできる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/toiletries.json
msgid "bathroom scale"
msgid_plural "bathroom scales"
msgstr[0] "体重計"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'bathroom scale'}
#: data/json/items/tool/toiletries.json
msgid "This is a small bathroom scale, meant to weigh a person while naked."
msgstr "裸になった時に体重を測るための小型の体重計だ。"

#: data/json/items/tool/toiletries.json
msgid "scrub brush"
msgid_plural "scrub brushes"
msgstr[0] "たわし"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'scrub brush', 'str_pl': 'scrub brushes'}
#: data/json/items/tool/toiletries.json
msgid "This is a simple scrub brush."
msgstr "シンプルな作りのたわしだ。"

#: data/json/items/tool/toiletries.json data/mods/change_hairstyle/item.json
msgid "electric hair trimmer"
msgid_plural "electric hair trimmers"
msgstr[0] "電動バリカン"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'electric hair trimmer'}
#: data/json/items/tool/toiletries.json
msgid ""
"This is a pocket-sized electric trimmer made for cutting hair.  You can use "
"it to cut your hair if it's supplied with batteries.  It requires 10 "
"batteries per use."
msgstr "髪を切るためのポケットサイズの電動バリカンだ。バッテリーを装填して使用すると髪を短く刈り込める。1回の使用でバッテリーを10消費する。"

#: data/json/items/tool/toiletries.json
msgid "mop"
msgid_plural "mops"
msgstr[0] "モップ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'mop'}
#: data/json/items/tool/toiletries.json
msgid ""
"This is an unwieldy mop.  Good for cleaning up spills.  Use to mop up any "
"'mess' you may have made."
msgstr "扱いにくいモップだ。こぼしたものを掃除するのにいい。自分がまき散らした「散らかったもの」を拭き取るのに使え。"

#: data/json/items/tool/toiletries.json
msgid "collapsible mop"
msgid_plural "collapsible mops"
msgstr[0] "折りたたみ式モップ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'collapsible mop'}
#: data/json/items/tool/toiletries.json
msgid ""
"A long unwieldy mop with a collapsible handle for convenient transportation."
"  You may use it to clean up any 'mess' you have made."
msgstr "長い上に扱いにくいが、折りたたみ式の柄が付いていて持ち運びに便利なモップだ。自分がまき散らした「散らかったもの」を拭き取るのに使える。"

#: data/json/items/tool/toiletries.json
msgid "razor blade"
msgid_plural "razor blades"
msgstr[0] "剃刀用替刃"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'razor blade'}
#: data/json/items/tool/toiletries.json
msgid ""
"A double-edged razor blade.  Finicky to use on its own, but can be used as a"
" cutting tool in a pinch."
msgstr "両刃の剃刀用替刃だ。単体で使うのは扱いにくいが、いざという時には切断ツールとして使える。"

#: data/json/items/tool/toiletries.json
msgid "shaving kit"
msgid_plural "shaving kits"
msgstr[0] "洗面キット"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'shaving kit'}
#: data/json/items/tool/toiletries.json
msgid ""
"This is a compact and lightweight shaving kit made for travelers.  You can "
"use it to shave if it's supplied with soap.  It requires 1 unit of soap per "
"use."
msgstr "旅行者向けに作られた、コンパクトで軽量なシェービングキットだ。石鹸があれば髭剃りに使える。1回の使用につき石鹸を1消費する。"

#: data/json/items/tool/toiletries.json
msgid "sponge"
msgid_plural "sponges"
msgstr[0] "スポンジ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'sponge'}
#: data/json/items/tool/toiletries.json
msgid ""
"A sponge is a tool or cleaning aid made of soft, porous material.  Typically"
" used for cleaning impervious surfaces, it can also be used for sanding wood"
" when dried."
msgstr "柔らかく多孔質の素材でできた、道具であり掃除用品だ。通常は防水性のある表面の掃除に使うが、乾いた状態では木材を研磨するのにも使える。"

#: data/json/items/tool/toiletries.json data/mods/change_hairstyle/item.json
msgid "makeshift haircut kit"
msgid_plural "makeshift haircut kits"
msgstr[0] "簡易散髪キット"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'makeshift haircut kit'}
#: data/json/items/tool/toiletries.json
msgid "This is a kit with tools for cutting hair."
msgstr "髪を切るための道具一式だ。"

#: data/json/items/tool/toiletries.json
msgid "makeshift shaving kit"
msgid_plural "makeshift shaving kits"
msgstr[0] "簡易洗面キット"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'makeshift shaving kit'}
#: data/json/items/tool/toiletries.json
msgid ""
"This is a makeshift shaving kit.  You can use it to shave if it's supplied "
"with soap.  It requires 1 unit of soap per use."
msgstr "簡易的なシェービングキットだ。石鹸があれば髭剃りに使える。1回の使用につき石鹸を1消費する。"

#: data/json/items/tool/toiletries.json
msgid "washboard"
msgid_plural "washboards"
msgstr[0] "洗濯板"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'washboard'}
#: data/json/items/tool/toiletries.json
msgid ""
"This is a wooden washboard.  You can use it to wash filthy clothing if it's "
"supplied with cleansing agent."
msgstr "木製の洗濯板だ。洗浄剤があれば汚れた衣類を洗うのに使える。"

#: data/json/items/tool/toiletries.json
msgid "washing kit"
msgid_plural "washing kits"
msgstr[0] "洗濯洗浄キット"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'washing kit'}
#: data/json/items/tool/toiletries.json
msgid ""
"A combination kit of a washboard and a scrubbing tool.  Everything you need "
"to clean items after the apocalypse."
msgstr "洗濯板と洗浄用具のセットだ。大災厄後の世界でアイテムをきれいにするために必要なものがすべて揃っている。"

#. ~ Use action bury_question for {'str': 'bear trap'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/traps.json
msgid "Bury the beartrap?"
msgstr "トラバサミを埋めるか？"

#. ~ Use action done_message for {'str': 'bear trap'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/traps.json
msgid "You set the beartrap."
msgstr "トラバサミを設置した。"

#. ~ Use action done_message for {'str': 'bear trap'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/traps.json
msgid "You bury the beartrap."
msgstr "トラバサミを埋めた。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'bear trap'}
#: data/json/items/tool/traps.json
msgid ""
"This is a spring-loaded pair of steel jaws connected to a sensitive pressure"
" plate.  Use it to set it on the ground, creating a trap that will ensnare "
"and damage anything that steps on it.  If you are carrying a shovel, you "
"will have the option of burying it."
msgstr ""
"感度の高い圧力板につながった、バネ仕掛けの鋼鉄製の爪だ。地面に設置すると、上に乗ったものを捕らえてダメージを与える罠になる。シャベルを持っていれば、埋めて隠すオプションが選べる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/traps.json
msgid "blade trap"
msgid_plural "blade traps"
msgstr[0] "刃の罠"

#. ~ Use action done_message for {'str': 'blade trap'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/traps.json
msgid "You set the blade trap %d squares away."
msgstr "%dタイル先に刃の罠を設置した。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'blade trap'}
#: data/json/items/tool/traps.json
msgid ""
"This is a machete attached laterally to a motor, with a tripwire controlling"
" its throttle.  When the tripwire is pulled, the blade is swung around with "
"great force.  The trap forms a 3x3 area of effect."
msgstr ""
"横向きにマチェットが取り付けられたモーターだ。仕掛け線でスロットルを制御する。仕掛け線が引っ張られると、強い力で刃が振り回される。罠の効果範囲は3x3タイルに及ぶ。"

#: data/json/items/tool/traps.json
msgid "nailboard trap"
msgid_plural "nailboard traps"
msgstr[0] "釘板の罠"

#. ~ Use action done_message for {'str': 'nailboard trap'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/traps.json
msgid "You set the board trap on the %s, nails facing up."
msgstr "%sに釘板の罠を設置した。釘の先が上を向いている。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'nailboard trap'}
#: data/json/items/tool/traps.json
msgid ""
"These are several pieces of wood nailed together, with some nails sticking "
"straight up.  If an unsuspecting victim steps on it, they'll get nails "
"through the foot."
msgstr "釘で打ち付けられた数枚の板から、何本もの釘がまっすぐ突き出ている。何も知らない犠牲者がこれを踏めば、足に釘が刺さるだろう。"

#. ~ Use action done_message for {'str': 'booby trap'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/traps.json
msgid "You set the booby trap up and activate the grenade."
msgstr "ブービートラップを設置し、手榴弾の安全ピンを抜いた。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'booby trap'}
#: data/json/items/tool/traps.json
msgid ""
"This is a crude explosive device triggered by a piece of string.  Use it to "
"set up and watch some poor bastard trigger it."
msgstr "ひもが引かれると起爆する簡単な爆発装置だ。設置して、気の毒な奴が引っかかるのを見物しろ。"

#. ~ Use action done_message for {'str': 'bubble wrap'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/traps.json
msgid "You set the bubble wrap on the ground, ready to be popped."
msgstr "プチプチを設置した。踏むと音が鳴る。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'bubble wrap'}
#: data/json/items/tool/traps.json
msgid ""
"This is a sheet of plastic covered with air-filled bubbles.  Use it to set "
"it on the ground, creating a trap that will warn you with noise when "
"something steps on it."
msgstr "空気が入った突起に覆われたプラスチック製のシートだ。地面に設置すると、誰かが踏んだ際に音を立てて警告する罠になる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/traps.json
msgid "loose caltrops"
msgid_plural "loose caltrops"
msgstr[0] "鉄菱"

#. ~ Use action done_message for {'str_sp': 'loose caltrops'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/traps.json
msgid "You scatter the caltrops on the %s."
msgstr "%sに鉄菱を撒いた。"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'loose caltrops'}
#: data/json/items/tool/traps.json
msgid ""
"These are small metal objects covered with many sharp points.  If an "
"unsuspecting victim steps on one, they'll get a spine through the foot."
msgstr "表面に何箇所も尖った箇所がある小さな金属片だ。何も知らない犠牲者がこれを踏めば、足に棘が突き刺さるだろう。"

#: data/json/items/tool/traps.json
msgid "loose glass caltrops"
msgid_plural "loose glass caltrops"
msgstr[0] "ガラス棘"

#. ~ Use action done_message for {'str_sp': 'loose glass caltrops'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/traps.json
msgid "You scatter the glass caltrops on the %s."
msgstr "%sにガラス棘を撒いた。"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'loose glass caltrops'}
#: data/json/items/tool/traps.json
msgid ""
"These are glass shards glued together to expose their sharp edges.  If an "
"unsuspecting victim steps on one, they'll get cut."
msgstr "鋭い箇所が露出するように接着したガラス片だ。何も知らない犠牲者がこれを踏めば、切り傷を負うだろう。"

#. ~ Use action done_message for {'str': 'crossbow trap'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/traps.json
msgid "You set the crossbow trap."
msgstr "クロスボウの罠を設置した。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'crossbow trap'}
#: data/json/items/tool/traps.json
msgid ""
"This is a simple tripwire, which is attached to the trigger of a loaded "
"crossbow.  When pulled, the crossbow fires.  Only a single round can be "
"used, after which the trap is disabled."
msgstr "クロスボウの引き金に仕掛け線を括り付けた罠だ。ボルトが1発装填されている。一度罠が発動すると、無力化される。"

#. ~ Use action bury_question for {'str': 'land mine'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/traps.json
msgid "Bury the land mine?"
msgstr "地雷を埋めるか？"

#. ~ Use action done_message for {'str': 'land mine'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/traps.json
msgid "You set the land mine."
msgstr "地雷を設置した。"

#. ~ Use action done_message for {'str': 'land mine'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/traps.json
msgid "You bury the land mine."
msgstr "地雷を埋めた。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'land mine'}
#: data/json/items/tool/traps.json
msgid ""
"This is a military anti-personnel mine that is triggered when stepped upon."
msgstr "上に乗ると作動する、軍用の対人地雷だ。"

#: data/json/items/tool/traps.json
msgid "double-barreled shotgun trap"
msgid_plural "double-barreled shotgun traps"
msgstr[0] "二連式ショットガンの罠"

#. ~ Use action done_message for {'str': 'double-barreled shotgun trap'}.
#. ~ Use action done_message for {'str': 'shotgun trap'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/traps.json
msgid "You set the shotgun trap."
msgstr "ショットガンの罠を設置した。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'double-barreled shotgun trap'}
#: data/json/items/tool/traps.json
msgid ""
"This is a simple tripwire is attached to the trigger of a loaded double-"
"barreled shotgun.  When pulled, the shotgun fires, discharging both barrels "
"into the target."
msgstr ""
"単純な仕掛け線が装填済みの二連式ショットガンの引き金に繋がっている。仕掛け線が引っ張られると、ショットガンが両方の銃身から発砲し、標的に向かって放たれる。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'shotgun trap'}
#: data/json/items/tool/traps.json
msgid ""
"This is a simple tripwire is attached to the trigger of a loaded single-"
"barreled shotgun.  When pulled, the shotgun fires."
msgstr "単純な仕掛け線が装填済みの単発式ショットガンの引き金に繋がっている。仕掛け線が引っ張られると、ショットガンが発砲する。"

#: data/json/items/tool/traps.json
msgid "tripwire trap"
msgid_plural "tripwire traps"
msgstr[0] "トリップワイヤー"

#. ~ Use action done_message for {'str': 'tripwire trap'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/traps.json
msgid "You string up the tripwire."
msgstr "トリップワイヤーを張った。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'tripwire trap'}
#: data/json/items/tool/traps.json
msgid ""
"This is some thin strong cable with some affixing tools on either end.  A "
"tripwire trap must be placed across a doorway or other thin passage.  Its "
"purpose is to trip up bypassers, causing them to stumble and possibly hurt "
"themselves slightly."
msgstr ""
"両端に取り付け具が付いた、細くて丈夫なケーブルだ。トリップワイヤーの罠は、出入り口や狭い通路などに設置しなければならない。通り過ぎようとした者をつまずかせて転倒させ、軽いダメージを与えるのがこの罠の目的だ。"

#. ~ Use action done_message for {'str': 'makeshift perimeter alarm'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/traps.json
msgid "You string up some cans on a tripwire."
msgstr "トリップワイヤーに空き缶をくくりつけた。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'makeshift perimeter alarm'}
#: data/json/items/tool/traps.json
msgid ""
"This is a set of empty cans used as makeshift noisemakers, strung up across "
"a doorway or other thin passage.  It will make noise when activated to alert"
" you of intruders, but is otherwise harmless."
msgstr ""
"玄関や狭い通路などに張り巡らせた、即席の騒音発生器として使われる空き缶のセットだ。起動すると音を立てて侵入者を警告してくれるが、それ以外の害はない。"

#: data/json/items/tool/traps.json
msgid "glass shard trap"
msgid_plural "glass shard traps"
msgstr[0] "ガラス片の罠"

#. ~ Use action done_message for {'str': 'glass shard trap'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/traps.json
msgid ""
"You carefully place the shards on the ground, ready to be cracked by "
"something passing by."
msgstr "何かが通った時に音を立てて割れるよう、足元にガラスの破片を慎重に敷き詰めた。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'glass shard trap'}
#: data/json/items/tool/traps.json
msgid ""
"Same glass shard as before but you can activate it to place it on the "
"ground, it will make noise when stepped on."
msgstr "以前のガラス片と同じだが、使用すると地面に設置でき、踏まれると音を立てる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/woodworking.json
msgid "wood axe"
msgid_plural "wood axes"
msgstr[0] "木の斧"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'wood axe'}
#: data/json/items/tool/woodworking.json
msgid ""
"This is a large, two-handed wood axe.  It makes a good melee weapon, but is "
"a bit slow to recover between swings."
msgstr "両手で扱う大きな木斧だ。良い近接武器になるが、攻撃後の体勢を立て直すのに少し時間がかかるのが欠点だ。"

#: data/json/items/tool/woodworking.json
msgid "bronze axe"
msgid_plural "bronze axes"
msgstr[0] "青銅の斧"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'bronze axe'}
#: data/json/items/tool/woodworking.json
msgid ""
"This is a large, two-handed wood axe with a bronze axehead.  It makes a good"
" melee weapon, but is a bit slow to recover between swings."
msgstr "青銅製の刃が付いた、両手で扱う大きな木斧だ。良い近接武器になるが、攻撃後の体勢を立て直すのに少し時間がかかるのが欠点だ。"

#: data/json/items/tool/woodworking.json
msgid "chainsaw (off)"
msgid_plural "chainsaws (off)"
msgstr[0] "チェーンソー [停止中]"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'chainsaw (off)', 'str_pl': 'chainsaws
#. (off)'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/woodworking.json
msgid "You turn on the chainsaw."
msgstr "チェーンソーの電源を入れた。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'chainsaw (off)', 'str_pl': 'chainsaws (off)'}
#: data/json/items/tool/woodworking.json
msgid ""
"This is a lumbering tool moonlighting as weapon of opportunity.  If loaded "
"with gas, using this item will cause it to turn on, turning it into a very "
"powerful but unwieldy melee weapon."
msgstr ""
"木材加工用の道具だが、非常時の武器として二重生活を送っている。ガソリンを装填して使用すると電源が入り、非常に強力だが扱いにくい近接武器になる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/woodworking.json
msgid "chainsaw (on)"
msgid_plural "chainsaws (on)"
msgstr[0] "チェーンソー [作動中]"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'chainsaw (on)', 'str_pl': 'chainsaws (on)'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/woodworking.json
msgid "You turn off the chainsaw."
msgstr "チェーンソーの電源を切った。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'chainsaw (on)', 'str_pl': 'chainsaws (on)'}
#: data/json/items/tool/woodworking.json
msgid "This chainsaw is on and making a lot of noise.  Use it to turn it off."
msgstr "チェーンソーは電源が入っており、大きな騒音を立てている。使用すると電源を切ることができる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/woodworking.json
msgid "circular saw (off)"
msgid_plural "circular saws (off)"
msgstr[0] "電動丸ノコギリ [停止中]"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'circular saw (off)', 'str_pl': 'circular saws
#. (off)'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/woodworking.json
msgid "You turn on the circular saw."
msgstr "電動丸ノコの電源を切った。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'circular saw (off)', 'str_pl': 'circular saws
#. (off)'}
#: data/json/items/tool/woodworking.json
msgid ""
"A lightweight handheld cordless circular saw.  Spins a circular blade fast "
"enough to cut wood, zombies, or in an emergency, pizza.  The blade, while "
"effective in combat, is hard to hit with due to its small size."
msgstr ""
"コードレスの軽量手持ち丸ノコギリだ。木材、ゾンビ、非常時にはピザさえ切断できるほどの速さで円形刃が回転する。刃は戦闘用としても有効だが、サイズが小さいため命中させるのは難しい。"

#: data/json/items/tool/woodworking.json
msgid "circular saw (on)"
msgid_plural "circular saws (on)"
msgstr[0] "電動丸ノコギリ [作動中]"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'circular saw (on)', 'str_pl': 'circular saws
#. (on)'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/woodworking.json
msgid "You turn off the circular saw."
msgstr "電動丸ノコの電源を切った。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'circular saw (on)', 'str_pl': 'circular saws
#. (on)'}
#: data/json/items/tool/woodworking.json
msgid ""
"A lightweight handheld cordless circular saw.  It is currently on and the "
"blade is spinning; use this item to turn it off."
msgstr "コードレスの軽量手持ち丸ノコギリだ。現在電源が入って刃が回転している。使用すると電源を切ることができる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/woodworking.json
msgid "copper axe"
msgid_plural "copper axes"
msgstr[0] "銅の斧"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'copper axe'}
#: data/json/items/tool/woodworking.json
msgid ""
"This is a decent-sized chunk of worked copper affixed to a wooden shaft, to "
"make a crude yet effective axe."
msgstr "ほど良い大きさの加工された銅片を木の棒に取り付けた、粗末だが効果的な手斧だ。"

#: data/json/items/tool/woodworking.json
msgid "hatchet"
msgid_plural "hatchets"
msgstr[0] "ハチェット"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'hatchet'}
#: data/json/items/tool/woodworking.json
msgid ""
"A one-handed hatchet.  Makes a great melee weapon, and is useful both for "
"chopping things and for use as a hammer."
msgstr "片手で扱えるハチェットだ。優れた近接武器になるし、物を切断したりハンマーの代用品としても使える。"

#: data/json/items/tool/woodworking.json
msgid "electric chainsaw (off)"
msgid_plural "electric chainsaws (off)"
msgstr[0] "電動チェーンソー [停止中]"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'electric chainsaw (off)', 'str_pl': 'electric
#. chainsaws (off)'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/woodworking.json
msgid "You turn on the electric chainsaw."
msgstr "電動チェーンソーの電源を入れた。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'electric chainsaw (off)', 'str_pl': 'electric
#. chainsaws (off)'}
#: data/json/items/tool/woodworking.json
msgid ""
"This is a lumbering tool moonlighting as weapon of opportunity.  If loaded "
"with batteries, using this item will cause it to turn on, turning it into a "
"very powerful but unwieldy melee weapon."
msgstr "木材加工用の道具だが、非常時の武器として二重生活を送っている。電池を装填して使用すると電源が入り、非常に強力だが扱いにくい近接武器になる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/woodworking.json
msgid "electric chainsaw (on)"
msgid_plural "electric chainsaws (on)"
msgstr[0] "電動チェーンソー [作動中]"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'electric chainsaw (on)', 'str_pl': 'electric
#. chainsaws (on)'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/woodworking.json
msgid "You turn off the electric chainsaw."
msgstr "電動チェーンソーの電源を切った。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'electric chainsaw (on)', 'str_pl': 'electric
#. chainsaws (on)'}
#: data/json/items/tool/woodworking.json
msgid ""
"This electric chainsaw is on and making a lot of noise.  Use it to turn it "
"off."
msgstr "電動チェーンソーは電源が入っており、大きな騒音を立てている。使用すると電源を切ることができる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/woodworking.json
msgid "primitive adze"
msgid_plural "primitive adzes"
msgstr[0] "原始的な手斧"

#. ~ Conditional name for {'str': 'primitive adze'} when COMPONENT_ID matches
#. rock
#: data/json/items/tool/woodworking.json
msgid "stone adze"
msgid_plural "stone adzes"
msgstr[0] "石の手斧"

#. ~ Conditional name for {'str': 'primitive adze'} when COMPONENT_ID matches
#. ceramic
#: data/json/items/tool/woodworking.json
msgid "ceramic adze"
msgid_plural "ceramic adzes"
msgstr[0] "セラミックの手斧"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'primitive adze'}
#: data/json/items/tool/woodworking.json
msgid ""
"This is a stone or ceramic adze, somewhat useful for smoothing wood objects."
msgstr "木材を滑らかにするのに多少役立つ、石またはセラミック製の手斧だ。"

#: data/json/items/tool/woodworking.json
msgid "primitive axe"
msgid_plural "primitive axes"
msgstr[0] "原始的な斧"

#. ~ Conditional name for {'str': 'primitive axe'} when COMPONENT_ID matches
#. rock
#: data/json/items/tool/woodworking.json
msgid "stone axe"
msgid_plural "stone axes"
msgstr[0] "石斧"

#. ~ Conditional name for {'str': 'primitive axe'} when COMPONENT_ID matches
#. ceramic
#: data/json/items/tool/woodworking.json
msgid "ceramic axe"
msgid_plural "ceramic axes"
msgstr[0] "セラミックの斧"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'primitive axe'}
#: data/json/items/tool/woodworking.json
msgid ""
"This is a stone with a narrow edge affixed to a stick.  It can chop wood, "
"but requires much more effort than a modern axe."
msgstr "幅の狭い石を木の棒に固定したものだ。木の伐採も可能だが、現代の斧よりも相当苦労するだろう。"

#: data/json/items/tool/woodworking.json
msgid "wood saw"
msgid_plural "wood saws"
msgstr[0] "ノコギリ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'wood saw'}
#: data/json/items/tool/woodworking.json
msgid "This is a thin saw, useful for cutting through wood objects."
msgstr "刃の薄いノコギリだ。木材を切るのに使える。"

#: data/json/items/tool/woodworking.json
msgid "stone chisel"
msgid_plural "stone chisels"
msgstr[0] "ノミ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'stone chisel'}
#: data/json/items/tool/woodworking.json
msgid ""
"This is a short stone chisel.  It can be used to engrave on stone, wood, or "
"soft metals."
msgstr "石で作られた短いノミだ。石、木材、柔らかい金属に彫刻するのに使える。"

#: data/json/items/tool/woodworking.json
msgid "primitive tomahawk"
msgid_plural "primitive tomahawks"
msgstr[0] "原始的なトマホーク"

#. ~ Conditional name for {'str': 'primitive tomahawk'} when COMPONENT_ID
#. matches rock
#: data/json/items/tool/woodworking.json
msgid "stone tomahawk"
msgid_plural "stone tomahawks"
msgstr[0] "石のトマホーク"

#. ~ Conditional name for {'str': 'primitive tomahawk'} when COMPONENT_ID
#. matches ceramic
#: data/json/items/tool/woodworking.json
msgid "ceramic tomahawk"
msgid_plural "ceramic tomahawks"
msgstr[0] "セラミックのトマホーク"

#. ~ Conditional name for {'str': 'primitive tomahawk'} when COMPONENT_ID
#. matches bone
#: data/json/items/tool/woodworking.json
msgid "bone tomahawk"
msgid_plural "bone tomahawks"
msgstr[0] "骨のトマホーク"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'primitive tomahawk'}
#: data/json/items/tool/woodworking.json
msgid ""
"A lightweight one-handed combat hatchet typically made of stone or bone, "
"originally used by the Algonquian people.  It makes for a half decent tool "
"and weapon."
msgstr "アルゴンキン族が元々使用していた、石や骨で作られた軽量の片手用戦闘手斧だ。そこそこ使える道具であり武器になる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/woodworking.json
msgid "copper tomahawk"
msgid_plural "copper tomahawks"
msgstr[0] "銅のトマホーク"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'copper tomahawk'}
#: data/json/items/tool/woodworking.json
msgid ""
"A lightweight one-handed combat hatchet made using basic copper.  Slightly "
"better than stone, though not as historically accurate."
msgstr "基本的な銅を使って作られた軽量の片手用戦闘手斧だ。歴史的な正確さはないものの、石製のものよりは少し優れている。"

#: data/json/items/tool/woodworking.json
msgid "sandpaper"
msgid_plural "sandpapers"
msgstr[0] "サンドペーパー"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'sandpaper'}
#: data/json/items/tool/woodworking.json
msgid ""
"A sheet of cloth or paper with an abrasive material glued to one side, "
"historically glass or sand, modernly aluminum oxide or silicon carbide.  It "
"is commonly used to smooth, roughen, or strip a wooden surface."
msgstr ""
"片面に研磨剤が接着された布や紙のシートだ。歴史的にはガラスや砂、現代では酸化アルミニウムや炭化ケイ素が使われる。一般的に、木材の表面を滑らかにしたり、粗くしたり、剥がしたりするために使われる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "pallet of wet adobe bricks"
msgid_plural "pallets of wet adobe bricks"
msgstr[0] "日干しレンガパレット [未乾燥]"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'pallet of wet adobe bricks', 'str_pl':
#. 'pallets of wet adobe bricks'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "You test the bricks, and they're solid enough to use."
msgstr "レンガを調べると、使用するのに十分なほど硬くなっている。"

#. ~ Use action not_ready_msg for {'str': 'pallet of wet adobe bricks',
#. 'str_pl': 'pallets of wet adobe bricks'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "The bricks are still too damp to bear weight."
msgstr "レンガはまだ湿っていて、重さに耐えられない。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'pallet of wet adobe bricks', 'str_pl': 'pallets
#. of wet adobe bricks'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"A pallet full of heavy mud bricks which need to dry slowly to be usable."
msgstr "泥製の重いレンガを満載したパレットだ。使えるようになるにはゆっくりと乾燥させる必要がある。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "pallet of dry adobe bricks"
msgid_plural "pallets of dry adobe bricks"
msgstr[0] "日干しレンガパレット"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'pallet of dry adobe bricks', 'str_pl': 'pallets
#. of dry adobe bricks'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"A pallet of humble mud bricks that have dried out while you were out risking"
" your life.  Disassemble it to retrieve your frame and building supplies."
msgstr "命をかけている間に乾燥した、質素な泥レンガのパレットだ。分解して、フレームと建築資材を回収できる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "pallet of wet ceramic"
msgid_plural "pallets of wet ceramic"
msgstr[0] "濡れたセラミックパレット"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'pallet of wet ceramic', 'str_pl': 'pallets of
#. wet ceramic'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "You test the ceramic, and it's the right consistency to use."
msgstr "セラミックを調べると、使用するのにちょうど良い硬さになっている。"

#. ~ Use action not_ready_msg for {'str': 'pallet of wet ceramic', 'str_pl':
#. 'pallets of wet ceramic'}.
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "The ceramic is still too damp to be used."
msgstr "セラミックはまだ湿っていて、使用できない。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'pallet of wet ceramic', 'str_pl': 'pallets of
#. wet ceramic'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"A pallet full of crushed wet ceramic, which needs to dry slowly to be "
"usable."
msgstr "砕かれた濡れたセラミックが満載されたパレットだ。使えるようになるにはゆっくりと乾燥させる必要がある。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "pallet of ceramic clay"
msgid_plural "pallets of ceramic clay"
msgstr[0] "陶土パレット"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'pallet of ceramic clay', 'str_pl': 'pallets of
#. ceramic clay'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"A pallet of ceramic clay which is now ready to be made into pottery.  "
"Disassemble it to retrieve your sheet, frame and crafting supplies."
msgstr "陶器の製作に使えるようになった陶土のパレットだ。分解して、シート、フレーム、製作資材を回収できる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "acetylene-gas machine"
msgid_plural "acetylene-gas machines"
msgstr[0] "アセチレンガス生成機"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'acetylene-gas machine'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"This bulky device takes water and calcium carbide and yields unpressurised "
"acetylene."
msgstr "この大がかりな装置は、水と炭化カルシウムから非加圧のアセチレンを生成する。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "angle grinder"
msgid_plural "angle grinders"
msgstr[0] "アングルグラインダー"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'angle grinder'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"This widespread powertool is often used for removing excess material or "
"polishing surfaces."
msgstr "この一般的な電動工具は、余分な素材の除去や表面の研磨によく使われる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "brick kiln"
msgid_plural "brick kilns"
msgstr[0] "レンガ窯"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'brick kiln'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"This is a portable charcoal-fired kiln.  It is designed for firing bricks, "
"but you could use it to fire anything made of clay."
msgstr "木炭を燃やして使う携帯型の窯だ。レンガを焼くためのものだが、粘土で作ったものなら何でも焼くことができる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "carding paddles"
msgid_plural "pairs of carding paddles"
msgstr[0] "ハンドカード器"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'carding paddles', 'str_pl': 'pairs of carding
#. paddles'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"A pair of toothy wooden paddles used to clean fibers for use in textile "
"production."
msgstr "繊維をきれいに均して布製品を作るための、2枚の歯付き木製パドルだ。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "paint chipper"
msgid_plural "paint chippers"
msgstr[0] "ペイントスクレーパー"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'paint chipper'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "A tool similar to a chisel, designed to remove paint."
msgstr "塗料を剥がすために設計された、ノミに似た道具だ。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "clamp"
msgid_plural "clamps"
msgstr[0] "かすがい"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'clamp'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"This clamp is useful for keeping things still, especially if you have "
"several of them."
msgstr "物をしっかりと固定するのに役立つ道具だ。いくつか持っていれば特に便利だろう。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "claw bar"
msgid_plural "claw bars"
msgstr[0] "小型バール"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'claw bar'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"This is a small prying tool with a clawed bend at one end for pulling "
"spikes.  Use it to open locked doors without destroying them or to lift "
"manhole covers.  You could also wield it to bash some heads in."
msgstr ""
"片方の端が曲がっており、釘などを抜くための小型の工具だ。これを使って鍵のかかったドアを破壊せずにこじ開けたり、マンホールの蓋を持ち上げたりできる。誰かの頭を叩き潰すのにも使えるだろう。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "concrete mixer"
msgid_plural "concrete mixers"
msgstr[0] "コンクリートミキサー"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'concrete mixer'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"A portable concrete mixer.  It is still large and heavy, but it can be "
"operated solo, and runs on batteries.  It also has a heater built in."
msgstr "持ち運びできるコンクリートミキサーだ。大きくて重いが、一人で操作でき、電池で駆動する。ヒーターも内蔵されている。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "cordless drill"
msgid_plural "cordless drills"
msgstr[0] "電動ドリル"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'cordless drill'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"This is a cordless battery-powered drill with a selection of drill bits."
msgstr "電池で稼働するコードレスの電動ドリルだ。付け替え用のドリルビットがいくつか付属している。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "distaff and spindle"
msgid_plural "distaves and spindles"
msgstr[0] "糸巻き棒と紡錘"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'distaff and spindle', 'str_pl': 'distaves and
#. spindles'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"A pair of specialized wooden rods used to spin fibers into thread and yarn."
msgstr "繊維を糸や毛糸に紡ぐために使う、特殊な形をした2本の棒だ。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "electric jackhammer"
msgid_plural "electric jackhammers"
msgstr[0] "電動ジャッキハンマー"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'electric jackhammer'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"This is a construction tool for drilling through hard rock or other "
"surfaces.  It runs on a rechargeable cell, optionally compatible with UPS.  "
"Use it to blast a hole in adjacent solid terrain."
msgstr "硬い岩や他の表面に穴を開けるための建設用工具だ。充電式セルで動作し、UPSにも対応している。隣接する固い地形に穴を開けるために使える。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "hacksaw"
msgid_plural "hacksaws"
msgstr[0] "弓ノコ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'hacksaw'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "This is a sturdy saw, useful for cutting through metal objects."
msgstr "金属製品を切断するのに便利な、丈夫なノコギリだ。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "wire saw"
msgid_plural "wire saws"
msgstr[0] "糸ノコ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'wire saw'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"This is a flexible saw made from thin wire, with simple handles on either "
"end.  It should suffice for light metal and wood sawing, or for cutting "
"chain-link fences."
msgstr ""
"細いワイヤーで作られた柔軟なノコギリで、両端にシンプルな取っ手が付いている。軽い金属や木材を切ったり、金網フェンスを切断したりするのに十分だろう。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "hammer"
msgid_plural "hammers"
msgstr[0] "ハンマー"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'hammer'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"This is a demagnetized steel claw hammer with a wooden grip.  With a hammer,"
" nails, and two by fours in your inventory, you could board up adjacent "
"doors and windows.  It has myriad other uses as well."
msgstr ""
"持ち手が木製の、脱磁された鋼鉄製くぎ抜き金づちだ。ハンマー、釘、2x4材をインベントリに持っていれば、隣接するドアや窓に板を打ち付けることができる。その他にも無数の用途がある。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "bronze hammer"
msgid_plural "bronze hammers"
msgstr[0] "青銅のハンマー"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'bronze hammer'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"This is a bronze claw hammer with a wooden grip, commonly used where sparks "
"from a steel hammer might be a safety hazard.  You could board up adjacent "
"doors and windows, among myriad other uses."
msgstr ""
"持ち手が木製の青銅製くぎ抜き金づちだ。鋼鉄製のハンマーでは火花が飛んで安全上の危険がある場所でよく使われる。隣接するドアや窓に板を打ち付けるほか、無数の用途がある。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "hand drill"
msgid_plural "hand drills"
msgstr[0] "手回しドリル"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'hand drill'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"A primitive manual drill with a single drill bit.  It is slow and it will "
"exhaust you quickly."
msgstr "ドリルビットが一つだけの、原始的な手回し式ドリルだ。作業に時間がかかり、すぐに疲労するだろう。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "rubber hose"
msgid_plural "rubber hoses"
msgstr[0] "ゴムホース"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'rubber hose'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"This is a flexible rubber hose.  It could be used for crafting, or siphoning"
" fuel from a vehicle."
msgstr "柔軟なゴムホースだ。製作に使えるほか、車両から燃料を抜き取ることもできる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "utility maintenance kit"
msgid_plural "utility maintenance kits"
msgstr[0] ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'utility maintenance kit'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"A compact kit for probing, joining, and extending fluid grid connections in "
"buildings."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "bottle jack"
msgid_plural "bottle jacks"
msgstr[0] "ボトルジャッキ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'bottle jack'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "A portable hydraulic bottle jack used for lifting vehicles."
msgstr "車両を持ち上げるのに使う、携帯可能な油圧式ボトルジャッキだ。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "makeshift jack"
msgid_plural "makeshift jacks"
msgstr[0] "簡易ジャッキ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'makeshift jack'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"A poorly constructed improvised scissor jack used for lifting vehicles if "
"you're brave enough to use it."
msgstr "粗末に作られた即席のシザーズジャッキだ。使う勇気があれば車両を持ち上げるのに使える。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "scissor jack"
msgid_plural "scissor jacks"
msgstr[0] "シザーズジャッキ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'scissor jack'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "A compact scissor jack used for lifting vehicles."
msgstr "車両を持ち上げる際に使う、小型のシザーズジャッキだ。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "jackhammer"
msgid_plural "jackhammers"
msgstr[0] "ジャックハンマー"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'jackhammer'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"This is a construction tool for drilling through hard rock or other "
"surfaces.  It runs on gasoline.  Use it (if loaded) to blast a hole in "
"adjacent solid terrain."
msgstr "硬い岩や地面に穴を開けるための建設用ツールだ。ガソリンで動く。燃料がある状態で隣接する固い地形に対して使用すると、穴を開けることができる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "Auger"
msgid_plural "Augers"
msgstr[0] "オーガー"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Auger'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"This is a construction tool for boring holes in ground.  It runs on "
"gasoline.  For health reasons alone, augers are a worthwhile investment."
msgstr "地面に穴を掘るための建設用ツールだ。ガソリンで動く。健康上の理由だけでも、オーガーは価値ある投資だ。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "electric kiln"
msgid_plural "electric kilns"
msgstr[0] "電動窯"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'electric kiln'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"This is a portable electric kiln, powered by batteries.  It is designed for "
"firing bricks, but you could use it to fire anything made of clay.  With a "
"little mechanical know-how, you could probably even convert it to run "
"directly off a vehicle's power system."
msgstr ""
"電池で動く携帯型の電動窯だ。レンガを焼くためのものだが、粘土で作ったものなら何でも焼くことができる。少しばかり機械の知識があれば、車両の電源から直接動くように改造することもできるだろう。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "gunsmith repair kit"
msgid_plural "gunsmith repair kits"
msgstr[0] "プロ用銃器修復キット"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'gunsmith repair kit'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"This is a complete toolkit made to repair damaged firearms, disassemble "
"ammunition and manufacture firearm modifications.  Powered by standard "
"batteries, it can tackle any armory work when coupled with a hand press.  It"
" requires 25 charges of battery power per use."
msgstr ""
"破損した銃器の修理、弾薬の分解、銃器改造の製作を行うための完全なツールキットだ。標準的なバッテリーで動作し、ハンドプレスと組み合わせればあらゆる武器庫作業をこなせる。1回の使用につき、バッテリーを25消費する。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "makeshift hammer"
msgid_plural "makeshift hammers"
msgstr[0] "簡易ハンマー"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'makeshift hammer'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"This is a crude hammer made from a piece of metal affixed to a stick.  It "
"functions adequately as a hammer, but really can't compare to a proper one."
msgstr "棒に金属片を括りつけた、粗末なハンマーの代用品だ。ハンマーとしては十分に機能するが、本物には遠く及ばない。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "metal fileset"
msgid_plural "metal filesets"
msgstr[0] "ヤスリ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'metal fileset'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"These tools are commonly used to remove small amounts of materials from the "
"surface of metal objects."
msgstr "金属製の素材の表面から少量の物質を取り除くのに一般的に使われる工具だ。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "metallic smoother"
msgid_plural "metallic smoothers"
msgstr[0] "金属の左官ごて"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'metallic smoother'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"This metallic tool is most often used to smooth concrete, or mortar, in "
"construction projects."
msgstr "この金属製の道具は、建設プロジェクトでコンクリートやモルタルを平滑にするためによく使われる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json data/mods/MagicalNights/items/tools.json
msgid "misc repair kit"
msgid_plural "misc repair kits"
msgstr[0] "多目的修復キット"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'misc repair kit'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"This is a portable toolkit, consisting of a small carving knife for precise "
"carving of replacement parts from raw materials, a wood saw for more heavy-"
"duty wood cutting, and a patch of soft material for cleaning surfaces.  If "
"supplied with duct tape, it can be used to repair certain items."
msgstr ""
"素材から精密な交換部品を削り出す小型カービングナイフ、重労働な木材切断用のノコギリ、表面をきれいにする柔らかい布のセットになった携帯用ツールキットだ。ダクトテープがあれば、特定のアイテムを修理できる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json data/mods/MagicalNights/items/tools.json
msgid "makeshift repair kit"
msgid_plural "makeshift repair kits"
msgstr[0] "簡易修復キット"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'makeshift repair kit'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"This is a portable toolkit, consisting of a primitive knife for carving "
"replacement parts, an adze for more heavy-duty wood cutting, and a patch of "
"soft material for cleaning surfaces.  It can be used to repair certain items"
" if supplied with pitch, though it isn't ideal for complex work."
msgstr ""
"交換部品を削り出すための原始的なナイフ、重労働な木材切断用の手斧、表面をきれいにする柔らかい布のセットになった携帯用ツールキットだ。ピッチがあれば特定のアイテムを修理できるが、複雑な作業には向いていない。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "plastic mold"
msgid_plural "plastic molds"
msgstr[0] "プラスチック用金型"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'plastic mold'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"This is a plastic mold.  It could be shaped and used to craft items made of "
"plastic."
msgstr "簡単なプラスチック製アイテムを作るためのプラスチック製の金型だ。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "multi-tool"
msgid_plural "multi-tools"
msgstr[0] "万能ツール"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'multi-tool'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"A cleverly designed all-in-one tool which combines several smaller tools "
"into the handles of a pair of pliers."
msgstr "巧妙に設計されたオールインワンツールで、ペンチの持ち手の部分にいくつかの小さな工具が組み込まれている。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "acetylene torch"
msgid_plural "acetylene torches"
msgstr[0] "アセチレンバーナー"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'acetylene torch', 'str_pl': 'acetylene torches'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"A compact tool kit intended for welding and cutting metal, this portable "
"oxyacetylene torch includes a torch handle and cutting attachment in an "
"easy-to-carry tote.  It requires connecting to pressurized cylinders of an "
"appropriate welding gas before use.  In addition to its metalworking uses, "
"you can activate it in order to destroy metal barriers."
msgstr ""
"金属の溶接や切断を目的とした小型のツールキットだ。この携帯式アセチレンバーナーには、持ち運びやすいトートバッグに収められたトーチハンドルと切断用アタッチメントが含まれている。使用前には、適切な溶接ガスが入った加圧シリンダーに接続する必要がある。金属加工に加えて、金属製の壁を破壊するためにも使える。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "paint brush"
msgid_plural "paint brushes"
msgstr[0] "刷毛"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'paint brush', 'str_pl': 'paint brushes'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "A wide brush, suitable for painting walls."
msgstr "壁面を塗装するのに適した幅広の刷毛だ。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "pickaxe"
msgid_plural "pickaxes"
msgstr[0] "つるはし"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'pickaxe'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"This is a large steel pickaxe, suitable for breaking up hard things or (with"
" enough skill) hard targets.  Strike the earth!"
msgstr "鋼製の大きなつるはしだ。硬いものを壊すのに適しており、十分なスキルがあれば硬い敵を破壊するのにも使える。大地を削れ！"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "debugging prospecting pick"
msgid_plural "debugging prospecting picks"
msgstr[0] "デバッグ用探索つるはし"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'debugging prospecting pick'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"This is a medium pickaxe-slash-hammer that could reveal close by ore "
"pockets. This one has an obscene range, for debugging. God save your CPU."
msgstr ""
"これは、近くの鉱脈の兆候を検知できる、中型のつるはし兼ハンマーだ。このツールはデバッグ用に、とてつもない範囲を検知する。君のCPUに神のご加護を。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "crude prospecting pick"
msgid_plural "crude prospecting picks"
msgstr[0] "粗末な探索つるはし"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'crude prospecting pick'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"This is a crude hammer-pick used for finding nearby mineral veins. Terrible "
"for anything you're not basically standing on."
msgstr "これは、近くの鉱脈を探すための粗末なハンマー兼つるはしだ。真上に立っているような場所でなければ、役に立たない。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "copper prospecting pick"
msgid_plural "copper prospecting picks"
msgstr[0] "銅製探索つるはし"

#. ~ Description for copper prospecting pick
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"This is a copper hammer-pick used for finding nearby mineral veins. Not "
"accurate enough for long range, but works."
msgstr "これは、近くの鉱脈を探すための銅製のハンマー兼つるはしだ。長距離の精度は高くないが、機能する。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "steel prospecting pick"
msgid_plural "steel prospecting picks"
msgstr[0] "鋼鉄製探索つるはし"

#. ~ Description for steel prospecting pick
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"This is a steel hammer-pick used for finding nearby mineral veins. Can help "
"you sniff out even faint traces of minerals."
msgstr "これは、近くの鉱脈を探すための鋼鉄製のハンマー兼つるはしだ。かすかな鉱物の痕跡さえも嗅ぎ当てるのに役立つ。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "pin reamer"
msgid_plural "pin reamers"
msgstr[0] "ピンリーマー"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'pin reamer'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"Handheld pin reamers of this kind are used to enlarge existing holes, or "
"remove any burs and such from them."
msgstr "この種の手持ち式ピンリーマーは、既存の穴を広げたり、バリなどを取り除いたりするために使われる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "pliers"
msgid_plural "pliers"
msgstr[0] "プライヤー"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'pliers'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"This is a basic pair of slip-joint pliers, able to handle basic mechanical "
"work and pulling apart some ammunition cartridges.  Anything too complex "
"will require a wrench."
msgstr "基本的なスリップジョイントプライヤーだ。簡単な機械作業や弾薬の分解に使える。複雑すぎる作業にはレンチが必要だ。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "electric polisher"
msgid_plural "electric polishers"
msgstr[0] "電動ポリッシャー"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'electric polisher'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"An electric polisher which can be used to buff metal surfaces until they are"
" reflective like a mirror."
msgstr "金属の表面を鏡のように反射するまで磨き上げるのに使える電動工具だ。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "stone hammer"
msgid_plural "stone hammers"
msgstr[0] "石のハンマー"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'stone hammer'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"This is a rock affixed to a stick, in the crude facsimile of a hammer.  It "
"functions adequately as a hammer, but really can't compare to a proper one."
msgstr "棒に石を括り付けた、ハンマーの粗末な模造品だ。ハンマーとしては十分に機能するが、本物には遠く及ばない。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "screwdriver"
msgid_plural "screwdrivers"
msgstr[0] "ドライバー"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'screwdriver'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"This is a Philips-head screwdriver.  It is important for almost all "
"electronics crafting, most mechanics crafting, and has many more uses."
msgstr "プラスドライバーだ。ほとんどの電子工作や機械工作で重要な役割を果たすほか、他にも様々な用途がある。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "screwdriver set"
msgid_plural "screwdriver sets"
msgstr[0] "ドライバーセット"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'screwdriver set'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"This is a set of screwdrivers in several sizes and blade types.  Guaranteed "
"to have the right tools for more precise work."
msgstr "数種類のサイズと先端の形状が揃ったドライバーセットだ。より精密な作業に適した工具が揃っている。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "firearm repair kit"
msgid_plural "firearm repair kits"
msgstr[0] "銃器修復キット"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'firearm repair kit'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"This is a portable toolkit made to repair damaged firearms.  Powered by "
"standard batteries, it is a vital tool for long-term firearms maintenance.  "
"It requires 100 charges of battery power per use."
msgstr ""
"破損した銃器を修理するために作られた携帯式ツールキットだ。標準的なバッテリーで動作し、長期的な銃器のメンテナンスに不可欠なツールだ。1回の使用につき、バッテリーを100消費する。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "electric soldering iron"
msgid_plural "electric soldering irons"
msgstr[0] "電気はんだごて"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'electric soldering iron'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"This is a device with a metal tip that can get very hot.  It is necessary "
"for advanced electronics crafting.  You could also use it to cauterize "
"wounds, if you had to."
msgstr "金属製の先端部が非常に熱くなる装置だ。高度な電子工作に必須だが、必要に迫られれば傷口の焼灼にも使える。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "alcohol-fueled soldering iron"
msgid_plural "alcohol-fueled soldering irons"
msgstr[0] "アルコール燃料式はんだごて"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'alcohol-fueled soldering iron'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"This is a device with a metal tip that can get very hot.  It is necessary "
"for advanced electronics crafting.  A metal tip is hold over the burner to "
"create enough heat to solder.  Not as sophisticated as a regular soldering "
"iron."
msgstr ""
"金属製の先端部が非常に熱くなる装置だ。バーナーの上に金属製の先端を置いて、はんだ付けに十分な熱を発生させる。通常のはんだごてほど洗練されてはいない。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "toolbox"
msgid_plural "toolboxes"
msgstr[0] "工具箱"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'toolbox', 'str_pl': 'toolboxes'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"This is a stout metal box containing a complete tool kit suitable for most "
"household maintenance and construction activities."
msgstr "頑丈な金属製の箱に、ほとんどの家庭での修繕や建設作業に適した完全なツールキットが入っている。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "workshop toolbox"
msgid_plural "workshop toolboxes"
msgstr[0] "業務用工具箱"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'workshop toolbox', 'str_pl': 'workshop
#. toolboxes'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"This is a stout metal box containing a complete tool kit suitable for most "
"household maintenance and construction activities, as well as additional "
"tools used in workshops for advanced fabrication jobs."
msgstr "家庭でのほとんどの修繕や建設作業に適した工具一式に加え、工場での高度な製造作業に使われる追加の工具も入った頑丈な金属製の箱だ。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "arc welder"
msgid_plural "arc welders"
msgstr[0] "アーク溶接機"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'arc welder'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"This is a battery powered tool for welding metal pieces together using an "
"electric arc.  It is an indispensable tool for construction or repair."
msgstr "電気アークを使って金属片を溶接する、バッテリー駆動の工具だ。建設や修理には欠かせない。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "wooden smoother"
msgid_plural "wooden smoothers"
msgstr[0] "木の左官ごて"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'wooden smoother'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"This large makeshift tool is used in smoothing concrete or mortar in "
"construction projects.  You could also use it as an improvised head-basher."
msgstr "この大きな即席の道具は、建設プロジェクトでコンクリートやモルタルを平滑にするために使われる。即席の鈍器としても使えるだろう。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "wool staple"
msgid_plural "wool staples"
msgstr[0] "ウール"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'wool staple'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"The natural cluster of wool fibers.  Could be processed to the felt patches "
"or yarns."
msgstr "天然の羊毛の塊だ。フェルトや糸に加工できる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "X-Acto knife"
msgid_plural "X-Acto knives"
msgstr[0] "アートナイフ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'X-Acto knife', 'str_pl': 'X-Acto knives'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"This is a small, sharp knife, designed for making precise cuts for textiles "
"or crafts.  It could cause decent damage, but is difficult to hit things "
"with it.  Its small, sharp blade allows for precision strikes in the hands "
"of the skilled.  It is too small to butcher corpses with."
msgstr ""
"織物や工作などの精密作業のために設計された、小型で鋭いナイフだ。そこそこのダメージを与えられるが、命中させるのは難しい。熟練者の手にかかれば、小さく鋭い刃で精密な攻撃を繰り出せる。死体の解体には小さすぎる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "wrench"
msgid_plural "wrenches"
msgstr[0] "レンチ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'wrench', 'str_pl': 'wrenches'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"This is an adjustable crescent wrench.  It could be a decent melee weapon, "
"and is used in many mechanics crafting recipes."
msgstr "サイズ調節が可能なクレセントレンチだ。そこそこ使える近接武器になるし、多くの機械工作のレシピで使われる。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "leather hose"
msgid_plural "leather hoses"
msgstr[0] "革製ホース"

#. ~ Description for leather hose
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"This is a hose made out of leather.  Watertight and flexiable, it can be "
"used to siphon fuel from a vehicle tank.  However, it's not as elastic a "
"rubber hose."
msgstr "革で作られたホースだ。防水性があり柔軟で、車両のタンクから燃料を抜き取るのに使える。ただし、ゴムホースほど弾力性はない。"

#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid "makeshift hand drill"
msgid_plural "makeshift hand drills"
msgstr[0] "簡易手回しドリル"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'makeshift hand drill'}
#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"This is a makeshift manual drill made out of pipe and improvised drill bit."
"  It is very slow and it will exhaust you quickly."
msgstr "パイプと即席のドリルビットで作った、簡易的な手回しドリルだ。作業に時間がかかり、非常に疲労するだろう。"

#: data/json/items/vehicle/alternator.json
msgid "vehicle alternator"
msgid_plural "vehicle alternators"
msgstr[0] "車両用オルタネーター"

#: data/json/items/vehicle/alternator.json
#: data/json/vehicleparts/alternator.json
msgid "car alternator"
msgid_plural "car alternators"
msgstr[0] "自動車用オルタネーター"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'car alternator'}
#: data/json/items/vehicle/alternator.json
msgid "A standard alternator used to power vehicle electrical systems."
msgstr "車両の電気系統に電力を供給する標準的なオルタネーターだ。"

#: data/json/items/vehicle/alternator.json
#: data/json/vehicleparts/alternator.json
msgid "motorbike alternator"
msgid_plural "motorbike alternators"
msgstr[0] "バイク用オルタネーター"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'motorbike alternator'}
#: data/json/items/vehicle/alternator.json
msgid ""
"A compact lightweight alternator used to power small vehicle electrical "
"systems."
msgstr "小型車両の電気系統に電力を供給する、小型で軽量のオルタネーターだ。"

#: data/json/items/vehicle/alternator.json
#: data/json/vehicleparts/alternator.json
msgid "bicycle alternator"
msgid_plural "bicycle alternators"
msgstr[0] "自転車用オルタネーター"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'bicycle alternator'}
#: data/json/items/vehicle/alternator.json
msgid "A very lightweight alternator used to power a bicycle's headlights."
msgstr "自転車のヘッドライトに電力を供給する、非常に軽量なオルタネーターだ。"

#: data/json/items/vehicle/alternator.json
#: data/json/vehicleparts/alternator.json
msgid "truck alternator"
msgid_plural "truck alternators"
msgstr[0] "トラック用オルタネーター"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'truck alternator'}
#: data/json/items/vehicle/alternator.json
msgid ""
"A larger and more powerful alternator used to power vehicle electrical "
"systems."
msgstr "車両の電気系統に電力を供給する、より大型で強力なオルタネーターだ。"

#: data/json/items/vehicle/alternator.json
#: data/json/vehicleparts/alternator.json
msgid "7.5kW generator"
msgid_plural "7.5kW generators"
msgstr[0] "7.5kW発電機"

#. ~ Description for {'str': '7.5kW generator'}
#: data/json/items/vehicle/alternator.json
msgid ""
"A bulky but efficient electrical generator designed to be attached to an "
"engine."
msgstr "嵩張るが効率の良い電気発電機だ。エンジンに取り付けるように設計されている。"

#: data/json/items/vehicle/animals.json
#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
msgid "yoke and harness"
msgid_plural "yokes and harnesses"
msgstr[0] "くびき付きハーネス"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'yoke and harness', 'str_pl': 'yokes and
#. harnesses'}
#: data/json/items/vehicle/animals.json
msgid ""
"A bar and harness to attach a creature to a wheeled vehicle, they then "
"should be able to pull it."
msgstr "車輪付きの車両に動物をつなぎ、それを引かせられるようにするための棒とハーネスだ。"

#: data/json/items/vehicle/armor.json
msgid "rebar grate"
msgid_plural "rebar grates"
msgstr[0] "鉄筋格子"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'rebar grate'}
#: data/json/items/vehicle/armor.json
msgid ""
"Interlocked sections of rebar that allows for light and effective "
"reinforcement of vehicle sections."
msgstr "車両の採光と効果的な補強を両立する、鉄筋を組み合わせて作られた部品だ。"

#: data/json/items/vehicle/armor.json data/json/vehicleparts/armor.json
msgid "shock absorber"
msgid_plural "shock absorbers"
msgstr[0] "緩衝装置"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'shock absorber'}
#: data/json/items/vehicle/armor.json
msgid ""
"This makeshift combination of springs and scrap, when attached to a vehicle "
"section, protects that section from impacts.  The springs can absorb a "
"surprising amount of damage."
msgstr ""
"バネとスクラップを組み合わせて作られた即席の緩衝装置だ。車両のセクションに取り付けると、衝撃からその部分を保護する。バネは驚くほどのダメージを吸収できる。"

#: data/json/items/vehicle/balloon.json data/json/vehicleparts/balloons.json
msgid "airship balloon"
msgid_plural "airship balloons"
msgstr[0] "飛行船バルーン"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'airship balloon'}
#: data/json/items/vehicle/balloon.json
msgid ""
"A big plastic airbag filled with hydrogen gas.  Provides lift if installed "
"on a vehicle, but you'll need a propeller to do anything more than float up "
"and down."
msgstr "水素ガスを充填した大きなプラスチック製のエアバッグだ。車両に取り付ければ揚力を得られるが、プロペラがなければ上下に浮き沈みするだけだろう。"

#: data/json/items/vehicle/battery.json data/json/vehicleparts/battery.json
msgid "car battery"
msgid_plural "car batteries"
msgstr[0] "自動車用バッテリー"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'car battery', 'str_pl': 'car batteries'}
#: data/json/items/vehicle/battery.json
msgid "A 12v lead-acid battery used to power car electrical systems."
msgstr "自動車の電気系統に電力を供給するために使われる12Vの鉛蓄電池だ。"

#: data/json/items/vehicle/battery.json data/json/vehicleparts/battery.json
msgid "motorbike battery"
msgid_plural "motorbike batteries"
msgstr[0] "バイクバッテリー"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'motorbike battery', 'str_pl': 'motorbike
#. batteries'}
#: data/json/items/vehicle/battery.json
msgid ""
"A 12v lead-acid battery used to power smaller vehicles' electrical systems."
msgstr "小型車両の電気系統に電力を供給するために使われる12Vの鉛蓄電池だ。"

#: data/json/items/vehicle/battery.json
msgid "small motorbike battery"
msgid_plural "small motorbike batteries"
msgstr[0] "小型バイク用バッテリー"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'small motorbike battery', 'str_pl': 'small
#. motorbike batteries'}
#: data/json/items/vehicle/battery.json
msgid ""
"A miniature 12v lead-acid battery used to power smaller vehicles' electrical"
" systems."
msgstr "小型車両の電気系統に電力を供給する、小型の12V鉛蓄電池だ。"

#: data/json/items/vehicle/battery.json
msgid "storage battery case"
msgid_plural "storage battery cases"
msgstr[0] "蓄電池ケース"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'storage battery case'}
#: data/json/items/vehicle/battery.json
msgid ""
"An empty case that can hold a storage battery, complete with charging "
"controller chip, connecting wires, and mechanisms to help lift the battery "
"to be mounted into position."
msgstr ""
"蓄電池を収納できる空のケースだ。充電コントローラーチップ、接続ワイヤー、そしてバッテリーを所定の位置に持ち上げて取り付けるための機構が完備されている。"

#: data/json/items/vehicle/battery.json data/json/vehicleparts/battery.json
msgid "very large storage battery"
msgid_plural "very large storage batteries"
msgstr[0] "超大型蓄電池"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'very large storage battery', 'str_pl': 'very
#. large storage batteries'}
#: data/json/items/vehicle/battery.json
msgid ""
"A huge storage battery containing many lithium-ion cells.  Holds a "
"tremendous amount of energy.  Could be installed into a storage battery case"
" for easy removal from a vehicle, or just welded straight in."
msgstr ""
"大量のリチウムイオン電池を搭載した巨大な蓄電池だ。膨大な量のエネルギーを蓄えられる。蓄電池ケースに組み込んで車両から簡単に取り外せるようにしてもいいし、直接溶接してしまってもいい。"

#: data/json/items/vehicle/battery.json data/json/vehicleparts/battery.json
msgid "medium storage battery"
msgid_plural "medium storage batteries"
msgstr[0] "中型蓄電池"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'medium storage battery', 'str_pl': 'medium
#. storage batteries'}
#: data/json/items/vehicle/battery.json
msgid "A medium storage battery containing multiple lithium-ion cells."
msgstr "複数のリチウムイオン電池が入っている中型の蓄電池だ。"

#: data/json/items/vehicle/battery.json data/json/vehicleparts/battery.json
msgid "sea scooter battery"
msgid_plural "sea scooter batteries"
msgstr[0] "シースクーター用バッテリー"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'sea scooter battery', 'str_pl': 'sea scooter
#. batteries'}
#: data/json/items/vehicle/battery.json
msgid ""
"A medium storage battery customized to fit specifically inside the hull of a"
" sea scooter. It also weighs less."
msgstr "シースクーターの船体内にぴったり収まるようにカスタマイズされた中型蓄電池だ。重量も軽い。"

#: data/json/items/vehicle/battery.json data/json/vehicleparts/battery.json
msgid "small storage battery"
msgid_plural "small storage batteries"
msgstr[0] "小型蓄電池"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'small storage battery', 'str_pl': 'small storage
#. batteries'}
#: data/json/items/vehicle/battery.json
msgid ""
"A small storage battery created with pre-Cataclysm lithium-ion technology.  "
"Useful for crafting."
msgstr "大災厄以前のリチウムイオン技術で作られた小型の蓄電池だ。製作に役立つ。"

#: data/json/items/vehicle/battery.json data/json/vehicleparts/battery.json
msgid "large storage battery"
msgid_plural "large storage batteries"
msgstr[0] "大型蓄電池"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'large storage battery', 'str_pl': 'large storage
#. batteries'}
#: data/json/items/vehicle/battery.json
msgid ""
"A large storage battery containing many lithium-ion cells.  Could be "
"installed into a storage battery case for easy removal from a vehicle, or "
"just welded straight in."
msgstr "リチウムイオン電池を多数搭載した大型の蓄電池だ。そのまま車両に直接溶接してもいいが、蓄電池ケースに入れて使えば簡単に取り外すことができる。"

#: data/json/items/vehicle/boat.json
msgid "wood boat hull"
msgid_plural "wood boat hulls"
msgstr[0] "木製の船体"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'wood boat hull'}
#: data/json/items/vehicle/boat.json
msgid ""
"A wooden board that keeps the boat afloat.  Add boat hulls to a vehicle "
"until it floats.  Then attach oars or a motor to get the boat to move."
msgstr "船を水に浮かせる木製の板だ。車両が浮くようになるまで船体を取り付け、オールやモーターを装着すれば動き始める。"

#: data/json/items/vehicle/boat.json data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
