#: data/json/mutations/mutation_category.json
msgid "Spider"
msgstr "クモ"

#. ~ Mutation class: Spider mutagen_message
#. ~ Mutation class: Arachnae mutagen_message
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_category.json
#: data/mods/Monster_Girls/categories.json
