#. ~ Mutation class: Kumamimi mutagen_message
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_category.json
#: data/mods/Monster_Girls/categories.json
msgid "You feel an urge to… patrol?  the forests?"
msgstr "衝動を感じる……パトロールしたい？森を？"

#. ~ Mutation class: Bear iv_message
#. ~ Mutation class: Kumamimi iv_message
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_category.json
#: data/mods/Monster_Girls/categories.json
