msgstr "クマと一つになった。"

#. ~ Mutation class: Bear Female memorial messsage
#. ~ Mutation class: Kumamimi Female memorial messsage
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_category.json
#: data/mods/Monster_Girls/categories.json
msgctxt "memorial_female"
msgid "Became one with the bears."
msgstr "クマと一つになった。"

#. ~ Mutation class name
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_category.json
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Feline"
msgstr "ネコ"

#. ~ Mutation class: Feline mutagen_message
#. ~ Mutation class: Nekomimi mutagen_message
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_category.json
#: data/mods/Monster_Girls/categories.json
msgid "As you lap up the last of the mutagen, you wonder why..."
msgstr "変異原を最後の一滴まで舐め尽くすと、なぜだか不思議に思う…"

#. ~ Mutation class: Feline iv_message
#. ~ Mutation class: Nekomimi iv_message
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_category.json
#: data/mods/Monster_Girls/categories.json
msgid "Your back arches as the mutagen takes hold."
msgstr "変異原が効き始めると、思わず背中を反らせる。"

#. ~ Mutation class: Feline Male memorial messsage
#. ~ Mutation class: Nekomimi Male memorial messsage
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_category.json
#: data/mods/Monster_Girls/categories.json
