msgstr "夢を現実にした。"

#. ~ Mutation class: Feline Female memorial messsage
#. ~ Mutation class: Nekomimi Female memorial messsage
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_category.json
#: data/mods/Monster_Girls/categories.json
msgctxt "memorial_female"
msgid "Realized the dream."
msgstr "夢を現実にした。"

#. ~ Mutation class name
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_category.json
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Wolf"
msgstr "オオカミ"

