#. ~ Mutation class: Inumimi mutagen_message
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_category.json
#: data/mods/Monster_Girls/categories.json
msgid "You feel an urge to mark your territory.  But then it passes."
msgstr "縄張りをマーキングしたい衝動に駆られる。だが、すぐに治まる。"

#. ~ Mutation class: Wolf iv_message
#. ~ Mutation class: Inumimi iv_message
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_category.json
