#: data/json/mutations/mutation_spells.json
msgid "Blinding spray"
msgstr "ブラインディング・スプレー"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Blinding spray'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_spells.json
msgid "Blinds enemy for a short time."
msgstr "敵を短時間盲目にする。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutation_spells.json
msgid "Poison"
msgstr "毒"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Poison'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_spells.json
msgid "Poisons the target."
msgstr "対象に毒を与える。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutation_spells.json
msgid "Paralyzing Poison"
msgstr "麻痺毒"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Paralyzing Poison'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_spells.json
msgid "Slows the target."
msgstr "対象の速度を低下させる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Fleet-Footed"
msgstr "俊足"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Fleet-Footed'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You can move more quickly than most, resulting in a 15% speed bonus on sure "
"footing."
msgstr "ほとんどの者より速く移動でき、確実な足場で移動する場合は速度ボーナスとして15%のボーナスを得る。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Weak Photophore"
msgstr "弱い発光器官"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Weak Photophore'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"A photophore has grown from your head; you can make it glow softly.  This "
"will make you very visible in the dark, ideal for attracting a partner "
"during mating season."
msgstr "頭部から発光器官が生え、弱々しく光らせることができる。暗闇で非常に目立つため、繁殖期のパートナーを引き寄せるのに最適だ。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Photophore"
msgstr "発光器官"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Photophore'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You can make your photophore glow brightly."
msgstr "発光器官を明るく光らせることができる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Good Hearing"
msgstr "優れた聴覚"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Good Hearing'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your hearing is better than average, and you can hear distant sounds more "
"easily."
msgstr "聴覚が平均以上で、遠くの音をより簡単に聞き取れる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Fey Hearing"
msgstr "妖精の聴覚"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Fey Hearing'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You're not sure the shape of your ears is helping you any; regardless, you "
"have become very sensitive to sounds."
msgstr "耳の形が役に立っているかは定かでないが、いずれにせよ音に対して非常に敏感になった。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Inattentive"
msgstr "不注意な"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Inattentive'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You never paid attention to your surroundings and specifically to people "
"around you.  You can't judge intent of critters you see."
msgstr "お前は周囲、人々に注意を払ってこなかった。そのため、遭遇した生き物の意図を判断することができない。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Outdoorsman"
msgstr "野外活動愛好家"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Outdoorsman'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You are accustomed to being exposed to the elements.  This decreases morale "
"penalties for being wet."
msgstr "風雨に晒されることに慣れている。濡れた状態での意欲ペナルティが減少する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Parkour Expert"
msgstr "パルクールの達人"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Parkour Expert'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You're skilled at clearing obstacles; terrain like railings or counters are "
"as easy for you to move on as solid ground.  Your experience also allows you"
" to take reduced damage from falls."
msgstr ""
"障害物を乗り越えるのが得意だ。手すりやカウンターのような地形も、平地と同じくらい簡単に移動できる。また、経験のおかげで落下ダメージも軽減できる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Indefatigable"
msgstr "不屈の精神"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Indefatigable'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Whether due to exercise and good diet, or due to a natural propensity to "
"physical endurance, you tire due to physical exertion much less readily than"
" others.  Your maximum stamina and stamina regeneration is 25% higher than "
"usual."
msgstr "エクササイズや良い食事、あるいは生来の体力のおかげで、肉体的な疲労を感じにくい。最大スタミナとスタミナの回復量が通常より25%高い。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Hyperactive"
msgstr "活動過多"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Hyperactive'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your body's efficiency is like that of a tiny furnace, increasing your "
"maximum stamina and stamina regeneration by 40%."
msgstr "体の効率は小さな炉のようで、最大スタミナとスタミナの回復量が40%増加する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Quick"
msgstr "俊敏"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Quick'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You're just generally quick!  You get a 10% bonus to action points."
msgstr "とにかく機敏だ！アクションポイントに10%のボーナスを得る。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Optimist'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Nothing gets you down!  You savor the joys of life, ignore its hardships, "
"and are generally happier than most people."
msgstr "何があってもくじけない！人生の喜びを味わい、困難をものともせず、たいていの人より幸せを感じている。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Fast Healer"
msgstr "高速治癒"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Fast Healer'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your wounds heal themselves quicker than usual.  You heal 50% faster whilst "
"asleep, and 20% faster whilst awake.  Your broken limbs also heal twice as "
"fast."
msgstr "傷が通常より早く治る。睡眠中は50%、起きている間は20%回復が速くなる。骨折した手足も2倍の速さで治る。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Light Eater"
msgstr "少食"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Light Eater'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your metabolism is a little slower, and you require less food than most."
msgstr "代謝が少し遅く、ほとんどの人より少ない食料で済む。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Accomplished Sleeper"
msgstr "高速睡眠"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Accomplished Sleeper'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have always been able to fall asleep easily, even when sleeping in less "
"than ideal circumstances."
msgstr "理想的とは言えない状況でも、常に簡単に眠りにつくことができる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Practiced Sleeper"
msgstr "熟睡"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Practiced Sleeper'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your body's demanding energy needs mean you can fall asleep just about "
"anywhere."
msgstr "体のエネルギー消費が激しいため、どんな場所でも眠りに落ちることができる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Pain Resistant"
msgstr "痛覚耐性"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Pain Resistant'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You have a high tolerance for pain."
msgstr "苦痛に対する耐性が高い。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Night Vision"
msgstr "夜目"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Night Vision'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You possess natural night vision, and can see further in the dark than most."
msgstr "生まれつき夜目が利き、ほとんどの者より暗闇をよく見通せる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Poison Resistant"
msgstr "毒耐性"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Poison Resistant'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your system is rather tolerant of poisons and toxins, and most will affect "
"you less."
msgstr "お前の身体は毒や毒素への耐性が高く、ほとんど影響は受けない。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Fast Reader"
msgstr "速読"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Fast Reader'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You're a quick reader, and can get through books a lot faster than most."
msgstr "読むのが速く、ほとんどの者より遥かに速く本を読み終えられる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Sheer Bulk"
msgstr "巨大な体躯"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Sheer Bulk'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You've developed a very robust build.  You get a +15 bonus to all hit "
"points.  Swimming will be more difficult from now on."
msgstr "非常に頑丈な体格に恵まれている。全ヒットポイントに+15のボーナスを得る。これからは水泳がより困難になる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Immense Bulk"
msgstr "圧倒的な巨体"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Immense Bulk'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"There is no way you'd be allowed to compete in pre-Cataclysm sports.  You "
"get a +30 bonus to all hit points.  Swimming is no longer recommended for "
"someone built like you."
msgstr ""
"大災厄以前の世界では、スポーツ競技に出場を許可されることはないだろう。全ヒットポイントに+30のボーナスを得る。君のような体格の者には、もはや水泳は推奨されない。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Tough"
msgstr "頑丈"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Tough'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"It takes a lot to bring you down!  You get a 20% bonus to all hit points."
msgstr "並大抵のことでは倒れない！全ヒットポイントに20%のボーナスを得る。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Durable"
msgstr "屈強"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Durable'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You can shrug off almost anything!  You get a 30% bonus to all hit points."
msgstr "ほとんど何でも耐え抜くことができる！全ヒットポイントに30%のボーナスを得る。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Unbreakable"
msgstr "超屈強"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Unbreakable'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Nothing can break you!  You get a 40% bonus to all hit points."
msgstr "何者もお前を破壊することはできない！全ヒットポイントに40%のボーナスを得る。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Thick-Skinned"
msgstr "厚い皮膚"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Thick-Skinned'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your skin is tough.  Armor is increased by 2 for your whole body.  There's a"
" small chance you don't cut yourself on sharp terrain."
msgstr "お前の皮膚は分厚く頑丈だ。全身のアーマー値が2増加する。また、鋭利な地形でも身を切る可能性がわずかに減少する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Packmule"
msgstr "運搬の達人"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Packmule'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You can manage to find space for anything!  You can carry 40% more volume."
msgstr "どんな場所にも荷物の隙間を見つけられる。所持できる容量が40%増加する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Strong Back"
msgstr "丈夫な腰"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Strong Back'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You are capable of carrying far more than someone with similar strength "
"could.  Your maximum weight carried is increased by 35%."
msgstr "同程度の筋力を持つ者よりも遥かに多くの荷物を運べる。最大所持重量が35%増加する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Fast Learner"
msgstr "呑み込みが早い"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Fast Learner'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have a flexible mind, allowing you to learn skills much faster than "
"others.  Note that this only applies to real-world experience, not to skill "
"gain from other sources like books."
msgstr ""
"柔軟な思考力を持っており、他人よりも遥かに速くスキルを習得できる。この効果は実践経験によるスキル習得にのみ適用され、本などからの学習には適用されない。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Strong Stomach"
msgstr "鉄の胃袋"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Strong Stomach'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You are less likely to throw up from food poisoning, alcohol, etc.  If you "
"throw up despite this, you won't suffer any residual nausea."
msgstr "食中毒やアルコールなどで嘔吐する可能性が低くなる。もし嘔吐してしまっても、後遺症的な吐き気に悩まされることはない。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Deft"
msgstr "機敏"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Deft'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your attacks are 10% faster overall.  You are also better at recovering from"
" a miss, and will be able to attempt another strike faster."
msgstr "攻撃速度が全体的に10%速くなる。また、攻撃を外した後の体勢立て直しが速く、次の攻撃をより早く繰り出せる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Spiritual"
msgstr "霊感"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Spiritual'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You've always felt that there is more to the world than we can see.  Whether"
" driven by religious beliefs or philosophical interest, you find great "
"inspiration in studying holy texts and experiencing mystical things."
msgstr ""
"お前は常に、この世界には目に見えるもの以上の何かがあると信じている。宗教的信念であれ哲学的な興味であれ、聖なる書物を研究したり神秘的な体験をすることで、大きなインスピレーションを得られる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Substance Tolerance"
msgstr "薬物耐性"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Substance Tolerance'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You can handle intoxicants well.  Their effects clear up more quickly for "
"you."
msgstr "鎮静剤をうまく処理できる。それらの効果がより早く消える。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Gourmand"
msgstr "大食漢"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Gourmand'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You eat faster, and can eat and drink more, than anyone else!  You also "
"enjoy food more; delicious food is better for your morale, and you don't "
"mind unsavory meals as much."
msgstr ""
"大食漢誰よりも速く食べ、誰よりも多くのものを飲食できる！また、食べ物をもっと楽しめる。美味しい食事は意欲をより高め、不味い食事もさほど気にならなくなる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Bookworm"
msgstr "本の虫"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Bookworm'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"There's nothing quite like the smell of a good book!  Books are more fun (or"
" less boring) for you!"
msgstr "良い本の匂いに勝るものはない！お前にとって、本はより楽しいものになる (退屈な本も、さほど退屈ではなくなる)！"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Addiction Resistant"
msgstr "依存症耐性"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Addiction Resistant'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Whether due to a lifetime of exposure or through simple willpower, it's "
"harder for you to become addicted to substances, and easier to rid yourself "
"of these addictions."
msgstr "長年にわたる経験によるものか、単なる意志の強さによるものか、依存性物質の中毒になりにくく、また中毒になっても克服するのが容易だ。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Animal Empathy"
msgstr "動物共感"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Animal Empathy'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Peaceful animals will not run away from you, and even aggressive animals are"
" less likely to attack.  This only applies to natural animals such as "
"woodland creatures."
msgstr "おとなしい動物はお前から逃げなくなり、攻撃的な動物でさえ襲ってくる可能性が低くなる。この効果は、森の生き物などの自然動物にのみ適用される。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Animal Kinship"
msgstr "動物親近"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Animal Kinship'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Something about your presence is calming to animals, and they will treat you"
" with innate trust.  This only applies to natural animals such as woodland "
"creatures."
msgstr "お前の存在には、動物を落ち着かせる何かがある。彼らはお前に生来の信頼感を抱くだろう。この効果は、森の生き物などの自然動物にのみ適用される。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Terrifying"
msgstr "畏怖"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Terrifying'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"There's something about you that creatures find frightening, and they are "
"more likely to try to flee."
msgstr "お前の存在には、生き物を怯えさせる何かがあり、彼らが逃げ出そうとする可能性が高くなる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "High Adrenaline"
msgstr "過剰アドレナリン"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'High Adrenaline'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"If you are in a very dangerous situation, you may experience a temporary "
"rush which increases your speed and strength significantly."
msgstr "非常に危険な状況に陥ると、一時的に速度と筋力が大幅に増加するアドレナリンラッシュを経験する可能性がある。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Less Sleep"
msgstr "短眠"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Less Sleep'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You need less sleep than the average person."
msgstr "平均的な人間よりも少ない睡眠で済む。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Masochist"
msgstr "被虐嗜好"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Masochist'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Although you still suffer the negative effects of pain, it also brings a "
"unique pleasure to you."
msgstr "痛みの負の効果は依然として受けるが、それに独特の快感を覚える。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Stimulant Psychosis"
msgstr "興奮物質精神病"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Stimulant Psychosis'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have a unique history with stimulants (like coffee or amphetamines).  "
"You can tolerate a lot more of them without overdosing, but if you indulge "
"too much, you start seeing things…"
msgstr ""
"興奮物質（コーヒーやアンフェタミンなど）とのユニークな歴史を持つ。大量に摂取しても過剰摂取になりにくいが、あまりに深入りしすぎると、幻覚を見始めるだろう…"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Fashion Deficient"
msgstr "ファッションセンス欠如"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Fashion Deficient'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have no sense of style, and don't care about wearing anything 'fancy';  "
"you'd be perfectly happy to wear non-matching socks, or wear socks and "
"sandals.  You get no morale bonus from fancy equipment."
msgstr ""
"お前にスタイルセンスはなく、「おしゃれな」服を着ることに関心がない。バラバラの靴下を履いていたり、靴下とサンダルを履いていたりしてもまったく気にしない。おしゃれな装備から意欲ボーナスを得ることはない。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Light Step"
msgstr "忍び足"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Light Step'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You make no noise while walking."
msgstr "歩行中に音を立てない。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json data/mods/rpg_system/main.lua
msgid "Scout"
msgstr "優秀なナビゲーター"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Scout'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You're an excellent navigator and your ability to recognize distant "
"landmarks is unmatched.  Your sight radius on the overmap extends beyond the"
" normal range."
msgstr "遠くの目印さえ見分けられる、比類なき優秀なナビゲーターだ。オーバーマップの視認範囲が通常より広くなる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Topographagnosia"
msgstr "地誌失認"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Topographagnosia'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Focal brain damage has rendered you incapable of recognizing landmarks and "
"orienting yourself in your surroundings, severely crippling your sight "
"radius on the overmap."
msgstr "脳の一部が損傷しており、地形や方角をうまく認識できない。オーバーマップの視認範囲が極端に狭くなる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Cannibal"
msgstr "食人嗜好"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Cannibal'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"For your whole life you've been forbidden from indulging in your peculiar "
"tastes.  Now the world's ended, and you'll be damned if anyone is going to "
"tell you that you can't eat people."
msgstr "これまでの人生、おかしな食欲を満たすことは禁じられていた。だが、世界は終わったのだ。人肉を食うなと言う奴は、くたばってしまえ。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Psychopath"
msgstr "サイコパス"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Psychopath'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You don't experience guilt like others do.  Even when you know your actions "
"are wrong, you just don't care."
msgstr "お前は他人のように罪悪感を覚えない。自分の行動が間違っていると分かっていても、まったく気にしない。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Killer Drive"
msgstr "殺害衝動"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Killer Drive'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You derive enjoyment from killing things.  Putting end to life seem to spark"
" some dark satisfaction and thrill, and you crave it every moment."
msgstr "何かを殺すことに喜びを感じる。命を絶つことは、ある種の暗い満足感とスリルをもたらし、お前は常にそれを渇望している。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Martial Arts Training"
msgstr "格闘術訓練"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Martial Arts Training'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have received some martial arts training at a local dojo.  You start "
"with your choice of Karate, Judo, Aikido, Tai Chi, Taekwondo, Kickboxing, or"
" Pankration."
msgstr ""
"地元の道場で何らかの格闘術訓練を受けている。空手、柔道、合気道、太極拳、テコンドー、キックボクシング、パンクラチオンから一つを選んで開始する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Self-Defense Classes"
msgstr "護身術"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Self-Defense Classes'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have taken some self-defense classes at a nearby gym.  You start with "
"your choice of Boxing, Capoeira, Krav Maga, Muay Thai, Ninjutsu, Wing Chun, "
"or Zui Quan."
msgstr "近所のジムで護身術のクラスを受けていた。ボクシング、カポエイラ、クラヴマガ、ムエタイ、忍術、詠春拳、酔拳の中から一つを選んで開始する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Shaolin Adept"
msgstr "少林拳の達人"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Shaolin Adept'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have studied the arts of the Shaolin monks.  You start with one of the "
"five animal fighting styles: Tiger, Crane, Leopard, Snake, or Dragon."
msgstr "少林僧の格闘術を学んでいた。虎形拳、鶴形拳、豹形拳、蛇形拳、龍形拳の五獣拳から一つを選んで開始する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Melee Weapon Training"
msgstr "近接武器訓練"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Melee Weapon Training'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have practiced fighting with weapons.  You start with your choice of "
"Barbaran Montante, Eskrima, Fencing, Fior Di Battaglia, Medieval "
"Swordsmanship, Niten Ichi-Ryu, Pentjak Silat, or Sōjutsu."
msgstr ""
"武器を使った戦闘を練習してきた。ババリアン・モンタンテ、エスクリマ、フェンシング、フィオーレ・ディ・バッタリア、中世剣術、二天一流、プンチャック・シラット、槍術から一つを選んで開始する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Competitive Fencer"
msgstr "フェンシング選手"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Competitive Fencer'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You were an avid fencer, starting with foil and moving onto saber, then "
"épée.  You competed nationally and dabbled with some of the historical "
"fencing weapons afforded by HEMA's popularity."
msgstr ""
"熱心なフェンシング選手で、フルーレから始めてサーブル、そしてエペへと移行し、全国大会にも出場した。近頃人気のHEMA（歴史的欧州剣術）の影響で、歴史的な武器を使ったフェンシングにも手を出している。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Weak Scent"
msgstr "体臭が薄い"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Weak Scent'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your scent is quite weak.  Animals that track your scent will do so with "
"more difficulty."
msgstr "体臭が非常に薄い。匂いでお前を追跡する動物は、より困難を強いられる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Skilled Liar"
msgstr "熟練の嘘つき"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Skilled Liar'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have no qualms about bending the truth, and have practically no tells.  "
"Telling lies and otherwise bluffing will be much easier for you."
msgstr ""
"事実を曲げることに何の良心的な呵責もない。嘘をついても、その嘘を見破られる兆候をほとんど示さない。嘘をつくことやハッタリをかますことが、お前にとってはるかに簡単になる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Pretty"
msgstr "美形"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Pretty'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You are a sight to behold.  People who care about such things will react "
"more kindly to you."
msgstr "見る者を引きつける容姿をしている。外見を気にする人々は、お前に親切に接してくれるだろう。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Bad Knees"
msgstr "膝が悪い"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Bad Knees'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Whether due to injury or age, your knees aren't particularly strong or "
"flexible.  Moving over rough terrain will slow you down more than normal."
msgstr "怪我や加齢のせいか、お前の膝は特に強くも柔軟でもない。でこぼこした地形を移動すると、通常よりも速度が落ちる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Languorous"
msgstr "体力不足"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Languorous'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Whether due to lack of exercise and poor diet, or due to a natural "
"disinclination to physical endurance, you tire due to physical exertion much"
" more readily than others.  Your maximum stamina and stamina regeneration is"
" 25% lower than usual."
msgstr ""
"運動不足や食生活の乱れ、あるいは生まれつき体力がないせいか、他人よりもはるかに早く肉体的な疲労を感じる。最大スタミナとスタミナ回復量が通常より25%低下する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Near-Sighted"
msgstr "近視"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Near-Sighted'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Without glasses, your seeing radius is severely reduced!  However, you are "
"guaranteed to start with a pair of glasses."
msgstr "メガネなしでは、お前の視界は著しく狭くなる！ただし、メガネを1つ持って開始できる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Slow Healer"
msgstr "治癒が遅い"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Slow Healer'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your wounds heal a little slower than most.  Your HP whilst asleep heals at "
"75% of the regular rate."
msgstr "傷の治りが他の人より少し遅い。睡眠中のHP回復速度が通常の75%になる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Poor Healer"
msgstr "治癒力不足"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Poor Healer'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your health recovery is severely impaired.  Your HP whilst asleep heals at "
"33% of the regular rate."
msgstr "体力回復能力が著しく損なわれている。睡眠中のHP回復速度が通常の33%になる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Imperceptive Healer"
msgstr "治癒力欠乏"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Imperceptive Healer'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Wounds are incredibly dangerous to you, as they barely heal at all.  Your HP"
" whilst asleep heals at 10% of the regular rate."
msgstr "傷はお前にとって信じられないほど危険だ。ほとんど治癒しないため、睡眠中のHP回復速度が通常の10%になる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Far-Sighted"
msgstr "遠視"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Far-Sighted'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Without reading glasses, you are unable to read anything, and take penalties"
" on melee accuracy and electronics/tailoring crafting.  However, you are "
"guaranteed to start with a pair of reading glasses."
msgstr "老眼鏡なしでは文字を読むことができず、近接攻撃の命中精度、電子工作、裁縫の製作にペナルティを受ける。ただし、老眼鏡を1つ持って開始できる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Heavy Sleeper"
msgstr "熟睡"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Heavy Sleeper'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You're quite the heavy sleeper.  Noises are unlikely to wake you up."
msgstr "お前はかなりの熟睡家だ。騒音で目覚める可能性が低くなる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Sleepy"
msgstr "眠たがり"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Sleepy'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You need sleep more often, but still spend most of your time awake."
msgstr "平均より頻繁に睡眠が必要だが、それでもほとんどの時間を起きて過ごせる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Asthmatic"
msgstr "喘息"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Asthmatic'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You will occasionally need to use an inhaler, or else suffer severe physical"
" limitations.  However, you are guaranteed to start with an inhaler."
msgstr "定期的に吸入器を使用しないと、深刻な身体的制限を受ける。ただし、吸入器を1つ持って開始できる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Bad Back"
msgstr "腰痛持ち"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Bad Back'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You simply cannot carry as much as people with a similar strength could.  "
"Your maximum weight carried is reduced by 35%."
msgstr "同じ筋力を持つ他の人と同じ量の荷物を運ぶことができない。最大所持重量が35%減少する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Bad Temper"
msgstr "短気"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Bad Temper'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Things just keep getting you down.  You tend to be unhappy, and it takes "
"some doing to cheer you up."
msgstr "常に何かに不満を感じている。気分が落ち込みやすく、機嫌を直すのに苦労する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Disorganized"
msgstr "整頓下手"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Disorganized'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You are terrible at organizing and storing your possessions.  You can carry "
"40% less volume."
msgstr "持ち物の整理や収納が非常に苦手だ。所持できる容量が40%減少する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Illiterate"
msgstr "文盲"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Illiterate'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You never learned to read!  Books and computers are off-limits to you."
msgstr "読み書きを学んだことがない！本やコンピューターは、お前にとっては未知の領域だ。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Poor Hearing"
msgstr "軽度難聴"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Poor Hearing'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your hearing is poor, and you may not hear quiet or far-off noises."
msgstr "聴覚が弱く、小さい音や遠くの音を聞き取ることができない。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Deaf'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You're not able to hear anything, and as such you're not able to talk to "
"NPCs."
msgstr "何も聞こえないため、他の人と会話することができない。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Slow Learner"
msgstr "飲み込みが遅い"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Slow Learner'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You are slow to grasp new ideas, and thus learn things more slowly than "
"others.  Note that this only applies to real-world experience, not to skill "
"gain from other sources like books."
msgstr ""
"新しい考えを理解するのに時間がかかり、他人よりも物事の習得が遅い。この効果は実践経験によるスキル習得にのみ適用され、本などからの学習には影響しない。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Insomniac"
msgstr "不眠症"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Insomniac'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have a hard time falling asleep, even under the best circumstances!"
msgstr "最高の環境でも、なかなか眠りにつくことができない！"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Meat Intolerance"
msgstr "肉食不耐性"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Meat Intolerance'}
#. ~ Description for Herbivorous Ancestry
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/obsolete.json
msgid ""
"You have problems with eating meat.  It's possible for you to eat it, but "
"you will suffer morale penalties and obtain less nutrition from it."
msgstr "お前は肉を食べることに問題を抱えている。肉を食べることは可能だが、意欲が低下し、得られる栄養が減少する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Thin-Skinned"
msgstr "薄い皮膚"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Thin-Skinned'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your skin is fragile.  Physical armor is reduced by 2 across your whole "
"body."
msgstr "お前の皮膚はもろい。全身の物理的アーマーが2減少する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Hates Vegetables"
msgstr "野菜嫌い"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Hates Vegetables'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have problems with eating vegetables.  It's possible for you to eat "
"them, but you will suffer morale penalties and obtain less nutrition from "
"them."
msgstr "お前は野菜を食べることをひどく嫌っている。野菜を食べることは可能だが、意欲が低下し、得られる栄養が減少する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Hates Fruit"
msgstr "果物嫌い"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Hates Fruit'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You despise eating fruits.  It's possible for you to eat them, but you will "
"suffer morale penalties and obtain less nutrition from them."
msgstr "お前は果物を食べることをひどく嫌っている。果物を食べることは可能だが、意欲が低下し、得られる栄養が減少する。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Lactose Intolerance'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You, like 75 percent of the world, cannot tolerate milk or milk based "
"products.  It's possible for you to eat them, but you will suffer morale "
"penalties and obtain less nutrition from them."
msgstr "世界の75%がそうであるように、お前は牛乳や乳製品を消化できない。それらを食べることは可能だが、意欲が低下し、得られる栄養が減少する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Junkfood Intolerance"
msgstr "ジャンクフード不耐性"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Junkfood Intolerance'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Something in those heavily processed foods doesn't agree with you.  It's "
"possible for you to eat them, but you will suffer morale penalties and "
"obtain less nutrition from them."
msgstr "過度に加工された食品には、お前の体に合わない何かがある。ジャンクフードを食べることは可能だが、意欲が低下し、得られる栄養が減少する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Grain Intolerance"
msgstr "穀物不耐性"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Grain Intolerance'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have a rare allergy that prevents you from eating most types of grains "
"such as wheat or oats.  It's possible for you to eat them, but you will "
"suffer morale penalties and obtain less nutrition from them."
msgstr ""
"小麦や燕麦など、ほとんどの種類の穀物を食べられない珍しいアレルギーを持つ。穀物を食べることは可能だが、意欲が低下し、得られる栄養が減少する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Sweet Tooth"
msgstr "ジャンクフード好き"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Sweet Tooth'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have a soft spot for processed foods, and gain a morale bonus from "
"eating them."
msgstr "加工食品が好物で、食べると意欲が上がる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Sugar-Loving"
msgstr "ジャンクフード狂"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Sugar-Loving'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You *adore* the taste of junk food, and find it preferable to everything "
"else!"
msgstr "ジャンクフードの味を崇拝しており、他のあらゆる食べ物より優れていると感じる！"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Glass Jaw"
msgstr "グラスジョー"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Glass Jaw'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your head can't take much abuse.  Its maximum HP is 20% lower than usual."
msgstr "頭部が打撃に弱い。最大HPが通常より20%減少する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Lightweight"
msgstr "下戸"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Lightweight'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Alcohol and drugs go straight to your head.  You suffer (and enjoy) the "
"effects of these for longer."
msgstr "アルコールや薬物がすぐに効く体質。効果が長続きし、苦痛（そして快楽）をより長く味わう。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Addictive Personality"
msgstr "依存症"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Addictive Personality'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"It's easier for you to become addicted to substances, and harder to rid "
"yourself of these addictions."
msgstr "依存性物質への耐性が低く、一度陥ると克服が困難になる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/obsolete.json
msgid "Strong Scent"
msgstr "体臭が強い"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Strong Scent'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your scent is particularly strong.  It's not offensive to humans, but "
"animals that track your scent will do so more easily."
msgstr "体臭が特に強い。人間には不快ではないが、臭いを追跡する動物に発見されやすくなる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Chemical Imbalance"
msgstr "化学的不均衡"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Chemical Imbalance'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You suffer from a minor chemical imbalance, whether mental or physical.  "
"Minor changes to your internal chemistry will manifest themselves on "
"occasion, such as hunger, sleepiness, narcotic effects, etc."
msgstr ""
"軽度の化学的不均衡に悩まされている。体内の化学組成がわずかに変化するだけで、空腹や眠気、麻薬効果といった軽微な症状が突発的に現れることがある。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Animal Discord"
msgstr "動物敵対"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Animal Discord'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Most animals don't like you, and aggressive animals are more likely to "
"attack you.  This only applies to natural animals such as woodland "
"creatures."
msgstr "ほとんどの動物に嫌われており、攻撃的な動物に襲われる可能性が高くなる。これは森の生き物などの自然動物のみに適用される。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Prey Animal"
msgstr "被食者"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Prey Animal'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Natural animals like dogs and wolves see you as prey, and are liable to "
"attack you on sight."
msgstr "イヌやオオカミなどの自然動物から獲物と認識され、発見され次第襲われる可能性が高い。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Slow Reader"
msgstr "遅読"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Slow Reader'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You're a slow reader, and it takes you longer to get through books than "
"most."
msgstr "読書が遅い。他のほとんどの人間よりも、本を読み終えるのに時間がかかる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Psychosis"
msgstr "妄想体質"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Psychosis'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You will periodically suffer from delusions, ranging from minor effects to "
"full visual hallucinations.  Some of these effects may be controlled through"
" the use of Thorazine."
msgstr "定期的に妄想に苦しみ、軽度の影響から完全な幻覚症状まで現れることがある。ソラジンを使用することで一部の症状を抑えることができる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Nyctophobia"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Nyctophobia'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You are terribly afraid of the dark.  You refuse to enter very dark areas.  "
"If you somehow still happen to stay in dark areas, you suffer from various "
"detrimental mental and physical effects."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Narcoleptic"
msgstr "睡眠発作"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Narcoleptic'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You randomly fall asleep without any reason."
msgstr "理由もなく突然眠ってしまうことがある。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Clumsy"
msgstr "不器用"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Clumsy'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You make more noise while walking."
msgstr "歩行時により大きな音を立てる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Jittery"
msgstr "神経過敏"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Jittery'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"When very hungry or under the effects of stimulants, you may find your hands"
" shaking uncontrollably, severely reducing your Dexterity."
msgstr "空腹時や興奮剤の効果がある間、手が制御不能に震えることがあり、器用さが著しく低下する。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Hoarder'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You don't feel right unless you're carrying as much as you can.  You suffer "
"morale penalties for carrying less than maximum volume (weight is ignored)."
"  Xanax can help control this anxiety."
msgstr "持ち物をできる限り持たないと落ち着かない。最大所持量以下だと意欲にペナルティーを受ける。ザナックスでこの不安を抑えることができる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Savant"
msgstr "専門学者"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Savant'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You tend to specialize in one skill and be poor at all others.  You advance "
"at half speed in all skills except your best one.  Note that combining this "
"with Fast Learner will come out to a slower rate of learning for all skills."
msgstr ""
"特定のスキルに特化し、他を犠牲にする傾向がある。最も高いスキル以外の全てのスキル成長速度が半減する。この特性を「呑み込みが早い」と組み合わせると、全てのスキル成長速度が低下する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Pacifist"
msgstr "平和主義"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Pacifist'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You don't like thinking about violence.  Your combat skills advance much "
"slower than usual, and you feel more guilt about killing."
msgstr "暴力的な思考を嫌う。戦闘スキルの成長が通常より大幅に遅くなり、殺害に対する罪悪感が強くなる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Mood Swings"
msgstr "気まぐれ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Mood Swings'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your morale will shift up and down at random, often dramatically."
msgstr "意欲がランダムに、しばしば劇的に上下する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Slow Footed"
msgstr "鈍足"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Slow Footed'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You can't move as fast as most, resulting in a 15% speed penalty on flat "
"ground."
msgstr "移動速度が人より遅い。平地での移動コストが15%増加する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Weak Stomach"
msgstr "胃弱"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Weak Stomach'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You are more likely to throw up from food poisoning, alcohol, etc."
msgstr "食中毒や飲酒などで吐きやすくなる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Wool Allergy"
msgstr "羊毛アレルギー"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Wool Allergy'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You are badly allergic to wool, and cannot wear any clothing made of the "
"substance."
msgstr "羊毛に重度のアレルギーがあり、羊毛製の衣類を着用できない。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Ugly"
msgstr "醜悪"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Ugly'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You're not much to look at.  People who care about such things will react "
"poorly to you."
msgstr "見た目が良くない。外見を気にする人々からの反応が悪化する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Albino"
msgstr "アルビノ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Albino'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You lack skin pigmentation due to a genetic problem.  You sunburn extremely "
"easily, and typically use an umbrella and sunglasses when going out in the "
"sun."
msgstr "遺伝的な問題で皮膚の色素が欠乏している。非常に日焼けしやすく、日中外出する際は通常、傘とサングラスを着用する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Flimsy"
msgstr "か弱い"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Flimsy'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your body can't take much abuse.  Its maximum HP is 25% lower than usual, "
"and you heal slightly slower.  Stacks with Glass Jaw."
msgstr "身体が打撃に弱い。最大HPが通常より25%低下し、治癒速度がわずかに遅くなる。「グラスジョー」と効果は重複する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Frail"
msgstr "虚弱"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Frail'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your body breaks very easily.  Its maximum HP is 50% lower than usual, and "
"you heal slower.  Stacks with Glass Jaw."
msgstr "身体が非常に脆い。最大HPが通常より50%低下し、治癒速度が遅くなる。「グラスジョー」と効果は重複する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Fragile"
msgstr "超虚弱"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Fragile'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your body is extremely fragile.  Its maximum HP is 75% lower than usual, and"
" you heal much slower.  Stacks with Glass Jaw."
msgstr "身体が極めて脆い。最大HPが通常より75%低下し、治癒速度が大幅に遅くなる。「グラスジョー」と効果は重複する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json data/mods/Old_Mutations/modinfo.json
msgid "Robust Genetics"
msgstr "堅牢な遺伝子"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Robust Genetics'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have a very strong genetic base.  Mutations gained from eating mutant "
"flesh will balance out at a higher number of positive mutations."
msgstr "遺伝子基盤が非常に強い。変異体の肉を食べることで得られる変異が、より多くのプラス変異を引き起こす。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Genetic Downward Spiral"
msgstr "遺伝子劣化"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Genetic Downward Spiral'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"The events of the Cataclysm have damaged your DNA beyond repair.  You mutate"
" frequently, and all mutations you receive (from any source) are negative."
msgstr "大災厄によりDNAが修復不能なほど損傷している。頻繁に変異を起こし、あらゆる変異（あらゆる原因による）がマイナス変異となる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Rough Skin"
msgstr "荒れ肌"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Rough Skin'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your skin is slightly rough.  This has no gameplay effect."
msgstr "肌がわずかに荒れている。ゲームプレイに影響はない。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "High Night Vision"
msgstr "高い暗視能力"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'High Night Vision'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You can see incredibly well in the dark!"
msgstr "暗闇の中でも驚くほどよく見える！"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Full Night Vision"
msgstr "完全暗視能力"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Full Night Vision'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You can see in pitch blackness as if you were wearing night-vision goggles, "
"and read in darkness as one can in dim lighting."
msgstr "漆黒の闇でもナイトビジョンゴーグルを着用しているかのように見え、暗がりでも本が読める。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Cephalopod Eyes"
msgstr "頭足類の目"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Cephalopod Eyes'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your eyes still bulge, yet your pupils look different somehow.  Water "
"doesn't seem to cause any trouble at all, though."
msgstr "目は隆起したままだが、瞳孔の形状が変化した。水中でも問題なく機能する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Fey Eyes"
msgstr "妖精の目"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Fey Eyes'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your eyes have turned… green.  It's tough to tell the exact shade as it "
"seems to shift.  The effect is… pleasant."
msgstr "目が……緑色に変わった。色合いが絶えず変化するため、正確な色を判別するのは困難だ。その効果は……心地よいものかもしれない。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Feline Eyes"
msgstr "ネコの目"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Feline Eyes'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your eyes have mutated, now having a slitted pupil and glittering in light, "
"much like those of cats.  This is visually striking, but it isn't helping "
"you see at night."
msgstr "瞳孔が縦溝状に変異し、光を反射してネコのように輝く。見た目は奇妙だが、夜間の視界向上には役立たない。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Avian Eyes"
msgstr "鳥の目"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Avian Eyes'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your vision has become particularly acute: you suspect you could pick out "
"zombies much farther away.  Perception +4."
msgstr "視覚が極めて鋭敏になった。遠くのゾンビも識別できるだろう。感覚+4。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Infrared Vision'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your eyes have mutated to pick up radiation in the infrared spectrum."
msgstr "目が変異し、赤外線の波長を感知する能力を得た。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Reptilian Eyes"
msgstr "爬虫類の目"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Reptilian Eyes'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your eyes have mutated, with a brilliant iris and slitted pupil similar to "
"that of a lizard.  This is visually striking, but doesn't seem to affect "
"your vision."
msgstr "虹彩が鮮やかになり、瞳孔はトカゲのように縦溝状に変異した。見た目は奇妙だが、視覚に影響はない。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Reptilian IR"
msgstr "爬虫類の赤外線視"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Reptilian IR'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your optic nerves and brain have mutated to catch up with your eyes, "
"allowing you to see in the infrared spectrum."
msgstr "視神経と脳が目に追いつき、赤外線を感知できるようになった。暗闇でも生物の位置を特定できる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Very Fast Healer"
msgstr "超高速治癒"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Very Fast Healer'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your flesh regenerates slowly, and you will regain HP even when not "
"sleeping."
msgstr "身体が徐々に回復する。睡眠をとっていない間もHPが回復する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Regeneration"
msgstr "再生力"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Regeneration'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your flesh regenerates from wounds incredibly quickly.  You heal 150% faster"
" whilst asleep and 200% faster whilst awake.  You do not require splints to "
"heal broken limbs."
msgstr "傷からの回復が驚くほど速い。睡眠中の治癒速度が150%増加し、覚醒中は200%増加する。骨折の治療に副木は不要となる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Reptilian Healing"
msgstr "爬虫類の治癒力"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Reptilian Healing'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your broken limbs mend themselves without significant difficulty.  You do "
"not require splints."
msgstr "骨折した手足が大きな苦もなく自然に治る。副木は不要だ。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Very Little Sleep"
msgstr "超短眠"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Very Little Sleep'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You don't sleep often.  But when you do, you need very little of it."
msgstr "睡眠時間はごくわずかで済む。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Tireless"
msgstr "疲れ知らず"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Tireless'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You defend the realm all night and all day."
msgstr "疲労を知らない。昼夜を問わず行動できる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Fangs"
msgstr "牙"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Fangs'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your teeth have grown into two-inch-long fangs, allowing you to make an "
"extra attack when conditions favor it."
msgstr "歯が5cmほどの牙に変化した。条件を満たせば、追加で攻撃できる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You sink your fangs into %s"
msgstr "牙を%sに突き立てる"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "%1$s sinks their fangs into %2$s"
msgstr "%1sは牙を%2$sに突き立てた"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Incisors"
msgstr "切歯"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Incisors'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your big teeth have grown in.  Folks had best show some more respect."
msgstr "大きな前歯が生えた。これを見た人々は、敬意を払うべきだろう。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You bite into %s with your large incisors"
msgstr "大きな切歯で%sに噛みつく"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "%1$s bites %2$s with their large incisors"
msgstr "%1sは大きな切歯で%2$s に噛みついた"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Nictitating Membrane"
msgstr "瞬膜"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Nictitating Membrane'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have a set of clear lenses which lower over your eyes while underwater, "
"allowing you to see as though you were wearing goggles.  Slightly decreases "
"wet penalties."
msgstr "目の下に透明な膜ができた。水中でゴーグルを着用したかのような視界が得られる。濡れ状態によるペナルティーがわずかに減少する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Gills"
msgstr "えら"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Gills'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You've grown a set of gills in your neck, allowing you to breathe "
"underwater.  Slightly increases wet benefits."
msgstr "首に一対のえらが生えた。水中で呼吸ができる。濡れ状態によるメリットがわずかに増加する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Cephalopod Gills"
msgstr "頭足類のえら"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Cephalopod Gills'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You've grown a set of gills, running from your neck up behind your ears.  "
"They allow you to breathe underwater and slightly increase wet benefits."
msgstr "首から耳の後ろにかけて一対のえらができた。水中で呼吸ができ、濡れ状態によるメリットがわずかに増加する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Mycus Flesh"
msgstr "マイカスの肉体"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Mycus Flesh'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"We have begun adapting local physiology to Mycus physical structure, greatly"
" reducing wet effects and granting this vessel 1 cut and 2 bash armor."
msgstr "我々は現地の生理機能をマイカスの身体構造に適応させた。濡れ状態による影響を大幅に軽減し、この肉体は斬撃耐性1、打撃耐性2の装甲を得る。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Mycus Fireproofing"
msgstr "マイカス不燃性"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Mycus Fireproofing'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"We have spliced the dense, amphibole fibers from Mycus core towers with the "
"resilient, adaptive flesh of local physiology.  This reduces our speed by a "
"moderate amount, but provides 2 cut 3 bash 1 bullet armor across our body, "
"nullifies wet effects, and provides complete protection from fire."
msgstr ""
"マイカスの核塔から採取した密度の高い角閃石繊維と、現地の弾力ある適応肉体とを結合させた。これにより移動速度は適度に低下するが、全身に斬撃耐性2、打撃耐性3、射撃耐性1の装甲を得て、濡れ状態の影響が無効化され、火炎に対して完全な防御力を得る。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Mycogenesis"
msgstr "マイカス身体回復"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Mycogenesis'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Local physiology has been fully incorporated with that of Mycus silicate "
"fibers.  In addition to benefits conferred by previous developments, as well"
" as 3 cut 5 bash and 2 bullet armor, we may join with Mycus fibers beneath "
"us - sleeping on top of fungal areas places us into a dormant state, which "
"spreads spores around us as we sleep and revitalizes our body much more "
"quickly than regular sleep."
msgstr ""
"現地の生理機能は、マイカスの珪酸塩繊維と完全に統合された。これまでの能力に加え、斬撃耐性3、打撃耐性5、射撃耐性2の装甲を得た。我々は我々より下にあるマイカス繊維と一体化できる。菌類の生えた場所で眠ると休眠状態に入り、胞子を周囲に拡散させるとともに、通常の睡眠よりもはるかに早く肉体を再生する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Scales"
msgstr "鱗"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Scales'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"A set of flexible green scales has grown to cover your body, acting as 3 "
"points of natural armor across your body.  Somewhat reduces wet effects."
msgstr "柔軟な緑色の鱗が全身を覆い、天然の装甲として全身の耐性を3ポイント向上させる。濡れ状態による影響をやや軽減する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Thick Scales"
msgstr "厚い鱗"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Thick Scales'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"A set of heavy green scales has grown to cover your body, acting as 10 "
"points of natural armor.  While difficult to penetrate, it also limits your "
"flexibility, resulting in a -2 penalty to Dexterity.  Greatly reduces wet "
"effects."
msgstr ""
"重厚な緑色の鱗が全身を覆い、天然の装甲として耐性を10ポイント向上させる。防御力は高いが、柔軟性が失われ器用さが-2低下する。濡れ状態による影響を大幅に軽減する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Sleek Scales"
msgstr "滑らかな鱗"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Sleek Scales'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"A set of very flexible and slick scales has grown to cover your body.  These"
" act as 2 points of weak natural armor, improve your ability to swim, and "
"make you difficult to grab.  Mostly reduces wet effects."
msgstr ""
"非常に柔軟で滑らかな鱗が全身を覆った。天然の装甲として耐性を2ポイント向上させ、泳ぎを向上させ、掴まれにくくする。濡れ状態による影響をほぼ軽減する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Light Bones"
msgstr "軽骨"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Light Bones'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your bones are very light.  This enables you to move and attack 10% faster, "
"but also reduces your carrying weight by 20% and makes bashing attacks hurt "
"a little more."
msgstr "骨が非常に軽い。攻撃と移動速度が10%向上するが、所持重量が20%低下し、打撃ダメージがわずかに増加する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Feathers"
msgstr "羽毛"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Feathers'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Iridescent feathers have grown to cover your entire body, providing 3 points"
" of armor against bash attacks and minor protection from cold.  They also "
"provide a natural waterproofing."
msgstr "光沢のある羽毛が全身を覆い、打撃耐性を3ポイント、寒さに対する耐性をわずかに提供する。また、自然な撥水性も備える。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Down"
msgstr "綿毛"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Down'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You shan't need to migrate south with your layer of down.  It's even better "
"with no apes around to kill you for it!"
msgstr "この綿毛があれば南へ渡る必要もないだろう。これを求めて殺しに来る猿のような存在がいないなら、なお良い！"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Lightly Furred"
msgstr "薄い毛皮"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Lightly Furred'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Light fur has grown to cover your entire body, providing slight protection "
"from cold."
msgstr "全身が薄い短毛の毛皮に覆われた。寒さに対する耐性をわずかに提供する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/obsolete.json
msgid "Furry"
msgstr "毛皮"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Furry'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Thick black fur has grown to cover your entire body, providing 3 points of "
"armor against bashing attacks, and considerable protection from cold."
msgstr "全身が厚い黒い毛皮に覆われた。打撃耐性を3ポイント、寒さに対する耐性をかなり提供する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/obsolete.json
msgid "Shaggy Fur"
msgstr "厚い毛皮"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Shaggy Fur'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your fur has grown out and thickened, providing 5 points of armor against "
"bashing attacks as well as considerable insulation."
msgstr "毛皮が伸びて厚くなった。打撃耐性を5ポイント、かなりの保温性を得る。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Gray Fur"
msgstr "灰色の毛皮"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Gray Fur'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Dense gray fur has grown to cover your entire body, providing a 3 points of "
"armor against bashing attacks, and considerable protection from cold."
msgstr "全身が密な灰色の毛皮に覆われた。打撃耐性を3ポイント、寒さに対する耐性をかなり提供する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Sleek Fur"
msgstr "滑らかな毛皮"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Sleek Fur'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You've grown sleek brown fur, providing some protection from cold."
msgstr "滑らかな茶色の毛皮が生えた。寒さに対する耐性を多少提供する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Lynx Fur"
msgstr "ヤマネコの毛皮"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Lynx Fur'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your fur has grown out significantly around your cheeks and neck."
msgstr "頬と首の周りの毛皮が著しく発達した。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Patchwork Skin"
msgstr "まだら皮膚"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Patchwork Skin'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your skin has mutated into an amalgamation of fur and scales, providing 2 "
"points of armor across your entire body."
msgstr "皮膚が毛皮と鱗の寄せ集めに変異した。全身の耐性を2ポイント向上させる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Thickened Patchwork Skin"
msgstr "厚いまだら皮膚"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Thickened Patchwork Skin'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your skin has mutated into an amalgamation of thickened fur and scales, "
"providing 5 points of armor across your entire body."
msgstr "皮膚が厚い毛皮と鱗の寄せ集めに変異した。全身の耐性を5ポイント向上させる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Chitinous Skin"
msgstr "キチン質の肌"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Chitinous Skin'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your epidermis has turned into a thin, flexible layer of chitin.  It "
"provides 5 points of protection from physical attacks.  Slightly reduces wet"
" effects."
msgstr "表皮が薄く柔軟なキチン質の層に変化した。物理攻撃に対する防御を5ポイント提供する。濡れ状態による影響をわずかに軽減する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Chitinous Armor"
msgstr "キチン質の装甲"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Chitinous Armor'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You've grown a chitin exoskeleton, much like that of an insect.  It provides"
" 8 points of armor across your entire body, but reduces your Dexterity by 1."
"  Somewhat reduces wet effects."
msgstr "昆虫の外骨格のようなキチン質の外骨格が生えた。全身の耐性を8ポイント向上させるが、器用さが-1低下する。濡れ状態による影響をやや軽減する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Chitinous Plate"
msgstr "キチン質の甲羅"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Chitinous Plate'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You've grown a chitin exoskeleton made of thick, stiff plates.  It provides "
"12 points of armor across your entire body, but reduces your Dexterity by 1 "
"and encumbers all body parts but your eyes and mouth.  Greatly reduces wet "
"effects."
msgstr ""
"厚く硬い板状のキチン質外骨格が生えた。全身の耐性を12ポイント向上させるが、器用さが-1低下し、目と口以外の全身の動作制限が増加する。濡れ状態による影響を大幅に軽減する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Hairy Chitin"
msgstr "産毛が生えたキチン"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Hairy Chitin'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You've developed some sort of hair growing out of your chitin.  It's a bit "
"warmer than not having hair, and provides 5 points of armor across your "
"body."
msgstr "キチン質から何らかの毛が生えた。毛がないより暖かく、全身の耐性を5ポイント向上させる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Furred Chitin"
msgstr "毛が生えたキチン"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Furred Chitin'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your chitin hair has thickened and spread across your body.  It provides 7 "
"physical armor across your body, plus another 10 bash armor."
msgstr "キチン質の毛が厚くなり、全身に広がった。全身の物理耐性を7ポイント、打撃耐性をさらに10ポイント向上させる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Furred Plate"
msgstr "毛に覆われた外殻"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Furred Plate'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your exoskeleton has hardened considerably, providing 10 physical armor and "
"15 bash armor, imposing a further -1 to Dexterity, and boasts a fine coat of"
" hairs that put feline whiskers to shame."
msgstr ""
"外骨格が大幅に硬化し、物理耐性を10ポイント、打撃耐性を15ポイント向上させた。さらに器用さが-1低下する。ネコ科のヒゲも恥じ入るほどの立派な毛並みを誇る。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Urticating Hairs"
msgstr "刺毛"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Urticating Hairs'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Significant amounts of your hairs have loosened.  If some creature tries to "
"attack you, your assailant is quite likely to get fine, bristly chitin in an"
" irritating spot; it doesn't carry your venom but it will be distracting."
msgstr "髪の毛の大部分が、針のような刺毛に変わった。攻撃してきた相手に細かいキチン質の刺毛が刺さり、気が散る原因となる。刺毛に毒はない。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Spines"
msgstr "棘"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Spines'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your skin is covered with fine spines.  Whenever an unarmed opponent strikes"
" a part of your body that is not covered by clothing, they will receive "
"moderate damage."
msgstr "皮膚が細かい棘で覆われた。服で覆われていない部分を素手で攻撃した敵に、軽度のダメージを与える。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Quills"
msgstr "針毛"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Quills'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your body is covered with large quills.  Whenever an unarmed opponent "
"strikes a part of your body that is not covered by clothing, they will "
"receive significant damage."
msgstr "全身がヤマアラシのような巨大な針毛で覆われた。服で覆われていない部分を素手で攻撃した敵に、かなりのダメージを与える。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Assault barbs'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Some of the quills on your arms have become quite loose.  By flinging your "
"arms, you can fire off these quills as projectiles."
msgstr "腕の針毛が抜けやすくなった。腕を振ることで、針毛を飛ばして攻撃できる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Phelloderm"
msgstr "コルク皮膚"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Phelloderm'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your skin is light green and has a slightly woody quality to it.  This "
"provides 2 points of cut and stab armor and 1 point of ballistic armor, and "
"helps you retain moisture, resulting in less thirst.  Greatly decreases wet "
"penalties."
msgstr ""
"皮膚が薄い緑色で、わずかに木のような質感がある。斬撃・刺突耐性を2、銃弾耐性を1向上させ、水分を保持するため喉の渇きを軽減する。濡れ状態によるペナルティーを大幅に軽減する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Bark"
msgstr "樹皮"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Bark'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your skin is coated in a light bark, like that of a tree.  This provides 5 "
"points of cutting and piercing damage, 4 points of ballistic armor, and one "
"point of protection from fire.  Greatly reduces wet effects."
msgstr "皮膚が樹木のような薄い樹皮に覆われた。斬撃・刺突耐性を5、銃弾耐性を4、火炎耐性を1向上させる。濡れ状態による影響を大幅に軽減する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Thorns"
msgstr "棘皮"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Thorns'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your skin is covered in small, woody thorns.  Whenever an unarmed opponent "
"strikes a part of your body that is not covered by clothing, they will "
"receive minor damage.  Your punches may also deal extra damage."
msgstr ""
"皮膚が小さな木質の棘で覆われた。服で覆われていない部分を素手で攻撃した敵に、わずかなダメージを与える。また、パンチで与えるダメージがわずかに増加する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Leaves"
msgstr "葉"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Leaves'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"All the hair on your body has turned to long, grass-like leaves.  Apart from"
" being physically striking, these provide you with a minor amount of "
"nutrients while in sunlight when your head is uncovered.  Slightly reduces "
"wet effects."
msgstr ""
"全身の毛が細長い草のような葉に変わった。外見は目立つが、頭部を覆っていない状態で日光を浴びると、わずかな養分を吸収する。濡れ状態による影響をわずかに軽減する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Lush Leaves"
msgstr "葉が茂った皮膚"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Lush Leaves'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your leaves have grown in size and prominence, with additional leaves "
"sprouting along your arms.  While your arms and head are uncovered, you will"
" photosynthesize nutrients while in sunlight.  Reduces wet effects."
msgstr ""
"腕からも葉が芽吹き、さらに大きく目立つようになった。頭と腕を覆っていない状態で日光を浴びると、養分を光合成する。濡れ状態による影響を軽減する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Verdant Leaves"
msgstr "葉が密生した皮膚"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Verdant Leaves'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your leaves are vibrant, large, and green, and have become a major source of"
" nutrients for your body.  Whenever your arms and head are uncovered you "
"will gain a large amount of nutrients by standing in the sunlight.  Reduces "
"wet effects."
msgstr ""
"鮮やかで大きな緑の葉が全身に生い茂り、主要な養分源となった。頭と腕を覆っていない状態で日光を浴びると、大量の養分を得る。濡れ状態による影響を軽減する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Transpiration"
msgstr "蒸散"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Transpiration'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You body has begun moving nutrients via the evaporation of water.  This "
"increases your thirst when it's hot, but reduces it when it's cold."
msgstr "水分の蒸発を通じて養分を体内に取り込むようになった。暑い時は喉が渇きやすくなるが、寒い時は喉の渇きが軽減される。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Flowering"
msgstr "開花"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Flowering'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You've started blooming where your scalp used to be.  Your blossoms have a "
"pleasant aroma, are visually striking, and are quite sensitive."
msgstr "頭皮があった場所から花が咲き始めた。花は心地よい香りを放ち、見た目は印象的で、非常に繊細で敏感だ。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Rosebuds"
msgstr "バラの蕾"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Rosebuds'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"The top of your head is blooming with rosebuds.  They're eye catching, and "
"have a strong fragrance that makes you pleasant to be around."
msgstr "頭頂部がバラの蕾で満開となった。人目を惹く強い香りを放ち、周囲の気分を楽しくさせる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Mycus Spores"
msgstr "マイカス胞子"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Mycus Spores'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "We have developed local spore sacs.  The Mycus must grow."
msgstr "我々は胞子嚢を発達させた。マイカスは増殖する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Mycus Sporogenesis"
msgstr "マイカス胞子形成"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Mycus Sporogenesis'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Local organisms seem to regard overt spore dispersal as a danger, and attack"
" the Mycus.  Accordingly, our local spore sacs remain quiescent, until local"
" guidance determines that it is safe to germinate.  Rapid development taxes "
"local nutrient reserves but ensures swift and effective growth."
msgstr ""
"現地の生物は、公然とした胞子の散布を危険と見なし、マイカスを攻撃する。したがって、この胞子嚢は休眠状態を維持する。現地の統括意識が発芽しても安全だと判断するまで。急速な発達は現地の栄養源を消耗させるが、迅速かつ効果的な成長を保証する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Mycus Blossoms"
msgstr "マイカス開花"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Mycus Blossoms'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "We have developed local blossoms.  The Mycus must grow."
msgstr "我々は花を発達させた。マイカスは増殖する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Mycus Bloom"
msgstr "マイカス満開"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Mycus Bloom'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Local organisms seem to regard overt spore dispersal as a danger, and attack"
" the Mycus.  Accordingly, our local blossoms remain quiescent, until local "
"guidance determines that it is safe to germinate.  Rapid development taxes "
"local nutrient reserves but ensures swift and effective growth."
msgstr ""
"現地の生物は、公然とした胞子の散布を危険と見なし、マイカスを攻撃する。したがって、この花は休眠状態を維持する。現地の統括意識が発芽しても安全だと判断するまで。急速な発達は現地の栄養源を消耗させるが、迅速かつ効果的な成長を保証する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Mycus Provenance"
msgstr "マイカス発生源"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Mycus Provenance'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Local spore sacs and blossoms have merged into a single, symbiotic form.  "
"Acting as one, they germinate together to cement rapid growth across a large"
" area according to local guidance.  The Mycus must grow."
msgstr "この個体の胞子嚢と花が単一の共生形態に統合された。一つとなって、統括意識に従い、広範囲で急速な成長を確実なものにする。マイカスは増殖する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Long Fingernails"
msgstr "長い指爪"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Long Fingernails'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your fingernails are long and sharp.  If you aren't wearing gloves, your "
"unarmed attacks deal a minor amount of cutting damage."
msgstr "指爪が長く鋭い。手袋を着用していなければ、素手攻撃にわずかな斬撃ダメージが加わる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Claws"
msgstr "鉤爪"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Claws'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have claws on the ends of your fingers.  Prevents wearing gloves, unless"
" they're fingerless."
msgstr "指先に鉤爪が生えた。指なし手袋以外の手袋は着用できない。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Rat Claws"
msgstr "ラットの爪"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Rat Claws'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your claws have grown tougher and slightly gnarled.  Prevents wearing gloves"
" that aren't fingerless."
msgstr "爪がより硬く、わずかに瘤状に発達した。指なし手袋以外の手袋は着用できない。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Stainless Claws"
msgstr "ステンレスの爪"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Stainless Claws'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your paws are bone, muscle, and claw with a thin layer of skin and fur.  "
"They might as well be made of stainless steel.  Prevents wearing gloves that"
" aren't fingerless."
msgstr ""
"骨、筋肉、そして爪で構成された手足は、薄い皮膚と毛皮で覆われている。まるでステンレス鋼でできているかのようだ。指なし手袋以外の手袋は着用できない。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Retractable Claws"
msgstr "伸縮自在の鉤爪"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Retractable Claws'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have claws on the ends of your fingers, and can extend or retract them "
"as desired.  Gloves will still get in the way, though."
msgstr "指先に鉤爪が生え、自由に伸ばしたり引っ込めたりできる。それでも手袋は邪魔になるだろう。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Tentacle Rakes"
msgstr "熊手の付いた触手"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Tentacle Rakes'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your upper tentacles have grown large, hook-barbed rakes on the ends.  "
"They're quite vicious, but really aren't suited for fine manipulation."
msgstr "上半身の触手が大きく成長し、先端に鋭い鈎針のついた熊手が生えた。見た目通り凶悪だが、細かい作業には全く向かない。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Ink glands"
msgstr "墨袋"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Ink glands'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Several ink glands have grown onto your torso.  They can be used to spray "
"defensive ink and blind an attacker in an emergency, as long as the torso "
"isn't covered."
msgstr "胴体に複数の墨袋が生えた。胴体に何も着用していなければ、緊急時に防御用の墨を噴射して攻撃者を盲目にできる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Bulging Reservoir"
msgstr "水分貯蔵"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Bulging Reservoir'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You develop a reservoir of fluids that bulges out of your abdomen.  Your "
"body has adapted to containing extra liquids in event of shortfalls."
msgstr "腹部から液体の貯蔵器官が膨らんでいる。体は水分不足に備え、余分な液体を溜め込むように適応した。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Large Talons"
msgstr "大きな鉤爪"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Large Talons'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your index fingers have grown into huge talons.  After a bit of practice, "
"you find that this does not affect your dexterity, but allows for a deadly "
"unarmed attack.  They also prevent wearing gloves, though fingerless gloves "
"are fair game."
msgstr ""
"人差し指が巨大な鉤爪に成長した。多少の練習で器用さには影響しないとわかったが、素手攻撃は致命的なものとなった。指なし手袋以外の手袋は着用できない。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Radiogenic"
msgstr "放射線適応"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Radiogenic'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your system has adapted to radiation.  While irradiated, you will actually "
"heal slowly, converting the radiation into hit points."
msgstr "身体が放射線に適応した。放射線を浴びている間、放射線をHPに変換することで徐々に傷が回復する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Marloss Carrier"
msgstr "マーロスの保有者"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Marloss Carrier'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Ever since you ate that Marloss berry, you can't get its scent out of your "
"nose, and you have a strong desire to try some seeds and… sap?"
msgstr "マーロスベリーを食べて以来、その香りが忘れられない。マｰロスの種や樹液が欲しいという強い欲求がある？"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Marloss Vessel"
msgstr "マーロスの適合者"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Marloss Vessel'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Ever since you ate that Marloss seed, you can't get its taste off of your "
"tongue, and you have a strong desire to try some berries and… sap?"
msgstr "マｰロスの種を食べて以来、その味が舌に残っている。マｰロスのベリーや樹液が欲しいという強い欲求がある？"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Marloss Vector"
msgstr "マーロスの媒介者"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Marloss Vector'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Ever since you ate that Marloss jelly, you can't stop thinking of it, and "
"you have a strong desire to eat some seeds and berries."
msgstr "マｰロスの樹液を食べて以来、そのことが頭から離れない。マｰロスの種やベリーが欲しいという強い欲求がある。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Marloss Rejection"
msgstr "マーロスの拒絶反応"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Marloss Rejection'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Ever since you had that life-threatening reaction to that Marloss junk, you "
"can't bear the thought of ever eating it again!"
msgstr "あのマーロスという代物で命の危険を感じて以来、二度と口にしたいとは思わない！"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Mutagenic Aversion"
msgstr "変異源拒否反応"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Mutagenic Aversion'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Ever since you had that life-threatening reaction to those mutagen and "
"purifier things, you can't bear the thought of ever using them again!"
msgstr "変異原と変異治療薬で命の危険を感じて以来、二度と使いたいとは思わない！"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Insect Pheromones"
msgstr "昆虫フェロモン"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Insect Pheromones'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your body produces low-level pheromones, identifying you as a friend to many"
" species of insects.  Insects will attack you much less."
msgstr "体から微量のフェロモンが分泌されている。多くの昆虫種がお前を仲間だと認識し、攻撃してくる可能性が大幅に低下する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Mammal Pheromones"
msgstr "哺乳類フェロモン"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Mammal Pheromones'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your body produces low-level pheromones which put mammals at ease.  They "
"will be less likely to attack or flee from you."
msgstr "体から哺乳類を安心させる微量のフェロモンが分泌されている。動物に攻撃されたり、逃げられたりする可能性が低下する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json data/json/obsoletion/mutations.json
msgid "Infection Immune"
msgstr "感染症免疫"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Infection Immune'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your immune system is particularly good at resisting infections.  Your "
"wounds will no longer become infected, altough existing infections are still"
" dangerous.  You will also be able to install non-sterile CBMs."
msgstr ""
"免疫システムが特に優れており、感染症に抵抗する。傷は感染しなくなるが、既存の感染症は依然として危険だ。また、非滅菌CBMの埋め込みが可能になる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Mycus Identity"
msgstr "マイカスの帰属意識"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Mycus Identity'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"We have synchronized our local physiology with that of the Mycus.  Any "
"spores we may encounter will not attempt to germinate inside the local "
"system, and we may traverse Mycus biospheres easily, as native bioforms "
"shift shape to accommodate us."
msgstr ""
"我々のこの個体の生理機能をマイカスと同期させた。これでもう他の胞子がこの個体内に発芽しようとすることはないだろう。現地の生物形態が我々に合わせて形を変えるため、マイカスの生物圏を容易に横断できる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Parasite Immune"
msgstr "寄生虫免疫"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Parasite Immune'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your body is unusually inhospitable to parasitic lifeforms.  You will never "
"become infested with internal parasites."
msgstr "寄生生物が非常に住み着きにくい体質になった。内臓に寄生虫が蔓延することはない。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Venomous"
msgstr "毒液分泌"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Venomous'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your body produces a potent venom.  Cutting or stabbing attacks from "
"mutations have a chance to poison your target."
msgstr "体から強力な毒液が分泌される。変異した部位による斬撃または刺突攻撃で、対象を毒状態にすることがある。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Strongly Venomous"
msgstr "猛毒分泌"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Strongly Venomous'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your venom has become particularly strong.  You're confident that your bites"
" or other cutting/stabbing natural attacks will take your target down "
"quickly."
msgstr "毒液が特に強力になった。咬み付き、斬撃、刺突といった変異した部位での攻撃は、標的の息の根を素早く止めるだろう。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Slime Hands"
msgstr "粘液まみれの手"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Slime Hands'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"The skin on your hands is a mucous membrane and produces a thick, acrid "
"slime.  Attacks using your hand will cause minor cutting damage.  Slightly "
"increases wet benefits."
msgstr ""
"手の皮膚が粘膜に変化し、分厚く刺激的な粘液を分泌する。手を使った攻撃はわずかな斬撃ダメージを与え、濡れていることによる効果をわずかに増加させる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Stretchy Limbs"
msgstr "伸縮性の手足"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Stretchy Limbs'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your limbs seem to have a little more 'give' to them.  +1 Dexterity."
msgstr "手足にわずかな『しなり』が加わったようだ。器用さが+1増加する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Rubbery Limbs"
msgstr "ゴム性の手足"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Rubbery Limbs'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your limbs are significantly more flexible than any pathetic human arm or "
"leg.  +3 Dexterity, -2 Strength."
msgstr "哀れな人間どもよりも、手足がはるかに柔軟だ。器用さが+3増加するが、筋力が-2減少する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Pseudolimbs"
msgstr "擬似手足"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Pseudolimbs'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your pseudopod-like limbs can fit into anything!  +4 Dexterity, -4 Strength."
msgstr "軟体動物の偽足のように、手足がどんな場所にもフィットする！器用さが+4増加するが、筋力が-4減少する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Compound Eyes"
msgstr "複眼"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Compound Eyes'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your eyes are compound, like those of an insect.  This increases your "
"Perception by 2 whenever you aren't wearing eyewear."
msgstr "目が昆虫のような複眼に変化した。眼鏡類を着用していない間、感覚が+2増加する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Padded Feet"
msgstr "肉球足"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Padded Feet'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"The bottoms of your feet are strongly padded.  If you're not wearing "
"footwear, you'll receive a 10% bonus to movement speed."
msgstr "足の裏に肉厚なパッドがついた。靴を履いていないとき、移動速度が10%増加する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Strong Legs"
msgstr "強靭な脚"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Strong Legs'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your legs have gained muscle mass to propel you across any terrain, and help"
" carry a bit more."
msgstr "あらゆる地形を進めるよう脚の筋肉量が増加し、少し多めに荷物を運ぶことができる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Toe Talons"
msgstr "鉤爪の生えた足"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Toe Talons'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have grown large, curved, and wickedly sharp talons in place of your big"
" toes.  Fortunately, they don't get in the way of your movement.  "
"Unfortunately, they do prevent wearing footgear."
msgstr "両足の親指に、大きく湾曲した鋭い鉤爪が生えた。幸いにも移動の邪魔にはならないが、残念ながら足に何も着用できなくなった。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You slash %s with a talon"
msgstr "鉤爪で%sを切り裂いた"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "%1$s slashes %2$s with a talon"
msgstr "%1sは鉤爪で%2$sを切り裂いた"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Hooves"
msgstr "蹄"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Hooves'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your feet have fused into hooves.  This allows kicking attacks to do much "
"more damage and provides 10 points of natural armor to your feet; however, "
"you cannot wear shoes of any kind.  Reduces wet effects."
msgstr ""
"足が融合して蹄になった。蹴り攻撃のダメージが大幅に増加し、足に10ポイントの自然装甲を得る。しかし、どんな靴も履けなくなる。濡れることによる悪影響を軽減する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You kick %s with your hooves"
msgstr "蹄で%sを蹴り飛ばした"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "%1$s kicks %2$s with their hooves"
msgstr "%1sは蹄で%2$sを蹴り飛ばした"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Alcohol Metabolism"
msgstr "アルコール代謝"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Alcohol Metabolism'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"So it's fermented?  Whatever, it's still good drinking.  You've developed "
"the ability to metabolize alcohol as a food source."
msgstr "発酵している？どうでもいい、まだ飲める。アルコールを食料源として代謝する能力を獲得した。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Subterranean Fortitude"
msgstr "地底人の忍耐力"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Subterranean Fortitude'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "The aches and pains of living underground don't bother you as much."
msgstr "地下での暮らしに伴う苦痛がほとんど気にならなくなった。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Subterranean Build"
msgstr "地底人の体格"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Subterranean Build'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your frame has adapted for life in confined spaces.  You seem a little "
"shorter and bulkier, trading mobility for muscle mass.  (+2 Strength, -2 "
"Dexterity)"
msgstr "体が狭い空間での生活に適応した。少し小柄でがっしりした体格になり、機動性を筋力と交換した。筋力が+2増加するが、器用さが-2減少する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Saprovore"
msgstr "腐食性"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Saprovore'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your digestive system is specialized to allow you to consume decaying "
"material.  You can eat rotten food, albeit for less nutrition than usual."
msgstr "腐敗したものを食べることに特化した消化器系だ。腐った食べ物を摂取できるが、通常の食べ物よりは栄養にならない。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Saprophage"
msgstr "腐食生物"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Saprophage'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You prefer to sustain your nutritional needs using your roots and direct "
"nutrient extraction/synthesis.  Your human parts still need the raw caloric "
"bulk of 'food' to keep them going, though, and you handle it a lot easier if"
" it's had time to… age a little."
msgstr ""
"根や直接的な栄養抽出・合成で養分を賄うことを好む。だが、人間の部分は「食べ物」のカロリーを必要とし、少し『熟成』させた方が処理しやすくなる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Gizzard"
msgstr "砂嚢"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Gizzard'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You seem to get full faster now, and food goes through you more rapidly as "
"well."
msgstr "すぐに満腹になり、食べ物がより早く消化される。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Mycus Feeder"
msgstr "マイカスの供給者"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Mycus Feeder'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"We have streamlined our nutritional requirements.  We rely on the Mycus for "
"sustenance, as it relies on us.  We may locate sources of sustenance in "
"close proximity to Mycus core towers, and in forested areas that the Mycus "
"has grown into."
msgstr ""
"我々の栄養摂取要件は合理化された。マイカスが我々に依存するように、我々もマイカスに依存する。マイカスのコアタワー付近や、マイカスが繁茂する森林地帯で食料を見つけられるだろう。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Ruminant"
msgstr "反芻動物"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Ruminant'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your digestive system is capable of digesting cellulose and other rough "
"plant material.  You can eat underbrush and shrubs by activating this, "
"standing over your target, and pressing E."
msgstr "セルロースやその他の粗い植物性素材を消化できる消化器系だ。この変異を有効化し、対象の場所でEキーを押すと藪や低木を食べられる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Grazer"
msgstr "草食動物"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Grazer'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You're accustomed to eating plants directly, and can get nutrition from "
"grass as well as underbrush and shrubs.  Eat either one by activating this, "
"standing over your target, and pressing E."
msgstr "植物を直接食べることに慣れ、藪や低木だけでなく草地からも栄養を得られる。この変異を有効化し、該当する場所でEキーを押すと食べられる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Eater Of The Dead"
msgstr "死肉喰らい"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Eater Of The Dead'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Eating rotting, long-dead flesh is good for the struggle, and safe--if still"
" completely unappealing--for you."
msgstr "腐りきった肉を食べることは生存にとって有益かつ安全だ──たとえ全く食欲をそそらなくても。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Burrowing"
msgstr "穴掘り"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Burrowing'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your claws and teeth allow you to dig through dirt and rubble with ease."
msgstr "爪と歯を使って土や瓦礫を簡単に掘り進むことができる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Saber Teeth"
msgstr "剣歯"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Saber Teeth'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your fangs have grown extremely large and incredibly sharp.  They make it "
"impossible to wear mouthgear and difficult to eat… but leave nasty wounds "
"when you bite."
msgstr "牙が信じられないほど大きく、鋭く成長した。口に何も着用できず、食べるのも困難になる……だが、噛みつき攻撃でひどい傷を負わせる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You tear into %s with your saber teeth"
msgstr "剣歯で%sを引き裂いた"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "%1$s tears into %2$s with their saber teeth"
msgstr "%1sは剣歯で%2$s を引き裂いた"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Hyper-Metabolism"
msgstr "超代謝"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Hyper-Metabolism'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You metabolize nutrients so rapidly that you can convert food directly into "
"useful tissue.  Excess nutrition will convert to HP, rather than being "
"wasted.  Activate to skip prompt for overeating."
msgstr ""
"栄養素を非常に速く代謝し、食べ物を有用な組織に直接変換できる。余分な栄養は無駄にならずHPに変換される。有効化すると食べ過ぎの確認をスキップする。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Horns"
msgstr "角"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Horns'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have a pair of small horns on your head.  They allow you to make a weak "
"piercing headbutt attack."
msgstr "頭に小さな角が一本生えた。弱い刺突属性の頭突き攻撃が可能になる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You headbutt %s with your horns"
msgstr "角で%sを突いた"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "%1$s headbutts %2$s with their horns"
msgstr "%1sは角で%2$sを突いた"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Curled Horns"
msgstr "渦巻いた角"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Curled Horns'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have a pair of large curled horns, like those of a ram.  They allow you "
"to make a powerful bashing headbutt attack, but prevent wearing any "
"headwear."
msgstr "雄羊のような、大きく渦巻いた角が一対生えた。強力な打撃属性の頭突き攻撃が可能になるが、頭に何も着用できなくなる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You headbutt %s with your curled horns"
msgstr "渦巻いた角で%sを突いた"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "%1$s headbutts %2$s with their curled horns"
msgstr "%1$sは渦巻いた角で%2$sを突いた"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Pointed Horns"
msgstr "鋭い角"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Pointed Horns'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have a pair of long, pointed horns, like those of an antelope.  They "
"allow you to make a strong piercing headbutt attack, but prevent wearing "
"headwear that is not made of fabric."
msgstr "アンテロープのような、長く鋭い角が一対生えた。強力な刺突属性の頭突き攻撃が可能になるが、頭に布製以外のアイテムを着用できなくなる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You stab %s with your pointed horns"
msgstr "鋭い角で%sを突き刺した"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "%1$s stabs %2$s with their pointed horns"
msgstr "%1$sは鋭い角で%2$sを突き刺した"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Antlers"
msgstr "枝角"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Antlers'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have a huge rack of antlers, like those of a moose.  They allow you to "
"make a weak headbutt attack, but prevent wearing headwear that is not made "
"of fabric."
msgstr "ヘラジカのような巨大な枝角が一対生えた。弱い頭突き攻撃が可能になるが、頭に布製以外のアイテムを着用できなくなる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You butt %s with your antlers"
msgstr "枝角で%sを突いた"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "%1$s butts %2$s with their antlers"
msgstr "%1$sは枝角で%2$sを突いた"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Antennae"
msgstr "触角"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Antennae'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have a pair of antennae.  They allow you to detect the presence of "
"monsters up to a few tiles away, even if you can't see or hear them, but "
"prevent wearing headwear that is not made of fabric."
msgstr "一対の触覚が生えた。視覚や聴覚が届かなくとも、数タイル以内にいるモンスターを感知できる。ただし、布製以外の頭部装備は着用できない。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Road-Runner"
msgstr "ロードランナー"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Road-Runner'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your legs are extremely limber and fast-moving.  You move 30% faster on flat"
" surfaces."
msgstr "脚が非常にしなやかで素早く動く。平坦な場所での移動速度が30%増加する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Stubby Tail"
msgstr "短い尻尾"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Stubby Tail'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You have a short, stubby tail, like a rabbit's.  It serves no purpose."
msgstr "兎のような短くずんぐりした尻尾が生えた。特に役には立たない。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Tail Fin"
msgstr "尾ひれ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Tail Fin'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have a fin-like tail.  It allows you to swim more quickly, but prevents "
"wearing non-fabric pants.  Slightly increases wet benefits."
msgstr "フィンのような尾ひれが生えた。より速く泳ぐことができるが、布製以外のズボンは着用できない。水濡れによる効果がわずかに増加する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Long Tail"
msgstr "長い尻尾"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Long Tail'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have a long, graceful tail, like that of a big cat.  It improves your "
"balance, making your ability to dodge higher, but prevents wearing non-"
"fabric pants."
msgstr "大型の猫科動物のような長くて優雅な尻尾が生えた。バランスが向上し、回避能力が高まる。ただし、布製以外のズボンは着用できない。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Cattle Tail"
msgstr "ウシの尻尾"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Cattle Tail'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have a long tail with a tuft on the end.  You find yourself "
"instinctively swatting away flies with it, though it's not as effective at "
"balancing you as you'd like.  Prevents wearing non-fabric pants."
msgstr "先端に房のついた長い尻尾が生えた。バランス補助としては期待できないが、反射的にハエを叩き落すことができる。布製以外のズボンは着用できない。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Rodent Tail"
msgstr "げっ歯類の尻尾"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Rodent Tail'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have a long but hairless tail.  It's a pretty effective balancing aid, "
"but does look, uh, ratty.  Prevents wearing non-fabric pants."
msgstr "毛のない長い尻尾が生えた。効果的なバランス補助になるが、見た目は、えーと、ネズミのようだ。布製以外のズボンは着用できない。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Thick Tail"
msgstr "太い尻尾"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Thick Tail'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have a long, thick, lizardlike tail.  It helps you balance a bit but "
"also makes a serviceable whip.  Prevents wearing non-fabric pants."
msgstr "トカゲのような長くて太い尻尾が生えた。多少のバランス補助になり、便利な鞭としても使える。布製以外のズボンは着用できない。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You whap %s with your tail"
msgstr "尾で%sを叩きつけた"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "%1$s whaps %2$s with their tail"
msgstr "%1sは尾で%2$sを叩きつけた"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Raptor Tail"
msgstr "ラプトルの尻尾"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Raptor Tail'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have a long and semi-stiff lizardlike tail.  You can't effectively lash "
"it in combat, but it significantly improves your balance.  Prevents wearing "
"non-fabric pants."
msgstr "トカゲのような硬質の長い尻尾が生えた。戦闘で鞭として使うことはできないが、バランスを大幅に向上させる。布製以外のズボンは着用できない。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Fluffy Tail"
msgstr "ふっわふっわの尻尾"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Fluffy Tail'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have a long, fluffy-furred tail.  It greatly improves your balance, "
"making your ability to dodge much higher.  Prevents wearing non-fabric "
"pants."
msgstr "ふっわふっわの毛に覆われた長い尻尾が生えた。バランスが大幅に向上し、回避能力がより高くなる。布製以外のズボンは着用できない。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Spiked Tail"
msgstr "針の付いた尻尾"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Spiked Tail'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have a long tail that ends in a vicious stinger.  It does not improve "
"your balance at all, but allows for a powerful piercing attack.  Prevents "
"wearing non-fabric pants."
msgstr "先端に禍々しい毒針が付いた長い尻尾が生えた。バランスを向上させる効果はないが、強力な刺突攻撃を可能にする。布製以外のズボンは着用できない。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You sting %s with your tail"
msgstr "尾の針で%sを刺した"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "%1$s stings %2$s with their tail"
msgstr "%1sは尾の針で%2$s を刺した"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Club Tail"
msgstr "棍棒状の尻尾"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Club Tail'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have a long tail that ends in a heavy, bony club.  It does not improve "
"your balance at all, but allows for a powerful bashing attack.  Prevents "
"wearing non-fabric pants."
msgstr "先端に重い骨の棍棒が付いた長い尻尾が生えた。バランスを向上させる効果はないが、強力な打撃攻撃を可能にする。布製以外のズボンは着用できない。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You club %s with your tail"
msgstr "尾の棍棒で%sを殴打した"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "%1$s clubs %2$s with their tail"
msgstr "%1sは尾の棍棒で%2$s を殴打した"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Hibernation"
msgstr "冬眠"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Hibernation'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You've developed the ability to stockpile calories and then sleep for "
"extended periods of time."
msgstr "カロリーを備蓄し、長時間眠る能力を得た。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Resilient"
msgstr "強靭な肉体"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Resilient'}
#. ~ Description for Immovable
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/obsolete.json
msgid ""
"You can survive injuries that would incapacitate humans: you get a 20% bonus"
" to all hit points.  Stacks with Tough, etc."
msgstr "並の人間が再起不能になるような負傷にも耐えられる。全ての部位のHPが20%増加する。頑丈などの特性/変異と重複する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Pain Recovery"
msgstr "鎮痛作用"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Pain Recovery'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You recover from pain slightly faster than normal."
msgstr "苦痛の回復が通常より若干早くなる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Solidly Built"
msgstr "堅牢な体躯"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Solidly Built'}
#. ~ Description for Unstoppable
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/obsolete.json
msgid ""
"Not much scares you.  You get a 30% bonus to all hit points.  Stacks with "
"Tough, etc."
msgstr "ほとんど怖いものがない。全ての部位のHPが30%増加する。頑丈などの特性/変異と重複する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "TAAANK"
msgstr "戦車"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'TAAANK'}
#. ~ Description for Meatshield
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/obsolete.json
msgid ""
"You can simply take the punishment from lesser beings and keep going.  You "
"get a 40% bonus to all hit points.  Stacks with Tough, etc."
msgstr "矮小な存在からの攻撃をただ受け流し、前進し続けられる。全ての部位のHPが40%増加する。頑丈などの特性/変異と重複する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Pain Junkie"
msgstr "痛覚中毒"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Pain Junkie'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You've developed a serious appetite for pain, and take pride in your scars."
msgstr "痛みを激しく求める性質を獲得し、傷跡を誇りに思う。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Cenobite"
msgstr "苦行者"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Cenobite'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You positively adore pain, in all its varied forms."
msgstr "あらゆる形の苦痛を心から愛する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Deadened"
msgstr "無痛"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Deadened'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Nothing hurts anymore.  Those bites tickle and the wounds itch a bit, but "
"that's it."
msgstr "もう痛みを感じない。噛まれた痕はくすぐったく、傷口は少し痒いだけだ。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Pain Sensitive"
msgstr "痛覚過敏"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Pain Sensitive'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"For some reason, things always seem to hurt you more.  Pain dealt to you is "
"increased by 25%."
msgstr "なぜか、他の人間よりも痛みを感じやすい。受ける苦痛が25%増加する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Hyperalgesia"
msgstr "過剰痛覚"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Hyperalgesia'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your body experiences pain out of proportion to the physical causes.  Pain "
"dealt to you is increased by 50%."
msgstr "身体に与えられた刺激以上の苦痛を感じる。受ける苦痛が50%増加する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Extreme Hyperalgesia"
msgstr "超過剰痛覚"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Extreme Hyperalgesia'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your body reacts cripplingly to any source of pain.  Pain dealt to you is "
"doubled."
msgstr "あらゆる痛みに対し、身体が著しく反応する。受ける苦痛が2倍になる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Culler"
msgstr "淘汰の実行者"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Culler'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You've had a revelation: by killing the weaker creatures, who would only die"
" anyway, you preserve resources for those better able to survive.  You are "
"less bothered by the deaths of others: their own weakness invited these "
"fates upon them."
msgstr ""
"啓示を得た。弱い生き物を殺すことで、どうせ死ぬ運命にあった彼らから、よりよく生き残る者に資源を温存するのだ。他者の死は気にならない。彼らの弱さがその運命を招いたのだ。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json data/json/npcs/classes.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_hunter.json
msgid "Hunter"
msgstr "ハンター"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Hunter'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your brain has a lot more in common with a predatory animal than a human, "
"making it easier to control misplaced reactions to the death of your prey.  "
"Additionally, combat skills, which you use to hunt, are easier to learn and "
"maintain."
msgstr "脳が人間よりも捕食動物に近くなり、獲物の死に対する不適切な反応を抑えやすくなった。また、狩りに使う戦闘スキルを習得・維持しやすくなる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Predator"
msgstr "捕食者"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Predator'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You consider yourself something other than human and no longer empathize "
"with them.  Combat skills are easy to learn and maintain, but your critical "
"thinking, so characteristic to these creatures, suffers."
msgstr ""
"少なくとも自己認識において、人間ではない何かになった。人間に対する共感が湧かない。戦闘スキルを習得・維持しやすくなる。しかし、人間特有の論理的思考力は損なわれる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Apex Predator"
msgstr "頂点捕食者"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Apex Predator'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your mind and brain have adapted to your new place in the world: as one on "
"top of the food chain.  You can effortlessly master and maintain combat "
"skills, but your critical thinking has atrophied further."
msgstr ""
"精神と脳が、世界の食物連鎖の頂点に立つ捕食者としての新しい地位に適応した。戦闘スキルを容易に習得・維持できるが、論理的思考力はさらに退化している。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Sapiovore"
msgstr "人喰"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Sapiovore'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "The hairless apes make as good eating as any other meat."
msgstr "毛のない猿も他の肉と同様に美味い。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Mycus Defender"
msgstr "マイカスの守護者"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Mycus Defender'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"From time to time the Mycus requires protection from non-Mycus that, for "
"whatever reason, wish it ill.  We have adapted to better carry out this task"
" - our fibers will grow strong and resilient when such threats present "
"themselves to us."
msgstr ""
"時としてマイカスは、いかなる理由であれ悪意を持つマイカス以外の者から保護される必要がある。我々はこの任務をより良く遂行するために適応した。そのような脅威が我々の前に現れると、我々の繊維は強く弾力のあるものへと成長する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Bird Wings"
msgstr "鳥翼"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Bird Wings'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have a pair of large, feathered wings.  Though your body is heavy and "
"not built for sustained flight, you can use your wings to fly for short "
"periods.  You can also glide to slow your descent and will never take "
"falling damage under any circumstances."
msgstr ""
"一対の大きな羽毛の翼が生えた。体が重く、長時間の飛行には向かないが、短時間の飛行が可能だ。滑空して落下速度を落とすこともでき、いかなる状況でも落下ダメージを受けない。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Insect Wings"
msgstr "虫の羽"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Insect Wings'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have a pair of large, translucent wings.  They are too small to provide "
"lift, but can reduce falling damage and if activated will greatly speed your"
" movement, with some effort and noise."
msgstr ""
"一対の大きな半透明の羽が生えた。揚力を生み出すには小さすぎるが、落下ダメージを軽減できる。活性化すると、多少の労力と音を伴うが、移動速度を大幅に向上させる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Mouth Tentacles"
msgstr "触手口"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Mouth Tentacles'}
#. ~ Description for Facial Tentacles
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"A set of tentacles surrounds your mouth.  They allow you to eat twice as "
"fast.  Slightly decreases wet penalties."
msgstr "口の周りに一組の触手が生えた。食べる速度が2倍になり、水濡れによる悪影響をわずかに軽減する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Mandibles"
msgstr "虫顎"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Mandibles'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"A set of insect-like mandibles have grown around your mouth.  They allow you"
" to eat faster and provide a slicing unarmed attack, but prevent wearing "
"mouthwear.  Slightly reduces wet effects."
msgstr ""
"口の周りに昆虫のような大顎が生えた。食べる速度が速くなり、斬撃属性の素手攻撃が可能になる。口に何も着用できない。水濡れによる悪影響をわずかに軽減する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You bite %s with your fangs"
msgstr "牙で%sを噛んだ"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "%1$s bites %2$s with their fangs"
msgstr "%1sは牙で%2$s を噛んだ"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Folding Fangs"
msgstr "伸縮自在の牙"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Folding Fangs'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your mandibles have developed extensible fangs, allowing you to bite quickly"
" or ensure your venom goes home, as desired."
msgstr "大顎から伸縮性の牙が生えた。素早い噛みつき攻撃や、確実に毒液を送り込むための攻撃を意のままに繰り出せる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Canine Ears"
msgstr "イヌの耳"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Canine Ears'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You've grown an extra pair of canine ears.  They enhance your hearing, "
"allowing you to hear at greater distances."
msgstr "イヌの耳がもう一対生えた。聴覚が強化され、より遠くの音を聞き取れる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Lupine Ears"
msgstr "オオカミの耳"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Lupine Ears'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your hearing has evolved further and is now on par with that of wolves.  You"
" can hear things significantly farther away."
msgstr "聴覚がさらに進化し、オオカミと同等になった。かなり遠くの物音を聞き取れる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Feline Ears"
msgstr "ネコの耳"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Feline Ears'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You've grown an extra pair of feline ears.  You find it easier to tune in on"
" sounds from afar.  They are also very fluffy!"
msgstr "ネコの耳がもう一対生えた。遠くの音を捉えやすくなる。とてもフワフワしている！"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Ursine Ears"
msgstr "クマの耳"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Ursine Ears'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You've grown an extra pair of ursine ears.  You can hear things a little "
"farther away."
msgstr "クマの耳がもう一対生えた。少し遠くの音を聞き取れる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Pointed Ears"
msgstr "尖った耳"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Pointed Ears'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your upper earlobes have grown noticeably higher.  Fortunately, they don't "
"get in the way of your headgear, much.  Unfortunately, they also don't seem "
"to help your hearing any."
msgstr "耳の上半分が目に見えて細長く伸びた。幸い、頭部装備の邪魔にはほとんどならない。残念ながら、聴覚の役にも立たないようだ。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Rodent Ears"
msgstr "げっ歯類の耳"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Rodent Ears'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your extra pair of ears are huge, round, and gray!  They're rather "
"fascinating, and help you hear from a much greater distance."
msgstr "もう一対の耳は、巨大で丸く、灰色だ！かなり面白く、より遠くの音を聞き取るのに役立つ。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Web Walker"
msgstr "クモの巣渡り"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Web Walker'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your body excretes very fine amounts of a chemical which prevents you from "
"sticking to webs.  Walking through webs does not affect you at all."
msgstr "身体からごく微量の化学物質が分泌され、クモの巣に付着しなくなる。クモの巣の上を歩いても何の影響も受けない。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Web Spinner"
msgstr "糸撒き"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Web Spinner'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your body produces and anchors webbing.  Too bad you can't seem to control "
"the process.  There is a chance that you will leave webs in your wake."
msgstr "身体がクモの糸を生成し、巣を張る。残念ながらそのプロセスを制御できないようだ。後を追うようにクモの巣を残すことがある。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Web Weaver"
msgstr "糸紡ぎ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Web Weaver'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You've developed the necessary anatomy and techniques to control your web-"
"generation.  Activate this to start or stop weaving webs."
msgstr "クモの糸生成を制御するために必要な肉体と技術を身につけた。有効化して糸紡ぎを開始/停止する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Web Diver"
msgstr "糸潜り"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Web Diver'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your webbing is easily strong enough to support your weight.  You'll use it "
"to descend down any sheer drops you may encounter, and to catch yourself "
"should you fall."
msgstr "生成されるクモの糸は、体重を支えるのに十分な強度を持つ。遭遇した急な崖を降下するのに使い、落下した際には自分自身を受け止める。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Rope Webs"
msgstr "ロープ糸"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Rope Webs'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"With spinnerets like THESE, who needs rope?!  Activate to sling a web rope "
"that you can climb, and can be disassembled into rope."
msgstr "この糸吐き器官があれば、ロープなど必要ない！有効化して、登ることができ、解体してロープにできるクモの糸のロープを投げる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You spin a rope from your silk."
msgstr "クモの糸からロープを紡いだ。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Arachnitect"
msgstr "クモの巣建築家"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Arachnitect'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"The pinnacle of silk spinning.  Spin suspended walkways between ledges to "
"span small gaps."
msgstr "糸紡ぎの究極系。足場と足場の間に吊り下げ式の通路を紡ぎ、小さな隙間を越えられる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Whiskers"
msgstr "ひげ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Whiskers'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have a handsome set of whiskers around your mouth.  These make you more "
"aware of vibrations in the air, and improve your ability to dodge very "
"slightly, but only when uncovered."
msgstr "口の周りに立派なひげが生えた。空気の振動をより敏感に察知し、身を隠していない場合に限り、回避能力がわずかに向上する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Wiry Whiskers"
msgstr "硬いひげ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Wiry Whiskers'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have a set of prominent rodent-like whiskers around your mouth.  These "
"make you more aware of vibrations in the air, and improve your ability to "
"dodge slightly, but only when uncovered."
msgstr "口の周りにげっ歯類のような目立つひげが生えた。空気の振動をより敏感に察知し、身を隠していない場合に限り、回避能力がわずかに向上する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Fat Deposits"
msgstr "脂肪の蓄え"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Fat Deposits'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You've put on some additional weight around your body.  It slows you down a "
"little, but helps your swimming and warmth and even provides 2 points of "
"physical armor across your body."
msgstr "身体に余分な脂肪がついた。少し移動が遅くなるが、水泳能力と保温性が向上し、全身に2ポイントの物理装甲を提供する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Inconveniently Large"
msgstr "不都合なほど大きい"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Inconveniently Large'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have grown noticeably taller and broader.  Much of it is useful muscle "
"mass (Strength +2), but you find it throws off your balance and you get in "
"your own way (+10 torso and arm encumbrance).  You can also fire heavy "
"weapons without the aid of terrain, at a penalty to accuracy."
msgstr ""
"目に見えて背が高く、幅広くなった。その多くは有用な筋肉量だが（筋力+2）、バランスを崩しやすくなり、動きが邪魔になる（胴体と腕の動作制限が+10増加）。また、地形の助けがなくても、精度にペナルティを受けるが、重火器を発射できる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/obsolete.json src/mtype.cpp
msgid "Large"
msgstr "巨大"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Large'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You carry your rugged body with the dignity you deserve.  Strength +2, and "
"you can fire heavy weapons without the aid of terrain at the cost of "
"accuracy."
msgstr "頑丈な体を堂々と運ぶ。筋力+2、精度を犠牲にするが、地形の助けなしに重火器を発射できる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Freakishly Huge"
msgstr "異常なほど巨大"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Freakishly Huge'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have grown even more massive, to the point where you cannot usefully fit"
" into human-sized clothing or vehicles.  Much of it is powerful muscle mass "
"(Strength +4), but it's a real pain to haul around.  On the plus side, "
"firing heavy weapons without mounting appropriate terrain is a bit easier."
msgstr ""
"さらに巨大になり、人間サイズの服や車両に実用的に収まらなくなった。その多くは強力な筋肉量だが（筋力+4）、持ち運びが非常に困難だ。良い面としては、適切な地形に設置しなくても重火器の発射が少し楽になる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json src/mtype.cpp
msgid "Huge"
msgstr "巨大化"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Huge'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your cardiovascular system has caught up with your muscular physique, so who"
" needs pathetic human cars?  Strength +4, and you can fire heavy weapons "
"unsupported more easily."
msgstr "心臓血管系が筋肉質な体格に追いついた。哀れな人間の車など必要ない。筋力+4、より容易に重火器を設置なしで発射できる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Strong"
msgstr "強靭"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Strong'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your muscles are a little stronger.  +1 Strength."
msgstr "筋肉が少し強くなった。筋力+1。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Very Strong"
msgstr "非常に強靭"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Very Strong'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your muscles are stronger.  +2 Strength."
msgstr "筋肉が強くなった。筋力+2。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Extremely Strong"
msgstr "極めて強靭"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Extremely Strong'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your muscles are much stronger.  +4 Strength."
msgstr "筋肉がはるかに強くなった。筋力+4。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Insanely Strong"
msgstr "驚異的な強靭さ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Insanely Strong'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your muscles are noticeably bulging.  +7 Strength."
msgstr "筋肉が目に見えて盛り上がっている。筋力+7。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Prime Strength"
msgstr "究極の強靭さ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Prime Strength'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your muscles are perfectly developed."
msgstr "筋肉が完璧に発達した。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Dextrous"
msgstr "器用"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Dextrous'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You are a little nimbler.  +1 Dexterity."
msgstr "少し身軽になった。器用さ+1。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Very Dextrous"
msgstr "非常に器用"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Very Dextrous'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You are nimbler.  +2 Dexterity."
msgstr "身軽になった。器用さ+2。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Extremely Dextrous"
msgstr "極めて器用"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Extremely Dextrous'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You are nimble and quick.  +4 Dexterity."
msgstr "俊敏で素早い動きだ。器用さ+4。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Insanely Dextrous"
msgstr "驚異的な器用さ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Insanely Dextrous'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You are much nimbler than before.  +7 Dexterity."
msgstr "以前よりもはるかに身軽になった。器用さ+7。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Prime Dexterity"
msgstr "究極の器用さ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Prime Dexterity'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You're perfectly coordinated."
msgstr "身体を完璧に協調させて動かせる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Smart"
msgstr "賢い"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Smart'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You are a little smarter.  +1 Intelligence."
msgstr "少し賢くなった。知力+1。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Very Smart"
msgstr "非常に賢い"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Very Smart'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You are smarter.  +2 Intelligence."
msgstr "賢くなった。知力+2。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Extremely Smart"
msgstr "極めて賢い"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Extremely Smart'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You are much smarter, and your skull bulges slightly.  +4 Intelligence."
msgstr "はるかに賢くなり、頭蓋骨がわずかに膨張している。知力+4。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Insanely Smart"
msgstr "驚異的な賢さ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Insanely Smart'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your skull bulges noticeably due to your impressive brain.  +7 Intelligence."
msgstr "優れた脳のため、頭蓋骨が目に見えて膨張している。知力+7。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Prime Intelligence"
msgstr "究極の賢さ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Prime Intelligence'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You understand almost everything about which you think, with minimal effort."
msgstr "最小限の労力で、思考することのほぼすべてを理解する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Distributed Neurology"
msgstr "分散神経系"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Distributed Neurology'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your brain has evolved beyond human imagination, though your body has become"
" more vulnerable to bashing damage by -3 points of armor.  You'll show them "
"the REAL meaning of 'gray goo'!"
msgstr ""
"お前の脳は人間の想像を超えて進化した。その代わり、身体は打撃ダメージに対して弱くなった（装甲値-3）。これで『グレイ・グー』の本当の意味を見せてやれるだろう！"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Perceptive"
msgstr "知覚的"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Perceptive'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your senses are a little keener.  +1 Perception."
msgstr "感覚が少し鋭くなった。感覚+1。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Very Perceptive"
msgstr "非常に知覚的"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Very Perceptive'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your senses are keener.  +2 Perception."
msgstr "感覚が鋭くなった。感覚+2。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Extremely Perceptive"
msgstr "極めて知覚的"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Extremely Perceptive'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your senses are much keener.  +4 Perception."
msgstr "感覚がはるかに鋭くなった。感覚+4。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Insanely Perceptive"
msgstr "驚異的な知覚"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Insanely Perceptive'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You can sense things you never imagined.  +7 Perception."
msgstr "想像もしなかった事柄を察知できる。感覚+7。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Prime Perception"
msgstr "究極の知覚"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Prime Perception'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your senses are keenly honed."
msgstr "感覚が完璧に研ぎ澄まされた。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Sensory Disintegration"
msgstr "感覚器の崩壊"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Sensory Disintegration'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your sense organs are all over the place: eyes extending and retracting, "
"'ears' of various shapes migrating about, and taste & smell are "
"uncontrollable.  The world is a horrible mixup.  Ugh!"
msgstr "すべての感覚器が混ざり合った。眼は伸び縮みし、様々な形の「耳」が移動し、味覚と嗅覚は制御不能だ。世界はひどく混乱している。うげえ！"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Distributed Senses"
msgstr "分散型知覚"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Distributed Senses'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You can now extend and reabsorb sensory organs at will, and can therefore "
"ignore most shocks that would overwhelm lesser beings."
msgstr "感覚器を意のままに生成・再吸収できるようになった。これにより、劣った生物を圧倒するようなほとんどの感覚ショックを無視できる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Uncomfortably Small"
msgstr "不都合なほど小さい"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Uncomfortably Small'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You've noticeably shrunk in size.  You're able to move with increased "
"litheness, but your smaller stature prevents you from carrying as much."
msgstr "身長が著しく縮んだ。よりしなやかに動けるが、体が小さいため多くの物を運べない。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json src/mtype.cpp
msgid "Small"
msgstr "小さい"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Small'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You can deny it no longer!  You are small.  You've adapted to your new size,"
" suffering a bit less from your reduced carry capacity and increased "
"fragility."
msgstr "もはや否定できない。お前は小さい。新しいサイズに適応し、所持容量の減少と脆さによる影響を少し軽減している。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Worryingly Tiny"
msgstr "不安になるほど小さい"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Worryingly Tiny'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You're only half as tall as you used to be!  The weight of things you once "
"found easy to carry is now unbearable, clothes are now twice as encumbering "
"for you unless you refit them (since you're half their size), and your hit "
"points are heavily reduced.  However, your movement is silent, and your "
"dodge skill is a little higher."
msgstr ""
"身長が以前の半分になった。かつて簡単に運べた物の重さが今では耐えがたい。服も（お前の半分のサイズであるため）再調整しない限り動作の邪魔になる。HPも大幅に減少する。しかし、移動は静かになり、回避スキルがわずかに向上する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json src/mtype.cpp
msgid "Tiny"
msgstr "極小"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Tiny'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You've mastered your tiny form!  Item encumbrance and carry weight penalties"
" are reduced, and you've learned to use your increased nimbleness to offset "
"your reduced capacity to absorb damage."
msgstr "極小の体型を習得した。アイテムの動作制限と所持重量のペナルティが軽減され、減少したダメージ吸収能力を機敏さで補うことを学んだ。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Crafty"
msgstr "抜け目のない"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Crafty'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"By making the most of your small stature, you can avoid the notice of all "
"but the most perceptive creatures, and your speed is greatly increased."
msgstr "小さな体を最大限に活用し、最も感覚の鋭い生物以外には気づかれずに済む。速度も大幅に向上する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Metallassomaiphile"
msgstr "変異中毒"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Metallassomaiphile'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Just thinking of mutagen (such a lovely word!  'Mutagen'.  Perfect!) makes "
"you thirsty.  And you so love your new parts.  You simply must have more "
"mutagen!"
msgstr ""
"変異原物質を考えただけで喉が渇く（なんと素晴らしい言葉だろう。「ミュータゲン」。完璧だ！）。新しい部位がとても愛おしい。もっと変異原物質が必要だ！"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Head Bumps"
msgstr "頭の瘤"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Head Bumps'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You have a pair of bumps on your skull."
msgstr "頭蓋骨に一対の瘤がある。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Slit Nostrils"
msgstr "裂けた鼻孔"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Slit Nostrils'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have a flattened nose and thin slits for nostrils, giving you a lizard-"
"like appearance.  This makes breathing slightly difficult and increases "
"mouth encumbrance by 10."
msgstr "平らな鼻と細い裂け目状の鼻孔になり、トカゲのような外見になった。呼吸がわずかに困難になり、口の動作制限が10増加する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Forked Tongue"
msgstr "二股の舌"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Forked Tongue'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your tongue is forked, like that of a reptile.  This has no effect."
msgstr "舌が爬虫類のように先端で二股に分かれている。効果はない。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Bulging Eyes"
msgstr "飛び出した眼"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Bulging Eyes'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your eyes bulge out several inches from your skull.  This does not affect "
"your vision in any way."
msgstr "眼球が頭蓋骨から数インチ（約10cm）飛び出している。視覚に何の影響もない。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Mouth Flaps"
msgstr "口ひだ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Mouth Flaps'}
#. ~ Description for Mouth Tendrils
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Skin tabs and odd flaps of skin surround your mouth.  They don't affect your"
" eating, but are unpleasant to look at."
msgstr "口の周りが皮膚の切れ端や奇妙なひだで覆われている。食事には影響しないが、見た目は不愉快だ。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Wing Stubs"
msgstr "翼状の突起"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Wing Stubs'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have a pair of stubby little wings projecting from your shoulderblades."
"  They can be wiggled at will, but are useless."
msgstr "肩甲骨から一対の短く小さな翼状の突起が生えている。意のままに動かせるが無駄だ。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Bat Wings"
msgstr "コウモリの翼"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Bat Wings'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have a pair of large, leathery wings.  You can move them a little, but "
"they only catch enough air to reduce falling damage a bit, and in fact put "
"you off balance, reducing your ability to dodge slightly."
msgstr ""
"一対の大きな革のような翼が生えている。少し動かせるが、空気抵抗を利用して落下ダメージをわずかに軽減できる程度だ。実際にはバランスを崩し、回避能力がわずかに低下する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Butterfly Wings"
msgstr "チョウの羽"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Butterfly Wings'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have a very large pair of brightly-colored, very beautiful wings.  They "
"can't lift you, and they make balancing tricky, but they certainly catch air"
" and attention!"
msgstr "非常に大きく、鮮やかで美しいチョウの羽を獲得した。空を飛ぶことはできず、バランスを取るのが難しくなるが、間違いなく注目を集める！"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Pale Skin"
msgstr "青白い肌"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Pale Skin'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your skin is rather pale."
msgstr "肌がかなり青白くなった。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Spots"
msgstr "斑点"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Spots'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your skin is covered in a pattern of red spots."
msgstr "肌が赤い斑点模様で覆われている。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Smelly"
msgstr "悪臭"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Smelly'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You smell awful.  Monsters that track scent will find you very easily, and "
"humans will react poorly."
msgstr "ひどい体臭を放っている。匂いで追跡するモンスターには容易に見つかり、人間は不快な反応を示す。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Deformed"
msgstr "奇形"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Deformed'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You're slightly deformed.  Some people will react badly to your appearance."
msgstr "わずかに奇形が見られる。お前の外見に悪い反応を示す人もいるだろう。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Badly Deformed"
msgstr "ひどい奇形"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Badly Deformed'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You're hideously deformed.  Some people will have a strong negative reaction"
" to your appearance."
msgstr "非常に醜い奇形が見られる。お前の外見に強い嫌悪感を示す人もいるだろう。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Grotesque"
msgstr "醜悪"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Grotesque'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your visage is disgusting and liable to induce vomiting.  People will not "
"want to interact with you unless they have a very good reason to."
msgstr "お前の顔は吐き気を催すほど醜悪だ。よほどの理由がない限り、誰も話しかけてこないだろう。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Beautiful"
msgstr "美しい"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Beautiful'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You're a real head-turner.  Some people will react well to your appearance, "
"and most people have an easier time trusting you."
msgstr "誰もが振り返るほどの美しさだ。お前の外見に好感を持つ人もいるだろう。ほとんどの人は、より簡単にお前を信用するようになる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Very Beautiful"
msgstr "非常に美しい"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Very Beautiful'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You are a vision of beauty.  Some people will react very well to your looks,"
" and most people will trust you immediately."
msgstr "お前は美しい幻想のようだ。外見に非常に強い好感を持つ人もいるだろう。ほとんどの人は、すぐにお前を信用する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Glorious"
msgstr "麗しい"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Glorious'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You are incredibly beautiful.  People cannot help themselves due to your "
"charms, and will do whatever they can to please you."
msgstr "信じられないほどの美しさだ。人々はその魅力に抗えず、お前を喜ばせるためならどんなことでもするだろう。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Snout"
msgstr "鼻面"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Snout'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your face and jaw have begun… changing.  Masks and such fit OK, but you're "
"noticeably mutated."
msgstr "顔と顎が…変化し始めた。マスクなどは問題なく着用できるが、変異が目立つ。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Bovine Snout"
msgstr "ウシの鼻面"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Bovine Snout'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your face resembles that of a bull, with a significant snout.  It looks "
"fearsome but prevents wearing mouthgear."
msgstr "顔が雄牛のようになり、大きな鼻面ができた。恐ろしげな見た目だが、口の装備は着用できない。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Lupine Muzzle"
msgstr "オオカミの鼻面"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Lupine Muzzle'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your jaw and nose have extended into a wolfish muzzle.  It lends itself to "
"biting in combat and looks impressive, but prevents wearing mouthgear."
msgstr "顎と鼻が伸びてオオカミのような鼻面になった。戦闘での噛みつきに適しており、見た目も印象的だが、口の装備は着用できない。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You nip at %s"
msgstr "%sに噛みついた"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "%1$s nips and harries %2$s"
msgstr "%1sは%2$sに噛みつき、苦しめた"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Ursine Muzzle"
msgstr "クマの鼻面"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Ursine Muzzle'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your jaw and nose have extended into a bearish muzzle.  You could bite with "
"it, and it looks impressive, but it prevents wearing mouthgear."
msgstr "顎と鼻が伸びてクマのような鼻面になった。噛みつくことができ、見た目も印象的だが、口の装備は着用できない。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You bite %s"
msgstr "%sに噛みついた"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "%1$s bites %2$s"
msgstr "%1$sは%2$sに噛いた"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Rodent Muzzle"
msgstr "げっ歯類の鼻面"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Rodent Muzzle'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your face and jaw have extended, giving you an alert and attentive "
"appearance."
msgstr "顔と顎が前方に伸び、機敏で注意深い外見になった。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Reptilian Muzzle"
msgstr "爬虫類の鼻面"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Reptilian Muzzle'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your face and jaws are a shorter version of those found on alligators.  They"
" look NASTY--as do the bite wounds they can inflict--but prevent wearing "
"mouthgear."
msgstr "顔と顎が、ワニを短くしたような形になった。ひどく不快な見た目であり、与える噛み傷も同様だ。口の装備は着用できない。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You bite a chunk out of %s"
msgstr "%sを噛みちぎった"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "%1$s bites a chunk out of %2$s"
msgstr "%1sは%2$sを噛みちぎった"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Proboscis"
msgstr "口吻"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Proboscis'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You've gotten rid of that terribly imprecise mouth and now imbibe your food "
"like a proper person.  Chewing was tiresome anyway."
msgstr "あのひどく不正確な口から解放され、一人前のように食べ物を吸い取る。どうせ咀嚼はうんざりする作業だった。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Hollow Bones"
msgstr "中空骨"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Hollow Bones'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have Avian Bone Syndrome--your bones are nearly hollow.  Your body is "
"very light as a result, enabling you to move and attack 20% faster, but also"
" frail; you can carry 40% less, and bashing attacks injure you more."
msgstr ""
"鳥類骨症候群を発症した。骨がほぼ中空になったため体が非常に軽くなり、移動と攻撃の速度が20%速くなる。しかし、その分脆く、所持容量が40%減少し、打撃攻撃によるダメージが増加する。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Nausea'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You feel nauseated almost constantly, and are more liable to throw up from "
"food poisoning, alcohol, etc.  You can, if desired, think yourself into "
"vomiting, too."
msgstr "ほぼ常に吐き気を感じる。食中毒やアルコールなどで嘔吐する可能性が高くなる。望めば意図的に嘔吐することも可能だ。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Vomitous"
msgstr "慢性嘔吐"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Vomitous'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have a major digestive disorder.  Though it causes you to vomit "
"frequently, you have found that you can trigger your vomit reflex on demand,"
" too."
msgstr "重度の消化器疾患を患っている。頻繁に嘔吐するが、反射を意のままに引き起こすことも可能だ。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Persistence Hunter"
msgstr "持久狩猟"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Persistence Hunter'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You can pursue prey for miles and miles at a variety of paces until they "
"stop from exhaustion."
msgstr "獲物が疲労で動けなくなるまで、様々なペースで何キロも追跡できる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Extreme Persistence Hunter"
msgstr "超持久狩猟"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Extreme Persistence Hunter'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You can pursue prey for days until they literally die from exhaustion.  It's"
" too bad zombies don't fatigue either."
msgstr "獲物が文字通り疲労困憊で死ぬまで、何日でも追跡を続けられる。残念ながら、ゾンビは疲労しないが。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Fast Metabolism"
msgstr "急速新陳代謝"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Fast Metabolism'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You require more food than most people.  On a plus side, you are more "
"resistant to cold."
msgstr "他のほとんどの人よりも多くの食料を必要とする。その代わり、寒さに強くなる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Rapid Metabolism"
msgstr "高速新陳代謝"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Rapid Metabolism'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You require more resources than most, but heal more rapidly as well.  "
"Provides weak regeneration even when not asleep."
msgstr "ほとんどの人よりも多くの資源を必要とするが、回復も速くなる。眠っていなくてもわずかにHPが再生する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Very Fast Metabolism"
msgstr "超高速新陳代謝"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Very Fast Metabolism'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You need about twice as much food as the average human to maintain your "
"flawed biology.  At least it warms you up when you need it."
msgstr "欠陥のある生体を維持するために、平均的な人間の約2倍の食料が必要だ。せめて、必要な時に体を温めてくれる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Extreme Metabolism"
msgstr "瞬間新陳代謝"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Extreme Metabolism'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You consume three times as much food as the average human to maintain your "
"inefficient body.  All the excess heat it generates could let you survive a "
"snowstorm naked."
msgstr "非効率な体を維持するために、平均的な人間の3倍の食料を消費する。生成される余剰な熱があれば、裸で吹雪を乗り越えることも可能だろう。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/obsolete.json
msgid "High Thirst"
msgstr "高乾燥"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'High Thirst'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your body dries out easily; you need to drink more water."
msgstr "体がすぐに乾燥する。より多くの水を飲む必要がある。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Very Thirsty"
msgstr "超高乾燥"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Very Thirsty'}
#. ~ Description for Giant Thirst
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/obsolete.json
msgid ""
"Ugh, out of water already?  You need about twice the fluids of an average "
"human."
msgstr "うげ、もう水がないのか？平均的な人間の約2倍の水分が必要だ。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Extremely Thirsty"
msgstr "瞬間乾燥"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Extremely Thirsty'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You dry out seriously quickly, requiring three times as much liquid to stay "
"hydrated."
msgstr "恐ろしく速く水分が失われ、水分補給のために通常の3倍の液体を必要とする。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Metabolic Rehydration"
msgstr "水分代謝"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Metabolic Rehydration'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your body gets everything it needs from the food that you eat!  You no "
"longer need hydration from fluids."
msgstr "体が生存に必要な水分を、食事で全て賄えるようになった！もはや液体からの水分補給は不要だ。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Very Heavy Sleeper"
msgstr "昏睡"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Very Heavy Sleeper'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You could probably sleep through a firefight."
msgstr "おそらく銃撃戦の最中でも眠り続けられるだろう。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Very Sleepy"
msgstr "傾眠"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Very Sleepy'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You find yourself needing to sleep quite often.  You'll spend about half of "
"your time in or around a bed."
msgstr "非常に頻繁に眠る必要がある。時間の約半分をベッド周辺で過ごすことになるだろう。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Weakening"
msgstr "衰弱"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Weakening'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You feel as though you are slowly weakening and your body heals slower."
msgstr "ゆっくりと体が弱っていくのを感じる。身体の治癒が遅くなる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Deterioration"
msgstr "消耗"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Deterioration'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your body is very slowly wasting away."
msgstr "非常にゆっくりだが、体が消耗していく。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Disintegration"
msgstr "崩壊"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Disintegration'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your body is slowly wasting away!"
msgstr "体がゆっくりと崩壊していく！"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Solar Sensitivity"
msgstr "色素性乾皮"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Solar Sensitivity'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your skin simply cannot handle ultraviolet radiation, such as sunlight.  It "
"will seriously burn you."
msgstr "皮膚が日光などの紫外線を適切に処理できない。深刻な火傷を負うだろう。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Sores"
msgstr "爛れた皮膚"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Sores'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your extremities are covered in painful sores.  The pain is worse when they "
"are covered in clothing."
msgstr "手足が皮膚がひどく爛れている。服で覆われると痛みがさらにひどくなる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Light Sensitive"
msgstr "光過敏"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Light Sensitive'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Sunlight makes you uncomfortable.  If you are outdoors and the weather is "
"Sunny, you suffer -1 to all stats."
msgstr "日光を浴びると不快になる。屋外で晴天の場合、すべての能力に-1のペナルティを受ける。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Very Light Sensitive"
msgstr "重度の光過敏"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Very Light Sensitive'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Sunlight makes you very uncomfortable.  If you are outdoors during the day, "
"you suffer -1 to all stats; -2 if the weather is Sunny."
msgstr "日光を浴びると非常に不快になる。日中に屋外にいるとすべての能力に-1、晴天の場合は-2のペナルティを受ける。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Troglobite'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Sunlight makes you extremely uncomfortable, resulting in large penalties to "
"all stats."
msgstr "日光を浴びるだけでひどく不快になり、すべての能力に大きなペナルティを受ける。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Webbed Hands"
msgstr "水かきのある手"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Webbed Hands'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your hands and feet are heavily webbed, reducing your Dexterity by 1 and "
"causing problems with gloves.  However, you can swim much faster.  Slightly "
"decreases wet penalties."
msgstr ""
"手足に分厚い水かきができた。器用さが1減少し、手袋の着用が難しくなる。しかし、泳ぐ速度が大幅に速くなる。水濡れによる悪影響がわずかに軽減される。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Paws"
msgstr "肉球手"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Paws'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your hands have fused into quasi-paws.  Fine manipulation is a challenge: "
"permanent hand encumbrance of 10, difficulty with delicate craftwork, and "
"your gloves don't fit.  But they handle water better."
msgstr ""
"手が肉球状に融合した。繊細な操作は困難だ:手の動作制限は恒久的に10増加し、繊細な製作作業が困難になり、手袋が装着できなくなる。しかし、水に対する扱いは向上する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Broad Paws"
msgstr "巨大な肉球手"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Broad Paws'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your paws are much larger now.  Manual dexterity is difficult: permanent "
"hand encumbrance of 20, serious problems crafting, and no gloves.  In "
"return, though, you can swim better."
msgstr ""
"肉球がさらに大きくなった。手先の器用さは非常に困難となり、手の動作制限が恒久的に20増加し、深刻な製作上の問題を引き起こし、手袋を装着できなくなる。その代わり、泳ぎが格段に向上する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Beak"
msgstr "嘴"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Beak'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have a beak for a mouth.  You can occasionally use it to peck at your "
"enemies, but it is impossible for you to wear mouth gear.  Slightly reduces "
"wet effects."
msgstr "口が嘴になった。時折、嘴で敵をつつくことができるが、口元に装備するアイテムは着用できなくなる。水濡れの影響をわずかに軽減する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You peck %s"
msgstr "%sをつついた"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "%1$s pecks %2$s"
msgstr "%1$sは%2$sをつついた"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Woodpecker Beak"
msgstr "キツツキの嘴"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Woodpecker Beak'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Pecking at prey is part of your daily routine now.  Slightly reduces wet "
"effects."
msgstr "獲物をつつくことは、今やお前の日課の一部だ。水濡れの影響をわずかに軽減する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You jackhammer into %s with your beak"
msgstr "くちばしで%sを激しく打ちつけた"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "%1$s jackhammer into %2$s with their beak"
msgstr "%1$sはくちばしを%2$sに激しく打ちつけた"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Hummingbird Beak"
msgstr "ハチドリの嘴"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Hummingbird Beak'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Though your beak's not suitable for pecking, those flowers out there are a "
"good source of energy.  Examine them to feed."
msgstr "嘴はつつくのには不向きだが、そこら中の花が良いエネルギー源になる。花を調べることで蜜を吸い、食料を確保できる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Genetically Unstable"
msgstr "不安定な遺伝子"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Genetically Unstable'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your DNA has been damaged in a way that causes you to continually develop "
"more mutations."
msgstr "DNAが損傷しており、継続的にさらなる変異が発生する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Genetic Chaos"
msgstr "混沌の遺伝子"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Genetic Chaos'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your body alters itself rapidly, and without your intervention or conscious "
"control."
msgstr "肉体が急速に変質し、お前の干渉や意識的な制御を一切受け付けない。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Minor Radioactivity"
msgstr "軽度の放射能"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Minor Radioactivity'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your body has become radioactive!  You continuously emit low levels of "
"radiation, which slowly contaminates the world around you."
msgstr "お前の体は放射能を帯びている！微量の放射線を放ち続け、周囲をゆっくりと汚染する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Radioactivity"
msgstr "放射能"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Radioactivity'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your body has become radioactive!  You continuously emit moderate levels of "
"radiation, which contaminates the world around you.  You also produce a lot "
"of heat."
msgstr "お前の体は放射能を帯びている！中程度の放射線を放ち続け、周囲を汚染する。また、大量の熱を放出する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Severe Radioactivity"
msgstr "重度の放射能"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Severe Radioactivity'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your body has become radioactive!  You continuously emit heavy levels of "
"radiation, making your surroundings unlivable.  You also overheat fast."
msgstr "お前の体は放射能を帯びている！大量の放射線を放ち続け、周囲は居住不可能になる。また、急速に体温が上昇する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Slimy"
msgstr "粘液性"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Slimy'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your body is coated with a fine slime.  Protects from long-term effects of "
"acid, though not short-term ones.  Greatly increases wet benefits."
msgstr ""
"全身が滑らかなスライムに覆われている。酸による持続ダメージからは保護されるが、短期的なダメージは防げない。水濡れ状態のメリットが大幅に増加する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Viscous"
msgstr "粘着性"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Viscous'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your body's slime output has become sticky and gel-like.  Provides 2 points "
"of acid protection.  Greatly increases wet benefits."
msgstr "体から分泌されるスライムが粘着性のあるジェル状になった。酸への防御力が2ポイント増加し、水濡れ状態のメリットが大幅に増加する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Amorphous Body"
msgstr "無定形体"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Amorphous Body'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your flesh is a pleasing gel-like consistency, providing 4 points of bash "
"armor all over.  Your bodily functions seem to be moving around, and your "
"leg-equivalents flow comfortably - if a little slower than your old meat-"
"legs."
msgstr ""
"お前の肉体は心地よいジェル状の物質で、全身に4ポイントの打撃耐性を付与する。内臓の位置は自由に動いているようで、脚の代わりとなる部分は快適に流動する——以前の肉でできた脚よりはわずかに遅いが。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Omnicellular"
msgstr "全細胞体"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Omnicellular'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your body is more or less one consistent whole: a single, giant, omni-cell "
"that alters itself as needed."
msgstr "お前の体は、ほぼ一つのまとまりとして構成されている。それは、必要に応じて自らを変化させる、単一の巨大な全能細胞だ。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Herbivore"
msgstr "草食性"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Herbivore'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your body's ability to digest meat is severely hampered.  Eating meat has a "
"good chance of making you vomit it back up; even if you manage to keep it "
"down, its nutritional value is greatly reduced."
msgstr "お前の肉を消化する能力が著しく阻害されている。肉を食べると高い確率で吐き戻してしまう。どうにか胃に留めても、その栄養価は大幅に減少する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Carnivore"
msgstr "肉食性"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Carnivore'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your body's ability to digest fruits, vegetables, grains and nuts is "
"severely hampered.  You cannot eat anything besides meat."
msgstr "お前の果物、野菜、穀物、木の実を消化する能力が著しく阻害されている。肉以外は一切食べることができない。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mutations/obsolete.json
msgid "Ponderous"
msgstr "鈍重"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Ponderous'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your muscles are generally slow to move.  You move 10% slower."
msgstr "筋肉は総じて動きが鈍い。移動速度が10%低下する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Very Ponderous"
msgstr "かなり鈍重"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Very Ponderous'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your muscles are quite slow to move.  You move 20% slower."
msgstr "筋肉はかなり動きが鈍い。移動速度が20%低下する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Extremely Ponderous"
msgstr "極度の鈍重"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Extremely Ponderous'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your muscles are very slow to move.  You move 30% slower."
msgstr "筋肉は非常に動きが鈍い。移動速度が30%低下する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Sunlight Dependent"
msgstr "日光依存性"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Sunlight Dependent'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You feel very sluggish when not in direct sunlight.  You suffer a 5% drop in"
" speed when in shade, and a 10% drop in speed when in the dark."
msgstr "直射日光を浴びていないと、体が非常にだるく感じる。日陰では移動速度が5%、暗闇では10%低下する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Vines"
msgstr "蔦"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Vines'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have developed several vines sprouting from your shoulder area.  They're"
" bulky, and get in the way."
msgstr "肩の周りから数本の蔦が生えた。嵩張り、動作の邪魔になる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Vine Limbs"
msgstr "蔦の手足"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Vine Limbs'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You've developed the ability to control your vines; they make good lashes.  "
"You can even rappel down sheer drops using them, but disconnecting HURTS."
msgstr "蔦を自在に操る能力を身につけた。蔦でうまく鞭打ち攻撃を繰り出せる。これを使って絶壁を懸垂下降することもできるが、切断されると激痛を伴う。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You lash %s with a vine"
msgstr "%sを蔦でむち打ちつけた"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "%1$s lashes %2$s with their vines"
msgstr "%1$sは%2$sを蔦でむち打ちつけた"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Vine Sprouter"
msgstr "蔦の発芽"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Vine Sprouter'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have full control of your vines, and can grow new ones and detach old "
"ones more or less at will."
msgstr "蔦を完全に制御できるようになった。新しい蔦を生やしたり、古い蔦を切り離したりするのも思いのままだ。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You detach a vine from your body."
msgstr "体から蔦を切り離した。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Hair Roots"
msgstr "根の髪"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Hair Roots'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Roots have started growing from your leaf-like hair.  They don't seem to do "
"much."
msgstr "葉のような髪から根が生え始めた。これといって役に立つことはないようだ。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Toe Roots"
msgstr "根の足指"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Toe Roots'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your toes have grown wriggly, and you can't imagine why you wear that stuff "
"on your feet.  Take it off.  It's in the way."
msgstr "つま先が根のように変化し、むずむずする。どうして足の上にこんな余計なものを履いているんだ？脱いじゃえ。邪魔だよ。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Roots"
msgstr "側根"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Roots'}
#. The idea is that you, for lack of a better term, plant yourself.  Crafting
#. and digging don't count because they presume a certain amount of movement
#. during the task.  The handheld game does count.
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"It's about time you started developing a root system.  When reading, "
"fishing, waiting, or otherwise being stationary for a while on diggable "
"terrain, you'll extract nutrients and water from the soil."
msgstr "ついに根を張る時期がやってきた。読書、釣り、待機など、掘削可能な地形の上でしばらく静止していると、土から養分と水を吸収する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Rooter"
msgstr "主根"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Rooter'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You find it difficult not to sink roots when able.  You extract nutrients "
"and water whenever on diggable terrain, but move more slowly."
msgstr "可能であればすぐにでも根を張ってしまう。掘削可能な地形の上にいる間、土から養分と水分を吸収するが、移動速度は低下する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Chloromorphosis"
msgstr "葉緑素変態"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Chloromorphosis'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Every inch of your skin is packed with chlorophyll and you have strong "
"roots.  Sleeping on diggable soil will satisfy any hunger or thirst you "
"might have."
msgstr "全身の皮膚に葉緑素が満ち、根は強靭になった。掘削可能な土の上で眠れば、空腹や喉の渇きは解消されるだろう。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Mycorrhizal Communion"
msgstr "根毛交信"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Mycorrhizal Communion'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have gained the ability to commune with trees and comprehend their "
"ancient wisdom.  Activate next to a tree to gradually gain overmap vision "
"through connected forests."
msgstr "木々と交信し、その古の知恵を理解する能力を得た。木の隣で能力を有効化すると、繋がった森を介してオーバーマップの視界が徐々に明らかになる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Heat Dependent"
msgstr "熱依存"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Heat Dependent'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your muscle response is dependent on ambient temperatures.  You lose 1% of "
"your speed for every 5 (2.8) degrees below 65 F (18.3 C).  This sluggishness"
" helps you conserve energy, however."
msgstr ""
"筋肉の反応は外気温に左右される。気温が18.3℃（65°F）を2.8℃（5°F）下回るごとに、移動速度が1%低下する。この鈍重さにより、エネルギーを節約できる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Very Heat Dependent"
msgstr "非常に熱依存"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Very Heat Dependent'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your muscle response is highly dependent on ambient temperatures.  You lose "
"1% of your speed for every 3 (1.7) degrees below 65 F (18.3 C), but your "
"slow metabolism requires much less food."
msgstr ""
"筋肉の反応は外気温に強く左右される。気温が18.3℃（65°F）を1.7℃（3°F）下回るごとに、移動速度が1%低下する。しかし、代謝が遅くなるため、必要な食料は大幅に少なくなる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Cold Blooded"
msgstr "変温動物"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Cold Blooded'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You are cold-blooded and rely on heat to keep moving.  Your lose 1% of your "
"speed for every 2 (1.1) degrees below 65 F (18.3 C), but only need to eat "
"about half as much as before."
msgstr ""
"変温動物に近づいたため、活動するには熱が必要だ。外気温が摂氏18.3度(華氏65度)を1.1度(2度)下回るごとに移動速度が1%低下する。しかし、必要な食料は半分で済む。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Ectothermic"
msgstr "完全な変温動物"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Ectothermic'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your body has become permanently cold-blooded.  Your speed lowers or raises "
"1% for every 2 (1.1) degrees below or above 65 F (18.3 C).  You only need to"
" eat half as much as an average human."
msgstr ""
"完全に変温動物になった。摂氏18.3度(華氏65度)を境に、外気温が1.1度(2度)上がるごとに移動速度が1%上昇し、下がるごとに1%低下する。必要な食料は平均的な人間の半分で済む。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Growling Voice"
msgstr "唸り声"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Growling Voice'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have a growling, rough voice.  Persuading NPCs will be more difficult, "
"but threatening them will be easier."
msgstr "獣が唸るような荒々しい声になった。NPCを説得するのは難しくなるが、脅すのは容易になる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Snarling Voice"
msgstr "凶暴な唸り声"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Snarling Voice'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have a threatening snarl in your voice.  Persuading NPCs will be near "
"impossible, but threatening them will be much easier."
msgstr "身の毛もよだつような凶悪な声になった。NPCを説得するのはほぼ不可能だが、脅すのは驚くほど容易になる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Hissing Voice"
msgstr "威嚇音"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Hissing Voice'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You hiss when speaking.  Persuading NPCs will be more difficult, but "
"threatening them will be easier."
msgstr "話すたびにシューシューと威嚇音を発する。NPCを説得するのは難しくなるが、脅すのは容易になる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Shouter"
msgstr "大声"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Shouter'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You occasionally shout uncontrollably."
msgstr "時折、我慢できずに大声で叫ぶ。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Screamer"
msgstr "金切り声"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Screamer'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You sometimes scream uncontrollably."
msgstr "時々、我慢できずに金切り声で叫ぶ。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Howler"
msgstr "遠吠え"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Howler'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You frequently let out a piercing howl."
msgstr "頻繁に、耳をつんざくような遠吠えを上げる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Feathered Arms"
msgstr "羽根の生えた腕"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Feathered Arms'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your arms have grown vibrantly-colored feathers.  They effectively "
"waterproof your arms and provide 1 point of bashing armor, but really get in"
" the way.  They're simply too small to help you in the air."
msgstr "腕に鮮やかな色の羽根が生えた。これにより腕は水を弾き、1ポイントの殴打耐性を得るが、非常に邪魔だ。空を飛ぶには小さすぎる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Insect Limbs"
msgstr "虫の肢"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Insect Limbs'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You've *finally* sprouted a pair of arms from your midsection.  They flail "
"more or less uncontrollably, making you feel rather larval."
msgstr "ついに胴体の脇腹から昆虫のような腕が2本生えた。この腕は制御できず、不規則に動くため、まるで幼虫になったような気分だ。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Insect Arms"
msgstr "虫の腕"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Insect Arms'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"It's good having all your arms.  Though they're too thin to block or punch, "
"you can fold them inside human-shaped gear if need be."
msgstr "腕がきちんと全部揃っているのは、気分が良いものだ。細くて打撃には使えないが、折り畳んでおけば人間用の装備を問題なく着用できる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Arachnid Limbs"
msgstr "クモの肢"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Arachnid Limbs'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"There's the last two limbs you were expecting.  Unfortunately, you still "
"can't coordinate them, so you're getting in your own way.  A lot."
msgstr "期待していた最後の2本の肢が生えた。残念ながら、まだ制御できないため、非常に邪魔に感じる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Arachnid Arms"
msgstr "クモの腕"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Arachnid Arms'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have four handsome limbs, and then those mutant 'hand' and 'foot' "
"things.  They probably aren't worth concealing."
msgstr "元からある手足も立派だが、変異で獲得した4本の新たな肢も負けてはいない。どう頑張っても隠すことはできないだろう。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Tentacle Arms"
msgstr "触手腕"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Tentacle Arms'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your arms have transformed into tentacles, resulting in a +1 bonus to "
"Dexterity, permanent hand encumbrance of 30, and an inability to wear "
"gloves.  Somewhat decreases wet penalties."
msgstr ""
"腕が触手になり、器用さに+1のボーナスを得る。しかし、常に手に30の動作制限を受け、手袋を着用できない。水濡れによるペナルティがわずかに軽減される。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You slap %s with your tentacle"
msgstr "触手で%sを叩きつけた"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "%1$s slaps %2$s with their tentacle"
msgstr "%1$sは触手を%2$sに叩きつけた"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You rake %s with your tentacle"
msgstr "触手で%sを引っ掻いた"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "%1$s rakes %2$s with their tentacle"
msgstr "%1$sは触手で%2$sを引っ掻いた"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "4 Tentacles"
msgstr "触手腕:4本"

#. ~ Description for {'str': '4 Tentacles'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your arms have transformed into four tentacles, resulting in a +1 bonus to "
"Dexterity, permanent hand encumbrance of 30, and an inability to wear "
"gloves.  You can make up to 3 extra attacks with them.  Somewhat decreases "
"wet penalties."
msgstr ""
"腕が4本の触手になった。器用さに+1のボーナスを得るが、手に30の動作制限を受け、手袋を着用できない。1回の攻撃で最大3回の追加攻撃が発生する。水濡れによるペナルティがわずかに軽減される。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "8 Tentacles"
msgstr "触手腕:8本"

#. ~ Description for {'str': '8 Tentacles'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your arms have transformed into eight tentacles, resulting in a +1 bonus to "
"Dexterity, permanent hand encumbrance of 30, and an inability to wear "
"gloves.  You can make up to 7 extra attacks with them.  Somewhat decreases "
"wet penalties."
msgstr ""
"腕が8本の触手になった。器用さに+1のボーナスを得るが、手に30の動作制限を受け、手袋を着用できない。1回の攻撃で最大7回の追加攻撃が発生する。水濡れによるペナルティがわずかに軽減される。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Shell"
msgstr "殻"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Shell'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have grown a thick shell over your torso, providing 6 bash, 14 cut, and "
"5 bullet armor.  You find you can use the empty space as 16 storage space, "
"but cannot wear anything on your torso.  Somewhat reduces wet effects."
msgstr ""
"胴体に厚い殻が生え、打撃6、斬撃14、弾丸5の装甲を得る。空いた空間を16の収納スペースとして利用できるが、胴体部に何も着用できなくなる。水濡れ効果をわずかに軽減する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Roomy Shell"
msgstr "巨大な殻"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Roomy Shell'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your protective shell has grown large enough to accommodate--if need be--"
"your whole body, providing 9 bash, 17 cut, and 5 bullet armor.  Activate to "
"pull your head and limbs into your shell, trading mobility and vision for "
"warmth and shelter."
msgstr ""
"保護用の殻が全身を覆うほど大きくなり、打撃9、斬撃17、弾丸5の装甲を得る。有効化することで頭や手足を殻に引き込み、機動性や視界と引き換えに温かさと安全を得られる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Leg Tentacles"
msgstr "触手脚"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Leg Tentacles'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your legs have transformed into six tentacles.  This decreases your speed on"
" land by 20%, makes your movement silent, increases your swimming speed and "
"reduces wet penalties, but you can't use footwear any more."
msgstr ""
"脚が6本の触手になった。地上での移動速度は20%低下するが、足音を立てず、水泳速度が上昇する。水濡れによるペナルティが軽減されるが、履物を着用できなくなる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Tentacle Bracing"
msgstr "吸盤触手"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Tentacle Bracing'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your lower tentacles have developed suckers.  They make land movement "
"marginally more tiring, but do a good job of keeping you set in place."
msgstr "下部の触手に吸盤が発達した。地上での移動は少し疲れるが、その場に体を固定するのに非常に役立つ。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Lizard'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You sometimes look back on your days before your tail came in.  But you're "
"better now."
msgstr "たまに尻尾が生える前のことを思い出す。だが、今のほうがいい。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Serpent'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"They say you have to crawl before you can walk.  You walked, but now "
"slithering feels better."
msgstr "「歩く前に這いずり回れ」と言うが、君は歩いた。だが今は、這いずる方が心地よいと感じる。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Bird'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"The skies are your domain now.  And the land too, there are still nests to "
"build after all."
msgstr "今や空は君の支配下にある。そして地上もだ。巣を築かなければならないのだから。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Aquatic"
msgstr "水生動物"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Aquatic'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Ninety percent of the planet, and it's yours to explore.  And colonize.  And"
" enjoy.  What was that about a surface?"
msgstr "この惑星の90%がお前のものだ。探索し、植民地化し、楽しもうではないか。地上などどうでもいいだろう？"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Beast'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"It's about time you grew out.  Now that you've matured, it is time to make "
"something of yourself."
msgstr "そろそろ成長しきる頃合いだろう。十分に成熟した今、お前自身の存在意義を示す時だ。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Feline'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Stalking prey, eating well, and lying in the sun.  Mmm, all you could ever "
"desire."
msgstr "獲物を追って、腹いっぱい食べて、太陽の下で寝転がる。ああ、これ以上何も望むものはない。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Wolf'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You're the perfect candidate to lead a pack."
msgstr "群れを率いるリーダーとして完璧な素質を持っている。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Bear'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "So the humans died; what's the worry?  Now they won't ruin the woods."
msgstr "人間どもが死んだ。何が心配だ？これで森が台無しにされることはない。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Bovine"
msgstr "ウシ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Bovine'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Civilization collapsed?  Great!  You and your kin will never have to worry "
"about a slaughterhouse again."
msgstr "文明社会が崩壊した？素晴らしい！もはやお前や仲間が屠殺される心配はない。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Insect'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"It would be good to be a Queen, having workers constantly servicing your "
"every need… but how would you keep them in line?"
msgstr "女王になるのは良いものだろう。召使いが四六時中、あらゆる要求を満たしてくれる。だが、どうやって彼らを統制する？"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Plant'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Well, you still have those other walking flowers-and the mushrooms too-to "
"deal with.  But you'll manage."
msgstr "さて、まだ歩く花と、どうしようもないキノコが残っている。だが、何とかなるだろう。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Aqueous"
msgstr "水溶性"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Aqueous'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"What was that old advertisement?  'Paint the planet'?  That might be a good "
"long-term goal, but for now…"
msgstr "昔の広告か何かで「この星を水で満たそう」みたいなのがあったな。現状では、良い長期目標になりそうだ…"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Subterranean"
msgstr "地底人"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Subterranean'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Not much point to rebuilding up in that horribly bright roofless wasteland."
"  Now that you've become accustomed to your new digs, there's the beginning "
"of a great empire right here, underground."
msgstr "あの恐ろしく明るく、屋根のない不毛の地で再建する意味はあまりない。新しい住処に慣れた今、ここ地下に偉大な帝国の礎を築く時だ。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Cephalopod'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Strange aeons, true, but Death seems to be slacking, and you are doing just "
"fine."
msgstr "確かに奇妙な永劫だが、死が手抜きをしているようだ。お前は順調にやっている。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Arachnid"
msgstr "アラクネ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Arachnid'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Well, maybe you'll just have to make your own worldwide web."
msgstr "まあ、お前だけのワールド・ワイド・ウェブを構築すればいい。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json data/json/npcs/BG_traits.json
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/rural.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BG_traits_afs.json
msgid "Survivor"
msgstr "サバイバー"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Survivor'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Hey.  Civilization fell.  You're still around.  'Rat' just isn't respectful."
msgstr "なあ。文明は崩壊した。だがお前はまだ生きている。「ネズミ」は敬意を払うには値しない。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Prototype"
msgstr "プロトタイプ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Prototype'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "After all those experiments, what's a few more, hmm?"
msgstr "あれだけ実験をしてきたんだ。もういくつかやってもいいだろう？"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Prime"
msgstr "プライム"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Prime'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You're the perfect candidate to tidy this mess."
msgstr "この混乱を正すべく現れた、理想的な候補者だ。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Fey'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You are the tree under which humankind will shelter during these dark times."
msgstr "お前は、この暗黒の時代に人類がその陰に身を寄せる一本の木だ。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Chaos"
msgstr "混沌"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Chaos'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You can't tell what you are anymore.  Everything and yet nothing, like you "
"weren't meant to exist.  But you do, and you're a force, no matter what "
"happens."
msgstr ""
"もはや自分が何者なのか分からない。まるで存在自体が間違いであるかのように、全てを持ちながら何も持っていない。しかし何が起ころうと、お前はやり遂げる。お前こそが力だ。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Raptor'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"The chance to undo not one but TWO extinction events.  You're confident "
"you'll do fine."
msgstr "一度ならず二度までも、絶滅を元通りにする機会に恵まれた。お前は上手くやれると確信している。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Diminutive"
msgstr "小動物"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Diminutive'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"So much food, everywhere!  And nobody's even guarding it anymore!  These are"
" good times."
msgstr "食べ物がどこにでもあふれている！しかも、誰も見張っていない！これは最高の時代だ。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Lagomorph"
msgstr "ウサギ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Lagomorph'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You really want to eat some carrots.  Welcome to the Lagomorpha family."
msgstr "今、お前は無性にニンジンを食べたい気分だ。ようこそウサギ目へ。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Rabbit Ears"
msgstr "ウサギの耳"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Rabbit Ears'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your ears have grown into tall, flexible and pretty rabbit ears.  They're "
"are slender and enhance your hearing beyond the normal range."
msgstr "耳が長くてしなやかな、可愛らしいウサギの耳になった。ほっそりした耳は、通常より遠くの音まで拾えるほど聴覚を強化する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Rabbit Tail"
msgstr "ウサギの尻尾"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Rabbit Tail'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your stubby tail has become fuzzy and more round.  It looks adorable, but "
"doesn't seem to serve another purpose beyond that."
msgstr "短かった尻尾がフワフワで丸くなった。とても可愛らしいが、それ以外の役には立たないようだ。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Rabbit Fur"
msgstr "ウサギの毛皮"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Rabbit Fur'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your fur keeps you covered in winter, providing 1 point of bash armor across"
" most of your body and maintaining heat and allowing you to better tolerate "
"cold temperatures."
msgstr "毛皮が体を覆い、冬の寒さから守ってくれる。体全体に1ポイントの殴打耐性を与え、保温性も高まり、寒さに強くなる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Rabbit Feet"
msgstr "ウサギの足"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Rabbit Feet'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your feet have grown into strong and large rabbit feet.  This makes your "
"kicks pack a little more oomph, and gives your feet 1 bashing armor.  "
"Emphasis on little.  It also offers some warmth, and the lucky part is but "
"superstition.  The downside is you are unable to wear shoes."
msgstr ""
"足が大きくて丈夫なウサギの足になった。蹴りの威力が増し、足に1ポイントの殴打耐性を与える。ただし、その効果はわずかだ。さらに足が温かくなるが、幸運をもたらすという部分はただの迷信だ。欠点としては、靴を履けなくなる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You kick %s with your large feet"
msgstr "大きな足で%sを蹴った"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "%1$s kicks %2$s with their large feet"
msgstr "%1sは大きな足で%2$sを蹴った"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Rabbit Nose"
msgstr "ウサギの鼻"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Rabbit Nose'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your nose has morphed into a cute bunny nose, along with the snout.  It's "
"extremely twitchy too."
msgstr "鼻が愛らしいウサギの鼻になり、鼻面も伸びた。ひどくピクピクと動く。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Little Paws"
msgstr "小さな手"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Little Paws'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your hands have elongated and look a bit more like paws.  It makes fine "
"manipulation a little more difficult, but you can still probably manage."
msgstr "手が細長くなり、少し小さな足のようになった。細かい作業は少し難しくなるが、おそらくまだ何とかなるだろう。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Marloss Gateway"
msgstr "マーロスへの入り口"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Marloss Gateway'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You get the feeling that you're on the cusp of becoming something greater "
"than yourself."
msgstr "自分は何かの一部であり、偉大な何かの末端にいるような、そんな感覚を覚える。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Mycus'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json src/iuse.cpp
msgid "We are the Mycus."
msgstr "我々はマイカス。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Acidproof"
msgstr "耐酸"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Acidproof'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Your mutated flesh is immune to the damaging effects of acid."
msgstr "変異した肉体組織は酸性の影響を受けない。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Acid Blood"
msgstr "酸性血"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Acid Blood'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your body has developed a wonderful defense mechanism.  Instead of normal "
"blood, you bleed a strong molecular acid which will damage any creature "
"foolish enough to harm you."
msgstr ""
"肉体が素晴らしい防御機構を獲得した。通常の血液の代わりに、強力な分子レベルの酸が全身を駆け巡っている。お前を傷つけるような愚かな生物は、強酸の洗礼を受けることになるだろう。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Pyromaniac"
msgstr "放火癖"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Pyromaniac'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have an unhealthy obsession with fire, and you get anxious if you don't "
"light them every now and then or stand near them often.  However, you gain a"
" mood bonus from doing so."
msgstr ""
"火に対して危険なほどの執着心を持っている。定期的に火をつけたり、火のそばにいたりしないと不安を覚えるが、その渇望が満たされると気分が良くなる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Amphibious"
msgstr "水陸両生"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Amphibious'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You're as comfortable in water as on land, and your body has adapted around "
"that fact.  Your base swimming speed is greatly increased, and weight will "
"hinder you much less while swimming."
msgstr "水中でも陸上のように快適に過ごせることに気づく。基本的な水泳速度が大幅に向上し、多少重い荷物を背負っていても楽に泳げる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Lidless Eyes"
msgstr "瞼の退化"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Lidless Eyes'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Like a true fish, your eyes lack eyelids, and are instead covered by a "
"translucent, protective membrane that blocks irritants and water, and "
"provides 3 cut and 1 bash armor.  It also allows you to sleep with your eyes"
" open!  Activate to cause the approach of hostile creatures to wake you up."
msgstr ""
"本物の魚のように、お前の目には瞼がない。代わりに半透明の保護膜が目を覆っており、刺激物や水から目を守り、斬撃耐性3、打撃耐性1を得る。このおかげで、目を開けたまま眠ることもできる。有効化すると、敵対的な生物が近づくと目が覚めるようになる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Aqueous Repose"
msgstr "水中での休息"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Aqueous Repose'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Falling asleep underwater is easy for you, and you spend less time asleep "
"when you rest there.  You can also eat underwater, though you can't drink."
msgstr "水中で簡単に眠れるため、そこで休息すると睡眠時間が短縮される。水中での食事も可能だが、飲み物を飲むことはできない。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Toxic Flesh"
msgstr "有毒の肉体"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Toxic Flesh'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your flesh is highly poisonous, and creatures that bite you will receive a "
"nasty surprise."
msgstr "お前の肉体には強力な毒性があるため、お前に噛みついた生物は痛い不意打ちを受けるだろう。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Freshwater Osmosis"
msgstr "淡水浸透性"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Freshwater Osmosis'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your gills and skin are highly permeable to moisture, and you can hydrate "
"your body through osmosis.  While submerged in fresh water, any thirst you "
"might have will be slaked."
msgstr ""
"エラと皮膚が水分に対して非常に強い浸透性を持っており、浸透作用によって体内に水分を取り込める。きれいな水に浸かっている間は喉の渇きが癒される。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Electroreceptors"
msgstr "電気受容器官"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Electroreceptors'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"A network of jelly-filled electroreceptors, like that of a shark, have grown"
" throughout your face and nose.  They are very sensitive to magnetic fields,"
" allowing you to see robots and creatures charged with electricity through "
"walls, but being shocked will seriously mess you up."
msgstr ""
"サメが持っているようなゼリー状の物質が詰まった電気受容器官が、顔や鼻のあたりに発達した。磁場に非常に敏感になり、電気を帯びたロボットや生物を壁越しに感知できる。ただし、電撃を受けるとひどく混乱する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Shark Teeth"
msgstr "サメの歯"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Shark Teeth'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your teeth have grown incredibly sharp, and have calcified even further.  In"
" addition to letting you eat much faster, you can use them as a lethal "
"natural weapon, as long as your anatomy favors it.  They also grow very "
"fast, and you harmlessly shed them more or less at random."
msgstr ""
"歯が信じられないほど鋭くなり、さらに石灰化した。ものを食べる速度が向上し、食事の好みに問題がなければ、天然の武器として使うこともできる。また、成長速度も非常に早く、痛みも伴わずに勝手に歯が抜け落ちる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You tear into %s with your teeth"
msgstr "歯で%sを食い破った"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "%1$s tears into %2$s with their teeth"
msgstr "%1sは歯で%2$sを食い破った"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Snake Body"
msgstr "蛇の胴体"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Snake Body'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your legs and feet have merged into a long, scaly tail.  It's harder for you"
" to move (though you can wind through obstacles a bit better) and harder to "
"dodge, and limits what you can wear.  Anything you can get to fit on your "
"tail just makes crawling around even more awkward.  At least it protects "
"your lower half decently, reduces wet effects, and lets you carry more "
"weight."
msgstr ""
"脚と足が一体化し、長い鱗に覆われた尻尾になった。移動は難しくなるが、障害物の間をすり抜けるのは少し得意になる。回避が難しくなり、身につけられるものも限られる。尻尾に合う服を見つけたとしても、這い回るのがさらに不格好になるだけだ。せめてもの救いは、下半身をしっかりと保護し、水濡れ効果を軽減し、より重いものを運べるようになることだ。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Serpentine Body"
msgstr "蛇の身体"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Serpentine Body'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your snake body has grown stronger and more flexible, or maybe you're just "
"getting used to moving with it.  It's still incredibly inconvenient to find "
"clothes for your tail, but you're better at navigating obstacles and can "
"even whip enemies with the end."
msgstr ""
"蛇の体がより強く、より柔軟になった。あるいは、この体での動きに慣れてきたのかもしれない。尻尾に合う服を見つけるのは依然として非常に不便だが、障害物を乗り越えるのが上手くなり、尻尾の先端で敵を叩きつけることさえできる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Crushing Coils"
msgstr "絞めつけるとぐろ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Crushing Coils'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your newfound size has granted some extra bulk to your serpentine half.  You"
" haven't figured out how to constrict anything with it, but it does further "
"enhance your strength (+4) and your lower half's natural armor is even "
"thicker."
msgstr ""
"巨大化したことで、蛇の下半身がさらにがっしりした。まだ何かを締めつける方法は見つけていないが、筋力はさらに強化され(+4)、下半身の自然な装甲はさらに厚くなる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Police Officer"
msgstr "警察官"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Police Officer'}
#. ~ Description for {'str': 'SWAT Officer'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You are a duly sworn law enforcement officer, with jurisdiction throughout "
"the New England region thanks to interstate agreements.  Whether that means "
"anything now is another question."
msgstr "正規に宣誓した法の執行者だ。州間協定により、その管轄権はニューイングランド州全域に及ぶ。それが今、何か意味をなすかはまた別の問題だ。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "SWAT Officer"
msgstr "SWAT隊員"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Bionic Officer"
msgstr "義体警察官"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Bionic Officer'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You are a cybernetically-resurrected law enforcement officer, with "
"jurisdiction throughout the New England region thanks to interstate "
"agreements.  Whether you can do for the law what the law did for you is "
"another question."
msgstr ""
"サイバネ技術によって蘇った法の執行者だ。州間協定により、その管轄権はニューイングランド州全域に及ぶ。法がお前にしてくれたことに対し、お前が法のために何ができるかはまた別の問題だ。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Churl"
msgstr "農奴"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Churl'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Thou art a lewede man, a lowly cowherd, though where thi catel been thou "
"hast not ynn certain."
msgstr "お前は無作法で身分の低い牛飼いだ。だが、お前の牛がどこにいるのか、お前自身も定かではない。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Police Detective"
msgstr "刑事"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Police Detective'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You are a duly sworn law enforcement investigator, with jurisdiction "
"throughout the New England region thanks to interstate agreements.  Whether "
"your shield means anything now is another question."
msgstr ""
"正規に宣誓した法の執行調査官だ。州間協定により、その管轄権はニューイングランド州全域に及ぶ。今やそのエンブレムが何か意味をなすかはまた別の問題だ。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "US Marshal"
msgstr "連邦保安官"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'US Marshal'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You are a duly sworn Federal marshal, with nationwide jurisdiction and the "
"authority of the United States of America."
msgstr "正規に宣誓した連邦保安官だ。全米を管轄区域とし、その身にアメリカ合衆国の権威と威信を帯びている。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "True Foodperson"
msgstr "真のフードパーソン"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'True Foodperson'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You are the true Foodperson, some might think Foodperson is just a mascot, "
"but you know better.  You are Foodperson, the mask has become your face; you"
" are real, and the only thing standing between this world and oblivion is "
"you."
msgstr ""
"真のフードパーソンだ。ただのマスコットだと思っている者もいるが、お前は違う。お前自身がフードパーソンなのだ。マスクは顔そのものになり、お前は現実となった。この世界と無意識の狭間に立つ唯一の存在がお前だ。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "MD"
msgstr "医療関係者"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'MD'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You were just through with the administrative formalities for your residency"
" when the Cataclysm struck.  \"Your\" hospital was overrun and evacuated, "
"but there's always work for a good doctor."
msgstr ""
"研修医になるための事務手続きをようやく終えた矢先に、大災厄が襲った。「お前の」病院は機能せず、誰もいなくなった。しかし、優秀な医者のための仕事はそこら中に転がっている。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Skater"
msgstr "スケート選手"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Skater'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You spent a lot of time actively maneuvering on skates before the Cataclysm,"
" and are better at staying on your feet when checked or blocked."
msgstr "大災厄以前はスケートに明け暮れていた。接触や妨害を受けても、倒れずにいられるのが得意だ。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Martial Artist"
msgstr "格闘家"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Martial Artist'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You were shaping up to be a pretty decent student of the martial arts before"
" the Cataclysm struck.  Time to see just how good you really are."
msgstr "大災厄以前は、格闘術の腕前を磨いていた。今こそ、お前の実力を見せるときだ。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Black Belt"
msgstr "有段者"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Black Belt'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You were competitive at national levels, and had considered teaching your "
"art.  Defending against the entire town may still be a challenge, though."
msgstr "その道においては全米レベルの実力者であり、指導者としての道も考えていた。街全体が試練となろうとも、その技で守り抜いてみせる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Pugilist"
msgstr "プロボクサー"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Pugilist'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You are experienced in the Sweet Science of boxing.  You could've had a shot"
" at a local boxing tournament, if the Cataclysm hadn't screwed that up."
msgstr "ボクシングの「甘い科学」を身をもって学んできた。大災厄さえなければ、地元のボクシング大会に出場していたことだろう。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Autodoc Specialist"
msgstr "オートドック技師"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Autodoc Specialist'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You're trained in proper operation of the Autodoc, an advanced machine used "
"for surgical procedures.  Operations involving it will be moderately more "
"likely to succeed."
msgstr "高度な外科手術用機械、オートドックの正しい操作訓練を受けている。これを使用する手術の成功率がわずかに高くなる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Dungeon Master"
msgstr "ダンジョンマスター"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Dungeon Master'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Weeks spent picking through manuals and researching topics you aren't versed"
" in has taught you to find what you need to know more quickly.  You read "
"slightly faster, and suffer no reading time penalty for books too complex "
"for you to easily understand."
msgstr ""
"何週間もかけてマニュアルを読み込み、詳しくない分野を調べてきたことで、必要な知識をより素早く見つけられるようになった。一般的な人より少し早く本が読め、難解な専門書の読書速度が遅くならない。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Military Remnant"
msgstr "軍の残党"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Military Remnant'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You are a member of the United States Armed Forces, or what's left of it at "
"least."
msgstr "お前はアメリカ合衆国軍の隊員、あるいはその残党だ。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Experienced Swimmer"
msgstr "熟練スイマー"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Experienced Swimmer'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have spent a large portion of your life swimming, granting you increased"
" speed in water."
msgstr "人生の大半を水中で過ごしたことで、水中の移動速度が上昇する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Carries Brandy"
msgstr "ブランデー所持者"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Carries Brandy'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "This Bartender now carries brandy!"
msgstr "このバーテンダーはブランデーを持っている！"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Carries Rum"
msgstr "ラム酒所持者"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Carries Rum'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "This Bartender now carries rum!"
msgstr "このバーテンダーはラム酒を運んでいる！"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Carries Whiskey"
msgstr "ウイスキー所持者"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Carries Whiskey'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "This Bartender now carries whiskey!"
msgstr "このバーテンダーはウイスキーを運んでいる！"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Has Level 1 Companion Missions"
msgstr "仲間ミッションLv.1を所持"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Has Level 1 Companion Missions'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "New mission options have become available!"
msgstr "新しいミッションが利用可能になった！"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Has Level 1 Construction Built"
msgstr "建設物Lv.1を所持"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Has Level 1 Construction Built'}
#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Has Level 2 Construction Built'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "New options may have become available!"
msgstr "新しい依頼が利用可能になったかもしれない！"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Has Level 2 Construction Built"
msgstr "建設物Lv.2を所持"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Starting NPC"
msgstr "開始地点のNPC"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Starting NPC'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Marker for starting NPCs"
msgstr "開始地点のNPCを示すマーカーだ"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Static NPC"
msgstr "固定NPC"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Static NPC'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Marker for static NPCs"
msgstr "固定配置のNPCを示すマーカーだ"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Hallucination"
msgstr "幻覚"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Hallucination'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"NPC trait that makes them be hallucination.  It is a bug if you have it."
msgstr "幻覚として現れるNPCの特性だ。この特性がプレイヤーに付与されている場合、バグが発生している。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Debug Night Vision"
msgstr "夜目:デバッグ専用"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Debug Night Vision'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You can clearly see that this is for dev purposes only."
msgstr "これが開発者専用の機能であることは、誰の目にも明らかだ。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Debug Noclip"
msgstr "デバッグ用すり抜け"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Debug Noclip'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Garry?"
msgstr "ゲイリー？"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Debug Invisibility"
msgstr "不可視:デバッグ専用"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Debug Invisibility'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "If you see this, you'd best be debugging something."
msgstr "もしこれを見ているなら、何かデバッグしているのだろう。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Debug Life Support"
msgstr "生命維持:デバッグ専用"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Debug Life Support'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Holds hunger, thirst, and fatigue stable.  You can debug all year long with "
"this one!"
msgstr "空腹、喉の渇き、疲労が安定する。これがあれば一年中デバッグができる！"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Debug Deodorizer"
msgstr "無臭:デバッグ専用"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Debug Deodorizer'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Smell that bug?  Smell's certainly not coming from you!"
msgstr "バグの匂いがするか？少なくともお前からではないな！"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Debug Silent Walk"
msgstr "無音歩行:デバッグ専用"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Debug Silent Walk'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Be vewwy vewwy quiet.  We're hunting bugs."
msgstr "しーっ、静かに。バグを狩っているんだ。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Debug HVAC"
msgstr "冷暖房:デバッグ専用"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Debug HVAC'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Temperature and weather won't bug you."
msgstr "気温や天候がお前を悩ませることはない。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Debug Invincibility"
msgstr "無敵:デバッグ専用"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Debug Invincibility'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Bug-repellent forcefield."
msgstr "バグを寄せ付けない力場が発生する。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Debug Hammerspace"
msgstr "ハンマースペース:デバッグ専用"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Debug Hammerspace'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Crafting and construction requirements bugger off with this one.  Apply with"
" care."
msgstr "これがあれば、製作や建設の要件が消え失せる。取り扱いには注意しろ。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Debug Hammertime"
msgstr "ハンマースペース:デバッグ専用"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Debug Hammertime'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Crafting and construction are practically instant."
msgstr "製作と建設が事実上、一瞬で終わる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Debug Mind Control"
msgstr "洗脳:デバッグ専用"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Debug Mind Control'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Mind the bugs, would you kindly?"
msgstr "「恐縮だが」、バグに用心してくれないか？"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Debug Carrying Capacity"
msgstr "運搬制限解除:デバッグ専用"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Debug Carrying Capacity'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Lets you carry 15 bugs worth of your body weight in your mandibles."
msgstr "体重の15倍ほどの重さがあるバグを顎で持ち運べる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Debug Bionic Installation"
msgstr "義体移植:デバッグ専用"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Debug Bionic Installation'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Lets you instantly install torsion ratchets for your eight legs."
msgstr "足が8本生えていても、捻れラチェットを即座に移植できるようになる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Debug Infinite Stamina"
msgstr "スタミナ無限:デバッグ専用"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Debug Infinite Stamina'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Lets you run or swim forever (in other words, until you fix that bug)."
msgstr "永久に走ったり泳いだりできる（言い換えれば、バグを直すまで）。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Bee"
msgstr "ハチ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Bee'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"NPC trait that makes monsters see it as a bee.  It is a bug (heh) if you "
"have it."
msgstr "モンスターからハチと見なされるNPCの特性だ。この特性がプレイヤーに付与されている場合、バグ（文字通り）が発生している。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "mycus friend"
msgstr "マイカスの友"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'mycus friend'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "NPC trait that makes fungaloid monsters see this NPC as a friend."
msgstr "菌類モンスターから友人と見なされるNPCの特性だ。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "mute"
msgstr "沈黙"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'mute'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"NPC trait that makes it impossible to say anything.  It is a bug if you have"
" it."
msgstr "何も話すことができなくなるNPCの特性だ。この特性がプレイヤーに付与されている場合、バグが発生している。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Brawler"
msgstr "乱闘者"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Brawler'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Whether from personal choice or childhood trauma, using ranged weapons is "
"off-limits to you, even if your life depended on it."
msgstr "個人的な選択か、あるいは幼少期のトラウマかは不明だが、命がかかっていたとしても遠距離武器は使えない。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Gun Shy"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Gun Shy'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Whether from personal choice or childhood trauma, using firearms is "
"completely off-limits to you, even if your life depended on it.  Other "
"ranged weapons, however, are totally fine."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Nomad"
msgstr "流浪者"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Nomad'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You're too adventurous for your own good.  The more time you spend "
"somewhere, the unhappier it makes you to be there."
msgstr "冒険心が行き過ぎている。どこかに長くとどまるほど、意欲が落ち込む。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Wayfarer"
msgstr "徒歩旅行者"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Wayfarer'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Whether from personal choice or childhood trauma, traveling with vehicles is"
" off-limits to you, even if your life depended on it."
msgstr "個人的な好みか、幼少期のトラウマかは不明だが、命がかかっていても乗り物で移動することはない。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Fast Reflexes"
msgstr "高反射神経"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Fast Reflexes'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You have fast reflexes, allowing you to dodge attacks more easily."
msgstr "反射神経が優れているため、攻撃をより簡単に回避できる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Feline Flexibility"
msgstr "ネコの柔軟性"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Feline Flexibility'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your muscles, joints, and the movement center of your brain have changed "
"internally somewhat, allowing you to traverse obstacles with ease.  It also "
"helps you avoid attacks a bit more easily, and flex with falls to take less "
"damage."
msgstr ""
"筋肉、関節、そして脳の運動中枢が内面的に変化したことで、障害物を楽に乗り越えられるようになった。また、攻撃を回避しやすくなり、転倒時のダメージも軽減される。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "No ranged crit"
msgstr "遠隔クリティカルなし"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'No ranged crit'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You are not an intellectual shooter.  Your ranged shots no longer able to "
"crit, and you more likely going to hit the body or limbs rather than the "
"head."
msgstr "お前は知的な射手ではない。遠隔武器でのクリティカル攻撃は発生しなくなり、頭部ではなく胴体や手足に命中しやすくなる。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Hunted"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Hunted'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Since the start of the Cataclysm, something has been hunting you "
"relentlessly.  You can outrun it, but it always seems to find you "
"eventually.  The only escape is for one of you to die."
msgstr ""

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Lost To The Cataclysm"
msgstr "大災厄に囚われし者"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Lost To The Cataclysm'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Something inside you snapped.  Whether through wallowing in decay or by "
"otherworldly influence, the living shun you while the undead mostly ignore "
"you.  Your mind and body will deteriorate if you don't keep killing the "
"living and sane.  Your fellow lost and damned will suffice too, but that "
"might cause the others to mistake you for the living."
msgstr ""
"お前の中の何かが壊れた。荒廃に浸りきったのか、あるいは異世界の力によるものか、生者は皆お前を避け、アンデッドのほとんどはお前を無視する。生きている者や正気な者を殺し続けなければ、お前の精神と肉体は蝕まれていくだろう。同じように堕落した者も標的になり得るが、その場合、他の者にお前が生者だと勘違いされるかもしれない。"

#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Swordsman"
msgstr "剣士"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Swordsman'}
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have trained in the ways of the European nobility. Mostly useless even "
"before the Cataclysm, now the only thing worth anything is the "
"swordsmanship."
msgstr "お前はヨーロッパの貴族の流儀で訓練を受けてきた。大災厄以前でさえ大半は無益だったが、今や価値があるのはその剣術のみだ。"

#: data/json/npcs/BG_traits.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BG_traits_afs.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyborg_npcs/backgrounds/bg_traits_cyborg.json
msgid "Survivor Story"
msgstr "サバイバーの話"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Survivor Story'}
#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Survivor'}
#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Whately Story'}
#: data/json/npcs/BG_traits.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/Backgrounds/BG_traits_afs.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/npcs/cyborg_npcs/backgrounds/bg_traits_cyborg.json
msgid "This NPC could tell you about how they survived the Cataclysm"
msgstr "このNPCは、どうやって大災厄から生き延びたかをお前に語るだろう。"

#: data/json/npcs/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
msgid "Bone Seer"
msgstr "占骨術師"

#: data/json/npcs/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
msgid "I wish to sing the song of the Bones"
msgstr "私は骨の歌を歌おうとしている。"

#: data/json/npcs/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
msgid "Mark of the Seer"
msgstr "占骨術師の印"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Mark of the Seer'}
#: data/json/npcs/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
msgid "A strange occult symbol carved into your hand by Brigitte LaCroix."
msgstr "ブリジット・ラクロワによって手に奇妙で神秘的な印を刻まれた。"

#: data/json/npcs/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
msgid "Brigitte LaCroix"
msgstr "ﾌﾞﾘｼﾞｯﾄ ﾗｸﾛﾜ"

#: data/json/npcs/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
msgid "Acolyte."
msgstr "修行者よ。"

#: data/json/npcs/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
msgid "You're back. Have you come to listen to the song?"
msgstr "戻ってきたな。歌を聞きに来たか？"

#: data/json/npcs/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
msgid "You there. Quiet down. Can you hear it? The song?"
msgstr "そこのお前。静かに。この歌が聞こえるか？"

#: data/json/npcs/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
msgid "What?  What do you mean?  What song?"
msgstr "何？どういう意味？歌とは？"

#: data/json/npcs/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
msgid "So about the songs…"
msgstr "その歌について…"

#: data/json/npcs/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
msgid ""
"You mentioned some cycle before, when I gave you the bones.  What does that "
"mean?"
msgstr "骨を持ってきたときに、輪廻がどうとか言っていたな。あれはどういう意味？"

#: data/json/npcs/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
msgid "Would you like to join me on my travels?"
msgstr "私の旅に同行する気はない？"

#: data/json/npcs/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json data/json/npcs/TALK_CITY_COP.json
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_ALLY.json data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_NC_FARMER.json data/json/npcs/TALK_SURVIVOR_CHEF.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Eddie_Isherwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Jack_Isherwood.json
#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_Red.json
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/npc/TALK_HEALER_GREY.json
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/npc/TALK_OLD_MAGUS.json
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/npc/TALK_TECHNO_KID.json
msgid "Let's trade items."
msgstr "物品の取引をしようか。"

#: data/json/npcs/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
msgid "Is there a way I can help you with your song?"
msgstr "その歌について私に手伝えることはある？"

#: data/json/npcs/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
msgid "I have to get going.  Take care, Seer."
msgstr "もう行くよ。お気をつけて、占い師さん。"

#: data/json/npcs/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
msgid ""
"Listen carefully. The bones… they sing. Can you hear it? The song they "
"weave? The stories they hold?"
msgstr "注意深く耳を傾けろ。骨たちが...歌っている。聞こえるか？彼らが紡ぐ歌が？彼らが持つ物語が？"

#: data/json/npcs/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
msgid "What?  Singing bones?  What are you talking about?"
msgstr "何？歌う骨？何の話をしているんだ？"

#: data/json/npcs/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
msgid "Uh… yeah, sure.  I think I'll just be on my way."
msgstr "ええと...ああ、そうだね。もう行かないと。"

#: data/json/npcs/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
msgid ""
"When it all happened, the Cataclysm, something… changed. You can see it in "
"all creatures, but most of all their bones. They break, morph, rise again, "
"in an infinite cycle. Living dead walk. Monsters rip and tear each other "
"apart. You can see the resonance, the quiet hum of raw strength, and only by"
" taking the bones does the cycle end - their story, their song, their "
"strength, become yours to use."
msgstr ""
"大災厄が起きた時、何かが...変化した。それはあらゆる生物に見られるが、特に彼らの骨において顕著だ。骨は砕け、形を変え、再び立ち上がる。無限の輪廻だ。死人が生き返り歩きだす。化け物たちが互いを引き裂きあう。お前は共鳴、生々しい力が静かに震えているのを感じるだろう。そして骨を取って初めて、輪廻は終わる。彼らの物語や、歌や、力が、お前のものとなる。"

#: data/json/npcs/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
msgid "So what do you actually do with the bones?"
msgstr "それで、実際に骨を使って何をするんだ？"

#: data/json/npcs/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
msgid "I'm still not quite sure what you mean about songs or strength."
msgstr "歌や強さというのが、まだよく分からないんだ。"

#: data/json/npcs/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
msgid "Does anyone else, uh, believe this?"
msgstr "ええと、その話を信じている人は他にもいるのか？"

#: data/json/npcs/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
msgid ""
"Only when you crush the bones of a body does it cease to rise. Only if you "
"examine the bones can you see what was. Thus is the story. Whatever causes "
"this change is alive, moving within us all, an inevitable part of this new "
"world. It holds the power of change. When we hold the bones, we hold the "
"power. Thus the strength. Together… they form a beautiful song."
msgstr ""
"骨を砕いて初めて、その持ち主は蘇らなくなる。骨を調べて初めて、その持ち主に何があったかを知ることができる。それが物語だ。この変化を引き起こす何かは生きており、私たちすべての中で動き、この新世界を構成する必然的な一要素となっている。それは変化の力を持っている。私たちが骨を持つ時、私たちはその力を持つ。それが強さだ。二つが合わさって…美しい歌を形成する。"

#: data/json/npcs/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
msgid "I think I understand what you mean, though I am not sure if I agree."
msgstr "同意できるかはともかく、言いたいことは伝わったと思う。"

#: data/json/npcs/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
msgid ""
"There are others who follow this cause. You'd do well to aid them, for "
"though we may not be numerous, we are emboldened by the songs we carry."
msgstr "この主張に同意する者は存在する。彼らを助けるのがいいだろう。我らは多数ではないが、その歌に勇気づけられている。"

#: data/json/npcs/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
msgid "I will bear that in mind."
msgstr "心に留めておこう。"

#: data/json/npcs/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
msgid "Cause?  Why do you gather these bones anyway?"
msgstr "主張？どうして骨を集めているんだ？"

#: data/json/npcs/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
msgid ""
"The song can be weaved in many forms. Carved bone charms, weapons and armor "
"all hold immense power, and when the time comes, me and my kindred shall "
"gather a great amount of song and sing it to restore this world. Restore it,"
" or end it. Makes no difference."
msgstr ""
"歌は様々な形で紡がれる。骨を彫って作った魔除けや武器、防具はすべて計り知れない力を秘めている。時が来れば私と私の縁者たちが多くの歌を集め、それを歌ってこの世界を復元するだろう。復元するか、終わらせるか。違いはない。"

#: data/json/npcs/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
msgid "End the world?  What?"
msgstr "世界の終焉？何だって？"

#: data/json/npcs/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
msgid ""
"We believe that enough power in one song could revert the Cataclysm - or "
"accelerate it to a time beyond all, ending it all the same. But with the "
"world looking as is, both options are preferable."
msgstr ""
"一つの歌に十分な力を集めれば、大災厄を元に戻す…あるいは、時を加速させ、すべてを終わらせることができると信じている。どちらも等しく世界の終焉だ。しかし、この世界の現状を考えれば、どちらの選択肢も望ましい。"

#: data/json/npcs/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
msgid ""
"Sounds somewhat… doomsday-ish, but I suppose it's a belief like any other.  "
"Still, at least you have a goal to help the world, one way or another."
msgstr "なんだか終末思想のようだが…まあ、他の信仰と同じようなものか。それでも、何らかの形で世界を助けるという目標があるのは良いことだ。"

#: data/json/npcs/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
msgid "You're nuts."
msgstr "お前は狂っている。"

#: data/json/npcs/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
msgid ""
"Your mind is open. More than most. Perhaps one day, you too will feel the "
"power of the song and become Kindred. For now, Acolyte, listen, listen and "
"feel the song."
msgstr ""
"お前の心は開かれている。ほとんどの者よりもな。きっといつか、お前も歌の力を感じ、縁者となるだろう。今はただ、修行者よ、歌に耳を傾け、その歌を感じるのだ。"

#: data/json/npcs/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
msgid "I… thank you."
msgstr "あ…ありがとう。"

#: data/json/npcs/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
msgid ""
"Your skepticism does not surprise me. Perhaps one day, you too will hear the"
" inevitability of the song, feel its power. But until then, you will remain "
"an Acolyte, path to the Kindred closed."
msgstr ""
"お前が懐疑的でも驚かない。きっといつか、お前も歌の必然性を聞き、その力を感じる時がくるだろう。だが、それまではお前は修行者であり続け、縁者への道は閉ざされたままだ。"

#: data/json/npcs/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
msgid "Yeah, alright."
msgstr "ああ、分かった。"

#: data/json/npcs/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
msgid "Gather Bones"
msgstr "骨集め"

#. ~ Description for mission '{'str': 'Gather Bones'}'
#: data/json/npcs/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
msgid "Gather bones for Brigitte LaCroix.  About 8 should do it."
msgstr "ブリジット・ラクロワのために骨を集めろ。8個あれば十分だ。"

#: data/json/npcs/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
msgid "There is always work to be done, song to be woven."
msgstr "やるべき仕事は常にあり、紡ぐべき歌もある。"

#: data/json/npcs/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
msgid ""
"If you wish to be set on the path to enlightenment, first you must learn to "
"listen and hear the song.  Go out, butcher a creature and feel the power "
"between your fingertips.  Then bring me the bones and I shall carve them for"
" you."
msgstr ""
"悟りへの道を歩みたいなら、まず歌に耳を傾け、それを聞く術を学べ。外に出て生き物を解体し、指先で力を感じ取れ。そして骨を持ってくるのだ。私がそれを彫刻してやろう。"

#: data/json/npcs/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
msgid "Excellent.  Now be on your way."
msgstr "素晴らしい。さあ、行くのだ。"

#: data/json/npcs/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
msgid ""
"I understand your reluctancy.  Feel free to return when you see the way."
msgstr "お前が気が進まないのは理解できる。道が見えたら戻ってくるといい。"

#: data/json/npcs/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
msgid ""
"The shambling corpses we see all around move in discord.  Their song can be "
"used, but for an Acolyte, this would be needlessly hard.  Be sure to carve "
"an unspoiled living creature."
msgstr ""
"周りで見かける歩く死体は、不協和音を奏でている。奴らの歌も使えるが、修行者のお前には無駄に難しいだろう。汚されていない生きた生物を解体するようにしろ。"

#: data/json/npcs/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
msgid "Have you felt the song in your hands yet?"
msgstr "もうその手で歌を感じたか？"

#: data/json/npcs/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
msgid ""
"And so, another cycle ends.  You have done well.  I will now bestow my mark "
"upon you, so that others may know the path you walk and aid you."
msgstr "そして、また一つの輪廻が終わる。お前はよくやった。今、私の印をお前に授けよう。お前が歩む道を知り、助けてくれる者が現れるだろう。"

#: data/json/npcs/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
msgid "So you say, but the song sings otherwise."
msgstr "お前はそう言うが、歌は違うと告げている。"

#: data/json/npcs/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
msgid "Then you shall try again, until you hear."
msgstr "ならば、聞こえるまで何度も試すのだ。"

#: data/json/npcs/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
msgid ""
"The song is… quiet for now.  Perhaps with time, more notes will be etched in"
" the bones of this world."
msgstr "歌は…今は静かだ。おそらく時が経てば、この世界の骨にもっと多くの音符が刻まれるだろう。"

#: data/json/npcs/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
msgid "An acolyte should not take on too many songs at once."
msgstr "修行者は一度に多くの歌を受け入れるべきではない。"

#: data/json/npcs/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
msgid "That is all for now."
msgstr "今のところ、話すことはそれだけだ。"

#: data/json/npcs/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
msgid "There are bones to etch, songs to sing.  Wish to join me?"
msgstr "彫るべき骨があり、歌うべき歌がある。私に加わるか？"

#: data/json/npcs/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
msgid "Do you wish to take on more songs?"
msgstr "これ以上、歌を引き受ける気か？"

#: data/json/npcs/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
msgid "Do you believe you can take on the burden of additional bones?"
msgstr "これ以上の骨をお前に負担させられると思っているのか？"

#: data/json/npcs/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
msgid "A song may yet be sung by you, should you wish to."
msgstr "お前が望むなら、歌うこともできるだろう。"

#: data/json/npcs/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
msgid "There is an additional song you could take on, if you'd like."
msgstr "必要があれば、もっと歌を用意しよう。"

#: data/json/npcs/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
msgid ""
"I know of certain bones that could be of use, if you'd like to know more."
msgstr "もっと知りたいのなら、役に立つかもしれない骨について心当たりがある。"

#: data/json/npcs/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_bartender.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_carpenter2.json
#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
msgid "I see."
msgstr "なるほどね。"

#: data/json/npcs/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_TRUE_FOODPERSON.json
#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
msgid "I'm listening."
msgstr "話してくれ。"

#: data/json/npcs/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
msgid "Perhaps another time, Seer."
msgstr "またいつか会おう、占い師さん。"

#: data/json/npcs/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
msgid ""
"If you wish to be set on the path to enlightenment, first you must learn to "
"listen and hear the song. Go out, butcher a creature and feel the power "
"between your fingertips. Then bring me the bones and I shall carve them for "
"you. "
msgstr ""
"悟りへの道を望むならば、まず耳を澄ませてその歌を聞き、感じ取ることだ。外に出て生き物を屠り、指先でその力を感じ取れ。さすれば、その骨に刻んでやろう。"

#: data/json/npcs/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
msgid "Well, I guess I oughta see where this goes.  I'm in."
msgstr "ああ、その話をもっと詳しく知りたい。協力するよ。"

#: data/json/npcs/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
#: data/json/npcs/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_ROBOFAC_INTERCOM.json
#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
msgid "Not interested."
msgstr "興味が無いね。"

#: data/json/npcs/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
msgid "Excellent. Now be on your way."
msgstr "素晴らしい。さあ取り掛かるのだ。"

#: data/json/npcs/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
msgid "Consider it done.  But I also wanted to ask…"
msgstr "仕事は終わったけど、私からも尋ねたいことがある..."

#: data/json/npcs/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
msgid "Where should I start?"
msgstr "何から始めればいい？"

#: data/json/npcs/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
msgid "Can you share some equipment to aid me in this?"
msgstr "私の活動に役立つ道具を分けてもらえない？"

#: data/json/npcs/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
msgid "I'm off then."
msgstr "もう行くよ。"

#: data/json/npcs/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
msgid ""
"The shambling corpses we see all around move in discord. Their song can be "
"used, but for an Acolyte, this would be needlessly hard. Be sure to carve an"
" unspoiled living creature."
msgstr ""
"いたるところで見かける動く死体は、不協和音を奏でながら動いている。あれらの歌を聞くこともできるが、修行の身には無駄に難しいだろう。自然のままの生き物を解体するようにしろ。"

#: data/json/npcs/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
msgid "So, a creature that isn't a zombie, or a monster.  Got it."
msgstr "つまり、ゾンビでも怪物でもない普通の生物だな。分かったよ。"

#: data/json/npcs/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
msgid ""
"The path to enlightenment is for you to walk. For me to aid you would "
"ultimately impede your progress and muddle your song."
msgstr "悟りへの道はお前自身で歩め。私の助けはお前の歩みを妨げ、お前の歌を迷わせることになる。"

#: data/json/npcs/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
msgid "I see.  Very well then."
msgstr "なるほど。よく分かったよ。"

#: data/json/npcs/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
msgid ""
"You bear my mark, meaning I believe you have potential to learn to truly "
"listen to the Song. Yes, I will lend my skills to you, for now."
msgstr "私はお前に印を与えた。つまり、お前が歌を聞く方法を学び取れるかもしれないと信じている。ああ、ひとまずは私の力を貸し与えよう。"

#: data/json/npcs/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
msgid "Only those who bear my mark will prove themselves worthy of my skills."
msgstr "私の力を示せるのは、私が印を与えた者だけだ。"

#: data/json/npcs/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
msgid "I am glad to hear it. Let's go then."
msgstr "そう言ってもらえると嬉しいよ。さあ行こう。"

#: data/json/npcs/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
msgid "That's good, but I need to go at it alone right now.  Maybe later."
msgstr "良い提案だが、今は一人で取り組みたいことがある。またいつか聞いてくれ。"

#: data/json/npcs/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
msgid ""
"I understand your reluctancy. Feel free to return when you see the way."
msgstr "気が進まないことは理解できる。道を見出したらまた来なさい。"

#: data/json/npcs/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
msgid "Maybe some other time.  Changing the topic…"
msgstr "どうだろうな。話を変えよう…"

#: data/json/npcs/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
#: data/mods/DinoMod/NPC/NC_BO_BARONYX.json
msgid "Alright, but I have to go now."
msgstr "なるほど。私はもう行くよ。"

#: data/json/npcs/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
msgid ""
"It's not just walking horrors and monsters that have changed with the "
"Cataclysm. It started a… cycle, of sorts. Everything repeats. We can only "
"see it in others, but it happens to us, even you and I. How many times have "
"you fallen? Your flesh rent from your body, devoured. Or perhaps it was the "
"quiet whimper of death to exposure. But your bones rose again. Different "
"flesh, different name, sometimes even different knowledge, but the bones, "
"the same. We are all trapped in the same cycle. We just keep forgetting. "
"That's why we need to amass the Song. That's why it has to end, even if it "
"means the destruction, not restoration."
msgstr ""
"大災厄で変わったのは、歩く死体や怪物だけではない。ある種の...輪廻が生まれたのだ。全ては繰り返される。自分自身の輪廻は知覚できないが、我ら全て、つまりお前にも、私にも起こることだ。お前は何度倒れた？お前は身体から肉を剥がされ、食い尽くされる。あるいはかすかな呻き声とともに死に絶える。だが、お前の骨は再び立ち上がる。異なる肉、異なる名、時には異なる記憶を同じ骨に纏って。我らは皆同じ輪廻に囚われている。ただ忘却し続ける。だからこそ、我らは歌を集める必要がある。それが、復活ではなく破壊を意味するとしても終焉を目指さねばならない理由だ。"

#: data/json/npcs/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
msgid ""
"That is… that's really one hell of a belief.  Well, if it helps you deal "
"with the world, who am I to argue."
msgstr "それは...とてつもない信念だな。でも、それがお前の生きる支えになっているなら、私が口を挟むべきことではないだろう。"

#: data/json/npcs/NPC_Brigitte_LaCroix.json
msgid "And here I thought you were nuts before.  I'm out of here."
msgstr "前に狂人だと思ったが、やっぱりそうだったな。もう行くよ。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CITY_COP.json
msgid "Hi there, <name_g>."
msgstr "やあ、<name_g>。"

#: data/json/npcs/TALK_CITY_COP.json
msgid ""
"STOP, Put your hands in the air! Ha, startled you didn't I…there is no law "
"anymore..."
msgstr "止まれ、両手を上げろ！はっ、驚いたか？…もう法律なんてありゃしない…"

