#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "When we drinkin'?"
msgstr "いつ飲むんだ？"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "When was the last time I had a drink?"
msgstr "最後にいつ水を飲んだっけな？"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "I'm parched, I need to drink something."
msgstr "喉が渇いてひどい。何か飲まないと。"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "I'm thirsty…"
msgstr "喉が渇いた…"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "I'm <very> thirsty."
msgstr "<very>喉が渇いた。"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "I'm <swear> thirsty."
msgstr "<swear>、喉が渇いた。"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "Can you give me something to drink, <name_g>?"
msgstr "<name_g>、何か飲むものをくれないか？"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "I <really> need to get some water."
msgstr "<really>水分が必要なんだ。"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "<ill_die> if I don't drink something."
msgstr "何か飲まないと、<ill_die>。"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "Water…  Is there an oasis nearby?"
msgstr "み、水...。近くにオアシスでもないか？"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "Did you know that lack of water kills faster than lack of rest?"
msgstr "水分の不足が、他の何よりも早く命を奪うって知ってたか？"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "I can't remember the last time I was this thirsty."
msgstr "こんなに喉が渇いたのは、いつ以来か思い出せない...。"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "I'd kill for a sip of water right now."
msgstr "今すぐ一杯の水のためなら、人だって殺せる気分だ。"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid ""
"Yeah sure, can't help but notice you got beer with you!  Let's crack a cold "
"one and chat, <name_g>, how goes it?"
msgstr "ああ、もちろん。君がビールを持ってることには気づいてるさ！冷えたのを飲みながら話そうじゃないか、<name_g>。調子はどうだ？"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid ""
"Oh definitely, how about one of those beers I see on you?  What's up anyway?"
msgstr "ああ、もちろん。君が持ってるビールを一本分けてくれないか？それで、調子はどうだ？"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid ""
"Yeah you share those beers I see you hoarding and then we chat all you like!"
"  Only joking, what's up <name_g>?"
msgstr "ああ、君が溜め込んでるビールを分けてくれるなら、いくらでも付き合うさ！なんてな、冗談だよ。<name_g>、調子はどう？"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid ""
"Hey <name_g>, I bet a chat would be all the sweeter with a nice, cold beer "
"in hand.  How's it going?"
msgstr "<name_g>、冷たいビールでもあれば、おしゃべりももっと楽しくなるんじゃないか？近況はどう？"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid ""
"While we chat, what say you we open a beer and just… pretend the world isn't"
" ending, just for a while?"
msgstr "話しながらビールでも開けて…しばらくの間だけ、世界が終わってないふりをするってのはどうだい？"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "Hey, sure thing, <name_g>, I need a break anyway, how are you?"
msgstr "ああ、もちろんさ、<name_g>。ちょうど一息入れたかったところなんだ。君の方はどうだい？"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "Yeah OK, <name_g>, how's it going?"
msgstr "ああ、いいとも。<name_g>、どうしてる？"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "Sure, let's shoot the shit!  You OK?"
msgstr "ああ、バカ話でもしようぜ！そっちは元気か？"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "Why not?  How you doing?"
msgstr "断る理由がないだろ？調子はどうだ？"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "I'm OK with that, what's up?"
msgstr "ああ、いいぜ。なんかあったか？"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "I can spare a few minutes, how's things?"
msgstr "数分なら付き合えるぜ。そっちはどうだ？"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "Sure thing <name_g>, you good?"
msgstr "もちろんだ、<name_g>。元気でやってるか？"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "Alright, you got something to get off your chest?"
msgstr "ああ、いいとも。何か話したいことでもあるのか？"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "Always ready for a good chat!  But why, you OK?"
msgstr "いつでもいい話を聞く準備はできてるぜ！でも、どうかしたのか？大丈夫か？"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "OK <name_g>, we should get to know each other, how are you coping?"
msgstr "分かったよ、<name_g>。お互いのことを知るべきだな。最近は、どう切り抜けてる？"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "Definitely, I'm game.  How you holding up?"
msgstr "もちろんだ、その話乗った。君は持ちこたえているか？"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid ""
"Good idea <name_g>.  Let's forget the world for a while.  How you doin'?"
msgstr "いいな、<name_g>。しばらくの間、世界のことは忘れようぜ。調子はどうだ？"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
