#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"A small belt driven mechanical pump capable of achieving a vacuum of -29.99 "
"hg (50 microns)."
msgstr "真空到達度-29.99hg (50ミクロン)のベルト駆動式小型機械ポンプだ。"

