#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "high quality shatter"
msgid_plural "high quality shatter"
msgstr[0] "高品質シャッター"

#. ~ Use action activation_message for {'str_sp': 'high quality shatter'}.
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "You take a dab. Wow that's got some killer terpenes!"
msgstr "ダブを使った。うわ、すごいテルペンだ！"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'high quality shatter'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"Concentrated cannabis extract, commonly known as dabs.  This particular "
"style of concentrate in is a thin sheet and shatters like glass at room "
"temperature.  Argueably its one of the better styles of concentrate compared"
" to wax, crumble, or distilate.  Normal cannabis contains around 20%THC, "
"this shatter should be around 55%THC."
msgstr ""
"濃縮された大麻抽出物で、一般にダブとして知られている。この特殊なスタイルの濃縮物は薄いシート状で、室温ではガラスのように砕ける。ワックス、クランブル、ディスティレートと比較しても、間違いなく最高の濃縮物の一つだ。通常の大麻がTHCを約20%含むのに対し、このシャッターは約55%のTHCを含んでいるはずだ。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "high quality wax"
msgid_plural "high quality wax"
msgstr[0] "高品質ワックス"

#. ~ Use action activation_message for {'str_sp': 'high quality wax'}.
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "You take a dab of some wax.  *cough cough* good stuff!"
msgstr "ワックスをダブで使った。ゲホッゲホッ、良いものだ！"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'high quality wax'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"Concentrated cannabis extract, commonly known as dabs.  This particular "
"style of concentrate has the look and consistency of a yellow waxy substance"
" at room temperature.  Normal cannabis contains around 20%THC, this wax "
"should be around 45%THC."
msgstr ""
"濃縮された大麻抽出物で、一般にダブとして知られている。この特殊なスタイルの濃縮物は、室温で黄色いワックス状の見た目と粘度を持つ。通常の大麻がTHCを約20%含むのに対し、このワックスは約45%のTHCを含んでいるはずだ。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "high quality crude oil"
msgid_plural "high quality crude oil"
msgstr[0] "高品質原油"

#. ~ Use action activation_message for {'str_sp': 'high quality crude oil'}.
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "You smoke some bad dabs.  Not a good idea."
msgstr "粗悪なダブを吸った。やめておくべきだった。"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'high quality crude oil'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"This is high quality concentrated oil derived from cannabis.  It still has "
"some residual solvents in it so it needs to be purged in a vacuum oven, "
"whipped over a heated surface, or distilled before it is safe to consume."
msgstr ""
"これは大麻から抽出された高品質の濃縮オイルだ。まだ残留溶剤が残っているため、安全に消費するには、真空オーブンでパージするか、加熱した表面で撹拌するか、あるいは蒸留する必要がある。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "low quality crude oil"
msgid_plural "low quality crude oil"
msgstr[0] "低品質原油"

#. ~ Use action activation_message for {'str_sp': 'low quality crude oil'}.
#. ~ Use action activation_message for {'str_sp': 'filtered low quality crude
#. oil'}.
#. ~ Use action activation_message for {'str_sp': 'filtered high quality crude
#. oil'}.
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "You smoke some really bad dabs.  Not a good idea."
msgstr "本当に粗悪なダブを吸ってしまった。やめておくべきだった。"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'low quality crude oil'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"This is low quality concentrated oil derived from cannabis.  It still has "
"some residual solvents in it so it needs to be purged in a vacuum oven, "
"whipped over a heated surface, or distilled before it is safe to consume."
msgstr ""
"これは大麻から抽出された低品質の濃縮オイルだ。まだ残留溶剤が残っているため、安全に消費するには、真空オーブンでパージするか、加熱した表面で撹拌するか、あるいは蒸留する必要がある。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "(ethanol) low quality crude oil"
msgid_plural "(ethanol) low quality crude oil"
msgstr[0] "(エタノール) 低品質原油"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': '(ethanol) low quality crude oil'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"This is low quality concentrated oil derived from cannabis thats been "
"diluted in ethanol and heated over a hotplate.  The next step would be to "
"filter it through a buchner flask."
msgstr "これはエタノールで希釈し、ホットプレートで加熱した、大麻由来の低品質濃縮オイルだ。次の工程は、ブフナーフラスコで濾過することになる。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "(ethanol) high quality crude oil"
msgid_plural "(ethanol) high quality crude oil"
msgstr[0] "(エタノール) 高品質原油"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': '(ethanol) high quality crude oil'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"This is high quality concentrated oil derived from cannabis thats been "
"diluted in ethanol and heated over a hotplate.  The next step would be to "
"filter it through a buchner flask."
msgstr "これはエタノールで希釈し、ホットプレートで加熱した、大麻由来の高品質濃縮オイルだ。次の工程は、ブフナーフラスコで濾過することになる。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "(ethanol) filtered low quality crude oil"
msgid_plural "(ethanol) filtered low quality crude oil"
msgstr[0] "(エタノール) 濾過済み低品質原油"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': '(ethanol) filtered low quality crude oil'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"This is low quality concentrated oil derived from cannabis thats been "
"diluted in ethanol, heated over a hotplate, and filtered through a buchner "
"flask.  The next step would be to run it through a rotovap."
msgstr ""
"これはエタノールで希釈し、ホットプレートで加熱し、ブフナーフラスコで濾過した、大麻由来の低品質濃縮オイルだ。次の工程は、ロータベイパーにかけることだろう。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "(ethanol) filtered high quality crude oil"
msgid_plural "(ethanol) filtered high quality crude oil"
msgstr[0] "(エタノール) 濾過済み高品質原油"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': '(ethanol) filtered high quality crude oil'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"This is high quality concentrated oil derived from cannabis thats been "
"diluted in ethanol, heated over a hotplate, and filtered through a buchner "
"flask.  The next step would be to run it through a rotovap."
msgstr ""
"これはエタノールで希釈し、ホットプレートで加熱し、ブフナーフラスコで濾過した、大麻由来の高品質濃縮オイルだ。次の工程は、ロータベイパーにかけることだろう。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "filtered low quality crude oil"
msgid_plural "filtered low quality crude oil"
msgstr[0] "濾過済み低品質原油"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'filtered low quality crude oil'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"This is low quality concentrated oil derived from cannabis thats been "
"diluted in ethanol, heated over a hotplate, filtered through a buchner "
"flask, and all the ethanol recovered using a rotary evaporator.  It is ready"
" for the distillation."
msgstr ""
"これは、大麻由来の低品質濃縮オイルをエタノールで希釈し、ホットプレートで加熱し、ブフナーフラスコで濾過し、ロータリエバポレーターを使ってすべてのエタノールを回収したものだ。蒸留の準備ができている。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "dab pen (on)"
msgid_plural "dab pens (on)"
msgstr[0] "ダブペン [作動中]"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'dab pen (on)', 'str_pl': 'dab pens (on)'}.
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "You turn off the dab pen."
msgstr "ダブペンの電源を切った。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'dab pen (on)', 'str_pl': 'dab pens (on)'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"This dab pen, for vaporizing cannabis, is turned on.  Now all you need is "
"'thc distillate' and you're ready to rock and roll."
msgstr "この大麻を気化させるためのダブペンは電源が入っている。あとは『THCディスティレート』さえあれば、すぐにでも始められる。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "filtered high quality crude oil"
msgid_plural "filtered high quality crude oil"
msgstr[0] "濾過済み高品質原油"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'filtered high quality crude oil'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"This is high quality concentrated oil derived from cannabis thats been "
"diluted in ethanol, heated over a hotplate, filtered through a buchner "
"flask, and all the ethanol recovered using a rotary evaporator.  It is ready"
" for the distillation."
msgstr ""
"これは、大麻由来の高品質濃縮オイルをエタノールで希釈し、ホットプレートで加熱し、ブフナーフラスコで濾過し、ロータリエバポレーターを使ってすべてのエタノールを回収したものだ。蒸留の準備ができている。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "high quality distillate (heads)"
msgid_plural "high quality distillate (heads)"
msgstr[0] "高品質ディスティレート (ヘッド)"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'high quality distillate (heads)'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"Concentrated cannabis extract.  This is the 'heads' portion from a distilled"
" batch of crude oil.  It still needs to be ran through a lab grade still one"
" more time before its a finished product."
msgstr "濃縮大麻抽出物。これは原油の蒸留バッチから採れた『ヘッド』の部分だ。完成品にするには、ラボグレードの蒸留器でもう一度処理する必要がある。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "high quality distillate (tails)"
msgid_plural "high quality distillate (tails)"
msgstr[0] "高品質ディスティレート (テール)"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'high quality distillate (tails)'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"Concentrated cannabis extract.  This material is the 'tails' portion from a "
"distilled batch of crude oil.  It needs to be ran through a lab grade still "
"another time."
msgstr "濃縮大麻抽出物。この材料は原油の蒸留バッチから採れた『テール』の部分だ。ラボグレードの蒸留器でもう一度処理する必要がある。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "high quality distillate"
msgid_plural "high quality distillate"
msgstr[0] "高品質ディスティレート"

#. ~ Use action activation_message for {'str_sp': 'high quality distillate'}.
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "You take a dab of some distillate.  Sooooo smooth..."
msgstr "ディスティレートをダブで使った。とぉってもスムーズだ..."

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'high quality distillate'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"Concentrated cannabis extract.  This style of extract goes through the most "
"processing, eliminating most if not all harmful ingredients.  Normal "
"cannabis contains around 20%THC, this distillate should be around 88%THC.  "
"Can be smoked in a bowl, used in a dab pen, or used to make distillate "
"cartridges."
msgstr ""
"濃縮大麻抽出物。このスタイルの抽出物は最も多くの加工を経ており、ほとんどすべての有害成分が除去されている。通常の大麻がTHCを約20%含むのに対し、このディスティレートは約88%のTHCを含んでいるはずだ。ボウルで吸う、ダブペンで使う、ディスティレート・カートリッジを作るのに使用できる。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "high quality distillate cartridge"
msgid_plural "high quality distillate cartridges"
msgstr[0] "高品質ディスティレート・カートリッジ"

#. ~ Use action activation_message for {'str': 'high quality distillate
#. cartridge'}.
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "You hit your dab pen.  Sooooo smooth..."
msgstr "ダブペンを吸った。とぉってもスムーズだ..."

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'high quality distillate cartridge'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"A small cartridge containing concentrated cannabis extract thats used with "
"dab pens.  This style of extract goes through the most processing, "
"eliminating most if not all harmful ingredients.  Normal cannabis contains "
"around 20%THC, this distillate should be around 70%THC after reintroducing "
"terpenes for flavoring."
msgstr ""
"ダブペンと共に使用される、濃縮大麻抽出物が入った小さなカートリッジだ。このスタイルの抽出物は最も多くの加工を経ており、ほとんどすべての有害成分が除去されている。通常の大麻がTHCを約20%含むのに対し、このディスティレートはテルペンで風味を再添加した後で、THCを約70%含んでいるはずだ。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "small closed loop extractor"
msgid_plural "small closed loop extractors"
msgstr[0] "小型クローズドループ抽出装置"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'small closed loop extractor'}.
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "You turn on the small closed loop extractor."
msgstr "小型クローズドループ抽出機の電源を入れた。"

#. ~ Use action need_charges_msg for {'str': 'small closed loop extractor'}.
#. ~ Use action need_charges_msg for {'str': 'small closed loop extractor
#. (on)', 'str_pl': 'small closed loop extractors (on)'}.
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "The small closed loop extractor's batteries need more charge."
msgstr "小型クローズドループ抽出機のバッテリーはもっと充電が必要だ。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'small closed loop extractor'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"A small closed loop extractor used for extracting essential oils from "
"organic material producing a high quality extract.  It consists of a long "
"metal tube clamped onto a steel \"honey pot\".  Organic material is packed "
"in the tube, flushed with solvent, and essential oils gathered from the pot."
"  Must be powered up to operate."
msgstr ""
"有機物から高品質のエッセンシャルオイルを抽出するための小型クローズドループ抽出装置だ。スチール製の「蜜瓶」に、金属製の長いチューブが固定されている。有機物をチューブに詰め、溶剤を流し込むことで、エッセンシャルオイルが瓶に集まる。作動させるには電力が必要だ。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "small closed loop extractor (on)"
msgid_plural "small closed loop extractors (on)"
msgstr[0] "小型クローズドループ抽出機 [作動中]"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'small closed loop extractor (on)', 'str_pl':
#. 'small closed loop extractors (on)'}.
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "You turn off the small closed loop extractor."
msgstr "小型クローズドループ抽出機の電源を切った。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'small closed loop extractor (on)', 'str_pl':
#. 'small closed loop extractors (on)'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"The small closed loop extractor is running, it just needs some material to "
"pack the tube with and an organic solvent like butane and it's good to go."
msgstr "小型クローズドループ抽出機は稼働中だ。あとはチューブに詰める材料と、ブタンのような有機溶剤があればすぐに使用できる。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "large closed loop extractor"
msgid_plural "large closed loop extractors"
msgstr[0] "大型クローズドループ抽出装置"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'large closed loop extractor'}.
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "You turn on the large closed loop extractor."
msgstr "大型クローズドループ抽出機の電源を入れた。"

#. ~ Use action need_charges_msg for {'str': 'large closed loop extractor'}.
#. ~ Use action need_charges_msg for {'str': 'large closed loop extractor
#. (on)', 'str_pl': 'large closed loop extractors (on)'}.
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "The large closed loop extractor's batteries need more charge."
msgstr "大型クローズドループ抽出機のバッテリーはもっと充電が必要だ。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'large closed loop extractor'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"A large machine used for extracting essential oils from large batches of "
"organic material producing a low quality crude oil.  It consists of three "
"long metal tubes funneled into a large drum that's set horizontally.  A "
"series of hoses and tubes come out of the machine going to different valves."
"  It needs to be powered up to operate."
msgstr ""
"大量の有機物から低品質の粗油を抽出するために使う大型機械だ。水平に置かれた大きな円筒に3本の長い金属製チューブが接続され、さらに一連のホースとチューブが異なるバルブへと伸びている。作動させるには電力が必要だ。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "large closed loop extractor (on)"
msgid_plural "large closed loop extractors (on)"
msgstr[0] "大型クローズドループ抽出機 [作動中]"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'large closed loop extractor (on)', 'str_pl':
#. 'large closed loop extractors (on)'}.
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "You turn off the large closed loop extractor."
msgstr "大型クローズドループ抽出機の電源を切った。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'large closed loop extractor (on)', 'str_pl':
#. 'large closed loop extractors (on)'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"The large closed loop extractor is running, it just needs some material to "
"pack the tube with and an organic solvent like butane and it's good to go."
msgstr "大型クローズドループ抽出機は稼働中だ。あとはチューブに詰める材料と、ブタンのような有機溶剤があればすぐに使用できる。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "makeshift essential oil extractor"
msgid_plural "makeshift essential oil extractors"
msgstr[0] "簡易エッセンシャルオイル抽出装置"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'makeshift essential oil extractor'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"A makeshift extraction system.  It's pretty much just a 55gal drum, a pipe "
"to stir the solution, and a faucet at the bottom to drain the extractor.  "
"Not the most ideal piece of equipment but it will work."
msgstr ""
"簡易的な抽出システムだ。容量200Lのドラム缶に、溶液をかき混ぜるためのパイプと、排出用の蛇口が底に付いているだけの必要最低限の構成である。理想的な装置ではないが、機能するだろう。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "qualitative filter paper"
msgid_plural "qualitative filter paper"
msgstr[0] "定性ろ紙"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'qualitative filter paper'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"filter paper for seperating solids from liquids.  This filter paper has a "
"rating of 2 microns, seperating more solids out than quantitative filter "
"paper but the process takes longer."
msgstr "液体から固体を分離するためのろ紙。孔径は2µmで、定量ろ紙よりも多くの固形物を分離できるが、その分プロセスに時間がかかる。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "quantitative filter paper"
msgid_plural "quantitative filter paper"
msgstr[0] "定量ろ紙"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'quantitative filter paper'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"filter paper for seperating solids from liquids.  This filter paper has a "
"rating of 20 microns, seperating less solids out than qualitative filter "
"paper but the process is much faster."
msgstr "液体から固体を分離するためのろ紙。孔径は20µmで、分離できる固形物は定性ろ紙よりも少ないが、プロセスははるかに速い。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "recovery pump"
msgid_plural "recovery pumps"
msgstr[0] "回収ポンプ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'recovery pump'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"A medium sized vacuum pump designed to recover solvent (hydrocarbons) from "
"extracted essential oils."
msgstr "抽出したエッセンシャルオイルから溶剤 (炭化水素) を回収するために設計された中型の真空ポンプだ。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "Directional EMP CBM"
msgid_plural "Directional EMP CBMs"
msgstr[0] "指向性EMP発生器CBM"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Directional EMP CBM'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"Small parabolic EMP field generators that are mounted in the palm of the "
"user's right hand.  These can be used to instantly fire a wide, but short-"
"ranged blast which will disable electronics and robots."
msgstr ""
"使用者の右手の掌に埋め込まれる小型の放物線状EMPフィールド発生器だ。これを使用し、短距離の広い範囲に存在する電子機器やロボットに対し、EMPブラストを即座に放射して無力化できる。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Obsolete Bionic'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"The effects of this bionic in the code have been replaced with Bionic "
"Infolink, so this should no longer spawn.  If you're still finding these in "
"the wild, update your mods."
msgstr ""
"コード内のこのバイオニックの効果は『バイオニック・インフォリンク』に置き換えられたため、これらはもう出現しないはずだ。もし野生でまだ見つけるなら、modsを更新しなさい。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "Internal Chronometer CBM installation data"
msgid_plural "Internal Chronometer CBM installation data"
msgstr[0] "CBMデータ [体内精密時計]"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'Internal Chronometer CBM installation data'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"Precise step-by-step instructions and other required data for installation "
"of Internal Chronometer CBM, stored on a data card of proprietary form-"
"factor, designed to be used extensively by an Autodoc, and allowing bionic "
"installation with minimal failure chance.  Integrated security subroutine "
"renders it unusable after installation."
msgstr ""
"体内精密時計CBMの移植に必要な正確な手順とその他のデータが保存された、独自規格のフォームファクターを持つデータカードだ。オートドックでの使用を想定しており、義体移植時の失敗の可能性を最小限に抑える。内蔵されたセキュリティサブルーチンにより、移植完了後に再使用はできなくなる。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "Weather Reader CBM installation data"
msgid_plural "Weather Reader CBM installation data"
msgstr[0] "CBMデータ [気象表示装置]"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'Weather Reader CBM installation data'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"Precise step-by-step instructions and other required data for installation "
"of Weather Reader CBM, stored on a data card of proprietary form-factor, "
"designed to be used extensively by an Autodoc, and allowing bionic "
"installation with minimal failure chance.  Integrated security subroutine "
"renders it unusable after installation."
msgstr ""
"気象表示装置CBMの移植に必要な正確な手順とその他のデータが保存された、独自規格のフォームファクターを持つデータカードだ。オートドックでの使用を想定しており、義体移植時の失敗の可能性を最小限に抑える。内蔵されたセキュリティサブルーチンにより、移植完了後に再使用はできなくなる。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "makeshift arc welder"
msgid_plural "makeshift arc welders"
msgstr[0] "簡易アーク溶接機"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'makeshift arc welder'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"This crude arc welder has been fashioned from a few small transformers, some"
" wire, improvised electrode holder and complete disregard for personal "
"safety.  While it's not as efficient as a factory welder, it will serve in a"
" pinch."
msgstr ""
"いくつかの小型変圧器、銅線、即席の電極ホルダーを、個人の安全を完全に無視して組み上げて作られた粗悪なアーク溶接機だ。工場製の溶接機ほど効率的ではないが、いざという時には役立つだろう。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "chunk of lobster meat"
msgid_plural "chunks of lobster meat"
msgstr[0] "ロブスターの肉片"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'chunk of lobster meat', 'str_pl': 'chunks of
#. lobster meat'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "A chunk of uncooked lobster meat."
msgstr "調理前のロブスターの肉片。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "cooked lobster"
msgid_plural "cooked lobster"
msgstr[0] "調理済みロブスター"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'cooked lobster'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "A chunk of delicious cooked lobster meat."
msgstr "美味しい調理済みロブスターの肉片。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "smoked lobster"
msgid_plural "smoked lobster"
msgstr[0] "燻製ロブスター"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'smoked lobster'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"Tasty lobster that has been heavily smoked for long term preservation.  It "
"could be further smoked to dehydrate it completely."
msgstr "長期保存のために強く燻製された美味しいロブスター。さらに燻製することで、完全に乾燥させることもできる。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "dehydrated lobster"
msgid_plural "dehydrated lobster"
msgstr[0] "乾燥ロブスター"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'dehydrated lobster'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"Dehydrated lobster flakes.  With proper storage, this dried food will remain"
" edible for an incredibly long time."
msgstr "乾燥ロブスターフレーク。適切に保存すれば、この乾燥食品は驚くほど長期間食べられる状態を保つ。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "rehydrated lobster"
msgid_plural "rehydrated lobster"
msgstr[0] "復元ロブスター"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'rehydrated lobster'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"Reconstituted lobster flakes, which are much more enjoyable to eat now that "
"they have been rehydrated."
msgstr "水分を復元させたロブスターフレーク。水分が戻ったことで、はるかに美味しく食べられるようになった。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "pickled lobster"
msgid_plural "pickled lobster"
msgstr[0] "ロブスターの酢漬け"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'pickled lobster'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"This is a serving of crisply brined and canned lobster.  Tasty and "
"nutritious."
msgstr "カリッと塩漬けにして缶詰にしたロブスターの一人前だ。美味しくて栄養豊富。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "salted lobster slice"
msgid_plural "salted lobster slices"
msgstr[0] "塩漬けロブスタースライス"

#. ~ Description for salted lobster slice
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "lobster slices cured in brine.  Salty but tasty in a pinch."
msgstr "塩水で加工されたロブスタースライス。塩辛いが、いざという時には美味しい。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "canned lobster"
msgid_plural "canned lobster"
msgstr[0] "ロブスターの缶詰"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'canned lobster'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"Low-sodium preserved lobster.  It was boiled and canned.  Contains most of "
"the nutrition, but little of the savor of cooked lobster."
msgstr "低ナトリウムのロブスター保存食。茹でて缶詰にされている。栄養のほとんどは含まれているが、調理済みロブスターのような風味はほとんどない。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "lobster roll"
msgid_plural "lobster rolls"
msgstr[0] "ロブスターロール"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'lobster roll'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "A delicious authentic lobster roll."
msgstr "美味しくて本格的なロブスターロール。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "lobster soup"
msgid_plural "lobster soups"
msgstr[0] "ロブスター・スープ"

#. ~ Description for lobster soup
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "A nutritious and delicious hearty lobster soup."
msgstr "栄養満点で美味しい、ボリュームのあるロブスター・スープ。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "fish and spinach bagel"
msgid_plural "fish and spinach bagels"
msgstr[0] "サンドイッチ [ﾌｨｯｼｭとｽﾋﾟﾅｯﾁ]"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'fish and spinach bagel'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "A delicious fish bagel with spinach and eggs."
msgstr "スピナッチと卵が入った、美味しいフィッシュベーグルサンドだ。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "BLT"
msgid_plural "BLTs"
msgstr[0] "サンドイッチ [BLT]"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'BLT'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "A bacon, lettuce, and tomato sandwich on toasted bread."
msgstr "ベーコン、レタス、トマトをトーストしたパンで挟んだサンドイッチだ。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "cucumber sandwich"
msgid_plural "cucumber sandwiches"
msgstr[0] "サンドイッチ [ｷｭｰｶﾝﾊﾞｰ]"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'cucumber sandwich', 'str_pl': 'cucumber
#. sandwiches'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "A refreshing cucumber sandwich.  Not very filling, but quite tasty."
msgstr "爽やかなキューカンバーサンドだ。腹持ちはしないが、スッキリとした味わいがある。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "mushroom spores"
msgid_plural "mushroom spores"
msgstr[0] "マッシュルーム胞子"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'mushroom spores'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "Some mushroom spores."
msgstr "いくらかのマッシュルームの胞子。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "morel mushroom spores"
msgid_plural "morel mushroom spores"
msgstr[0] "モレルマッシュルームの胞子"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'morel mushroom spores'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "Some morel mushroom spores."
msgstr "モレルマッシュルームの胞子。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "rosin"
msgid_plural "rosins"
msgstr[0] "ロジン"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'rosin'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "This is a chunk of yellowish rosin, usable as a flux for soldering."
msgstr "はんだ付け用のフラックスとして利用できる、黄色っぽいロジンの塊だ。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "liquid cooling outfit"
msgid_plural "liquid cooling outfits"
msgstr[0] "液体冷却服"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'liquid cooling outfit'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"This skintight suit covers you from head to toe and is designed to keep you "
"at an ideal temperature using a number of heatsinks and heating coils tied "
"to a liquid coolant system.  It also includes some handy features such as a "
"built-in thermometer.  Use it to turn it on."
msgstr ""
"このぴったりしたスーツは全身を覆い、液体冷却システムに接続された複数のヒートシンクと発熱コイルを使って、あなたを理想的な温度に保つよう設計されている。また、内蔵温度計などの便利な機能も含まれている。使って電源を入れる。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "liquid cooling outfit (on)"
msgid_plural "liquid cooling outfits (on)"
msgstr[0] "液体冷却服 [作動中]"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'liquid cooling outfit (on)', 'str_pl': 'liquid
#. cooling outfits (on)'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"This skintight suit covers you from head to toe and is designed to keep you "
"at an ideal temperature using a number of heatsinks and heating coils tied "
"to a liquid coolant system.  It also includes some handy features such as a "
"built-in thermometer.  It is currently on, use it to turn it off."
msgstr ""
"このぴったりしたスーツは全身を覆い、液体冷却システムに接続された複数のヒートシンクと発熱コイルを使って、あなたを理想的な温度に保つよう設計されている。また、内蔵温度計などの便利な機能も含まれている。現在電源が入っている。使って電源を切る。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "liquid cooling balaclava"
msgid_plural "liquid cooling balaclavas"
msgstr[0] "液冷バラクラバ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'liquid cooling balaclava'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"This face mask is designed to keep your face and head at an ideal "
"temperature using a number of heatsinks and heating coils tied to a liquid "
"coolant system.  It also includes some handy features such as a built-in "
"thermometer.  Use it to turn it on."
msgstr ""
"このフェイスマスクは、液体冷却システムに接続された複数のヒートシンクと発熱コイルを使用して、顔と頭を理想的な温度に保つよう設計されている。内蔵温度計などの便利な機能も含まれている。使って電源を入れる。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "liquid cooling balaclava (on)"
msgid_plural "liquid cooling balaclava (on)s"
msgstr[0] "液冷バラクラバ [作動中]"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'liquid cooling balaclava (on)'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"This face mask is designed to keep your face and head at an ideal "
"temperature using a number of heatsinks and heating coils tied to a liquid "
"coolant system.  It also includes some handy features such as a built-in "
"thermometer.  It is currently on, use it to turn it off."
msgstr ""
"このフェイスマスクは、液体冷却システムに接続された複数のヒートシンクと発熱コイルを使用して、顔と頭を理想的な温度に保つよう設計されている。内蔵温度計などの便利な機能も含まれている。現在電源が入っている。使って電源を切る。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "plastic gasket"
msgid_plural "plastic gaskets"
msgstr[0] "プラスチック・ガスケット"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'plastic gasket'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid " A single-use plastic gasket."
msgstr "使い捨てのプラスチック製ガスケットだ。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "The Essential Oil Enthusiasts Handbook"
msgid_plural "copies of The Essential Oil Enthusiasts Handbook"
msgstr[0] "精油愛好家のハンドブック"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'The Essential Oil Enthusiasts Handbook',
#. 'str_pl': 'copies of The Essential Oil Enthusiasts Handbook'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"A heavy hardback book explaining the process of essential oil making, with "
"schematics for the equipment to do it.  Good luck, and don't blow yourself "
"up!"
msgstr "精油の作り方や、そのための装置の設計図が図を交えて解説されている重厚なハードカバー本だ。幸運を祈る。そして、自爆はするなよ！"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "MAS 223 magazine"
msgid_plural "MAS 223 magazines"
msgstr[0] "MAS 223 マガジン"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'MAS 223 magazine'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"A 25-round magazine for the MAS 223.  It resembles a STANAG magazine but is "
"not compatible nor interchangeable."
msgstr "MAS 223に対応する25発マガジンだ。STANAGマガジンに似ているが、互換性も交換性もない。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'cooked strawberry', 'str_pl': 'cooked
#. strawberries'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "It's like strawberry jam, only without sugar."
msgstr "砂糖が入っていない、ストロベリージャムのようなものだ。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'cooked blueberry', 'str_pl': 'cooked
#. blueberries'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "It's like blueberry jam, only without sugar."
msgstr "砂糖が入っていない、ブルーベリージャムのようなものだ。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'washing machine'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "A very small washing machine designed for use in vehicles."
msgstr "車両で使用するために設計された、非常に小さな洗濯機だ。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'dishwasher'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "A very small dishwasher designed for use in vehicles."
msgstr "車両用に設計された、非常に小さな食器洗浄機だ。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "multi cooker - cooking"
msgid_plural "multi cooker - cookings"
msgstr[0] "マルチクッカー [作動中]"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'multi cooker - cooking'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"A professional-grade multi-cooker, with a battery slot for camping trips or "
"tailgating.  There is a dish in it."
msgstr ""
"プロ仕様のマルチクッカーだ。キャンプやテールゲートパーティーで使えるよう、バッテリー用スロットが組み込まれている。調理済みの料理が中に入っている。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "can of butane"
msgid_plural "cans of butane"
msgstr[0] "ブタン缶"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'can of butane', 'str_pl': 'cans of butane'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"A typical can of butane that you would normally use to fill a lighter.  It "
"could be useful as a fuel, but also as a solvent or chemical reagent."
msgstr "一般的にライターに充填するブタンガスが入った缶だ。燃料としてだけでなく、溶剤や化学試薬としても有用である。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "butane tank"
msgid_plural "tanks of butane"
msgstr[0] "ブタンタンク"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'butane tank', 'str_pl': 'tanks of butane'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"This is a tank of liquid compressed butane.  It can be used to extract "
"essential oils from organic material."
msgstr "これは圧縮された液化ブタンのタンクだ。有機物から精油を抽出するのに使用できる。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid "extended toolset"
msgid_plural "extended toolsets"
msgstr[0] "拡張工具セット"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'extended toolset'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json
msgid ""
"Your toolset, protruding from your hands.  It can slice, dice, and make "
"everything nice."
msgstr "手から突き出た工具セットだ。切断したり、さいの目に刻んだりと、様々な作業ができる。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/missions.json
msgid "Find a Flu Shot"
msgstr "インフルエンザワクチンを探せ"

#: data/json/obsoletion/missions.json
msgid ""
"The doctor has some ideas on how to recreate a vaccination program for the "
"common flu.  If you come across an unused flu shot please bring it to me.  "
"We haven't had any fatalities from the flu yet but it is only a matter of "
"time until one of the older or younger members of the outpost gets a bad "
"case."
msgstr ""
"医師は一般的なインフルエンザに対するワクチン接種プログラムを再開する方法を考えている。もし未使用のインフルエンザワクチンを見つけたら、私に持って来てくれ。今のところインフルエンザで死者は出ていないが、前哨基地の年長者や子供が重症化するのは時間の問題だ。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/missions.json
msgid "Hospitals or clinics might have a few that haven't been used."
msgstr "病院か診療所になら、いくつか未使用のものがあるかもしれん。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/missions.json
msgid "Do you have the flu shot?"
msgstr "インフルエンザワクチンは手に入ったか？"

#: data/json/obsoletion/monsters.json
msgid "deer mouse"
msgid_plural "deer mouses"
msgstr[0] "シカネズミ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'deer mouse'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/monsters.json
msgid ""
"The white-footed mouse, a prolific rodent with a white underbelly and a long"
" fuzzy tail.  A common sight in fields, forests, and research centers."
msgstr "白い足と下腹部、そして長い微毛の尾を持つ多産な齧歯動物だ。平野、森林、研究施設などでよく見かける。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/monsters.json
msgid "dragonfly"
msgid_plural "dragonflies"
msgstr[0] "ドラゴンフライ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'dragonfly', 'str_pl': 'dragonflies'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/monsters.json
msgid ""
"A thin-bodied insectoid predator with a large wingspan and big compound "
"eyes."
msgstr "大きな翼幅と大きな複眼を持つ、細身の肉食昆虫だ。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/monsters.json
msgid "bull frog"
msgid_plural "bull frogs"
msgstr[0] "ウシガエル"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'bull frog'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/monsters.json
msgid ""
"The American bullfrog, in its natural habitat.  It feeds on insects, mice, "
"lizards and any other living thing it can stuff down its gullet."
msgstr "自然の生息地にいるアメリカウシガエルだ。昆虫、ネズミ、トカゲなど、飲み込めるものは何でも食べる。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/monsters.json
msgid "mosquito"
msgid_plural "mosquitos"
msgstr[0] "モスキート"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'mosquito'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/monsters.json
msgid ""
"A blood-sucking fly with a needle-like proboscis.  Its bite leaves behind "
"itchy welts and can easily spread disease."
msgstr "針のような口吻で血を吸う吸血性のハエだ。その刺し傷はかゆみを伴う腫れを残し、病気を容易に広める可能性がある。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/monsters.json
msgid "shrew"
msgid_plural "shrews"
msgstr[0] "トガリネズミ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'shrew'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/monsters.json
msgid ""
"The masked shrew, a mouse-like creature with a pointed, whiskery snout.  It "
"digs tunnels into the ground in search of bugs to eat."
msgstr "尖った口吻とヒゲを持つ、ネズミのような姿のカッショクトガリネズミだ。餌となる虫を探して地面にトンネルを掘る。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/monsters.json
msgid "slug"
msgid_plural "slugs"
msgstr[0] "ナメクジ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'slug'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/monsters.json
msgid ""
"The leopard slug, an omnivorous gastropod.  It consumes decaying matter as "
"well as planted crops, and will attack and eat other slugs that cross its "
"path."
msgstr "雑食性の腹足類であるマダラコウラナメクジだ。腐敗した物質や栽培された作物を食い荒らし、通りかかった他のナメクジを襲って食べることもある。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/monsters.json
msgid "jumping spider"
msgid_plural "jumping spiders"
msgstr[0] "ハエトリグモ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'jumping spider'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/monsters.json
msgid ""
"A little spider with elongated forelegs.  It does not build extensive webs, "
"but leaps very quickly, appearing to move instantaneously from one spot to "
"another."
msgstr "細長い前脚を持つ小さなクモだ。大きな巣は作らないが、非常に素早く跳躍し、まるで瞬間移動したかのように見える。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/monsters.json
msgid "trapdoor spider"
msgid_plural "trapdoor spiders"
msgstr[0] "トダテグモ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'trapdoor spider'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/monsters.json
msgid ""
"A midsized spider with a bulbous thorax.  It creates a subterranean nest and"
" lies in wait for prey to draw close enough for capture."
msgstr "胸部が球根型をした中型のクモだ。地下に巣を作り、獲物が捕獲できるほど近くに来るまでじっと待機する。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/monsters.json
msgid "black widow spider"
msgid_plural "black widow spiders"
msgstr[0] "クロゴケグモ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'black widow spider'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/monsters.json
msgid ""
"An infamous spider with a characteristic red hourglass marking on its black "
"carapace, known for its highly toxic bite."
msgstr "黒い甲羅に赤い砂時計型の模様が特徴的な、高い毒性で知られる悪名高いクモだ。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/monsters.json
msgid "wolf spider"
msgid_plural "wolf spiders"
msgstr[0] "オオカミグモ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'wolf spider'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/monsters.json
msgid ""
"A fairly large spider which tracks and catches prey through agility and "
"stealth.  Its bite can be irritating even to large animals."
msgstr "敏捷性と隠密性を駆使して獲物を追跡し、捕らえるかなり大きなクモだ。その噛みつきは、大型の動物に対しても炎症を引き起こす可能性がある。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'wasp'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/monsters.json
msgid ""
"A slender-bodied flying insect, with a painful sting.  They can be somewhat "
"aggressive if disturbed."
msgstr "痛みを伴う針を持つ、細身の飛翔昆虫だ。平穏を乱されるとやや攻撃的になることがある。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/monsters.json
msgid "M249 autonomous CROWS II"
msgid_plural "M249 autonomous CROWS IIs"
msgstr[0] "M249 CROWS II"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'M249 autonomous CROWS II'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/monsters.json
msgid ""
"A remote weapon system derived from the M153 CROWS II and enhanced with "
"autonomous operation software.  Thousands of these were deployed by the US "
"military before the Cataclysm and they were valued for their use in engaging"
" infantry without exposing the operator.  This one is fitted with a M249."
msgstr ""
"M153 CROWS "
"IIから派生し、自律運用ソフトウェアで強化された遠隔兵器システムだ。大災厄前に米軍により数千機が展開され、操作者を危険に晒すことなく歩兵と交戦できる点が評価されていた。これはM249を搭載している。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/monsters.json
msgid "M240 autonomous CROWS II"
msgid_plural "M240 autonomous CROWS IIs"
msgstr[0] "M240 CROWS II"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'M240 autonomous CROWS II'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/monsters.json
msgid ""
"A remote weapon system derived from the M153 CROWS II and enhanced with "
"autonomous operation software.  Thousands of these were deployed by the US "
"military before the Cataclysm and they were valued for their use in engaging"
" infantry without exposing the operator.  This one is fitted with a M240."
msgstr ""
"M153 CROWS "
"IIから派生し、自律運用ソフトウェアで強化された遠隔兵器システムだ。大災厄前に米軍により数千機が展開され、操作者を危険に晒すことなく歩兵と交戦できる点が評価されていた。これはM240を搭載している。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/monsters.json
msgid "M2HB autonomous CROWS II"
msgid_plural "M2HB autonomous CROWS IIs"
msgstr[0] "M2HB CROWS II"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'M2HB autonomous CROWS II'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/monsters.json
msgid ""
"A remote weapon system derived from the M153 CROWS II and enhanced with "
"autonomous operation software.  Thousands of these were deployed by the US "
"military before the Cataclysm and they were valued for their use in engaging"
" anything up to light vehicles at long range without exposing the operator."
"  This one is fitted with a M2HB."
msgstr ""
"M153 CROWS "
"IIから派生し、自律運用ソフトウェアで強化された遠隔兵器システムだ。大災厄前に米軍により数千機が展開され、操作者を危険に晒すことなく軽車両に至るまで長距離で交戦できる点が評価されていた。これはM2HBを搭載している。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/monsters.json
msgid "improvised MP5 turret"
msgid_plural "improvised MP5 turrets"
msgstr[0] "急造MP5 タレット"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'improvised MP5 turret'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/monsters.json
msgid ""
"An MP5 attached to a motorized chassis with basic autonomous software "
"control.  There is no mechanism to reload the weapon when its magazine is "
"empty and the fire control system is only designed for semi automatic fire."
msgstr ""
"基本的な自律制御ソフトウェアを備えた電動車台にMP5を搭載した武装だ。弾倉が空になっても自動で再装填する機構はなく、射撃制御システムはセミオート射撃のみに設計されている。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/mount.json
msgid "replaceable furniture kit"
msgid_plural "replaceable furniture kits"
msgstr[0] "交換式外装セット"

#: data/json/obsoletion/mount.json
msgid ""
"This is a kit consisting of various steel and plastic parts; when installed,"
" it would permanently modify and partially replace some of the weapon's "
"furniture so that it could be easily changed if needed.  This allows "
"installing any kind of more advanced grips or other furniture."
msgstr ""
"様々な鋼鉄とプラスチック部品で構成されたキットだ。組み込むと、銃器のストックやグリップの一部を恒久的に交換し、必要に応じて容易に変更できるようにする。これにより、より高度なグリップや他の外装部品を取り付けられるようになる。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/mount.json
msgid "grip mount"
msgstr "グリップマウント"

#: data/json/obsoletion/mount.json
msgid "side mount"
msgid_plural "side mounts"
msgstr[0] "サイドマウント"

#: data/json/obsoletion/mount.json
msgid ""
"This is a plastic mount for attaching a rail accessory, designed to be "
"permanently installed onto almost any weapon, along with some fasteners.  "
"Ideal for bringing out your inner tacticool on older guns."
msgstr ""
"レールアクセサリを取り付けるためのプラスチック製マウントだ。留め具とともに、ほとんど全ての銃器に恒久的に取り付けられるように設計されている。旧式の銃をタクティクールに改造したい場合に最適だ。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/mount.json
msgid "rail mount"
msgstr "レールマウント"

#: data/json/obsoletion/mount.json
msgid "sights mount"
msgid_plural "sights mounts"
msgstr[0] "照準器マウント"

#: data/json/obsoletion/mount.json
msgid ""
"This is a plastic mount for attaching a sight, designed to be permanently "
"installed onto almost any weapon other than launchers and pistols, along "
"with some fasteners.  Ideal for bringing out your inner tacticool on older "
"guns."
msgstr ""
"照準器を取り付けるためのプラスチック製マウントだ。ランチャーとピストルを除くほとんど全ての銃器に恒久的に取り付けられるように、留め具とともに設計されている。旧式の銃をタクティクールに改造したい場合に最適だ。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/mount.json
msgid "launcher sights mount"
msgid_plural "launcher sights mounts"
msgstr[0] "ランチャー用照準器マウント"

#: data/json/obsoletion/mount.json
msgid ""
"This is a plastic mount for attaching a sight, designed to be permanently "
"installed onto almost any launcher, along with some fasteners.  Ideal for "
"bringing out your inner tacticool on rocket launchers."
msgstr ""
"照準器を取り付けるためのプラスチック製マウントだ。留め具とともに、ほとんど全てのランチャーに恒久的に取り付けられるように設計されている。ロケットランチャーをタクティクールに改造したい場合に最適だ。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/mount.json
msgid "pistol sights mount"
msgid_plural "pistol sights mounts"
msgstr[0] "ピストル用照準器マウント"

#: data/json/obsoletion/mount.json
msgid ""
"This is a plastic mount for attaching a sight, designed to be permanently "
"installed onto almost any pistol, along with some fasteners.  Ideal for "
"bringing out your inner tacticool on pocket pistols."
msgstr ""
"照準器を取り付けるためのプラスチック製マウントだ。留め具とともに、ほとんど全てのピストルに恒久的に取り付けられるように設計されている。小型のピストルをタクティクールに改造したい場合に最適だ。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/mount.json
msgid "replaceable stock kit"
msgid_plural "replaceable stock kits"
msgstr[0] "交換式銃床セット"

#: data/json/obsoletion/mount.json
msgid ""
"This is a kit consisting of various steel parts; when installed, it would "
"remove the weapon's original fixed stock, install a new stock mount on its "
"place, modify original stock to fit it and then reattach it to the gun, or "
"simply attach a stock mount if gun had no stock to start with.  This allows "
"easy installation of any kind of more advanced stocks."
msgstr ""
"様々な鋼鉄部品で構成されたキットだ。組み込むと、銃器の元々固定されていた銃床を取り外し、その場所に新しい銃床マウントを取り付ける。元の銃床を改造して再装着することも、銃床がない場合は単にマウントを取り付けることも可能だ。これにより、より高度な銃床を容易に取り付けられるようになる。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/mount.json
msgid "stock mount"
msgstr "銃床マウント"

#: data/json/obsoletion/mount.json
msgid "bottom mount"
msgid_plural "bottom mounts"
msgstr[0] "下部マウント"

#: data/json/obsoletion/mount.json
msgid ""
"This is a plastic mount for attaching an underbarrel accessory, designed to "
"be permanently installed onto almost any weapon, along with some fasteners."
"  Ideal for bringing out your inner tacticool on older guns."
msgstr ""
"アンダーバレルアクセサリを取り付けるためのプラスチック製マウントだ。留め具とともに、ほとんど全ての銃器に恒久的に取り付けられるように設計されている。旧式の銃をタクティクールに改造したい場合に最適だ。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/mount.json
msgid "underbarrel mount"
msgstr "アンダーバレルマウント"

#: data/json/obsoletion/mutations.json
msgid "Truth Teller"
msgstr "正直者"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Truth Teller'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/mutations.json
msgid "I'd lie if I said this trait was worth a whole point."
msgstr "この特性が丸々1ポイントの価値があると言ったら、嘘になるだろう。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/mutations.json
msgid "Quick Pain Recovery"
msgstr "迅速な鎮痛"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Quick Pain Recovery'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You recover from pain faster than normal.  DUMMIED OUT because it wasn't "
"actually functional…"
msgstr "通常より痛みが早く回復する。実際には機能しなかったためダミー化された…"

#: data/json/obsoletion/mutations.json
msgid "Very Quick Pain Recovery"
msgstr "超迅速な鎮痛"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Very Quick Pain Recovery'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You recover from pain much faster than normal.  DUMMIED OUT because it "
"wasn't actually functional…"
msgstr "通常より遥かに痛みが早く回復する。実際には機能しなかったためダミー化された…"

#: data/json/obsoletion/mutations.json
msgid "Rigid Table Manners"
msgstr "厳格な食事作法"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Rigid Table Manners'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You've been taught proper table manners from your early childhood on.  Now "
"you can't even think about eating without a table.  Eating without it "
"frustrates you, but eating like a civilized person gives you a bigger morale"
" bonus."
msgstr ""
"お前は幼い頃から適切な食事作法を教え込まれた。そのせいで、今やテーブルなしで食事をすることなど考えられない。テーブルなしで食べると意欲が低下するが、文明人らしい作法で食事をすればより大きな意欲ボーナスを得られる。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/mutations.json
msgid "Hates Books"
msgstr "本嫌い"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Hates Books'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Reading is for nerds!  Boring books are more boring, and you can't have fun "
"by reading books."
msgstr "読書なんてオタクの趣味だ！退屈な本はさらに退屈に感じ、楽しい本を読んでも楽しめない。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/mutations.json
msgid "Trigger Happy"
msgstr "トリガーハッピー"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Trigger Happy'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Unimplemented.  To be removed after 0.F. to preserve save compatibility."
msgstr "未実装だ。セーブデータの互換性を維持するため、バージョン 0.F 以降で削除される予定だ。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/mutations.json
msgid "Forgetful"
msgstr "健忘症"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Forgetful'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have a hard time remembering things.  Your skills will erode slightly "
"faster than usual, and you can remember less terrain."
msgstr "物事を記憶するのが困難だ。スキルは通常よりわずかに早く劣化し、記憶できる地形も少なくなる。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/mutations.json
msgid "Extended Claws"
msgstr "発達した爪"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Extended Claws'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/mutations.json
msgid "Sharp claws are extended from the end of your fingers."
msgstr "鋭い爪が指先から伸びている。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/mutations.json
msgid "Helicopter Pilot"
msgstr "ヘリコプター操縦士"

#. ~ Description for Helicopter Pilot
#: data/json/obsoletion/mutations.json
msgid "Everyone can pilot a helicopter nowadays, you don't need this trait."
msgstr "今や誰もがヘリコプターを操縦できるため、この特性は必要ない。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/mutations.json
msgid "Intestinal Fortitude"
msgstr "不屈の消化器官"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Intestinal Fortitude'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your guts have developed the ability to handle poisonous food.  Mostly."
msgstr "お前の内臓は有毒な食べ物を処理する能力を発達させた。大抵の物は大丈夫だ。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Infection Immune'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your bloodstream has developed antibiotic properties.  Your wounds will "
"never become infected."
msgstr "お前の血流は抗生作用を獲得した。負傷から感染症に罹ることは決してない。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/mutations.json
msgid "Disease Resistant"
msgstr "病気耐性"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Disease Resistant'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/mutations.json
msgid ""
"It's very unlikely that you will catch ambient diseases like a cold or the "
"flu."
msgstr "風邪やインフルエンザのような環境由来の病気に罹る可能性は非常に低い。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/mutations.json
msgid "Disease Immune"
msgstr "病気免疫"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Disease Immune'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your body is simply immune to diseases.  You will never catch an ambient "
"disease."
msgstr "お前の体は単純に病気に対して免疫がある。環境由来の病気に決して罹ることはない。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/mutations.json
msgid "Good Memory"
msgstr "優れた記憶力"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Good Memory'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have an exceptional memory, and find it easy to remember things.  Your "
"skills will erode slightly slower than usual."
msgstr "並外れた記憶力を持っており、物事を容易に覚えられる。スキルの劣化が通常よりもわずかに遅くなる。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/mutations.json
msgid "Antsy"
msgstr "落ち着きがない"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Antsy'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You can't bear to stay still for long.  Your morale will suffer unless you "
"constantly explore new territory."
msgstr "長時間じっとしていることに耐えられない。絶えず新しい領域を探索し続けないと意欲が低下する。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/mutations.json
msgid "Restless"
msgstr "多動"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Restless'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Spending any amount of time in familiar places makes you miserable.  Must.  "
"Keep.  Moving."
msgstr "慣れた場所に少しでも留まると気分が落ち込む。動け。動け。とにかく動け。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/mutations.json
msgid "Fey Vision"
msgstr "妖精の視界"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Fey Vision'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/mutations.json
msgid "The shadows don't seem as dark now."
msgstr "影が以前ほど暗く見えない。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/mutations.json
msgid "Fey Nightsight"
msgstr "妖精の暗視"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Fey Nightsight'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have great low-light vision now, though that doesn't allow you to "
"perform fine tasks such as crafting and reading in darkness."
msgstr "今や優れた低光量視力を持っているが、暗闇でクラフトや読書といった細かい作業を行うことはできない。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/mutations.json
msgid "Feline Vision"
msgstr "ネコの視界"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Feline Vision'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your optic nerves and brain caught up with your eyes.  Now you can see "
"pretty well at night."
msgstr "視神経と脳がお前の目に追いついた。これで夜間でもかなりよく見える。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/mutations.json
msgid "Cephalopod Vision"
msgstr "頭足類の視界"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Cephalopod Vision'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your brain has caught up with your eyes.  You can see much better in the "
"dark, but sunlight seems much brighter now."
msgstr "お前の脳が目に追いついた。暗闇では遥かによく見えるが、日光がずっと明るく感じるようになった。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/mutations.json
msgid "Ursine Vision"
msgstr "クマの視界"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Ursine Vision'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your visual processing has shifted: though you can see better in the dark, "
"you're nearsighted in the light.  Maybe glasses would help.  Activate to "
"toggle NV-visible areas on or off."
msgstr "視覚の処理方法が変化した。暗闇では視界が向上するが、明るい光の下では近視になる。有効化して暗視可能な領域を切り替えられる。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/mutations.json
msgid "Tough Feet"
msgstr "頑丈な足"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Tough Feet'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/mutations.json
msgid ""
"This mutation has been obsoleted due to the hidden movement speed penalty "
"being removed.  If you see this on a profession or mutate this trait, this "
"is a bug."
msgstr "隠された移動速度ペナルティが削除されたため、この変異は廃止された。職業や変異によってこの特性が見られる場合、それはバグである。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Stylish'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/mutations.json
msgid "Obsoleted due to becoming default behavior."
msgstr "デフォルトの挙動になったため廃止された。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/mutations.json
msgid "Self-Aware"
msgstr "自己認識能力"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Self-Aware'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/mutations.json
msgid "This mutation is now just an option in the settings."
msgstr "この変異は現在、設定のオプションの一つとなっている。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/npc.json
msgid "Head of Security"
msgstr "警備主任"

#: data/json/obsoletion/npc.json
msgid "U. Rourke"
msgstr "U. ﾙｰｸ"

#: data/json/obsoletion/npc.json
msgid "Head of security"
msgstr "警備主任"

#: data/json/obsoletion/npc.json
msgid "Alonso Lautrec"
msgstr "ｱﾛﾝｿ ﾛｰﾄﾚｯｸ"

#: data/json/obsoletion/npc_dialogue.json
msgid "You seem a little forward…"
msgstr "お前は少し図太いようだな…"

#: data/json/obsoletion/npc_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"[PERCEPTION 10] What is up with you?  What's with the fake accent, and "
"speaking in the third person?"
msgstr "[感覚 10] お前、一体どうしたんだ？その奇妙な訛りと、三人称での話し方は何なんだ？"

#: data/json/obsoletion/npc_dialogue.json
msgid "Hello again, gorgeous"
msgstr "また会ったな、お洒落さん。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/npc_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"Oh my, it's good to see such a strong and handsome fellow around here.  They"
" call me Alonso."
msgstr "何とまあ、このあたりに私のように強くハンサムな男がいるとは良いことだ。皆は私をアロンソと呼ぶ。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/npc_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"Oh my, you're a beautiful lady, so nice to see you.  They call me Alonso."
msgstr "ああ、何と麗しいレディだろう、会えて光栄だ。皆は私をアロンソと呼ぶ。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/npc_dialogue.json
msgid "Nice to meet you, Alonso."
msgstr "はじめまして、アロンソ。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/npc_dialogue.json
msgid "Hi, Alonso.  What's up?"
msgstr "やあ、アロンソ。調子はどうだ？"

#: data/json/obsoletion/npc_dialogue.json
msgid "Hi Alonso, nice to meet you.  I gotta go though."
msgstr "やあ、アロンソ、会えて嬉しいよ。でももう行かなくちゃ。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/npc_dialogue.json
msgid "Hi Alonso.  I can't stay to talk."
msgstr "やあ、アロンソ。立ち話はできない。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/npc_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"Nice to meet you too.  Very nice.  It gets so lonely here in the center."
msgstr "こちらこそだ。本当に嬉しい。このセンターでの生活はとても孤独になる。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/npc_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"Well, it's a lot better now that you're here.  Nice to see a familiar face."
msgstr "うむ、お前がここにいるからずっと気分が良い。見知った顔に会えて嬉しい。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/npc_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"Now that you are here, everything.  Is there anything Alonso can… *do for "
"you*?"
msgstr "お前がここにいる、それが全てだ。アロンソがお前のためにできることは…あるか？"

#: data/json/obsoletion/npc_dialogue.json
msgid "You know me, I gotta be me, right?"
msgstr "お前は私を知っている。私は私でなくてはならない、そうだろう？"

#: data/json/obsoletion/npc_dialogue.json
msgid "Alonso cannot help himself, in the face of someone so fine as you."
msgstr "お前のように素敵な人を前にしては、アロンソは自分を抑えられない。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/npc_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"Aw man, why you gotta be like that?  I'm just tryin' to get an air of "
"mystery okay?  Nobody wants to be with a slutty guy from Brooklyn, but "
"Alonso the mysterious is another story."
msgstr ""
"おいおい、なぜそんなことを言うんだ？ちょっと神秘的な雰囲気を出そうとしているだけだ。ブルックリンの下品な男と一緒になりたい奴はいないが、ミステリアスなアロンソなら話は別だろう。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/npc_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"Aw come on, why you gotta be like that?  I'm just tryin' to get an air of "
"mystery okay?  Nobody wants to be with a slutty guy from Brooklyn, but "
"Alonso the mysterious is another story."
msgstr ""
"おいおい、なぜそんなことを言うんだ？ちょっと神秘的な雰囲気を出そうとしているだけだ。ブルックリンの下品な男と一緒になりたい奴はいないが、ミステリアスなアロンソなら話は別だろう。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/npc_dialogue.json
msgid "And how is that working out for you?"
msgstr "で、その口調でうまくやれてるのか？"

#: data/json/obsoletion/npc_dialogue.json
msgid "Better'n you'd maybe think, okay?  Can we drop it?"
msgstr "お前が思っているよりずっとうまくいってる、わかったか？もうこの話はよしてもいいか？"

#: data/json/obsoletion/npc_dialogue.json
msgid "Just stop talking like that around me, maybe?  It's really obnoxious."
msgstr "私の周りだけでも、その話し方を止めてくれないか？本当に不愉快だ。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/npc_dialogue.json
msgid "I'll leave you to it then."
msgstr "それなら、好きにしろ。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/npc_dialogue.json
msgid "Fine.  As a favor to you, I'll be a guy from Brooklyn."
msgstr "わかった。お前への恩として、ブルックリンから来たただの男になろう。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/npc_dialogue.json
msgid "Thanks.  I'd better get going."
msgstr "ありがとう。もう行くよ。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/npc_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"I'm tryin' ta forget, y'know?  Don't like thinkin' about the past.  Better "
"to plan for the future, even if the future looks grim."
msgstr "忘れようとしているんだ、わかるだろう？過去について考えるのは嫌いだ。たとえ暗い未来が待ち受けていようとも、未来の計画を立てる方が良い。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/npc_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"Alonso does not wish to talk about the past, only the future.  There are "
"dark days ahead, but perhaps together we can bring a little light?"
msgstr "アロンソは過去について話したくない。未来のことだけを話す。これから先も暗い日々が続くが、一緒にいれば少しは光明をもたらせると思わないか？"

#: data/json/obsoletion/npc_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"Could be better.  I don't really got any friends here in the center, but "
"seeing travelers like you always brightens my day."
msgstr "もっと良くなるだろう。ここセンターには友人はいないが、お前のような旅人を見るといつも気分が晴れる。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/npc_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"Here in the center, Alonso is a bit lonely.  We get a few brave, strong "
"travelers like yourself, though, and seeing them brightens Alonso's day."
msgstr "ここセンターで、アロンソは少し孤独だ。だが、お前のような勇敢で強い旅人が何人か来てくれるので、アロンソは彼らを見て気分が晴れる。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/uncategorized.json
msgid "Internal Storage"
msgstr "体内格納庫"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Internal Storage'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/uncategorized.json
msgid ""
"Space inside your chest cavity has been surgically converted into a storage "
"area.  You may carry an extra 2 liters of volume."
msgstr "胸腔内部が外科手術によって格納領域へと改造された。最大所持容積が2リットル増加する。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/uncategorized.json
msgid "wheel (steerable)"
msgstr "ホイール [転舵輪]"

#: data/json/obsoletion/uncategorized.json
msgid "racing slick (steerable)"
msgstr "レーシングスリック [転舵輪]"

#: data/json/obsoletion/uncategorized.json
msgid "armored wheel (steerable)"
msgstr "装甲ホイール [転舵輪]"

#: data/json/obsoletion/uncategorized.json
msgid "bicycle wheel (steerable)"
msgstr "自転車ホイール [転舵輪]"

#: data/json/obsoletion/uncategorized.json
msgid "off-road bicycle wheel (steerable)"
msgstr "オフロード自転車ホイール [転舵輪]"

#: data/json/obsoletion/uncategorized.json
msgid "motorbike wheel (steerable)"
msgstr "バイクホイール [転舵輪]"

#: data/json/obsoletion/uncategorized.json
msgid "off-road motorbike wheel (steerable)"
msgstr "オフロードバイクホイール [転舵輪]"

#: data/json/obsoletion/uncategorized.json
msgid "small wheel (steerable)"
msgstr "小型ホイール [転舵輪]"

#: data/json/obsoletion/uncategorized.json
msgid "wide wheel (steerable)"
msgstr "ワイドホイール [転舵輪]"

#: data/json/obsoletion/uncategorized.json
msgid "off-road wide wheel (steerable)"
msgstr "オフロードワイドホイール [転舵輪]"

#: data/json/obsoletion/uncategorized.json
msgid "Inconspicuous"
msgstr "影が薄い"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Inconspicuous'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/uncategorized.json
msgid ""
"While sleeping or staying still, it is less likely that monsters will wander"
" close to you."
msgstr "睡眠や待機中は、モンスターがお前の近くをさまよう可能性が低くなる。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/uncategorized.json
msgid "Savings"
msgstr "貯金好き"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Savings'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/uncategorized.json
msgid ""
"You had some money stashed at the bank for a rainy day.  Now that the storm "
"is raging, it's a last call to use it maybe?"
msgstr "いざという時に備えて銀行にいくらかお金を貯めていた。嵐が吹き荒れる今、ひょっとすると最後の使い時かもしれないぞ？"

#: data/json/obsoletion/uncategorized.json
msgid "Debt"
msgstr "債務者"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Debt'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/uncategorized.json
msgid ""
"You needed money and had a big loan in a bank.  Good thing nobody will come "
"to collect it now, right?  Right?"
msgstr "大金が必要で、銀行で多額のローンを組んでいた。幸い、今は誰も取り立てに来ない、そうだろう？…そうだよな？"

#: data/json/obsoletion/uncategorized.json
msgid "Millionaire"
msgstr "ミリオネア"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Millionaire'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/uncategorized.json
msgid ""
"At the time of Cataclysm you were an owner of a fortune stashed in a bank.  "
"Does that have any meaning now?"
msgstr "大災厄が発生したとき、お前は銀行に多額の財産を預けていた。それが今、何か意味を持つのだろうか？"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'metal wheel'}
#. ~ Description for {'str': 'roller drum'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/uncategorized.json data/json/vehicleparts/wheel.json
msgid "A strong metal wheel."
msgstr "頑丈な金属製ホイールだ。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/uncategorized.json
msgid "washcloth"
msgid_plural "washcloths"
msgstr[0] "布巾"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'washcloth'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/uncategorized.json
msgid "A piece of cloth that can be used for cleaning impervious surfaces."
msgstr "固形物の表面を掃除するために使える布切れだ。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/uncategorized.json
msgid "Dusty"
msgstr "埃まみれ"

#. ~ Description for fault '{'str': 'Dusty'}'
#: data/json/obsoletion/uncategorized.json
msgid "It's dusty.  Has no effect - obsolete fault."
msgstr "埃まみれだ。効果はない（廃止された欠陥）。"

#. ~ Name of mending method for fault '{'str': 'Dusty'}'
#: data/json/obsoletion/uncategorized.json
msgid "Wipe clean"
msgstr "拭き取り"

#. ~ Success message for mending method 'Wipe clean' of fault '{'str':
#. 'Dusty'}'
#: data/json/obsoletion/uncategorized.json
#, c-format
msgid "You clean you %s."
msgstr "%sを綺麗に掃除した。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/uncategorized.json
msgid "reactor core expansion device"
msgid_plural "reactor core expansion devices"
msgstr[0] "反応炉心拡張装置"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'reactor core expansion device'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/uncategorized.json
msgid ""
"This is an expansion device for use on plutonium-powered equipment.  With "
"enough electronics skill, you could attach this to an atomic tool to double "
"the amount of plutonium it can hold.  Note that this device is incompatible "
"with the atomic battery mod."
msgstr ""
"プルトニウム駆動の装備に使用する拡張装置だ。十分な電子工学スキルがあれば、原子力ツールに取り付けてプルトニウムの充填量を2倍にできる。ただし、この装置は原子力バッテリーMODとは互換性がない点に注意が必要だ。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/uncategorized.json
msgid "Scent Vision"
msgstr "臭跡視"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Scent Vision'}
#: data/json/obsoletion/uncategorized.json
msgid ""
"While this system is powered, you're able to visually sense your own scent, "
"making it possible for you to recognize your surroundings even in complete "
"darkness."
msgstr "このシステムに電力が供給されている間、お前自身の匂いを視覚的に感知できる。これにより、完全な暗闇の中でも周囲を認識できるようになる。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/uncategorized.json
msgid "broken centrifuge"
msgstr "壊れた遠心分離機"

#. ~ Description for broken centrifuge
#: data/json/obsoletion/uncategorized.json
msgid ""
"This used to be a centrifuge, a liquid separating device with an automated "
"analyzer unit.  If it was still functional, it could have been used to "
"analyze a medical fluid sample."
msgstr ""
"かつては遠心分離機、つまり自動分析ユニット付きの液体分離装置だったものだ。もし機能していれば、医療用の液体サンプルを分析するのに使えただろう。"

#: data/json/obsoletion/uncategorized.json
msgid "broken autoclave"
msgstr "壊れたオートクレーブ"

#. ~ Description for broken autoclave
#: data/json/obsoletion/uncategorized.json
msgid ""
"This thing is basically an extremely high tech laundry machine or "
"dishwasher.  It seems to not do anything useful anymore."
msgstr "これは基本的に超ハイテクな洗濯機か食器洗い機のようなものだ。もう何の役にも立たないようだ。"

#. ~ Description for water dispenser
#: data/json/obsoletion/uncategorized.json
msgid "A machine with several taps that dispenses clean water."
