#. ~ Name for scenario 'Robots' for a male character
#: data/mods/Aftershock/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scenario_male"
msgid "Robots"
msgstr "ロボット"

#. ~ Name for scenario 'Robots' for a female character
#: data/mods/Aftershock/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scenario_female"
msgid "Robots"
msgstr "ロボット"

#. ~ Description for scenario 'Robots' for a male character.
#: data/mods/Aftershock/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"During the riots and chaos, you hid in a robot dispatch center hoping the "
"robots would protect you, but they may prove more dangerous than the "
"zombies."
msgstr ""
"暴動と混乱の中、ロボットが守ってくれることを期待してロボット派遣センターに隠れた。しかし、ロボットはゾンビよりずっと危険だと証明されそうだ。"

#. ~ Description for scenario 'Robots' for a female character.
#: data/mods/Aftershock/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"During the riots and chaos, you hid in a robot dispatch center hoping the "
"robots would protect you, but they may prove more dangerous than the "
"zombies."
msgstr ""
"暴動と混乱の中、ロボットが守ってくれることを期待してロボット派遣センターに隠れた。しかし、ロボットはゾンビよりずっと危険だと証明されそうだ。"

#. ~ Starting location for scenario 'Robots'.
#: data/mods/Aftershock/scenarios.json
msgctxt "start_name"
msgid "Robot Dispatch"
msgstr "ロボット派遣センター"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/speech.json
msgid "\"I have no mouth and yet I scream!\""
msgstr "「口が無いのにまだ叫んでいる！」"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/speech.json
msgid "\"¿Por qué?\""
msgstr "「¿Por qué?（なんで？）」"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/speech.json
msgid "\"Come closer little one.\""
msgstr "「近くへおいで、おちびさん」"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/speech.json
msgid "\"The better to eat you!  I don't actually think I eat anymore.\""
msgstr "「君を食べるためだよ！実際、もう食べるものなんてないと思うけど。」"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/speech.json
msgid "\"Cyrus said if I was patient, he could get me a new body.\""
msgstr "「サイラスは、辛抱強くしていれば新しい身体を手に入れられると言った。」"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/speech.json
msgid "\"Quem é Você?\""
msgstr "「Quem é Você?\"(あなたは誰？)」"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/speech.json
msgid "\"Eu vou te matar!\""
msgstr "「Eu vou te matar! (お前を殺す！)」"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/speech.json
msgid "\"I can't keep myself from killing you, please run!\""
msgstr "「お前を殺さずにはいられない、どうか逃げてくれ！」"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/speech.json
msgid "\"bzzzzzz.\""
msgstr "「ブブブブブ」"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/start_locations.json
msgid "Robot Dispatch Center"
msgstr "ロボット派遣センター"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/ammo.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/ammo_type.json
msgid "acidic bore"
msgid_plural "acidic bores"
msgstr[0] "酸性塊"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'acidic bore'}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/ammo.json
msgid ""
"This wriggling nodule of resin and flesh appears to be secreting a pungent "
"fluid.  You'd probably best feed it into the bioblaster."
msgstr "この蠢く樹脂と肉質の塊は、刺激性の液体を分泌している。おそらく、これを生体ブラスターに装填するのが最善の利用法だ。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/ammo.json
msgid "x-ray laser barrel"
msgid_plural "x-ray laser barrels"
msgstr[0] "X線レーザー砲身"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'x-ray laser barrel'}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/ammo.json
msgid ""
"Your very own Project Excalibur.  Better get to defending America with it."
msgstr "君自身のエクスカリバー計画だ。これを使ってアメリカを防衛しろ。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/ammo_type.json
msgid "ray laser barrel"
msgstr "光線レーザー砲身"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
msgid "bag of holding"
msgid_plural "bags of holding"
msgstr[0] "収納の鞄"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'bag of holding', 'str_pl': 'bags of holding'}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
msgid ""
"A sleek, unfathomably-complicated machine covered in dozens of blinking "
"lights, worn on the back by sturdy faux-leather straps.  An electrode "
"dangles from the back, attaching to your forehead.  How it operates without "
"annihilating spacetime isn't quite clear, but a localized portal allows "
"things to be stored in an extradimensional space."
msgstr ""
"何十もの明滅するライトに覆われた、洗練された不可解なほど複雑な機械。頑丈な合皮ストラップで背中に装着する。後部からは電極がぶら下がり、額に貼り付ける仕組みだ。時空を消滅させずに動作する理屈は不明だが、局在化されたポータルがアイテムの次元外空間への格納を可能にしている。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
msgid "titanium vest"
msgid_plural "titanium vests"
msgstr[0] "チタンベスト"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'titanium vest'}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
msgid ""
"A lightweight armor vest made of pieces of titanium sewn together, with "
"cloth padding for comfort.  Brittle against blunt force, but highly "
"resistant to cuts and corrosion."
msgstr "チタンの小片を縫い合わせ、快適な布製緩衝材を備えた軽量のアーマーベスト。打撃には脆いが、斬撃と腐食に対しては非常に高い耐性を持つ。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
msgid "hologram cloak mk.2"
msgid_plural "hologram cloak mk.2s"
msgstr[0] "ホログラム・クロークmk.2"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'hologram cloak mk.2'}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
msgid ""
" A, when activated, will create an holographic decoy of its wearer.  Powered"
" by an experimental n-space energy generator, it slowly recharges itself for"
" free, probably by syphoning excess energy from some unknown "
"hyperdimensional space."
msgstr ""
"これは、起動すると着用者の姿を模したホログラフィック・デコイを生成する。実験的なN空間エネルギー生成装置を搭載しており、未知の超次元空間から余剰エネルギーを吸い上げることによって、ゆっくりと自動的に充電される。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
msgid "sentinel-lx cloak"
msgid_plural "sentinel-lx cloaks"
msgstr[0] "センチネルLXクローク"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'sentinel-lx cloak'}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
msgid ""
"The vantablack cloak of sentinel-lx hangs around ones shoulders as a solid, "
"unnatural shadow.  Made from woven graphene, its lightweight and resistant, "
"but cannot be repaired"
msgstr ""
"ベンタブラック色の外套は、着用者の肩に、実体を持つ不自然な影のようにまとわりつく。グラフェンを織り込んだ素材で作られており、軽量かつ耐久性があるが、修理は不可能だ。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
msgid "Uplifted SWAT armor"
msgid_plural "Uplifted SWAT armors"
msgstr[0] "知性生物用SWATアーマー"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Uplifted SWAT armor'}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
msgid ""
"An extra large suit of black bulletproof armor with lots of pockets.  The "
"word SWAT is emblazoned across the back.  Specifically designed for Uplifted"
" officers such as Mastodons."
msgstr ""
"ポケットがたくさん付いた特大サイズの黒い防弾性装甲スーツ。背中には大きくSWATの文字が刻印されている。マストドンのような知性化された警官のために特別に設計されたものだ。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
msgid "empty XL  ballistic vest"
msgid_plural "empty XL  ballistic vests"
msgstr[0] "空のXL防弾ベスト"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'empty XL  ballistic vest'}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
msgid ""
"Oversized ballistic armor without any armor inserts.  The soft armor plate "
"carrier is still protective but it won't stop high energy projectiles."
msgstr ""
"防御プレートが挿入されていない特大サイズの防弾装甲。軟質装甲のプレートキャリアは依然として防護性能を持つが、高威力の弾丸を防ぐことはできない。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
msgid "XL ESAPI ballistic vest"
msgid_plural "XL ESAPI ballistic vests"
msgstr[0] "XL-ESAPI防弾ベスト"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'XL ESAPI ballistic vest'}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
msgid "Oversized ballistic armor with ESAPI ceramic armor plates."
msgstr "ESAPIセラミックアーマープレートを内蔵した特大サイズの防弾装備だ。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
msgid "pair of Killophant gloves"
msgid_plural "pair of Killophant gloves"
msgstr[0] "キロファントグローブ"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'pair of Killophant gloves'}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
msgid ""
"A pair of reinforced Kevlar tactical gloves, specifically designed to "
"accomodate three fingered Killophants.  Thinner than regular oversized "
"tactical gloves."
msgstr ""
"補強されたケブラー製のタクティカルグローブ。3本指のキロファントに対応するよう特別に設計されている。通常の特大タクティカルグローブよりも薄い。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
msgid "XL tactical full helmet"
msgid_plural "XL tactical full helmets"
msgstr[0] "XLタクティカルフルヘルメット"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'XL tactical full helmet'}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
msgid ""
"An all-encompassing massive black helmet that covers your entire face and "
"neck, providing excellent protection from all sorts of damage."
msgstr "全てを覆い尽くす巨大な黒いヘルメット。顔全体と首を保護し、あらゆる種類のダメージに対して優れた防御力を提供する。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
msgid "HERC rig"
msgid_plural "HERC rigs"
msgstr[0] "HERCリグ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'HERC rig'}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor.json
msgid ""
"A lightweight steel-reinforced tool carrier.  Keeps your tools safe and "
"about in zero-g, Mars, the bottom of the Pacific, or other generally "
"inhospitable environments.  It has several deep pockets, and two mounting "
"points for pressurized canisters or other large magazines."
msgstr ""
"鋼鉄で強化された軽量の工具運搬装備。無重力、火星、太平洋の海底、その他一般的に過酷な環境下で、工具を安全に保管し、手元に保持する。複数の深いポケットと、加圧キャニスターや大型の弾倉を装填するための2つの取り付け口を備える。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/bioparts.json
msgid "living brain in a jar"
msgid_plural "jars full of living brains"
msgstr[0] "脳缶"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'living brain in a jar', 'str_pl': 'jars full of
#. living brains'}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/bioparts.json
msgid ""
"This jar contains a human brain kept alive by mi-go technology.  It has "
"metal veined tendrils that appear to allow it to connect to various devices."
msgstr ""
"この缶の中には、ミ＝ゴの技術によって生きたまま保持されている人間の脳が入っている。金属質の筋が通った触手が伸びており、様々な装置に接続できるように見える。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/bioparts.json
msgid "humming heart"
msgid_plural "humming hearts"
msgstr[0] "唸る心臓"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'humming heart'}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/bioparts.json
msgid ""
"This heartlike organ has multiple valves and upon its proper removal from "
"the bioweapons corpse each valve sealed itself.  It hums gently in your "
"hands, as if waiting for an appropriate receptacle."
msgstr ""
"複数の弁が付いた心臓のような器官だ。生体兵器の死体から適切に取り出すと、各弁がひとりでに密封された。適切な格納容器を待っているかのように、手の中で静かに鳴っている。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/bioparts.json
msgid "sensory cluster"
msgid_plural "sensory clusters"
msgstr[0] "感覚器官"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'sensory cluster'}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/bioparts.json
msgid ""
"This lump of flesh has various lobes protruding from it that at intervals "
"will emit toned sounds.  Perhaps it works via echolocation.  Like all mi-go "
"bioparts the openings on this piece closed up after it was cut free and it "
"seems to have gone into a form of hibernation with the pulses occurring "
"slower and slower as it conserves energy."
msgstr ""
"様々な突起が突き出し、一定間隔で調律された音を発する肉塊。おそらくエコーロケーションによって機能している。他のミ＝ゴ製生体パーツと同様に、この器官も切り離された後、開口部が閉鎖された。エネルギーを節約するにつれてパルスは次第に遅くなり、休止状態に移行したようだ。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/bioparts.json
msgid "bioweapon chassis"
msgid_plural "bioweapon chassis"
msgstr[0] "生体タレットシャーシ"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'bioweapon chassis'}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/bioparts.json
msgid ""
"This cross between a sea anemone and what you imagine a dragon's mouth would"
" look like is the core body of the bioweapon.  You cannot imagine what you "
"could make out of this but maybe someone somewhere does."
msgstr ""
"イソギンチャクと、想像するドラゴンの口とを掛け合わせたような形状の、生体兵器の中核となる胴体だ。これを使って何が作れるかは想像もつかないが、どこかの誰かなら作り方を知っているかもしれない。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/bioparts.json
msgid "broken mi-go turret"
msgid_plural "broken mi-go turrets"
msgstr[0] "壊れたミ＝ゴタレット"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'broken mi-go turret'}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/bioparts.json
msgid ""
"A broken mi-go turret.  It's leaking fluids and smells you can't identify.  "
"Could be butchered for parts."
msgstr "壊れたミ＝ゴタレット。液体を漏らし、識別不能な臭いを放っている。部品目当てに解体できるかもしれない。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/bioparts.json
msgid "vibrating bioblaster"
msgid_plural "vibrating bioblasters"
msgstr[0] "震える生体銃"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/bioparts.json
msgid ""
"You ripped this from a mi-go abomination.  You think you should wear gloves "
"to reload it.  "
msgstr "忌まわしきミ＝ゴの異形から引き剥がした銃だ。弾薬を装填する際は、手袋を着用すべきだろう。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/books.json
msgid "original copy of Housefly"
msgid_plural "original copies of Housefly"
msgstr[0] "イエバエ原本"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'original copy of Housefly', 'str_pl': 'original
#. copies of Housefly'}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/books.json
msgid ""
"The only copy of Housefly in existence - a long book about three individuals"
" drawn together by fate in the early 1800s to save their English town of "
"Victoria from a mysterious threat.  You never got to publish it, but reading"
" it lets you forget the horrors of the Cataclysm, if only for a moment."
msgstr ""
"「イエバエ」という題の、現存する唯一の写しだ。1800年代初期、運命に引き寄せられた3人の人物が、イギリスの街ビクトリアを不可解な脅威から救おうと奮闘する長編小説だ。出版は叶わなかったが、読めば、大災厄の恐怖をほんの一瞬だけでも忘れさせてくれる。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/books.json
msgid "USMC M1014 technical manual"
msgid_plural "USMC M1014 technical manuals"
msgstr[0] "USMC M1014技術手引書"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'USMC M1014 technical manual'}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/books.json
msgid ""
"A pocket-sized book printed in 2000 by the United States Marine Corps for "
"official use.  It describes the operation, repair, and cleaning of the "
"Benilli M1014 shotgun.  Though specific to the M4, it can provide a wealth "
"of information to the trained eye."
msgstr ""
"米国海兵隊が2000年に公的利用のため出版したポケットサイズの書籍。ベネリM1014ショットガンの操作、修理、清掃が詳述されている。M4に特化した内容だが、熟練者の目には豊富な情報をもたらすだろう。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/books.json
msgid "Black Powder to Berettas"
msgid_plural "copies of Black Powder to Berettas"
msgstr[0] "黒色火薬からベレッタまで"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Black Powder to Berettas', 'str_pl': 'copies of
#. Black Powder to Berettas'}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/books.json
msgid ""
"This hardcover book, aimed at the gun nut, provides an illustrated, concise "
"history of the handgun throughout history, including technical "
"specifications and use techniques.  It's difficult to follow without a "
"passing knowledge in pistols, but an experienced handgun user could glean "
"much from it."
msgstr ""
"銃マニアを対象としたこのハードカバー本は、ハンドガンの簡潔な歴史から技術仕様や使用技術までを、図解も交えて解説している。拳銃に関する基礎知識がなければ理解は困難だが、熟練のハンドガン使いであれば多大な知識を引き出せるだろう。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/books.json
msgid "America's Rifle"
msgid_plural "copies of America's Rifle"
msgstr[0] "アメリカのライフル"

#. ~ Description for {'str': "America's Rifle", 'str_pl': "copies of America's
#. Rifle"}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/books.json
msgid ""
"A history book penned by an anonymous author.  Starting from its design by "
"John Garand and ending with the Vietnam War, it provides a detailed run-down"
" of the M1 Garand rifle's use throughout history as well as its design and "
"quirks with the weapon."
msgstr ""
"匿名で執筆された歴史書だ。ジョン・ガーランドによる設計からベトナム戦争の終結まで、M1ガーランドライフルの歴史を通じた詳細な運用記録、デザイン、および武器の癖について解説されている。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/books.json
msgid "Jane's Flamethrowers and Firestarters"
msgid_plural "copies of Jane's Flamethrowers and Firestarters"
msgstr[0] "ジェーン社発行:火炎放射器と発火装置"

#. ~ Description for {'str': "Jane's Flamethrowers and Firestarters",
#. 'str_pl': "copies of Jane's Flamethrowers and Firestarters"}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/books.json
msgid ""
"A detailed, full-colored guide to flamethrowers, incendiary weapons, and "
"napalm.  It builds off of information provided in its sister book, Jane's "
"Mortars and Rocket Launchers, and so it's mostly incomprehensible to anyone "
"without prior knowledge."
msgstr ""
"火炎放射器、焼夷兵器、ナパーム弾について、フルカラーで詳細に解説されたガイドだ。姉妹本である「迫撃砲とロケットランチャー」の情報に基づいて記述されているため、予備知識なしにはほとんど理解できない。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/books.json
msgid "Nuclear Physics Made Easy"
msgid_plural "copies of Nuclear Physics Made Easy"
msgstr[0] "よくわかる核物理学"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Nuclear Physics Made Easy', 'str_pl': 'copies of
#. Nuclear Physics Made Easy'}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/books.json
msgid ""
"A book detailing the workings of state of the art atomic technology, and the"
" physics behind it."
msgstr "最先端の原子力技術と、それを支える物理学について詳述した本だ。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/books.json
msgid "Cyrus Whateley's Notes on Repurposing mi-go victims"
msgid_plural "copies of Cyrus Whateley's Notes"
msgstr[0] "サイラス・ウェイトリーによるミ＝ゴの犠牲者再利用に関する覚書"

#. ~ Description for {'str': "Cyrus Whateley's Notes on Repurposing mi-go
#. victims", 'str_pl': "copies of Cyrus Whateley's Notes"}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/books.json
msgid ""
"A folio of notes written by a madman.  They seem to suggestion ways to re-"
"animate the dead and create various affronts to the natural order."
msgstr "狂人によって書かれたノートの折帖。死者を蘇生させたり、自然の秩序に対する様々な禁忌を生み出す方法を示唆しているようだ。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/books.json
msgid "Dr Moreau and You"
msgid_plural "copies of Dr Moreau and You"
msgstr[0] "モロー博士とあなた"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Dr Moreau and You', 'str_pl': 'copies of Dr
#. Moreau and You'}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/books.json
msgid ""
"In what many considered a stunning example of poor taste and others "
"considered overt specieism this text on the creation of Uplifted Animals "
"references a story about sapient animals killing their creator.  Otherwise a"
" dry text about genetic modification."
msgstr ""
"知性生物の創造に関するこのテキストは、知性をもった動物が創造主を殺害する物語を引用している。多くの者が悪趣味の驚くべき一例と見なし、またある者はあからさまな種族差別と見なす内容だ。その他の部分については、遺伝子組み換えに関する無味乾燥な記述である。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/books.json
msgid "Millyficent's Diary"
msgid_plural "copies of Millyficent's Diary"
msgstr[0] "ミリフィセントの日記"

#. ~ Description for {'str': "Millyficent's Diary", 'str_pl': "copies of
#. Millyficent's Diary"}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/books.json
msgid ""
"A pocket-sized book filled to the margins with cramped handwriting and notes"
" on the biology of Mi-Go and other musings.  It's hard to understand and "
"quite gruesome in some places and written in a shorthand or cipher in "
"others."
msgstr ""
"欄外の余白まで乱雑な手書き文字で埋め尽くされた小型の本。ミ＝ゴの生態やその他の思索に関するメモが記されている。一部は難解でぞっとする内容だが、別の部分では速記や暗号で書かれている。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/books.json
msgid "Unusual Ammunitions of the Corporations"
msgid_plural "copies of Unusual Ammunitions of the Corporations"
msgstr[0] "企業の特殊弾薬"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Unusual Ammunitions of the Corporations',
#. 'str_pl': 'copies of Unusual Ammunitions of the Corporations'}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/books.json
msgid ""
"A lab book dedicated to reverse engineering various ammunitions found "
"throughout the solar system.  Written in a format to allow barely trained "
"technicians to *safely* replicate these rounds."
msgstr ""
"太陽系全域で見つかったありとあらゆる弾薬のリバースエンジニアリングに特化した実験ノートだ。かろうじて訓練を受けた技術者でも、これらの弾薬を安全に複製できるよう、分かりやすく記述されている。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/cast_spell_items.json
msgid "caster"
msgid_plural "casters"
msgstr[0] "詠唱装置"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'caster'}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/cast_spell_items.json
msgid "A generic techno doodad used to cast spells."
msgstr "呪文詠唱に使われる汎用的なテクノ・ガジェットだ。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/cast_spell_items.json
msgid "hologram transposition caster"
msgid_plural "hologram transposition casters"
msgstr[0] "ホログラム転位詠唱装置"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'hologram transposition caster'}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/cast_spell_items.json
msgid ""
"A small metallic sphere with a recessed bottom up top.  When activated it "
"will allow you to swap positions with an existing hologram."
msgstr "底が凹んだ小さな金属製の球体だ。起動すると、既存のホログラムと自分の位置を交換できる。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/cast_spell_items.json
msgid "hologram flare caster"
msgid_plural "hologram flare casters"
msgstr[0] "ホログラム閃光詠唱装置"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'hologram flare caster'}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/cast_spell_items.json
msgid ""
"A small metallic sphere with a recessed bottom up top.  When activated it "
"will allow you to select an hologram, which will explode in a blinding "
"flash, stunning anything nearby."
msgstr "底が凹んだ小さな金属製の球体だ。起動すると、選択したホログラムを爆発させ、強烈な閃光を発生させることで、付近のあらゆるものを気絶させる。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/cast_spell_items.json
msgid "decoy caster"
msgid_plural "decoy casters"
msgstr[0] "デコイ詠唱装置"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'decoy caster'}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/cast_spell_items.json
msgid ""
"A small metallic sphere with a recessed bottom up top.  When activated it "
"will a holographic decoy in a location of your choosing."
msgstr "底が凹んだ小さな金属製の球体だ。起動すると、選択した位置に囮として機能するホログラムが出現する。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/cast_spell_items.json
msgid "decoy field caster"
msgid_plural "decoy field casters"
msgstr[0] "デコイ・フィールド詠唱装置"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'decoy field caster'}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/cast_spell_items.json
msgid ""
"A small metallic sphere with a recessed bottom up top.  When activated it "
"will create several holographic decoys around you."
msgstr "底が凹んだ小さな金属製の球体だ。起動すると、周囲に囮として機能する複数のホログラムを生成する。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/cbms.json
msgid "Wind Turbine CBM"
msgid_plural "Wind Turbine CBMs"
msgstr[0] "風力タービン CBM"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Wind Turbine CBM'}
#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Wind Turbines'}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/cbms.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Installed on your body is a set of small retractable wind turbines.  When "
"activated, they will deploy and slowly harvest wind power to recharge your "
"power level."
msgstr "胴体に小型の格納式風力タービンが組み込まれている。起動すると風車を展開し、風力を利用してCBMの電力をゆっくりと再充電する。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/cbms.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/bionics.json
msgid "Cranium Bomb"
msgid_plural "Cranium Bombs"
msgstr[0] "頭蓋爆弾"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Cranium Bomb'}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/cbms.json
msgid ""
"A bomb installed where your spine meets your brain stem.  It's on a timer "
"from installation and you don't have the codes to reset the timer."
msgstr "背骨と脳幹の間に移植された爆弾だ。タイマーが付いているが、リセットするコードはない。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/cbms.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/bionics.json
msgid "Skullgun CBM"
msgid_plural "Skullgun CBMs"
msgstr[0] "スカルガン CBM"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Skullgun CBM'}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/cbms.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Concealed in your head is a single shot .40 pistol.  Activate the bionic to "
"fire and reload the skullgun."
msgstr "頭部に隠された.40口径の単発拳銃だ。この義体を起動することで、スカルガンを射撃および再装填できる。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
msgid "nutriment"
msgid_plural "nutriments"
msgstr[0] "栄養剤"

#. ~ Description for nutriment
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
msgid ""
"A crumbly white pill half the size of your thumb, packed with vitamins and "
"calories.  Provides a whole day's nutrition in portable form, but it's a "
"little hard to keep down, thanks to the rancid taste and chalky texture."
msgstr ""
"ビタミンとカロリーが詰まった、親指ほどの大きさの脆い白い錠剤。携帯可能で丸一日分の栄養を供給するが、腐敗臭のする味と粉っぽい食感のせいで、吐き気を催し、飲み込むのに苦労する。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
msgid "nutriment water"
msgid_plural "nutriment waters"
msgstr[0] "栄養剤ドリンク"

#. ~ Description for nutriment water
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
msgid ""
"Nutriment that has been dissolved in water to dilute its taste.  Unnervingly"
" resembles spoiled milk."
msgstr "味を薄めるために水に溶かされた栄養剤だ。不気味なほど腐った牛乳に似ている。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles.json
msgid "sundew"
msgid_plural "sundews"
msgstr[0] "サンデュー"

#. ~ Description for sundew
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles.json
msgid ""
"Water treated with some sort of chemical compound.  It's incapable of "
"freezing, is very light, and glows faintly.  Drinking it seems to sharpen "
"the senses."
msgstr "ある種の化合物で処理された水だ。決して凍らず、非常に軽く、ほのかに光る。飲むと感覚が鋭くなるようだ。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/comestibles.json
msgid "sungel"
msgid_plural "sungels"
msgstr[0] "サンジェル"

#. ~ Use action activation_message for sungel.
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/comestibles.json
msgid ""
"Your vision sharpens and your eyes widen as the sungel slams your senses."
msgstr "サンジェルが感覚を直撃し、視力が向上し、目が大きく見開かれる。"

#. ~ Description for sungel
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/comestibles.json
msgid ""
"Mixed with morphine, this sundew has congealed, and has an immense "
"stimulative and pain-numbing effect.  With sufficient tools, it could be "
"used to create anesthesia."
msgstr "モルヒネと混合され凝固したサンデューだ。絶大な興奮作用と鎮痛作用を持つ。適切な道具があれば、これを材料に麻酔薬を製作できる。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/obsolete.json
msgid "sunesthesia"
msgid_plural "sunesthesias"
msgstr[0] "サンエステシア"

#. ~ Use action activation_message for sunesthesia.
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/obsolete.json
msgid "You go limp and collapse as the sunesthesia knocks you senseless."
msgstr "サンエステシアがあなたを無感覚にし、体の力が抜け、崩れ落ちる。"

#. ~ Description for sunesthesia
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/obsolete.json
msgid ""
"This sungel has been mixed with several drugs and yet inherits none of their"
" effects.  Its painkilling effect hasn't changed, but its stimulative "
"properties have been reversed, and it could be used as anesthesia for "
"installation of bionics."
msgstr ""
"サンジェルに数種類の薬品が混合されているが、それらの効果は引き継いでいない。鎮痛作用は維持されているが、興奮作用が鎮静作用に反転している。CBMを移植する際の麻酔薬として利用可能だ。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/corpses.json
msgid "broken sentinel-lx"
msgid_plural "broken sentinels-lx"
msgstr[0] "壊れたセンチネルLX"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'broken sentinel-lx', 'str_pl': 'broken
#. sentinels-lx'}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/corpses.json
msgid ""
"The irreparably broken remains of a Sentinel-lx.  Could be gutted for "
"valuable parts."
msgstr "修復不可能なセンチネルLXの残骸だ。貴重な部品目当てに解体できるだろう。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/corpses.json
msgid "broken bloodhound drone"
msgid_plural "broken bloodhound drones"
msgstr[0] "壊れたブラックハウンド・ドローン"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'broken bloodhound drone'}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/corpses.json
msgid ""
"This bloodhound won't be chasing anyone anymore.  Could be gutted for parts."
msgstr "このブラッドハウンドが誰かを追うことはもうない。部品目当てに解体できるだろう。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/corpses.json
msgid "broken utility robot"
msgid_plural "broken utility robots"
msgstr[0] "壊れた多目的ロボット"

#. ~ Description for broken utility robot
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/corpses.json
msgid ""
"A broken utility robot, now limp and unmoving.  Could be gutted for parts or"
" crafted into a salvaged robot."
msgstr "壊れた多目的ロボット。今は動かず、ぐったりと垂れ下がっている。部品目当てに解体したり、サルベージロボットの材料にしたりできる。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/corpses.json
msgid "broken beehive robot"
msgid_plural "broken beehive robots"
msgstr[0] "壊れた養蜂ロボット"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/corpses.json
msgid "broken xray laser turret"
msgid_plural "broken xray laser turrets"
msgstr[0] "壊れたX線レーザータレット"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/corpses.json
msgid "broken Whately turret"
msgid_plural "broken Whately turrets"
msgstr[0] "壊れたウェイトリータレット"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/corpses.json
msgid "broken butler-bot"
msgid_plural "broken butler-bots"
msgstr[0] "壊れたバトラーボット"

#. ~ Description for broken butler-bot
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/corpses.json
msgid ""
"A broken butler-bot, now silent and mangled.  Could be stripped down for "
"parts."
msgstr "沈黙し、ひどく破壊されたバトラーボットの残骸だ。部品目当てに解体できるだろう。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/corpses.json
msgid "broken construction robot"
msgid_plural "broken construction robots"
msgstr[0] "壊れた建設作業ロボット"

#. ~ Description for broken construction robot
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/corpses.json
msgid ""
"A broken construction robot, now wrecked and immobile.  Could be stripped "
"down for parts."
msgstr "破壊され、身動きが取れなくなった建設作業ロボットだ。部品目当てに解体できるだろう。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/corpses.json
msgid "broken firefighter robot"
msgid_plural "broken firefighter robots"
msgstr[0] "壊れた消防ロボット"

#. ~ Description for broken firefighter robot
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/corpses.json
msgid ""
"A broken firefighter robot, now cold and inert.  Could be stripped down for "
"parts."
msgstr "冷え切って活動を停止した消防ロボットの残骸だ。部品目当てに解体できるだろう。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/corpses.json
msgid "broken rat snatcher"
msgid_plural "broken rat snatchers"
msgstr[0] "壊れたラットスナッチャー"

#. ~ Description for broken rat snatcher
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/corpses.json
msgid ""
"A broken rat snatcher, now harmless and inert.  Could be stripped down or "
"re-crafted."
msgstr "無害となり活動を停止したラットスナッチャーだ。分解したり、再構築したりできるだろう。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/corpses.json
msgid "broken grab-bot"
msgid_plural "broken grab-bots"
msgstr[0] "壊れたグラブボット"

#. ~ Description for broken grab-bot
