"projector.  Could be stripped for parts."
msgstr "壊れた改良型ロボットだ。内蔵されたEMP発生装置で武装している。部品目当てに解体できるだろう。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/corpses.json
msgid "broken disarmed military bot"
msgid_plural "broken disarmed military bots"
msgstr[0] "壊れた武装解除型軍用ロボット"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/corpses.json
msgid "broken disarmed defense bot"
msgid_plural "broken disarmed defense bots"
msgstr[0] "壊れた武装解除型防衛ロボット"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/corpses.json
msgid "broken medical bot"
msgid_plural "broken medical bots"
msgstr[0] "壊れたメディボット"

#. ~ Description for broken medical bot
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/corpses.json
msgid ""
"A broken medical robot, now crumpled and inert.  Could be stripped down for "
"parts."
msgstr "ぐしゃぐしゃに潰れ、活動を停止した医療ロボットの残骸だ。部品目当てに解体できるだろう。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/frankenstein_items.json
msgid "inactive frankenstein"
msgid_plural "inactive frankensteins"
msgstr[0] "フランケンシュタイン [停止中]"

#. ~ Description for inactive frankenstein
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/frankenstein_items.json
msgid ""
"This stitched together abomination in human form lies still and waiting for "
"you to give it the spark of life.  In all likelihood you are the monster."
msgstr "皮膚を縫い合わされた人間型の忌まわしい残骸。生命の火花を与えられる時をじっと待っている。ほぼ間違いなく、あなたこそが怪物なのだ。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/grenades.json
msgid "electroshock grenade"
msgid_plural "electroshock grenades"
msgstr[0] "電撃手榴弾"

#. ~ Description for electroshock grenade
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/grenades.json
msgid ""
"This is an electronic weapon that will emit a short ranged electric field.  "
"When activated, you'll have five turns before it starts doing so; throwing "
"it before that would be a good idea."
msgstr "狭い範囲に電撃を発生させる電子兵器だ。起動すると、作動するまでに5ターンの猶予がある。その前に投げるのが得策だろう。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/grenades.json
msgid "armed electroshock grenade"
msgid_plural "armed electroshock grenades"
msgstr[0] "電撃手榴弾 [作動中]"

#. ~ Description for armed electroshock grenade
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/grenades.json
msgid ""
"This electroshock grenade is currently creating a dangerous electric field."
msgstr "この電撃手榴弾は現在、危険な電撃を発生させている。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json
msgid "inactive brain blaster"
msgid_plural "inactive brain blasters"
msgstr[0] "生体タレット [停止中]"

#. ~ Use action friendly_msg for {'str': 'inactive brain blaster'}.
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json
msgid "The brain blaster swivels towards you.  Hi new friend!"
msgstr "ブレインブラスターがこちらに振り向いた。「やあ、新しい友達！」"

#. ~ Use action hostile_msg for {'str': 'inactive brain blaster'}.
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json
msgid "The brain blaster swivels towards you.  You feel a buzzing in the air."
msgstr "ブレインブラスターがこちらに振り向いた。空気に不穏な振動を感じる。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'inactive brain blaster'}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json
msgid ""
"This is a horrifying monstrosity.  Using this item is cannibalism in all but"
" taste and involves turning it on and placing it on the ground, where it "
"will attach itself.  If reprogrammed and rewired successfully the turret "
"will identify you as a friendly, and attack all enemies with its revolving "
"laser cannons."
msgstr ""
"これは恐ろしい怪物だ。使用すると起動し、地面に置くと自ら付着して固定される。これは味覚以外は人肉食に等しい行為だ。プログラムの書き換えと配線に成功すれば、タレットはあなたを味方と認識し、回転式レーザー砲であらゆる敵を攻撃する。"

#. ~ Use action hostile_msg for {'str': 'inactive chicken walker'}.
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json
msgid "The chicken walker whirrs and aims directly at you.  Take cover!"
msgstr "チキンウォーカーが唸る音を立てて、あなたに照準を合わせた！ 隠れろ！"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'inactive chicken walker'}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json
msgid ""
"This is an inactive chicken walker.  Using this item involves placing it on "
"the ground, loading the unit with the factory-loaded 5.56 rounds and 40mm "
"cartridge grenades in your inventory (if you wish to divide your ammunition,"
" set aside whatever ammunition you do NOT want to give the robot) and "
"turning it on.  If reprogrammed and rewired successfully the tank drone will"
" then identify you as a friendly, roam around or follow you, and attack all "
"enemies with a built-in firearm and grenade launcher."
msgstr ""
"停止状態のチキンウォーカーだ。使用すると地面に設置し、所持している工場弾薬の5.56mm弾と40mmカートリッジグレネードが装填され、起動する。（弾薬を分ける場合は、ロボットに渡したくない弾薬を一旦地面に置いておけ）。プログラムの書き換えと配線に成功すると、チキンウォーカーはあなたを味方と認識し、追従もしくは周囲の探索を開始。内蔵銃器とグレネードランチャーであらゆる敵を攻撃する。"

#. ~ Use action hostile_msg for {'str': 'inactive tripod'}.
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json
msgid ""
"The tribot glowers down at you and ignites its flamethrower.  Turns out you "
"hate the smell of napalm."
msgstr "トライボットがあなたをにらみつけ、火炎放射器に点火した。どうやらあなたはナパームの臭いが大嫌いなようだ。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json
msgid "inactive sentinel-lx"
msgid_plural "inactive sentinel-lxs"
msgstr[0] "センチネルLX [停止中]"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'inactive sentinel-lx'}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json
msgid ""
"Crouched and dead still, this armored luxurious robot resembles an ancient "
"knight immersed in deep prayer.  If reprogrammed and rewired successfully "
"the robot will identify you as a friendly, and will protect you from nearby "
"foes."
msgstr ""
"豪華に装甲されたこのロボットは、身をかがめて微動だにせず、まるで深い祈りを捧げる古代の騎士のようだ。プログラムの書き換えと配線に成功すれば、あなたを味方として認識し、付近の敵から護衛してくれるだろう。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json
msgid "inactive bloodhound drone"
msgid_plural "inactive bloodhound drones"
msgstr[0] "ブラックハウンド・ドローン [停止中]"

#. ~ Use action friendly_msg for {'str': 'inactive bloodhound drone'}.
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json
msgid "The bloodhound drone flies from your hand and surveys the area!"
msgstr "ブラックハウンド・ドローンが手から飛び立ち、周辺を監視している！"

#. ~ Use action hostile_msg for {'str': 'inactive bloodhound drone'}.
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json
msgid "You misprogram the bloodhound drone; it's hostile!"
msgstr "プログラムミスだ。ブラックハウンド・ドローンが敵対化した！"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'inactive bloodhound drone'}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json
msgid ""
"This is an inactive bloodhound drone.  If successfully deployed, it will fly"
" towards enemy targets and highlight them with a powerful spotlight."
msgstr "停止中のブラックハウンド・ドローンだ。展開に成功すると敵めがけて飛び立ち、強力なスポットライトで対象を照らしだす。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'inactive laser turret'}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json
msgid ""
"This is an inactive laser turret.  Using this item involves turning it on "
"and placing it on the ground, where it will attach itself.  If reprogrammed "
"and rewired successfully the turret will identify you as a friendly, and "
"attack all enemies with its replaceable laser cannons.  It requires "
"ammunition tubes to fire."
msgstr ""
"停止状態のレーザータレットだ。使用すると起動し、地面に置くと自ら付着して固定される。プログラムの書き換えと配線に成功すれば、あなたを味方と認識し、交換可能なレーザー砲であらゆる敵を攻撃する。発射には弾薬チューブが必要だ。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json
msgid "inactive bee-bot"
msgid_plural "inactive bee-bots"
msgstr[0] "養蜂ボット [停止中]"

#. ~ Description for inactive bee-bot
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json
msgid ""
"A salvaged utility robot converted into an ambulatory bee hive that "
"periodically removes and delivers segments of fresh honey comb.  It protects"
" the insect colony with a mechanical crossbow mounted to its chassis.  "
"Activate this item, with wooden bolts in your inventory, to load and deploy "
"the robot."
msgstr ""
"回収された多目的ロボットを歩行可能な巣箱に改造したものだ。新鮮なハチの巣の塊を定期的に取り出して運搬する。機械式クロスボウがフレームに搭載されており、昆虫の群れを外敵から護衛する。木製ボルトを所持した状態で起動すると、ロボットが展開しボルトが装填される。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json
msgid "inactive medibot"
msgid_plural "inactive medibots"
msgstr[0] "メディボット [停止中]"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json
msgid "inactive utilibot"
msgid_plural "inactive utilibots"
msgstr[0] "ユーティリティボット [停止中]"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json
msgid "inactive hack"
msgid_plural "inactive hacks"
msgstr[0] "マンハック [停止中]"

#. ~ Description for inactive hack
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json
msgid ""
"This is an inactive manhack.  Manhacks are fist-sized robots that fly "
"through the air.  They are covered with whirring blades and attack by "
"throwing themselves against their target.  Use this item to reprogram and "
"activate the manhack.  Electronics and computer skill determines if the "
"targeting matrix is reprogrammed successfully."
msgstr ""
"停止状態のマンハックだ。常に刃を高速回転させながら空中を飛ぶ拳ほどのサイズの自律ロボットで、標的に向かって体当たり攻撃を行う。使うとプログラムを書き換えて起動する。機械整備およびコンピュータのスキルに応じて、再プログラムの成否が決まる。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json
msgid "inactive floating lantern"
msgid_plural "inactive floating lanterns"
msgstr[0] "マンハック(光源/停止)"

#. ~ Use action friendly_msg for inactive floating lantern.
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json
msgid "The floating lantern flies from your hand and lights up the area!"
msgstr "マンハック(光源)が飛び立ち、周辺を監視し始めた！"

#. ~ Use action hostile_msg for inactive floating lantern.
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json
msgid "You misprogram the lantern."
msgstr "マンハック(光源)のプログラムに間違いがあったようだ。"

#. ~ Description for inactive floating lantern
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json
msgid ""
"An inactive floating lantern, a fist-sized robots that flies through the air"
" and illuminates its surroundings with bright LEDs.  The lantern is non "
"aggressive and has no means of attack.  Activate this item to deploy the "
"salvaged robot."
msgstr ""
"停止中の浮遊ランタンだ。空中を浮遊しながら、明るいLEDで周囲を照らす拳大のロボットである。非攻撃的であり、攻撃手段を持たない。このアイテムを起動すると、回収されたロボットが展開される。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json
msgid "inactive military robot"
msgid_plural "inactive military robots"
msgstr[0] "軍用ロボット [停止中]"

#. ~ Description for inactive military robot
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json
msgid ""
"An unpowered military robot fitted with an integrated 7.62x51mm firearm and "
"electric prod.  Activate this item, with ammo in your inventory, to load and"
" deploy the robot."
msgstr ""
"電源の入っていない軍用ロボット。7.62x51mmの銃器と電気ムチが内蔵されている。インベントリに弾薬がある状態でこのアイテムを起動すると、ロボットを装填・展開できる。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json
msgid "inactive floating heater"
msgid_plural "inactive floating heaters"
msgstr[0] "浮遊ヒーター [停止中]"

#. ~ Description for inactive floating heater
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json
msgid ""
"A salvaged eyebot repurposed into a floating space heater.  It emits a "
"constant jet of warm air to heat an enclosed space.  It is non-aggressive "
"and has no weapons systems.  Activate this item to deploy the robot."
msgstr ""
"浮遊するヒーターに改造した停止中のアイボットだ。暖気を噴出し続けて密閉された空間を暖める。積極的に敵を攻撃することはなく、武器も搭載していない。使用するとロボットが起動する。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json
msgid "inactive defense robot"
msgid_plural "inactive defense robots"
msgstr[0] "防衛ロボット [停止中]"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json
msgid "inactive rat snatcher"
msgid_plural "inactive rat snatchers"
msgstr[0] "ラットスナッチャー [停止中]"

#. ~ Description for inactive rat snatcher
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json
msgid ""
"A salvaged skitterbot repurposed for hunting small game.  It attacks targets"
" with pincers and an integrated tazer.  Activate this item to deploy the "
"robot."
msgstr ""
"回収された高速ボットを、小動物の狩りのために再利用したものだ。ハサミと内蔵されたテーザー銃で標的を攻撃する。このアイテムを起動すると、ロボットが展開される。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json
msgid "inactive grab-bot"
msgid_plural "inactive grab-bots"
msgstr[0] "グラブボット [停止中]"

#. ~ Description for inactive grab-bot
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json
msgid ""
"A salvaged skitterbot repurposed to grab onto and immobilize enemies.  "
"Activate this item to deploy the robot."
msgstr "回収されたスキッターボットを、敵を掴んで拘束できるように再利用したものだ。このアイテムを起動すると、ロボットが展開される。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json
msgid "inactive pest hunter"
msgid_plural "inactive pest hunters"
msgstr[0] "ペストハンター [停止中]"

#. ~ Description for inactive pest hunter
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/inactiverobot.json
msgid ""
"A salvaged skitterbot refitted with an 8mm integrated firearm.  Activate "
"this item, with ammo in your inventory, to load and deploy the robot."
msgstr "8mm弾を発射する内蔵銃器を取り付けた高速ボットだ。弾薬を所持した状態で使用すると、ロボットが起動して弾薬が装填される。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/items.json
msgid "Crypto coin"
msgid_plural "Crypto coins"
msgstr[0] "暗号コイン"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Crypto coin'}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/items.json
msgid ""
"PrepNet had been heavily involved in avoiding taxes by using untraceable "
"internet currencies.  These however are physical coins with random numbers "
"sequences embossed on them and RFID chips inside."
msgstr ""
"PrepNetは、追跡不可能なインターネット通貨を用いた租税回避に深く関わっていた。しかし、この品は乱数列がエンボス加工され、RFIDチップが内蔵された物理的な硬貨だ。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/items.json
msgctxt "container"
msgid "basin"
msgid_plural "basins"
msgstr[0] "たらい"

#. ~ Description for {'ctxt': 'container', 'str': 'basin'}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/items.json
msgid ""
"A wide, shallow basin used to hold liquid, hammered from a piece of sheet "
"metal.  Ideal for collecting water."
msgstr "一枚の板金から打ち出して作られた、広く浅い液体用の容器だ。水を集めるのに最適だろう。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/items.json
msgid "scrap titanium"
msgid_plural "scrap titanium"
msgstr[0] "チタン屑"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'scrap titanium'}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/items.json
msgid "A piece of light titanium, usable for crafting or repairs."
msgstr "軽量チタンの欠片だ。製作や修理の材料に使える。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/items.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/vehicles/part_items.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/vehicles/vehicle_parts.json
msgid "MetalMaster forge buddy"
msgid_plural "MetalMaster forge buddies"
msgstr[0] "メタルマスター鍛造バディ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'MetalMaster forge buddy', 'str_pl': 'MetalMaster
#. forge buddies'}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/items.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/vehicles/part_items.json
msgid ""
"From the makers of the best-selling* FOODCO kitchen buddy comes the "
"MetalMaster forge buddy, for all your metalworking, firing, and welding "
"needs!  It's just as clunky and awkward as the thing it's spinning off, and "
"still requires a vehicle battery to function."
msgstr ""
"大ベストセラーのFOODCOキッチンバディのメーカーが送る、金属加工、焼成、溶接のニーズを全て満たすメタルマスター鍛造バディだ！スピンオフ元と同様に不格好で扱い辛く、稼働には相変わらず車両バッテリーが必要となる。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/items.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/vehicles/part_items.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/vehicles/vehicle_parts.json
msgid "KitchenMaster cooking buddy"
msgid_plural "KitchenMaster cooking buddies"
msgstr[0] "キッチンマスター調理バディ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'KitchenMaster cooking buddy', 'str_pl':
#. 'KitchenMaster cooking buddies'}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/items.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/vehicles/part_items.json
msgid ""
"Because it *clearly* needed one, this large all-in-one station provides the "
"functions of FOODCO's kitchen buddy, now with complementary fume hoods and "
"chemistry materials.  Why a chef would need a chemical rig is anyone's "
"guess, but you can mount it on a vehicle to make use of it."
msgstr ""
"必要性が明白だったため、FOODCOキッチンバディの機能に、ドラフトチャンバーと化学実験材料を補完的に加えた、大型オールインワンの作業台だ。シェフが化学装置を必要とする理由など、誰も知りようがないが、車両に取り付けて利用できる。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/items.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/vehicles/part_items.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/vehicles/vehicle_parts.json
msgid "cooking rig"
msgid_plural "cooking rigs"
msgstr[0] "調理装置"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'cooking rig'}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/items.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/vehicles/part_items.json
msgid ""
"Skillet, pot, hotplate, and chemistry set; everything you need to cook food "
"and chemicals.  Includes proper fume vents and a separator, so you don't "
"contaminate your food with toxic chemicals."
msgstr ""
"フライパン、鍋、ホットプレート、化学実験セット。食品と化学物質を調理するために必要な全てが揃っている。適切な排煙機構と隔離板が備わっているため、食品が有害な化学物質で汚染される心配はない。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/items.json
msgid "titanium"
msgid_plural "titanium"
msgstr[0] "チタン"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'titanium'}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/items.json
msgid ""
"A strong, durable metal.  Highly valued for its weight to strength ratio, it"
" was an excellent upgrade to aluminum for those properties albeit a lot more"
" expensive due to rarity.  More commonly used in jewelery and medical "
"implants."
msgstr ""
"強く頑丈な金属だ。比強度に優れており、希少性が高いため非常に高価だが、アルミニウムの優れた上位互換となる。装身具や医療用インプラントなどに頻繁に用いられる。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/items.json
msgid "titanium implant"
msgid_plural "titanium implants"
msgstr[0] "チタンインプラント"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'titanium implant'}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/items.json
msgid ""
"An internal implant to correct a musculoskeletal problem such as a bad hip "
"or back.  It is made of titanium due to its biocompatibility."
msgstr "痛めた股関節や背骨などの筋骨格の問題を治療するために体内に埋め込む器具だ。生体適合性のため、チタンでできている。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/items.json
msgid "titanium tooth"
msgid_plural "titanium tooths"
msgstr[0] "チタン製人工歯"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'titanium tooth'}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/items.json
msgid ""
"A dental implant made of pure titanium, used to replace teeth due to its "
"bio-compatibility and durability."
msgstr "生体への適合性と耐久性に優れており、歯の治療に使われる純チタン製の人工歯だ。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/items.json
msgid "titanium watch"
msgid_plural "titanium watches"
msgstr[0] "チタン腕時計"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'titanium watch', 'str_pl': 'titanium watches'}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/items.json
msgid ""
"A thick, masculine watch made out of titanium.  It is durable, light-weight "
"and water-resistant, an excellent watch to have in a hostile environment."
msgstr "チタン製の分厚い男性向け腕時計だ。耐久性が高く、軽量で耐水性があり、過酷な環境で持つには優れた時計である。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/items.json
msgid "titanium ring"
msgid_plural "titanium rings"
msgstr[0] "チタンリング"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'titanium ring'}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/items.json
msgid ""
"A thick, masculine ring made out of titanium.  Made in a variety of styles "
"and finishes, they're valued for their durability."
msgstr "チタン製の分厚い男性向け指輪だ。様々なスタイルと仕上げで製造されており、その耐久性が高く評価されている。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/materials.json
msgid "Titanium"
msgstr "チタン"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/materials.json
msgid "Graphene Weave"
msgstr "グラフェン織物"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/mutagen.json
msgid "mi-go serum"
msgid_plural "mi-go serums"
msgstr[0] "ミ＝ゴ血清"

#. ~ Description for mi-go serum
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/mutagen.json
msgid ""
"A super-concentrated mutagen strongly resembling a lava lamp.  You need a "
"syringe to inject it… if you really want to?"
msgstr "ラバライトによく似た、超濃縮された変異原物質だ。注射器を使って注射する必要がある… 本当にやるつもりか？"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/mutagen.json
msgid "mi-go mutagen"
msgid_plural "mi-go mutagens"
msgstr[0] "ミ＝ゴ変異原物質"

#. ~ Description for mi-go mutagen
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/mutagen.json
msgid ""
"An extremely rare mutagen cocktail, it smells of sulphur and glows orange."
msgstr "極めて希少な変異原カクテルだ。硫黄の匂いがし、オレンジ色に光っている。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/mutagen.json
msgid "mastodon serum"
msgid_plural "mastodon serums"
msgstr[0] "マストドン血清"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'mastodon serum'}
#. ~ Description for {'str': 'stego serum'}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/mutagen.json
#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/mutagen.json
msgid ""
"A super-concentrated mutagen not for those frightened of this thing they "
"have become.  You need a syringe to inject it… if you really want to?"
msgstr "超濃縮された変異原物質だ。自分が成り果てた姿を恐れる者には向かない。注射器を使って注射する必要がある… 本当にやるつもりか？"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/mutagen.json
msgid "mastodon mutagen"
msgid_plural "mastodon mutagens"
msgstr[0] "マストドン変異原物質"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'mastodon mutagen'}
#. ~ Description for {'str': 'stego mutagen'}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/mutagen.json
#: data/mods/DinoMod/items/mutagen.json
msgid ""
"An extremely rare mutagen cocktail, it seeks to cure what's deep inside."
msgstr "極めて希少な変異原カクテルだ。それは、内奥にあるものを治癒しようと作用する。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/obsolete.json
msgid "hauling space"
msgid_plural "hauling spaces"
msgstr[0] "大型カーゴスペース"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'hauling space'}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/obsolete.json
msgid ""
"A huge, empty space used in truck trailers to transport vast quantities of "
"stuff."
msgstr "大量輸送のため、トラックのトレーラーに使用される巨大な空き空間だ。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/obsolete.json
msgid "precision solderers"
msgid_plural "precision solderers"
msgstr[0] "精密ハンダ付けツール"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/obsolete.json
msgid "Precision Solderers CBM"
msgid_plural "Precision Solderers CBMs"
msgstr[0] "精密ハンダ付けツール CBM"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Precision Solderers CBM'}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/obsolete.json
msgid ""
"A set of tiny electronics tools, including soldering irons and wire cutters."
"  They serve no purpose on their own, but are required for crafting bionics."
msgstr "はんだごてやワイヤーカッターなどの微小な電子機器ツール一式だ。単体では何の役にも立たないが、義体の製作に必要となる。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'hauling space'}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/obsolete.json
msgid ""
"A huge metal space used in conjunction with extension of a vehicle's roof to"
" create a very large amount of space for transporting goods."
msgstr "車両の屋根を拡張し、大量の物資輸送のために極めて大きな空間を生み出す、巨大な金属製空間だ。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/obsolete.json
msgid "dough"
msgid_plural "doughs"
msgstr[0] "練り粉"

#. ~ Description for dough
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/obsolete.json
msgid ""
"Flour mixed with water, kneaded into a gooey paste.  This dough can be used "
"to bake bread more efficiently than with just flour."
msgstr "穀粉と水を混ぜ合わせ、こねて作られた粘性の高いペーストだ。穀粉をそのまま使うよりも効率よくパンを焼くことができる。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/obsolete.json
msgid "hazardous environment suit"
msgid_plural "hazardous environment suits"
msgstr[0] "HEVスーツ"

#. ~ Description for hazardous environment suit
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/obsolete.json
msgid ""
"Developed for the exploration of alien planes, the lightweight, orange-black"
" HEV suit covers everything below the neck.  While it possesses only modest "
"physical protection, it provides excellent protection from most "
"environmental hazards.  A hatch in the front opens to provide a small amount"
" of storage."
msgstr ""
"異次元領域の探査のために開発された、首から下を覆う軽量のオレンジと黒のスーツだ。物理的な防護性能は控えめだが、大抵の環境ハザードからは優れた保護を提供する。前面のハッチは開き、わずかな収納スペースとなる。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/obsolete.json
msgid "hazardous environment helmet"
msgid_plural "hazardous environment helmets"
msgstr[0] "HEVヘルメット"

#. ~ Use action msg for hazardous environment helmet.
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/obsolete.json
msgid "You turn the helmet's headlamp on."
msgstr "ヘルメットのヘッドランプの電源を入れた。"

#. ~ Description for hazardous environment helmet
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/obsolete.json
msgid ""
"Meant to pair with a compatible HEV suit, this helmet's physical protection "
"is basic at best, but makes up for it with an air recycler that provides "
"excellent protection from airborne contaminants.  It has a mounted LED "
"headlamp, powered by standard batteries."
msgstr ""
"互換性のあるHEVスーツと組み合わせて着用するよう設計されている。物理的な防護力は良くても基本レベルだが、空気循環装置によって大気中の汚染物質からの優れた保護を提供することでそれを補っている。標準的な電池で稼働するLEDヘッドランプを搭載している。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/obsolete.json
msgid "hazardous environment helmet (on)"
msgid_plural "hazardous environment helmets (on)"
msgstr[0] "HEVヘルメット [点灯中]"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'hazardous environment helmet (on)', 'str_pl':
#. 'hazardous environment helmets (on)'}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/obsolete.json
msgid ""
"Meant to pair with a compatible HEV suit, this helmet's physical protection "
"is basic at best, but makes up for it with an air recycler that provides "
"excellent protection from airborne contaminants.  Its light is on, "
"illuminating the area at a cost of batteries."
msgstr ""
"互換性のあるHEVスーツと組み合わせて着用するよう設計されている。物理的な防護力は良くても基本レベルだが、空気循環装置によって大気中の汚染物質からの優れた保護を提供する。ライトが点灯しており、電池を消費しながらエリアを照らしている。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/obsolete.json
msgid "boot quiver"
msgid_plural "boot quivers"
msgstr[0] "ブーツ矢筒"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'boot quiver'}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/obsolete.json
msgid ""
"This is a makeshift quiver made from a thigh-high boot with the heel removed"
" and patched shut, and strings used as a strap run through a hole punched "
"into its side.  It can hold 40 arrows or bolts for easy access."
msgstr ""
"サイハイブーツのヒールを取り外し、当て布で塞ぎ、側面に開けた穴にストラップを通した手製の矢筒だ。40本の矢やボルトを取り出しやすい位置に保持できる。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/obsolete.json
msgid "brigandine"
msgid_plural "brigandines"
msgstr[0] "ブリガンダイン"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'brigandine'}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/obsolete.json
msgid ""
"A piece of body armor from the Middle Ages consisting of boiled leather with"
" riveted metal plates lying underneath.  Typically used to protect from "
"arrows, it has very good protection against cuts."
msgstr ""
"茹でて硬化させた革に、金属板を裏地としてリベットで打ち付けた中世のボディアーマーだ。一般的に矢を防ぐために使われていたが、斬撃に対して非常に高い防護性能を持つ。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/obsolete.json
msgid "MBR vest (titanium)"
msgid_plural "MBR vests (titanium)"
msgstr[0] "モジュール式防弾ベスト [チタン]"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'MBR vest (titanium)', 'str_pl': 'MBR vests
#. (titanium)'}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/obsolete.json
msgid ""
"A Modular Bullet Resistant Vest.  Titanium scraps have been inserted to "
"improve its protection.  It has four pouches capable of carrying magazines."
msgstr "モジュール式防弾ベストだ。防御性能向上のためにチタンの破片が挿入されている。弾倉を運搬できるポーチが4つ付いている。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/obsolete.json
msgid "crafted brigandine"
msgid_plural "crafted brigandines"
msgstr[0] "簡易ブリガンダイン"

#. ~ Description for crafted brigandine
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/obsolete.json
msgid ""
"Modeled after a proper brigandine from medieval times, this makeshift piece "
"of body armor consists of layered cloth with small pieces of sheet metal "
"affixed to the underside.  While not as protective as a proper piece of "
"armor, it'll still keep you relatively safe."
msgstr ""
"中世のブリガンダインをモデルとし、層状に重ねた布の裏側に小さな板金を貼り付けて自作された防具だ。本物の防具ほど防御力はないが、それでも比較的安全な状態を保ってくれる。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/obsolete.json
msgid "makeshift rail rifle"
msgid_plural "makeshift rail rifles"
msgstr[0] "簡易レールライフル"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/obsolete.json
msgid ""
"A single-shot, break-action, electrically propelled, steel rail launcher "
"handcrafted from scrap.  The hypervelocity metal stake that it fires is "
"accelerated to the point of spontaneous combustion by a Lorentz force "
"generated by electromagnetic induction, powered by a standard UPS."
msgstr ""
"廃材から自作された、単発・中折れ式の電磁加速スチール製レール投射装置だ。射出される超高速の金属杭は、電磁誘導によって発生するローレンツ力により、自然発火点まで加速される。標準的なUPSで動作する。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/seed.json
msgid "pineapple stem"
msgid_plural "pineapple stem"
msgstr[0] "パイナップルの茎"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'pineapple stem'}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/seed.json
msgid "Roots of a pineapple plant, for growing your own."
msgstr "自家栽培に使うための、パイナップル植物の根元部分だ。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/seed.json
msgid "melon seeds"
msgid_plural "melon seeds"
msgstr[0] "メロンの種"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'melon seeds'}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/seed.json
msgid "Some melon seeds."
msgstr "メロンの種。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/seed.json
msgid "banana saplings"
msgid_plural "banana saplings"
msgstr[0] "バナナの苗"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'banana saplings'}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/seed.json
msgid "Some banana saplings."
msgstr "バナナの苗木。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/seed.json
msgid "orange vine"
msgid_plural "orange vine"
msgstr[0] "オレンジのつる"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'orange vine'}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/seed.json
msgid "Some orange vine.  Definitely GMO."
msgstr "オレンジのつる。間違いなく遺伝子組み換え生物だ。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/seed.json
msgid "lemon vine"
msgid_plural "lemon vine"
msgstr[0] "レモンのつる"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'lemon vine'}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/seed.json
msgid "Some lemon vines.  Definitely GMO."
msgstr "レモンのつる。間違いなく遺伝子組み換え生物だ。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/seed.json
msgid "subterraenean coconut"
msgid_plural "subterraenean coconut"
msgstr[0] "地下生ココナッツ"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'subterraenean coconut'}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/seed.json
msgid "Proof that man went too far before the Cataclysm."
msgstr "大災厄以前に人類が度を超したことの証である。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/tool_armor.json
msgid "cryopod bodyglove"
msgid_plural "cryopod bodygloves"
msgstr[0] "クライオポッド・ボディグローブ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'cryopod bodyglove'}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"A dark orange bodyglove, hundreds of tubes curl over its surface, tracing "
"the contours of human musculature.  Meant to control body temperature during"
" prolonged cryopreservation, it could easily keep you comfortable in any "
"earthly climate.  Use it to activate its climate control functionality."
msgstr ""
"濃いオレンジ色のボディグローブで、人間の筋組織の輪郭に沿って何百ものチューブが表面に巻かれている。長期間の冷凍保存中に体温を制御するためのもので、あらゆる地球上の気候で快適に保つことが容易にできる。これを使用すると温度制御機能が有効になる。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/tool_armor.json
msgid "cryopod bodyglove (on)"
msgid_plural "cryopod bodygloves (on)"
msgstr[0] "クライオポッド・ボディグローブ [作動中]"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'cryopod bodyglove (on)', 'str_pl': 'cryopod
#. bodygloves (on)'}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/tool_armor.json
msgid ""
"The temperature control units of this high-tech garment are currently "
"active, and continuously draining battery power.  Use it to turn them off."
msgstr "このハイテク衣服の温度制御ユニットは現在作動中であり、バッテリー電力を継続的に消耗している。これを使用すると電源を切ることができる。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/tool_quality.json
msgid "bionic assembly"
msgstr "義体組み立て"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/tools.json
msgid "Wraitheon executive's smartphone"
msgid_plural "Wraitheon executive's smartphones"
msgstr[0] "レイスオン幹部のスマートフォン"

#. ~ Description for {'str': "Wraitheon executive's smartphone"}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/tools.json
msgid ""
"Your custom crafted atomic smartphone.  Most notably a confidential "
"executive-level override program allows you to remotely control most robots."
msgstr ""
"カスタムで製作したアトミック・スマートフォンだ。特筆すべきは、幹部レベルの機密オーバーライドプログラムによって、大抵のロボットを遠隔操作できる点である。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/tools.json
msgid "Wraitheon executive's smartphone - music"
msgid_plural "Wraitheon executive's smartphones - music"
msgstr[0] "レイスオン幹部のスマートフォン [音楽再生]"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/tools.json
msgid "Executive's smartphone - Flashlight"
msgid_plural "Executive's smartphones - Flashlight"
msgstr[0] "レイスオン幹部のスマートフォン [点灯中]"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/tools.json
msgid "chain wrench"
msgid_plural "chain wrenches"
msgstr[0] "チェーンレンチ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'chain wrench', 'str_pl': 'chain wrenches'}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/tools.json
msgid ""
"An adjustable chain wrench, designed for hard-to-reach places.  Being "
"handmade, it lacks the precision of a proper wrench."
msgstr "サイズ調整可能なチェーンレンチで、手の届きにくい場所での作業向けに設計されている。手作りのため、本格的なレンチほどの精密さはない。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/tools.json
msgid "power cutter (off)"
msgid_plural "power cutters (off)"
msgstr[0] "パワーカッター [停止中]"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'power cutter (off)', 'str_pl': 'power cutters
#. (off)'}.
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/tools.json
msgid "You rev up the power cutter!"
msgstr "パワーカッターを始動させた！"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'power cutter (off)', 'str_pl': 'power cutters
#. (off)'}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/tools.json
msgid ""
"A huge, gas-powered saw with a diamond blade.  If it has gasoline, it can be"
" turned on to turn it into a powerful metal cutting tool."
msgstr "ダイヤモンドブレードを備えた巨大なガソリン駆動の鋸だ。ガソリンが入っていれば、電源を入れることで強力な金属切断ツールとして使用できる。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/tools.json
msgid "power cutter (on)"
msgid_plural "power cutters (on)"
msgstr[0] "パワーカッター [作動中]"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'power cutter (on)', 'str_pl': 'power cutters
#. (on)'}.
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/tools.json
msgid "Your power cutter falls quiet."
msgstr "パワーカッターが静かになった。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'power cutter (on)', 'str_pl': 'power cutters
#. (on)'}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/tools.json
msgid ""
"A huge, gas-powered saw with a diamond blade, currently a whirling blur.  "
"It's consuming gasoline, but can be used a fantastic tool for cutting metal."
"  You can also use it as a terrifying weapon, if you're into that sort of "
"thing."
msgstr ""
"ダイヤモンドブレードを備えた巨大なガソリン駆動の鋸で、現在は回転してぼやけて見える。ガソリンを消費するが、金属を切断するための素晴らしいツールとして使用できる。もしその気があるなら、恐ろしい武器としても利用可能だ。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/tools.json
msgid "murdersaw (off)"
msgid_plural "murdersaws (off)"
msgstr[0] "殺人カッター [停止中]"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'murdersaw (off)', 'str_pl': 'murdersaws
#. (off)'}.
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/tools.json
msgid "You rev up the murdersaw!"
msgstr "殺人カッターを始動させた！"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'murdersaw (off)', 'str_pl': 'murdersaws (off)'}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/tools.json
msgid ""
"This former power cutter has been lightened and stripped of all those "
"unnecessary safety measures, turning it into a gas-powered killing machine."
"  Use it to turn it on."
msgstr "元のパワーカッターから不要な安全対策をすべて取り除いて軽量化し、ガソリン駆動の殺戮マシンへと変貌させたものだ。これを使用すると電源が入る。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/tools.json
msgid "murdersaw (on)"
msgid_plural "murdersaws (on)"
msgstr[0] "殺人カッター [作動中]"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'murdersaw (on)', 'str_pl': 'murdersaws
#. (on)'}.
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/tools.json
msgid "Your murdersaw falls quiet."
msgstr "殺人カッターが静かになった。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'murdersaw (on)', 'str_pl': 'murdersaws (on)'}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/tools.json
msgid ""
"This fearsome weapon is currently whirring loudly and shaking with the force"
" of its own power.  Use it to turn it off."
msgstr "この恐ろしい武器は現在、大きな唸り音を上げて、自身の力で振動している。これを使用すると電源が切れる。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/tools.json
msgid "rope lighter"
msgid_plural "rope lighters"
msgstr[0] "ロープライター"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'rope lighter'}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/tools.json
msgid ""
"A rope lighter made from simple materials.  Windproof and flameless, it "
"consists of a length of rope run through a copper tube; a flint strike "
"sparks embers in the rope that smolder and are used to ignite fires.  "
"Specialized for outdoor use, it lasts for a very long time, but it's much "
"slower to use than a normal lighter."
msgstr ""
"シンプルな素材で作られたロープライターだ。銅管にロープを通した作りで、風に強く炎は出ない。火打石で火花を散らすとロープに種火がくすぶり、火をつけるのに使われる。屋外での利用に特化しており、非常に長持ちするが、通常のライターよりも着火に時間がかかる。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'UPS', 'str_pl': "UPS's"}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/tools.json
msgid ""
"This is a unified power supply, or UPS.  It is a civilian evolution of a "
"military project.  Designed to power advanced weapons and armor, the "
"civilian version serves as a portable power bank and inverter for many "
"household electronics.  It can be worn around to either leg for ease of "
"access."
msgstr ""
"これは統合電源、すなわちUPSである。軍事プロジェクトの民間向け進化形だ。高度な武器や装甲に電力を供給するために設計されたが、民間版は多くの家庭用電子機器用のポータブル電源バンクおよびインバーターとして機能する。アクセスしやすいようにどちらかの脚に装着できる。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'advanced UPS', 'str_pl': "advanced UPS's"}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/tools.json
msgid ""
"This is an advanced version of the unified power supply, or UPS.  This "
"device has been significantly redesigned to provide better efficiency as "
"well as to consume plutonium fuel cells rather than batteries, and is both "
"slimmer and lighter to wear.  Sadly, its plutonium reactor can't be charged "
"in UPS charging station."
msgstr ""
"統合電源の改良型だ。バッテリーではなくプルトニウム燃料電池を消費するように大幅に再設計されており、効率が向上したうえ、装着した時の薄さと軽さも改善されている。残念ながら、このプルトニウム原子炉はUPS充電ステーションでは充電できない。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/tools.json
msgid "bionic maintenance toolkit"
msgid_plural "bionic maintenance toolkits"
msgstr[0] "義体整備キット"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'bionic maintenance toolkit'}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/tools.json
msgid ""
"A set of very small tools and encrypted digital keys normally used to repair"
" bionic modules in clinical settings.  They will allow you to disassemble "
"simple bionics, but anything more complex would require even more "
"specialized tools."
msgstr ""
"非常に小さな工具と暗号化されたデジタルキーのセットだ。通常は臨床現場で義体を修理する際に使用される。これがあれば単純な義体は分解できるが、より複雑なものにはさらに専門的な工具が必要となるだろう。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/tools.json
msgid "complete bionic toolkit"
msgid_plural "complete bionic toolkits"
msgstr[0] "完全義体ツールキット"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'complete bionic toolkit'}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/tools.json
msgid ""
"A set of very small robotic tools and encrypted digital keys originally "
"designed to disassemble and test the quality of industrially produced "
"bionics.  A highly skilled and patient engineer could use them to manually "
"assemble new cybernetics."
msgstr ""
"非常に小さなロボットツールと暗号化されたデジタルキーのセットだ。元々は工場生産されたバイオニクスを分解し、品質をテストするために設計された。高度な技術と忍耐力を持つエンジニアであれば、これらを使って新しいサイバネティクスを手作業で組み立てることができる。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/tools.json
msgid "cybernetic power port mod"
msgid_plural "cybernetic power port mods"
msgstr[0] "義体電源ポート改造"

#. ~ Description for cybernetic power port mod
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/tools.json
msgid ""
"This device replaces standard power connections and battery ports for "
"electronic devices with a carefully-shaped port that hooks into bionic "
"implants.  When applied, it will convert an item to run directly off of "
"bionic power."
msgstr ""
"電子機器の標準的な電源接続やバッテリーポートを、義体に接続するよう精密に成形されたポートに置き換える装置だ。適用すると、そのアイテムは義体電力から直接稼働するように変換される。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'control laptop'}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/tools.json
msgid ""
"A modified laptop, now capable of transmitting in the ultra-high frequencies"
" utilized by robots.  Activate it to command robots from afar."
msgstr "改造されたラップトップだ。ロボットが利用する超高周波帯で通信できるようになっている。これを作動させると、ロボットを遠隔で指揮できる。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/vehicle_items.json
#: data/mods/Aftershock/vehicles/vehicle_parts.json
msgid "robot carrier"
msgid_plural "robot carriers"
msgstr[0] "ロボット運搬カーゴ"

#. ~ Description for robot carrier
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/vehicle_items.json
msgid ""
"A heavy frame outfitted with tie-downs and attachment points for carrying "
"cargo, with additional railings to keep a large machine in place.  It is "
"meant to hold large drones and robots for transport.  Use it on a suitable "
"robot to capture, use it on an empty tile to release."
msgstr ""
"貨物運搬用の固定具と取り付けポイントを備えた重いフレームだ。大型機械を所定の位置に保つための追加の囲いも付いている。大型ドローンやロボットを輸送するために作られた。適切なロボットに使用して捕獲し、空のタイルに使用して解放する。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/weapons.json
msgid "energy saber"
msgid_plural "energy sabers"
msgstr[0] "エナジーサーベル"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'energy saber'}.
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/weapons.json
msgid "You activate the energy saber, and its blade blazes into existence!"
msgstr "エナジーサーベルを起動すると、輝く刃が実体化した！"

#. ~ Use action need_charges_msg for {'str': 'energy saber'}.
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/weapons.json
msgid "The energy saber is out of charge."
msgstr "エナジーサーベルの電力が尽きた。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'energy saber'}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/weapons.json
msgid ""
"A hefty black tube the size of your hand.  Activate to produce a hard-light "
"blade, running off of UPS."
msgstr "掌大のずっしりとした黒い筒だ。起動するとUPS電力を消費して硬質光の刃を生成する。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/weapons.json
msgid "energy saber (active)"
msgid_plural "energy sabers (active)"
msgstr[0] "エナジーサーベル [作動中]"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'energy saber (active)', 'str_pl': 'energy
#. sabers (active)'}.
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/weapons.json
msgid "The blade dissipates into particles."
msgstr "刃は粒子となって消散した。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'energy saber (active)', 'str_pl': 'energy sabers
#. (active)'}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/weapons.json
msgid ""
"This glittering blue saber of cyan light hums gently, extending from its "
"superalloy handle.  Its edge is lethally sharp, and being made of light, "
"it's weightless, and immune to being damaged.  It's not white-hot like in "
"pop culture, so it can't cut through anything, but there's not much in the "
"way of flesh that it won't slice through easily."
msgstr ""
"きらめくシアン光の青いサーベルが、超合金製の柄から伸びて小さく唸っている。驚異的な切れ味を持ち、光で作られているため重量がなく、破損しない。ポップカルチャーのように白熱してはいないため、何でも切断できるわけではないが、肉体程度なら簡単に切り刻めないものはない。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/weapons.json
msgid "hard-light longbow"
msgid_plural "hard-light longbows"
msgstr[0] "ハードライトロングボウ"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/weapons.json
msgid ""
"A sleek, stringless white metal longbow constructed of ultralight, atomic-"
"age materials.  Rather than using ammunition, each shot uses high-tech "
"projectors to create a string and arrow out of hard light on the spot, which"
" provide excellent accuracy and armor penetration.  Being a bow, it's still "
"not as powerful as conventional ballistic weapons.  It runs off of UPS "
"power, and rather efficiently so."
msgstr ""
"原子力時代の超軽量素材で作られた、弦のない流線型の白色合金製ロングボウだ。弾薬は使わず、高度なプロジェクターが硬質光の弦と矢をその場で生成し、優れた精度と装甲貫通力を発揮する。しかし、所詮は弓なので、従来の弾道兵器ほどの威力には及ばない。UPSの電力を非常に効率的に消費して稼働する。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/weapons.json
msgid "hydraulic gauntlet"
msgid_plural "hydraulic gauntlets"
msgstr[0] "油圧式ガントレット"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'hydraulic gauntlet'}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/weapons.json
msgid ""
"A huge, heavy metal gauntlet lined with tubing and gauges.  Slow and "
"unwieldy, it uses internal pressure to deliver devastating blows, but takes "
"tremendous strength to use effectively.  Thanks to an internal microreactor,"
" it doesn't require power of its own."
msgstr ""
"チューブと計器類が付属した巨大で重い金属製のガントレットだ。動作は鈍く扱いにくいが、内圧を利用して壊滅的な打撃を繰り出す。効果的に使うには途方もない筋力が必要だ。内部のマイクロ反応炉のおかげで、外部電源は不要である。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/weapons.json
msgid "barbed-wire rolling pin"
msgid_plural "barbed-wire rolling pins"
msgstr[0] "有刺鉄線麺棒"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'barbed-wire rolling pin'}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/weapons.json
msgid ""
"Typically used to flatten dough, this rolling pin has been repurposed as a "
"weapon, with barbed wire adding some extra power and weight to its swing.  "
"It has some real heft to it; perfect for the bakers of the apocalypse."
msgstr ""
"通常は生地を平らにするために使われる麺棒だが、武器として転用されている。有刺鉄線がスイングに追加の威力と重さを加えており、かなりの重さがある。大災厄後のパン屋に完璧に似合う一品だ。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/weapons.json
msgid ""
"A grenade launcher mounted onto your right-hand wrist.  Less powerful than a"
" proper grenade launcher, but infinitely more portable, and quick to reload."
msgstr "右手首に装着されたグレネードランチャーだ。本格的なランチャーより威力は劣るが、桁違いに携帯性に優れ、素早く再装填できる。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/weapons.json
msgid "titanium bat"
msgid_plural "titanium bats"
msgstr[0] "チタンバット"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'titanium bat'}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/weapons.json
msgid ""
"A luxury baseball bat made out of titanium that was banned from competitive "
"sport due to the increased performance that put defenders at risk."
msgstr "チタン製の高級な野球用バットだ。守備側を危険に晒すほどの性能向上が見られたため、競技スポーツでの使用は禁止されていた。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/weapons.json
msgid "bodyguard knife"
msgid_plural "bodyguard knives"
msgstr[0] "ボディガードナイフ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'bodyguard knife', 'str_pl': 'bodyguard knives'}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/weapons.json
msgid ""
"Designed to evade security measures, this knife is a must have for any "
"Cataclysm dinner party."
msgstr "セキュリティ対策を回避できるように設計されたこのナイフは、大災厄（Cataclysm）の世界で開かれるディナーパーティーの必需品だ。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/weapons.json
msgid "handheld x-ray cannon"
msgid_plural "handheld x-ray cannons"
msgstr[0] "携帯式X線キャノン"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/weapons.json
msgid ""
"This is an x-ray laser stripped a TX-5LR Cerberus laser turret that has been"
" modified to use UPS power for firing.  Single shot then requires reloading."
"  Nicknamed the 'Tin Can Killer' for it's ability to destroy power armor."
msgstr ""
"TX-5LRケルベロス・レーザータレットから剥ぎ取られたX線レーザーで、UPS電源を使用して発射できるように改造されている。単発発射後に再装填が必要だ。パワードアーマーを破壊する能力から「ブリキ缶キラー」の愛称で呼ばれている。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
msgid "sundew classic"
msgid_plural "sundew classics"
msgstr[0] "サンデュー・クラシック"

#. ~ Description for sundew classic
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
msgid ""
"An golden can of sundew, the leading soft drink of the world.  Staring at "
"the can, you feel a craving so intense that you are unsure whether its "
"genuine, or if it has been carefully engineered and implanted into your "
"mind."
msgstr ""
"黄金の缶に入ったサンデュー、世界を代表するソフトドリンクだ。その缶を見つめていると、強烈な渇望を感じるが、それが本物なのか、あるいは巧妙に設計されてあなたの心に埋め込まれたものなのか、確信が持てない。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
msgid "H₂O™"
msgid_plural "H₂O™"
msgstr[0] "H₂O™"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'H₂O™'}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
msgid ""
"When Thistle Industries successfully trademarked the chemical formula of "
"water, you thought the world had gone irreparably insane, but things have "
"only gotten worse since."
msgstr ""
"Thistle "
"Industries社が水の化学式を商標登録した時、世界は取り返しのつかないレベルで正気を失ったと思ったが、状況はそれ以来悪化の一途を辿っている。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
msgid "food cubes"
msgid_plural "food cubes"
msgstr[0] "フードキューブ"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'food cubes'}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
msgid ""
"Smoothly blended edibles, neatly shaped into cubes for maximum enjoyment."
msgstr "滑らかにブレンドされた食料品だ。最大限の満足を得られるように、きっちりとした立方体に成形されている。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
msgid "Foodplace's Food-to-go™"
msgid_plural "Foodplace's Food-to-go™"
msgstr[0] "フード・トゥ・ゴー™"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': "Foodplace's Food-to-go™"}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
msgid ""
"Foodplace™ easy-storage Food-to-go™ the choice Food™ for the contemporary "
"Foodman™."
msgstr "保管しやすいFoodplace™のFood-to-go™は、現代のFoodman™のための選ばれたFood™だ。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
msgid "loop 'fruit'"
msgid_plural "loop 'fruits'"
msgstr[0] "ループ『フルーツ』"

#. ~ Description for {'str': "loop 'fruit'", 'str_pl': "loop 'fruits'"}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
msgid "Rings of caramelized yellow colorant, tasting not exactly like apple."
msgstr "カラメルがけの黄色い着色料入りリングだ。味は決してリンゴではない。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
msgid "cee wafers"
msgid_plural "cee wafers"
msgstr[0] "Cウエハース"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'cee wafers'}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
msgid ""
"Smooth crackers colored grayish-green.  Used to be perfectly edible seaweed,"
" or so the wrapper claims."
msgstr "灰色がかった緑色の滑らかなクラッカーだ。包装紙によると、かつては完璧に食用となる海藻だったらしい。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
msgid "beefsim"
msgid_plural "beefsims"
msgstr[0] "ビーフシム"

#. ~ Description for beefsim
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
msgid ""
"Soy or pureed rat?  Better not to know.\n"
"(But its probably both.) "
msgstr ""
"大豆か、それともネズミのピューレか？ 知らないほうがましだ。\n"
"(だが、おそらく両方だろう。)"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
msgid "soup, flavor 27"
msgid_plural "soup, flavor 27"
msgstr[0] "フレーバー27スープ"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'soup, flavor 27'}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
msgid ""
"Yellow chunks float on creamy liquid, like flotsam on a filthy summer pond."
"  Branding implies at least 26 other flavors, but you have neither seen or "
"heard about any of them."
msgstr ""
"クリーム状の液体に、汚れた夏の池に浮かぶ浮遊物のように黄色い塊が漂っている。パッケージには少なくとも26種類ものフレーバーが存在することが示唆されているが、それらのどれ一つとして見たことも聞いたこともない。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
msgid "caffex"
msgid_plural "caffex"
msgstr[0] "カフェックス"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'caffex'}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/comestibles/cheap_food.json
msgid ""
"A dark and soapy beverage, pre-brewed and loaded with synthetic caffeine."
msgstr "事前に抽出され、合成カフェインが配合された、濃い石鹸のような飲み物だ。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/crafting_scrap/abstract_scrap.json
msgid "ur-scrap"
msgid_plural "ur-scraps"
msgstr[0] "ur-scrap"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'ur-scrap'}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/crafting_scrap/abstract_scrap.json
msgid "A small techno doodad."
msgstr "小さな技術的なガジェットだ。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/crafting_scrap/biomaterial_scrap.json
msgid "monomeric slurry"
msgid_plural "monomeric slurry"
msgstr[0] "モノマー懸濁液"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'monomeric slurry'}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/crafting_scrap/biomaterial_scrap.json
msgid ""
"A collection of the building blocks of polymers.  With this and a whole lot "
"of know how you can create proteins and other building blocks of life."
msgstr "ポリマーの構成要素の集合体だ。これと大量の専門知識があれば、タンパク質やその他の生命の構成要素を創造できる。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/crafting_scrap/biomaterial_scrap.json
msgid "micellular growth medium"
msgid_plural "micellular growth mediums"
msgstr[0] "ミセル培地"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'micellular growth medium'}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/crafting_scrap/biomaterial_scrap.json
msgid ""
"For the mixing of biomaterials that might otherwise be antithetical to one "
"another."
msgstr "通常は相容れない生体物質同士を混合するために使用する。"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/crafting_scrap/biomaterial_scrap.json
msgid "artificial muscle fibers"
msgid_plural "artificial muscle fibers"
msgstr[0] "人工筋線維"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'artificial muscle fibers'}
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/crafting_scrap/biomaterial_scrap.json
msgid ""
"Lab grown or bioprinted muscle fibers, much denser and with higher "
