#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/monsters/crt_monster.json
msgid "Slasher Necromorph"
msgid_plural "Slasher Necromorphs"
msgstr[0] "スラッシャー・ネクロモーフ"

#. ~ Description for Slasher Necromorph
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/monsters/crt_monster.json
msgid ""
"A horrifically twisted human body.  Two massive, bladed appendages have "
"burst through its shoulders where they are poised above its head as it "
"stalks about with terrifying purpose."
msgstr "恐ろしく歪んだ人型の身体を持つ。肩を突き破って生えた2本の巨大な刃状の付属肢を頭上に構え、恐るべき目的を持って徘徊している。"

#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/monsters/crt_monster.json
msgid "Weak Slasher Necromorph"
msgid_plural "Weak Slasher Necromorphs"
msgstr[0] "ウィークスラッシャー・ネクロモーフ"

#. ~ Description for Weak Slasher Necromorph
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/monsters/crt_monster.json
msgid ""
"A horrifically mutilated human body.  Two scrawny blades have freshly "
"bursted through its hand to deal with prey and the haunting visage of a "
"jawless maw and a gaping wound in its forehead sends chills down your spine."
"  The awkward steps it takes slows it down greatly."
msgstr ""
"酷く損傷した恐ろしい死体。両手の肉を突き破って2本の骨のような刃が生えており、獲物を仕留める。顎のない口と額の大きな裂傷が陰惨な印象を与え、背筋が凍る。ぎこちない歩き方で動きは大幅に鈍っている。"

#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/monsters/crt_monster.json
msgid "Waster Necromorph"
msgid_plural "Waster Necromorphs"
msgstr[0] "ウェイスター・ネクロモーフ"

#. ~ Description for Waster Necromorph
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/monsters/crt_monster.json
msgid ""
"Clad in heavy assault gear, an eerie light green glows beneath its helmet "
"from sunken eye sockets and a gaping mouth.  Strange blade like points have "
"burst out of it's forearms making it a formidable force to be reckoned with."
msgstr ""
"重装備のアサルトギアをまとい、ヘルメットの下では、くぼんだ眼窩と大きく開いた口から不気味な薄緑の光が漏れている。前腕部からは奇妙な刃のようなものが飛び出しており、侮りがたい強敵となっている。"

#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/monsters/crt_monster.json
msgid "Leaper Necromorph"
msgid_plural "Leaper Necromorphs"
msgstr[0] "リーパー・ネクロモーフ"

#. ~ Description for Leaper Necromorph
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/monsters/crt_monster.json
msgid ""
"This once-human body is barely recognizable, scrambling about on its abdomen"
" as it leaps forward with immense arm strength.  With elongated fangs that "
"can easily mutilate your flesh, the grotesque face roars incessantly.  The "
"lower body has fused together into one giant tail with a barbed spike."
msgstr ""
"かつて人間だった身体はほとんど原型をとどめておらず、巨大な腕力で跳躍しながら腹部をかき回している。肉を引き裂く細長い牙を持つグロテスクな顔は、絶え間なく唸り声を上げる。下半身は融合し、有刺鉄線のトゲを持つ巨大な尾になっている。"

#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/monsters/crt_monster.json
msgid "Twitcher Necromorph"
msgid_plural "Twitcher Necromorphs"
msgstr[0] "ツウィッチャー・ネクロモーフ"

#. ~ Description for Twitcher Necromorph
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/monsters/crt_monster.json
msgid ""
"With narrow blades coming out of its hands, this corpse spasmically dashes "
"to-and-fro with surprising speed.  It carries itself quite steadily when "
"idle, further observation shows that the person before this husk was a "
"C.R.I.T S-I G.E.A.R operator."
msgstr ""
"手から細い刃が出ているこの死体は、驚くほどの速さで痙攣的に前後に飛び回る。待機中は比較的安定した足取りで、さらに観察すると、この抜け殻が生前はC.R.I.T"
" S-I G.E.A.Rのオペレーターだったことが分かる。"

#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/monsters/crt_monster.json
msgid "Pack Necromorph"
msgid_plural "Pack Necromorphs"
msgstr[0] "パック・ネクロモーフ"

#. ~ Description for Pack Necromorph
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/monsters/crt_monster.json
msgid ""
"A shrieking mutated child zombie.  The face is is mainly blank with eyes "
"swollen shut and a torn-open mouth with flaps of flesh hanging to the side."
"  A pair of seemingly purposeless appendages sprout from its shoulders "
"before ending in its arms.  Its small hands end in sharp claws."
msgstr ""
"金切り声を上げる変異した子供のゾンビ。顔は白っぽく、腫れ上がった瞼で目は閉じ、裂けた口の端には肉片がぶら下がっている。一見無意味に見える一対の付属肢が両肩から生え、細い腕に続いている。その小さな手の先には鋭い爪が生えている。"

#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/monsters/crt_monster.json
msgid "Puker Necromorph"
msgid_plural "Puker Necromorphs"
msgstr[0] "ピューカー・ネクロモーフ"

#. ~ Description for Puker Necromorph
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/monsters/crt_monster.json
msgid ""
"A rather mutilated corpse covered in gaping sores.  Hanging arms with hands "
"that have long corroded away reveal jagged edges that could easily pierce "
"into your flesh.  A sticky, frothing yellow sludge flows from its exposed "
"internal organs to its unhinged jaw where it drips, hissing as it eats "
"through material."
msgstr ""
"全身がパックリと裂けた傷に覆われた、かなり損傷の激しい死体。長く腐食した両腕の先からは、肉をたやすく切り裂きそうな鋸状の突起が覗いている。粘性の高い黄色い泡状の汚泥が露出した内臓から外れた顎へと流れ落ちており、滴りながら物質を溶かす際にシューシューと音を立てる。"

#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/monsters/monster.json
msgid "Animate Arm"
msgid_plural "Animate Arms"
msgstr[0] "蠢く腕"

#. ~ Description for Animate Arm
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/monsters/monster.json
msgid ""
"A dismembered arm that slowly crawls forward.  Occasionally, tentacles "
"sprout out from the wound and lash about wildly."
msgstr "ゆっくりと匍匐前進する切断された腕。時折、傷口から触手が飛び出し、激しく暴れ回る。"

#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/monsters/monster.json
msgid "Dullahan"
msgid_plural "Dullahans"
msgstr[0] "デュラハン"

#. ~ Description for Dullahan
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/monsters/monster.json
msgid ""
"A headless humanoid that slowly sways.  Ornate and functional armor adorn "
"this dreadful corpse which carries itself with an unerringly terrible "
"steadiness.  A long tentacle has sprouted out of its right arm which "
"occasionally flails about wildly."
msgstr ""
"身体をゆっくりと揺らす頭部のない人型。豪華で機能的な装甲がこの恐ろしい死体を飾り、それは恐るべき正確な足取りで身を運ぶ。時折、右腕から生えた長い触手が無秩序に暴れ回る。"

#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/mutations/crt_mutatinoc.json
msgid "Shadow Meld"
msgstr "影潜り"

#. ~ Description for Shadow Meld
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/mutations/crt_mutatinoc.json
msgid ""
"The light around you bends strangely, making it harder for enemies to notice"
" you."
msgstr "周囲の光が不自然に屈折し、敵に感知されにくくなる。"

#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/mutations/crt_mutatinoc.json
msgid "Moon-lit Grace"
msgstr "月華"

#. ~ Description for Moon-lit Grace
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/mutations/crt_mutatinoc.json
msgid ""
"Aside from your appearances, your movements are incredibly graceful and "
"allow you to seemingly glide through every task."
msgstr "外見は別として、非常に優雅な仕草で行動する。あらゆる動作を滑るように滞りなくこなせる。"

#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/mutations/crt_mutatinoc.json
msgid "Red Iris"
msgstr "赤い虹彩"

#. ~ Description for Red Iris
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/mutations/crt_mutatinoc.json
msgid ""
"You eyes are a pleasant shade of hypnotic scarlet.  People feel mildly "
"persuaded by you."
msgstr "魅惑的な緋色の瞳を持つ。その目を見た者は、穏やかに説得されているような気分になる。"

#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/mutations/crt_vamp_mutations.json
msgid "Night Walker"
msgstr "ナイトウォーカー"

#. ~ Description for Night Walker
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/mutations/crt_vamp_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Emerge from the grave of the old world, and become the night once again."
msgstr "旧世界の墓場から抜け出し、再び夜そのものとなった。"

#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/mutations/crt_wendigo_mutations.json
msgid "Forest Guardian"
msgstr "森の守護者"

#. ~ Description for Forest Guardian
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/mutations/crt_wendigo_mutations.json
msgid ""
"The forests have longed for your help, and this last cry shook the world."
msgstr "木々はお前の助けを切望し、この最後の叫びが世界を揺るがした。"

#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/mutations/crt_wendigo_mutations.json
msgid "Nature's Boon"
msgstr "自然の恵み"

#. ~ Description for Nature's Boon
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/mutations/crt_wendigo_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your very prescence is masked by nature itself.  You are slightly harder to "
"detect."
msgstr "存在そのものが自然環境に溶け込んでいる。若干発見されにくくなる。"

#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/mutations/crt_wendigo_mutations.json
msgid "Slashers"
msgstr "スラッシャー"

#. ~ Description for Slashers
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/mutations/crt_wendigo_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your torso has an extra set of appendages that have burst out of your back, "
"they are tipped with massive bone blades at the end, and look like they can "
"do some serious damage with the thick acid that they secrete."
msgstr "背中から骨の刃が付いた一対の突起が生えている。この部位は濃厚な酸を分泌しており、武器として使えば深刻なダメージを与えられそうだ。"

#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/mutations/crt_wendigo_mutations.json
msgid "You tear into %s with your blades"
msgstr "%sを刃で引き裂いた"

#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/mutations/crt_wendigo_mutations.json
msgid "%1$s tears into %2$s with their blades"
msgstr "%1$sは%2$s を刃で引き裂いた。"

#. ~ Mutation class name
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/mutations/vamp_mut_cat.json
msgid "Vampire"
msgstr "吸血鬼"

#. ~ Mutation class: Vampire mutagen_message
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/mutations/vamp_mut_cat.json
msgid ""
"Nearby shadows seem to bend towards you for a moment and then reality warps "
"back into place."
msgstr "付近の影が一瞬こちらに向かって歪曲したように見えたが、すぐに元通りに戻った。"

#. ~ Mutation class: Vampire iv_message
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/mutations/vamp_mut_cat.json
msgid ""
"You twitch and pant randomly as your desire to slake your inhuman thirst "
"becomes overwhelming."
msgstr "渇きを癒したいという非人間的な欲求が増すにつれ、不意に身体が引きつり息が荒くなる。"

#. ~ Mutation class: Vampire Male memorial messsage
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/mutations/vamp_mut_cat.json
msgctxt "memorial_male"
msgid "Dispersed into the shadows."
msgstr "影と交わった。"

#. ~ Mutation class: Vampire Female memorial messsage
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/mutations/vamp_mut_cat.json
msgctxt "memorial_female"
msgid "Dispersed into the shadows."
msgstr "影と交わった。"

#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/mutations/vamp_mut_cat.json
msgid "vampire mutagen"
msgid_plural "vampire mutagens"
msgstr[0] "ヴァンパイア変異原物質"

#. ~ Description for vampire mutagen
#. ~ Description for wendigo mutagen
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/mutations/vamp_mut_cat.json
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/mutations/wendigo_mut_cat.json
msgid "Mutagen cocktail simply labeled 'C.R.I.T R&D.'"
msgstr "ただ「C.R.I.T研究開発部」とだけ書かれたラベルが貼ってある変異原物質だ。"

#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/mutations/vamp_mut_cat.json
msgid "vampire serum"
msgid_plural "vampire serums"
msgstr[0] "ヴァンパイア血清"

#. ~ Description for vampire serum
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/mutations/vamp_mut_cat.json
msgid ""
"A super-concentrated pitch-black substance with silvery flecks that reminds "
"you of a starry-night sky.  You need a syringe to inject it… if you really "
"want to?"
msgstr "星空を思わせる銀色の粒子が浮かんだ、超濃縮の漆黒の物質だ。注射器が必要となるが...本当に使うつもりか？"

#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/mutations/vamp_mut_cat.json
msgid "You have a strange dream about the shadows."
msgstr "影に関する奇妙な夢を見た。"

#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/mutations/vamp_mut_cat.json
msgid "Your dreams give you a peculiar feeling of sinking into the dark."
msgstr "暗闇の中に沈み込む奇妙な感覚の夢を見た。"

#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/mutations/vamp_mut_cat.json
msgid "You have a vivid dream of talking a midnight stroll."
msgstr "真っ暗闇の中を散策する鮮烈な夢を見た。"

#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/mutations/vamp_mut_cat.json
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/mutations/wendigo_mut_cat.json
msgid "You dream of drinking copious amounts of warm water."
msgstr "温かい液体をたくさん飲む夢を見た。"

#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/mutations/vamp_mut_cat.json
msgid ""
"You have a dream of being chased by dogs as something warm drips from your "
"mouth."
msgstr "温かい液体が口から零れ落ち、犬に追われる夢を見た。"

#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/mutations/vamp_mut_cat.json
msgid "Snippets of stalking something in the star-lit night shakes you awake."
msgstr "星降る夜に誰かを追跡している断片的な記憶が、夢から覚めても心に残った。"

#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/mutations/vamp_mut_cat.json
msgid "You dream of sinking your fangs into more and more enemies."
msgstr "牙をたくさんの敵に突き立てる夢を見た。"

#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/mutations/vamp_mut_cat.json
msgid ""
"You have a lucid dream where streams of blood are slowly pooling around your"
" feet."
msgstr "流れ出した血が足下にゆっくりと溜まっていく鮮烈な夢を見た。"

#. ~ Mutation class name
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/mutations/wendigo_mut_cat.json
msgid "Wendigo"
msgstr "ウェンディゴ"

#. ~ Mutation class: Wendigo mutagen_message
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/mutations/wendigo_mut_cat.json
msgid ""
"Nearby plants seem to bend towards you for a moment and then they shift back"
" into place."
msgstr "付近の植物が一瞬こちらに向かって歪曲したように見えたが、すぐに元通りに戻った。"

#. ~ Mutation class: Wendigo iv_message
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/mutations/wendigo_mut_cat.json
msgid ""
"A serene feeling of terror grips you as become acutely aware of the flora "
"and fauna beckoning towards you."
msgstr "動植物がこちらに強い意識を向けていることを感じ、穏やかな恐怖に取り憑かれた。"

#. ~ Mutation class: Wendigo Male memorial messsage
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/mutations/wendigo_mut_cat.json
msgctxt "memorial_male"
msgid "Reclaimed by nature."
msgstr "自然に還った。"

#. ~ Mutation class: Wendigo Female memorial messsage
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/mutations/wendigo_mut_cat.json
msgctxt "memorial_female"
msgid "Reclaimed by nature."
msgstr "自然に還った。"

#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/mutations/wendigo_mut_cat.json
msgid "wendigo mutagen"
msgid_plural "wendigo mutagens"
msgstr[0] "ウェンディゴ変異原物質"

#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/mutations/wendigo_mut_cat.json
msgid "wendigo serum"
msgid_plural "wendigo serums"
msgstr[0] "ウェンディゴ血清"

#. ~ Description for wendigo serum
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/mutations/wendigo_mut_cat.json
msgid ""
"A super-concentrated peat-brown substance with glittering green flecks that "
"reminds you of a a tree.  You need a syringe to inject it… if you really "
"want to?"
msgstr "きらびやかな緑色の粒子が浮かんだ泥炭色の物質で、深い森を連想させる超濃縮された変異原物質だ。注射器が必要となるが...本当に使うつもりか？"

#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/mutations/wendigo_mut_cat.json
msgid "You have a strange dream about the mountain forests."
msgstr "山の木々に関する奇妙な夢を見た。"

#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/mutations/wendigo_mut_cat.json
msgid "Your dreams give you a peculiar feeling of sinking into the treelines."
msgstr "生い茂る樹木に沈み込む奇妙な感覚の夢を見た。"

#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/mutations/wendigo_mut_cat.json
msgid "You have a vivid dream of strolling through the woods."
msgstr "森の中を散策する鮮烈な夢を見た。"

#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/mutations/wendigo_mut_cat.json
msgid "You have a dream of chasing something as a raw hunger sears your mind."
msgstr "生の飢餓に心が焼かれる中、何かを追跡する夢を見た。"

#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/mutations/wendigo_mut_cat.json
msgid "Recollections of stalking a human shakes you awake."
msgstr "人間を追跡している記憶が、夢から覚めても心に残る。"

#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/mutations/wendigo_mut_cat.json
msgid "You dream of tearing into more and more enemies."
msgstr "たくさんの敵を引き裂く夢を見た。"

#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/mutations/wendigo_mut_cat.json
msgid "You have a lucid dream where nature carefully welcomes your body."
msgstr "木々が身体を優しく包み込む鮮烈な夢を見た。"

#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/scenarios/crt_enforcer.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "C.R.I.T. Bionic Enforcer"
msgstr "C.R.I.T.義体化執行官"

#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/scenarios/crt_enforcer.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "C.R.I.T. Bionic Enforcer"
msgstr "C.R.I.T.義体化執行官"

#. ~ Profession (male C.R.I.T. Bionic Enforcer) description
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/scenarios/crt_enforcer.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"STR 10 recommended.  You were a granted the authority of a U.S Marshal. "
"While hired as a guard, with some others joking that you were nothing more "
"than a mall cop with a fancy badge, you eventually got promoted. From mearly"
" a guard to a highly augmented melee fighter. You were sent in to retake a "
"city, but with most of the others failing, mission parameters have expanded "
"quite a bit."
msgstr ""
"[推奨筋力10] "
"お前には連邦保安官の権限が与えられた。当初は警衛として雇われ、周囲からは「派手なバッジを付けただけのモール警備員」と嘲笑されたこともあったが、お前は昇進を重ねた。単なる警備員の域を超え、高度な義体化を施された近接戦闘員へと。お前は都市奪還のために投入されたが、他の部隊はほぼ壊滅。今や任務の範囲は、当初の予定を遥かに超えて拡大している。"

#. ~ Profession (female C.R.I.T. Bionic Enforcer) description
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/scenarios/crt_enforcer.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"STR 10 recommended.  You were a granted the authority of a U.S Marshal. "
"While hired as a guard, with some others joking that you were nothing more "
"than a mall cop with a fancy badge, you eventually got promoted. From mearly"
" a guard to a highly augmented melee fighter. You were sent in to retake a "
"city, but with most of the others failing, mission parameters have expanded "
"quite a bit."
msgstr ""
"[推奨筋力10] "
"お前には連邦保安官の権限が与えられた。当初は警衛として雇われ、周囲からは「派手なバッジを付けただけのモール警備員」と嘲笑されたこともあったが、お前は昇進を重ねた。単なる警備員の域を超え、高度な義体化を施された近接戦闘員へと。お前は都市奪還のために投入されたが、他の部隊はほぼ壊滅。今や任務の範囲は、当初の予定を遥かに超えて拡大している。"

#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/scenarios/crt_enforcer.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "C.R.I.T. Enforcer"
msgstr "C.R.I.T.執行官"

#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/scenarios/crt_enforcer.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "C.R.I.T. Enforcer"
msgstr "C.R.I.T.執行官"

#. ~ Profession (male C.R.I.T. Enforcer) description
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/scenarios/crt_enforcer.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"STR 10 recommended.  You were a granted the authority of a U.S Marshal.  As "
"a guard, others joked that you were nothing more than a mall cop with a "
"fancy badge.  Knowingly, you laughed it off as the you donned your equipment"
" and deployed.  While you mainly spent time at base, you honed your skills "
"and received special implants to do your job easier at the low low cost of "
"serving as a \"guard\" forever.  Time to do your job, mission parameters "
"look like they've expanded quite a bit though."
msgstr ""
"[推奨筋力10] "
"連邦保安官の権限を与えられた。皆はお前を、派手なバッジをつけた格好だけのモール警備員だと笑ったが、お前はそれを承知で笑い飛ばし、装備を身に着けて展開した。主に基地で過ごす間、お前は技能を磨き、永遠に「警備員」として奉仕するという安すぎる代償で、仕事を楽にする特殊な移植手術を受けた。さあ、仕事の時間だ。任務の範囲は途方もなく拡大したようだがな。"

#. ~ Profession (female C.R.I.T. Enforcer) description
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/scenarios/crt_enforcer.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"STR 10 recommended.  You were a granted the authority of a U.S Marshal.  As "
"a guard, others joked that you were nothing more than a mall cop with a "
"fancy badge.  Knowingly, you laughed it off as the you donned your equipment"
" and deployed.  While you mainly spent time at base, you honed your skills "
"and received special implants to do your job easier at the low low cost of "
"serving as a \"guard\" forever.  Time to do your job, mission parameters "
"look like they've expanded quite a bit though."
msgstr ""
"[推奨筋力10] "
"連邦保安官の権限を与えられた。皆はお前を、派手なバッジをつけた格好だけのモール警備員だと笑ったが、お前はそれを承知で笑い飛ばし、装備を身に着けて展開した。主に基地で過ごす間、お前は技能を磨き、永遠に「警備員」として奉仕するという安すぎる代償で、仕事を楽にする特殊な移植手術を受けた。さあ、仕事の時間だ。任務の範囲は途方もなく拡大したようだがな。"

#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/scenarios/crt_enforcer.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "C.R.I.T. Guard"
msgstr "C.R.I.T.警備員"

#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/scenarios/crt_enforcer.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "C.R.I.T. Guard"
msgstr "C.R.I.T.警備員"

#. ~ Profession (male C.R.I.T. Guard) description
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/scenarios/crt_enforcer.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"STR 10 recommended. You were once regarded as the world's leading bodyguard;"
" Until you were hired to guard a C.R.I.T. base. As a guard, others joked "
"that you were nothing more than a mall cop with a fancy badge.  Knowingly, "
"you laughed it off as the you donned your equipment and deployed. While new "
"to your job, you at least recieved the new equipment given to all enforcers."
" Time to do your job of being a guard, first by retaking the territory to "
"guard"
msgstr ""
"[推奨筋力10] "
"お前はかつて、世界屈指のボディーガードと目されていた。…C.R.I.T.基地の警備に雇われるまでは。警備員となったお前を、周囲は「派手なバッジを付けただけのモール警備員」だと嘲笑した。お前はそれを承知で笑い飛ばし、装備を整え展開した。新人ではあるが、少なくとも全執行官に支給される最新装備は受け取っている。さあ、警備の仕事の時間だ。まずは守るべき領土を奪還することから始めろ。"

#. ~ Profession (female C.R.I.T. Guard) description
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/scenarios/crt_enforcer.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"STR 10 recommended. You were once regarded as the world's leading bodyguard;"
" Until you were hired to guard a C.R.I.T. base. As a guard, others joked "
"that you were nothing more than a mall cop with a fancy badge.  Knowingly, "
"you laughed it off as the you donned your equipment and deployed. While new "
"to your job, you at least recieved the new equipment given to all enforcers."
" Time to do your job of being a guard, first by retaking the territory to "
"guard"
msgstr ""
"[推奨筋力10] "
"お前はかつて、世界屈指のボディーガードと目されていた。…C.R.I.T.基地の警備に雇われるまでは。警備員となったお前を、周囲は「派手なバッジを付けただけのモール警備員」だと嘲笑した。お前はそれを承知で笑い飛ばし、装備を整え展開した。新人ではあるが、少なくとも全執行官に支給される最新装備は受け取っている。さあ、警備の仕事の時間だ。まずは守るべき領土を奪還することから始めろ。"

#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/scenarios/crt_grunt_classes.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "C.R.I.T. ROTC Member"
msgstr "C.R.I.T.訓練生"

#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/scenarios/crt_grunt_classes.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "C.R.I.T. ROTC Member"
msgstr "C.R.I.T.訓練生"

#. ~ Profession (male C.R.I.T. ROTC Member) description
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/scenarios/crt_grunt_classes.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were training ahead of time to become a Catastrophe Response and "
"Investigation Team officer in the upcoming war.  Your call to arms arrived "
"dead on arrival and already plastered in the all-too vibrant gore of your "
"squadmates.  In the midst of panic, you bugged out lest you join the "
"remnants of your friends.  Now it's up to your wits and short years of "
"training to keep you alive in this Cataclysm."
msgstr ""
"次なる戦争に備え、『大災厄対応・調査チーム』の隊員になるための予備訓練を積んでいた。緊急呼び出し先の現場は、すでに仲間たちの鮮やかすぎる血肉に覆われ、到着時には手遅れだった。仲間たちの残骸と化すことを恐れ、混乱の中で逃げ出した。今や、この大災厄で生き残るには、お前の知恵とわずかな訓練期間だけが頼りだ。"

#. ~ Profession (female C.R.I.T. ROTC Member) description
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/scenarios/crt_grunt_classes.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were training ahead of time to become a Catastrophe Response and "
"Investigation Team officer in the upcoming war.  Your call to arms arrived "
"dead on arrival and already plastered in the all-too vibrant gore of your "
"squadmates.  In the midst of panic, you bugged out lest you join the "
"remnants of your friends.  Now it's up to your wits and short years of "
"training to keep you alive in this Cataclysm."
msgstr ""
"次なる戦争に備え、『大災厄対応・調査チーム』の隊員になるための予備訓練を積んでいた。緊急呼び出し先の現場は、すでに仲間たちの鮮やかすぎる血肉に覆われ、到着時には手遅れだった。仲間たちの残骸と化すことを恐れ、混乱の中で逃げ出した。今や、この大災厄で生き残るには、お前の知恵とわずかな訓練期間だけが頼りだ。"

#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/scenarios/crt_grunt_classes.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "C.R.I.T. NCO"
msgstr "C.R.I.T.下士官"

#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/scenarios/crt_grunt_classes.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "C.R.I.T. NCO"
msgstr "C.R.I.T.下士官"

#. ~ Profession (male C.R.I.T. NCO) description
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/scenarios/crt_grunt_classes.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were a senior NCO for the Catastrophe Response and Investigation Team, "
"relaying orders to your squad was an everyday task.  When the cataclysm "
"struck, your expertise helped save everyone time and time again until it all"
" fell apart."
msgstr ""
"『大災厄対応・調査チーム』の上級軍曹として、部隊に命令を伝達することは日常業務だった。大災厄が襲ったとき、お前の経験と知識は幾度となく仲間たちを救う手助けとなったが、ついにすべてが崩壊した。"

#. ~ Profession (female C.R.I.T. NCO) description
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/scenarios/crt_grunt_classes.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were a senior NCO for the Catastrophe Response and Investigation Team, "
"relaying orders to your squad was an everyday task.  When the cataclysm "
"struck, your expertise helped save everyone time and time again until it all"
" fell apart."
msgstr ""
"『大災厄対応・調査チーム』の上級軍曹として、部隊に命令を伝達することは日常業務だった。大災厄が襲ったとき、お前の経験と知識は幾度となく仲間たちを救う手助けとなったが、ついにすべてが崩壊した。"

#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/scenarios/crt_grunt_classes.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "C.R.I.T. Grunt"
msgstr "C.R.I.T.歩兵"

#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/scenarios/crt_grunt_classes.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "C.R.I.T. Grunt"
msgstr "C.R.I.T.歩兵"

#. ~ Profession (male C.R.I.T. Grunt) description
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/scenarios/crt_grunt_classes.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were part of the infantry; first to hit the ground running, clear a FOB "
"and then come back to relax with your squad.  Those days ended when the "
"cataclysm reared its ugly head.  Your lines were torn through like wet paper"
" when the otherworldly abominations arrived.  Now fleeing for your life, "
"will you have what it takes to survive or is this hellish landscape your "
"resting place?"
msgstr ""
"歩兵隊に所属していた。真っ先に前線へ突っ込み、前哨基地の安全を確保し、仲間と共に寛いで帰還する。大災厄がその醜い頭をもたげたとき、そんな日々は終わった。異界の化け物が現れると、お前の戦線は濡れた紙が引き裂かれるように崩壊した。今、命からがら逃げているお前に、生き残るだけのものがあるか？"
" それとも、この地獄が安息の地となるのか？"

#. ~ Profession (female C.R.I.T. Grunt) description
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/scenarios/crt_grunt_classes.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were part of the infantry; first to hit the ground running, clear a FOB "
"and then come back to relax with your squad.  Those days ended when the "
"cataclysm reared its ugly head.  Your lines were torn through like wet paper"
" when the otherworldly abominations arrived.  Now fleeing for your life, "
"will you have what it takes to survive or is this hellish landscape your "
"resting place?"
msgstr ""
"歩兵隊に所属していた。真っ先に前線へ突っ込み、前哨基地の安全を確保し、仲間と共に寛いで帰還する。大災厄がその醜い頭をもたげたとき、そんな日々は終わった。異界の化け物が現れると、お前の戦線は濡れた紙が引き裂かれるように崩壊した。今、命からがら逃げているお前に、生き残るだけのものがあるか？"
" それとも、この地獄が安息の地となるのか？"

#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/scenarios/crt_grunt_classes.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "C.R.I.T. Automatic Rifleman"
msgstr "C.R.I.T.自動小銃兵"

#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/scenarios/crt_grunt_classes.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "C.R.I.T. Automatic Rifleman"
msgstr "C.R.I.T.自動小銃兵"

#. ~ Profession (male C.R.I.T. Automatic Rifleman) description
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/scenarios/crt_grunt_classes.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were assigned the billet of specializing in creating dead zones and "
"providing support fire.  When the cataclysm struck, your trusty LMG couldn't"
" keep the veritable tide of undead from overtaking your squad.  Now running "
"with all the strength your body can muster, will you have what it takes to "
"survive or is this hellish landscape something you just can't suppress?"
msgstr ""
"無効化領域の確保と支援射撃を専門とする役職に割り当てられていた。大災厄が起きた時、信頼していたLMGでも、押し寄せる死者の大群が部隊を圧倒するのを食い止められなかった。今、全力を振り絞って逃げているお前に、生き残るだけのものがあるか？"
" それとも、この地獄のような世界は、お前には抑えきれないものなのか？"

#. ~ Profession (female C.R.I.T. Automatic Rifleman) description
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/scenarios/crt_grunt_classes.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were assigned the billet of specializing in creating dead zones and "
"providing support fire.  When the cataclysm struck, your trusty LMG couldn't"
" keep the veritable tide of undead from overtaking your squad.  Now running "
"with all the strength your body can muster, will you have what it takes to "
"survive or is this hellish landscape something you just can't suppress?"
msgstr ""
"無効化領域の確保と支援射撃を専門とする役職に割り当てられていた。大災厄が起きた時、信頼していたLMGでも、押し寄せる死者の大群が部隊を圧倒するのを食い止められなかった。今、全力を振り絞って逃げているお前に、生き残るだけのものがあるか？"
" それとも、この地獄のような世界は、お前には抑えきれないものなのか？"

#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/scenarios/crt_grunt_classes.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "C.R.I.T. Commanding Officer"
msgstr "C.R.I.T.司令官"

#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/scenarios/crt_grunt_classes.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "C.R.I.T. Commanding Officer"
msgstr "C.R.I.T.司令官"

#. ~ Profession (male C.R.I.T. Commanding Officer) description
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/scenarios/crt_grunt_classes.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"As a top-ranking CO, you didn't see much in the way of combat other than "
"when you felt like it.  Your charisma and sharp intellect helped you climb "
"up the ranks and provided support to allies in need.  Now that everything "
"went down the drain, will it help you again?"
msgstr ""
"最高位の司令官として、お前が戦闘を目にすることはほとんどなかった（気が向いた時を除いて）。カリスマ性と鋭い知性で階級を駆け上がり、助けを必要とする仲間に支援を提供した。すべてが破滅した今、その才能は再びお前を助けるだろうか？"

#. ~ Profession (female C.R.I.T. Commanding Officer) description
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/scenarios/crt_grunt_classes.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"As a top-ranking CO, you didn't see much in the way of combat other than "
"when you felt like it.  Your charisma and sharp intellect helped you climb "
"up the ranks and provided support to allies in need.  Now that everything "
"went down the drain, will it help you again?"
msgstr ""
"最高位の司令官として、お前が戦闘を目にすることはほとんどなかった（気が向いた時を除いて）。カリスマ性と鋭い知性で階級を駆け上がり、助けを必要とする仲間に支援を提供した。すべてが破滅した今、その才能は再びお前を助けるだろうか？"

#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/scenarios/crt_grunt_classes.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "C.R.I.T. Recruit"
msgstr "C.R.I.T.新兵"

#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/scenarios/crt_grunt_classes.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "C.R.I.T. Recruit"
msgstr "C.R.I.T.新兵"

#. ~ Profession (male C.R.I.T. Recruit) description
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/scenarios/crt_grunt_classes.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were scheduled for some survival training in New England when the "
"Cataclysm broke out and your instructor never showed up for the next lesson."
"  Now stuck in the quarantine zone with your standard issue training "
"equipment, you wish you had a better gun.  Looks like you'll definitely "
"learn a thing or two about survival though!"
msgstr ""
"大災厄が発生した時、お前はちょうどニューイングランド地域でサバイバルトレーニングを受ける予定だったが、教官は次のレッスンに現れなかった。今、標準支給品の訓練用装備しか持たずに隔離区域に取り残されている。もっと高性能な銃があれば良かったのにと願っているだろう。しかし、これでサバイバルについて色々なことを学べそうだな！"

#. ~ Profession (female C.R.I.T. Recruit) description
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/scenarios/crt_grunt_classes.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were scheduled for some survival training in New England when the "
"Cataclysm broke out and your instructor never showed up for the next lesson."
"  Now stuck in the quarantine zone with your standard issue training "
"equipment, you wish you had a better gun.  Looks like you'll definitely "
"learn a thing or two about survival though!"
msgstr ""
"大災厄が発生した時、お前はちょうどニューイングランド地域でサバイバルトレーニングを受ける予定だったが、教官は次のレッスンに現れなかった。今、標準支給品の訓練用装備しか持たずに隔離区域に取り残されている。もっと高性能な銃があれば良かったのにと願っているだろう。しかし、これでサバイバルについて色々なことを学べそうだな！"

#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/scenarios/crt_lone_wolf.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "C.R.I.T. Lone Wolf"
msgstr "C.R.I.T. ローンウルフ"

#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/scenarios/crt_lone_wolf.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "C.R.I.T. Lone Wolf"
msgstr "C.R.I.T. ローンウルフ"

#. ~ Profession (male C.R.I.T. Lone Wolf) description
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/scenarios/crt_lone_wolf.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"STR 10 recommended.  You are fully armored badass granted the full authority"
" of a U.S Marshal.  Sent in as the one man army capable of handling "
"anything.  Dropped into warzones, you singlehandedly laid out entire "
"battalions by yourself.  Time to hang them all."
msgstr ""
"[推奨筋力10] "
"連邦保安官の全権を与えられた、完全武装の猛者だ。何事も単独で解決可能なワンマンアーミーとして送り込まれた。戦場に降下し、独力で敵大隊を一掃してきた。今こそ、奴らを皆、吊るし上げる時だ。"

#. ~ Profession (female C.R.I.T. Lone Wolf) description
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/scenarios/crt_lone_wolf.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"STR 10 recommended.  You are fully armored badass granted the full authority"
" of a U.S Marshal.  Sent in as the one man army capable of handling "
"anything.  Dropped into warzones, you singlehandedly laid out entire "
"battalions by yourself.  Time to hang them all."
msgstr ""
"[推奨筋力10] "
"連邦保安官の全権を与えられた、完全武装の猛者だ。何事も単独で解決可能なワンマンアーミーとして送り込まれた。戦場に降下し、独力で敵大隊を一掃してきた。今こそ、奴らを皆、吊るし上げる時だ。"

#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/scenarios/crt_lone_wolf.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "C.R.I.T. Sniper"
msgstr "C.R.I.T.狙撃手"

#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/scenarios/crt_lone_wolf.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "C.R.I.T. Sniper"
msgstr "C.R.I.T.狙撃手"

#. ~ Profession (male C.R.I.T. Sniper) description
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/scenarios/crt_lone_wolf.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were deep in training to become a Lone Wolf; Now you need to prove "
"yourself, perhaps you could even become one, the old guard would support "
"that."
msgstr ""
"お前はローンウルフとなるべく、過酷な訓練に身を投じてきた。今こそ、その実力を証明する時だ。もし生き延びて目的を果たせば、真にその名を冠することになるだろう。古参の連中も、それを後押ししてくれるはずだ。"

#. ~ Profession (female C.R.I.T. Sniper) description
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/scenarios/crt_lone_wolf.json
