#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/scenarios/crt_lone_wolf.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "C.R.I.T. Hunter"
msgstr "C.R.I.T.ハンター"

#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/scenarios/crt_lone_wolf.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "C.R.I.T. Hunter"
msgstr "C.R.I.T.ハンター"

#. ~ Profession (male C.R.I.T. Hunter) description
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/scenarios/crt_lone_wolf.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were recently recruited into the CRIT Lone Wolf training program. While "
"you are barely trained at all, they still sent you out there just like the "
"rest of the team. Maybe you stand a chance though, a better chance then the "
"medics that is."
msgstr ""
"お前は最近、C.R.I.T.のローンウルフ "
"訓練プログラムに召集されたばかりだ。まともな訓練などほとんど受けていないが、組織はお前を他のチーム同様、外の世界へと放り出した。だが、ひょっとすると生き残るチャンスはあるかもしれない。…少なくとも、あの衛生兵たちよりはマシなチャンスがな。"

#. ~ Profession (female C.R.I.T. Hunter) description
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/scenarios/crt_lone_wolf.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were recently recruited into the CRIT Lone Wolf training program. While "
"you are barely trained at all, they still sent you out there just like the "
"rest of the team. Maybe you stand a chance though, a better chance then the "
"medics that is."
msgstr ""
