"flesh and massive toothy jaws.  Joints and cracks around its body ooze with "
"black goo."
msgstr ""
"石灰化した歪な骨の増殖体が、この恐竜の腐敗した皮膚と、巨大な歯のある顎を覆い尽くしている。体中の関節やヒビ割れからは、黒い粘液がにじみ出ている。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
msgid "skeletal ornithomimid brute"
msgid_plural "skeletal ornithomimid brutes"
msgstr[0] "凶暴骸骨オルニトミムス"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'skeletal ornithomimid brute'}
#. ~ Description for {'str': 'skeletal thescelosaurus brute'}
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
msgid ""
"Distorted outgrowths of calcified bone plates cover this dinosaur's beak and"
" feathers.  Joints and cracks around its body ooze with black goo."
msgstr "石灰化した歪な骨の増殖体が、この恐竜のくちばしと羽毛を覆い尽くしている。体中の関節やヒビ割れからは、黒い粘液がにじみ出ている。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
msgid "skeletal beaked juggernaut"
msgid_plural "skeletal beaked juggernaut"
msgstr[0] "巨体骸骨オルニトミムス"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'skeletal beaked juggernaut'}
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
msgid ""
"This hideous colossus of plated bones and misshapen flesh drags its heavy, "
"pointed limbs behind it.  Already strong and dangerous, bones grew around "
"its form to protect it - only, they kept growing.  The shape and twisting "
"pointed beak suggest some kind of beaked, two legged dinosaur."
msgstr ""
"骨の装甲と歪に膨れ上がった肉でできたこのおぞましい巨体は、重く尖った四肢を引きずって進む。もともと強く危険な存在だったが、体を護るために成長し始めた骨が、増殖を止められずにいる。体格と捻じれて尖ったくちばしから、何らかのくちばしを持つ二足歩行恐竜だったことがわかる。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
msgid "skeletal nothronychus brute"
msgid_plural "skeletal nothronychus brutes"
msgstr[0] "凶暴骸骨ノトロニクス"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'skeletal nothronychus brute'}
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
msgid ""
"Distorted outgrowths of calcified bone plates cover this dinosaur's rotting "
"flesh, long neck and claws.  Joints and cracks around its body ooze with "
"black goo."
msgstr ""
"石灰化した歪な骨の増殖体が、この恐竜の腐敗した皮膚、長い首、そして爪を覆い尽くしている。体中の関節やヒビ割れからは、黒い粘液がにじみ出ている。"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'skeletal theropod juggernaut'}
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
msgid ""
"This hideous colossus of plated bones and misshapen flesh drags its heavy, "
"pointed limbs behind it.  Already strong and dangerous, bones grew around "
"its form to protect it - only, they kept growing.  The shape and twisting "
"clawed arms suggest some kind of two legged dinosaur."
msgstr ""
"骨の装甲と歪に膨れ上がった肉でできたこのおぞましい巨体は、重く尖った四肢を引きずって進む。もともと強く危険な存在だったが、体を護るために成長し始めた骨が、増殖を止められずにいる。体格と捻じれた爪のある腕は、何らかの二足歩行恐竜だったことを暗示している。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
msgid "skeletal anzu brute"
msgid_plural "skeletal anzu brutes"
msgstr[0] "凶暴骸骨アンズー"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'skeletal anzu brute'}
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
msgid ""
"Distorted outgrowths of calcified bone plates cover this dinosaur's rotting "
"flesh, long neck and beak.  Joints and cracks around its body ooze with "
"black goo."
msgstr ""
"石灰化した歪な骨の増殖体が、この恐竜の腐敗した皮膚、長い首、そしてくちばしを覆い尽くしている。体中の関節やヒビ割れからは、黒い粘液がにじみ出ている。"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'skeletal beaked juggernaut'}
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
msgid ""
"This hideous colossus of plated bones and misshapen flesh drags its heavy, "
"pointed limbs behind it.  Already strong and dangerous, bones grew around "
"its form to protect it - only, they kept growing.  The shape and twisting "
"beak suggest some kind of two legged beaked dinosaur."
msgstr ""
"骨の装甲と歪に膨れ上がった肉でできたこのおぞましい巨体は、重く尖った四肢を引きずって進む。もともと強く危険な存在だったが、体を護るために成長し始めた骨が、増殖を止められずにいる。体格と歪んだくちばしから、何らかのくちばしを持つ二足歩行恐竜だったことがわかる。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
msgid "skeletal dromaeosaurid brute"
msgid_plural "skeletal dromaeosaurid brutes"
msgstr[0] "凶暴骸骨ユタラプトル"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'skeletal dromaeosaurid brute'}
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
msgid ""
"Distorted outgrowths of calcified bone plates cover this dinosaur's rotting "
"flesh, claws, and sharp teeth.  Joints and cracks around its body ooze with "
"black goo."
msgstr ""
"石灰化した歪な骨の増殖体が、この恐竜の腐敗した皮膚、爪、そして鋭い歯を覆い尽くしている。体中の関節やヒビ割れからは、黒い粘液がにじみ出ている。"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'skeletal theropod juggernaut'}
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
msgid ""
"This hideous colossus of plated bones and misshapen flesh drags its heavy, "
"pointed limbs behind it.  Already strong and dangerous, bones grew around "
"its form to protect it - only, they kept growing.  The shape and twisting "
"claws and sharp teeth suggest some kind of two legged dinosaur."
msgstr ""
"骨の装甲と歪に膨れ上がった肉でできたこのおぞましい巨体は、重く尖った四肢を引きずって進む。もともと強く危険な存在だったが、体を護るために成長し始めた骨が、増殖を止められずにいる。体格と、捻じれた爪と鋭い歯から、何らかの二足歩行恐竜だったことがわかる。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
msgid "skeletal thescelosaurus brute"
msgid_plural "skeletal thescelosaurus brutes"
msgstr[0] "凶暴骸骨テスケロサウルス"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
msgid "dilophosaurus acidic zombie"
msgid_plural "dilophosaurus acidic zombies"
msgstr[0] "強酸ゾンビディロフォサウルス"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'dilophosaurus acidic zombie'}
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
msgid ""
"The shuffling corpse of a dinosaur with sharp teeth and two prominent bony "
"crests on its head, with ragged strips of ripped flesh hanging down like a "
"frill.  Sticky yellow fluid oozes out from sores in the scales."
msgstr ""
"鋭い歯と、頭部に目立つ骨質の二つのトサカを持つ恐竜の死体が、足をひきずって動いている。引き裂かれた肉片がえり飾りのようにだらしなく垂れ下がっている。鱗のただれた傷からは、粘つく黄色い液体がにじみ出ている。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
msgid "ceratosaurus acidic zombie"
msgid_plural "ceratosaurus acidic zombies"
msgstr[0] "強酸ゾンビケラトサウルス"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'ceratosaurus acidic zombie'}
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
msgid ""
"This zombie is enormous, scaly, and studded with bony spikes.  Sticky yellow"
" fluid oozes out from sores in the scales."
msgstr "ゾンビは巨大で、全身が鱗で覆われ、骨の棘が散在している。鱗のただれた傷からは、粘つく黄色い液体がにじみ出ている。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of a strange jungle with giant ferns."
msgstr "巨大なシダが生い茂る奇妙なジャングルを夢に見ている。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/dreams.json
msgid "Dreams of being the king are all you can remember."
msgstr "王になる夢だけが、お前の記憶に残っている。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You brush through tree sized ferns as you hunt for your prey.  The rain "
"falls slick upon your skin."
msgstr "獲物を追って、木ほどの大きさのシダを押し分けながら進む。降り注ぐ雨が、皮膚を滑らかに滑り落ちていく。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/dreams.json
msgid "Thunderous footsteps shake the earth, are they yours?"
msgstr "雷鳴のような足音が大地を揺さぶる。これは自分の足音だろうか？"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/dreams.json
msgid "Your teeth, how do you have so many teeth?  Am I growing extra teeth?"
msgstr "お前の歯だ、どうしてこんなにたくさんの歯があるんだ？まさか、余分な歯が生えてきたのか？"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/dreams.json
msgid "The hairless apes around you smell like food.  Are they?"
msgstr "お前の周りの毛のない猿どもは、食べ物のような匂いがする。こいつらは食料なのか？"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/dreams.json
msgid "So close, you can taste the rebirth of a glorious past."
msgstr "指先で触れられるほど近くに、輝かしい過去の再生を感じ取れる。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/dreams.json
msgid "King, nay not a king.  A god among beasts."
msgstr "王、いや、王ではない。獣の神だ。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/dreams.json
msgid "The warm sun upon your skin.  A heavier air, golden dreams."
msgstr "肌に感じる暖かな太陽。濃密な空気、黄金の夢。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/dreams.json
msgid "You dream of eating the largest fern you've ever seen."
msgstr "今まで見た中で一番大きなシダを食べる夢を見ている。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/dreams.json
msgid ""
"Large, you are becoming larger every day.  Armored skin, to protect you from"
" the world.  These are the gifts you are receiving."
msgstr "巨大だ、お前は日に日に大きくなっている。装甲された皮膚は、世界からお前を護る。これらがお前が受け取っている贈り物だ。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You dream of before the Cataclysm, but you are different somehow.  The other"
" humans all seem so soft to you."
msgstr "大災厄以前の光景を夢に見ているが、お前はどこか異なっている。他の人間は皆、お前にはとても柔らかく見える。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/dreams.json
msgid ""
"Slower, trudging through the universe, you cease to notice those that try to"
" stop you as you walk through them."
msgstr "ゆっくりと、宇宙を重々しく踏みしめて進む。お前を止めようとする者どもを、貫きながら歩き抜けるため、彼らに気づきさえしない。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/dreams.json
msgid "Why is this world so cold compared to the one in your dreams?"
msgstr "夢の中の世界と比べて、この世界はどうしてこんなに寒いのか？"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/dreams.json
msgid ""
"Is this how superman feels?  Bulletproof?  But superman is much faster than "
"you."
msgstr "スーパーマンもこんな気分なのか？防弾か？だが、スーパーマンはお前よりもずっと速い。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/dreams.json
msgid "Nothing less than an asteroid can kill you."
msgstr "隕石でなければ、お前を殺すことはできない。"

#. ~ Mutation class name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Tyrant"
msgstr "ティラノサウルス"

#. ~ Mutation class: Tyrant mutagen_message
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "The gnashing of teeth and rending of flesh calls to you."
msgstr "歯ぎしりと肉を引き裂く音がお前を呼び寄せる。"

#. ~ Mutation class: Tyrant iv_message
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You feel additional teeth working their way into your mouth."
msgstr "余分な歯が口の中に生えてきた気がする。"

#. ~ Mutation class: Tyrant Male memorial messsage
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/mutations.json
msgctxt "memorial_male"
msgid "Struck by a rogue asteroid."
msgstr "はぐれ小惑星に吹っ飛ばされてきました。"

#. ~ Mutation class: Tyrant Female memorial messsage
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/mutations.json
msgctxt "memorial_female"
msgid "Struck by a rogue asteroid."
msgstr "はぐれ小惑星に吹っ飛ばされてきました。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Tyrano Sapien"
msgstr "ティラノ・サピエンス"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Tyrano Sapien'}
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Thunder lizard, dragon, tyrant.  All these names pale before your majesty."
msgstr "雷竜、ドラゴン、暴君。数々の異名もこの威厳の前には霞む。"

#. ~ Mutation class name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Stego"
msgstr "ステゴサウルス"

#. ~ Mutation class: Stego mutagen_message
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You are the armor."
msgstr "お前こそが装甲だ。"

#. ~ Mutation class: Stego iv_message
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Who needs platemail."
msgstr "プレートメイルなど、誰が必要とするものか。"

#. ~ Mutation class: Stego Male memorial messsage
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/mutations.json
msgctxt "memorial_male"
msgid "The end of an era."
msgstr "一つの時代が幕を下ろした。"

#. ~ Mutation class: Stego Female memorial messsage
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/mutations.json
msgctxt "memorial_female"
msgid "The end of an era."
msgstr "一つの時代が幕を下ろした。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Stego'}
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Slow, methodical, heavily armored.  A walking tank."
msgstr "鈍重かつ規則正しい動きの重装甲。 まさに歩く戦車そのものだ。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Tough-Skinned"
msgstr "硬い皮膚"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Tough-Skinned'}
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your skin is getting tougher.  Cutting and bash armor are increased by 4 and"
" stab armor by 1.  Makes you less dextrous though."
msgstr "皮膚が硬くなっている。斬撃と打撃の耐性が4増加し、刺突の耐性が1増加する。ただし、これにより器用さは低下する。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Diamond-Skinned"
msgstr "ダイヤモンドの皮膚"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Diamond-Skinned'}
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your skin is developing kevlar-like qualities, granting you 6 physical "
"armor, though not against bullets.  Makes you slower though."
msgstr "皮膚がケブラーのような特性を発現しており、物理耐性を6を得るが、銃弾に対しては無効である。ただし、動作が遅くなる。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Apatosaurus Back"
msgstr "アパトサウルスの体格"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Apatosaurus Back'}
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You are capable of carrying inhuman amounts - more than others with similar "
"strength could.  Your maximum weight carried is increased by 70%."
msgstr "同程度の筋力を持つ人よりも、ありえないほど大量の物を持ち運べる。最大所持重量が70%増加する。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Serrated Teeth"
msgstr "鋸歯"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Serrated Teeth'}
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your mouth has reshaped to accomodate many serrated teeth.  They make it "
"impossible to wear mouthgear and difficult to eat… but tear giant wounds in "
"your prey."
msgstr ""
"口の形が多数のノコギリ状の歯を収めるために変わった。これによりマウスギアの装着は不可能になり、食事も困難になる… "
"しかし、獲物には巨大な裂傷をつけることができる。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You tear into %s with your serrated teeth"
msgstr "ギザギザの歯で%sを引き裂いた"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "%1$s tears into %2$s with their serrated teeth"
msgstr "%1$sはギザギザの歯で%2$sを引き裂いた"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "Horned Tail"
msgstr "棘付きの尾"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Horned Tail'}
#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"You have a long, thick, tail with sharp pointed horns.  It helps you balance"
" a bit but also makes a heavy bludgeon.  Prevents wearing non-fabric pants."
msgstr ""
"先端に鋭い棘が付いた、トカゲのような長くて太い尻尾が生えている。身体のバランスを多少補助し、重い棍棒にもなる。布製以外のアイテムを脚に着用できない。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "You smash %s with your tail"
msgstr "尻尾で%sを砕いた"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/mutations/mutations.json
msgid "%1$s smashes %2$s with their tail"
msgstr "%1$sは尻尾で%2$sを砕いた"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/obsolete/fieldoffice.json
msgid "wildlife field office"
msgstr "鳥獣保護センター"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/obsolete/monsters.json
msgid "Dimorphodon zombie"
msgid_plural "Dimorphodon zombie"
msgstr[0] "ゾンビディモルフォドン"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'Dimorphodon zombie'}
#: data/mods/DinoMod/obsolete/monsters.json
msgid ""
"The raggedly flying corpse  of a feathered reptile over three feet long, "
"with short wings and a big colorful beak."
msgstr "全長約90cm超の、短い翼と大きく色鮮やかなくちばしを持つ羽毛付き爬虫類の死体。そのボロボロになった体は異様に乱雑に飛び回っている。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Winged Horror'}
#: data/mods/DinoMod/obsolete/monsters.json
msgid ""
"The flying corpse of a feathered reptile over three feet long, with short "
"wings and a big colorful beak.  Its entire body bulges with distended "
"muscles and swollen, festering wounds."
msgstr ""
"短い翼と大きく色鮮やかなくちばしを持ち、全長約90cm超の羽毛付き爬虫類の死体。その全身は、膨張した筋肉と、腫れ上がり爛れた傷口によって異様に膨れ上がっている。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/obsolete/monsters.json
msgid "Dimorphozombie bio-operator"
msgid_plural "Dimorphozombie bio-operators"
msgstr[0] "改造兵ゾンビディモルフォドン"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Dimorphozombie bio-operator'}
#: data/mods/DinoMod/obsolete/monsters.json
msgid ""
"The raggedly flying corpse of a feathered reptile, with short wings and a "
"colorful glowing beak.  It has been implanted with crackling bionics and is "
"dripping black goo."
msgstr ""
"短い翼でフラフラと飛ぶ羽毛付き爬虫類の死体。くちばしは色鮮やかに発光し、パチパチと音を立てる義体インプラントが埋め込まれており、黒い粘液を滴らせている。"

#: data/mods/DinoMod/obsolete/npc_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"It could be a mighty challenge, but Alonso knows there are some that are "
"into this, no?  I think they call themselves escalier, which is Italian for "
"the scaly banana.  Or staircase.  It is not important, I mean to say that "
"people love who they love, and the dinosaur, she does the same, and there is"
" no shame in what two people or dinosaurs do in the escalier.  Alonso does "
"not judge you.  You do you.  And maybe Alonso as well when you are done with"
" the you doing."
msgstr ""
"ムズいチャレンジかもしれんけど、こういう趣味のヤツがいるって、アロンソは知ってるっての！な？奴らは自分たちを「エスカリエ」って呼ぶんだろ。イタリア語で「鱗だらけのバナナ」って意味らしいがな。…いや、階段だっけ？まあ、どうでもいい！要するに、人は好きな人を愛するってこと。恐竜だって同じだろ。人間だろうが恐竜だろうが、エスカリエの中で何してようが別に恥ずかしくないって。アロンソはあんたをジャッジしないよ。あんたはあんたの好きにやれ。で、あんたが終わったら、アロンソも好きにさせてもらうわ。"

