#. 'pairs of demon chitin gauntlets'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/armor.json
msgid ""
"Gauntlets crafted from the carefully cleaned and pruned red exoskeletons of "
"demon spiders.  Fire-resistant and very durable."
msgstr "デーモンスパイダーの赤い外骨格を丁寧に洗浄し、切り取って作り上げたガントレットだ。耐火性があり、非常に耐久性に優れている。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/armor.json
