#. ~ Description for {'str': 'pair of demon chitin boots', 'str_pl': 'pairs of
#. demon chitin boots'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/armor.json
msgid ""
"Boots crafted from carefully cleaned and pruned pruned red exoskeletons of "
"demon spiders.  Fire-resistant and very durable."
msgstr "デーモンスパイダーの赤い外骨格を丁寧に洗浄し、切り取って作り上げたブーツだ。耐火性があり、非常に耐久性に優れている。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/armor.json
msgid "demon chitin dog mesh harness"
msgid_plural "demon chitin dog mesh harnesses"
msgstr[0] "デーモンキチン・ドッグハーネス"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'demon chitin dog mesh harness', 'str_pl': 'demon
#. chitin dog mesh harnesses'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/armor.json
msgid ""
"A makeshift harness of demon chitin fitted to a thin mesh protecting the "
"neck to flank of canines.  You could put this on a friendly dog."
msgstr "デーモンキチンの急造ハーネスが取り付けられた薄いメッシュだ。イヌの首から脇腹にかけてを保護する。友好的なイヌに装着できる。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/armor.json
msgid "demon chitin horse armor"
msgid_plural "demon chitin horse armors"
msgstr[0] "デーモンキチン馬鎧"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'demon chitin horse armor'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/armor.json
msgid ""
"A makeshift assembly of criniere, peytral and croupiere made from demon "
"chitin fitted to a thin mesh.  You could put this on a friendly horse."
msgstr "薄いメッシュに装着された、デーモンキチン製のクリニエール、ペイトレール、クルーピエの急造された集合体だ。友好的なウマに装着できる。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/black_dragon_items.json
msgid "black dragon scale"
msgid_plural "black dragon scales"
msgstr[0] "黒竜の鱗"

#. ~ Description for black dragon scale
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/black_dragon_items.json
msgid ""
"A scale from a black dragon.  It still has its magical properties and acid "
"resistance."
msgstr "黒竜の鱗だ。魔法的な特性と耐酸性を維持している。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/black_dragon_items.json
msgid "raw black dragon hide"
msgid_plural "raw black dragon hides"
msgstr[0] "黒竜の粗皮"

#. ~ Description for raw black dragon hide
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/black_dragon_items.json
msgid ""
"A carefully folded raw hide harvested from a black dragon.  It is a large "
"enough piece that it is workable to make armor, and with enough scales you "
"could make scale mail."
msgstr "黒竜から剥ぎ取って丁寧に折り畳まれた生皮だ。防具を製作するのに十分な大きさがあり、加工に適している。十分な鱗があれば鱗鎧を製作できる。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/black_dragon_items.json
msgid "tanning black dragon hide"
msgid_plural "tanning black dragon hides"
msgstr[0] "黒竜の粗皮 (鞣し中)"

#. ~ Use action msg for tanning black dragon hide.
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/black_dragon_items.json
msgid "You carefully unfold the black dragon hide and shake it clean."
msgstr "鞣した黒竜の皮を慎重に広げ、揺すって綺麗にした。"

#. ~ Use action not_ready_msg for tanning black dragon hide.
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/black_dragon_items.json
msgid "The black dragon hide isn't done yet."
msgstr "黒竜の皮はまだ鞣し終わっていない。"

#. ~ Description for tanning black dragon hide
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/black_dragon_items.json
msgid ""
"A treated black dragon hide which is undergoing the chemical processes "
"required to become workable.  You will be able to activate it to unroll and "
"make use of it when it is done."
msgstr "素材として使用可能となるための化学処理を現在進行中の、処理済み黒竜皮だ。処理が完了した時点で、これを有効化して広げ、利用できるようになる。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/black_dragon_items.json
msgid "black dragon hide"
msgid_plural "black dragon hides"
msgstr[0] "黒竜皮"

#. ~ Description for black dragon hide
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/black_dragon_items.json
msgid ""
"Prepared hide from a black dragon.  Hard, acid-resistant, and with more "
"scales could make a suit of armor as hard as steel and half as heavy."
msgstr "加工済みの黒竜皮だ。硬く、耐酸性があり、さらに鱗と合わせれば、鋼鉄と同じくらい硬く、重さが半分の一式の鎧を製作できる。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/black_dragon_items.json
msgid "pair of black dragonscale boots"
msgid_plural "pairs of black dragonscale boots"
msgstr[0] "黒竜鱗ブーツ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'pair of black dragonscale boots', 'str_pl':
#. 'pairs of black dragonscale boots'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/black_dragon_items.json
msgid ""
"Boots made of black dragonscale.  Very protective, and surprisingly light."
msgstr "黒竜の鱗で作られたブーツだ。防御性が非常に高く、驚くほど軽量である。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/black_dragon_items.json
msgid "pair of black dragonhide boots"
msgid_plural "pairs of black dragonhide boots"
msgstr[0] "黒竜皮ブーツ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'pair of black dragonhide boots', 'str_pl':
#. 'pairs of black dragonhide boots'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/black_dragon_items.json
msgid ""
"Boots made of black dragonhide.  Very protective, and surprisingly light."
msgstr "黒竜皮で作られたブーツだ。防御性が非常に高く、驚くほど軽量である。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/black_dragon_items.json
msgid "black dragonscale helmet"
msgid_plural "black dragonscale helmets"
msgstr[0] "黒竜鱗ヘルメット"

#. ~ Description for black dragonscale helmet
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/black_dragon_items.json
msgid ""
"A helmet made from black dragonscale, held together with black dragonhide.  "
"It comes equipped with a full face visor."
msgstr "黒竜の鱗を主材とし、黒竜皮で繋ぎ止められたヘルメットだ。フルフェイスバイザーが装備されている。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/black_dragon_items.json
msgid "black dragonhide helmet"
msgid_plural "black dragonhide helmets"
msgstr[0] "黒竜皮ヘルメット"

#. ~ Description for black dragonhide helmet
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/black_dragon_items.json
msgid ""
"A helmet made from black dragonhide.  It protects your head well, and "
"doesn't cover your face."
msgstr "黒竜皮で作られたヘルメットだ。頭部をしっかりと保護するが、顔面は覆われない。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/black_dragon_items.json
msgid "black dragonscale armor"
msgid_plural "black dragonscale armors"
msgstr[0] "黒竜鱗アーマー"

#. ~ Description for black dragonscale armor
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/black_dragon_items.json
msgid ""
"A full suit of black dragon scale mail.  It comes with all the accoutrements"
" that cover your torso, legs, and arms, with the benefit of being very light"
" and flexible."
msgstr "黒竜の鱗で作られた一式の鱗鎧だ。胴体、脚、腕を覆う付属部品一式が揃っており、非常に軽量かつ柔軟性に優れているという利点がある。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/black_dragon_items.json
msgid "black dragonhide armor"
msgid_plural "black dragonhide armors"
msgstr[0] "黒竜皮アーマー"

#. ~ Description for black dragonhide armor
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/black_dragon_items.json
msgid ""
"A full suit of black dragonhide armor.  It comes with all the accoutrements "
"that cover your torso, legs, and arms, with the benefit of being very light "
"and flexible."
msgstr "黒竜皮で作られた一式の鎧だ。胴体、脚、腕を覆う付属部品一式が揃っており、非常に軽量かつ柔軟性に優れているという利点がある。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/black_dragon_items.json
msgid "pair of black dragonscale gauntlets"
msgid_plural "pairs of black dragonscale gauntlets"
msgstr[0] "黒竜鱗ガントレット"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'pair of black dragonscale gauntlets', 'str_pl':
#. 'pairs of black dragonscale gauntlets'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/black_dragon_items.json
msgid ""
"A pair of heavy-duty gauntlets made of black dragonscale that covers your "
"hands."
msgstr "頑丈な黒竜の鱗で作られた、両手を覆う一組のガントレットだ。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/black_dragon_items.json
msgid "pair of black dragonhide gloves"
msgid_plural "pairs of black dragonhide gloves"
msgstr[0] "黒竜皮グローブ"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/black_dragon_items.json
msgid "pair of XL black dragonscale boots"
msgid_plural "pairs of XL black dragonscale boots"
msgstr[0] "XL黒竜鱗ブーツ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'pair of XL black dragonscale boots', 'str_pl':
#. 'pairs of XL black dragonscale boots'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/black_dragon_items.json
msgid ""
"Massive boots made of black dragonscale, modified to fit even the strangest "
"of bodies.  Very protective, and surprisingly light."
msgstr "変異した体型にも合うよう改造された、巨大なブーツだ。防御性が非常に高く、驚くほど軽量である。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/black_dragon_items.json
msgid "pair of XL black dragonhide boots"
msgid_plural "pairs of XL black dragonhide boots"
msgstr[0] "XL黒竜皮ブーツ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'pair of XL black dragonhide boots', 'str_pl':
#. 'pairs of XL black dragonhide boots'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/black_dragon_items.json
msgid ""
"Massive boots made of black dragonhide, modified to fit even the strangest "
"of bodies.  Very protective, and surprisingly light."
msgstr "変異した体型にも合うよう改造された、黒竜皮で作られた巨大なブーツだ。防御性が非常に高く、驚くほど軽量である。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/black_dragon_items.json
msgid "pair of XL black dragonscale gauntlets"
msgid_plural "pairs of XL black dragonscale gauntlets"
msgstr[0] "XL黒竜鱗ガントレット"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'pair of XL black dragonscale gauntlets',
#. 'str_pl': 'pairs of XL black dragonscale gauntlets'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/black_dragon_items.json
msgid ""
"A pair of heavy-duty gauntlets made of black dragonscale that covers your "
"hands, or whatever you use as hands."
msgstr "頑丈な黒竜の鱗で作られた一組のガントレットだ。お前の手、あるいはお前が手として使うものであろうと、覆う。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/black_dragon_items.json
msgid "pair of XL black dragonhide gloves"
msgid_plural "pairs of XL black dragonhide gloves"
msgstr[0] "XL黒竜皮グローブ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'pair of XL black dragonhide gloves', 'str_pl':
#. 'pairs of XL black dragonhide gloves'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/black_dragon_items.json
msgid ""
"A pair of customized, Kevlar armored leather gloves, modified to be easy to "
"wear while providing maximum protection under extreme conditions.  Sized to "
"fit even the strangest of anatomy."
msgstr ""
"ケブラーで補強された特注の革製グローブだ。極限状況下で最大限の保護を提供しつつ、容易に装着できるように改造されている。最も異様な解剖学的構造にも合うよう、サイズ調整されている。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/black_dragon_items.json
msgid "XL black dragonscale helmet"
msgid_plural "XL black dragonscale helmets"
msgstr[0] "XL黒竜鱗ヘルメット"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'XL black dragonscale helmet'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/black_dragon_items.json
msgid ""
"A massive helmet made from black dragonscale, held together with black "
"dragonhide.  It comes equipped with a full face visor and is large enough to"
" fit even the strangest of heads."
msgstr "黒竜の鱗を主材とし、黒竜皮で繋ぎ止められた巨大なヘルメットだ。フルフェイスバイザーが装備されており、最も奇妙な頭部にさえ合うほど大きい。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/black_dragon_items.json
msgid "XL black dragonhide helmet"
msgid_plural "XL black dragonhide helmets"
msgstr[0] "XL黒竜皮ヘルメット"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'XL black dragonhide helmet'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/black_dragon_items.json
msgid ""
"A massive helmet made from black dragonhide.  It protects your head well, "
"and doesn't cover your face, but is large enough to fit even the strangest "
"of heads."
msgstr "黒竜皮で作られた巨大なヘルメットだ。頭部をしっかりと保護し、顔面は覆われないが、最も奇妙な頭部にさえ合うほど大きい。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/black_dragon_items.json
msgid "XL black dragonscale armor"
msgid_plural "XL black dragonscale armors"
msgstr[0] "XL黒竜鱗アーマー"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'XL black dragonscale armor'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/black_dragon_items.json
msgid ""
"A massive full suit of black dragon scale mail.  It comes with all the "
"accoutrements that cover your torso, legs, and arms; sized to fit even the "
"strangest of bodies."
msgstr "黒竜の鱗で作られた巨大な一式の鱗鎧だ。胴体、脚、腕を覆う付属部品一式が揃っており、最も異様な体型にさえ合うようサイズ調整されている。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/black_dragon_items.json
