msgstr[0] "XL黒竜皮アーマー"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'XL black dragonhide armor'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/black_dragon_items.json
msgid ""
"A massive full suit of black dragonhide armor.  It comes with all the "
"accoutrements that cover your torso, legs, and arms; sized to fit even the "
"strangest of bodies."
msgstr "黒竜皮で作られた巨大な一式の鎧だ。胴体、脚、腕を覆う付属部品一式が揃っており、最も異様な体型にさえ合うようサイズ調整されている。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/books_lore.json
msgid "vacation brochure"
msgid_plural "vacation brochures"
msgstr[0] "リゾート地の広告"

#. ~ Use action message for vacation brochure.
#. ~ Use action message for lair map.
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/books_lore.json
msgid "You add the locations to your map."
msgstr "特定の地点をマップに追記した。"

#. ~ Description for vacation brochure
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/books_lore.json
msgid ""
"This is a glossy brochure encouraging students to book vactaions at a lake "
"retreat or remote cabin.  The brochure includes lush photographs of a tower "
"on an island and a remote looking cabin in the woods.  It includes a map of "
"the areas."
msgstr ""
"学生向けに、湖畔の保養所または人里離れた山小屋での休暇予約を促す光沢のあるパンフレットだ。小島にそびえる塔や森の中に建つへんぴな山小屋などの豊かな写真と共に、その地域の地図が載っている。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/books_lore.json
msgid "lair map"
msgid_plural "lair maps"
msgstr[0] "巣穴の地図"

#. ~ Description for lair map
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/books_lore.json
msgid ""
"This is an well worn map.  It has pictures of fantastical beasts "
"embellishing the carefully drawn map markers."
msgstr "古びて擦り切れた地図だ。注意深く描かれた地図上の目印を装飾するように、幻想的な生物の絵が描かれている。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/books_lore.json
msgid "old photo"
msgid_plural "old photos"
msgstr[0] "古い写真"

#. ~ Description for old photo
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/books_lore.json
msgid ""
"A photo of a jovial, old wizard, he seems to be dancing with a coat rack in "
"this basement.  There is a stack of suitcases in the background."
msgstr "年老いた陽気な魔法使いの写真だ。この地下室でコート掛けと一緒に踊っているようだ。背後にはスーツケースが山積みになっている。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/class_items.json
msgid "Biomancer rune"
msgid_plural "Biomancer runes"
msgstr[0] "バイオマンサー・ルーン"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Biomancer rune'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/class_items.json
msgid ""
"This magical pebble has an insignia of rended flesh and bones on it.  It is "
"necessary for Biomancers to channel magic into their crafts."
msgstr "表面に引き裂かれた肉や骨を表す印が刻まれた奇妙な小石。バイオマンサーがアイテムに魔力を込める際に必要になる。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/class_items.json
msgid "Technomancer rune"
msgid_plural "Technomancer runes"
msgstr[0] "テクノマンサー・ルーン"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Technomancer rune'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/class_items.json
msgid ""
"This magical pebble has an insignia of clockwork and gears on it.  It is "
"necessary for Technomancers to channel magic into their crafts."
msgstr "表面にゼンマイと歯車を表す印が刻まれた奇妙な小石。テクノマンサーがアイテムに魔力を込める際に必要になる。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/class_items.json
msgid "Magus rune"
msgid_plural "Magi runes"
msgstr[0] "メイガス・ルーン"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Magus rune', 'str_pl': 'Magi runes'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/class_items.json
msgid ""
"This magical pebble has an insignia of crystal and mana orbs on it.  It is "
"necessary for Magi to channel magic into their crafts."
msgstr "表面に水晶とマナの宝玉を表す印が刻まれた奇妙な小石。メイガスがアイテムに魔力を込める際に必要になる。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/class_items.json
msgid "Earthshaper rune"
msgid_plural "Earthshaper runes"
msgstr[0] "アースシェイパー・ルーン"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Earthshaper rune'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/class_items.json
msgid ""
"This magical pebble has an insignia of steel and rocks on it.  It is "
"necessary for Earthshapers to channel magic into their crafts."
msgstr "表面に鋼と岩を表す印が刻まれた奇妙な小石です。アースシェイパーがアイテムに魔力を込める際に必要になる。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/class_items.json
msgid "Kelvinist rune"
msgid_plural "Kelvinist runes"
msgstr[0] "ケルビニスト・ルーン"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Kelvinist rune'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/class_items.json
msgid ""
"This magical pebble has an insignia of ice and flames on it.  It is "
"necessary for Kelvinists to channel magic into their crafts."
msgstr "表面に氷と炎を表す印が刻まれた奇妙な小石です。ケルビニストがアイテムに魔力を込める際に必要になる。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/class_items.json
msgid "Stormshaper rune"
msgid_plural "Stormshaper runes"
msgstr[0] "ストームシェイパー・ルーン"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Stormshaper rune'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/class_items.json
msgid ""
"This magical pebble has an insignia of lightning and storm clouds on it.  It"
" is necessary for Stormshapers to channel magic into their crafts."
msgstr "表面に雷と嵐を表す印が刻まれた奇妙な小石です。ストームシェイパーがアイテムに魔力を込める際に必要になる。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/class_items.json
msgid "Druid rune"
msgid_plural "Druid runes"
msgstr[0] "ドルイド・ルーン"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Druid rune'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/class_items.json
msgid ""
"This magical pebble has an insignia of nature and trees on it.  It is "
"necessary for Druids to channel magic into their crafts."
msgstr "表面に自然と木々を表す印が刻まれた奇妙な小石です。ドルイドがアイテムに魔力を込める際に必要になる。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/class_items.json
msgid "Animist rune"
msgid_plural "Animist runes"
msgstr[0] "アニミスト・ルーン"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Animist rune'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/class_items.json
msgid ""
"This magical pebble has an insignia of summoners on it.  It is necessary for"
" Animists to channel magic into their crafts."
msgstr "表面に召喚士を表す印が刻まれた奇妙な小石です。アニミストがアイテムに魔力を込める際に必要になる。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/class_items.json
msgid "alchemist rune"
msgid_plural "alchemist runes"
msgstr[0] "アルケミスト・ルーン"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'alchemist rune'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/class_items.json
msgid ""
"This magical pebble has an insignia of alchemy and potions on it.  While "
"versatile in use, the lack of attunement to any school prevents creation of "
"more advanced recipes."
msgstr ""
"表面に錬金術と水薬を表す印が刻まれた奇妙な小石です。用途は様々ですが、どの流派とも波長が合っていないため、より高度なレシピの製作は不可能です。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/class_items.json
msgid "Biomancer spear"
msgid_plural "Biomancer spears"
msgstr[0] "バイオマンサーの骨槍"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Biomancer spear'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/class_items.json
msgid ""
"A grotesque bone spearhead on a stout wooden pole.  There is a Biomancer "
"rune embedded at the base of the head."
msgstr "頑丈な木の棒に、不気味な骨の槍先が固定されている。槍先の基部にはバイオマンサーのルーンが埋め込まれている。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/class_items.json
msgid "Technomancer toolbar"
msgid_plural "Technomancer toolbars"
msgstr[0] "テクノマンサーのツールバー"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Technomancer toolbar'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/class_items.json
msgid ""
"This staff incorporates a sturdy cresent wrench on top of a prybar and a "
"hammer on the other in a convienent package.  There is a Technomancer rune "
"embedded in the hammerhead."
msgstr ""
"この杖は、頑丈な自在スパナをバールの上部に、そしてもう一方の端にはハンマーを便利な形で一つにまとめたものだ。ハンマーの頭にはテクノマンサーのルーンが埋め込まれている。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/class_items.json
msgid "Magus staff"
msgid_plural "Magus staves"
msgstr[0] "メイガスの杖"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Magus staff', 'str_pl': 'Magus staves'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/class_items.json
msgid ""
"A quarterstaff with runes carved into it and two glass jars, heat-tempered "
"and infused with mana for durability, to act as mana receptacles.  There are"
" two Magi runes embedded at the tips."
msgstr ""
"ルーン文字が刻まれたクォータースタッフに、熱処理され耐久性を高めるためにマナが注入された2つのガラス瓶が、マナの受け皿として固定されている。先端にはメイガスのルーンが2つ埋め込まれている。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/class_items.json
msgid "Kelvinist flamberge"
msgid_plural "Kelvinist flamberges"
msgstr[0] "ケルビニスト・フランベルジュ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Kelvinist flamberge'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/class_items.json
msgid ""
"A sword with an undulating blade, reminiscent of a flame.  There is a "
"Kelvinist rune embedded in the pommel."
msgstr "炎を思わせる波状の刃をもつ剣だ。柄頭にケルビニストのルーンが埋め込まれている。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/class_items.json
msgid "Stormshaper axe"
msgid_plural "Stormshaper axes"
msgstr[0] "ストームシェイパーの斧"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Stormshaper axe'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/class_items.json
msgid ""
"A forged copper axe with silver trimmings and a wooden handle.  There is a "
"Stormshaper rune embedded in the eye."
msgstr "銀の縁飾りが付いた鍛造銅製の斧で、木製の柄が取り付けられている。柄穴にはストームシェイパーのルーンが埋め込まれている。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/class_items.json
msgid "Animist athame"
msgid_plural "Animist athames"
msgstr[0] "アニミストのアサメ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Animist athame'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/class_items.json
msgid ""
"A steel ritual knife used by Animists to draw blood for summoning.  Their "
"school rune is embedded in the crossguard."
msgstr "アニミストが召喚用の血を採取する時に使う、鋼鉄製の儀式用ナイフだ。十字型の鍔に彼らの流派のルーンが埋め込まれている。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/class_items.json
msgid "technomancer's toolbelt"
msgid_plural "technomancer's toolbelts"
msgstr[0] "テクノマンサーのツールベルト"

#. ~ Description for {'str': "technomancer's toolbelt"}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/class_items.json
msgid ""
"A custom-built leather utility belt that instantly creates any tool that you"
" reach for.  Activate to sheathe/draw a weapon."
msgstr "お前が手を伸ばしたあらゆる道具を即座に創造する、特製の革製ユーティリティベルトだ。有効化して武器を納刀/抜刀する。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/class_items.json
msgid "Druid composite bow"
msgid_plural "Druid composite bows"
msgstr[0] "ドルイドのコンポジットボウ"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/class_items.json
msgid ""
"A bow made of multiple materials to maximize energy efficiency.  There are "
"two Druid runes embedded at the tips."
msgstr "複数の素材を組み合わせてエネルギー効率を最大化した弓だ。両端に一つずつドルイドのルーンが埋め込まれている。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/class_items.json
msgid "Earthshaper cestus"
msgid_plural "Earthshaper cesti"
msgstr[0] "アースシェイパーの拳闘グローブ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Earthshaper cestus', 'str_pl': 'Earthshaper
#. cesti'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/class_items.json
msgid ""
"A stone battle glove with carved runes encasing the hand, protecting it "
"while increasing striking power.  There is an Earthshaper rune embedded in "
"the palm."
msgstr ""
"ルーン文字が刻まれた石を手を包み込むように組み込んだバトルグローブだ。拳を保護しつつ打撃力を高める。掌の部分にはアースシェイパーのルーンが埋め込まれている。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/comestibles.json
msgid "owlbear egg"
msgid_plural "owlbear eggs"
msgstr[0] "オウルベアの卵"

#. ~ Description for owlbear egg
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/comestibles.json
msgid ""
"This egg laid by an owlbear seems almost indistinguishable from a large rock"
" until you touch it and can feel the warm glow of potential life energy from"
" within.  It's hard to believe that an owlbear could grow so quickly from "
"something so small.  Perhaps you could carefully crack it open to get at the"
" liquid golden goodness inside."
msgstr ""
"オウルベアが産んだこの卵は、触れてみないとほとんど大岩と見分けがつかない。内部からは、潜在的な生命エネルギーが放つ暖かい輝きを感じ取れる。この程度の大きさのタマゴから、オウルベアがあれほど急速に成長するとは信じがたい。慎重に割り開けば、中に入っている黄金色の素晴らしい液体にありつけるかもしれない。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/comestibles.json
msgid "owlbear egg yolk"
msgid_plural "owlbear egg yolks"
msgstr[0] "オウルベアの卵黄"

#. ~ Description for owlbear egg yolk
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/comestibles.json
msgid "The liquid innards of an owlbear egg.  Good eating."
msgstr "オウルベアの卵の液状の中身だ。美味しく食べられる。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/comestibles.json
msgid "hairball"
msgid_plural "hairballs"
msgstr[0] "毛玉"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'hairball'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/comestibles.json
msgid ""
"A big, ugly ball of animal spit and licked-off hairs.  Don't swallow it."
msgstr "動物の唾液と舐め取られた毛でできた、大きくて醜い塊だ。飲み込もうとするな。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/comestibles.json
msgid "dragon meat"
msgid_plural "dragon meat"
msgstr[0] "竜の肉"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'dragon meat'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/comestibles.json
msgid ""
"The meat from a slain dragon.  It does not seem to respond to cooking the "
"same way as other meat, making it obvious that it still retains some magical"
" properties."
msgstr "倒したドラゴンから得た肉だ。他の肉と同じようには調理に反応せず、何らかの魔法的な特性を保持していることが明らかだ。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/comestibles.json
msgid "scream mushroom"
msgid_plural "scream mushrooms"
msgstr[0] "サケビタケ"

#. ~ Description for scream mushroom
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/comestibles.json
msgid ""
"The mushrooms harvested from a dead shrieker.  Could be used in potions."
msgstr "死んだシュリーカーから採取したキノコだ。ポーションの材料になる。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/comestibles.json
msgid "purified meat"
msgid_plural "purified meats"
msgstr[0] "精製肉"

#. ~ Description for purified meat
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/comestibles.json
msgid ""
"Indistinguishable from pre-Cataclysm lab grown beef.  It should be excellent"
" but somehow it's just edible."
msgstr "大災厄前の培養肉と見分けがつかない。非常に美味しいはずなのに、どういうわけか、ただ食べられるだけだ。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/comestibles.json
msgid "impure meat"
msgid_plural "impure meats"
msgstr[0] "不純肉"

#. ~ Description for impure meat
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/comestibles.json
msgid ""
"Not as tainted as previously and tastes like the real thing.  You do not "
"want to cook this for your friends, though if you do they won't know the "
"difference for a while."
msgstr ""
"以前ほどは汚染されておらず、本物そっくりの味がする。これを使った料理を友人に振る舞いたくはないが、もし振る舞ったとしても、しばらくの間は違いがわからないだろう。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/constructs.json
msgid "broken clay golem"
msgid_plural "broken clay golems"
msgstr[0] "壊れた粘土ゴーレム"

#. ~ Description for broken clay golem
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/constructs.json
msgid ""
"A broken clay golem, looking like a piece of post-modern art.  Could be "
"smashed for clay."
msgstr "壊れてポストモダンアートのような姿になった、粘土のゴーレムだ。叩き壊せば粘土が入手できる。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/constructs.json
msgid "broken plastic golem"
msgid_plural "broken plastic golems"
msgstr[0] "壊れたプラスチックゴーレム"

#. ~ Description for broken plastic golem
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/constructs.json
msgid ""
"A broken plastic golem, like a giant action figure chewed up by an equally "
"giant puppy.  You could smash it up into recycled plastic bits."
msgstr ""
"同じく巨大な子犬に噛まれた巨大なアクションフィギュアのような姿になった、壊れたプラスチックのゴーレムだ。叩き壊せばリサイクルプラスチックの破片が入手できる。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/constructs.json
msgid "broken stone golem"
msgid_plural "broken stone golems"
msgstr[0] "壊れたストーンゴーレム"

#. ~ Description for broken stone golem
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/constructs.json
msgid ""
"A broken stone golem, not that much different from big boulder.  Could be "
"smashed for stone."
msgstr "壊れて大きな岩とそう変わらない姿になった、石のゴーレムだ。叩き壊せば石が入手できる。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/constructs.json
msgid "broken iron golem"
msgid_plural "broken iron golems"
msgstr[0] "壊れたアイアンゴーレム"

#. ~ Description for broken iron golem
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/constructs.json
msgid ""
"A broken iron golem, with all iron you would possibly ever need.  Could be "
"smashed for iron."
msgstr "壊れた鉄のゴーレムだ。お前がおそらく必要とするであろう鉄のすべてを備えている。叩き壊せば鉄が入手できる。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/constructs.json
msgid "broken fresh resin golem"
msgid_plural "broken fresh resin golems"
msgstr[0] "壊れた新鮮な樹脂のゴーレム"

#. ~ Description for broken fresh resin golem
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/constructs.json
msgid ""
"A broken resin golem, slowly becoming more and more of a puddle.  You could "
"recover some small amount of materials from it, but it'll be difficult "
"considering how liquid it is."
msgstr "壊れた樹脂のゴーレムだ。徐々に水たまりになりつつある。少量の素材を回収できるかもしれないが、液体状であることを考えると難しいだろう。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/constructs.json
msgid "broken semi-cured resin golem"
msgid_plural "broken semi-cured resin golems"
msgstr[0] "壊れた半硬化樹脂のゴーレム"

#. ~ Description for broken semi-cured resin golem
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/constructs.json
msgid ""
"A broken resin golem, looking a bit like a big pile of toffee.  You can "
"recover some materials from it, but some wastage will definitely happen."
msgstr "壊れた樹脂のゴーレムで、まるで大きなタフィーの山のように見える。素材をいくらか回収できるが、多少の無駄は確実に生じるだろう。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/constructs.json
msgid "broken cured resin golem"
msgid_plural "broken cured resin golems"
msgstr[0] "壊れた硬化樹脂のゴーレム"

#. ~ Description for broken cured resin golem
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/constructs.json
msgid ""
"A broken resin golem, now reduced to a pile of rubble.  You could recover "
"some materials from it if you were to work at it for a while."
msgstr "壊れた樹脂のゴーレム。今は瓦礫の山と化している。しばらく手間をかければ、いくらかの素材を回収できるだろう。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid "pair of magical armored stone gauntlets"
msgid_plural "pairs of magical armored stone gauntlets"
msgstr[0] "魔法石の籠手"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'pair of magical armored stone gauntlets',
#. 'str_pl': 'pairs of magical armored stone gauntlets'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid "A magical flexible stonelike substance for protection and attack."
msgstr "防御と攻撃に適した、魔法的で柔軟な石のような物質。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid "finger firelighter"
msgid_plural "finger firelighters"
msgstr[0] "フィンガー・ファイアライター"

#. ~ Use action msg for finger firelighter.
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid "You dim the flame."
msgstr "炎を弱める。"

#. ~ Description for finger firelighter
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid ""
"This is a small flame you can hold in your hand.  With a thought, you can "
"cause it to light something on fire."
msgstr "手に持って使える小さな炎だ。心の中で念じれば、何かに点火させられる。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid "finger firelighter (dimmed)"
msgid_plural "finger firelighter (dimmed)s"
msgstr[0] "フィンガー・ファイアライター [弱]"

#. ~ Use action msg for finger firelighter (dimmed).
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid "You brighten the flame."
msgstr "炎を強める"

#. ~ Description for finger firelighter (dimmed)
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid ""
"This is a small flame you can hold in your hand.  With a thought, you can "
"cause it to light something on fire, though it is currently dimmed."
msgstr "手に持つことができる小さな炎である。思考一つで、何かに火をつけることができるが、現在は炎を弱めてある。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid "magic lamp"
msgid_plural "magic lamps"
msgstr[0] "魔法のランプ"

#. ~ Use action msg for magic lamp.
#. ~ Use action msg for magic light.
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid "You dim your spell until it's dark."
msgstr "呪文を暗くなるまで弱める。"

#. ~ Description for magic lamp
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid "a magical light source that will light up a small area."
msgstr "狭い範囲を照らす魔法の光源だ。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid "magic lamp (dimmed)"
msgid_plural "magic lamp (dimmed)s"
msgstr[0] "魔法のランプ [弱]"

#. ~ Use action msg for magic lamp (dimmed).
#. ~ Use action msg for magic light (dimmed).
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid "You return your spell to full brightness."
msgstr "呪文を最大の明るさに戻す。"

#. ~ Description for magic lamp (dimmed)
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid "a magical aura that you know can be brightened into a powerful light."
msgstr "明るさを強力な光にできる魔法のオーラ。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid "magic light"
msgid_plural "magic lights"
msgstr[0] "魔法の灯火"

#. ~ Description for magic light
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid "A small magical light that you can read by."
msgstr "読書に役立つ小さな光源です。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid "magic light (dimmed)"
msgid_plural "magic light (dimmed)s"
msgstr[0] "魔法の光 [弱]"

#. ~ Description for magic light (dimmed)
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid "A magical aura which you know can be brightened for reading light."
msgstr "読書に適した明るさに変えることができる魔法のオーラ。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid "large shield of magical ice"
msgid_plural "large shields of magical ice"
msgstr[0] "氷の大盾"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'large shield of magical ice', 'str_pl': 'large
#. shields of magical ice'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid "A lightweight but tough shield crafted entirely of magical ice."
msgstr "魔法の氷だけで作られた軽量かつ頑丈な盾だ。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid "slick icy coatings"
msgid_plural "slick icy coatings"
msgstr[0] "薄氷の膜"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'slick icy coatings'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid ""
"A magical slick icy coating on your feet.  While quite fast on flat floors, "
"they make it difficult to move on rough terrain."
msgstr "足元に形成された、滑りやすい魔法の氷コーティング。平坦な地形では非常に素早く移動できるが、起伏の多い地形では動作が困難になる。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid "The Stormhammer"
msgid_plural "The Stormhammers"
msgstr[0] "嵐の戦鎚"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'The Stormhammer'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid ""
"A crackling magical warhammer full of lightning to smite your foes with, and"
" of course, smash things to bits!"
msgstr "雷の力に満ちた、火花を散らす魔法の戦鎚。敵を打ち倒し、さらにはあらゆるものを粉々に砕く。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid "Stormfist"
msgid_plural "Stormfists"
msgstr[0] "ストームフィスト"

#. ~ Description for Stormfist
#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Stormfist'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid ""
"Encases your arm and hand in a sheath of crackling magical lightning, you "
"can punch and defend yourself with it in melee combat."
msgstr "腕と手を、火花を散らす魔法の稲妻の鞘で包む。これを近接戦闘の攻撃と防御に利用できる。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid "vicious tentacle whip"
msgid_plural "vicious tentacle whips"
msgstr[0] "触手鞭"

#. ~ Description for vicious tentacle whip
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid ""
"A long, writhing, tentacle covered in sharp bonelike blades and spikey "
"protrusions."
msgstr "鋭い骨の刃と尖った突起に覆われた、蠢く長い触手だ。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid "flesh pouch"
msgid_plural "flesh pouches"
msgstr[0] "肉のポーチ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'flesh pouch', 'str_pl': 'flesh pouches'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid ""
"A large pouch of tough flesh on your back, filled with tiny tentacles that "
"grasp and hold anything you place inside.  It shifts and adjusts itself to "
"minimize encumbrance."
msgstr ""
"背中にある、頑丈な肉の大きな袋。中に入れたものを掴んで保持する無数の小さな触手で満たされている。 袋は自ら動いて調整し、動作制限を最小限に抑える。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid "Wicked Bonespear"
msgid_plural "Wicked Bonespears"
msgstr[0] "骨の槍"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Wicked Bonespear'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid "This is a wicked spear/halberd hybrid entirely created of bone."
msgstr "槍とハルバードの混成武器であり、その全体が骨から作られた邪悪な得物だ。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid "Woodbow"
msgid_plural "Woodbows"
msgstr[0] "ウッドボウ"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid ""
"A magically conjured ornate recurve bow of solid flexible wood.  A matching "
"conjured wooden arrow appears when you draw the string back for firing."
msgstr "頑丈で柔軟な木に凝った装飾が施された、魔法で生成されたリカーブボウ。弓を引き絞ると、対応する魔法の木の矢が出現する。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid "seed of purification"
msgid_plural "seeds of purification"
msgstr[0] "浄化の種"

#. ~ Use action menu_text for {'str': 'seed of purification', 'str_pl': 'seeds
#. of purification'}.
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid "Squeeze seed"
msgstr "種を潰す"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'seed of purification', 'str_pl': 'seeds of
#. purification'}.
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid ""
"You squeeze the seed in your palm, and it begins to turn to a fine dust."
msgstr "潰した種が細かい粉末状に変化した。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'seed of purification', 'str_pl': 'seeds of
#. purification'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid ""
"A magical seed that can be squeezed to release purifying dust, which can "
"then be used to purify up to a gallon of water"
msgstr "魔法の種を潰すと生成される粉末は浄水作用を持っており、3.75Lまでの水を浄水できる。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid "faintly glowing dust"
msgid_plural "faintly glowing dusts"
msgstr[0] "浄化の粉"

#. ~ Description for faintly glowing dust
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid "This fine dust glows with a growing intensity"
msgstr "粉が放つ光はどんどん強くなっていく。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid "obfuscating aura"
msgid_plural "obfuscating auras"
msgstr[0] "オーラ(幻惑)"

#. ~ Description for obfuscating aura
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid ""
"An all-encompassing, invisible layer of magic distorts light around your "
"body.  Allows you to dodge two extra attacks in a given turn."
msgstr "全身を覆う目に見えない魔法のオーラが周囲の光を歪める。1ターンにつき最大2回の追加回避を可能にする。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid "acid resistance aura"
msgid_plural "acid resistance auras"
msgstr[0] "オーラ(耐酸)"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'acid resistance aura'}
#. ~ Description for greater acid resistance aura
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid "An all-encompassing, invisible layer of protection against acid."
msgstr "酸に対する耐性を付与する透明な保護膜だ。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid "greater acid resistance aura"
msgid_plural "greater acid resistance auras"
msgstr[0] "オーラ(強耐酸)"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid "frost armor"
msgid_plural "frost armor"
msgstr[0] "氷の鎧"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'frost armor'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid "A thin layer of magical ice, covering the entire body."
msgstr "魔法の氷で作られた薄い層が全身を覆う。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid "stoneskin coating"
msgid_plural "stoneskin coating"
msgstr[0] "石肌の衣"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'stoneskin coating'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid ""
"A thin layer of shifting, almost fluid living rock, covering the entire "
"body."
msgstr "蠢き、ほとんど流体化した生きた岩石の薄い層が、全身を覆う。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid "overcharge burn"
msgid_plural "overcharge burns"
msgstr[0] "過充電火傷"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'overcharge burn'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid "Ouch, this really smarts!  It'll go away soon, maybe?"
msgstr "アチッ、酷い痛みだ！ すぐに治まる、多分な？"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid "aura of protection"
msgid_plural "auras of protection"
msgstr[0] "防御のオーラ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'aura of protection', 'str_pl': 'auras of
#. protection'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid ""
"An all-encompassing, invisible layer of magical aura that protects you from "
"the environment."
msgstr "全身を覆う目に見えない魔法のオーラが、有害な環境から保護する。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Flamesword'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid ""
"This wooden sword is ablaze!  It seems to be safe-ish to hold, but will burn"
" up soon."
msgstr "この木製の剣は燃え盛っている！ 持っても安全そうだが、すぐに燃え尽きてしまうだろう。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid "decaying boneclub"
msgid_plural "decaying boneclubs"
msgstr[0] "デケイイング・ボーンクラブ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'decaying boneclub'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid ""
"A pulsating club made of bone, stained with an ever-moving blood coating "
"eager to absorb the living."
msgstr "骨で作られ、脈打つ棍棒。生者を吸収したがる、絶えず動く血のコーティングで染まっている。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid "windrunning aura"
msgid_plural "windrunning auras"
msgstr[0] "ウィンドランニング・オーラ"

#. ~ Description for windrunning aura
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid "The wind at your back helping to ease your travel."
msgstr "背中を押し、移動を楽にする風。"

#. ~ Description for Holy Blade
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/ethereal_items.json
msgid ""
"A broadsword made out of concentrated magical light and glowing with holy "
"power.  Let your blade cleave through these unholy monsters!"
msgstr "濃縮された魔法の光から作られ、聖なる力で輝くブロードソード。刃で不浄なモンスターを切り裂け！"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'dragon blood'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/fuel.json
msgid ""
"Blood of a dragon, it radiates warmth and looking at it you see moving "
"patterns form and disappear in it as if looking at an actual fire."
msgstr "ドラゴンの血。熱を放射し、見つめると、本物の火のように動く模様がその中に現れては消える。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'mana infused blood', 'str_pl':
#. 'mana_infused_blood'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/fuel.json
msgid ""
"Blood that is filled to the brim with arcane energy.  It releases a faint "
"blue glow."
msgstr "溢れんばかりな魔術的エネルギーで満たされた血液。かすかな青い光を放つ。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/guns.json
msgid "Bulette .45 ACP"
msgid_plural "Bulette .45 ACPs"
msgstr[0] "ブーレット .45 ACP"

#. ~ Description for Bulette .45 ACP
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/guns.json
msgid ""
"A .45 ACP round with what looks like a small bulette pearl as the "
"projectile.  While the round doesn't seem much better than a standard FMJ "
"round at the moment, you get the feeling that it's hiding some special "
"properties deep down."
msgstr ""
".45 ACP 弾で、弾頭が小さなブーレットの真珠のように見える。この弾薬は現時点では標準的な FMJ "
"弾と大差ないように見えるが、奥底に特別な特性を秘めているような予感がする。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/guns.json
msgid "Bulette .357 Magnum"
msgid_plural "Bulette .357 Magnums"
msgstr[0] "ブーレット .357 マグナム"

#. ~ Description for Bulette .357 Magnum
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/guns.json
msgid ""
"A .357 Magnum round with what looks like a small bulette pearl as the "
"projectile.  While the round doesn't seem much better than a standard FMJ "
"round at the moment, you get the feeling that it's hiding some special "
"properties deep down.  Some of this specialness is already displayed with "
"the fact that it can even be used in guns that only take .38 special "
"otherwise."
msgstr ""
".357 マグナム弾で、弾頭が小さなブーレットの真珠のように見える。この弾薬は現時点では標準的な FMJ "
"弾と大差ないように見えるが、奥底に特別な特性を秘めているような予感がする。この特殊性の一部は、通常 .38 "
"スペシャルしか使用できない銃でも使用可能なという事実によって既に示されている。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/guns.json
msgid "Bulette .40 S&W"
msgid_plural "Bulette .40 S&Ws"
msgstr[0] ".40 S&W 魔法弾"

#. ~ Description for Bulette .40 S&W
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/guns.json
msgid ""
"A .40 Smith and Wesson round with what looks like a small bulette pearl as "
"the projectile.  While the round doesn't seem much better than a standard "
"FMJ round at the moment, you get the feeling that it's hiding some special "
"properties deep down."
msgstr ""
".40 スミス＆ウェッソン弾で、弾頭が小さなブーレットの真珠のように見える。この弾薬は現時点では標準的な FMJ "
"弾と大差ないように見えるが、奥底に特別な特性を秘めているような予感がする。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/guns.json
msgid "Bulette .45 ACP Enhanced"
msgid_plural "Bulette .45 ACP Enhanceds"
msgstr[0] "ビュレット .45 ACP 強化型"

#. ~ Description for Bulette .45 ACP Enhanced
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/guns.json
msgid ""
"A .45 ACP round with what looks like a small bulette pearl as the "
"projectile.  The essence of Earth infused into the bullet allows it to "
"crumple armor with ease"
msgstr ""
".45 ACP 弾で、弾頭が小さなブーレットの真珠のように見える。弾丸に注入された大地のエッセンスにより、装甲を容易に崩壊させることができる。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/guns.json
msgid "Bulette .357 Magnum Enhanced"
msgid_plural "Bulette .357 Magnum Enhanceds"
msgstr[0] "ビュレット .357 マグナム 強化型"

#. ~ Description for Bulette .357 Magnum Enhanced
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/guns.json
msgid ""
"A .357 Magnum round with what looks like a small bulette pearl as the "
"projectile.  The Air energy infused into it allows it to act as practically "
"a pocket-sniper."
msgstr ""
".357 マグナム弾で、弾頭が小さなブーレットの真珠のように見える。注入された空気のエネルギーにより、実質的にポケット・スナイパーとして機能する。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/guns.json
msgid "Bulette .40 S&W Enhanced"
msgid_plural "Bulette .40 S&W Enhanceds"
msgstr[0] "ビュレット .40 S&W 強化型"

#. ~ Description for Bulette .40 S&W Enhanced
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/guns.json
msgid ""
"A .40 Smith and Wesson round with what looks like a small bulette pearl as "
"the projectile.  The Fire imbued into it has made it quite the spicy round, "
"dealing large amounts of damage as well as having some incendiary "
"properties.  Not terribly good against armor though."
msgstr ""
".40 "
"スミス＆ウェッソン弾で、弾頭が小さなブーレットの真珠のように見える。これに込められた炎によって、非常に刺激的な弾薬となり、多大なダメージを与えると同時に、焼夷性を持つ。ただし、装甲に対してはあまり効果的ではない。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/mana_crystals.json
msgid "crystallized mana"
msgid_plural "crystallized mana"
msgstr[0] "マナ結晶"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'crystallized mana'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/mana_crystals.json
msgid ""
"Some crystallized mana.  This can be reloaded into rechargable mana "
"crystals, but can never be unloaded."
msgstr "結晶化したマナ。マナクリスタルに充填できるが、一度充填すると元に戻せない。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/mana_crystals.json
msgid "small mana crystal"
msgid_plural "small mana crystals"
msgstr[0] "小型マナクリスタル"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'small mana crystal'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/mana_crystals.json
msgid ""
"This is a small mana crystal specifically designed to be attached to wand "
"tips."
msgstr "杖の先端に取り付けられるよう特別に設計された小型マナクリスタル。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/martial_manuals.json
msgid "A Beginner's Guide to Adventuring"
msgid_plural "copies of A Beginner's Guide to Adventuring"
msgstr[0] "冒険者のための入門書"

#. ~ Description for {'str': "A Beginner's Guide to Adventuring", 'str_pl':
#. "copies of A Beginner's Guide to Adventuring"}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/martial_manuals.json
msgid ""
"This looks like a fairly standard beginner HEMA manual, but some of the "
"points in particular sound a bit more like fantasy than reality."
msgstr "これはごく標準的な初心者向けの HEMA マニュアルのように見えるが、特にいくつかの記述は現実というよりファンタジーのように聞こえる。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/martial_manuals.json
msgid "A Guide to Common Adventuring Remedies"
msgid_plural "copies of A Guide to Common Adventuring Remedies"
msgstr[0] "冒険者のための治療薬ガイド"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'A Guide to Common Adventuring Remedies',
#. 'str_pl': 'copies of A Guide to Common Adventuring Remedies'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/martial_manuals.json
msgid ""
"This book looks like a fairly standard historical foraging or herbal "
"remedies guide, but the claims it makes are simply outlandish!"
msgstr "この本はごく標準的な歴史的な採集またはハーブ療法のガイドのように見えるが、記載されている主張はとんでもないものばかりだ！"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/martial_manuals.json
msgid "The Guide to Natural Adventuring Tools"
msgid_plural "copies of The Guide to Natural Adventuring Tools"
msgstr[0] "自然の冒険道具ガイド"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'The Guide to Natural Adventuring Tools',
#. 'str_pl': 'copies of The Guide to Natural Adventuring Tools'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/martial_manuals.json
msgid ""
"A clever little book that tells you some neat tricks using the natural "
"environment."
msgstr "自然環境を利用したいくつかの気の利いた技を教えてくれる、賢い小さな本。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/martial_manuals.json
msgid "Studying the Blade"
msgid_plural "copies of Studying the Blade"
msgstr[0] "『今日から始める刀修行』"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Studying the Blade', 'str_pl': 'copies of
#. Studying the Blade'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/martial_manuals.json
msgid ""
"Interspersed with weeaboo stories that would make a 5chan board "
"sarcastically clap, you find some surprisingly detailed notes on a few "
"specific techniques. But there's no chance they work... right?"
msgstr ""
"5ちゃん民が皮肉で拍手しそうな痛々しい中二ストーリーが随所に挟まれているが、その合間には妙に詳しい、いくつかの技法に関するメモが残されている。……とはいえ、本当に使えるわけがないよな？　な？"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/martial_manuals.json
msgid "Swiftly Slashing"
msgid_plural "copies of Swiftly Slashing"
msgstr[0] "『一閃の哲学』"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Swiftly Slashing', 'str_pl': 'copies of Swiftly
#. Slashing'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/martial_manuals.json
msgid ""
"A collection of haikus detailing the importance of swiftness when wielding a"
" blade, as well as how to apply the philosophy more generally. Just as the "
"descriptions of the techniques are concise, so must your strikes be."
msgstr ""
"刃を振るう際に求められる迅さの重要性、そしてその哲学をより広く日常へ応用する術を、俳句の形で綴った一冊。技法の記述が簡潔であるように、あなたの一撃もまた簡潔でなければならない。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/martial_manuals.json
msgid "Strong like Steel"
msgid_plural "copies of Strong like Steel"
msgstr[0] "『鋼のごとき強さ』"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Strong like Steel', 'str_pl': 'copies of Strong
#. like Steel'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/martial_manuals.json
msgid ""
"A historical text on the importance of the swordsman being just as strong "
"and sturdy as his blade, complete with illustrations and proverbs."
msgstr "剣士は己の刃と同じく強く、そして頑丈であらねばならない──その重要性を説いた歴史文書。挿絵や格言も添えられている。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/martial_notes.json
msgid "Martial Note"
msgid_plural "Martial Notes"
msgstr[0] "格闘術書"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/martial_notes.json
msgid "Note on Whirlwind Blade"
msgid_plural "Notes on Whirlwind Blade"
msgstr[0] "『ホワール・ウィンド・ブレード』の心得書"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Note on Whirlwind Blade', 'str_pl': 'Notes on
#. Whirlwind Blade'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/martial_notes.json
msgid ""
"Sometimes, you have to spin to win! Those enemies stand no chance with your "
"blade!"
msgstr "時には、勝つために回る必要がある！ あなたの刃の前ではあいつらに勝ち目はない！"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/martial_notes.json
msgid "Note on Sprint"
msgid_plural "Notes on Sprint"
msgstr[0] "『スプリント』の心得書"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Note on Sprint', 'str_pl': 'Notes on Sprint'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/martial_notes.json
msgid ""
"This'll give those jerks on your old highschool track team a run for their "
"money!"
msgstr "これなら昔の高校の陸上部にいた嫌な奴らをギャフンと言わせられる！"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/martial_notes.json
msgid "Note on Adventurer's Remedy"
msgid_plural "Notes on Adventurer's Remedy"
msgstr[0] "『冒険者の治療薬』の心得書"

#. ~ Description for {'str': "Note on Adventurer's Remedy", 'str_pl': "Notes
#. on Adventurer's Remedy"}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/martial_notes.json
msgid ""
"Inevitably, every adventurer will get in a sticky situation with a bad cut "
"or break at least once in their career. This'll help put you on the mend and"
" get back to adventuring!"
msgstr ""
"避けられないことだが、どんな冒険者もキャリアの中で一度はひどい切り傷や骨折といった厄介な状況に陥るだろう。これは回復を助け、冒険に戻るための手助けとなる！"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/martial_notes.json
msgid "Note on Swift Strike"
msgid_plural "Notes on Swift Strike"
msgstr[0] "『スィフト・ストライク』の心得書"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Note on Swift Strike', 'str_pl': 'Notes on Swift
#. Strike'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/martial_notes.json
msgid ""
"It may not be the fastest strike out there, but it'll certainly do against "
"the standard adventuring fare."
msgstr "世にある中でも最速の攻撃ではないかもしれないが、標準的な冒険の敵に対しては間違いなく通用するだろう。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/martial_notes.json
msgid "Note on Pocket Sand"
msgid_plural "Notes on Pocket Sand"
msgstr[0] "『ポケット・スタンド』の心得書"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Note on Pocket Sand', 'str_pl': 'Notes on Pocket
#. Sand'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/martial_notes.json
msgid ""
"You think you saw this in a video of some kind once. It's certainly worth a "
"try, in this world."
msgstr "以前、何らかの動画でこれを見た気がする。この世界では間違いなく試す価値がある。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/martial_notes.json
msgid "Note on Adventurer's Cure"
msgid_plural "Notes on Adventurer's Cure"
msgstr[0] "『冒険者の解毒薬』の心得書"

#. ~ Description for {'str': "Note on Adventurer's Cure", 'str_pl': "Notes on
#. Adventurer's Cure"}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/martial_notes.json
msgid ""
"A must-have for any adventurers with an allergy to bee stings and similar "
"natural poisons."
msgstr "蜂に刺された時や同様の自然毒にアレルギーを持つあらゆる冒険者にとって必携の品。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/martial_notes.json
msgid "Note on Survivalist's Wooden Javelins"
msgid_plural "Notes on Survivalist's Wooden Javelins"
msgstr[0] "『サバイバリストの木製ジャベリン』の心得書"

#. ~ Description for {'str': "Note on Survivalist's Wooden Javelins",
#. 'str_pl': "Notes on Survivalist's Wooden Javelins"}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/martial_notes.json
msgid ""
"For those averse to bowery, a good set of javelins is the next-best thing. "
"Fortunately, adventurers devised ways to quickly make a pair serviceable for"
" their travels."
msgstr "弓を好まない者にとって、上質なジャベリンは次に最善の策となる。幸いにも、冒険者たちは旅で役に立つ一対を素早く作る方法を考案した。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/martial_notes.json
msgid "Note on Adventurer's Relief"
msgid_plural "Notes on Adventurer's Relief"
msgstr[0] "『冒険者の鎮痛剤』の心得書"

#. ~ Description for {'str': "Note on Adventurer's Relief", 'str_pl': "Notes
#. on Adventurer's Relief"}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/martial_notes.json
msgid ""
"Adventuring tends to result in a good amount of small cuts and bruises that "
"might not be life-threatening, but boy do they hurt like hell!"
msgstr "冒険をすれば、命に関わるほどではないが、とてつもなく痛い小さな切り傷や打撲がたくさんできるものだ！"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/martial_notes.json
msgid "Note on Sparrow's Strike"
msgid_plural "Notes on Sparrow's Strike"
msgstr[0] "『スパロー・ストライク』の心得書"

#. ~ Description for {'str': "Note on Sparrow's Strike", 'str_pl': "Notes on
#. Sparrow's Strike"}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/martial_notes.json
msgid "You must strike like a sparrow and attack before your enemy may react"
msgstr "スズメのように素早く打ち込み、敵が反応するより先に攻撃しなければならない。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/martial_notes.json
msgid "Note on Treechopping Cut"
msgid_plural "Notes on Treechopping Cut"
msgstr[0] "『ツリーチョッピング・カット』の心得書"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Note on Treechopping Cut', 'str_pl': 'Notes on
#. Treechopping Cut'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/martial_notes.json
msgid "Ever wanted to chop down a tree in a single strike? Now you can!"
msgstr "一撃で木を倒してみたいと思ったことはあるか？　今ならできる！"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/martial_notes.json
msgid "Note on Hornet's Stinger"
msgid_plural "Notes on Hornet's Stinger"
msgstr[0] "『ホーネット・スティンガー』の心得書"

#. ~ Description for {'str': "Note on Hornet's Stinger", 'str_pl': "Notes on
#. Hornet's Stinger"}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/martial_notes.json
msgid ""
"Much like a hornet's stinger stabs right through your skin, you must stab "
"right through your enemies."
msgstr "スズメバチの針が皮膚を突き刺すように、敵も貫くように突き刺さなければならない。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/martial_notes.json
msgid "Note on Traveling Strike"
msgid_plural "Notes on Traveling Strike"
msgstr[0] "『トラベリング・ストライク』の心得書"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Note on Traveling Strike', 'str_pl': 'Notes on
#. Traveling Strike'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/martial_notes.json
msgid ""
"A technique for when you're on the move and you don't want to stop in place "
"and cut your enemy down"
msgstr "移動中でも立ち止まらずに敵を斬り伏せるための技法。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/martial_notes.json
msgid "Note on Execution Flurry"
msgid_plural "Notes on Execution Flurry"
msgstr[0] "『エグゼキューション・フラーリー』の心得書"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Note on Execution Flurry', 'str_pl': 'Notes on
#. Execution Flurry'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/martial_notes.json
msgid ""
"You are a storm that is approaching, preparing to devastate your enemies."
msgstr "おまえは迫り来る嵐そのものだ。敵を破壊し尽くすために力を収束させている。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/martial_notes.json
msgid "Note on Iaido"
msgid_plural "Notes on Iaido"
msgstr[0] "『ライドー』の心得書"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Note on Iaido', 'str_pl': 'Notes on Iaido'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/martial_notes.json
msgid ""
"Attacking your enemy in the same breath that you draw your sword is a recipe"
" for efficient combat."
msgstr "剣を抜くと同時に敵へ攻撃を仕掛ける、これこそが効率的な戦闘の極意だ。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/martial_notes.json
msgid "Note on Blademaster's Repose"
msgid_plural "Notes on Blademaster's Repose"
msgstr[0] "『ブレードマスター・リポーズ』の心得書"

#. ~ Description for {'str': "Note on Blademaster's Repose", 'str_pl': "Notes
#. on Blademaster's Repose"}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/martial_notes.json
msgid ""
"When your reflexes and your blade are what stands between you and death, you"
" must make sure that both are razor-sharp."
msgstr "反射神経と刃だけが生死を分けるなら、そのどちらも常に研ぎ澄ませておかなければならない。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/materials.json
msgid "raw owlbear pelt"
msgid_plural "raw owlbear pelts"
msgstr[0] "未加工のオウルベアの毛皮"

#. ~ Description for raw owlbear pelt
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/materials.json
msgid ""
"A carefully folded raw skin harvested from an owlbear.  It still has the fur"
" attached.  You can cure it for storage and tanning, or eat it if you're "
"desperate enough."
msgstr ""
"アウルベアから採取された、注意深く折りたたまれた生の皮。毛皮がまだ付いている。保存やなめしのために加工することも、絶望的な状況であれば食べることもできる。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/materials.json
msgid "cured owlbear pelt"
msgid_plural "cured owlbear pelts"
msgstr[0] "鞣されたオウルベアの毛皮"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'cured owlbear pelt'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/materials.json
msgid ""
"A rolled up owlbear hide which has been scraped of extraneous hair and flesh"
" and treated to prevent decay.  It could be tanned and transformed into "
"usable fur pelts."
msgstr "余分な毛や肉が削ぎ落とされ、腐敗を防ぐために処理された、丸められたアウルベアの皮。なめして、使用可能な毛皮に変えることができる。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/materials.json
msgid "owlbear fur pelt"
msgid_plural "owlbear fur pelts"
msgstr[0] "オウルベアの毛皮"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'owlbear fur pelt'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/materials.json
msgid ""
"A small bolt of fur from an owlbear.  Can be used for VERY warm clothing."
msgstr "アウルベアから取れた小さな毛皮の束。非常に暖かい衣類に使用できる。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/materials.json
msgid "dragon bone"
msgid_plural "dragon bones"
msgstr[0] "竜骨"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'dragon bone'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/materials.json
msgid ""
"A bone from a dragon!  Even on its own, these bones make an excellent "
"material for weapons.  However, something tells you that the bones hide more"
" secrets than just that."
msgstr "ドラゴンの骨！ これだけでも武器にとって素晴らしい素材になる。しかし、この骨はそれ以上の秘密を隠していると何かが語りかける。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/materials.json
msgid "dragon bone shard"
msgid_plural "dragon bone shards"
msgstr[0] "竜骨の破片"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'dragon bone shard'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/materials.json
msgid "A small shard of dragon bone, shaped almost like a shard of porcelain."
msgstr "小さなドラゴンボーンの破片で、まるで磁器の破片のように形作られている。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/materials.json
msgid "bulette plate"
msgid_plural "bulette plates"
msgstr[0] "ブレイプレート"

#. ~ Description for bulette plate
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/materials.json
msgid ""
"The great plates from behind a bulette's head have always been prized for "
"use in shield and armor making."
msgstr "ブーレットの頭部後方にある巨大な装甲板は、盾や鎧の製作に使用する素材として珍重されてきた。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/materials.json
msgid "chunk of demon chitin"
msgid_plural "chunks of demon chitin"
msgstr[0] "デーモンキチンの塊"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'chunk of demon chitin', 'str_pl': 'chunks of
#. demon chitin'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/materials.json
msgid ""
"A piece of demon spider exoskeleton.  It is light and very durable, and "
"probably has some magical properties."
msgstr "デーモンスパイダーの外骨格の一部。軽くて非常に耐久性が高く、恐らくは魔法に関する特性を持つ。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/materials.json
msgid "demon chitin plate"
msgid_plural "demon chitin plates"
msgstr[0] "デーモンキチンプレート"

#. ~ Description for demon chitin plate
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/materials.json
msgid ""
"A large piece of demon spider exoskeleton, painstakingly cut from the corpse"
" of an adult demon spider.  A plate of this size can be used to create armor"
" plating."
msgstr "成体のデーモンスパイダーの死体から苦労して切り出された、大きな外骨格の一部。 このサイズのプレートは、装甲板の作成に使用可能だ。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/materials.json
msgid "lump of orichalcum"
msgid_plural "lumps of orichalcum"
msgstr[0] "オリハルコン塊"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'lump of orichalcum', 'str_pl': 'lumps of
#. orichalcum'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/materials.json
msgid ""
"A lump of raw orichalcum.  Needs to be reformed into an ingot to be useful."
msgstr "未加工のオリハルコンの塊。 有用な素材とするには、まずインゴットに再成形する必要がある。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/materials.json
msgid "sliver of orichalcum"
msgid_plural "slivers of orichalcum"
msgstr[0] "オリハルコン片"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'sliver of orichalcum', 'str_pl': 'slivers of
#. orichalcum'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/materials.json
msgid ""
"A sliver of orichalcum broken from a larger piece.  Needs to be reformed "
"into an ingot to be useful."
msgstr "大きな塊から割れ落ちたオリハルコンの破片。 有用な素材とするには、まずインゴットに再成形する必要がある。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/materials.json
msgid "orichalcum ingot"
msgid_plural "orichalcum ingots"
msgstr[0] "オリハルコンインゴット"

#. ~ Description for orichalcum ingot
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/materials.json
msgid ""
"An ingot of orichalcum.  About 3 cm by 7 cm by 12 cm in size, ready to be "
"used for various blacksmithing tasks."
msgstr "オリハルコンのインゴット。サイズは約3cm×7cm×12cmで、様々な鍛冶作業に使用可能だ。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/materials.json
msgid "liquid mercury"
msgid_plural "liquid mercury"
msgstr[0] "水銀"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'liquid mercury'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/materials.json
msgid "Elemental liquid mercury.  Known for its use in thermometers."
msgstr "元素の水銀の液体。温度計に使用されることで知られる。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/materials.json
msgid "lump of mithril"
msgid_plural "lumps of mithril"
msgstr[0] "ミスリルの塊"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'lump of mithril', 'str_pl': 'lumps of mithril'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/materials.json
msgid ""
"A lump of raw mithril.  Needs to be reformed into an ingot to be useful."
msgstr "未加工のミスリルの塊。有用にするにはインゴットに再成形する必要がある。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/materials.json
msgid "mithril ingot"
msgid_plural "mithril ingots"
msgstr[0] "ミスリルインゴット"

#. ~ Description for mithril ingot
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/materials.json
msgid ""
"An ingot of mithril.  About 3cm by 7cm by 12cm in size, ready to be used for"
" various blacksmithing tasks."
msgstr "ミスリルのインゴット。サイズは約 3cm × 7cm × 12cm で、様々な鍛冶作業にすぐに使用できる。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/melee.json
msgid "Mjölnir"
msgid_plural "Mjölnirs"
msgstr[0] "ミョルニル"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Mjölnir'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/melee.json
msgid ""
"Mjölnir, the legendary hammer of Thor.  It is rumored to be able to level "
"mountains with a single blow.  You feel the power of Asgard coursing through"
" the hammer."
msgstr "雷神トールの伝説的な戦鎚、ミョルニール。 一振りで山を平らにできると噂されている。鎚を通してアスガルドの力が脈打つのを感じる。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/melee.json
msgid "Gungnir"
msgid_plural "Gungnirs"
msgstr[0] "グングニル"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Gungnir'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/melee.json
msgid ""
"Gungnir, the spear of Odin.  It is rumored to be the perfect spear, "
"perfectly hitting any target regardless of the wielder's strength or skill."
"  If feels like Odin's protecting you."
msgstr ""
"オーディンの槍、グングニル。 装備者の力や技量に関係なく、どのような標的にも完璧に命中する、完璧な槍だと噂される。オーディンの加護が感じられる。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/melee.json
msgid "Gram"
msgid_plural "Grams"
msgstr[0] "グラム"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Gram'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/melee.json
msgid ""
"Gram, the sword of Sigurd.  It is rumored to be the sword that slayed the "
"legendary dragon, Fafnir.  Once said to have cleaved Regin's anvil in half, "
"the edge is impeccable."
msgstr ""
"シグルズの剣、グラム。 "
"伝説のドラゴン、ファフニールを討ち取った剣だと噂される。かつてレギンの金床を真っ二つに両断したと言われる通り、その刃は非の打ち所がない。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/melee.json
msgid "Laevateinn"
msgid_plural "Laevateinns"
msgstr[0] "レーヴァテイン"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Laevateinn'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/melee.json
msgid ""
"Laevateinn, the staff of Loki.  Said to have been plucked from the gates of "
"Hel by Loki.  Imbued with a mysterious magic, the magic of the trickster god"
" himself."
msgstr "ロキの杖、レーヴァテイン。 ロキ自身が死の国の門から引き抜いたと言われる。悪戯の神が持つ神秘的な魔力が、この杖に染み込んでいる。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/melee.json
msgid "orichalcum combat knife"
msgid_plural "orichalcum combat knives"
msgstr[0] "コンバットナイフ(オリハルコン)"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'orichalcum combat knife', 'str_pl': 'orichalcum
#. combat knives'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/melee.json
msgid ""
"A variant of the combat knife that is made of orichalcum instead of steel.  "
"Sharper and easier to maintain than steel while just as dense, this knife "
"also has a thinner blade, which shaves off some weight."
msgstr ""
"鋼鉄の代わりにオリハルコンで作られたコンバットナイフの亜種。 "
"鋼鉄と同じ密度でありながら、より鋭く手入れが容易だ。また、刃が薄いため、重量も軽減されている。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/melee.json
msgid "orichalcum longsword"
msgid_plural "orichalcum longswords"
msgstr[0] "ロングソード(オリハルコン)"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'orichalcum longsword'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/melee.json
msgid ""
"A variant of the longsword that is made of orichalcum instead of steel.  "
"Sharper and easier to maintain than steel while just as dense, this "
"longsword also has a thinner blade, which shaves off some weight."
msgstr ""
"鋼鉄の代わりにオリハルコンで作られたロングソードの亜種。 鋼鉄と同じ密度でありながら、より鋭く手入れが容易だ。また、刃が薄いため、重量も軽減されている。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/melee.json
msgid "orichalcum fire axe"
msgid_plural "orichalcum fire axes"
msgstr[0] "消火斧(オリハルコン)"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'orichalcum fire axe'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/melee.json
msgid ""
"A fire axe made with orichalcum instead of steel.  This allows the axe to be"
" just as effective as its steel counterpart at chopping, with less weight to"
" tire the arms."
msgstr "鋼鉄の代わりにオリハルコンで作られた消防斧。 鋼鉄製と同じ高い切断効果を持ちながら、軽量化により腕への負担を軽減する。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/melee.json
msgid "dragonbone longsword"
msgid_plural "dragonbone longswords"
msgstr[0] "竜骨のロングソード"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'dragonbone longsword'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/melee.json
msgid ""
"A variant of the longsword that is made of dragonbone.  This makes for a "
"very powerful blade without sacrificing durability.  Even better than "
"orichalcum, and you can sense that this isn't even its final form."
msgstr ""
"竜の骨で作られたロングソードの亜種。 "
"耐久性を犠牲にすることなく、非常に強力な刃となる。オリハルコンよりも優れており、これが最終形態ではないことを感じ取れる。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/melee.json
msgid "dragonbone battleaxe"
msgid_plural "dragonbone battleaxes"
msgstr[0] "竜骨のバトルアックス"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'dragonbone battleaxe'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/melee.json
msgid ""
"A variant of the battleaxe that is made of dragonbone.  This makes for a "
"very powerful blade without sacrificing durability.  Even better than "
"orichalcum, and you can sense that this isn't even its final form."
msgstr ""
"竜の骨で作られた、バトルアックスの亜種。耐久性を犠牲にすることなく、非常に強力な刃となっている。オリハルコンよりもさらに優れており、これが最終形態ではないことを感じ取れる。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/melee.json
msgid "dragonbone qiang"
msgid_plural "dragonbone qiangs"
msgstr[0] "竜骨の槍"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'dragonbone qiang'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/melee.json
msgid ""
"A variant of the qiang that is made of dragonbone.  This makes for a very "
"powerful blade without sacrificing durability.  Even better than orichalcum,"
" and you can sense that this isn't even its final form."
msgstr ""
"竜の骨で作られた、槍の亜種。耐久性を犠牲にすることなく、非常に強力な刃となっている。オリハルコンよりもさらに優れており、これが最終形態ではないことを感じ取れる。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/melee.json
msgid "dragonbone tachi"
msgid_plural "dragonbone tachis"
msgstr[0] "竜骨の太刀"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'dragonbone tachi'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/melee.json
msgid ""
"A variant of the tachi that is made of dragonbone.  This makes for a very "
"powerful blade without sacrificing durability.  Even better than orichalcum,"
" and you can sense that this isn't even its final form."
msgstr ""
"竜の骨で作られた、太刀の亜種。耐久性を犠牲にすることなく、非常に強力な刃となっている。オリハルコンよりもさらに優れており、これが最終形態ではないことを感じ取れる。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/melee.json
msgid "Gaul Maraz"
msgid_plural "Gaul Marazs"
msgstr[0] "ガウル・マラーズ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Gaul Maraz'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/melee.json
msgid ""
"An impressively ornate golden warhammer with a sapphire and a ruby embedded "
"within.  The engraved words on it appear to be in some strange mix of "
"ancient French and German.  You can sense a faint magic aura being emitted "
"by it, and picking up the weapon gives you the distinct impression that "
"there's even more power within laying dormant.  If only you could harness "
"that power and awaken it once more…"
msgstr ""
"サファイアとルビーが埋め込まれた、見事な装飾が施された黄金のウォーハンマー。刻まれた文字は、古代フランス語とドイツ語が奇妙に混ざり合ったもののようだ。微かな魔法のオーラが放たれているのが感じられ、手に取ると、さらに大きな力が内部で眠っているというはっきりとした印象を受ける。もしその力を引き出し、再び目覚めさせることができれば…"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/melee.json
msgid "acid-infused dragonbone longsword"
msgid_plural "acid-infused dragonbone longswords"
msgstr[0] "酸を注入された竜骨のロングソード"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'acid-infused dragonbone longsword'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/melee.json
msgid ""
"A variant of the longsword that is made of dragonbone, now with the acidic "
"ire of a black dragon imbued within."
msgstr "竜の骨で作られたロングソードの亜種。 今や、ブラック・ドラゴンの酸性の怒りが内に宿っている。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/melee.json
msgid "acid-infused dragonbone battleaxe"
msgid_plural "acid-infused dragonbone battleaxes"
msgstr[0] "酸を注入された竜骨のバトルアックス"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'acid-infused dragonbone battleaxe'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/melee.json
msgid ""
"A variant of the battleaxe that is made of dragonbone, now with the acidic "
"ire of a black dragon imbued within."
msgstr "竜の骨で作られたバトルアックスの亜種。今は、ブラック・ドラゴンの酸性の怒りが内に込められている。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/melee.json
msgid "acid-infused dragonbone qiang"
msgid_plural "acid-infused dragonbone qiangs"
msgstr[0] "酸を注入された竜骨の槍"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'acid-infused dragonbone qiang'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/melee.json
msgid ""
"A variant of the qiang that is made of dragonbone, now with the acidic ire "
"of a black dragon imbued within."
msgstr "竜の骨で作られた槍の亜種。今は、ブラック・ドラゴンの酸性の怒りが内に込められている。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/melee.json
msgid "acid-infused dragonbone tachi"
msgid_plural "acid-infused dragonbone tachis"
msgstr[0] "酸を注入された竜骨の太刀"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'acid-infused dragonbone tachi'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/melee.json
msgid ""
"A variant of the tachi that is made of dragonbone, now with the acidic ire "
"of a black dragon imbued within."
msgstr "竜の骨で作られた太刀の亜種。今は、ブラック・ドラゴンの酸性の怒りが内に込められている。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/monster_weapons.json
msgid "greatclub"
msgid_plural "greatclubs"
msgstr[0] "グレートクラブ"

#. ~ Description for greatclub
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/monster_weapons.json
msgid ""
"A stout knotty club with a large knob at the top.  While it's very heavy, "
"it's a very effective weapon in the hands of a strong opponent."
msgstr "端に大きな持ち手が付いた、節くれだった頑丈な棍棒だ。非常に重いが、力の強い者が持てばとても効果的な武器になる。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/monster_weapons.json
msgid "wood trident"
msgid_plural "wood tridents"
msgstr[0] "木製トライデント"

#. ~ Description for wood trident
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/monster_weapons.json
msgid ""
"A wooden melee weapon with a hand-forged steel forked spearhead attached to "
"the end.  It can be used for stabbing opponents either in close-range or as "
"a thrown weapon, and in the right hands can also readily disarm opponents."
msgstr "先端に鍛造した鋼製のフォークを取り付けた、木製の武器だ。近接武器の他にも投擲して敵に突き刺すこともでき、上手く扱えば敵の武装解除もできる。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/monster_weapons.json
msgid "barbed javelin"
msgid_plural "barbed javelins"
msgstr[0] "棘付きジャベリン"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'barbed javelin'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/monster_weapons.json
msgid ""
"This weapon measures about 3 feet in length and is fletched like an arrow "
"for better accuracy.  The business end of the javelin has wicked-looking "
"barbs which could cause significant bleeding."
msgstr "投擲精度を高める矢羽がついた、長さ約90cmの武器だ。先端には邪悪な見た目の棘が複数付いており、命中すれば酷い出血を引き起こす。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/monster_weapons.json
msgid "Fake gun that fires barbed javelins."
msgstr "棘付きジャベリンを発射する疑似アイテムだ。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/mutagen.json
msgid "concentrated mana serum"
msgid_plural "concentrated mana serums"
msgstr[0] "濃縮マナポーション"

#. ~ Description for concentrated mana serum
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/mutagen.json
msgid ""
"A very concentrated form of mana potion.  You aren't quite sure of the "
"effects this will have…"
msgstr "マナポーションを極限まで濃縮した液体だ。摂取するとどのような効果を発揮するのか、よく分かっていない…"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/necromancy.json
msgid "zombie voodoo doll"
msgid_plural "zombie voodoo dolls"
msgstr[0] "ブードゥー人形(ゾンビ)"

#. ~ Description for zombie voodoo doll
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/necromancy.json
msgid ""
"A remarkably accurate effigy of an undead human, including pieces of bone "
"and organs.  Necromantic magic delays immediate rot, but it won't last "
"forever.  Piercing it with the attached needle could compel it to serve you."
msgstr ""
"骨や臓器を使って死んだ人間を非常に正確に再現した人形だ。 死霊術によって腐敗を遅らせているが、永久に保たれることはない。 "
"付属の針で刺すことで、人形にあなたへの奉仕を強制できる。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/necromancy.json
msgid "ossified voodoo doll"
msgid_plural "ossified voodoo dolls"
msgstr[0] "ブードゥー人形(骸骨ゾンビ)"

#. ~ Description for ossified voodoo doll
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/necromancy.json
msgid ""
"A remarkably accurate effigy of an undead human covered with bone, including"
" pieces of organs.  Necromantic magic delays immediate rot, but it won't "
"last forever.  Piercing it with the attached needle could compel it to serve"
" you."
msgstr ""
"骨で覆われ、臓器の断片も含む、驚くほど正確なアンデッド人間の人形。 死霊術が即座の腐敗を遅らせるが、永続することはない。 "
"付属の針で刺すことで、人形にあなたへの奉仕を強制できる。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/necromancy.json
msgid "cougar voodoo doll"
msgid_plural "cougar voodoo dolls"
msgstr[0] "ブードゥー人形(ゾンビピューマ)"

#. ~ Description for cougar voodoo doll
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/necromancy.json
msgid ""
"A remarkably accurate effigy of an undead cougar, complete with fur, bones, "
"and organs.  Necromantic magic delays immediate rot, but it won't last "
"forever.  Piercing it with the attached needle could compel it to serve you."
msgstr ""
"毛皮、骨、臓器を使い、アンデッドのピューマを驚くほど正確に再現した人形。 死霊術が即座の腐敗を遅らせるが、永続することはない。 "
"付属の針で刺すことで、人形にあなたへの奉仕を強制できる。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/obsolete.json
msgid "wand of fireballs"
msgid_plural "wands of fireballs"
msgstr[0] "ファイアボールの杖"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'wand of fireballs', 'str_pl': 'wands of
#. fireballs'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/obsolete.json
msgid ""
"A classic, this wand shoots fireballs without fail.  A more skilled "
"Kelvinist could cast them more efficiently, though."
msgstr "ファイアボールを失敗せずに撃てる、古典的な杖だ。熟練のケルビニストであれば、より効率的に呪文を詠唱できる。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/obsolete.json
msgid "wand of magic missiles"
msgid_plural "wands of magic missiles"
msgstr[0] "マジック・ミサイルの杖"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'wand of magic missiles', 'str_pl': 'wands of
#. magic missiles'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/obsolete.json
msgid ""
"A classic, this wand shoots magic missiles without fail.  A more skilled "
"Magus could cast them more efficiently, though."
msgstr "マジック・ミサイルを失敗せずに撃てる、古典的な杖だ。熟練のメイガスであれば、この呪文をより効率的に発動できる。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/obsolete.json
msgid "OBSOLETE! Blood Power Generator CBM"
msgid_plural "OBSOLETE! Blood Power Generator CBMs"
msgstr[0] "廃止済み！血液発電機CBM"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'OBSOLETE! Blood Power Generator CBM'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/obsolete.json
msgid "OBSOLETE ITEM!  Only exists for save integrity"
msgstr "廃止済みアイテム！セーブデータの整合性のためだけに存在する"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/potions.json
msgid "lesser mana potion"
msgid_plural "lesser mana potions"
msgstr[0] "下級マナポーション"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'lesser mana potion'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/potions.json
msgid ""
"You can't buy these, so you need to save them until the last boss!  "
"Actually, don't even use them there!"
msgstr "非売品だ。だから、ラスボスと戦う時まで取っておけ！実際は、最後まで使わずにクリアしてしまうのだろうがな！"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/potions.json
msgid "mana potion"
msgid_plural "mana potions"
msgstr[0] "中級マナポーション"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/potions.json
msgid "greater mana potion"
msgid_plural "greater mana potions"
msgstr[0] "上級マナポーション"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/potions.json
msgid "potion of Cat's Grace"
msgid_plural "potions of Cat's Grace"
msgstr[0] "ポーション(キャッツ・グレース)"

#. ~ Description for {'str': "potion of Cat's Grace", 'str_pl': "potions of
#. Cat's Grace"}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/potions.json
msgid ""
"This is a potion of Cat's Grace.  It will increase your dexterity for 10 "
"minutes."
msgstr "キャッツ・グレースのポーションだ。器用の値が10分間上昇する。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/potions.json
msgid "potion of Ogre's Strength"
msgid_plural "potions of Ogre's Strength"
msgstr[0] "ポーション(オーガズ・ストレングス)"

#. ~ Description for {'str': "potion of Ogre's Strength", 'str_pl': "potions
#. of Ogre's Strength"}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/potions.json
msgid ""
"This is a potion of Ogre's Strength.  It will increase your strength for 10 "
"minutes."
msgstr "オーガズ・ストレングスのポーションだ。筋力の値が10分間上昇する。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/potions.json
msgid "potion of Eagle's Sight"
msgid_plural "potions of Eagle's Sight"
msgstr[0] "ポーション(イーグルズ・サイト)"

#. ~ Description for {'str': "potion of Eagle's Sight", 'str_pl': "potions of
#. Eagle's Sight"}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/potions.json
msgid ""
"This is a potion of Eagle's Sight.  It will increase your perception for 10 "
"minutes."
msgstr "イーグルズ・サイトのポーションだ。感覚の値が10分間上昇する。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/potions.json
msgid "potion of Fox's Cunning"
msgid_plural "potions of Fox's Cunning"
msgstr[0] "ポーション(フォックセズ・カンニング)"

#. ~ Description for {'str': "potion of Fox's Cunning", 'str_pl': "potions of
#. Fox's Cunning"}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/potions.json
msgid ""
"This is a potion of Fox's Cunning.  It will increase your intelligence for "
"10 minutes."
msgstr "フォックセズ・カンニングのポーションだ。知力の値が10分間上昇する。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/potions.json
msgid "potion of Twisted Restoration"
msgid_plural "potions of Twisted Restoration"
msgstr[0] "ポーション(ツイステッド・レストレーション)"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'potion of Twisted Restoration', 'str_pl':
#. 'potions of Twisted Restoration'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/potions.json
msgid ""
"This foul-smelling liquid simulates undead regeneration by accelerating your"
" heart to dangerous levels.  Drinking this in danger or at critical "
"condition may be lethal."
msgstr ""
"悪臭が漂う液体だ。脈拍を危険なレベルまで加速させてアンデッドの自然治癒力を再現する。危険な状況や危機的な状態でこれを飲むと、致命的になる可能性がある。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/potions.json
msgid "potion of Improved Twisted Restoration"
msgid_plural "potions of Improved Twisted Restoration"
msgstr[0] "ポーション(ツイステッド・レストレーション改)"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'potion of Improved Twisted Restoration',
#. 'str_pl': 'potions of Improved Twisted Restoration'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/potions.json
msgid ""
"This foul-smelling liquid simulates undead regeneration by accelerating your"
" heart to dangerous levels.  Drinking this in danger or at critical "
"condition may be lethal.  Improved infusion techniques lessen the strain of "
"the process."
msgstr ""
"悪臭が漂う液体だ。脈拍を危険なレベルまで加速させてアンデッドの自然治癒力を再現する。危険な状況や危機的な状態でこれを飲むと、致命的になる可能性がある。煎じ方を改良したことで、摂取に伴う負担が軽減された。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/recipe_books.json
msgid "Black Dragons: Swamp Ruins"
msgid_plural "copies of Black Dragons: Swamp Ruins"
msgstr[0] "『ブラックドラゴン: 沼地の廃墟』"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Black Dragons: Swamp Ruins', 'str_pl': 'copies
#. of Black Dragons: Swamp Ruins'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/recipe_books.json
msgid ""
"This book details black dragons: The most evil of dragons, who live in ruins"
" generally in swamps.  Immune to acid and breathe acid.  The book also "
"details how to prepare its hide and craft various armors that make use of "
"some of its acid resistance."
msgstr ""
"ブラックドラゴンについて詳述された書物だ。ブラックドラゴンは最も邪悪な竜であり、一般的には沼地の廃墟に生息している。酸に完全耐性があり、口から酸を吐く。書物には、この竜の皮を加工する方法と、その耐酸性を活かした様々な防具の作り方も解説されている。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/recipe_books.json
msgid "A Beginner's Guide to Alchemy"
msgid_plural "copies of A Beginner's Guide to Alchemy"
msgstr[0] "『はじめての錬金術』"

#. ~ Description for {'str': "A Beginner's Guide to Alchemy", 'str_pl':
#. "copies of A Beginner's Guide to Alchemy"}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/recipe_books.json
msgid "A paperback tome for the art of liquid magic, alcohol not included."
msgstr "酒以外の液体を使った魔法の技術を解説したペーパーバック本だ。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/recipe_books.json
msgid "A Soulbinder's Guide to Necromancy"
msgid_plural "copies of A Soulbinder's Guide to Necromancy"
msgstr[0] "『ソウルバインダーの死霊術ガイド』"

#. ~ Description for {'str': "A Soulbinder's Guide to Necromancy", 'str_pl':
#. "copies of A Soulbinder's Guide to Necromancy"}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/recipe_books.json
msgid ""
"A paperback tome for the art of binding undead creatures' souls to dolls, "
"along with emulating their healing factor."
msgstr "アンデッドの魂を人形に縛り付け、その自然治癒力を模倣・再現する技術を解説した、大型のペーパーバック本だ。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/recipe_books.json
msgid "Magitek Illustrated"
msgid_plural "copies of Magitek Illustrated"
msgstr[0] "『図解魔科学』"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Magitek Illustrated', 'str_pl': 'copies of
#. Magitek Illustrated'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/recipe_books.json
msgid ""
"A paperback tome for the art of combining modern technology with magic.  "
"There is a disclaimer on the back: `Cannith Industries bears no "
"responsibility for malfunctions or accidents for any products mentioned "
"herein`."
msgstr ""
"現代科学と魔法を組み合わせた技術について解説したペーパーバック本です。裏表紙には免責事項が載っています。「Cannith "
"Industries社は、本書に記載されている製品に関する誤作動や事故について一切責任を負いません」"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/recipe_books.json
msgid "The Weapons of Asgard and Beyond"
msgid_plural "copies of The Weapons of Asgard and Beyond"
msgstr[0] "『アスガルドと冥府の武器』"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'The Weapons of Asgard and Beyond', 'str_pl':
#. 'copies of The Weapons of Asgard and Beyond'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/recipe_books.json
msgid ""
"An ornate book which appears to be written in Norse runes.  Based on the "
"detailed illustrations, it appears to contain information about crafting "
"numerous weapons used by various Gods."
msgstr "北欧のルーン文字のような書体で記された鮮やかな書物だ。詳細なイラストに基づくと、様々な神が使う多数の武器の作り方が解説されているようだ。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/recipe_books.json
msgid "Cooking with Poison"
msgid_plural "copies of Cooking with Poison"
msgstr[0] "『毒物調理法』"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Cooking with Poison', 'str_pl': 'copies of
#. Cooking with Poison'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/recipe_books.json
msgid ""
"A leatherbound book with an embossed cauldron on the cover.  Inside it "
"describes ways to purify food magically."
msgstr "表紙にエンボス加工された大釜の絵が載っている革装本だ。中には、不思議な力で食べ物を浄化する方法が記されている。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/recipe_books.json
msgid "Metals of Legend"
msgid_plural "copies of Metals of Legend"
msgstr[0] "『伝説の金属』"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Metals of Legend', 'str_pl': 'copies of Metals
#. of Legend'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/recipe_books.json
msgid ""
"A book with a brass coverplate.  It professes to teach one how to make "
"magical metals such as Orichalcum.  It is dry reading even for an alchemical"
" tome."
msgstr "オリハルコンなどの魔法の金属の作り方を教えると謳う、表紙が真鍮で覆われた本だ。錬金術に関する書物とはいえ、内容は退屈である。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/recipe_books.json
msgid "Protection from Magical Beasts"
msgid_plural "copies of Protection from Magical Beasts"
msgstr[0] "『魔獣からの防御』"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Protection from Magical Beasts', 'str_pl':
#. 'copies of Protection from Magical Beasts'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/recipe_books.json
msgid ""
"A leatherbound book with a picture of a shield holding back dragonfire on "
"the cover.  There are many ways to turn monster skins and hides into "
"protective equipment inside."
msgstr ""
"ドラゴンの吐く炎を押しとどめる盾の絵が表紙に描かれた、革装丁の本だ。中には、モンスターの皮革を加工して身体を保護する防具を作る様々な方法が掲載されている。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/recipe_books.json
msgid "Enchanter's Guidebook"
msgid_plural "copies of Enchanter's Guidebooks"
msgstr[0] "『魔術師の指南書』"

#. ~ Description for {'str': "Enchanter's Guidebook", 'str_pl': "copies of
#. Enchanter's Guidebooks"}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/recipe_books.json
msgid ""
"A hefty textbook on the theory and practice of magically strengthening "
"weapons and tools."
msgstr "武器や道具を魔法で強化する理論と実践について書かれた、分厚い教科書だ。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/recipe_books.json
msgid "Bulette Bullet Research"
msgid_plural "copies of Bulette Bullet Research"
msgstr[0] "『ブーレット弾の研究』"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Bulette Bullet Research', 'str_pl': 'copies of
#. Bulette Bullet Research'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/recipe_books.json
msgid ""
"A small set of research papers written on what looks to be parchment from "
"the 1800s regarding the creation of bulette-pearl bullets.  The papers go "
"over the theoretical creation of a satchel that would slowly produce bulette"
" ammo over time, and the author is listed as… Nikola Tesla?!?"
msgstr ""
"1800年代の羊皮紙のように見えるものに書かれた、ブーレット真珠弾の作成に関する小さな研究論文一式。これらの論文は、時間とともにブーレット弾薬をゆっくりと生成するサッチェルの理論的作成について論じており、著者はニコラ・テスラと記載されている！？"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/spell_scrolls.json
msgid "Spell Scroll"
msgid_plural "Spell Scrolls"
msgstr[0] "呪文書"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/spell_scrolls.json
msgid "Scroll of Crystallize Mana"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Crystallize Mana"
msgstr[0] "呪文書(クリスタライズ・マナ)"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Scroll of Crystallize Mana', 'str_pl': 'Scrolls
#. of Crystallize Mana'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/spell_scrolls.json
msgid ""
"A proper wizard is always prepared, crystallize your mana for the future!"
msgstr "真の魔法使いは準備を欠かさない。将来のためにマナを結晶化して保存せよ！"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/spell_scrolls.json
msgid "Scroll of Dark Sight"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Dark Sight"
msgstr[0] "呪文書(ダーク・サイト)"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Scroll of Dark Sight', 'str_pl': 'Scrolls of
#. Dark Sight'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/spell_scrolls.json
msgid ""
"The darkness holds no secrets for the arcane.  Adjust your sight to see in "
"perfect darkness!"
msgstr "秘儀の前では暗闇も秘密を隠せない。視界を調整し、完全な暗闇を見通せ！"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/spell_scrolls.json
msgid "Scroll of Invisibility"
msgid_plural "Scrolls of Invisibility"
msgstr[0] "呪文書(インビジビリティ)"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Scroll of Invisibility', 'str_pl': 'Scrolls of
#. Invisibility'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/spell_scrolls.json
msgid ""
"The light can not interact with you unless you want it to.  Become "
"invisible!"
msgstr "自分から望まない限り、全身が光を反射しなくなる。完全に透明だ！"

