msgid_plural "foldable orichalcum frames"
msgstr[0] "折畳フレーム(オリハルコン)"

#. ~ Description for foldable orichalcum frame
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/vehicle/frames.json
msgid ""
"A folding frame made of orichalcum pipes.  Not as light as aluminum, but "
"significantly sturdier."
msgstr "オリハルコン製パイプで作られた折り畳み式フレーム。アルミニウムほど軽くはないが、かなりの頑丈さを持つ。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/vehicle/frames.json
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/vehicleparts/frames.json
msgid "orichalcum frame"
msgid_plural "orichalcum frames"
msgstr[0] "フレーム(オリハルコン)"

#. ~ Description for orichalcum frame
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/vehicle/frames.json
msgid ""
"A frame made of orichalcum.  Significantly sturdier than steel, but also "
"much more expensive."
msgstr "オリハルコン製のフレーム。鋼鉄よりもはるかに頑丈だが、価格も桁違いに高い。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/items/vehicle/vehicle_parts.json
msgid "bulette plating"
msgstr "装甲板(ブレッド)"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/monsters/demon_spider.json
msgid "demon spider"
msgid_plural "demon spiders"
msgstr[0] "デーモンスパイダー"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/monsters/demon_spider.json
msgid "demon spiderling"
msgid_plural "demon spiderlings"
msgstr[0] "デーモンスパイダー(幼体)"

#. ~ Description for demon spiderling
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/monsters/demon_spider.json
msgid ""
"Despite it being the size of a small dog, you can tell this is a very young "
"spider.  Its red color is why you gave it this name; you have never seen "
"this creature before the Cataclysm.  It is quick, and its large fangs drip "
"with venom."
msgstr ""
"小型犬ほどのサイズだが、これが非常に若いクモだとわかる。その赤い体色から、お前がこの名前をつけたのだ。こんな化け物を、お前は大災厄以前には見たことがない。非常に素早く、大きな牙からは毒が滴っている。"

#. ~ Description for demon spider
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/monsters/demon_spider.json
msgid ""
"This spider is the size of a car.  Its huge compound eyes seem to be "
"infinite pools of blackness that seem to suck the light out of the air.  Its"
" maroon carapace is studded with wicked-looking spikes that drip with some "
"kind of viscious black liquid that sizzles when it touches the ground."
msgstr ""
"このクモは車ほどのサイズだ。その巨大な複眼は、大気中の光を吸い込むかのような、無限の闇の溜まりに見える。小豆色の甲羅には、凶悪な棘がいくつも生えており、そこから粘性の黒い液体が滴り落ち、地面に触れるたびにジュージューと音を立てる。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/monsters/demon_spider.json
msgid "demon spider queen"
msgid_plural "demon spider queens"
msgstr[0] "女王デーモンスパイダー"

#. ~ Description for demon spider queen
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/monsters/demon_spider.json
msgid ""
"This gigantic spider is the size of a moving van: you have no idea how it "
"manages to stay together, much less move with that bulk.  Its abdomen is "
"huge and swollen-looking, and an evil intelligence burns in its eyes even as"
" magic crackles around its chitinous barbs."
msgstr ""
"この巨大なクモは引越し用のバンほどのサイズがある。あの巨体でどうにか体を保ち、まして動けている理由など、皆目見当がつかない。腹部は大きく腫れ上がったように見え、キチン質の棘の周囲で魔力がパチパチと音を立てる中でも、その目には邪悪な知性が宿っている。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/monsters/dragon.json
msgid "dreadful presense"
msgstr "威圧感"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/monsters/dragon.json
msgid "frightful presense"
msgstr "強い威圧感"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/monsters/dragon.json
msgid "terrifying presense"
msgstr "圧倒的な威圧感"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/monsters/dragon.json
msgid "black dragon wyrmling"
msgid_plural "black dragon wyrmlings"
msgstr[0] "ブラックドラゴン(幼体)"

#. ~ Description for black dragon wyrmling
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/monsters/dragon.json
msgid ""
"This is a small black dragon, less than five years old.  Its scales are "
"glossy, and its horns barely peek out of its head.  Even from one so young, "
"you see the glint of sadism in its eyes."
msgstr ""
"生後5年にも満たない、小さな黒いドラゴンだ。鱗は艶があり、角はかろうじて頭から覗いている程度だ。これほど幼い個体からでさえ、その瞳には嗜虐姓のきらめきを見て取れる。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/monsters/dragon.json
msgid "young black dragon"
msgid_plural "young black dragons"
msgstr[0] "ブラックドラゴン(亜成体)"

#. ~ Description for young black dragon
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/monsters/dragon.json
msgid ""
"This black dragon appears to still be in the early stages of life.  Its eyes"
" have just started to sink in its sockets, and its curved, segmented horns "
"have just begun to darken at the tips.  You can tell just by looking at it, "
"this creature is evil to its very core.  Even though this dragon is not "
"fully grown, it is the size of a full-grown bull."
msgstr ""
"この黒いドラゴンは、まだ生命の初期段階にあるようだ。目は窪み始めたばかりで、湾曲し節くれだった角の先端も黒く染まり始めたばかりだ。見ただけでわかる。この生物は、その根源から極めて邪悪だ。完全に成長した成体ではないが、すでに成体の雄牛ほどのサイズがある。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/monsters/dragon.json
msgid "adult black dragon"
msgid_plural "adult black dragons"
msgstr[0] "ブラックドラゴン(成体)"

#. ~ Description for adult black dragon
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/monsters/dragon.json
msgid ""
"A black-scaled monstrosity with deep-set eye sockets glowing green with "
"evil.  Its face and skull appear skeletal, and acid drips from its dagger-"
"like jaws."
msgstr ""
"黒い鱗に覆われた怪物。深く窪んだ眼窩は邪悪な緑色に輝いている。その顔と頭蓋骨は骸骨のように骨張っており、短剣のような顎からは酸が滴っている。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/monsters/goblins.json
msgid "Goblin"
msgid_plural "Goblins"
msgstr[0] "ゴブリン"

#. ~ Description for Goblin
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/monsters/goblins.json
msgid ""
"A short, mischievous green humanoid covered in dirty, slightly-worn "
"clothing.  Brandishing a cudgel and with a certain grin on its face, you can"
" tell that it loves causing trouble and likely won't back down from a fight."
msgstr ""
"汚れて少々着古した服をまとった、背の低い、いたずら好きな緑色の人型生物。棍棒を振り回し、その表情にはある種の笑みが浮かんでおり、トラブルを起こすことを愛しており、戦いからおそらく引き下がらないことがわかる。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/monsters/goblins.json
msgid "Goblin Slinger"
msgid_plural "Goblin Slingers"
msgstr[0] "ゴブリンスリンガー"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Goblin Slinger'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/monsters/goblins.json
msgid ""
"A short green humanoid who slings rocks just about as well as it slings "
"insults.  They have quite a penchant for taunting, and they're dodgier in "
"more ways than one."
msgstr "罵倒を投げるのと同じくらい上手に石を投げる、背の低い緑色の人型生物。彼らはからかうことが非常に好きで、複数の意味でずる賢い。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/monsters/goblins.json
msgid "Goblin Chieftain"
msgid_plural "Goblin Chieftains"
msgstr[0] "ゴブリンの族長"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Goblin Chieftain'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/monsters/goblins.json
msgid ""
"An ugly bastard of a goblin who asserted his rule over the rest through "
"liberal application of violence and a little extra cunning.  He's much "
"tougher, and he brandishes a weapon that has faint tinges of magic."
msgstr ""
"暴力を惜しみなく行使し、少々の狡猾さを加えることで、他のゴブリンたちに支配を確立した、醜悪なゴブリン。彼は遥かに頑丈で、微かな魔法の気配がある武器を振りかざしている。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/monsters/golems.json
msgid "clay golem"
msgid_plural "clay golems"
msgstr[0] "クレイゴーレム"

#. ~ Description for clay golem
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/monsters/golems.json
msgid ""
"A large, humanoid golem made from clay.  Its proportions are off and it "
"seems fragile."
msgstr "粘土で作られた、巨大な人型ゴーレム。プロポーションが狂っており、ひどく脆そうだ。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/monsters/golems.json
msgid "plastic golem"
msgid_plural "plastic golems"
msgstr[0] "プラスチックゴーレム"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'plastic golem'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/monsters/golems.json
msgid ""
"Traditionally, making a golem is a months-long process involving hand tools "
"and precision craftsmanship.  A stone golem is as much a work of art as it "
"is a magical device.  The advent of 3D printing made it easy to get into the"
" golem-making hobby, and plastic golems have soared in popularity."
msgstr ""
"伝統的なゴーレム作成は、手工具と緻密な職人技を要する数ヶ月におよぶ工程だ。石のゴーレムは、魔法の装置であると同時に芸術作品でもある。しかし、3Dプリント技術の出現によってゴーレム作成は趣味として気軽に始められるようになり、プラスチック製ゴーレムの人気は急騰している。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/monsters/golems.json
msgid "stone golem"
msgid_plural "stone golems"
msgstr[0] "ストーンゴーレム"

#. ~ Description for stone golem
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/monsters/golems.json
msgid ""
"A large, humanoid golem made from stone.  Its fists look similar to rockets."
msgstr "石で作られた、巨大な人型ゴーレム。その拳はロケットに似た形をしている。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/monsters/golems.json
msgid "iron golem"
msgid_plural "iron golems"
msgstr[0] "アイアンゴーレム"

#. ~ Description for iron golem
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/monsters/golems.json
msgid ""
"A large, humanoid golem made from iron.  Some sort of noxious gas seems to "
"be seeping from its mouth."
msgstr "鉄で作られた、巨大な人型ゴーレム。口からは何らかの有毒ガスが染み出しているようだ。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/monsters/golems.json
msgid "fresh resin golem"
msgid_plural "fresh resin golems"
msgstr[0] "フレッシュ・レジン・ゴーレム"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'fresh resin golem'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/monsters/golems.json
msgid ""
"Traditionally, creating a golem is a long and arduous process, taking "
"several months for a golem so large as this one.  However, the advent of "
"modern materials has allowed for much simpler and quicker to make golems.  "
"This golem appears to somehow still be very fresh, almost as if it had only "
"been very recently poured, and it can likely recover from wounds rather "
"quickly"
msgstr ""
"伝統的に、ゴーレムの創造は長く困難なプロセスであり、これほど大きなゴーレムを作るには数ヶ月かかる。しかし、現代の素材の出現により、はるかに単純で迅速にゴーレムを作れるようになった。このゴーレムはどういうわけかまだ非常に新鮮で、まるでごく最近になって流し込まれたばかりのようで、傷からかなり素早く回復する可能性がある。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/monsters/golems.json
msgid "somewhat-cured resin golem"
msgid_plural "somewhat-cured resin golems"
msgstr[0] "部分硬化レジン・ゴーレム"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'somewhat-cured resin golem'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/monsters/golems.json
msgid ""
"Traditionally, creating a golem is a long and arduous process, taking "
"several months for a golem so large as this one.  However, the advent of "
"modern materials has allowed for much simpler and quicker to make golems.  "
"This golem appears to be partially, but not fully, cured.  As such, it can "
"likely recover from small injuries given some time."
msgstr ""
"伝統的に、ゴーレムの創造は長く骨の折れるプロセスであり、これほど巨大なゴーレムであれば数ヶ月を要する。だが、現代の素材が出現したことで、ゴーレム製作ははるかに単純かつ迅速に行えるようになった。このゴーレムは部分的に硬化しているが、完全ではないようだ。そのため、多少の時間をかければ小さな傷から回復できる可能性が高い。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/monsters/golems.json
msgid "hardened resin golem"
msgid_plural "hardened resin golems"
msgstr[0] "硬化レジン・ゴーレム"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'hardened resin golem'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/monsters/golems.json
msgid ""
"Traditionally, creating a golem is a long and arduous process, taking "
"several months for a golem so large as this one.  However, the advent of "
"modern materials has allowed for much simpler and quicker to make golems.  "
"This golem appears to be fully cured, meaning it'll be almost like stone.  "
"You can't quite tell whether that's just a pattern on it, or if it's "
"something more sinister…"
msgstr ""
"伝統的に、ゴーレムの創造は長く困難なプロセスであり、これほど大きなゴーレムを作るには数ヶ月かかります。しかし、現代の素材の出現により、はるかに単純で迅速にゴーレムを作れるようになりました。このゴーレムは完全に硬化しているようで、ほとんど石のようになっています。その表面にあるものが単なる模様なのか、それともさらに邪悪な何かなのかは、はっきりとは判断できません。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/monsters/golems.json
msgid "orichalcum golem"
msgid_plural "orichalcum golems"
msgstr[0] "オリハルコン・ゴーレム"

#. ~ Description for orichalcum golem
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/monsters/golems.json
msgid ""
"A large, humanoid golem made from orichalcum.  It's arms are fashioned into "
"sharp blades."
msgstr "オリハルコンで作られた、大型の人型ゴーレム。その腕は鋭い刃物に加工されている。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/monsters/golems.json
msgid "mithril golem"
msgid_plural "mithril golems"
msgstr[0] "ミスリル・ゴーレム"

#. ~ Description for mithril golem
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/monsters/golems.json
msgid ""
"A large, humanoid golem made from mithril.  This golem is practically "
"invulnerable.  Luckily, it is less aggressive"
msgstr "ミスリルで作られた、大型の人型ゴーレム。このゴーレムは実質的に無敵だ。幸いにも、攻撃性は低い。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/monsters/lizardfolk.json
msgid "lizardfolk warrior"
msgid_plural "lizardfolk warriors"
msgstr[0] "リザードフォークの戦士"

#. ~ Description for lizardfolk warrior
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/monsters/lizardfolk.json
msgid ""
"A tall, powerful, reptilian humanoid with a muscular tail whose skin is "
"covered in dark gray-green scales.  They are tribal and tend to be found in "
"caves and near water, especially in areas inhabited by dragons and wyrms.  "
"They aren't particularly hostile, though they don't care for outsiders and "
"are highly dangerous when provoked.  While they usually prefer to fight with"
" their greatclubs, they are equally ferocious with their sharp teeth and "
"claws."
msgstr ""
"筋肉質の尾をもち、皮膚は濃い緑灰色の鱗で覆われた、背が高く力が強い人型の爬虫類です。部族として生活し、洞窟や水辺、特にドラゴンやウィルムが生息する地域でよく見かけます。別段敵対的ではありませんが、部外者には容赦せず、挑発するのは非常に危険です。立派な棍棒を持って戦うことを好みますが、鋭い歯と爪も強力な武器になる。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/monsters/lizardfolk.json
msgid "lizardfolk hunter"
msgid_plural "lizardfolk hunters"
msgstr[0] "リザードフォークの狩人"

#. ~ Description for lizardfolk hunter
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/monsters/lizardfolk.json
msgid ""
"The hunter is a smaller lizardfolk than a warrior, but equally as deadly, "
"with their lithe figures and accurate javelin throws."
msgstr "リザードフォークの狩人は戦士よりも小柄だが、しなやかな体躯と正確な投槍術により、同等の危険性を持つ。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/monsters/lizardfolk.json
msgid "The hunter hurls a barbed javelin at you!"
msgstr "リザードフォークの狩人は棘付きの槍を投げた！"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/monsters/lizardfolk.json
msgid "lizardfolk shaman"
msgid_plural "lizardfolk shamans"
msgstr[0] "リザードフォークの呪術師"

#. ~ Description for lizardfolk shaman
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/monsters/lizardfolk.json
msgid ""
"Lizardfolk are very intelligent and cunning, but magical ability is a rare "
"quality.  Shamans are chosen from the tribe during childhood, when magical "
"abilities mark the fate of the young tribesman.  Not much is known about the"
" initiation ritual they must undergo, but few survive the experience.  "
"Shamans are druidic spellcasters that can use the forces of nature to battle"
" enemies, as well as summoning assistance when needed."
msgstr ""
"リザードフォークは非常に知的で狡猾だが、魔法の能力を持つ個体は稀な資質だ。呪術師は、魔力の有無が若い部族民の命運を決定づける幼少期に、部族の中から選ばれる。彼らが受けなければならない通過儀礼についてはあまり知られていないが、その経験を生き残る者はほとんどいない。呪術師はドルイドの呪文詠唱者であり、自然の力を利用して敵と戦うほか、必要に応じて援軍を召喚する。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/monsters/lizardfolk.json
msgid "lizardfolk chieftan"
msgid_plural "lizardfolk chieftans"
msgstr[0] "リザードフォークの族長"

#. ~ Description for lizardfolk chieftan
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/monsters/lizardfolk.json
msgid ""
"Among the lizardfolk, ambition is a rare quality.  Chieftans earn their "
"place by exhibiting unusually high levels of ambition, often mistaken by "
"outsiders as excessive, brutal violence.  This chief is the largest and "
"strongest member of its tribe and carries a fierce trident to compliment its"
" teeth and claws."
msgstr ""
"リザードフォークの間では、野心は稀な資質だ。族長は、通常では考えられないほどの高い野心を示すことでその地位を獲得するが、その行動はしばしば部外者によって過度で残忍な暴力と誤解される。この族長は部族で最大かつ最強の個体であり、その歯と爪を補完するために獰猛なトライデントを携行している。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/monsters/lizardfolk.json
msgid "crocodile"
msgid_plural "crocodiles"
msgstr[0] "クロコダイル"

#. ~ Description for crocodile
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/monsters/lizardfolk.json
msgid ""
"A once-and-future lizardfolk shaman, this large crocodile no longer has any "
"hint of any humanoid characteristics and looks very, very dangerous."
msgstr ""
"かつては将来の指導者となるはずだったリザードフォークの呪術師。この大きなワニには、もはや人型の特徴は一切残っておらず、非常に、非常に危険な外見をしている。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/monsters/monsters.json
msgid "owlbear"
msgid_plural "owlbears"
msgstr[0] "オウルベア"

#. ~ Description for owlbear
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/monsters/monsters.json
msgid ""
"The horrible owlbear is probably the result of genetic experimentation by "
"some insane wizard.  These creatures inhabit the tangled forest regions of "
"every temperate climate, as well as subterranean labyrinths.  They are even "
"more easily angered than normal bears, so it's best to keep a distance.  "
"Something tells you this isn't exactly a very old species, based on only "
"recently seeing them."
msgstr ""
"あの恐ろしいアウルベアは、おそらく常軌を逸した魔術師による遺伝子実験の結果だろう。このクリーチャーは、あらゆる温帯気候の絡み合った森林地帯や、地下迷宮に生息する。普通のクマよりもさらに容易に怒るため、距離を保つのが最善だ。最近見かけるようになったことから考えても、これは決して古い種ではないと直感が告げている。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/monsters/monsters.json
msgid "black pudding"
msgid_plural "black puddings"
msgstr[0] "ブラックプディング"

#. ~ Description for black pudding
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/monsters/monsters.json
msgid ""
"Writhing, sticky, black sludge undulates across the ground.  A faint "
"sizzling sound comes from the ground beneath it as it lurches toward you."
msgstr ""
"のたうつ、べたつく黒いヘドロが地面を這い、波打っている。それがあなたに向かってよろめき突進するのに合わせて、その下の地面からはかすかな焼けるような音が聞こえる。"

#. ~ Attack message of monster "black pudding"'s spell "None"
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/monsters/monsters.json
#, c-format
msgid "The black pudding burns %3$s with acid!"
msgstr "ブラックプディングの酸が%3$sを焼いた！"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/monsters/monsters.json
msgid "krabgek"
msgid_plural "krabgeks"
msgstr[0] "クラブゲック"

#. ~ Description for krabgek
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/monsters/monsters.json
msgid ""
"A large baleful eye peers out from the darkness, its gleam hinting at a "
"weird intelligence and unnerving malevolence.  The eye oozes some pinkish "
"liquid, and the weirdly humanoid figure is covered in sharp blue-black "
"triangular plates."
msgstr ""
"闇の中から、大きな邪悪な目がじっと覗いている。そのきらめきは、奇妙な知性と不穏な悪意をほのめかしている。目からはピンク色の液体がにじみ出ており、その異様な人型生物は、鋭い青黒い三角形の装甲板で覆われている。"

#. ~ Attack message of monster "krabgek"'s spell "None"
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/monsters/monsters.json
#, c-format
msgid "The krabgek gazes at %3$s!"
msgstr "クラブゲックは%3$sを凝視した！"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/monsters/monsters.json
msgid "owlbear cub"
msgid_plural "owlbear cubs"
msgstr[0] "オウルベア(幼体)"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/monsters/monsters.json
msgid "bulette"
msgid_plural "bulettes"
msgstr[0] "ブレッド"

#. ~ Description for bulette
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/monsters/monsters.json
msgid ""
"The bulette (or landshark) was the result of a mad wizard's experimental "
"cross breeding of a snapping turtle and armadillo with infusions of demons' "
"ichor.  They range temperate climates feeding on horses, men, and most other"
" flesh.  The stupid bulette is irascible and always hungry, and they fear "
"nothing."
msgstr ""
"ブレッド(またはランドシャーク)は狂気の魔術師がカミツキガメとアルマジロを実験的に交配させ、さらに悪魔の魔血を注入した結果生まれた怪物だ。彼らは温暖な気候の地域に生息し、ウマ、人間、そして大抵の生物の肉を餌とする。この愚かなブレッドは短気で常に空腹であり、恐れるものを知らない。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/monsters/monsters.json
msgid "will-o-wisp"
msgid_plural "will-o-wisps"
msgstr[0] "ウィルオウィスプ"

#. ~ Description for will-o-wisp
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/monsters/monsters.json
msgid ""
"Will-o’-wisps can be yellow, white, green, or blue.  They are easily "
"mistaken for lanterns, especially in the foggy marshes and swamps where they"
" reside."
msgstr "ウィル・オー・ウィスプは、黄色、白色、緑色、または青色に光る。特に彼らが棲む霧の濃い湿地帯や沼地では、ランタンと容易に間違われる。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/monsters/monsters.json
msgid "troll"
msgid_plural "trolls"
msgstr[0] "トロール"

#. ~ Description for troll
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/monsters/monsters.json
msgid ""
"Monstrous, green-skinned humanoid.  Trolls are renowned for their thick "
"hides and natural regenerative ability."
msgstr "異形の、緑色の肌を持つ人型生物。トロールは、その分厚い皮膚と自然の再生能力で広く知られている。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/monsters/monsters.json
msgid "stirge"
msgid_plural "stirges"
msgstr[0] "スタージ"

#. ~ Description for stirge
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/monsters/monsters.json
msgid ""
"This horrid flying creature looks like a cross between a large bat and "
"oversized mosquito."
msgstr "この恐ろしい飛行生物は、巨大なコウモリと特大の蚊を掛け合わせたような姿をしている。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/monsters/monsters.json
msgid "shrieker"
msgid_plural "shriekers"
msgstr[0] "シュリーカー"

#. ~ Description for shrieker
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/monsters/monsters.json
msgid ""
"A shrieker is a human-sized mushroom that emits a piercing screech to drive "
"off creatures that disturb it."
msgstr "シュリーカーは人間ほどのサイズのキノコであり、邪魔をする生物を追い払うために鋭い金切り声を発する。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/monsters/monsters.json
msgid "lemure"
msgid_plural "lemures"
msgstr[0] "レムール"

#. ~ Description for lemure
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/monsters/monsters.json
msgid ""
"A lemure resembles a molten mass of flesh with a vaguely humanoid head and "
"torso."
msgstr "レムールは、どことなく人間に似た頭部と胴体を持つ、溶けた肉の塊のような姿をしている。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/monsters/orcs.json
msgid "Orc Warrior"
msgid_plural "Orc Warriors"
msgstr[0] "オークの戦士"

#. ~ Description for Orc Warrior
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/monsters/orcs.json
msgid ""
"A big, badly behaved brutish humanoid.  Armed with a sword and possessing "
"more than enough strength to use it to deadly effect, you don't want to be "
"in the way of one when its angry.  It's also well armored, alongside a hide "
"one might slightly exaggerate as being ironlike.  Generally less intelligent"
" than goblins, but it's ill advised to mention that."
msgstr ""
"大きくて、行儀が悪く、残忍な人型生物。剣で武装しており、それを致命的な効果で使うのに十分すぎるほどの力を持っているため、怒っている時は邪魔をしない方がいい。鉄のようだと少し大げさに言われるような硬い皮膚に加えて、しっかりとした鎧を身につけている。ゴブリンよりも概して知能は低いが、それを口に出すのは賢明ではない。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/monsters/orcs.json
msgid "Orc 'Arrer"
msgid_plural "Orc 'Arrers"
msgstr[0] "オークの弓兵"

#. ~ Description for {'str': "Orc 'Arrer"}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/monsters/orcs.json
msgid ""
"A big brute who wields a powerful bow.  Not as respected among orc society, "
"but still very effective.  It won't hesitate to slam you with the bow if "
"necessary, though."
msgstr ""
"強力な弓を操る、大きな野蛮なオーク。オーク社会ではあまり尊敬されていないが、非常に効果的だ。必要であれば、ためらうことなく弓であなたを叩きのめすだろう。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/monsters/orcs.json
msgid "Orc Blood Warrior"
msgid_plural "Orc Blood Warriors"
msgstr[0] "オークの血色戦士"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Orc Blood Warrior'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/monsters/orcs.json
msgid ""
"As a deviation from the normal verdant skin of the orcs, the blood warriors "
"are believed to be blessed by the gods of the orcs.  They certainly look the"
" part, and from what you can tell their strength matches up with it.  You "
"best be ready for a fight, because they'll certainly give you one."
msgstr ""
"オークの通常の緑色の肌とは異なり、血の戦士たちはオークの神々から祝福を受けていると信じられている。彼らは確かにその姿をしており、わかる限りでは彼らの力もそれに匹敵する。戦いの準備をしておいた方がいい、彼らは間違いなくあなたと戦ってくれるからだ。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/npc/TALK_HEALER_GREY.json
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/npc/missiondef.json
msgid "Blessed be."
msgstr "祝福あれ。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/npc/TALK_HEALER_GREY.json
msgid ""
"I must purge this land of its curse.  Will you help or hinder our mission?"
msgstr "この土地の呪いを一掃しなければ。あなたは私たちの使命を援助しに来たのか、それとも妨害に来たのか？"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/npc/TALK_HEALER_GREY.json
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/npc/TALK_OLD_MAGUS.json
msgid "Hello <name_g>."
msgstr "こんにちは、<name_g>。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/npc/TALK_HEALER_GREY.json
msgid "Blessed be.  May you purge that which opposes the calm."
msgstr "祝福あれ。平穏を妨げるものは一掃しよう。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/npc/TALK_HEALER_GREY.json
msgid "I must purge this place before I can move on."
msgstr "他の場所へ行く前に、この場所を清めなければ。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/npc/TALK_OLD_MAGUS.json
msgid "Oh, you again."
msgstr "ああ、またお前か。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/npc/TALK_OLD_MAGUS.json
msgid "Huh? *mumble mumble* … Who are you?"
msgstr "あ？*モゴモゴ*...誰だ？"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/npc/TALK_OLD_MAGUS.json
msgid "I'm busy, what is it?"
msgstr "忙しいのだ、何か用か？"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/npc/TALK_OLD_MAGUS.json
msgid "And leave my tower and all my research? I think not."
msgstr "我が塔と我が研究を置いてか？そうはいかない。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/npc/TALK_TECHNO_KID.json
msgid "Ah, hello again."
msgstr "ああ、また会ったな。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/npc/TALK_TECHNO_KID.json
msgid "Do you seek power as well?"
msgstr "君も力を求めているのか？"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/npc/TALK_TECHNO_KID.json
msgid "Yes, yes… *electrical crackling* Isn't it beautiful?"
msgstr "やあ、やあ...*電気が爆ぜる音*...美しいだろう？"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/npc/TALK_TECHNO_KID.json
msgid "I must find more power before I can leave."
msgstr "ここを去る前に、まずは更なる力を手に入れたい。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/npc/classes.json
msgid "Mage Test"
msgstr "魔法使いテスト"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/npc/classes.json
msgid "I'm a wandering debug tester for the arcane arts."
msgstr "不思議な術を使ってデバッグをしているところだ。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/npc/classes.json
msgid "Master Magus"
msgstr "熟練魔法使い"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/npc/classes.json
msgid "I'm an old Magus.  Get off my lawn!"
msgstr "私は古の魔法使いだ。未熟者は帰れ！"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/npc/classes.json
msgid "Techno-student"
msgstr "テクノマンシー学者"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/npc/classes.json
msgid "I'm searching for more power."
msgstr "更なる力を求めているんだ。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/npc/classes.json
msgid "Healer"
msgstr "治療師"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/npc/classes.json
msgid "I will purge this land of its curse."
msgstr "この土地の呪いを清めているんだ。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/npc/factions.json
msgid "The Ancient Ones"
msgstr "エンシェント・ワン"

#. ~ Description for The Ancient Ones
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/npc/factions.json
msgid ""
"The spellcrafters of old.  Hidden from the world until the cataclysm, they "
"have their own agenda and care little for you or yours."
msgstr "古のスペルクラフターである。大災厄まで世界から隔絶されており、彼らには独自の目的があり、あなたやあなたの仲間をほとんど気にかけない。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/npc/factions.json
msgid "The Grey Flame"
msgstr "灰色の炎"

#. ~ Description for The Grey Flame
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/npc/factions.json
msgid ""
"A collection of those cursed by the cataclysm.  They have sworn to rid this "
"world of its curse and will stop at nothing to accomplish their task."
msgstr "大災厄に呪われた者たちの集団である。彼らはこの世界から呪いを解き放つことを誓っており、任務達成のためにはいかなる手段も厭わない。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/npc/missiondef.json
msgid "Retrieve Magic Book"
msgstr "呪文書を見つける"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/npc/missiondef.json
msgid "Where did I put that blasted…"
msgstr "どこに置いたんだったか…"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/npc/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"I seem to have misplaced my book, The Tome of The Battle Mage.  That "
"worthless apprentice probably stole it.  Bring it to me."
msgstr "「魔法戦士の書」という本を失くしてしまったようだ。きっとろくでもない弟子が盗んだに違いない。探してきたまえ。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/npc/missiondef.json
msgid "…What?  Oh you're still here.  Go find my book."
msgstr "...何？あぁまだ居たのか。本を探しに行きたまえ。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/npc/missiondef.json
msgid "Just as useless as that apprentice…"
msgstr "ろくでもない弟子に似た役立たずめ…"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/npc/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"You want me to do your job for you?  Bah.  That apprentice said something "
"about wanting to look around town, you might start there.  Oh, and it's "
"called The Tome of The Battle Mage, you can read at least the title, can't "
"you?"
msgstr ""
"ぜひともやらせて下さいお願いします、だと？ハッ。その弟子は、街を見て回ると言っていたような気がするから、そこから探すといい。本のタイトルは「魔法戦士の書」だ。タイトル程度なら自力で読めるだろう？"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/npc/missiondef.json
msgid "Where's my book?"
msgstr "私の本はどこだ？"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/npc/missiondef.json
msgid "Finally.  Took you long enough."
msgstr "やっと来たか。ずいぶん待たされたな。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/npc/missiondef.json
msgid "Nonsense!  Useless!  Waste of my time!"
msgstr "バカバカしい！役立たずめ！時間の無駄だ！"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/npc/missiondef.json
msgid "Ugh, why am I cursed with useless people?"
msgstr "うぐぐ、役立たずが集まってくる呪いでも掛けられたか？"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/npc/missiondef.json
msgid "Find Power Storage CBM"
msgstr "CBM: 蓄電装置を見つける"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/npc/missiondef.json
msgid "More power… moar power… MOAR POWAA!"
msgstr "もっと力を...もっと、力を...もっとぉ、力をぉ！"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/npc/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"I need more power.  Find me more power storage and I'll give you this book."
msgstr "もっと力が欲しいんだ。蓄電装置のCBMを持ってきてくれ。お礼に本をあげよう。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/npc/missiondef.json
msgid "I don't care where it comes from so long as it's clean."
msgstr "ちゃんと滅菌してあるなら、どこで手に入れたものでも構わない。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/npc/missiondef.json
msgid "You want more power too, don't you?"
msgstr "君、もっと力が欲しくはないのかね？"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/npc/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Electronic Stores might have what I need.  Or you could just cut it out of "
"something."
msgstr "電器店でなら見つかるかもしれない。もしくは、誰かの体内から取り出せばいい。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/npc/missiondef.json
msgid "Find anything?"
msgstr "見つかったか？"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/npc/missiondef.json
msgid "Perfect.  More power… power…"
msgstr "完璧だ。更なる力...力…"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/npc/missiondef.json
msgid "I must find more power, this setback is inconvenient."
msgstr "もっと力を手に入れなければ。この停滞はマズいな。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/npc/missiondef.json
msgid "Kill 50 Zombies"
msgstr "50体のゾンビを殺す"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/npc/missiondef.json
msgid "Will you answer the call?"
msgstr "君も呼び声に応えるのか？"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/npc/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"This world has fallen to chaos and death.  Remove 50 of the cursed from this"
" world; assist me in purging this curse and you shall be rewarded."
msgstr "この世界は混沌と死に塗れている。呪われしものを50体排除するんだ。手伝ってもらえないだろうか。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/npc/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Blessed be.  I shall observe your efforts and judge you as one of the many "
"or one of the few."
msgstr "祝福あれ。私も君の行動を観察し、ひとかどの人物なのか見極めるとしよう。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/npc/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"You will not help purge this curse?  Perhaps you are a part of the curse…"
msgstr "呪いを清めるつもりがないのか？君も呪いの一部なんだな..."

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/npc/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"The awakened congregate in towns and cities, the closer to the center the "
"more you will find."
msgstr "死者たちは村や街にいるが、中心部に近づくほど群れの数は多い。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/npc/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Blessed be.  You are one of the few.  We shall do great works together."
msgstr "祝福あれ。君は類まれな者の一人だ。共に意義深い行動を続けよう。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/npc/missiondef.json
msgid "Deception is the realm of the cursed.  You disappoint me."
msgstr "欺瞞は呪われた領域のものだ。君には失望したよ。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/npc/missiondef.json
msgid "Was the curse too strong for you?"
msgstr "君にとって呪いが強大すぎたのか？"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/npc/missiondef.json
msgid "Kill 150 Zombies"
msgstr "150体のゾンビを殺す"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/npc/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"You have proven you are one of the few, will you stand with the few again?"
msgstr "君が類まれな人間であることが証明された。もう一度立ち上がってみないか？"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/npc/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"We must continue the purge.  Remove 150 more of the cursed from this land "
"and you shall be blessed with greatness."
msgstr "浄化を続ける必要がある。呪われしものをこの土地から更に150体排除すれば、君の偉大さが祝福されるだろう。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/npc/missiondef.json
msgid "Blessed be.  You are a true testament to the few."
msgstr "幸いあれ。あなたは選ばれた者の真の証です。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/npc/missiondef.json
msgid "I see.  Perhaps you will find your way back to us one day."
msgstr "そうか。いつかきっと、戻ってきてくれると信じているよ。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/npc/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"The awakened stir in even the darkest of corners.  Seek them out and destroy"
" them."
msgstr "死者たちは地下深くの隠された場所に群れている。探し出して、倒すんだ。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/npc/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Blessed be.  You are a valuable asset to our cause.  Perhaps you may even be"
" our salvation."
msgstr "祝福あれ。君はこの大義を果たすための貴重な人材だ。私たちの救世主になのかもしれないな。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/npc/missiondef.json
msgid "You have come so far.  Only to fall."
msgstr "せっかくここまで来たのに。台無しだ。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/npc/missiondef.json
msgid "The curse of this land infects that which does not seek to purge."
msgstr "この土地の呪いは、それを清めようとしないものに蔓延するんだ。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/npc/npc.json
msgid "magus"
msgstr "ﾒｲｶﾞｽ"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/npc/npc.json
msgid "technologist"
msgstr "ﾃｸﾉﾛｼﾞｽﾄ"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/npc/npc.json
msgid "healer"
msgstr "ﾋｰﾗｰ"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/ter_fur_transform/ter_fur_transform.json
msgid "The earth here does not listen to your command to move."
msgstr "動けと命令しても地球は耳を貸さない。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/ter_fur_transform/ter_fur_transform.json
msgid "The pit has deepened further."
msgstr "穴が更に深くなった。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/ter_fur_transform/ter_fur_transform.json
msgid "More debris shifts out of the pit."
msgstr "たくさんのゴミが穴から飛び出した。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/ter_fur_transform/ter_fur_transform.json
msgid "The earth moves out of the way for you."
msgstr "通行の邪魔にならないよう地球が移動した。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/ter_fur_transform/ter_fur_transform.json
msgid "The rocks here are ground into sand."
msgstr "石がすり潰されて砂になった。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/ter_fur_transform/ter_fur_transform.json
msgid "The rock crumbles to dust."
msgstr "岩は砕けて粉々になった。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/ter_fur_transform/ter_fur_transform.json
msgid "All the dust in the air here falls to the ground."
msgstr "空気中のほこりがすべて落下した。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/ter_fur_transform/ter_fur_transform.json
msgid "The fungus here dies back."
msgstr "菌類が死滅した。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/ter_fur_transform/ter_fur_transform.json
msgid ""
"The ground shakes, a section of unnaturally smooth stone wall rising up."
msgstr "地面が揺れ、異様に滑らかな石壁が飛び出した。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/ter_fur_transform/ter_fur_transform.json
msgid "The dead tree regrows."
msgstr "枯れ木が再生した。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/ter_fur_transform/ter_fur_transform.json
msgid "Life springs anew from the dead grass."
msgstr "枯れ草が息を吹き返した。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/traits/classes.json
msgid "Magus"
msgstr "メイガス"

#. ~ Description for Magus
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/traits/classes.json
msgid ""
"A tradition as old as magic, the Magus focuses on binding and shaping the "
"energy of the universe to their will."
msgstr "魔法の歴史と同じくらい古い伝統を持つメイガスは、宇宙のエネルギーを意志の力で縛り、形作ることに重点を置く。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/traits/classes.json
msgid "Animist"
msgstr "アニミスト"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Animist'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/traits/classes.json
msgid ""
"The animist tradition is a relatively new school of magical thought, formed "
"through combination of many older ways that focus on harmony and connection "
"to the natural world.  This does not mean that animists are passive: the "
"natural world is a savage place."
msgstr ""
"アニミストの伝統は、比較的歴史の浅い魔術思想の流派である。これは、調和と自然界との繋がりを重視する多くの古い流儀が組み合わされて成立した。 "
"しかし、アニミストが非攻撃的であるわけではない。自然界は過酷な場所なのだ。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/traits/classes.json
msgid "Kelvinist"
msgstr "ケルビニスト"

#. ~ Description for Kelvinist
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/traits/classes.json
msgid ""
"Disciples of the great Archwizard Lord Kelvin.  Kelvinists focus their magic"
" on manipulation and control of the temperature of their environment, "
"leading to spectacularly powerful explosions or bone-chilling cold."
msgstr ""
"偉大なる大魔術師、ケルビン卿の門下生である。ケルビニストは、環境の温度操作と制御に魔力を集中させ、その結果、壮絶に強力な爆発や骨まで凍る冷気を操る。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/traits/classes.json
msgid "Stormshaper"
msgstr "ストームシェイパー"

#. ~ Description for Stormshaper
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/traits/classes.json
msgid ""
"Stormshapers follow ancient arcane disciplines of meditation and harmony "
"with the winds and tides that shape the planet.  Through their deep "
"connection to these forces, they can request powerful changes."
msgstr ""
"ストームシェイパーは、古代の秘術の鍛錬に従い、惑星を形作る風と潮の流れとの調和に焦点を当てる。これらの力と深く結びつくことで、彼らは強力な変化を引き起こす。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/traits/classes.json
msgid "Technomancer"
msgstr "テクノマンサー"

#. ~ Description for Technomancer
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/traits/classes.json
msgid ""
"Technomancers are the new breed of modern magician, blending their arcane "
"might with their advanced knowledge of the fundamental nature of the "
"universe.  They use technology to enhance their magic and vice versa."
msgstr ""
"テクノマンサーは、宇宙の根源的な性質に関する高度な知識と、彼らの秘術の力を融合させる、現代の新たな魔術師の系統である。彼らは技術を利用して魔術を強化し、その逆も行う。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/traits/classes.json
msgid "Earthshaper"
msgstr "アースシェイパー"

#. ~ Description for Earthshaper
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/traits/classes.json
msgid ""
"Earthshapers have allowed their minds to sink deep within the stones and "
"metals of the planet, and become one with its secrets.  To a master "
"Earthshaper, spells can be as permanent as the stones they are created from,"
" and time is measured in geological eras."
msgstr ""
"アースシェイパーは、精神を地球の岩石や金属の奥深くに沈ませ、その秘密と一体となる。熟練したアースシェイパーにとって、呪文は創り出した岩のように恒久的であり、彼らが測る時間は地質時代の尺度である。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/traits/classes.json
msgid "Biomancer"
msgstr "バイオマンサー"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Biomancer'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/traits/classes.json
msgid ""
"The Biomancer focuses on manipulating and even absorbing flesh; their own, "
"and that of other living or dead things.  Most other wizards find their "
"powers gross and disturbing, but no one can question the potency of their "
"abilities, and certainly not their adaptability to any situation."
msgstr ""
"バイオマンサーは、肉体の操作、そして自己や他の生物、さらには死んだ肉体の吸収に焦点を当てる。ほとんどの魔術師は彼らの力を下品で不快だと考えるが、その能力の有効性を疑う者は誰もいない。そして、どんな状況への適応力に至っては、なおさらだ。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/traits/classes.json
msgid "Druid"
msgstr "ドルイド"

#. ~ Description for Druid
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/traits/classes.json
msgid ""
"Druids follow a wild tradition of allegiance and rebirth within the world of"
" nature, especially the cycle of death and rebirth that is the plant world."
"  A powerful Druid is as much a part of that world as the human one."
msgstr ""
"ドルイドは、自然界、特に植物の死と再生という循環の中で、忠誠と転生という野生の伝統に従う。強力なドルイドは、人間世界と等しく、その自然世界の一部である。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/traits/classes.json
msgid "Adventurer"
msgstr "冒険者"

#. ~ Description for Adventurer
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/traits/classes.json
msgid ""
"Adventurers are the jack-of-all-trades of the physical realm, not "
"specializing in any one aspect prominently due to the variety encountered in"
" their journeys."
msgstr "冒険者は、物理的な領域における「何でも屋」です。彼らが旅で遭遇する多様性のため、どの側面においても際立って専門的になることはありません。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/traits/classes.json
msgid "Blademaster"
msgstr "ブレードマスター"

#. ~ Description for Blademaster
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/traits/classes.json
msgid ""
"Blademasters have studied the art of the blade extensively, honing their "
"ability to strike fast and strike true.  Now you can look like your favorite"
" anime character as you slay Zombies."
msgstr ""
"ブレードマスターは剣技を極め、素早く正確に斬る力を鍛えてきた。ゾンビを倒しながら、お気に入りのアニメキャラクターのように振る舞うこともできる。"

#. ~ Mutation class name
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/traits/manatouched.json
msgid "Manatouched"
msgstr "マナタッチ"

#. ~ Mutation class: Manatouched mutagen_message
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/traits/manatouched.json
msgid "Your ley lines surge with mana."
msgstr "レイラインからマナの奔流が湧き上がった。"

#. ~ Mutation class: Manatouched iv_message
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/traits/manatouched.json
msgid "A crackle of power comes from within."
msgstr "内側から力がパチパチと音を立てて湧き上がる。"

#. ~ Mutation class: Manatouched Male memorial messsage
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/traits/manatouched.json
msgctxt "memorial_male"
msgid "Ascended to the metaphysical."
msgstr "形而上学的な存在な存在へと昇華した。"

#. ~ Mutation class: Manatouched Female memorial messsage
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/traits/manatouched.json
msgctxt "memorial_female"
msgid "Ascended to the metaphysical."
msgstr "形而上学的な存在な存在へと昇華した。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Manatouched'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/traits/manatouched.json
msgid "Magic is in you.  Magic is you."
msgstr "魔法はお前の中に宿る。魔法はお前そのものだ。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/traits/manatouched.json
msgid "Mana Solidification"
msgstr "マナ結晶化"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Mana Solidification'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/traits/manatouched.json
msgid ""
"Your internal ley lines have become much easier for you to control, "
"resulting in you being able to naturally create crystallized mana."
msgstr "内なるレイラインは格段に制御しやすくなり、その結果、結晶化したマナを自然に生成できるようになった。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Seeker Bolts'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/traits/manatouched.json
msgid ""
"Your hands glow with mana energy.  You can fire seeker bolts from your "
"fingertips."
msgstr "両手はマナエネルギーで発光している。指先からシーカーボルトを発射可能だ。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/traits/manatouched.json
msgid "Subtle Spell"
msgstr "巧みな詠唱"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Subtle Spell'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/traits/manatouched.json
msgid ""
"You no longer need to move your arms to cast spells, due to your ley lines "
"becoming untethered from your arms.  Arm encumbrance no longer applies to "
"spell failure chance."
msgstr "レイラインが腕から解き放たれたため、呪文詠唱時に腕を動かす必要はない。腕の動作制限は、スペルの失敗確率に影響しなくなった。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/traits/manatouched.json
msgid "Silent Spell"
msgstr "無音詠唱"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Silent Spell'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/traits/manatouched.json
msgid ""
"You no longer need to use your voice to enforce your will upon the world.  "
"Mouth encumbrance no longer applies to spell failure chance."
msgstr "もはや声を発して世界に意思を強制する必要はない。口の動作制限は、スペルの失敗確率に影響しなくなった。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/traits/manatouched.json
msgid "Weak"
msgstr "柔弱"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Weak'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/traits/manatouched.json
msgid "Your body is unnaturally weak.  -2 Strength."
msgstr "超自然の力によって身体が弱っています。筋力-2"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/traits/manatouched.json
msgid "Mana Luminance"
msgstr "マナの輝き"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Mana Luminance'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/traits/manatouched.json
msgid ""
"Your body discards unusable mana as light and heat, making you glow softly."
msgstr "身体は、使用できないマナを光と熱として排出する。そのため、身体が微かに発光している。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/traits/manatouched.json
msgid "Mana Siphon"
msgstr "マナ・サイフォン"

#. ~ Description for Mana Siphon
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/traits/manatouched.json
msgid ""
"This is the spell portion of the mana siphon series of mutations.  If you "
"have this spell you probably debugged it in."
msgstr "これはマナ・サイフォン系列の突然変異の呪文部分だ。この呪文を持っているなら、おそらくデバッグで追加したものだろう。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Mana Siphon'}
#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Mana Drain'}
#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Mana Vortex'}
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/traits/manatouched.json
msgid ""
"Violence excites your ley lines.  Whenever you hit an enemy in melee, you "
"have a chance of regaining some mana."
msgstr "暴力はレイラインを活性化させる。敵に近接攻撃を命中させるたび、一定確率でマナを回復する。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/traits/manatouched.json
msgid "Mana Drain"
msgstr "マナ吸収"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/traits/manatouched.json
msgid "Mana Vortex"
msgstr "マナの旋風"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/traits/mutation.json
msgid "Lesser Mana Efficiency"
msgstr "マナ貯蔵力上昇(レベル1)"

#. ~ Description for Lesser Mana Efficiency
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/traits/mutation.json
msgid "You are able to store a little more mana in your body than usual."
msgstr "体内に溜めておけるマナの量が平均より多少高くなっている。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/traits/mutation.json
msgid "Mana Efficiency"
msgstr "マナ貯蔵力上昇(レベル2)"

#. ~ Description for Mana Efficiency
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/traits/mutation.json
msgid "You are able to store more mana in your body than usual."
msgstr "体内に溜めておけるマナの量が平均より高くなっている。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/traits/mutation.json
msgid "Greater Mana Efficiency"
msgstr "マナ貯蔵力上昇(レベル3)"

#. ~ Description for Greater Mana Efficiency
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/traits/mutation.json
msgid "You are able to store a lot more mana in your body than usual."
msgstr "体内に溜めておけるマナの量が平均より大幅に高くなっている。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/traits/mutation.json
msgid "Lesser Mana Inefficiency"
msgstr "マナ貯蔵力低下(レベル1)"

#. ~ Description for Lesser Mana Inefficiency
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/traits/mutation.json
msgid "You are able to store a little less mana in your body than usual."
msgstr "体内に溜めておけるマナの量が平均より多少低くなっている。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/traits/mutation.json
msgid "Mana Inefficiency"
msgstr "マナ貯蔵力低下(レベル2)"

#. ~ Description for Mana Inefficiency
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/traits/mutation.json
msgid "You are able to store less mana in your body than usual."
msgstr "体内に溜めておけるマナの量が平均より低くなっている。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/traits/mutation.json
msgid "Greater Mana Inefficiency"
msgstr "マナ貯蔵力低下(レベル3)"

#. ~ Description for Greater Mana Inefficiency
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/traits/mutation.json
msgid "You are able to store a lot less mana in your body than usual."
msgstr "体内に溜めておけるマナの量が平均より大幅に低くなっている。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/traits/mutation.json
msgid "Lesser Mana Regeneration"
msgstr "マナ回復力上昇(レベル1)"

#. ~ Description for Lesser Mana Regeneration
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/traits/mutation.json
msgid "Your natural mana regeneration is slightly faster than normal."
msgstr "マナの回復速度が通常より多少上昇する。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/traits/mutation.json
msgid "Mana Regeneration"
msgstr "マナ回復力上昇(レベル2)"

#. ~ Description for Mana Regeneration
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/traits/mutation.json
msgid "Your natural mana regeneration is faster than normal."
msgstr "マナの回復速度が通常より上昇する。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/traits/mutation.json
msgid "Greater Mana Regeneration"
msgstr "マナ回復力上昇(レベル3)"

#. ~ Description for Greater Mana Regeneration
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/traits/mutation.json
msgid "Your natural mana regeneration is much faster than normal."
msgstr "マナの回復速度が通常より大幅に上昇する。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/traits/mutation.json
msgid "Poor Mana Regeneration"
msgstr "マナ回復力低下(レベル1)"

#. ~ Description for Poor Mana Regeneration
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/traits/mutation.json
msgid "Your natural mana regeneration is slightly slower than normal."
msgstr "マナの回復速度が通常より多少低下する。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/traits/mutation.json
msgid "Very Poor Mana Regeneration"
msgstr "マナ回復力低下(レベル2)"

#. ~ Description for Very Poor Mana Regeneration
#: data/mods/MagicalNights/traits/mutation.json
msgid "Your natural mana regeneration is slower than normal."
msgstr "マナの回復速度が通常より低下する。"

#: data/mods/MagicalNights/traits/mutation.json
msgid "Abysmal Mana Regeneration"
