#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_mutations.json
msgid "Made Of Sugar"
msgstr "砂糖の身体"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Made Of Sugar'}
#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_mutations.json
msgid ""
"You are literally made of sugar, giving you 10 cut armor, 5 bash armor, and "
"making you immune to bleeding, radiation, and thirst, but it also prevents "
"you from installing CBMs, prevents you from eating anything but sugar, and "
"you can only heal using caramel ointment."
msgstr ""
"あなたは文字通り 砂糖でできている。これにより、斬撃装甲 10、打撃装甲 "
"5が与えられ、出血、放射線、喉の渇きに免疫を持つ。代わりにCBMのインストールができず、砂糖以外のものを食べることができず、キャラメル軟膏を使ってのみ "
"回復できる。"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Sugar Boy"
msgstr "シュガーボーイ"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Sugar Girl"
msgstr "シュガーガール"

#. ~ Profession (male Sugar Boy) description
#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You're a human shaped candy brought to life under unknown circumstances.  "
"You have your whole life ahead of you and it's gonna be sweet!"
msgstr "どういうわけか命を与えられた、人型のキャンディー。長く甘い人生が始まった！"

#. ~ Profession (female Sugar Girl) description
#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You're a human shaped candy brought to life under unknown circumstances.  "
"You have your whole life ahead of you and it's gonna be sweet!"
msgstr "どういうわけか命を与えられた、人型のキャンディー。長く甘い人生が始まった！"

#. ~ Name for scenario 'The Sweet Life' for a male character
#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_scenarios.json
msgctxt "scenario_male"
msgid "The Sweet Life"
msgstr "甘い生活"

#. ~ Name for scenario 'The Sweet Life' for a female character
#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_scenarios.json
msgctxt "scenario_female"
msgid "The Sweet Life"
msgstr "甘い生活"

#. ~ Description for scenario 'The Sweet Life' for a male character.
#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You open your eyes as if for the first time, looking at yourself you can see"
" your skin gleam in the light.  One word come to your mind \"sugar\" you "
"don't remember where you learned it, in fact you don't remember anything.  "
"You don't know why but you feel hopeful, everything feels new and you're "
"going to make the best of it!"
msgstr ""
"目を開くと、光を反射して輝く自分の肌が見えた。「砂糖」という言葉が頭に浮かんだが、どこで覚えた言葉なのか分からないどころか、記憶がまったくない。何故か世界が生まれ変わったと感じ、それを最大限に活用しようとする希望が湧いてきた！"

#. ~ Description for scenario 'The Sweet Life' for a female character.
#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You open your eyes as if for the first time, looking at yourself you can see"
" your skin gleam in the light.  One word come to your mind \"sugar\" you "
"don't remember where you learned it, in fact you don't remember anything.  "
"You don't know why but you feel hopeful, everything feels new and you're "
"going to make the best of it!"
msgstr ""
"目を開くと、光を反射して輝く自分の肌が見えた。「砂糖」という言葉が頭に浮かんだが、どこで覚えた言葉なのか分からないどころか、記憶がまったくない。何故か世界が生まれ変わったと感じ、それを最大限に活用しようとする希望が湧いてきた！"

#. ~ Starting location for scenario 'The Sweet Life'.
#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_scenarios.json
msgctxt "start_name"
msgid "Candy Shop"
msgstr "菓子店"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_snippets.json
msgid ""
"A flyer for some kind of candy.  It shows a picture of a gleaming human made"
" of smooth candy looking at you in terror.  \"SugarKin the first life-size "
"human candy!  Are you a real monster?  Will you be able to devour it all?\""
msgstr ""
"キャンディーか何かのチラシです。恐ろしげにこちらを見つめる、滑らかな飴で作られた人間が描かれています。「シュガーキン(砂糖の血族)は史上初の等身大ヒューマンキャンディーです！君は真のモンスターか？これを食べ尽くすことが出来るか？」"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_start_locations.json
msgid "Candy Shop"
msgstr "菓子店"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/creatures/baked.json
msgid "cracker kid"
msgid_plural "cracker kids"
msgstr[0] "クラッカーキッド"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'cracker kid'}
#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/creatures/baked.json
msgid "A small graham cracker kid, running around on its graham cracker legs."
msgstr "成長したグラハムクラッカーが、グラハムクラッカーの脚で走り回っている。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'graham cracker'}
#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/creatures/baked.json
msgid ""
"A fully grown graham cracker, running around on its graham cracker legs."
msgstr "小さなクッキーが、パンくずを探してちょこまかと動き回っている。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'cookie'}
#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/creatures/baked.json
msgid "A small cookie, scuriying around in search of crumbs."
msgstr "クモの形に引き伸ばされた巨大なガムの塊。ガムの巣の中でじっと動かない。"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/creatures/gum_spider.json
msgid "gum spider"
msgid_plural "gum spiders"
msgstr[0] "ガムスパイダー"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'gum spider'}
#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/creatures/gum_spider.json
msgid ""
"A giant piece of gum, stretched in the shape of a spider.  It stands very "
"still in its gum web."
msgstr "クモの形に引き伸ばされた巨大なガムの塊。まるで何らかの興奮剤の影響下にあるかのように、素早く攻撃的に動く。"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/creatures/gum_spider.json
msgid "caffeinated gum spider"
msgid_plural "caffeinated gum spiders"
msgstr[0] "カフェインガムスパイダー"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'caffeinated gum spider'}
#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/creatures/gum_spider.json
msgid ""
"A giant piece of gum, stretched in the shape of a spider.  It moves quickly "
"and aggressively; as if under the effect of some stimulant."
msgstr "砂糖のゼラチンでできた、可愛らしい子グマ。いつか大きくなるのかと不思議に思う。"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/creatures/gummy.json
msgid "gummy cub"
msgid_plural "gummy cubs"
msgstr[0] "グミベア(幼体)"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'gummy cub'}
#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/creatures/gummy.json
msgid ""
"A cute bear cub made of sugary gelatin.  You wonder if it will grow big one "
"day."
msgstr "砂糖ゼラチンでできたかわいらしい子グマ。いつか大きくなるのかと不思議に思う。"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/creatures/gummy.json
msgid "gummy bear"
msgid_plural "gummy bears"
msgstr[0] "グミベア"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'gummy bear'}
#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/creatures/gummy.json
msgid ""
"A big bear made of fruit flavored gelatin, its smooth round shape and its "
"fruity smell make it less scary than its fleshy counterpart."
msgstr "フルーツ味のゼラチンでできた大きなクマ。その滑らかで丸い形とフルーティーな香りは、肉でできたものよりも怖さを感じさせない。"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/creatures/marshmallow.json
msgid "marshmallow kid"
msgid_plural "marshmallow kids"
msgstr[0] "マシュマロキッド"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'marshmallow kid'}
#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/creatures/marshmallow.json
msgid ""
"A small humanoid made of marshmallow.  It bumbles around on its stubby "
"cushioned legs.  How cute!"
msgstr "マシュマロでできた小さな人型生物。ずんぐりしたクッションのような脚でよちよちと歩き回る。なんてかわいいんだ！"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/creatures/marshmallow.json
msgid "marshmallow guy"
msgid_plural "marshmallow guys"
msgstr[0] "マシュマロガイ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'marshmallow guy'}
#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/creatures/marshmallow.json
msgid ""
"A marshmallow humanoid with a smile drawn on its face.  It bumbles around, "
"hollow eyes scanning its surroundings, seemingly looking for something."
msgstr "顔に笑顔が描かれたマシュマロの人型生物。よちよちと歩き回り、虚ろな目で周囲を見回し、何かを探しているようだ。"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/creatures/marshmallow.json
msgid "marshmallow buff"
msgid_plural "marshmallow buffs"
msgstr[0] "マシュマロマッチョ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'marshmallow buff'}
#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/creatures/marshmallow.json
msgid ""
"A muscular body made of marshmallow, proudly striding towards an unknown "
"goal.  Yummy!"
msgstr "あてもなく誇らしげに歩き回る、筋肉モリモリのマシュマロ。おいしいね！"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/creatures/marshmallow.json
msgid "marshmallow goliath"
msgid_plural "marshmallow goliaths"
msgstr[0] "巨体マシュマロ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'marshmallow goliath'}
#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/creatures/marshmallow.json
msgid ""
"A gigantic marshmallow humanoid softly stomping around, frozen smile and big"
" empty eyes carefully scanning its surroundings."
msgstr "巨大なマシュマロの人型生物が柔らかく足を踏み鳴らしながら歩き回る。凍り付いたような笑顔と大きな虚ろな目で周囲を注意深く見回している。"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/creatures/marshmallow.json
msgid "marshmallow squire"
msgid_plural "marshmallow squires"
msgstr[0] "マシュマロ従士"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'marshmallow squire'}
#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/creatures/marshmallow.json
msgid ""
"A small humanoid made of marsmallow.  It is armored in chocolate coated "
"graham crackers and bumbles around on its stubby, cushioned legs.  How cute!"
msgstr ""
"マシュマロでできた小さな人型生物。チョコレートコーティングされたグラハムクラッカーで武装し、ずんぐりしたクッションのような脚でよちよちと歩き回る。なんてかわいいんだ！"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/creatures/marshmallow.json
msgid "marshmallow knight"
msgid_plural "marshmallow knights"
msgstr[0] "マシュマロナイト"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'marshmallow knight'}
#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/creatures/marshmallow.json
msgid ""
"A marshmallow humanoid in full graham cracker knight armor.  It bumbles "
"around, hollow eyes scanning its surrounding seemingly looking for "
"something."
msgstr "グラハムクラッカーの全身騎士鎧を身につけたマシュマロの人型生物。よちよちと歩き回り、虚ろな目で周囲を見回し、何かを探しているようだ。"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/creatures/marshmallow.json
msgid "marshmallow champion"
msgid_plural "marshmallow champions"
msgstr[0] "マシュマロ闘士"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'marshmallow champion'}
#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/creatures/marshmallow.json
msgid ""
"Standing tall in its shining armor of chocolate coated graham crackers, this"
" marshmallow is proudly striding towards an unknown goal."
msgstr "チョコレートコーティングされたグラハムクラッカーの輝く鎧を身につけ、このマシュマロは誇らしげに未知の目標に向かって大股で歩いている。"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/creatures/marshmallow.json
msgid "marshmallow war lord"
msgid_plural "marshmallow war lords"
msgstr[0] "マシュマロ将軍"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'marshmallow war lord'}
#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/creatures/marshmallow.json
msgid ""
"A gigantic humanoid armored with thick plates of chocolate coated graham "
"crackers.  A frozen smile is half visible under its heavy helmet, as it "
"carefully scans its surroundings."
msgstr ""
"分厚いチョコレートコーティングされたグラハムクラッカーの板で武装した巨大な人型生物。その重いヘルメットの下からは凍り付いたような笑顔が半分見え、周囲を注意深く見回している。"

#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/creatures/other.json
