msgstr "レベル倍率が %s に設定された。"

#: data/mods/rpg_system/modinfo.json
msgid "RPG System"
msgstr "RPGシステム"

#. ~ Description for RPG System
#: data/mods/rpg_system/modinfo.json
msgid ""
"Adds an RPG [System] with [Classes], [Traits] and [Levels]. Gain experience "
"from killing monsters, level up, choose a class, and gain powerful traits."
msgstr ""
"RPGシステムを追加する。クラス、特性、レベルを備える。モンスターを倒して経験値を獲得し、レベルアップしてクラスを選び、強力な特性を習得しよう。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': '[System Interface]'}
#: data/mods/rpg_system/system_interface.json
msgid ""
"A mysterious interface that allows you to access the [System]. It "
"materialized in your possession when the System initialized."
msgstr "謎めいたインターフェースで、[System]にアクセスできる。システムが初期化された際に、いつの間にか手元に現れた。"

#: data/mods/rpg_system/system_interface.json
msgid "Your soul burns and aches"
msgstr "魂が焼けるように痛む"

#: data/mods/rpg_system/system_interface.json
msgid "Damaged Soul"
msgstr "傷ついた魂"

#. ~ Description of effect 'Damaged Soul'.
#: data/mods/rpg_system/system_interface.json
msgid ""
"Your spirit has been damaged by abandoning your chosen path. You feel "
"weakened and disconnected from your inner power."
msgstr "選んだ道を捨てたことで精神が損なわれた。内なる力とのつながりが弱まり、力が衰えたように感じる。"

#. ~ Apply message for effect(s) 'Damaged Soul'.
#: data/mods/rpg_system/system_interface.json
msgid "You feel a deep pain in your soul as you abandon your path."
msgstr "道を捨てた瞬間、魂の奥深くに激しい痛みを感じる。"

#. ~ Remove message for effect(s) 'Damaged Soul'.
#: data/mods/rpg_system/system_interface.json
msgid "The spiritual damage heals."
msgstr "霊的なダメージが癒えた。"

#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid "[Warrior]"
msgstr "[戦士]"

#. ~ Description for [Warrior]
#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid ""
"Through rigorous training, you've honed your body. Your endurance is "
"exceptional, you tire slowly. Every 5 minutes increase stamina. Per level: "
"+0.55 STR, +0.2 DEX, +0.1 INT, +0.15 PER"
msgstr ""
"厳しい鍛錬を通じて、あなたの身体は研ぎ澄まされた。持久力は並外れており、疲れにくい。5分ごとにスタミナが増加する。レベルごとの上昇値:筋力 "
"+0.55、器用 +0.2、知力 +0.1、感覚 +0.15。"

#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid "[Berserker]"
msgstr "[狂戦士]"

#. ~ Description for [Berserker]
#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid ""
"Rage fuels your strikes. Your fury makes you strike 15% faster. Your "
"endurance is exceptional, you tire slowly. Every 5 minutes increase stamina."
" Per level: +0.75 STR, +0.45 DEX, +0.1 INT, +0.2 PER"
msgstr ""
"怒りが攻撃力を高める。激怒により攻撃速度が15%向上する。耐久力に優れ、疲れにくい。5分ごとにスタミナが回復。レベルごとの能力値上昇:筋力 "
"+0.75、器用 +0.45、知力 +0.1、感覚 +0.2"

#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid "[Guardian]"
msgstr "[守護者]"

#. ~ Description for [Guardian]
#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid ""
"A living shield, protecting all. Your skin is naturally armored (+4 physical"
" armor). Your endurance is exceptional, you tire slowly. Every 5 minutes "
"increase stamina. Per level: +0.6 STR, +0.15 DEX, +0.15 INT, +0.6 PER"
msgstr ""
"生きた盾として、すべてを守る。肌は自然に装甲化されている（物理防御 "
"+4）。耐久力に優れ、疲れにくい。5分ごとにスタミナが回復。レベルごとの能力値上昇:筋力 +0.6、器用さ +0.15、知力 +0.15、感覚 +0.6"

#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid "[Mage]"
msgstr "[魔術師]"

#. ~ Description for [Mage]
#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid ""
"The arcane flows through you naturally. Vast reserves of mana (+1000 mana, "
"+25% mana regen). Per level: +0.1 STR, +0.05 DEX, +0.55 INT, +0.3 PER"
msgstr ""
"秘術が自然に流れ込む。膨大なマナを備えている（マナ +1000、マナ回復 +25%）。レベルごとの能力値上昇:筋力 +0.1、器用さ +0.05、知力 "
"+0.55、感覚 +0.3"

#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid "[Mystic]"
msgstr "[修道士]"

#. ~ Description for [Mystic]
#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid ""
"You channel raw destructive power. Your hands glow with light (15). Immense "
"reserves of mana (+2500 mana, +50% mana regen). Per level: +0.1 STR, +0.2 "
"DEX, +0.75 INT, +0.45 PER"
msgstr ""
"生の破壊力を操る。手が光で輝く (光量 15)。膨大なマナを備えている（マナ +2500、マナ回復 +50%）。レベルごとの能力値上昇:筋力 "
"+0.1、器用 +0.2、知力 +0.75、感覚+0.45"

#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid "[Scholar]"
msgstr "[学者]"

#. ~ Description for [Scholar]
#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid ""
"Knowledge flows to you effortlessly. You read with supernatural "
"comprehension (+100% reading speed). Moderate mana reserves (+800 mana, +20%"
" mana regen). Per level: +0.05 STR, +0.15 DEX, +0.8 INT, +0.5 PER"
msgstr ""
"知識が自然に流れ込む。超常的な理解力で読書が可能（読書速度 +100%）。中程度のマナを備えている（マナ +800、マナ回復 "
"+20%）。レベルごとの能力値上昇:筋力 +0.05、器用 +0.15、知力 +0.8、感覚 +0.5"

#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid "[Rogue]"
msgstr "[盗賊]"

#. ~ Description for [Rogue]
#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid ""
"Cunning and dexterous. A master of finesse and guile. Per level: +0.1 STR, "
"+0.55 DEX, +0.15 INT, +0.2 PER"
msgstr "ずる賢く器用。巧妙さと策略の達人。レベルごとの能力値上昇:筋力 +0.1、器用 +0.55、知力 +0.15、感覚 +0.2"

#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid "[Scout]"
msgstr "[斥候]"

#. ~ Description for [Scout]
#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid ""
"Master tracker and observer. Your senses are razor sharp. Your movements are"
" unnaturally fast (5% faster movement, +1 speed per level). Per level: +0.15"
" STR, +0.3 DEX, +0.05 INT, +0.5 PER"
msgstr ""
"追跡と観察の達人。感覚は鋭く、動きは異常に速い（移動速度 +5%、レベルごとに速度 +1）。レベルごとの能力値上昇:筋力 +0.15、器用 "
"+0.3、知力 +0.05、感覚 +0.5"

#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid "[Acrobat]"
msgstr "[曲芸師]"

#. ~ Description for [Acrobat]
#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid ""
"A blur of graceful motion. Your reflexes are supernatural (+6 dodge bonus). "
"Your movements flow with impossible speed (8% faster movement, +1.5 speed "
"per level). Per level: +0.1 STR, +0.8 DEX, +0.2 INT, +0.4 PER"
msgstr ""
"優雅な動きの残像。反射神経は超自然的（回避ボーナス +6）。動きは信じられない速さで流れる（移動速度 +8%、レベルごとに速度 "
"+1.5）。レベルごとの能力値上昇:筋力 +0.1、器用 +0.8、知力 +0.2、感覚 +0.4"

#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid "[Assassin]"
msgstr "[暗殺者]"

#. ~ Description for [Assassin]
#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid ""
"A shadow striking without warning. You move in complete silence (-40% noise,"
" +30% hearing). You are nearly invisible (+50% stealth). Your movements blur"
" with supernatural speed (8% faster movement, +1.5 speed per level). Per "
"level: +0.1 STR, +0.75 DEX, +0.35 INT, +0.3 PER"
msgstr ""
"警告なく襲いかかる影。完全に静かに移動できる（ノイズ -40%、聴覚 +30）。ほとんど姿が見えない（ステルス "
"+50%）。動きは超自然的な速さでぼやける（移動速度 +8%、レベルごとに速度 +1.5）。レベルごとの能力値上昇:筋力 +0.1、器用 "
"+0.75、知力 +0.35、感覚 +0.3"

#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid "[Ranger]"
msgstr "[レンジャー]"

#. ~ Description for [Ranger]
#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid ""
"Master sharpshooter with perfect aim. You see clearly in darkness (night "
"vision 20 tiles). You require less water (half at level 10, none at 20). "
"Your movements are unnaturally fast (5% faster movement, +1 speed per "
"level). Per level: +0.15 STR, +0.45 DEX, +0.1 INT, +0.8 PER"
msgstr ""
"完璧な狙いを持つ射撃の達人。暗闇でもはっきり見える（ナイトビジョン "
"20タイル）。水の必要量が少ない（レベル10で半分、レベル20で不要）。動きは超自然的に速い（移動速度 +5%、レベルごとに速度 "
"+1）。レベルごとの能力値上昇:筋力 +0.15、器用 +0.45、知力 +0.1、感覚 +0.8"

#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid "[Craftsman]"
msgstr "[職人]"

#. ~ Description for [Craftsman]
#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid ""
"Master of all trades. Your skilled hands work with incredible precision (+1 "
"to all crafting skills, +40% crafting speed). Per level: +0.2 STR, +0.3 DEX,"
" +0.4 INT, +0.6 PER"
msgstr ""
"あらゆる分野の達人。熟練した手は驚くほど正確に働く（全クラフト技能 +1、クラフト速度 +40%）。レベルごとの能力値上昇:筋力 +0.2、器用 "
"+0.3、知力 +0.4、感覚 +0.6"

#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid "[Bionic Symbiote]"
msgstr "[義体共生体]"

#. ~ Description for [Bionic Symbiote]
#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid ""
"Your cells integrate seamlessly with cybernetics. Your body naturally "
"generates bionic power (regenerates 2 kJ per level every 5 minutes)."
msgstr "細胞はサイバネティクスと完全に統合されている。体は自然にバイオニックパワーを生成する（レベルごとに5分ごとに2 kJ回復）。"

#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid "[Vital Essence]"
msgstr "[生命の本質]"

#. ~ Description for [Vital Essence]
#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid ""
"Life energy flows through you. You are perpetually healthy and healing "
"(increases health by 0.02 per level every 5 minutes)."
msgstr "生命エネルギーがあなたを流れている。常に健康で自然治癒する（レベルごとに5分ごとに体力が0.02増加）。"

#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid "[Purifying Blood]"
msgstr "[浄化の血]"

#. ~ Description for [Purifying Blood]
#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid ""
"Your blood purifies toxins and radiation. You naturally cleanse radiation "
"from your body (removes 0.5 radiation per level every 5 minutes)."
msgstr "血液は毒素と放射能を浄化する。体内の放射線を自然に除去する（レベルごとに5分ごとに放射線を0.5除去）。"

#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid "[Resistant Skin]"
msgstr "[耐性のある皮膚]"

#. ~ Description for [Resistant Skin]
#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid ""
"Your skin is unnaturally resistant to environmental hazards. You naturally "
"resist corrosive and thermal damage (+4 acid armor, +4 heat armor)."
msgstr "皮膚は環境による危害に対して異常なほど耐性を持つ。腐食性や熱によるダメージを自然に防ぐ（酸耐性+4、熱耐性+4）。"

#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid "[Lightweight Frame]"
msgstr "[軽量フレーム]"

#. ~ Description for [Lightweight Frame]
#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid ""
"Your body is optimized for speed over strength. You move much faster but "
"can't carry as much (25% faster movement, 25% less carry capacity)."
msgstr "体は筋力よりもスピードに最適化されている。移動速度は大幅に上がるが、持てる重量は減少する（移動速度+25%、持載量-25%）。"

#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid "[Strong Back]"
msgstr "[丈夫な腰]"

#. ~ Description for [Strong Back]
#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid ""
"You carry burdens that would crush others. Your carrying capacity is "
"significantly increased (+40% carry capacity)."
msgstr "他の者が背負えば潰れてしまうような荷物でも運べる。所持容量が大幅に増加する（所持容量+40%）。"

#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid "[Tireless]"
msgstr "[疲れ知らず]"

#. ~ Description for [Tireless]
#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid ""
"Your stamina seems endless. You can exert yourself for much longer (+50% max"
" stamina)."
msgstr "スタミナは尽きることがないように感じられる。より長く体力を使い続けられる（最大スタミナ+50%）。"

#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid "[Mana Font]"
msgstr "[マナフォント]"

#. ~ Description for [Mana Font]
#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid ""
"Mana flows through you like a river. You possess increased magical power "
"(+1250 mana, +25% mana regen, +12.5% mana multiplier)."
msgstr "魔力が川のようにあなたに流れる。魔法の力が増大している（マナ+1250、マナ回復+25%、マナ倍率+12.5%）。"

#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid "[Blink Step]"
msgstr "[ブリンクステップ]"

#. ~ Description for [Blink Step]
#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid ""
"You move with supernatural quickness. Your movements are a blur (25% faster "
"movement)."
msgstr "超自然的な速さで動く。動きはほとんど残像のように見える（移動速度+25%）。"

#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid "[Natural Healer]"
msgstr "[自然治癒者]"

#. ~ Description for [Natural Healer]
#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid ""
"Your body repairs itself rapidly. Your wounds close at an accelerated rate "
"(+50% HP regen while awake, +100% HP regen while resting)."
msgstr "体が急速に自己修復する。傷は通常より早く癒える（起きている間のHP回復+50%、休息中のHP回復+100%）。"

#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid "[Adaptive Biology]"
msgstr "[適応生物学]"

#. ~ Description for [Adaptive Biology]
#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid ""
"Your body adapts to harsh conditions. You naturally resist extreme "
"temperatures (-750, 750 bodytemp units)."
msgstr "体が過酷な環境に適応する。極端な温度に自然に耐性を持つ（体温単位で-750〜750）。"

#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid "[Glass Cannon]"
msgstr "[ガラスの大砲]"

#. ~ Description for [Glass Cannon]
#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid ""
"Immense power, fragile form. You move with tremendous speed (+20% speed) but"
" are more vulnerable (-2 physical armor)."
msgstr "途方もない力を持つが、脆い体。非常に速く移動できる（速度 +20%）が、より脆弱になる（物理防御 -2）。"

#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid "[Juggernaut]"
msgstr "[ジャガーノート]"

#. ~ Description for [Juggernaut]
#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid ""
"An unstoppable force. You are incredibly strong (+100% carry capacity, +8 "
"physical armor) but move very slowly (30% slower movement, 15% slower "
"speed)."
msgstr "止められない力。非常に強靭である（積載量 +100%、物理防御 +8）が、非常に遅く移動する（移動速度 -30%、スピード -15%）。"

#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid "[Arcane Battery]"
msgstr "[秘術の蓄電]"

#. ~ Description for [Arcane Battery]
#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid ""
"You store immense magical energy. Your mana reserves are enormous (+5000 "
"mana) but regenerate very slowly (50% slower mana regen)."
msgstr "膨大な魔力を蓄えている。マナの最大値は非常に高い（+5000）が、回復は非常に遅い（マナ回復速度 -50%）。"

#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid "[Iron Fists]"
msgstr "[鉄拳]"

#. ~ Description for [Iron Fists]
#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid ""
"Your fists are hardened weapons. Your unarmed strikes deal devastating "
"damage (+6 bash, +4 cut, +3 pierce damage)."
msgstr "拳は武器のように硬化している。素手攻撃は甚大なダメージを与える（打撃 +6、斬撃 +4、刺突 +3）。"

#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid "[Efficient Metabolism]"
msgstr "[効率的な代謝]"

#. ~ Description for [Efficient Metabolism]
#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid ""
"Your body uses resources efficiently. You need 40% less food and get tired "
"30% slower."
msgstr "体は資源を効率的に利用する。必要な食料は40%少なく、疲労は30%遅くなる。"

#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid "[Combat Reflexes]"
msgstr "[戦闘反射神経]"

#. ~ Description for [Combat Reflexes]
#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid ""
"You react instantly to threats. Your reflexes grant superior evasion (+3 "
"dodge bonus)."
msgstr "脅威に即座に反応する。反射神経により優れた回避力を得る（回避+3）。"

#. ~ Description for [Acrobat]
#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid ""
"You land gracefully from any height. You take 95% less falling damage and "
"gain +2 dodge bonus."
msgstr "あらゆる高さから優雅に着地する。落下ダメージは95%軽減され、回避+2のボーナスを得る。"

#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid "[Tireless Worker]"
msgstr "[疲れ知らずの働き手]"

#. ~ Description for [Tireless Worker]
#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid ""
"You never seem to tire. You get tired 50% slower and recover from fatigue "
"80% faster."
msgstr "疲れ知らずだ。疲労は50%遅く蓄積され、疲労回復は80%速くなる。"

#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid "[Rapid Metabolism]"
msgstr "[高速代謝]"

#. ~ Description for [Rapid Metabolism]
#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid ""
"Your body processes energy rapidly. You regenerate stamina 100% faster but "
"need 40% more food."
msgstr "体はエネルギーを急速に処理する。スタミナの回復速度は100%向上するが、必要な食料は40%増える。"

#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid "[Scentless]"
msgstr "[無臭]"

#. ~ Description for [Scentless]
#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid ""
"You emit almost no scent. Enemies that track by smell have much harder time "
"detecting you (90% reduced scent)."
msgstr "ほとんど匂いを発しない。嗅覚で追跡する敵は、あなたを感知しにくくなる（匂いは90%減少）。"

#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid "[Clotting Factor]"
msgstr "[止血因子]"

#. ~ Description for [Clotting Factor]
#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid ""
"Your blood clots almost instantly. You are highly resistant to bleeding "
"(1000 bleed resistance)."
msgstr "血液はほとんど瞬時に凝固する。出血に非常に強い（出血耐性1000）。"

#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid "[Regenerator]"
msgstr "[再生者]"

#. ~ Description for [Regenerator]
#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid ""
"Your limbs mend at an incredible rate. Broken and damaged limbs heal 100% "
"faster."
msgstr "手足は驚異的な速度で回復する。骨折や損傷した手足の治癒速度が100%向上する。"

#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid "[Master Craftsman]"
msgstr "[名匠]"

#. ~ Description for [Master Craftsman]
#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid ""
"Your hands are skilled at creation. You craft 20% faster and build 20% "
"faster."
msgstr "手は創造の技に長けている。クラフト速度が20%向上し、建築速度も20%向上する。"

#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid "[Pack Rat]"
msgstr "[パックラット]"

#. ~ Description for [Pack Rat]
#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid ""
"You know how to pack efficiently. Your worn containers hold 50% more items."
msgstr "効率的なパッキングの技術を持っている。装備した収納アイテムに50%多くのアイテムを収められる。"

#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid "[Creature Harvester]"
msgstr "[生物収穫者]"

#. ~ Description for [Creature Harvester]
#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid ""
"You instinctively know how to harvest creatures. You can efficiently harvest"
" materials with your bare hands (butchering quality 40)."
msgstr "本能的に生物の収穫方法を知っている。素手でも効率的に素材を採取できる（解体品質 40）。"

#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid "[Vampiric]"
msgstr "[吸血鬼]"

#. ~ Description for [Vampiric]
#: data/mods/rpg_system/traits.json
msgid ""
"You drain life essence from your foes. Heal for 0.5% of monster's max HP per"
" level (minimum 1 HP) on kill."
msgstr "敵から生命エネルギーを吸収する。敵を倒すとレベルごとにモンスターの最大HPの0.5%（最低1HP）を回復する。"

#: data/mods/saveload_lua_test/modinfo.json
msgid "SaveLoad Lua Test"
msgstr "SaveLoad Luaテスト"

#. ~ Description for SaveLoad Lua Test
#: data/mods/saveload_lua_test/modinfo.json
msgid "Mod for testing Lua save/load API."
msgstr "Luaのセーブ／ロードAPIをテストするためのMod。"

