msgstr "オートドックは<npcname>の血流に抗放射線薬を検出したため、現時点では追加の投与はしないと判断した。"

#: src/iexamine.cpp
msgid ""
"The autodoc administered an anti-radiation drug to treat radiation "
"poisoning."
msgstr "オートドックは放射線中毒を治療するために抗放射線薬を投与した。"

#: src/iexamine.cpp
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Warning!  Autodoc detected a radiation leak of %d mSv from items in "
"patient's possession.  Urgent decontamination procedures highly recommended."
msgstr "警告！オートドックが患者の所持品から%dmSvの被曝を検出しました。緊急除染を強く推奨します。"

#: src/iexamine.cpp
msgid "The autodoc analyzed your blood."
msgstr "オートドックはお前の血液を分析した。"

#: src/iexamine.cpp
msgid "The autodoc analyzed <npcname>'s blood."
msgstr "オートドックは<npcname>の血液を分析した。"

#: src/iexamine.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "This mill contains %s, which can't be milled!"
msgstr "製粉機に入っている%sは製粉できない！"

#: src/iexamine.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "You remove the %s from the mill."
msgstr "製粉機から%sを取り出した。"

#: src/iexamine.cpp
msgid ""
"This mill is empty.  Fill it with starchy products such as wheat, barley or "
"oats and try again."
msgstr "この製粉機は空だ。小麦、大麦、オーツなどのデンプン質を含むアイテムを投入し、再度試すこと。"

#: src/iexamine.cpp
msgid ""
"This mill is overloaded with products, and the millstone can't turn.  Remove"
" some and try again."
msgstr "この製粉機はアイテムの過負荷により、石臼が回転できない。一部を取り除き、再度試すこと。"

#: src/iexamine.cpp
#, c-format
msgctxt "volume units"
msgid "You think that you can load about %s %s in it."
msgstr "%sの%sを中に入れられそうだ。"

#: src/iexamine.cpp
msgid "You remove the brake on the millstone and it slowly starts to turn."
msgstr "ブレーキを解除すると、石臼がゆっくりと回転を始めた。"

#: src/iexamine.cpp src/iuse_actor.cpp
msgid "Select specimen sample:"
msgstr ""

#: src/iexamine.cpp
msgid "The cloning vat begins its rapid incubation process."
msgstr ""

#: src/iexamine.cpp
msgid "This rack already contains smoked food."
msgstr "この燻製ラックには既に燻製食品が入っている。"

#: src/iexamine.cpp
msgid "Remove it before firing the smoking rack again."
msgstr "燻製ラックを再点火する前に、中身を取り除くこと。"

#: src/iexamine.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "This rack contains %s, which can't be smoked!"
msgstr "燻製ラックに入っている%sは燻製にできない！"

#: src/iexamine.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "You remove %s from the rack."
msgstr "%sを燻製ラックから取り出した。"

#: src/iexamine.cpp
msgid ""
"This rack has some smoked food that might be dehydrated by smoking it again."
msgstr "燻製ラックの中には、再度燻製加工することで脱水できる可能性がある燻製食品が入っている。"

#: src/iexamine.cpp
msgid ""
"This rack is empty.  Fill it with raw meat, fish or sausages and try again."
msgstr "この燻製ラックは空だ。生の肉や魚肉、ソーセージなどを投入して再度試すこと。"

#: src/iexamine.cpp
msgid "There is no charcoal in the rack."
msgstr "燻製ラックに木炭が入っていない。"

#: src/iexamine.cpp
msgid ""
"This rack is overloaded with food, and it blocks the flow of smoke.  Remove "
"some and try again."
msgstr "燻製ラックに食品を詰め込み過ぎて、煙の流れが悪くなっている。食品をいくつか取り出して再度試すこと。"

#: src/iexamine.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "You think that you can load about %s %s in it."
msgstr "%sの%sを中に入れられそうだ。"

#: src/iexamine.cpp
msgid "There is not enough charcoal in the rack to smoke this much food."
msgstr "燻製ラックに木炭が不足しているため、この量の食品を燻製にできない。"

#: src/iexamine.cpp
#, c-format
msgid ""
"You need at least %1$s pieces of charcoal, and the smoking rack has %2$s "
"inside."
msgstr "少なくとも%1$s以上の木炭が必要だ。現在、燻製ラックには%2$sの木炭が入っている。"

#: src/iexamine.cpp
msgid "This smoking rack is ready to be fired, but you have no fire source."
msgstr "この燻製ラックは点火の準備が整っている。しかし着火道具を持っていない。"

#: src/iexamine.cpp
msgid "Fire the smoking rack?"
msgstr "燻製ラックを点火する？"

#: src/iexamine.cpp
msgid "You light a small fire under the rack and it starts to smoke."
msgstr "燻製ラックの下部に小さな火がともり、煙が出始めた。"

#: src/iexamine.cpp src/iuse_actor.cpp
msgid "ding!"
msgstr "チーン！"

#: src/iexamine.cpp
msgid "You can't place more food while it's smoking."
msgstr "燻製中は食品を追加できない。"

#: src/iexamine.cpp
msgid "Remove it before loading the smoking rack again."
msgstr ""

#: src/iexamine.cpp
msgid "Load smoking rack with what kind of food?"
msgstr "燻製ラックに入れる食品は？"

#: src/iexamine.cpp
msgid "You don't have any food that can be smoked."
msgstr "燻製にできる食品がない。"

#: src/iexamine.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Insert how many %s into the rack?"
msgstr "燻製ラックに%sをいくつ入れるか？"

#: src/iexamine.cpp
msgid "You don't have that many."
msgstr "そんなにたくさん持っていない。"

#: src/iexamine.cpp
msgid "You can't place that many."
msgstr "多すぎて入らない。"

#: src/iexamine.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "You carefully place %s %s in the rack."
msgstr "燻製ラックの中に%sの%sを注意深く置いた。"

#: src/iexamine.cpp
msgid "You can't place more food while it's milling."
msgstr "製粉中に追加投入はできない。"

#: src/iexamine.cpp
msgid "Load mill with what kind of product?"
msgstr "製粉機に入れるアイテムは？"

#: src/iexamine.cpp
msgid "You don't have any materials that can be milled."
msgstr "製粉できる材料を何も持っていない。"

#: src/iexamine.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Insert how many %s into the mill?"
msgstr "製粉機に%sをいくつ入れる？"

#: src/iexamine.cpp
#, c-format
msgctxt "item amount and name"
msgid "You carefully place %s %s in the mill."
msgstr "製粉機の中に%sの%sを注意深く置いた。"

#: src/iexamine.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Cancel incubation (%s left)"
msgstr ""

#: src/iexamine.cpp
msgid "Cancel incubation process?  This will kill the specimen inside."
msgstr ""

#: src/iexamine.cpp
msgid "The water mill needs to be over shallow flowing water to work."
msgstr "水車を稼働するには浅い流水上に設置する必要がある。"

#: src/iexamine.cpp
msgid "The wind mill needs to be outside in the wind to work."
msgstr "風車を稼働するには風が吹いている屋外に設置する必要がある。"

#: src/iexamine.cpp
msgid "What to do with the mill?"
msgstr "製粉機を操作"

#: src/iexamine.cpp
msgid "Inspect mill"
msgstr "製粉機を点検する"

#: src/iexamine.cpp
msgid "Remove brake and start milling… insert some products for milling first"
msgstr "ブレーキを解除して製粉を開始する... まず製粉用の材料を投入しろ。"

#: src/iexamine.cpp
msgid "Remove brake and start milling"
msgstr "ブレーキを解除して製粉を開始する"

#: src/iexamine.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Remove brake and start milling, milling will take about %s."
msgstr "ブレーキを解除して製粉を開始する。完了まで約%sかかる。"

#: src/iexamine.cpp
msgid "Insert products for milling… mill is full"
msgstr "製粉するアイテムを入れる...満杯"

#: src/iexamine.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Insert products for milling… remaining capacity is %s %s"
msgstr "製粉するアイテムを入れる...残り容量%s%s"

#: src/iexamine.cpp
msgid "Fill the mill with starchy products such as wheat, barley or oats."
msgstr "小麦、大麦、オーツ麦などのデンプン質を含む材料を製粉機に投入する。"

#: src/iexamine.cpp
msgid "Remove products from mill"
msgstr "製粉機からアイテムを取り出す"

#: src/iexamine.cpp
msgid "Apply brake to mill"
msgstr "製粉機にブレーキをかける"

#: src/iexamine.cpp
msgid "Applying the brake will stop milling process."
msgstr "ブレーキをかけると製粉を停止する。"

#: src/iexamine.cpp
msgid "There's a mill here.  It is turning and milling."
msgstr "製粉機がある。回転しながら製粉中だ。"

#: src/iexamine.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "It should take about %s to finish milling."
msgstr "あと%sほどで製粉が完了する。"

#: src/iexamine.cpp
msgid "There's a mill here."
msgstr "製粉機がある。"

#: src/iexamine.cpp
msgid "You inspect its contents and find: "
msgstr "ラックの内容物: "

#: src/iexamine.cpp
msgid "…that it is empty."
msgstr "...何も入っていない。"

#: src/iexamine.cpp
msgid "You see that the milling process is not yet complete."
msgstr "製粉プロセスがまだ完了していないのを確認した。"

#: src/iexamine.cpp
msgid "It is already milling."
msgstr "既に製粉中だ。"

#: src/iexamine.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "You remove %s from the mill."
msgstr "製粉機から%sを取り出す。"

#: src/iexamine.cpp
msgid "You stop the milling process."
msgstr "製粉を中断した。"

#: src/iexamine.cpp
msgid "What to do with the smoking rack:"
msgstr "燻製ラック操作:"

#: src/iexamine.cpp
msgid "Inspect smoking rack"
msgstr "燻製ラックを点検する"

#: src/iexamine.cpp
msgid "Light up and smoke food… insert some food for smoking first"
msgstr "点火して燻製を開始する... まず燻製用の食料を投入しろ。"

#: src/iexamine.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Light up and smoke food… need extra %d charges of charcoal"
msgstr "点火して燻製を開始する... 追加の木炭が %d チャージ分必要だ。"

#: src/iexamine.cpp
msgid "Light up and smoke food"
msgstr "点火して燻製を始める"

#: src/iexamine.cpp
msgid ""
"Light up the smoking rack and start smoking.  Smoking will take about 6 "
"hours."
msgstr "燻製ラックを点火して燻製を開始する。完了まで約6時間かかる。"

#: src/iexamine.cpp
msgid "Insert food for smoking… smoking rack is full"
msgstr "燻製する食品を入れる...満杯"

#: src/iexamine.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Insert food for smoking… remaining capacity is %s %s"
msgstr "燻製する食品を入れる...残り容量%s%s"

#: src/iexamine.cpp
msgid ""
"Fill the smoking rack with raw meat, fish or sausages for smoking or fruit "
"or vegetable or smoked meat for drying."
msgstr "燻製ラックで生肉、魚、ソーセージの燻製、または果物、野菜、燻製肉の乾燥が可能だ。"

#: src/iexamine.cpp
msgid "You cannot disassemble this smoking rack while it is active!"
msgstr "稼働中の燻製ラックは解体できない！"

#: src/iexamine.cpp
msgid "Disassemble the smoking rack"
msgstr "燻製ラックを解体する"

#: src/iexamine.cpp
msgid "Remove food from smoking rack"
msgstr "燻製ラックから食品を取り出す"

#: src/iexamine.cpp
msgid "Reload with charcoal… you don't have any"
msgstr "木炭を補充する... 木炭を所持していない。"

#: src/iexamine.cpp
msgid "Reload with charcoal"
msgstr "木炭を補充する"

#: src/iexamine.cpp
#, c-format
msgid ""
"You need %d charges of charcoal for %s %s of food.  Minimal amount of "
"charcoal is %d charges."
msgstr "%dの木炭で%s%sの食料を燻製にできる。最低%dの木炭を装填する必要がある。"

