#: src/monattack.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "The %s slashes at your neck!  You duck!"
msgstr "%sが首を斬ろうとしたが、頭を下げてかわした！"

#: src/monattack.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "The %s slashes at <npcname>'s neck!  They duck!"
msgstr "%sが<npcname>の首を斬ろうとしたが、頭を下げてかわした！"

#: src/monattack.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "The %1$s slashes at your neck, cutting your throat for %2$d damage!"
msgstr "%1$sが首を斬り、首に%2$dのダメージを与えた！"

#: src/monattack.cpp
#, c-format
msgid ""
"The %1$s slashes at <npcname>'s neck, cutting their throat for %2$d damage!"
msgstr "%1$sが<npcname>の首を斬り、首に%2$dのダメージを与えた！"

#: src/monattack.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "The %1$s slashes at your %2$s, but glances off your armor!"
msgstr "%1$sが%2$sを攻撃したが、跳ね返された！"

#: src/monattack.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "The %1$s slashes at <npcname>'s %2$s, but glances off armor!"
msgstr "%1$sが<npcname>の%2$sを斬り払おうとしたが、跳ね返された！"

#: src/monattack.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "A shadow splits from the %s!"
msgstr "%sの影が分裂した！"

#: src/monattack.cpp
msgid "\"Stop it please\""
msgstr "「お願い、やめて」"

#: src/monattack.cpp
msgid "\"Let us help you\""
msgstr "「君を助ける機会をくれないか」"

#: src/monattack.cpp
msgid "\"We wish you no harm\""
msgstr "「私たちは君を傷つけたいわけじゃない」"

#: src/monattack.cpp
msgid "\"Do not fear\""
msgstr "「怖がらないで」"

#: src/monattack.cpp
msgid "\"We can help you\""
msgstr "「私たちが助けてあげられるよ」"

#: src/monattack.cpp
msgid "\"We are friendly\""
msgstr "「私たちは君の友達になるために来たんだ」"

#: src/monattack.cpp
msgid "\"Please dont\""
msgstr "「お願い、やめて」"

#. ~ Your slimes try to cheer you up!
#. ~ Lowercase is intended: they're small voices.
#: src/monattack.cpp
msgid "\"hey, it's gonna be all right!\""
msgstr "「ねえ、全部大丈夫になるよ！」"

#. ~ Your slimes try to cheer you up!
#. ~ Lowercase is intended: they're small voices.
#: src/monattack.cpp
msgid "\"we'll get through this!\""
msgstr "「私たちが助けるから！」"

#. ~ Your slimes try to cheer you up!
#. ~ Lowercase is intended: they're small voices.
#: src/monattack.cpp
msgid "\"i'm here for you!\""
msgstr "「助けに来たんだ！」"

#. ~ Lowercase is intended: they're small voices.
#: src/monattack.cpp
msgid "\"let me help!\""
msgstr "「助けてあげる！」"

#: src/monattack.cpp
msgid "The slime cleans you out!"
msgstr "スライムがあなたを洗い流す！"

#: src/monattack.cpp
msgid "The slime flows over you, but your gouges still ache."
msgstr "スライムがあなたの体を這いずり回るが、傷はまだ痛む。"

#: src/monattack.cpp
msgid "The slime seals up your leaks!"
msgstr "スライムがあなたの出血を止める！"

#: src/monattack.cpp
msgid "The slime flows over you, but your fluids are still leaking."
msgstr "スライムがあなたの体を這いずり回るが、まだ血が滲んでいる。"

#: src/monattack.cpp
msgid "but you grab its arm and flip it to the ground!"
msgstr "だが、相手の腕を掴んで地面に叩きつける！"

#: src/monattack.cpp
msgid "The flip does shock you…"
msgstr "叩きつけた反動で体がしびれる…"

#: src/monattack.cpp
msgid "but you deftly spin out of its grasp!"
msgstr "しかし機敏に体を翻し、手から逃れる！"

#: src/monattack.cpp
msgid ""
"Halt and submit to arrest, citizen!  The police will be here any moment."
msgstr "『動かずに逮捕を受け入れろ、市民！すぐに警官が到着する。』"

#: src/monattack.cpp
msgid "Please stay in place, citizen, do not make any movements!"
msgstr "『その場で立ち止まれ、市民。動くな！』"

#: src/monattack.cpp
msgid "The robot carefully scans you."
msgstr "ロボットがあなたの身元を確認する。"

#: src/monattack.cpp
msgid "The robot carefully scans <npcname>."
msgstr "ロボットが慎重に<npcname>の身元を確認する。"

#: src/monattack.cpp
msgid "The riotbot orders you to present your hands and be cuffed."
msgstr "鎮圧ボットがあなたに手を差し出し、手錠をかける準備を命じる。"

#: src/monattack.cpp
msgid "Allow yourself to be arrested."
msgstr "逮捕に従う。"

#: src/monattack.cpp
msgid "Resist arrest!"
msgstr "逮捕に抵抗する！"

#: src/monattack.cpp
msgid "Feign death."
msgstr "死んだふりをする。"

#: src/monattack.cpp
msgid ""
"You deftly slip out of the handcuffs just as the robot closes them.  The "
"robot didn't seem to notice!"
msgstr "ロボットが手錠をかける際、巧妙に手を抜いたが、ロボットは気づかなかった！"

#: src/monattack.cpp
msgid "The robot puts handcuffs on you."
msgstr "ロボットがあなたに手錠をかける。"

#: src/monattack.cpp
msgid ""
"You are under arrest, citizen.  You have the right to remain silent.  If you"
" do not remain silent, anything you say may be used against you in a court "
"of law."
msgstr "『お前を逮捕する。お前には沈黙する権利がある。沈黙権を放棄して発言した内容は、法廷でお前を不利にする可能性がある。』"

#: src/monattack.cpp
msgid ""
"You have the right to an attorney.  If you cannot afford an attorney, one "
"will be provided at no cost to you.  You may have your attorney present "
"during any questioning."
msgstr "『お前には弁護人を立てられる権利がある。弁護人を立てられない場合は、国選弁護人が選任され、取り調べの際に弁護人を同席させることができる。』"

#: src/monattack.cpp
msgid ""
"If you do not understand these rights, an officer will explain them in "
"greater detail when taking you into custody."
msgstr "『以上の権利を理解できない場合、拘留中に警察がより詳しく説明する。』"

#: src/monattack.cpp
msgid ""
"Do not attempt to flee or to remove the handcuffs, citizen.  That can be "
"dangerous to your health."
msgstr "『逃走または手錠の除去を試みるな、市民。お前の命が危険にさらされる可能性がある。』"

#: src/monattack.cpp
msgid ""
"You fall to the ground and feign a sudden convulsive attack.  Though you're "
"obviously still alive, the riotbot cannot tell the difference between your "
"'attack' and a potentially fatal medical condition.  It backs off, signaling"
" for medical help."
msgstr ""
"床に倒れ、急性発作を装う。まだ明らかに生きているが、鎮圧ロボットはあなたの「急性発作」と本当に致命的な症状を区別できなかった。ロボットは後退し、緊急救難信号を送信し始める。"

#: src/monattack.cpp
msgid "Your awkward movements do not fool the riotbot."
msgstr "煙は不十分で、鎮圧ロボットを欺くことに失敗した。"

#: src/monattack.cpp
msgid "The robot sprays tear gas!"
msgstr "ロボットが催涙ガスを噴射する！"

#: src/monattack.cpp
msgid "Empty your hands and hold your position, citizen!"
msgstr "『手にある武器を下ろし、その場で立ち止まれ！』"

#. ~ Sound of a riotbot using its blinding flash
#: src/monattack.cpp
msgid "fzzzzzt"
msgstr "パチパチ"

#: src/monattack.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "The %1$s impales yor chest for %2$d damage!"
msgstr "%1$sがあなたの胸を突き、%2$dのダメージを与える！"

#: src/monattack.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "The %1$s impales <npcname>'s chest for %2$d damage!"
msgstr "%1$sが<npcname>の胸を突き、%2$dのダメージを与える！"

#: src/monattack.cpp
#, c-format
msgid ""
"The %1$s attempts to burrow itself into you, but is stopped by your armor!"
msgstr "%1$sがあなたに食い込もうとしたが、防具に阻まれた！"

#: src/monattack.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "The %1$s slashes at <npcname>'s torso, but is stopped by their armor!"
msgstr "%1$sが<npcname>の胴体を貫こうとしたが、防具に阻まれた！"

#: src/monattack.cpp
#, c-format
msgid ""
"The %1$s burrows within %2$s corpse and a %3$s emerges from the remains!"
msgstr "%1$sが%2$sの死体に食い込み、%3$sがその残骸から飛び出してくる！"

#: src/monattack.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "The %1$s burrows within %2$s corpse!"
msgstr "%1$sが%2$sの死体に食い込む！"

#: src/monattack.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "A %1$s emerges from %2$s corpse!"
msgstr "%1$sが%2$sの死体から飛び出してくる！"

#: src/monattack.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "An egg pod ruptures and a %s crawls out from the remains!"
msgstr "卵の鞘が割れ、%sが瓦礫の中から這い出てくる！"

#: src/monattack.cpp
msgid "Resplendent fronds emerge from the still intact pods!"
msgstr "まばゆい光を放つ葉が、まだ無傷の鞘から伸びる！"

#: src/monattack.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "The %s blooms into flowers!"
msgstr "%sが花となって咲き誇る！"

#: src/monattack.cpp
msgid ""
"The hound's movements chaotically rewind as a living afterimage splits from "
"it!"
msgstr "生ける残像が伸び、猟犬の足取りが勝手に巻き戻る！"

#: src/monattack.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "The %s dissipates and reforms close by."
msgstr "%sが消え、近くで再構成される。"

#: src/monattack.cpp
msgid "The floor trembles underneath your feet."
msgstr "足元の地面が揺れる。"

#: src/monattack.cpp
msgid "a deafening roar!"
msgstr "耳がつんとするほどの咆哮！"

#: src/monattack.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "A %s struggles to pull itself free from the %s!"
msgstr "%sが%sから逃れようともがく！"

#: src/monattack.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s mechanically grabs at %2$s!"
msgstr "%1$sが機械的に%2$sを掴む！"

#: src/monattack.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s slams %2$s to the ground!"
msgstr "%1$sが%2$sを地面に叩きつけた！"

#. ~ 1$s is the attacker, 2$s is bodypart name in accusative, 3$d is damage
#. value.
#: src/monattack.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "The %1$s kicks your %2$s for %3$d damage…"
msgstr "%1$sが%2$sを蹴飛ばし、%3$dのダメージを与える…"

#: src/monattack.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "and slams you, face first, to the ground for %d damage!"
msgstr "そして顔から地面に叩きつけて、追加で%dのダメージを与える！"

#: src/monattack.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "and slams you to the ground for %d damage!"
msgstr "そして地面に叩きつけて、%dのダメージを与える！"

#: src/monattack.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "and slams you for %d damage!"
msgstr "そして殴りつけて、%dのダメージを与える！"

#: src/monattack.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s mechanically lunges at %2$s!"
msgstr "%1$sが機械的に%2$sに向かって突進する！"

#: src/monattack.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s impales %2$s!"
msgstr "%1$sが%2$sを貫く！"

#: src/monattack.cpp
msgid "The %1$s tries to impale your %s…"
msgstr "%1$sが%sを刺そうとする…"

#: src/monattack.cpp
msgid "The %1$s tries to impale <npcname>'s %s…"
msgstr "%1$sが<npcname>の%sを刺そうとする…"

#: src/monattack.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "and deals %d damage!"
msgstr "%dのダメージを受ける！"

#: src/monattack.cpp
msgid "but fails to penetrate your armor!"
msgstr "しかし、防具を貫けなかった！"

#: src/monattack.cpp
msgid "but fails to penetrate <npcname>'s armor!"
msgstr "しかし、<npcname>の防具を貫けなかった！"

#: src/monattack.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s mechanically reaches for %2$s!"
msgstr "%1$sが機械的に%2$sに向かって武器を振るう！"

#: src/monattack.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "The zombie grabs your %s…"
msgstr "ゾンビがあなたの%sを掴む…"

#: src/monattack.cpp
msgid "and throws it to the ground!"
msgstr "そのまま床に叩きつける！"

#: src/monattack.cpp
msgid "but you break its grip!"
msgstr "だが、あなたはその手から抜け出した！"

#: src/monattack.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "The %s lights up menacingly."
msgstr "%sが威嚇的に光を放つ。"

#: src/monattack.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "The %s deploys a pacification hack!"
msgstr "%sがマンハックを起動する！"

#: src/monattack.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "The %s deploys a flashbang hack!"
msgstr "%sが閃光弾マンハックを起動する！"

#: src/monattack.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "The %s deploys a tear gas hack!"
msgstr "%sが催涙ガスマンハックを起動する！"

#: src/monattack.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "The %s buzzes and deploys a C-4 hack!"
msgstr "%sがブンブンと音を立てながらC-4マンハックを起動する！"

#: src/monattack.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "The %s deploys a grenade hack!"
msgstr "%sは手榴弾マンハックを起動する！"

#: src/monattack.cpp
#, c-format
